 {"dead-and-buried-1\nС кем сразишься сначала - с мертвецом или погребённым?","你会先与谁交战——亡者，还是被埋葬的人？"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n                                    DREAM  ISLAND\n      Have a visit and leave with a smile on your face.","梦想的岛\n参观和微笑的离开你的脸。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n                                 LIGHTHOUSE AREA\n+5 extra nobility for each lighthouse you own.Visitors forbidden.","灯光区\n每座灯塔 + 5 额外贵族,禁止访客"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n                           ¤¤¤¤¤¤         ¤¤¤¤¤¤          ¤¤¤¤¤¤            \n\n                                                 MERLIN\n\n           ","                           ¤¤¤¤¤¤         ¤¤¤¤¤¤          ¤¤¤¤¤¤            \n\n梅尔林\n\n           "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n       LEARNING AREA         \n <----- Haste      Slow ----->","       学习能力地区 地区\n <----- 攻击加速      迟缓大法 ----->"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n \"A wise decision would be to stay here for the rest of the day.\"\nMaximus didn`t see who whispered that,but decides to stay anyway.","\"明智的决定是留在这\"其 他一天\"。\"\n马克西姆斯没看到是谁低语了 不过还是决定留下"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n \"I WANT TO GO HOME\"cries the border guard.\n\"I will not let anyone pass here unless they give me the Tome.If you have it give it to me right now.\"he says with an angry voice.\n\nYou have no choice,so you give it to him.You leave with a sour grin on your face.","\"我想回家\" 克里亚斯边防警卫。\n\"我不会让任何人通过这里 除非他们给我他用愤怒的声音说:\n\n你没有选择,所以你把它给他。 你离开时脸上满脸笑容。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n \"Not without the shield\"shout the border guard.\"You should have brought it with you,you fool.\"I will not let anyone pass here without it\". ","\"不是\"没有 护体神盾# 呼喊 # # # \"Shout #\"边防警卫。\"你本该带它来,笨蛋。\"没有它我绝不让任何人经过这里。\" "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n \"Thank you Maximus.Now you can enter the land of shadows.And if you get out of there alive(now comes the secret)and you don`t know where to go.Look for a hidden passage,close to the Unknown castle.It will take you to the wild barbarian lands.\"","谢谢马克西姆斯现在您可以输入有阴影的地方。和如果你活着离开那里(现在来了)秘密)和寻找一个隐藏的通道,接近未知城堡,会带你去野生的野蛮土地\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n At last you are here Maximus.We are searching for wood.Though we are in a forest we can`t be free and let you pass here without it.","你终于来了马克西姆斯. 我们正在查找木材尽管我们身处森林中 却无法自由和让你在这里通过 没有它。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n At last you have it.Now we can let you pass.But watch out,this is Genghis Khan land.","终于你拿到了 现在我们可以让你通过 但当心,这是成吉思 可汗土地。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Go kill Genghis.","去杀成吉思."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Have you got the beautiful cornucpia with you?I must have it now,please.\nThe border guard beggs on his knees to you.\nHe continues.Genghis Khan stole it from our empire a long time ago.Please give it back to us.In return we will let you visit the tent. ","你有没有过跟你在一起的美丽的玉米?\n边防警卫跪在你的膝盖上\n他继续。成吉思 可汗很久以前从我们的帝国偷走了它 请把它还给我们帐篷。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Hello,i saw you loose the artifacts.Now i have a deal for you.If you could pay the small amount of 88921 gold and 120 sulfur i would give the Tome of water back to you.","你好,我看见你松了 宝物现在,我有一个交易 为你。 如果你能支付88921美元小额金币 和 120 硫磺我会给水的多米还给你"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n I`m so sorry,but i `ll need the orb. ","我很抱歉 但我需要或b。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n I`m sorry.The Roman gladiator games have been closed.You are too late.","对不起罗马角斗士游戏已经关门了 你来晚了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n In order to reach the Roman Empire you have to collect some artifacts for us.Give us the following three`Ambassador`s sach,Diplomat`s ring and Statesman`s medal and we will reward you by letting you pass. ","为了达到罗马帝国 你必须收集一些宝物为了我们 给我们3个`大使萨奇、外交官环和政治家奖章和我们会通过让你通过来奖励你 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n It`s cruel,but i want him dead.\nWho?,you ask.\nGenghis(the terrible)Khan off course.\nAnd how am i suppose to get to him?you ask,\nBy boat off course.\nBut there are no boats here, you say to the seer.\nSummon one you stupid , he says.\nAnd what will i get in return if i kill him?\nThat my dear friend will be a surprise,says the seer.","这是残酷的, 但我希望他死。\n问谁?\n成吉思(可怕的)可汗偏离航向\n和我该怎么去找他?\n乘船离开航道\n但这里没有船,你说见\n他说,你这个蠢蛋,就传一个\n和如果我杀了他,我能得到什么回报?\n我亲爱的朋友会是个惊喜见"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Jeddite"," 杰德特"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Kill Semgal Khan and we will let you pass.","杀塞姆加尔 可汗 和我们会让你通过。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Now you can free Marion.Imprisoned here by Robin Hood when she didn`t want to marry him.She could collect troops for you here.","现在你可以自由了玛丽昂. 由罗宾当她不想嫁给他时 胡德可以在这里为你集结军队"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Now you can go south and give it to the border guard.\n \n ","现在你可以往南走和给它边防警卫。\n \n "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Swimming only!","只有游泳!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n Thank you.One day you might get it back.","谢谢 有一天你会拿回来的"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n The grail shall be revealed to the one who is chosen.Are you the chosen one.I don`t think so!","  圣杯须向被选中的人,你们是被选的吗?选一个 我不这么认为!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n The warning signal echoe in the cave.\n\"Leave the campfires and it`s creatures alone!\""," 警报信号回声洞穴。\n\"离开\"营火和约生物独自一人!\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n This land is sucking us dry.We could award you greatly if you could bring us the following artifacts,Charm of mana,Talisman of mana and Mystic orb of mana. ","这片土地把我们吸干了 如果你能带我们来 我们可以授予你巨大的奖赏下述宝物,魔力护符,魔法护符 和 魔力球. "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n We agree to let you pass now Maximus.To your homelands.But don`t expect a warm welcome.","我们同意你现在通过马克西姆斯来到你的故乡 但别期待受到热烈欢迎"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n You agree with that offer from the border guard.Now you can go south to the white border guard.You wonder what`s beyond there.","你同意我的提议现在你们可以往南去白色边防警卫,你想知道外面是什么?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n You see a Stronghold to the left.Wondering how to get there.The wild barbarians seems to be playing with you.You do not like that feeling","你可以看到准备如何到达那里。野生野蛮人似乎在玩弄你 你不喜欢那种感觉"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n You should have paid the border guard at the outpost of the world`s end.\nWe will not let you pass here without defeating the monsters there.","你应该付钱的边防警卫总部前世界末日\n我们不会让你走过这里,不败你那边有怪物"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n\" If you could bring me the vial of mercury i would be very happy.Not will i only let you pass here,i will also tell you a secret.Will you give it to me?\"","如果你能带我瓶装水银我会很高兴的,我不会只让你过来这里 我也会告诉你一个秘密 你愿意告诉我吗?\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n\"I`m not a prisoner,i`m a free man\"you shout to the man in front of you.\n\"You are right you are not a prisoner\"he answers.\n\"YOU ARE A DEAD MAN\"he shouts as loud as he can.","\"我不是囚犯,我是一个自由的人\" 你喊着在你面前的男人。\n\"你是对的,你不是囚犯\" 他回答。\n\"你是个死人\" 他大声叫喊,他可以。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n\"Yes,take shelter behind the border gate.And don`t come out without the shield.That`s all we have to say to you Maximus.Have a safe journey.\"","\"是的,躲在边境大门。和不要出来没有 护体神盾我们只能对你说这些马克西姆斯一路平安\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n\"Your troops seems like my kind\"says the cavaliers and wish to join you.You should accept. ","\"你的军队好像是我的同类\" 骑兵 和希望加入你们 你们应该接受 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n\"hihihiii från här är det inte så långt kvar.","嘻嘻，从这里往前已经没多远了。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n........and something is happening.The ground starts to shake and you hear that thunderlike sound from the ground.And it cracks wide open.You fall down in that crack.You are falling deeper and deeper and deeper down.Then suddenly you wake and you hear someone speaking.\n\"Greetings my dear warrior.I have something you would like very much right now\".\nAnd he hands it over to you.","........和正在发生一些事情地面开始颤抖和你听见那雷声响起地面。和你倒在裂缝中,你正在更深处和深层和然后,你忽然醒了,和你听到有人在说话\n\"祝福我亲爱的勇士 我有你现在非常想要的东西\"\n和他把它交给你。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n100 thousand Greater Basilik attack!","10万大巴西利克攻击!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\n10000 Gold.That`s what we want to let you pass.It`s nothing to you.Please give it to us.","10000 金币这就是我们想让你通过的东西 对你没什么,请给我们"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA Behemoth climbes down from the mountains and hands you a message.\n\"You stranger are not welcome here.This is a land where wild barbarians live.We are strong at heart but nevertheless weak in mind.We are true warriors and we enjoy it to the full.\"\nSomehow you sense great danger here.","AA比蒙从山山山区和给您发个信息\n你们这群陌生人不受欢迎,这里是野生野蛮人居住的国度。我们内心坚强,心智虚弱。我们确是真正的战士。和我们享受它满满的\"\n不知怎的,你觉得这里很危险"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA Lost soul approaches you from the direction of the lake.\n\"Good evening sire.I have a special message to you from\nmy good friends.It will come...actually it is coming right now!\"","迷失的灵魂接近你2008年12月23日,2013年湖边\n晚上好 殿下 我有一个特别的消息要给你\n我的好友们,会来的... 事实上它现在就来!\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA TALE THAT WASN`T RIGHT\nThere was a man named Robin Hood.He lived in the Sherwood forest.He stole from the rich and gave to the poor.At least that was what you have heard until now.\nYour scout came back today from the Sherwood forest.He had nothing but bad news for you.\"Yes Robin is there\",he says.\"But the tale you have heard is not right.Robin is just a tax collector for the British empire.And another thing\",the scout continues.\"Robin has friends who also are tax collectors\"\nYou thank the scout for the information and he rush off again.\nThis is bad you think,real bad.\n","说得不对\n有个男人叫罗宾胡德 胡德. 他住在舍伍德森林 他从富有和给给至少这是你迄今听到的。\n你的侦察兵今天从雪伍德森林 他只有坏消息要告诉你\"罗宾他说:\"但是。\"你们所听到的故事是不对的。罗宾只是一个收税的英国帝国和还有一件事,继续侦察\"罗宾也有朋友也是收税者”。\n感谢侦察信息信息信息和他又冲走了\n这是坏的,你认为, 真正的坏。\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA bit further you will find the cartographer.And you will see that you can`t visit it.Unless you are willing to sacrifice your whole army.Better leave it be.","再往远一点,你会发现制图员和你将看到你不能去参观它。除非你愿意牺牲你整个军队最好别管它了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA capitol and castle have been built today.So now your income will increase.","甲胺醇和城堡今天已经建成了 所以现在你的收入会增加"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA creature attack you suddenly!","一个生物突然攻击你!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA friendly group of monks invite you to stay in the sanctuary for the night.They will protect you against Xyron.","友好的一组国家僧侣邀请您留在避难避难所的他们将保护你免遭夜间袭击希瑞尔."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA friendly peasant shows up from nowhere.He`s got some information for you.\n\n\"I have heard of your coming Maximus.The peasant king sent me here to warn you.Now listen carefully.I will say this only once.\nIf you bring all the troops you can get Merlin will still be too strong for you.That is why i am telling you to leave all your troops behind(in the garrison)except for a couple of Arch Angels.ALWAYS KEEP TO THE LEFT ON THE WATER.When you see The red garrison choose to go right  and you will have a chance to visit the purple keymasters tent.Remember that surrender isn`t always for cowards.If Merlin attacks you,you have a tavern in King Arthurs castle.\"\nAnd the peasant disappears without a trace.","友好农民不知从哪冒出来的 他有些消息要告诉你\n\n\"我听说过你的到来\"马克西姆斯. 农民王派我到这儿来警告你 仔细听好了 我只说一次\n如果你把所有的所以,我叫你把你们所有的军队都留在后面)除两座拱门外,天使继续左边水,当你看到红卫军选择右转和你将有机会去拜访紫色钥匙师帐篷。记住投降并非总是为懦夫。如果梅林攻击你,你就在亚瑟国王城堡有一个酒馆。”\n和 农民消失无踪影"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA friendly peasant speak to Maximus.\n\"Go search for the gold Maximus.\"\n\"And find the one way to Mongolia.Genghis Khan lives there.\"\n\"But  watch out for Xyron.You can not fight Xyron.\"\nAnd that`s all the peasant said. ","友好农民说话用马克西姆斯.\n\"去寻找 金币 马克西姆斯.\"\n\"和查找查找查找通往蒙古的一条路成吉思 可汗生活在那里。\"\n但当心希瑞尔你不能战斗希瑞尔.\"\n和就这些 农民说。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA great thing is happening to Maximus as he leaving the Lucid pools.","一件伟大的事情正在发生马克西姆斯离境时的家属卢西德游泳池。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA month have passed now since Maximus woke up on the beach.Still he don`t remember how he got there.But he is almost certain that he must have been on a ship that went down.He is still remembering his dream about conquering the world and becoming the emperor.Somehow he feels that that dream could be his destiny.Maybe he was meant for it.Maybe he must conquer the world and become the emperor to find his way back to the Roman empire.","至今已有一个月了马克西姆斯醒来时但他几乎可以肯定 他一定是在一艘坠落的船上世界世界和成为 皇帝也许他注定要这么做 或许他必须征服世界世界和成为 皇帝寻找回他回到罗马帝国"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA new world disorder.\nChaos,pest and plague.\n\nMessage from the devil.","新的世界混乱\n混乱,虫害和瘟疫。\n\n发自 恶魔."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA peasant aproaches Maximus in a hurry.\n\"That was close,you almost opened the green border guard.You should stay here til tomorrow,otherwise we can`t find shelter for you the next day.\"\n\nNote to the player:\nTo be sure to get to the safe places,you should go back to the stables and visit it on day 1 next week and stay here with Maximus over the night and continue only on DAY 2 OF THE WEEK.\n","AA农民预处理马克西姆斯赶时间\n差一点 你差点就打开了绿色边界警卫队,你应该留在这儿直到明天 否则我们找不到藏身之处第二天\"。\"\n\n注释注玩家 :\n一定要做到安全的地方,你应该回去稳定马和下星期第1天访问和留在这马克西姆斯超过夜间和仅持续到一个星期。\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA peasant whisper to Maximus.\n\"Quick behind that border gate to the right,and stay there for the night.\"\nAnd the peasant disappears without a trace.","AA农民轻声播放马克西姆斯.\n\"在边境大门后快速到右,和呆在那里等夜深时分\"\n和 农民消失无踪影"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA powerful wizard owns this tower.  He refuses to let you pass unless you bring him the Blackshard of the Dead Knight, Shield of the Yawning Dead, Skull Helmet and Rib Cage.That is so he can build the powerful artifact\nArmor of the damned.He tells you that you might find all the pieces \nsomewhere among the Lost souls in the underworld.\nHe also tell you that the reward in the tree up north could make the difference between a succesful war,or death.\nNote to the player:Don`t forget about this border guard.Visit as soon as you can.\n","一个强大的巫师拥有这座塔  他不会让你通过,除非你带他来 黑魔剑, 亡灵盾, 骷髅冠 和 骨质胸甲那样他才能造出强大的宝物\n诅咒铠甲他告诉你,你可能会发现所有片块\n中间某处迷失的灵魂黑社会\n他还告诉你报酬中的报酬向北树上可以做战争或死亡之间的差别\n注释注玩家: 不要忘记这个边框守卫。 请尽快访问 。\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA reasonable amount of gold,but enormously strong guards.Is it worth it?","合理数额金币但是非常强大的守卫 值得吗?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA small quantity of gold,but strong guards.take it?","少量金币但是坚强的卫兵 拿着吧?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA strange creature approach you.He is handing over a message to you.\nYou read.\n\"You are welcome to this small kingdom Maximus.From here you can build a base and come back with troops from around the world.You will see that this place is old and not well taken care off.The path out is for your eyes to find.\"\nThe message ends without any signature.","一个奇怪的生物接近你 他给你一个信息\n你读。\n欢迎来到这个小王国马克西姆斯。从这里你可以建立一个基础和带着来自周围的军队回来你将看到这里是古老的和没有好好照顾。你的眼睛可以看见出路。\n信件结尾处没有任何签名。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nA stranger whispers in the seawind.\"Do not challenge the dragons outside the utopia.They will crystalize you.\"","一个陌生人在\"不要挑战\"外面的龙乌托邦,他们会把你化为一体。\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nActually this gems was left here by mistake when Genghis Khan was on his way home.","其实这个宝石被误落在这里 当成吉思 可汗是在回家的路上。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAn old wizard stops you and whisper something to you.\n\"Use maaagiic ahead,can`t get acroos cursed ground else.But danggeer there.I wwaarrrn yoouuuuu\".\nAnd suddenly the old wizard disapears.","一个老巫师拦住你和低语的东西给你。\n前面用马法基语,不能让被诅咒的地段被割断\n和突然间旧巫师的失物招领"},
