 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs they did now.You didn`t like that feeling at all.You decided to go against the Roman Empire and to not pay for the next week.The peasants around where so happy about that so they became your true friends,and helped you in any way they could.","你完全不喜欢这种感觉,你决定反对罗马帝国和不支付下周见 农民在那里如此快乐,所以他们成为你真正的朋友和他们尽一切可能帮助你"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you are about to summon a boat, you here a voice repeating a phrase over and over again.\n\"Death is god of all.\"\nYou wonder what it could mean.","当你即将召唤一艘船时 你在这里的呼声中 重复了一句话和再来一次\n\"死亡是万物之神\"\n你想知道这是什么意思吗?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you enter this little landing zone you havea strong feeling that war is not far.","当你进入这个小着陆区时 你有一种强烈的感觉 认为战争不远"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you marching towards the wood that you hope to be the treasure you are looking for you notice a dragon flying by to the south.","当你们朝向 木材你希望成为您正在寻找的宝藏中, 注意一条龙飞过南边。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you sail further into the darkness of this cavern,you start to realize all that is around you.Nothing is as it seems,nothing is safe...","当你们驶往这个洞穴的黑暗 你开始意识到周围的一切"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you sail through the channel,you feel a sudden warm feeling.And at once you get a bit wiser.","当你航行过时频道,你感到突然的温暖的感觉。和一旦你变得有点聪明了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAs you`re aproaching the guard you start thinking about you`re dream again.All the battles you fought to be the emperor.The fun you had exploring the world.But that was just a dreamworld.This is the real world and the guard ahead is for real.You can actually be killed by the guard.It frightens you a bit.But when you think about your home in Rome it makes you strong and you decide to kill that guard.Just so you one day might get home again.","因为你在自责警卫,你开始想起 你再次做梦。你们为战斗而战 皇帝.你探索的乐趣但这只是一个梦幻世界实际世界和前面的防守是真实的但是当你想到你在罗马的家时 就会变得坚强和你决定杀了那个警卫 以便你有一天能回家"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nAt an early age,Inteus mastery of fire earned him a spot with a group of entertainers.Some believed he was the son of the Fire god.One night,he felt a calling and left his profession.","早一点时代,恩托斯拥有火的主人和一群艺人为他赢得了一席之地,有人相信他是。国公公子公子有天晚上,他感觉到一个召唤和离开他的职业。"},
