 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nLet us introduce ourself to you.We are known by the name Ogres.Some even call us Ogre Magi.That is because we cast bloodlust on our allies.Bloodlust causes our troops to inflict a lot more damage on our enemies.That is why you should leave this place.Go home.","让我们向你们自我介绍一下。 名字 食人魔有人甚至打电话给我们食人魔玛吉,那是因为我们投嗜血奇术我们的盟友。嗜血奇术我们的军队会给我们的敌人造成更多伤害 所以你应该离开这个地方 回家吧"},
