 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nLong ago there was an artifact that brought happiness to a whole empire.It brought them so much resources that they could live in piece for centuries.That was until the fearful Genghis Khan came to their empire.He and his army fought a succesful war.They could easily have conquered the whole empire and they would have if it wasn`t for this artifact.When they found it they could`nt believe their eyes.Genghis had never seen such a beautiful thing in his whole life.So he took it and left the war to ride back with it to his home.He hasn`t fought a war since.\n\nNote to the player:You will need this artifact later to pass a border guard.","很久以前有一个宝物给整个帝国带来幸福 它给他们带来了这么多资源以至他们各个世纪后,能原样地生活。恐惧成吉思 可汗他来到了他们的帝国和他的军队打过一场战争 他们本可以轻易征服整个帝国和如果不是这个原因 他们就会有宝物当他们发现它的时候, 他们无法相信他们的眼睛。成吉思他这辈子从未见过这么美丽的东西 所以他拿走了和左左他从此就没打过仗\n\n注释注播放器: 您需要这个宝物之后通过边防警卫。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nLong ago, powerful wizards were able to create magical artifacts, but time has caused us to forget how to make new items.  I would like to learn these techniques myself, but I need one of these artifacts first to see how it was done.  If you could bring me, the Vial of Dragon Blood, you would be well rewarded. ","很久以前 强大的巫师创造了魔法宝物但是时间让我们忘记了如何制作新项目。  我想自己学习这些技巧 但我需要其中之一宝物首先看看它是如何完成的。  如果你能带我走 龙之血瓶你会得到很好的奖励 "},
