 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus cannot believe his eyes.Is this for real or just another dream?It`s hard to tell.A black sea with some sorts of clouds on it.Whatever he expected it was not this.","马克西姆斯这是真实的还是另一个梦? 很难说黑海上面有乌云,"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus dream about becoming the Emperor of the word is starting to fade now.He realizes that he has no home and no food to eat .The time is going fast.He ask around for information and gets a little from the archers around here.They say there is a castle within reach.But he must move quickly to get there in time.And that castle belongs to a cleric named Longbow and he is a specialist in archery.You need more troops to get to that castle,says the archers.Longbow has put out guards so that no uninvited guests should arrive.You wonder how you can reach \nthat castle and you decide to just move on and see what happens. ","马克西姆斯梦想成为 皇帝联 联 年 月 日 月他意识到自己没有家和没有食物吃。时间飞快,他到处问情况和得到一点点来自 弓箭手附近有人说有座城堡可以靠近 但他必须迅速行动才能及时到达和城堡属于一个叫朗宝的神职人员和他是一个专家箭术你需要更多部队才能到达城堡 弓箭手Longbow已经派出警卫, 以免任何未受邀请的客人到来。\n那个城堡和你决定继续前进和看看会发生什么。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus dream is over.He is slowly recovering from his long sleep.He wakes on the beach.He sees the shipwreck and the dead bodies around.Wondering if he is the only survivor.\nHe is remembering his dream.The dream about conquering the world and becoming the emperor.It was a good dream and it felt so real to him.First he killed all the tax collectors back in Rome.The Peasants were so happy about that so they helped Maximus a lot by building up castles and contributing gold to Maximus.\nAnd so many troops arrived and wanted to join him.So  Maximus grew strong and continued his war.It was a succesfull war.Maximus conquered the whole world and he became the new Emperor. ","马克西姆斯梦已经过去,他正在从长眠中慢慢恢复他看见,船舶沉船和尸体周围。 如果他是的话,他一定会死的只有幸存者。\n他在回忆他的梦想梦想征服世界世界和成为 皇帝那是个好梦和对他而言感觉如此真实 首先他杀了所有的人罗马的税务员 农民如此高兴,所以他们相助马克西姆斯建造城堡是很多事和捐款金币至马克西姆斯.\n和这么多部队到来和想加入他 所以...马克西姆斯强劲增长和继续他的战争,这是一场无休止的战争马克西姆斯已征服全世界全世界和成为新建新皇帝. "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus feels the sadness coming over him.He has always wondered what happened to his brother.It has been so many years since Maximus last heard of him.But he somehow thought that he would be alive.Fidor was an adventurer in heart and mind.","马克西姆斯感觉他一直想知道他弟弟发生了什么事。马克西姆斯他最后听说了他,但他不知何故以为他还活着。Fidor内心深处是一个冒险家。和头脑。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus is slowly recovering and he feels his strength is coming back more and more.That axe will probably be useful as well.","马克西姆斯正在缓慢恢复和他觉得自己的力量 回来了更多和更多,斧头可能也会有用。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus is wondering why the scout havent been heard of for so long.He ask all the friendly peasants around if they have seen or heard from him,but the answer is always the same.No one has either seen or heard from him for at least a month now.Maximus have a bad feeling about that.Maybe something have happened to him.","马克西姆斯想知道为什么好久没听到童子军的消息了 他问所有人友好友好农民假若他们看见他,或听到他的消息,那末,他必在他们的周圍。总是答案至今至少一个月没有人见过他或听到他的消息。马克西姆斯也许他出事了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus seems to be a bit lost without the scout.\nHe is wondering where the purple keymasters tent could be,so he can pass to the south,outside Brother Tucks castle.\nAnd he is wondering where to go next.What would be the smartest thing to do.\nWell,if the scout doesn`t come back soon,he have some tough decisions to make in the future.","马克西姆斯好像有点迷路了没有侦察兵\n他想知道,紫金钥匙主管帐篷可能就是,所以他可以通过南边的塔克斯兄弟城堡\n和他想知道下一步要去哪里。做最聪明的事\n如果侦察兵不会很快回来 他有些艰难的决定要做出未来。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nMaximus thinking about what the peasant said.Search for the gold was one thing he said.What gold could he mean.Is there a treasure somewhere here,it must be Maximus thinks.\nWatch out for Xyron you can`t fight him,was another thing the peasant said.That must mean i can`t go that way or is it possible somehow to get pass him.Maximus are thinking about that posibility for a while.At last he decides to try to get pass Xyron just so he one day can see the strange land of Mongolia.","马克西姆斯思考什么 农民寻找 金币他说了一件事 什么?金币他的意思是。 是否有一个宝藏 在这里某处,它必须是马克西姆斯思考。\n小心点希瑞尔你无法和他打斗,是另一回事 农民意思是我不能走那条路 或者有可能通过他马克西姆斯他最后决定尝试通过希瑞尔使他有朝一日能看见蒙古的奇特土地"},
