 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNote to the player!\nDo not summon a boat after this Lighthouse.You will be trapped if you do.","注释注玩家!\n灯塔之后别叫船来,你就会被困住"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNote to the player!\nYou can not land your boat ahead.To get to that place(wich you must)you have to water walk from where you entered this labyrinth.But to reach it from there you have to have visited a stable the same week.If you not reach it anyway,get rid of your slowest creatures in Maximus army.\nAnd there is another hidden place somewhere here.Do the same to get to that place. ","注释注玩家!\n你不能在前面降落你的船。凌波微步进入迷宫的地方,但要到达迷宫,你必须去过马厩。同样的一周。 如果你没有到达它反正, 摆脱你最慢的生物内马克西姆斯军队。\n和这里还有另一个隐藏的地方。 Do与到达那个地方相同。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNote to the player.\nDo not waste your time by trying to reach it now.You will be stopped if you havent been to the north of this labyrinth and defeated the conflux king.","注释注玩家。\n不要浪费时间试图到达它。 如果你没有去, 你会被阻止的这个迷宫以北和已击败组合王。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNote to the player.\nDon`t let Christian die or anything else.You will need him in the end of the game.\nHe could collect troops for you til`then.","注释注玩家。\n不要让克里斯丁或别的什么,你需要他期末游戏。\n到那时他可以为你们集结军队"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNote to the player.\nDon`t let Marion die or something else.You will need her in the end of the game.\nShe could collect troops for you til`then.","注释注玩家。\n不要让玛丽昂死亡或别的东西。 你会需要她在期末游戏。\n到那时她可以为你集结军队"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow Maximus knows why he woke up on the beach.","现在马克西姆斯知道他为什么醒来海滩。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow it`s real bad in your troops.","现在,这是真正的坏 在你的部队。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow that you have vanquished Semgal Khan, the threat is gone.You may pass.But be careful what you do now. You are not far from Genghis Khan and his fearful army.","你们确已灭亡了,塞姆加尔 可汗, 威胁已经消失 你可能会通过 但要小心你现在做什么 离你不远成吉思 可汗 和他可怕的军队。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow you have found the entrance to the devils empire.Proceed with caution.","现在你找到了进入 恶魔帝国,小心行事"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow you have reliesed A friend of Robin Hood.Brother Tuck they call him.\nHe has been waiting here for you,so he can get his revenge.","现在你依赖一个朋友罗宾胡德,他们叫他塔克兄弟\n他一直在这里等你,所以他可以报复"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nNow.","现在"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nOh no!Dwarfs.Just what you thought.It`s the hardworking dwarfs that has cut all the trees.They must have a master here too.","哦不!矮人就像你所想的一样辛勤工作矮人已经切除全部树,他们在这里一定也有主人"},
