 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nSCOUT REPORT \nHe tells you about the Hall of the gods wich is located in the underworld.But the monolith just beside Longbow leads to it.\nHe tells you that there are four gods there and they are\nGod of water,Fire,Earth and Air.\n\"You must fight them one by one,\"he says\n\"First you must fight and defeat God of water.Then the border guard will let you\n pass to the south where Arthur lives.Arthur is the king of Brittania and he is the one who is responsible for all this tax collecting.\"  ","实际报告报告\n他跟你说过大会堂神与神位于地下世界,但就在朗波旁边的巨石 通向它\n他告诉你那里有四神和这些人\n上帝的水, 火灾,地球和空气\n他说:\"你必须逐个和他们战斗\"\n\"首先你们必须战斗\"和然后,以水击败真主。边防警卫会放你们走\n传到以南,亚瑟生命。亚瑟是国王 年不列颠 和他是一个他负责征收一切税项。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nSCOUT REPORT \nHe tells you that there is a castle a few days ride to the east.\nAnd that you need troops there.Cause it`s not unguarded.There is also a prison there wich could be of some use to you, he says.\nThe scout runs off again.This time he will go further away.","实际报告报告\n他告诉你,有城堡 几天的旅程东面\n和在那里需要军队 因为那里不是无人看守的\n侦察兵又跑掉了 这次他会走得更远"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nSafe at last you think.But you realize that there is no turning back now.\nYou can`t Town portal to one of your castles now,cause that means you have to come this way again.And Xyron might block your way then.You have to find yourself a castle somewhere.","最终你会觉得安全,但你意识到现在没有回头路了\n你不能时空之门现在去你的城堡之一, 因为这意味着你必须再次来到这里。和 希瑞尔可能会挡住你的路 你必须找个城堡"},
