 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe Mongols don`t know much about the sea.They have never been true sailors.They have always fought their wars on land.This makes your army feel safe here on this narrow path.","蒙古人不太了解他们从来就不是真正的水手 他们总是在陆地上打仗 这使你的军队在这条狭窄的道路上感到安全"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe Pit lords saved treasure!"," 深渊领主保存的宝藏!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe Queen was so beautiful in her white dress.The most beautiful girl you have ever seen.And she was in the love with you.The priest before you asked the question to her\"Do you Queen of Wonderland take Maximus the Great to be your husband and your one and only husband for as long as you live.\"The answer.\n                                  \" Y E S \"","女王穿着白裙子那么漂亮最美丽的女孩 你见过。和她当时在爱你在你问牧师之前向她提问\"您是否愿意 神奇之地女王马克西姆斯 做你丈夫真好和属于你的和\"只要你活着就只有丈夫了\"回答。\n\" Y Y E S \""},
