 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe Royal Griffins has arrived today."," 皇家狮鹫今天到达。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe Sherwood forest troops seems to be willing to join your war.","舍伍德森林部队似乎愿意加入你们的战争"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe angels came to you.They flew from the sky just to visit you.They gave you happiness and glory.They joined you and they fought for you.They resurrected an entirely wiped out army for you.They helped you in any way they could and they stand up for you so grand in the nightsky."," 天使他们从你身边飞来天空只是来拜访你 他们给了你幸福和荣耀,他们与你同在和他们为你们而战,他们为你而复活一支被消灭的军队。他们尽一切可能地帮助你们。和他们为你站起来 如此盛大在夜间。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe angry machines attack!","愤怒机器攻击!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe barbarians have begun to fear you now,and perhaps they will even more if you open this box.Or maybe it is a trap.Well you know what to do.","野蛮人开始害怕你了和如果你打开这个盒子,也许他们还会更棒。 或者说它可能是一个陷阱。你知道该怎么做。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe border guard agrees to let you by in exchange for the Shield of the Damned.  Do wish to pass at this time to the strange lands of Mongolia?","边防警卫同意让你来交换 邪盾.  请在此时间通过蒙古的陌生土地?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe border guard is admant.  Without the Shield of the Damned, none will pass.","边防警卫是副官。  没有 邪盾, 任何人都不得通过."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe campfires attracts danger,and danger attacks you.","营火会带来危险和危险攻击你。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe conversation continues.\nYou ask the peasant if he has seen anybody else pass here lately.\n\"No,you`re the only one Maximus\"he replies.\nAnd you ask him  How far away the castle that the archer told you about is.\n\"Not very far,he says.But you have to travel through a subterranean gate wich is guarded to get there.So be careful Maximus.\"\nYou thank the friendly peasant and rush off.","继续对话。\n你自问 农民如果他最近看见别人经过这里\n\"不,你是只有一个马克西姆斯\"他的答复。\n和你问他多远城堡 弓箭手告诉你是。\n他说不远,但你必须经过地下通道守备森严,所以要小心马克西姆斯.\"\n感谢友好友好农民 和赶着走"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe dragons attacked you and there were millions of them.You raised your sword in the sky.You shouted at them\"Fear my sword dragons,it`s the sword of your JUDGMENT.","龙龙袭击你和你举起剑来害怕我的剑龙,它为你辩护的剑。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe dream","梦想"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe evil forces beginning to appear now.You see the anti-magic garrison ahead with legions of Demons.Somehow you know that there will be harder challenges ahead.","邪恶的力量开始出现前方有一支反魔法部队恶鬼你知道未来会有更艰巨的挑战"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe eyes in the shadows come closer and they attack!","眼睛中阴影更近一点和他们攻击!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe friendly archers and peasants also tell you that you need to visit the stable ahead so you can reach the castle Longbow in time.And they tell you that troops of your own kind will always join you.You thank them and rush off towards the stables and towards Longbow.","友好友好弓箭手 和 农民并告诉你,你需要访问使你能够达到长弓城堡及时到来和他们告诉你,你的同类部队 将永远与你同在和冲向稳定马和向隆弓前进"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe gods have spoken.\"Do not dare to enter the hall.Only gods are welcome there.If you enter we will send you straight to hell.\"","神 曾 說 、 你 們 不 可 进 入众神明在那里是受喜悦的。如果你们进去,我们将派你们入火狱。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe grail secret lies here,are you the chosen one?"," 圣杯秘密的谎言在这里,你是选择一个吗?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe grail shall be revealed to the one who is chosen."," 圣杯须向他们是被拣选的,"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe grail shall be revealed,to the one who is chosen."," 圣杯将被揭发,他们是被拣选的,"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe guard","警卫警卫"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe guess was right.The footsteps came from a Giant.You see legions of them ahead.Guarding the entrance to the winterland.","猜对了脚步来自巨人你看到他们前面的军团 守卫进入冬地。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe horsekeeper behind the stables speak to Maximus.\n\"Greetings my dear warrior,i see you brought some soldiers with you.\nMaximus reply\"Greetings my dear peasant,yes i brought some soldiers,quite a lot infact.I must find my way back home to Rome.\"\n\"Well, then you must be smart cause these troops won`t help you against Xyron.He is much stronger than you.\"\n\"Must go anyway\"Maximus reply.\n\"Well then i will help you the peasant says.The first thing you should do now is to stay here through the night.Tomorrow you will ride as fast as you can.Some of my friends will guide you along the way as well,so you listen to them warrior!\"\n\"I will and thank you,peasants are always my friends\".","后面的守马人与马克西姆斯.\n\"祝福我亲爱的勇士, 我看到你带来了一些士兵与你同行。\n马克西姆斯感谢亲爱的农民我带了些士兵来 说了很多不实之事 我必须找到回罗马的路\n\"你一定聪明,因为这些部队 无法帮助你对抗\"希瑞尔他比你强多了\"\n\"无论如何,一定要去\"马克西姆斯答复。\n\"那么我会帮你\" 农民说。你要做的第一件事 就是留在这儿明天晚上你会骑尽最快的速度 我的朋友会指引你你也要听他们的勇士!\"\n\"我会\"和谢谢农民永远是我的朋友。”"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe labyrinth is truly a dark and sinister place.\nYou feel as if the caverns are watching you.\nAs you stare into the darkness the darkness stares back.\nA shiver crawls up your spine as you wonder whether \"The Four\" created this place,or if it created them.","迷宫真是黑暗和阴险的地方\n你感觉好像洞穴在看着你。\n当你凝视黑暗黑暗凝视着背影\n颤抖的刺从你的脊椎爬上来,因为你想知道是否 \"四\"创造了这个地方, 或者如果它创造了它们。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe labyrinth of the Four.","迷宫四岁"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe largest amount of gold.and the biggest armyTake it?","最大数额金币.和最大的军队拿它吗?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe lost souls are sucking mana.","迷失的灵魂在吸马纳。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe lost souls did take so much from you.The Tome of earth,water and Admirals hat.Now how can you pass the black border guard.You have no clue at all.Is this really the end of your search for Rome you wonder.Perhaps you were not meant to find your way back home.You take a step forward and..........","失去的灵魂确实夺走了你很多东西地球的多米水和 海军上将之帽现在你如何能通过黑边防,你根本不知道或许你不应该找到回家的路和.........."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe mermaids sing a sweet song you will never forget.You swear to someday come back and listen again.","美人鱼唱着甜美的歌 你永远不会忘记和再听一遍。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe mountain walls of the pass echo with the sounds of your army`s movement.\nYou are constantly looking up,warily as you sense great danger here.","山墙时过回声军队运动的声音\n你不断抬头看 感觉这里很危险"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe name is just Unknown.This castle have no master.Only wild creatures\nhave have taken control over it.Fight them and be the new master."," 名字这个城堡没有主人 只有野生的生物\n已经控制了它,去对付他们吧和be be 的新大师"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe old Wizard comes back and whisper to you.\n\"Where are you going?Cannot go down there Must be strong first,else you`re dead.","旧向导回来和轻轻地对你说。\n\"你要去哪里?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe outpost of the world`s end.","总部前世界末日"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasant shout at you as you are going north.\n\"Wait Maximus,why the hurry.I have some information for you\".\nYou stop and listen.\n\"The evil forces of the Roman empire are strong,Maximus.You have to be careful here.You may need help.If you could find the two Tome of earth artifacts,you could bring help here.Caesar is the strongest of all.He has collected troops in the empire for long now,and they are the best of all troops.Bring two of your friends and let them fight Caesar before you,than you might have a chance.I know they won`t probably be as strong as you are Maximus,but if you could find the hidden monolith that are rumoured to be somewhere here in the Roman empire,they will be strong.You will see.That`s all i have to say for now Maximus.Good luck.\"\nYou thank the peasant and rush off."," 农民当你向北走的时候,你对你大喊大叫\n\"等等\"马克西姆斯为什么我有些消息要告诉你\"\n你停下来和听着\n\"邪恶势力的邪恶力量罗马帝国很强大马克西姆斯你在这里必须小心,你可能需要帮助 如果你能找到地球两度宝物你可以带帮手过来 Caesar他已派遣部队,长久以来,帝国和这些人带两个朋友来和让他们在你之前跟凯撒作战 而不是你可能有机会 我知道他们不会像你这么坚强马克西姆斯但是如果你能找到被传闻在某处的隐藏石块罗马帝国,它们会很强大 你会看到,我只有这些暂时说马克西姆斯. 好幸运术.\"\n感谢 农民 和赶着走"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasant told you to keep left.Now it`s too late!"," 农民叫你左转 现在太晚了!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasants are working day and night so even more buildings have been finished today.Just as the peasants told you."," 农民工作日和晚上,所以更多的建筑 今天已经完工。 农民告诉你。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasants are working hard and even more buildings have been finished today."," 农民正在辛勤工作和今天,更多的建筑已经完工。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasants around Rome are so happy that you have come home again.\nThey have built an artifact while you were gone.And as a token for true friendship they give it to you."," 农民罗马各地都很高兴你又回到了家\n他们建造了宝物当你离开的时候和以示他们给予你的真友情。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe peasants promise you that some buildings will be ready everyday,til the castle is finished.Except the Portal,the tavern and the highest mage guild wich they haven`t knowledge to build.You pay the peasants some gold in advance."," 农民答应你,有些建筑 将每天准备就绪城堡已经完成。除此以外门户,酒馆和最高法师他们没有知识可以建立。 农民部分金币预发本。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe road to Longbow is to the north.Just follow the road to get there in time.","通往朗波的公路向北,跟着及时赶到那里"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe shadow gate stands behind you.A tremble runs through your veins as you feel the empty eyes of the dead  watching you...","你身后有一道阴暗的门 颤抖在你的血管中流淌空眼看着你死去..."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe stench of death rises from this cavern.\nYou wonder if it`s wise to continue...","死气沉沉的恶臭从这个洞穴里涌出\n你想知道继续下去是否明智..."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe tree guards attack!","树卫攻击!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe troops halt you on your way towards the smoke.\n\"We will not go that way\",they say.\n\"But that`s the only way\",you answer.\nSilence............\nMaximus breaking the silence,\n\"If we ever going to reach Rome,we have to go this way.It is our destiny.\"\nThe troops answer,\n\"We never thought it would be such a long and hard way to the Roman empire.\"\nMaximus.\n\"Neither did i\",he answers.\"But we have travelled far together and you have been a loyal troop always,don`t let me down now,when i need you the most.\nA short silence,then Maximus speak again.\n\"Those of you who wishes to leave,leave now.\"\nMaximus is waiting,so far none has left.He is waiting a bit more,and there is still no one leaving.\n","军队阻止你们进军烟雾。\n他们说\"我们不会走那条路\"\n\"但是,这是唯一的方法\",你回答。\n安静...\n马克西姆斯间断中沉默,\n\"如果我们要去罗马,我们必须走这条路。 这是我们的命运\"\n部队回答,\n\"我们从没想过会这么长\"和很难找到\"罗马帝国\"\n马克西姆斯.\n\"我也没有,他回答\" 但是我们一起旅行很远和你一直是忠心的军队 现在不要让我失望,当我需要你的时候多数。\n短暂的沉默,然后马克西姆斯再说一次\n\"你们中想离开的人 现在就走\"\n马克西姆斯正在等待,至今没有任何人离开他。他在等待,和仍然没有人离开。\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe troops pay rent for staying in the castle","部队部队为留在营地支付租金城堡"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe warning signal echoe all over the cave.\n\"Leave the campfires and it`s creatures alone!\"","警报信号 到处回声洞穴。\n\"离开\"营火和约生物独自一人!\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe warning signal echoe in the whole cave.\n\"Leave the campfires burning\"","警报信号回声整个洞穴\n\"离开\"焚烧营火\""},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe water is crystal clear and the ceiling full with bats.You lower your hand to touch the water.You are surprised that the water is so cold.","水晶是清洁的,和手放下来触碰水,你对水感到惊讶水是如此寒冷。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe wizard agrees to let you by in exchange for the Blackshard of the Dead Knight, Shield of the Yawning Dead, Skull Helmet and Rib Cage.\n ","巫师同意让您来交换 黑魔剑, 亡灵盾, 骷髅冠 和 骨质胸甲.\n "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThe wood elf stops you on your way to Treasurehunt.\nThey say that farmers are not aloud to ride on this road.\nYou say that you are no farmer anymore,You are Maximus a warrior from Rome."," 木精灵阻止你去寻宝途中\n他们说,农民们不大声疾呼,不敢在这条路上骑马。\n你说你不再是农民了 你是马克西姆斯来自罗马的战士"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nTheir mission is to kill!","他们的任务是杀人!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThen he woke up here on the beach.He don`t remember how he got here.He thinks he must have been sailing and the ship went down.He sees the dead bodies floating on the water,wondering if he is the only survivor.\nAnd he looks at his army.Only one Cavalier.How can i survive here with only one Cavalier he wonders.\nWell ,there is no time to wonder anymore.Maximus must find himself a castle. ","然后他醒来 醒来在这里他不记得他是怎么来到这里的 他认为他一定是在航行和他看见船坠下,漂浮在如果他是雨水,只有幸存者。\n和他看着他的军队 只有一支骑兵我怎么能在这里生存 只有一个骑兵他觉得奇怪。\n好了,没有时间去思考了马克西姆斯必须找到自己的城堡。 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThere are even flowers in this wildland.","这片荒野甚至还有花朵"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThere is nothing here.","这里什么都没有"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThere is slight movement here and you see eyes in the shadows.The campfires warn you about the danger here.The more campfires the more creatures will attack.","这里的动动微弱和看见眼睛阴影。营火警告你这里有危险更多营火更多生物将攻击。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThere will be no warnings,just devastating attacks.","不会有任何警告 只是毁灭性的攻击"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThese one eyed creatures Will gladly join your war.","这些眼神,生物乐意加入你们的战争"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey are coming out of the crypt.They are dead soldiers with a mission.","他们从他们是一个任务中死去的士兵"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey are wild and they are hungry.They will fight you and they will eat you.\nThey call out to you\"defend yourself\"and you do.","他们是野生的和肚子饿了,会打你和他们会吃掉你\n他们呼唤你\"保护你自己\"和你这样做。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey have seen you coming.The eyes in the shadows of the cave have been watching you.It`s the eyes of the four that have been staring at you and followed every move you have made.The four are prepared,are you?","他们看见你来了眼睛中阴影的阴影洞穴一直注视着你双眼四 个 盯着 你 的 眼看和你们所行的善功,将随着他们而实现。四号已经准备好了,是吗?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey helped you by building up the castle and they contributed with gold now and then.Troops arrived to your castles and you became strong,so you decided to fight the empire.It was when you lost the fight against Caesar  you were banished from the land forever.You went away with a boat that sank after a couple of weeks on the sea.Then you woke up on the beach,with no memory.You were the only survivor.Now you are back in the Roman Empire,and revenge burns in your heart and mind.You have become strong over the past year.You thought Rome was paradise on earth,but now you remember that it`s not.You must stop this tax collecting immediality.","他们帮助你 建立城堡和他们用他们所捐献的金币现在和之后,小车来到你们的城堡和你变得坚强,所以你决定战斗帝国的时代 你迷失了与你被逐出的凯撒战斗你带着一艘船走了 几周后沉没了然后你在海中醒来海滩,没有记忆现在你们又回来了罗马帝国和复仇在你的心中燃烧和你变得坚强了罗马是地球上的天堂 但现在你记住了不,你必须停止收税"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey pay you some of their savings as well.","他们还付你一些储蓄"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThey say,\"100 guards one half\".A half for each 100?","他们说\"100个警卫 一半\" 每100人一半?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis bridge wasn`t here before.You must have been away for a long time now.","这座桥以前不在这里 你一定已经离开很久了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis gold belongs to Genghis Khan,our Emperor.Leave it here.","这个金币属于成吉思 可汗,我们的皇帝留在这儿"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis is a special note to the player.\n\nTo be able to complete the map,you should read the events.Some info there can be very important.\nMaximus must learn the following secondary skills.(Pathfinding,fire and water magic).This is very important.If you don`t get to choose these skills from experiance you will learn them from Witch huts close to your first castle.\nSome places are hidden,so keep your eyes open.\n\nIf you get any problems along the way,you can always email me//Darklord.\nE-mail         hap654b@tninet.se","特此在此特别说明玩家。\n\n能够完成您应该读作有些信息可能非常重要\n马克西姆斯必须学习后继第二技能。 (寻路术,火和 水系魔法这是非常重要的。如果你不能选择这些技能 从性欲中选择, 你会从你第一个城堡附近的巫术小屋里学习。\n有些地方是隐蔽的,所以要睁大眼睛。\n\n如果你遇到任何问题那样的话 你可以给我//达克洛德发邮件\n电子邮件:hap654b@tninet.se"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis is a trap!!!","这是陷阱!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis is not the gold you are looking for.","不是这样的 金币你在找的东西。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis is the Kings crown,not yours!","这是皇冠,不是你的!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis is the adventure of Maximus.A warrior from Rome.He was banished from his homeland.He went away by sea.The ship sank.Maximus was the only survivor.He woke up on a beach with no memory of what have happened.Now Maximus must find his way back to Rome.","这是历险的冒险马克西姆斯罗马的勇士 被逐出故乡船沉没。马克西姆斯原为他醒来在海滩上 完全不记得发生了什么 现在马克西姆斯一定要找到回罗马的路"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis library is not for visitors.Begone!","这个图书馆不是访客用的 走开!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis passage is safe as there are no campfires here.Get the picture?","这个通道是安全的 因为这里没有营火图片?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThis place is so strange and beautiful.You can`t help yourself as you start to dance along the dancers in the garden.","这地方好奇怪和美丽,你无法自忍 当你开始跳舞时舞女花园。"},
