 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nThunderbirds have arrived from the mountains.Another message is handed over to you.\n\"Die,die,die.Die by my wild barbarian forces out here or die by my own hands.\"\nSigned/Hrodogrin the terrible.","雷鸟从山岳的另一条消息已交给你们。\n\"死,死,死了。 死在我的野兽部队 在这里或者死在我自己的手。\"\n签字/签署赫罗多格林 可怕的可怕。"},
