 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nWhat a discovery.How could those wild barbarians have missed it?They must be blind you think.","这些野生野蛮人怎么会错过呢?双目失明你会想。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nWhat could it be here behind us?Maybe nothing at all,or maybe a trap.","也许一无所有 或者陷阱"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nWhat!!Maximus shouts.\nThis is my grave but i`m not dead.Why?\nMaximus don`t understand a thing.","什么!马克西姆斯喊叫声。\n这是我的坟墓 但我还没死 为什么?\n马克西姆斯什么都不懂"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nWith a burning desire to gain in power and protect her homeland.Adrienne became a social outcast and hated by her own people.","与渴望获得权力的燃烧欲望和保护她的祖国。埃德妮成为社会弃儿和被自己的人民所憎恨"},
