 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nWrong passage!!!Robins bandits attack!!!","错路了 罗宾斯强盗攻击"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYes,it`s here.The hidden monolith.\nA peasant comes forward from the bushes.\n\"There`s no use for you Maximus,to enter the monolith.Let Christian and Marion go there and they will find what they need to be able to fight Caesar.","是的,它在这里。隐藏的石碑。\nAA农民从树丛。\n\"你没有用处\"马克西姆斯输入单之一.克里斯丁 和 玛丽昂去那边和他们会找到他们需要的东西 才能和凯撒作战"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYes,you have found the entrance.","是的,你找到了入口。"},
