 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou enter a strange anti-magic zone.","你进入了一个奇怪的反魔法区"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou found a book lying on the ground.You pick it up.Reading the title.\n                             T O M E OF A I R\nYou suddenly wake up.\n\nWell at least you gain something.","你发现一本书 躺在地面,你把它捡起来标题。\n一、《一一一》的\n你突然醒来。\n\n至少你得到一些东西"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou found another entrance to one of the Four. ","你找到了另一个入口四岁 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou get a little spell points.","你得到一点点法术点。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou got a message as you are about to open the red border.You don`t see who it comes from,you just hear the whisper.\n\"Stay here through the night and make sure you have built the tavern in Kings castle.\"\n","当你即将打开时, 您得到了一个消息红色边界。 你看不到它来自谁,你只是听到轻声低语\n\"留在这里经过夜间和确保您已经建造了\"国王城堡的酒馆\"\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou have find the help you need against Genghis Khan.","你找到了需要帮助或帮助成吉思 可汗."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou have seen this place before.Now it comes to your memory.You didn`t remember why you woke up on the beach before,now you do.","你以前见过这个地方 现在想起你的记忆了 你不记得为什么你醒来之前的海滩,现在你做。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou learn something on this holy ground.","你在这神圣的土地上学到了一些东西"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou must be very careful here.This is the place where you lost the ship before.You don`t remember what happened then,But soon you might.","你在这里一定要非常小心失所地点你不记得当时发生了什么 但很快你就会知道"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou notice the trees.How they have been cut down.This must be it.The wood that the border guard needs must be here.You continue south but think you must be very careful.Whoever cut those trees must be here somewhere.","你注意到树苗是怎样被砍掉的,必须如此。 木材且边界警卫必须在这里。你继续往南走,但认为你必须非常小心。谁砍那些树,谁肯定就在这附近。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou recieve information today from all the friendly peasants and archers around.\nThey say that you are in a kingdom called Brittania.They have a king and his name is Arthur.He is an evil king and he collect taxes from farmers in his entire kingdom.\nThis sound so familiar to you.It is just like in your dream,but then it was the Roman empire that collected taxes.","你今天从所有人那里收集信息友好友好农民 和 弓箭手周围。\n他们说:你们在一个被召去的王国中,不列颠他们有一个国王和三、其名字是亚瑟他是个邪恶的国王和他向整个王国的农民征税\n这声音如此使魔它就像在你的梦中,但后来罗马帝国收税"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou remember a rumour you heard about an ancient artifact a long time ago.The famous Statue of legion is supposed to be here in the barbarian wildlands.You decide to keep your eyes open to find every hidden path that may lead to it.","你还记得一个传闻吗? 你听说过一个古老的宝物很久以前的事了出名天赐神兵应该是在这里你决定睁大眼睛 寻找所有可能通往它的秘密道路"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou remember stories from the old that spoke of this place.\nAll of them spoke of death and horrors beyond imagination.\nYou hope that these were just tales meant to scare children.\nBut somehow you think that they were not.","你还记得从古老的说起这个地方。\n他们都谈论死亡和无法想象的恐怖\n你希望这些只是用来吓唬孩子的故事\n但不知何故你觉得他们不是"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see Orcs ahead and you are not surprised of their looks.Your brother Fidor once told you they were the most ugly creatures in the world,you agree.\n","你看,你看半兽人未来和你弟弟菲多尔曾经告诉你最丑陋生物内世界,你同意。\n"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see a peasant in the bushes.He speaks to you.\n\"Who are you?I`ve never seen you here before.\"\nYou reply.\"I am Maximus a warrior from Rome.\"\n\"Then you are a long long way from home.What are you doing here Maximus?\"\n\"I actually don`t know.I woke up on the beach a few days ago and i don`t remember how i got there. ","你看,你看农民内灌木丛 他跟你说话\n\"你是谁?\n\"你回答我,我是\"马克西姆斯来自罗马的勇士\n\"那么你离家很远 你在这里做什么\"马克西姆斯?\"\n\"我不知道,我醒来时几天前海滩和我不记得我是怎么到那的 "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see a small group of Medusas ahead.Wondering what they are doing here in the middle of nowhere.You decide to kill them just because they are in your way.","你看到一小组美杜莎了解他们在这里所做的一切你决定杀了他们 就因为他们挡了你的路"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see cyclops ahead.and you hope this is the last of the barbarians.You thought killing Hrodogrin was enough.","你看,你看独眼巨人前面。和希望这是最后一个野蛮人。 你想杀人?赫罗多格林已经足够了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see more of those fire creatures ahead.You hope you don`t have to fight them.","你更多看见那些火生物你希望你不必和他们战斗"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see the sun going down in the northwest.The darkness falls and the sky is clear.You feel the wind blow on your skin.Suddenly you realize the cold.It must be several degrees below the freezing point.You regret you did`nt brought more clothes with you.But you don`t complain and you convince your troops to continue even further north.You decide to go on towards the cold part of the world.","你看,你看太阳落下西北部黑暗降临和天空清空,你感觉风吹在皮肤上,你忽然意识到了。下方必须有几度冷冻点,你后悔没带更多衣服和你说服你的部队 继续往北走冰冷部分世界。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see yet another garrison ahead.This time it seems to be impossible to fight the guardians.Maybe you have to walk on fire to get any further.","这次似乎无法战斗或许你不得不在火上行走 才能取得更多进展"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou see yet another stable ahead.If you missed the last one you should have \na visit to this one.Those cavaliers seems to be friendly as well.","你看见前面又有一个稳定的,如果你错过了最后一个你应该有\n访问这一次。骑兵似乎也是友好的。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou sense a great danger here.The box is so tempting and you decide to open it,just to still your hunger for adventure.","你感到这里很危险框中是如此诱人和你决定打开它 只是为了保持你对冒险的渴望"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou should give this one to Christian.He should collect Fortress troops and fight Caesar til`death.","你应该把这个送给克里斯丁他应该集结军队和与凯撒战斗直到死亡"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou should give this to Marion.She should collect Stronghold troops and fight Caesar til`death.","你应该把这个送给玛丽昂她应征集坚挺部队和与凯撒战斗直到死亡"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou should go even further to the left!","你应该更进一步到左边!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou should have known better.This is Dwarf gold!","你早该知道的矮人 金币!"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou stop as the peasant speak to you.\n\"Hail Maximus,you came back.Just as the old spoke of. Please free us from all the evil that has taken control of the Roman empire.\n\n\"I will try to do that,peasant\"You answer,and eagerly you move on.\n\n ","你停下来 农民和你说话。\n\"万圣马克西姆斯你回来了,就像古老的话题。 请让我们远离所有人至於不义而且已加以控制者,罗马帝国\n\n我会尽力做到的农民\"你回答,和你急切地向前看\n\n "},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou were just a farmer in the Roman Empire.Every week the Roman Empire collected taxes from farmers around.","你只是个农民而已罗马帝国,每周一次罗马帝国向周围的农民征税。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou were not supposed to go where the campfires are.","你不应该去哪里营火是。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou wonder not why anymore.","你不再想知道为什么了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou wonder why there are Cyclops here?","你想知道为什么独眼巨人这里?"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou wonder why this castle isn`t built .You ask your friends(the peasants)if they could help you building up this castle.And they agree for a small fee though.The peasants even offer you to send out a scout to tell you about the things that are going around here.And you thank them for that offer wich was free.","你想知道为什么这座城堡不是建的吗? 你问你的朋友 农民如果他们能帮助你建立这座城堡和不过他们同意收取一点小费。 农民甚至让你派个侦察员来告诉你周围的东西。和感谢他们的出价 Which是免费的。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYou`ve completed all the tests.Now pick up the reward beside and see if you can build the Angelic alliance.","你完成了全部测试。 现在取附加报酬的,和看你能否建立 天使联盟."},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour castle is the only one nearby that has homes for warriors.Several has arrived today,and they pay for their visit.","你的城堡是你的城堡附近只有一家有战士的家和他们支付他们的访问费。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour fear was right.The smoke is a perfect hideout for hostile creatures.Summoned by the Death god himself they attack.","你的恐惧是对的烟雾是敌对的完美藏身之地生物由他们攻击的死神"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour hope was wrong.The heat has just become even worse now.Your armour almost glow from it.You wish to take it off,but decides not to.You feel the sense of danger here.You are prepared.","你的希望错了你的盔甲几乎从中发光了 你想把它脱下来,但决定不要。这儿有危险感 你准备好了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour horse is running as fast as he can.This is hot.","你的马跑得越快越好 这太热了"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour wish to get out of here,may come soon as you notice the monolith ahead.\nBut it might also lead to the center of this place.","你希望离开这里, 可能会很快来,你一注意到前面的石块。\n但也可能导致这个地方的中心。"},
 {"empire-of-the-world-2-1\nYour wood supplies grows and you feel you wanna tribute some to Peasants around here.","您的木材供应量增长和觉得自己想向农民这里附近"},
