 {"ira-the-mage-3\nCongratulations, you got it. The prizes are \"Old Ballista\" brand leather gloves and boots. In addition, there is an ability training certificate. The following is a detailed answer to each question.\n1. The spearmen actually have special effects. {correct}. The pikeman's special skill is {offset cavalry charge}. Although the explanatory text is not written, this effect is real.\n2. If there is a mage or archmage among the creatures the hero brings, if you don't consider the influence of the enemy Pegasus, the MP required for any magic he casts will be reduced by 2 points. {error}. {Adventure magic will not be reduced}2 points. Otherwise, the perspective of Guantianguandi's camouflage can be reduced to 0 or even upside-down.\n3. In addition to sailing boats, there are row boats in the H3 world. {correct}. Use {cemetery or fortress's city shipyard} to build ships, and you can clearly see that they are row boats in the pictures of the city.\n4. During the Week of Creatures, it is possible that cities that have upgraded high-level nest buildings and cities that only have low-level creature nests without upgrading can increase their output at the same time. {correct}. {MInacle of Hell City} makes every week a little monster week, in this case, no matter whether the little monster's lair is upgraded or not, extra output can be added.\n5. Two godsends can increase the output of level 2 soldiers in a city by 10. {correct}. When the same hero brings two godsends, only one is effective, but {two heroes each bring one} in the same city (one of them enters the city), it can both be effective, so that the output is increased by\n10.\n6. Dragon-slaying magic is also effective against bone dragons, but it is not effective against phoenixes. {error}. The expert-level dragon slaying is effective against all 7th-level soldiers, including the Phoenix. Although the description of the magic does not mention the Phoenix, it is actually effective.\n7. No matter what low-level arms are, once they are promoted to high-level, they can't be lowered back to low-level. {error}. {Skeleton warrior} can be downgraded, how to drop, don't I need to teach it?\n8. In the absence of the Orb of Destruction, any attempt to click and cast any magic in the magic book on the black dragon is futile. {error}. The black dragon can also eat {dispel} magic in a normal state. However, the single dispel requires the target to have the magic effect of the body before it can be cast. How to let the black dragon have body magic, it is very simple, for example, let him be beaten by an old tree. Similarly, the black dragon also eats a big dispel. You can try the following difference. When using the big acceleration, the black dragon will not have the magic animation of the tornado, and when using the big dispel, the black dragon will have the magic animation of the halo.\n9. I once spent an hour playing a single-player scene map and scored 415 points. {error}. 160% difficulty can only be 400 points, and 200% difficulty must be an even number, so it is impossible to have a score of 415 points {more than 400 but an odd number}. Although allowing the number of days to overflow can also cause abnormal scores, it is impossible to achieve the number of days overflow in a mere 1 hour. So there are {4} items in the correct statement.","恭喜你答对了。\n\n奖品是“老弩车”牌皮手套与皮靴。此外还有能力培训证一张。\n\n下面是各题的详细解答。\n\n1，枪兵其实是有特技的。\n{正确}。枪兵的特技是{抵消骑兵冲锋}。虽然说明文字没有写，但这个效果真实存在。\n\n2，英雄所带的生物中如果有法师或大法师，如果不考虑遇到敌方飞马的影响，他施放的任何魔法所需要的MP都会降低2点。\n{错误}。{探险魔法不会降低}2点。要不然观天观地伪装透视还能降到0甚至倒贴了不成。\n\n3，除了帆船之外，H3世界中还有排桨船。\n{正确}。用{墓园或要塞的城内船坞}造船，在城内的画面中可以很明显地看到是排桨船。\n\n4，生物之周的时候，已经升级了高级巢穴建筑的城与没有升级只有低级生物巢穴的城是有可能同时额外增加产量的。\n{正确}。{地狱城的奇迹}使得每周都是小怪物周，这种情况下不论小怪物的巢穴是否升级都能增加额外产量。\n\n5，两个天赐神足能让一个城内的2级兵产量加10。\n{正确}。同一个英雄带2件天赐神足时只有一件有效，但是{两个英雄各带一个}在同一座城里（其中一个进到城内）时，就能都有效，从而达到产量加10了。\n\n6，屠龙魔法对付骨龙也有效，但对付凤凰无效。\n{错误}。专家级屠龙对付所有的7级兵全部有效，包括凤凰，虽然魔法的说明文字中没有提到凤凰，但实际是有效的。\n\n7，不管是什么低级兵种，一旦升为高级，就无法再降回低级了。\n{错误}。{骷髅勇士}可以降级，怎么降，不用我教了吧？\n\n8，在没有毁灭之球的情况下，魔法书中的任何魔法试图点击在黑龙身上施放都是徒劳的。\n{错误}。黑龙在普通状态下也能吃{驱散}魔法。但是单体驱散要求目标有受身魔法效果时才能施放。怎么让黑龙有受身魔法呢，很简单，比如说让他被老树打一下。同样，黑龙也吃大驱散，你可以试一下如下区别，使用大加速时，黑龙身上不会有龙卷风的魔法动画，而使用大驱散时，黑龙身上会有光环的魔法动画。\n\n9，我曾经花了1小时打了一张单人场景地图得了415分。\n{错误}。160%难度最高只能400分，而200%难度则得分一定是偶数，因此不可能出现415分这样的{大于400却是奇数}的分数。虽然让天数溢出也能造成反常的分数，但是区区1小时的时间是无法做到天数溢出的。\n\n所以正确的的叙述有{４}项。\n\n\n\n\n"},
