 {"ira-the-mage-3\nDeep in the forest, some workers are cutting wood.\n{Ina:} Wow, these people are so amazing, working in such a cold place, and sweating profusely...\n{Freeman:} This is Yun Xuesong, right?\n{Ina:} Jack is so good, he seems to know everything...\n{Freeman:} I learned in textbooks before, Yun Xuesong is the most famous hard wood on the mainland of Mirronia, only on Snow Mountain Island. There are products in the mountains, but precious.\n{Foreman:} That's right. This is Yun Xuesong, the best hardwood in the world. You look like foreigners, don't you? But the vision is good.\n{Ina:} But, why didn't you chop down a tree for a long time?\n{Foreman:} Because this is the best hardwood in the world, of course it is also the hardest tree to cut. It's a pity that my logging team only has so many people, and the labor force is severely insufficient, so the progress is too slow. Can you help me pull in some labor to help? I will pay them.\n{Ina:} This...I want to find a way.","山林深处，一些工人在伐木。\n\n{伊娜：}哇，这些人好厉害哦，在这么冷的地方工作，还满头大汗……\n{弗里曼：}这是云雪松吧？\n{伊娜：}杰克好厉害，似乎什么都知道耶……\n{弗里曼：}以前课本上学过的，云雪松是米尔罗尼亚大陆上最有名的硬质木材了，只在雪山岛的深山里有产，可名贵呢。\n{工头：}没错。这就是云雪松，世上最好的硬木。你们看上去是外地人吧？不过眼光不错哦。\n{伊娜：}可是，怎么你们砍了半天，一棵都没砍倒呢？\n{工头：}正因为这是世上最好的硬木，当然也就是最难砍的树。可惜我的伐木队只有这么些人手，劳动力严重不足啊，所以进展太慢。你们有没有办法帮我拉一些劳动力来帮忙？我会付给他们报酬的。\n{伊娜：}这个……我想想办法。\n\n\n"},
