 {"ira-the-mage-3\nFor a long time, Ladia was speechless, covering her face with her hands, her sword already aside. Ina didn't continue to ask, but stayed by her side. At this time, Rael's words broke the silence.\n{Rael:} What are you going to do next, Ina?\n{Ina:} Ah, Rael, I'm sorry...\n{Rael:} Anyway, find a way out, you can't stay here forever.\n{Ina:} So too. How about letting Radia and his men go to Kozia to settle down? There is our own territory, and it shouldn't be threatened by the demons anymore.\n{Freeman:} Although I personally do not object, I am afraid it will cause confusion. After all, the citizens may not be able to accept it.\n{Ina:} But Radya is so pitiful. We can't leave her alone. Do you want her to walk with us?\n{Radia:} Don't decide without authorization! Who needs you to be pitiful, who said he would join you?\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm sorry...\n{Ladia:} I will take care of my own affairs. Don't bother you. So farewell.\n{Ina:} Ah, wait...\n{Ladia:} The Phoenix, the phoenix you were looking for, no longer exists. Clio lured him to the altar and sacrificed to Lord Solo. They had this idea in the first place, so they had to find ways to release the phoenix, use the life of the beast to sacrifice, and obtain more powerful power. You better be careful, Clio is dead, and they won't let it go. After Radia finished speaking, while Ina and others were still shocked by the news, they fluttered away.","良久，拉迪亚说不出话来，双手捂着脸，剑早已丢在了一边。伊娜也没继续追问，只是陪在旁边。这时，雷尔的话打破了沉寂。\n\n{雷尔：}下面你打算怎么办，伊娜？\n{伊娜：}啊，雷尔，对不起……\n{雷尔：}不管怎么说，拿个办法出来吧，总不能一直在这里愣下去。\n{伊娜：}也是。让拉迪亚和他的部下到科齐亚城去安身怎么样？那里是我们自己的地盘，应该不会被魔族威胁了。\n{弗里曼：}虽然我个人不反对，可是只怕会引起混乱，毕竟，市民们并不一定能接受得了。\n{伊娜：}可是拉迪亚她好可怜耶。我们总不能扔下她不管吧。要不让她跟我们同行？\n{拉迪亚：}你们不要擅自决定！谁需要你们可怜了，谁说过愿意加入你们了？\n{伊娜：}啊，对不起……\n{拉迪亚：}我自己的事情由我自己来解决。不劳你们操心。就此告辞了。\n{伊娜：}啊，等等……\n{拉迪亚：}你们要找的不死鸟菲尼克斯，已经不存在了。克里奥把他诱骗至祭坛，向索罗大人献祭了。他们最初就是打的这个主意，所以才要想方设法放出不死鸟，用魔兽的生命来献祭，而获得更为强大的力量。你们最好多加小心，克里奥死了，他们不会善罢甘休的。\n\n拉迪亚说完，趁着伊娜等人还在为这个消息震惊的时候，振翅飞走了。\n\n\n\n"},
