 {"ira-the-mage-3\nI defeated the demon and found a letter from him, the content is as follows: Lord Holia, we have prepared the things you want, and will be delivered soon. Hope you can fulfill your promise.\n{Ina:} That's just a little bit of content, it's unclear.\n{Freeman:} This Lord Holia, I am a little impressed. He seems to be the prime minister of the kingdom of Solandria.\n{Ina:} I seem to have remembered this place in Solandria. I looked through the notes. Ah, I found it. It is the hometown of the poet Wu De, opposite to the sea {southwest of Terracia}. How could the prime minister of that place have something to do with the demons, and from this letter, it seemed that he was making a deal.\n{Freeman:} But we don't know what he wants and what he promises.\n{Ina:} Let's sort out the information we have so far. First, the heroes of Longyashan are in the same group as the demons; second, the heroes of Longyashan are not restricted by the Barland government; third, they have a leader called General Zelando, and can manage Longyashan Heroic people; Fourth, the demons believe that the Baland Kingdom is basically a territory of the demons; fifth, the demons have a deal with the prime minister of Solandria, Horia-sama. In addition to the previous sixth, the Barland Kingdom has received the support of the demons; therefore, it can be concluded that the Longyashan hero is an armed force with a backstage of the demons, and is also an accomplice with the Barland government. , And the Zelando general is their leader. If we can find out that {General Zelando}, maybe it will be clearer.","打倒了恶魔，从他身上搜出一封信件，内容如下：\n\n霍利亚大人，您要的东西我们已经给您准备好了，很快送到。希望您也能履行您的诺言。\n\n{伊娜：}就这么点内容啊，不明不白的。\n{弗里曼：}这个霍利亚大人，我有点印象。他好像是索兰德里亚王国的宰相。\n{伊娜：}索兰德里亚这个地方我好像记到过呢，我翻翻笔记。啊，找到了，是诗人舞德的故乡，在{泰拉西亚西南方向的海对面}。那个地方的宰相，怎么会跟魔族扯上关系，而且从这信看，好像是在做什么交易。\n{弗里曼：}可是我们并不知道，他要的东西是什么，以及他许诺的又是什么。\n{伊娜：}我们先整理一下目前所得到的情报好了。\n第一，龙牙山好汉与魔族是一伙的；\n第二，龙牙山好汉不受巴兰德政府的约束；\n第三，他们有一个叫西兰多将军的头目，并且能管龙牙山好汉的人；\n第四，魔族认为巴兰德王国根本就相当于是魔族的地盘；\n第五，魔族与索兰德里亚的宰相霍利亚大人有交易。\n再加上之前得到的\n第六，巴兰德王国得到过魔族的支持；\n因此，可以得出结论，龙牙山好汉，就是有魔族后台的一股武装力量，与巴兰德政府也是同伙，而那个西兰多将军则是他们的头儿。如果我们能找出那个{西兰多将军}，也许就更清楚了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nI saw a big city for the first time.","第一次见到大城市。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIdentify the target.","确定目标。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIf you want to conquer the world, you must conquer the ocean first. Call upon all officers and soldiers of the army to study the quotations of General","想要征服世界，就要先征服海洋。\n\n号召全军官兵学习斯拜恩罗德里将军语录。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn a thatched cottage in the mountains, a few ghosts were crying.\n{Ina:} Hey, what's the matter with you?\n{Ghost:} We are trapped here. There is a bandit called King Jaya who is active in this area. We can't escape his chase.\n{Ina:} Why is he chasing you down?\n{Ghost:} Because we know the whereabouts of a treasure.\n{Ina:} What treasure?\n{Ghost:} You don't want to hit the treasure, do you? I won't tell you.\n{Ina:} No, no, I never do bad things to take other people's things. I'm just curious to ask. It doesn't matter if you don't tell me. ?a?aBut, having said that, you are ghosts, how can you be afraid of people?\n{Ghost:} That King Jaya can use {Expelling} magic, and as long as he takes action, we will be wiped out.\n{Ina:} So, it seems that King Jaya is really amazing.","山间的一个草屋里，几个鬼魂在哭。\n{伊娜：}咦，你们怎么啦？\n{鬼魂：}我们被困在这里了，有个叫查亚大王的山贼在这一带活动，我们没有办法逃过他的追杀。\n{伊娜：}他为什么要追杀你们？\n{鬼魂：}因为我们知道一件宝物的下落。\n{伊娜：}什么宝物啊？\n{鬼魂：}你不会也想打那宝物的主意吧？才不告诉你。\n{伊娜：}不不，我从来不会去做夺取别人的东西的坏事，只是好奇问一下，你们不告诉我也没关系。——不过，话说回来，你们是鬼耶，怎么会怕人呢？\n{鬼魂：}那个查亚大王会使{除灵}魔法，他只要一出手，我们就瞬灭了。\n{伊娜：}这样啊，看来那个查亚大王果然很厉害。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn front of them, a group of people in ragged clothes who looked like the people rushed toward them in a hurry. Seeing the team led by Ina and others, his legs were so frightened.\n{Women:} Army, we have encountered the army again, my God...\n{Man:} Let us go, we have nothing left.\n{Freeman:} What is going on? You are?\n{Old man:} You soldiers drove us away from the town and robbed us of all our money. Now we have nothing, no money, no luggage, we can only eat wild vegetables all the way and sleep in the wild. What do you want?\n{Women:} Dad, stop talking, don't mess with them.\n{Ina:} Ah, could it be that the Barland army did it? They like to rob civilians, but they didn't expect to rob even people from their own country. This... Don't worry, we are not the Barland army and will not rob civilians.\n{Old man:} I know that you are not the Barland army, I can tell by looking at the clothes. You are not the Barland army, aren't we more dangerous? The armies of other countries will not show mercy to us.\n{Ina:} Huh? Why do you say that. Our Kartia army will not rob civilians, never.\n{Man:} What? Is there an army in the world that does not rob civilians? I heard it for the first time in more than thirty years.\n{Ina:} Well, there are still troops in the world that rob civilians. I only heard about it after I met the Barland army.\n{Women:} Really? Are you serious about lying to us? The army of other countries will not rob civilians?\n{Ina:} Have you never been to another country?\n{Women:} No. {Ina:} So I have only seen the Barland army, so do you think the soldiers are like them? Oh my goodness.\n{Man:} In this case, I suggest that folks should seek refuge in other countries.\n{Old man:} But, to go to other countries, we must at least cross a rocky field north, where there is no wild vegetables to dig, what do we eat?\n{Man:} This question...I didn't expect...\n{Freeman:} Well, how about we provide you some travel expenses?\n{Ina:} Well, I think so too.\n{Old man:} Really...really?\n{Women:} Thank you so much, I didn't expect Kartia's army to be so good.\n{Freeman:} Uh, strictly speaking, we are not regarded as the regular troops of Kartia. We are still armed by Kozia...\n{Man:} Okay, then we will go to Kozia to take refuge. Right.\n{Old man:} Do you know where that place is? very far.\n{Women:} But it's very stable there. There are such good soldiers. It's also worth it. If Dad can't walk, we all take turns carrying it.\n{Old man:} Well, it's up to you.\n{Man:} Then we are leaving, I really appreciate you.\n{Ina:} You are welcome. I wish you all the best.","前方一队衣衫褴褛的看起来像是民众的人仓惶地迎面奔来。看到伊娜等人带领的队伍，吓得腿都软了。\n\n{妇女：}军队，又碰到军队了，天哪……\n{男子：}放过我们吧，我们已经什么都没有了。\n{弗里曼：}这是怎么回事？你们是？\n{老人：}你们这些军人把我们从城镇里赶走，还抢走我们所有的钱财。现在我们什么都没有了，没有钱，没有行李，只能一路吃野菜，睡野外。你们还想怎么样啊。\n{妇女：}爸爸，少说点吧，别惹他们为好。\n{伊娜：}啊，难道是，巴兰德军干的？他们就喜欢抢劫平民，没想到居然连自己国的人都抢。这个……你们放心啦，我们不是巴兰德军，不会抢平民的。\n{老人：}我知道你们不是巴兰德军，我看衣服就能看得出来。你们不是巴兰德军，我们不是更危险了吗。别国的军队，对我们更不会手下留情了。\n{伊娜：}唉？为什么会这么说。我们卡尔提亚的军队才不会抢劫平民呢，从来不会。\n{男子：}什么？世界上还有不抢劫平民的军队？我活了三十几年头一次听到。\n{伊娜：}好吧，世界上还有会抢劫平民的军队，我遇到巴兰德军后才头一次听到。\n{妇女：}真的吗？你当真不骗我们？别的国家的军队不会抢劫平民？\n{伊娜：}你们，从没去过别的国家吗？\n{妇女：}没有。\n{伊娜：}所以只见过巴兰德军，于是就以为军人都是像他们那样了吗。天哪。\n{男子：}既然这样，我提议，乡亲们不如就去其他国家避难吧。\n{老人：}可是，要去其他国家，我们至少要向北穿过一片岩石地，那里没有野菜挖，我们吃什么？\n{男子：}这个问题……我没想到……\n{弗里曼：}这样吧，我们给你们提供一些路费怎么样？\n{伊娜：}嗯，我也这么想了。\n{老人：}真……真的吗？\n{妇女：}太感谢你们了，没想到卡尔提亚的军队这么好。\n{弗里曼：}呃，严格地来说，我们还不算卡尔提亚的正规部队，现在还只是科齐亚的地方武装……\n{男子：}好，那么我们就到科齐亚去避难吧。\n{老人：}你知道那地方在哪吗？很远的。\n{妇女：}可是那里很安定啊。有这么好的军人。远一点也值得。爸爸要是走不动，我们大家轮流背着好了。\n{老人：}好好好，就依你们。\n{男子：}那么我们告辞了，真的很感激你们。\n{伊娜：}不用客气啦。祝你们一路顺风。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the depths of the tunnel, some people gathered there. From the clothing point of view, they all seem to be civilians. But one of them looked familiar.\n{Ina:} Ah, it's Jack!\n{Freeman:} Huh? It's you. How come you guys are here. Why did you call me Jack again?\n{Ina:} Rael made me call that.\n{Rael:} Kartia is searching for you everywhere. It is more convenient to call Jack. Although it is not Kartia, it doesn't seem to matter. But why are you here? Who are these people?\n{Freeman:} They are residents here. Because the demons suddenly invaded and occupied this area, we had to hide in this tunnel temporarily. We are discussing how to take this country back from the hands of the demons.\n{Ina:} Jack is indeed a man of great leadership. How did you meet the people here?\n{Freeman:} I met by chance. Just when I passed by here, the army of the demons came. Someone greeted me to hide in. So we people hid in the tunnel without being discovered by the demons.\n{Ina:} But when I came in, there was a sign saying \"No one is hiding in this tunnel.\" It turned out to be used to deceive the demons?\n{Woman:} This is the truth. I am the original owner of this tunnel, and my name is \"Nobody\".\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be like this, please write it down quickly. So what is the organ in the channel?\n{No one:} This is what Master Freeman taught us. Thanks to his trick, the demons couldn't get in.\n{Freeman:} When I came out, I brought a book about civil engineering from the Royal Library. There were organ practices on it, and I had learned some physics before, so I did it. However, Ina was still better, and was not stopped by my agency.\n{No one:} Since this Miss Ina is so powerful, is there a way to help us defeat the demons?\n{Freeman:} I think so too.\n{Ina:} I will work hard, I wanted to teach them.","地道的深处，有一些人聚集在那里。从衣着上看，似乎都是平民。但其中有一个人看上去挺面熟。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，是杰克！\n{弗里曼：}唉？是你们。你们怎么会来到这里了。怎么又叫我杰克了？\n{伊娜：}是雷尔让我这么叫的。\n{雷尔：}卡尔提亚到处在搜捕你，叫杰克比较方便，虽然说这里不是卡尔提亚，好像也没什么关系了。不过你怎么会在这里呢？这些人是？\n{弗里曼：}他们是这里的居民。因为魔族突然入侵，把这一带都占领了，我们只好暂时躲在这个地道里。我们正在商量呢，怎么才能从魔族手中把这个国家夺回来。\n{伊娜：}杰克果然是个很有领导才能的人。你跟这里的人怎么认识的？\n{弗里曼：}偶然认识的吧。我正好经过这里时，魔族的大军杀来了。就有人招呼我躲进来。于是我们这些人就躲进了地道，没有被魔族发现。\n{伊娜：}可是进来时有个路牌写的“没有人躲在这个地道里”，原来是用来骗魔族的？\n{女子：}这是真话。我就是这个地道原来的主人，我的名字叫做“没有人”。\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是这样，赶紧记下来。那么通道里的机关又是？\n{没有人：}这是弗里曼大人教我们布下的，多亏他的这一招，才让魔族没法进来。\n{弗里曼：}我出来时带了一本从皇家图书馆里拿的土木工程的书，上面有机关的作法，加上我以前学过一些物理，所以就这么做了。不过伊娜还是技高一筹，没被我的机关拦住。\n{没有人：}这位伊娜小姐既然这么厉害，是不是有办法帮我们打败魔族？\n{弗里曼：}我也是这么想的。\n{伊娜：}我会努力的，我本来就想教训他们呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the distance came a Karti runner-up. When he arrived, the officer leading the team saw Jack and saluted immediately.\n{Officer:} The subordinates are late for rescue, and I hope that the prince will forgive him.\n{Jack:} It turned out to be General Bruno. It's hard work. Fortunately, Nanling Pass has been recovered. Thanks to this Miss Ina.\n{Ina:} Huh? Are you the prince?\n{Jack:} Sorry, I concealed my identity, I am not Jack, I am Prince Freeman.\n{Rael:} I said that I always felt that something was wrong. It turned out that the prince had slipped out...\n{Ina:} But, shouldn't the prince be in the palace? Why do you want to go to such a dangerous place alone...\n{Freeman:} The palace is full of the smell of political struggle. I don't like that environment. Those nobles were keen on fighting over and under the guise, and the country was invaded and no one cared about it. I was worried, so I came out alone.\n{Bruno:} His Royal Highness's concern about the country and the people really moved his subordinates. But the border is too dangerous, so the subordinates should send His Royal Highness back to the palace. After His Highness succeeds to the throne, he is uncertain.","远处来了一支卡尔提亚军。到了面前，带队的军官看到杰克，立即行礼。\n{军官：}属下救驾来迟，望王子殿下恕罪。\n{杰克：}原来是布里诺将军啊。辛苦了。好在南岭关已经收复了。多亏了这位伊娜小姐。\n{伊娜：}咦？你是王子殿下？\n{杰克：}对不起，我隐瞒了身份，我不是杰克，我是弗里曼王子。\n{雷尔：}我说怎么好像总觉得哪里不对劲，原来是王子殿下一个人溜出来了……\n{伊娜：}可是可是，王子不是应该在宫里吗？为什么要一个人跑到这么危险的地方来……\n{弗里曼：}宫廷里到处充斥着政治斗争的气味，我不喜欢那种环境。那些贵族们却热衷于明争暗斗，而国家遭到侵略也没人管，我很担心，所以就一个人出来了。\n{布里诺：}王子殿下忧国忧民实在令属下感动。不过边境太危险，属下还是送殿下回宫吧。等殿下继位之后，何愁江山不定啊。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the inn, a traveler is chatting with the boss.\n{Traveler:} Boss, your business is not good here.\n{Boss:} Oh, I'm so sad. Originally, the annual worship festival was approaching, but now it should be the peak season, and priests and monks all over the country will come to Intasia to worship. But because of a fire in the forest to the south, traffic was blocked and everyone couldn't come.\n{Passenger:} Alas, for this reason, I am stuck here and cannot return home. I heard that this time the Prime Minister set fire to the forest in order to reclaim farmland, but it's too late, right?\n{Boss:} I also feel abnormal. However, no one dared to oppose the Prime Minister's decision.\n{Traveler:} It is said that Sunday is a great opportunity for the palace to increase income. The prime minister usually values money more than anything, but this time he was willing to give up such a large income to open up wasteland? I think there must be some article behind this. He will only do this if he can get more substantial benefits than the income of worship. But what is this more substantial benefit?\n{Boss:} Guest, it's better not to say this. You will pat your butt and leave in a few days. My shop has to go on. Can't offend those in power. A few months ago, because a customer spoke ill of the Prime Minister in our shop, the official heard me and fined me 3000 gold coins.\n{Passenger:} Ah, sorry, okay, I won't talk about this topic anymore. Let's talk about other things.","客栈里，一个旅客正在跟老板聊着。\n\n{旅客：}老板，你这里生意不行啊。\n{老板：}唉，愁死了。本来一年一度的礼拜节快要到了，现在正应该是旺季，全国的神官和僧侣们都要到因塔西亚来朝拜。却因为南边森林的一把火，阻断了交通，大家来不了了。\n{旅客：}唉，我也是因为这个原因，滞留在这里，回不了家。听说这次是宰相大人为了开垦农田才放火烧林的，不过，也太不是时候了吧？\n{老板：}我也觉得不正常。不过，宰相大人的决定，谁也不敢反对。\n{旅客：}按说礼拜节正是王宫增加收入的大好机会，那个宰相平时对金钱看得比啥都重，这次却舍得放弃这么大一笔收入来开荒？我看，这背后一定有什么文章。只有当他这样做能获得比礼拜节收入更可观的利益时，他才会这么做的。不过这个更可观的利益是什么呢？\n{老板：}客倌啊，这话还是不要说的好。你过几天就拍拍屁股走人了，我这店还得开下去啊。可不能得罪了当权的。几个月前，因为有一客人在我店里说宰相大人的坏话，正巧被当官的听见，罚了我3000个金币啊。\n{旅客：}啊，抱歉，好吧，这个话题不说了。我们聊聊别的。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the melee, the arrows of Solandria's army flew towards Radia, who fell to the ground and couldn't move.\n{Ina:} Not good! Ina ignored the Solandria army in front of her, and turned back a fireball to hit the arrow, which turned to ashes before hitting Radia. At the same time, a Soldier of Solandria rushed in front of Ina and slashed with an axe. Rael quickly leaped over to the cross sword stand to block. After a crisp sound, Rael and Ina were both knocked to the ground, Rael's sword was also broken, and the armor on his body cracked a deep mark. Ina immediately got up with a magic arrow and knocked down the Solanderian soldiers in front of him.\n{Rael:} Are you okay, Ina?\n{Ina:} Well, it hurts to fall, but fortunately, I haven't been chopped up... Rael, you hurt?\n{Rael:} It's okay, the armor is thick enough that it just didn't cut the body.\n{Ina:} That guy took advantage of the danger too much.\n{Radia:} You guys, why do you want to save me? We are obviously enemies.\n{Ina:} I'll tell you later, there are some Sorlandrian troops, let me clean them up first.","混战之中，索兰德里亚军的箭飞向了倒地动弹不得的拉迪亚。\n\n{伊娜：}不好！\n\n伊娜不顾面前还有索兰德里亚军，回头一个火球打向飞箭，箭在碰到拉迪亚之前化为了灰烬。同时，一个索兰德里亚士兵已经冲到伊娜面前，抬斧就砍。雷尔赶紧跃过来横剑架挡。一声脆响之后，雷尔和伊娜都被震倒在地，雷尔的剑也断了，身上的铠甲也裂开了一条深深的痕。伊娜随即起身一个魔箭将面前的索兰德里亚兵击倒。\n\n{雷尔：}没事吧，伊娜？\n{伊娜：}唔，摔得好痛，还好没被砍上……雷尔你受伤了？\n{雷尔：}没事，铠甲够厚，刚刚好没砍到身体。\n{伊娜：}那个家伙趁人之危太过份了。\n{拉迪亚：}你们，为什么要救我？我们明明是敌人的。\n{伊娜：}等下再跟你说啦，还有些索兰德里亚军，先让我清理完他们。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the ruins of the old city, people accidentally found some books that recorded magic.","在旧城的废墟中，人们无意之中发现了一些记载着魔法的书籍。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIn the snowy area surrounded by coniferous forests, there are two unique broad-leaved trees, which are only ten steps apart from the north and the south. And in the middle of the connection between the two trees, there is a little fresh magical power hidden.","在周围到处是针叶林的雪地中，却有两棵独特的阔叶树，它们南北相望只隔了十步之远。而在这两树连线的正中间，隐藏着一点清新的魔法力量。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna","伊娜"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna and Radia were about to go to war, and suddenly a strong wave of magic flashed in the middle of the two. Ina felt it first.\n{Ina:} No good, get out of the way! Ina said a rush to retreat and hide away, but Radia reacted a step late and was rubbed against her body by the huge soaring fire column.\n{Ina:} Ah, you are injured, does it matter?\n{Radia:} Leave me alone!\n{Voice:} The reaction is very fast, as expected, the magician who defeated the Phoenix.\n{Radia:} Creo, is it you? come out! We are in a duel, why should we be calculated?\n{Clio:} I wanted to clean up the two of you at once, but it seemed unsuccessful. duel? is this necessary?\n{Ladia:} As long as I defeat her, as long as I defeat her...\n{Clio:} Lord Solo has forbidden you to go out. If you haven’t listened to the order to secretly come out, you still bring out the troops without permission, you Do you know what this is? Even if you win, you won't get offended, let alone you messed up. Do you know? Since the last time you came back, Lord Solo hasn't expected you to be useful anymore, you have long been abandoned.\n{Radia:} How did it... become like this...\n{Clio:} Obediently follow me back to be executed, you, and your stupid subordinates. If you are obedient, I will leave a whole body for you, so as not to be wiped out in ashes.\n{Radia:} No, I can be executed if you want, please let go of my subordinates, I ordered them out privately, it is all my responsibility, please don’t...\n{Clio:} Jokes, you Do you think you still have the right to bargain?\n{Ladia:} Creo, you...\n{Ina:} Wait a minute, the guy over there, you are making trouble again. It was you last time. I won't let you take Radia!\n{Clio:} Wouldn’t it be great if I helped you deal with an opponent?\n{Ina:} Although she is an opponent, she has already agreed to a duel with me. She has already agreed.\n{Clio:} So what? Although I admit that you are indeed a little capable, but you are not far enough to prevent me from taking her away.\n{Ina:} Really? Then dare you to compete with me?\n{Clio:} Alright, since you are so anxious to be cleaned up by me.","伊娜与拉迪亚正要开战，突然一股强劲的魔法波动就朝两人正中间闪袭而来。伊娜先感觉到了。\n\n{伊娜：}不好，快闪开！\n\n伊娜说着一个急退躲远，而拉迪亚反应迟了一步，被巨大的冲天火柱贴着身体擦过。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，你受伤了，不要紧吧？\n{拉迪亚：}别管我！\n{声音：}反应很迅速嘛，不愧是打败了不死鸟的魔法师。\n{拉迪亚：}克里奥，是你吧？出来！我们正在决斗，为什么要暗算我们？\n{克里奥：}本想一次把你们两个同时收拾掉，看来不成功啊。决斗？有这个必要吗？\n{拉迪亚：}我只要打败了她，只要打败了她就可以……\n{克里奥：}索罗大人已经禁止你外出，你还不听命令偷偷出来，还私自带出部队，你知道这是什么罪吧？就算你赢了也不会得到饶怒，何况你还搞砸了。你知道不知道？从上次你回来之后，索罗大人就没再指望你派上用场，你早就被抛弃了。\n{拉迪亚：}怎么会……变成这样……\n{克里奥：}乖乖地跟我回去接受处刑吧，你，还有你的那些愚蠢盲从的部下。好好听话就给你们留个全尸，免得灰飞烟灭。\n{拉迪亚：}不，你要处死我可以，请放过我的部下，是我私自命令他们出来的，全部是我一个人的责任，请不要……\n{克里奥：}笑话，你觉得你现在还有讨价还价的资格吗？\n{拉迪亚：}克里奥，你……\n{伊娜：}等一下，那边的家伙，你又来捣乱了，上次也是你。我不会让你带走拉迪亚！\n{克里奥：}我帮你处理掉一个对手，不是很好吗？\n{伊娜：}虽然是对手，但是，她已经答应了跟我堂堂正正决斗，她已经答应了。\n{克里奥：}那又怎么样？虽然我承认你确实有点能耐，不过，想阻止我带走她，你还不远远不够呢。\n{伊娜：}是吗？那么你敢不敢跟我较量一下呢？\n{克里奥：}也好，既然你那么急着被我收拾掉的话。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna and others leaned out from the vent. This is only half a mountainside of an isolated island, surrounded by steep rocks, and there is no way to leave. Ina looked up, but saw a creature gradually approaching.\n{Ina:} Ah, you are...Ladia?\n{Radia:} Huh? Are you out alive? It's really gratifying.\n{Ina:} We have already destroyed the \"Spirit Gathering Tower\". Thanks to your help. Are you here to pick us up?\n{Radia:} Oh, they are going after them...\n{Ina:} What? Who's chasing it? ...\n{Radia:} You take this and hide it.\n{Ina:} Huh? What is this? A helmet?\n{Ladia:} There is no time to explain to you now. I have to go first. You can keep this thing for me for a while, and I will come to you in the future. Don't let it fall into the hands of Solo's people.\n{Ina:} Ah, I know, but... Radia ignored Ina's question, danced her wings and flew away to the southwest. After a while, two flying creatures passed by.\n{Flyer A:} It's in the southwest, can you see it?\n{Flyer B:} Yes, that is Traitor Radia. If Master Solo knows that Thor's Helmet was stolen by her, we will be unlucky, chase it, and we must take it back! The two flying creatures chased Radia's direction and flew away without noticing Ina below.\n{Freeman:} Ina, there is no access here, right? I said it was just a ventilation hole. Are you still outside for so long?\n{Ina:} Jack, Rael, come and see.\n{Rael:} What's wrong?\n{Ina:} I met Ladia just now, she gave me this, and then left. It seems that someone from the demons is chasing her.\n{Rael:} This helmet?\n{Freeman:} What helmet is this?\n{Ina:} Jack doesn't know either? But it seems that it must be very important. Radia was hunted down for this thing, but gave it to me and led the enemy away by herself... I think we should help her.\n{Rael:} But we can't fly, how can we get there?\n{Ina:} I only know that she is heading {southwest}, we just need to follow the direction to find, there should be a way.\n{Freeman:} Alright, I don't think she should be left alone in danger. Then let's go to the southwest to find Radia and chasing soldiers. In order to speed up the march, I suggest that this time we wear light and fast horses, {don't bring slow soldiers}.","伊娜等人从通风口探出身来。这里只是一个孤岛的半山腰，四周险石嶙峻，根本没有可以离开的通路。伊娜抬头张望了一下，却看到一个生物渐渐地飞近来。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，你是……拉迪亚？\n{拉迪亚：}唉？你们活着出来啦？真是可喜可贺。\n{伊娜：}我们已经把“聚灵塔”破坏了哦。这还是多亏你的帮忙了。你是来接我们的吗？\n{拉迪亚：}糟了，他们就快追来了……\n{伊娜：}什么？谁追来了？……\n{拉迪亚：}你把这个拿好，藏起来。\n{伊娜：}咦？这是什么东西？一个头盔？\n{拉迪亚：}现在没时间跟你解释了。我得先走了，这个东西你帮我保管一阵，以后我还会来找你的。千万不要让它落入索罗的人手中。\n{伊娜：}啊，我知道了，可是……\n\n拉迪亚没再理会伊娜问话，舞起双翅，向西南方向飞走了。没一会儿，又有两个飞着的生物从空中经过。\n\n{飞行者A：}就在西南方向，看到了吗？\n{飞行者B：}没错，那就是叛徒拉迪亚，如果让索罗大人知道被她偷走了雷神盔，我们就要倒霉了，快追，一定要把东西夺回来！\n\n两个飞行生物追着拉迪亚的方向飞去了，并没有察觉到伊娜在下面。\n\n{弗里曼：}伊娜，这边也没有通路吧，我说了是通风孔而已的，你还在外面待那么久？\n{伊娜：}杰克，雷尔，你们来看。\n{雷尔：}怎么了？\n{伊娜：}我刚才遇到拉迪亚了，她给了我这个，然后又走了。好像有魔族的人在追她。\n{雷尔：}这个头盔？\n{弗里曼：}这是什么头盔？\n{伊娜：}杰克也不知道吗？可是看起来它一定很重要。拉迪亚为了这个东西被追杀，却把它交给我，自己引开了敌人……我觉得我们应该去帮助她。\n{雷尔：}可是我们不会飞，怎么去呢？\n{伊娜：}只知道她是往{西南方向}去了，我们只要循着方向去找找，应该会有办法的吧。\n{弗里曼：}也好，我也觉得不该让她一个人陷入危险之中。那么我们就去西南方向寻找拉迪亚和追兵吧。为了加快行军，我建议这回我们轻装快马，{不要带慢速兵}了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna and others were about to pass through the valley when a violent blizzard hit them.","伊娜等人正要通过山谷，一阵猛烈的暴风雪迎面袭来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna and the others walked through a narrow valley, and suddenly swarms of flying dragons flew up on the rocks on both sides, rushing towards Ina and the others.\n{Ina:} Are these also monsters of the Demon Race?\n{Freeman:} Attacking with flying soldiers on this terrain seems to have been carefully prepared... It's so strange...\n{Ina:} Well, let's deal with these guys first.","伊娜等人走过一处狭窄的谷地，突然两边的山岩上扑楞扑楞地飞起成群的飞龙，朝伊娜他们冲了过来。\n\n{伊娜：}这些也是魔族的怪物吗？\n{弗里曼：}在这个地形用飞兵攻击，好像是精心准备过的一样……太奇怪了……\n{伊娜：}唉，先应付完这些家伙再说吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna approached the box, and a voice came from the box.\n{Voice:} Let me out! I hear you approaching! Chinu, you bastard! let me out!\n{Ina:} Huh, Chinu?\n{Voice:} You are not Chinu? who are you? No matter who it is, let me out first! I'm going to beat up Qi Nu and actually trick me into the box and shut it up!\n{Ina:} What is going on?\n{Voice:} I am a monster. A month ago, I was cheated by a guy named Chinu. He said that there was something delicious in this box, so I went in. As a result, he suddenly closed the box and I couldn't get out. Then he told me that this is an oven and will bake me for 3 months to make a sacrifice. I am now being roasted all over my body red and burning.\n{Ina:} It turns out that Chinu did such a bad thing, it was too much. He arrested our friend, and we are looking for him to settle accounts.\n{Voice:} Great, let me out, I will help you.","伊娜走近盒子，盒子里传来声音。\n{声音：}放我出去！我听到你靠近了！齐努你这混蛋！放我出去！\n{伊娜：}啊，齐努？\n{声音：}你不是齐努？你是谁？不管是谁，先放我出去！我要去把齐努揍一顿，竟然把我骗进盒子里关着！\n{伊娜：}这是怎么回事呀？\n{声音：}我本是一个神怪。一个月前，我被一个叫齐努的家伙骗了，他说这个箱子里有好吃的，我就进去了，结果他突然关上盒子，我就出不去了。然后他才告诉我，这是个烤箱，要把我烤上3个月，做成祭品。我现在被烤得全身通红直冒火。\n{伊娜：}原来齐努还干这样的坏事，真过份。他抓了我们的朋友，我们也正要找他算帐呢。\n{声音：}太好了，放我出来吧，我会帮助你们。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna can't remember what happened to her when she was young. She was raised by her grandfather and has been living in the village of Ainar since she has memories. Since her grandfather passed away when she was 15 years old, Ina has been living on her own. She is lively, cheerful and helpful, and the villagers like her very much. Ina always carries a notebook that never leaves her body, and calls herself \"Ina little universal notebook\".","伊娜不记得自己幼年时的事情了。她由爷爷抚养，从她有记忆的时候起就一直生活在艾拉尔村。自从爷爷在她15岁那年去世后，伊娜就开始一个人独立生活。她活泼开朗而乐于助人，村民们都很喜欢她。伊娜平时总是带着一本从不离身的笔记本，并且自称为“伊娜酱万能笔记本”。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna continued to try a new summoning technique.","伊娜继续尝试新的召唤术。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna donated the money she saved from her part-time job to the church.","伊娜把打工攒下的钱捐给了教会。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna handed over 88 mercury.\n{Old man:} Well, smart. Mercury in English is mercury, which means Mercury. Mercury is the planet closest to the sun. The revolution period of Mercury is 88 days. Very good, you got it right. Well, let me tell you how to get to Taslinna Mountains. From {this path behind me, cross a tunnel, and then take a boat}, you can get there.\n{Ina:} Thank you, grandpa, but in what direction should you sail?\n{Old man:} Don't worry about this, you will understand when you get on board. {There is only one waterway}.","伊娜交出88水银。\n\n{老者：}嗯，聪明。水银的英文是mercury，也就是水星的意思。水星是离太阳最近的行星。水星的公转周期是88天。很好，你答对了。好吧，我告诉你去塔斯林纳山的办法。从{我身后这条小路，穿过一个地道，然后再坐船}，就可以到达了。\n{伊娜：}谢谢老爷爷，可是坐船朝什么方向航行呢？\n{老者：}这个你不用担心，等你到了船上就会明白了。{那里只有唯一的一条水道}。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna released the civilians who were locked in the city.\n{Man A:} Ah, mother, how are you...\n{Man B:} NIna, great, we are still alive...\n{Man C:} Thank you so much, not only for saving us, but also for saving To our family.\n{Rael:} But, what should I do next? It must be dangerous if you continue to stay here.\n{Freeman:} And they can't let them follow us for a long time. Archbishop Yingluck's troops have been following our tracks. Although what happened here is not related to Archbishop Yingluck, it's definitely not possible for him to hit him. Good thing. Besides, our strategy is based on high-speed marching...\n{Ina:} Jack, you have a good geography. Do you know if there is a port or something near here?\n{Freeman:} Yes, from here {head south to the beach}, there should be a small port called Rosen Harbor.\n{Ina:} We brought these civilians there, and then let them go to Kozia by boat. It should be safe. Then, we have to investigate what they said about the strange vibration of {city west side}, it must be related to the changes here, if it is also related to the archbishop Yingluck, it would be even better.\n{Freeman:} That's the only thing now. But why is it better to be related to Archbishop Yingluck?\n{Ina:} Our initial surprise attack on the territory of Barland was just to divert the attention of Archbishop Yingluck and prevent him from attacking Kozia. And if we find an important thing related to Archbishop Yingluck here, first, we can get closer to the truth of the matter and understand the conspinacy behind Archbishop Yingluck's series of abnormal actions; second, we may be able to destroy His important things are to prevent him from achieving a certain plan; third, it does not prevent him from drawing his attention away from Kozia's goal. If his important things are discovered or even destroyed by us, he will only be more anxious. To chase us. And fourth, if it wasn't related to Archbishop Yingluck, wouldn't there be other heavyweight enemy forces? One more enemy is worse than one less enemy.\n{Rael:} Maybe it's also related to the demons.\n{Ina:} It is related to the Demon Race, that is, it is related to the Archbishop Yingluck. Now it is clear that they are in a group, although I don't know who is older. They can be regarded as an enemy force for the time being, one more is worse than one less.\n{Freeman:} Now that the monsoon is right, everyone should go to Rosen Harbor without further ado.\n{Ina:} Well, let's go.","伊娜把关在城里的平民放出来。\n\n{男子A：}啊，老妈，你还好吧……\n{男子B：}尼娜，太好了，我们还活着……\n{男子C：}太感谢你们了，不但救了我们，还救了我们的家人。\n{雷尔：}可是，接下去该怎么办呢？如果继续停留在这里肯定很危险。\n{弗里曼：}而且也不能让他们长久跟着我们，英拉大主教的部队一直在追寻我们的踪迹，这边发生的事虽然不知道是不是跟英拉大主教有关，但让他撞到了肯定没好事。何况我们的战略是建立在高速行军的基础上的……\n{伊娜：}杰克，你地理好，知道不知道这里附近有没有港口什么的？\n{弗里曼：}有，从这里{向南到达海边}，应该有个叫罗森港的小港。\n{伊娜：}我们把这些平民带到那里，然后让他们坐船去科齐亚，应该就安全了吧。然后，我们还要去调查他们所说的{城西面}的奇怪的震动，那一定和这里的变故有关，如果同时还跟那个英拉大主教有关的话就更好了。\n{弗里曼：}目前也只有这样了。不过，为什么说跟英拉大主教有关就更好呢？\n{伊娜：}我们最初奇袭巴兰德境内的目的，只是为了调走英拉大主教的注意力，让他不要进攻科齐亚。而如果我们在这里发现了一个跟英拉大主教有关的重要的东西的话，\n第一，我们可以更加接近事情的真相，了解英拉大主教一系列反常举动的背后的阴谋；\n第二，我们也许可以破坏他的重要的东西，来阻止他达成某个计划；\n第三，同时并不妨碍吸引他注意力离开科齐亚的目标，如果他的重要的东西被我们发现甚至破坏了，他只会更着急地来追我们。\n还有第四，如果不是跟英拉大主教有关的话，岂不是还有其他重量级的敌人势力，多一个敌人总不如少一个敌人吧。\n{雷尔：}说不定也会跟魔族有关啊。\n{伊娜：}跟魔族有关也就是跟英拉大主教有关啦，现在已经明确知道他们是一伙的了，虽然不知道谁大谁小。他们姑且就算作一个敌人势力好了，多一个不如少一个。\n{弗里曼：}现在季风正合适，大家还是赶快去罗森港吧，事不宜迟。\n{伊娜：}嗯，出发。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna suddenly stopped.\n{Ina:} Look, what is this?\n{Rael:} White feathers...\n{Freeman:} Is this Roland's wing feather?\n{Ina:} Of course it is. Look at the barren surroundings of this mountain, you can't see any birds. This feather must be Roland's.","伊娜突然停住了脚步。\n\n{伊娜：}你们看，这是什么？\n{雷尔：}白羽毛……\n{弗里曼：}这是罗兰的翅膀羽毛吗？\n{伊娜：}当然是啦，你看这山周围荒秃秃的，什么鸟都看不到。这羽毛一定是罗兰的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna walked to the gate of the city, and did not see any guards, but saw some huge animal sleeping above the city, showing a red tail drooping from the corner of the city.\n{Ina:} What are these guys, are they guards? It's troublesome now, the language is not good, how can I trick them... Well, there is no way, okay, let's see how this is, little Ina special double-ring thunder bomb! Ina threw a fist-sized lightning ball to the city gate, bang-bang! The sleeping huge red animals were obviously awakened, and they flew down from the top of the city, angrily looking for the source of the sound. Now Ina could see the whole picture of these animals. It turned out to be a group of red dragons.\n{Ina:} Well, next is here. Ina threw a lightning ball to the south outside the city. Boom?apop! The red dragons passed by following the voice.\n{Ina:} That's right, so behave, stay away from the city, there should be no problem. It's time for everyone to move. Ina hit a fireball in the sky. When Rael and Prince Freeman saw the signal, they rushed up with troops.\n{Rael:} Get it done?\n{Ina:} Hmm. Then you can safely clean them up outside the city.","伊娜走到城门近处，没看到有看守的人影，却见城的上方盘睡着什么巨大的动物，露出一条红色的尾巴从城角上耷拉下来。\n\n{伊娜：}这些家伙是什么啊，难道他们是看守？这下子麻烦了啊，语言不通，怎么诱骗他们呢……嗯，也不是没有办法，好吧，看看这个怎么样，伊娜酱特制双响雷声弹！\n\n伊娜把一个拳头大小的闪电球抛到城门前，砰——啪！\n\n睡着的巨大红色动物显然被吵醒了，他们从城顶上呼啸着飞下来，怒气冲冲地寻找声响的来源。这下伊娜看清了这些动物的全貌，原来是一群红龙。\n\n{伊娜：}嗯，接下来是这边。\n\n伊娜又把一个闪电球抛向城外南边的方向。砰——啪！\n\n红龙们循着声音过去了。\n\n{伊娜：}对啦，这样就乖了，离城远一点，应该没什么问题了。下面该大家出动了。\n\n伊娜朝天打了一个火球。雷尔和弗里曼王子看到信号立即带着部队冲了上来。\n\n{雷尔：}搞定了？\n{伊娜：}嗯。接下来可以放心地在城外把他们收拾掉了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna was about to pass through a narrow passage, when a row of ghosts suddenly appeared, and could not help but rushed forward.\n{Ghost:} Tomb Raiders go to death!\n{Ina:} Wow, I was scared to death. Why are you here again?\n{Ghost:} Tomb Raiders go to death!\n{Ina:} The real tomb thief was put in by you, we are not tomb thief but you want to stop me. Is there a mistake?\n{Ghost:} Tomb Raiders go to death!\n{Ina:} Have you heard me talking?\n{Ghost:} Tomb Raiders go to death!\n{Ina:} Do you only know this line?\n{Ghost:} Tomb Raiders go to death!\n{Ina:} Okay, well, I will help you clean up the tomb robbers, but before that, it seems necessary to let you rest in peace.","伊娜正要经过一处狭窄的通道，突然冒出一排幽灵，不由分说，扑了上来。\n{幽灵：}盗墓者去死！\n{伊娜：}哇，吓死我了。怎么又来了。\n{幽灵：}盗墓者去死！\n{伊娜：}真正的盗墓贼被你们放进去了，我们不是盗墓贼你们却要拦我。有没有搞错？\n{幽灵：}盗墓者去死！\n{伊娜：}你们听到我说话了没有啊？\n{幽灵：}盗墓者去死！\n{伊娜：}难道你们只会这一句台词吗？\n{幽灵：}盗墓者去死！\n{伊娜：}好了好了，我会帮你们把盗墓贼清理掉的，不过在这之前，看起来有必要先让你们安息。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna was drying her clothes, and suddenly a bolt of lightning struck down in the air, smashing all three clothes.\n{Ina:} Woo...what's going on, it's broken...who did a good thing...\n{Voice:} Ina? why you?\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be Radia!\n{Ladia:} I saw the uniform of the Red Sea Fleet, and thought it was Spien Rodri's subordinate, so I attacked with magic.\n{Ina:} That's the uniform we got for disguise. It's useless now...\n{Ladia:} By the way, how come you have also come to the devil world.\n{Ina:} Of course, I came to find the remaining parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". In addition, we have to stop Solo, although he is not particularly clear about his conspinacy at the moment, only knows what \"Sword of Destruction\" he seems to want...\n{Ladia:} So you even know about the \"Sword of Destruction\". Up.\n{Ina:} I don't know yet, I just heard a little clue.\n{Radia:} Well, I planned to tell you all anyway. Let's talk about it one by one. First of all, I have already inquired that the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" is in Spinrodri's hand and is about to find him.\n{Ina:} Hey, you don't have to go. \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" we have already got it.\n{Radia:} It's faster than me! What about \"Dragon Armor\"?\n{Ina:} There is no news at all.\n{Radia:} Okay, then I don't need to go to Eldria, I will go to find news about \"Dragon Armor\".\n{Ina:} So what does Radia know about the \"Sword of Destruction\"?\n{Radia:} \"The Sword of Destruction\" is an artifact of ancient times, called the Magic Sword. Its power is far stronger than the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". In order to prevent it from bringing disaster to the world, the ancestors broke it down and sealed it. However, Solo had already learned how to open the seal, so he only had to find the three components \"Red Star Sword\", \"Purple Spirit Shield\" and \"Blue Thunder Ring\".\n{Ina:} Far stronger than the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", so terrifying... If Solo finds all three parts, will he be able to spell out the \"Sword of Destruction\"?\n{Radia:} There is also a need for specific spells to lift the seal. But Solo has obtained the method of casting this spell. Only need a lot of spiritual support, you can use it. This is why he set up an altar to sacrifice a huge amount of life force including monsters. Once his altar has enough energy and the three parts are complete, he will be able to get the \"Sword of Destruction.\"\n{Ina:} It's terrible. In that case, there is another component, the \"Blue Thunder Ring\", which absolutely cannot fall into his hands. We need to find it in front of Vidor.\n{Radia:} Victor? Is that person looking for \"Blue Thunder Ring\"? He has been beaten to death by me.\n{Ina:} Huh? {Radia:} Seeing him moving around {Qingyunling}, I didn't know that he was looking for something. I only knew that he was a close associate of Solo, so I attacked him and killed him. I didn't find any treasure in him.\n{Ina:} Great, now we don't have to worry about being preempted by him. So, \"Qinglei Ring\" is in that place called\n{?à??} {Ling}? {Radia:} I think it might be. Qingyunling is here {a little west}, not far away, it will be there soon. But there is one more thing that must be reminded of you. Archbishop Yingluck is also active in the Demon Realm now, and it seems that he has been assisting Solo. You must be careful of him, he is definitely a dangerous man.\n{Ina:} Ah! Archbishop Yingluck is coming to the Demon World!\n{Radia:} Well, you are careful anyway, and this thing is for you.\n{Ina:} What is this?\n{Radia:} This is a tool that I used to steal the Thor's helmet by the way. It's called a \"walkie talkie\". There are 2 in total. You take one and I take one, so that even if we are not together, we can pass this Talk on the intercom. In this way, progress can be notified in time to avoid duplication of work.\n{Ina:} There is still such a good thing. That's great.\n{Radia:} I didn't expect you to come to the Demon World last time, or it would be given to you then. Alright, I've told you all the news I know, now I'm going to find the news about \"Dragon Armor\". Say goodbye.","伊娜正在晾衣服，突然空中一道闪电劈下来，把三件衣服都劈碎了。\n\n{伊娜：}呜……怎么回事嘛，这样就碎掉了……谁干的好事……\n{声音：}伊娜？怎么是你？\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是拉迪亚！\n{拉迪亚：}我看到赤海舰队的制服，还以为是斯拜恩罗德里的手下，就用魔法攻击了。\n{伊娜：}那是我们为了伪装弄来的制服，这下没用了……\n{拉迪亚：}话说，你怎么也跑到魔界来了。\n{伊娜：}当然是来找“龙王神力”剩下的部件啊。另外，我们还要阻止索罗，虽然目前还不是特别清楚他的阴谋，只知道他好像想得到什么“毁灭之剑”……\n{拉迪亚：}原来你们连“毁灭之剑”的事都知道了。\n{伊娜：}还不算知道，只是听到了一点点线索。\n{拉迪亚：}好吧，反正我本来也打算都告诉你们的。一件一件来说吧，首先是，我已经打听到“龙牙项链”在斯拜恩罗德里的手中，正想去找他。\n{伊娜：}嘻，你不用去了啦。“龙牙项链”我们已经弄到手了哦。\n{拉迪亚：}居然比我还快！那么“龙甲”呢？\n{伊娜：}完全没有消息。\n{拉迪亚：}好吧，那么我不用去埃尔德里亚了，我接着去找“龙甲”的消息。\n{伊娜：}那么关于“毁灭之剑”，拉迪亚知道些什么吗？\n{拉迪亚：}“毁灭之剑”是上古时代的神器，被称为魔剑。其力量远远比“龙王神力”还要强大。先人为了防止它给世界带来灾难，将它分解并封印了。然而索罗已经得到了解开封印的方法，所以他现在只差把三个部件“赤星剑”，“紫灵盾”，“青雷环”找齐了。\n{伊娜：}比“龙王神力”还要远远强大，这么可怕……如果让索罗找齐了三个部件，是不是他就能拼出“毁灭之剑”？\n{拉迪亚：}还需要特定的法术来解除封印。不过这个法术的施展方法索罗已经得到了。只需要大量的灵力支持，就可以施展。这就是他开设祭坛，要祭献包括魔兽在内的巨量生命力量的原因。他的祭坛一旦能量攒够，三个部件齐全，他就能得到“毁灭之剑”。\n{伊娜：}好可怕。这么说来，还有一个部件“青雷环”绝对不能落入他的手中。我们要抢在维多的前面找到它。\n{拉迪亚：}维多？那个人在找“青雷环”啊？他已经被我打死了。\n{伊娜：}啊？\n{拉迪亚：}看到他在{青云岭}一带活动，我不知道他在找东西，只知道他是索罗的手下亲信，所以偷袭了他，把他干掉了。我并没在他身上找到什么宝物。\n{伊娜：}太好了，这下我们就不用担心被他抢先了。这么说“青雷环”就是在那个叫{青云}\n{岭}的地方喽？\n{拉迪亚：}我想可能是吧。青云岭就在这边{向西一点}的地方，并不远，很快就到的。不过还有一件事情必须要提醒你们当心。英拉大主教那个家伙现在也在魔界活动，似乎他一直在协助索罗。你们一定要小心他，他绝对是个危险人物。\n{伊娜：}啊！英拉大主教到魔界来啦！\n{拉迪亚：}嗯，总之你们小心，还有，这个东西给你。\n{伊娜：}这是什么？\n{拉迪亚：}这是我以前去偷雷神盔时顺便入手的工具，叫做“对讲机”，总共有2只，你拿一只我拿一只，这样即使我们不在一起时，也能通过这个对讲机通话。这样一来就可以及时通报进展，免得重复劳动了。\n{伊娜：}还有这样的好东西啊。真是太好了。\n{拉迪亚：}上次没想到你们也会到魔界来，要不然那时就给你了。好啦，我所知道的消息都告诉你了，下面我去找“龙甲”的消息了。就此告辞。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna was writing in her notebook while flipping through previous records from time to time.\n{Rael:} Did you hear what the two soldiers said just now?\n{Ina:} Well, I just remember it. Look at the clues of Ina-chan's universal notebook. First, Archbishop Yingluck issued a national wanted warrant, and sheltering is the same crime. It is difficult for Jack to hide in Kartia. Second, the government sent troops to search for Jack but did not find him. Third, the borders of the Kingdom of Kartia are blocked, and it is difficult for Jack to escape through ordinary roads. Fourth, sister Mengying said before that there is a secret passage to other countries in Horn Valley, which most people don't know; Fifth, there was a little prince who went to Horn Valley two years ago; Sixth, from us From the perspective of Jack who had been in contact, he was not a dull person, and he was quite adventurous.\n{Rael:} Ina, you are so careful, I didn't care what Mengying said, you actually wrote down all these details.\n{Ina:} Well, my grandpa taught me since I was a kid, a good memory is worse than a bad pen.\n{Rael:} In this way, the clue is clear. Jack is probably the person who has been to Horn Valley two years ago. Then he will know the secret passage. We should find a way through the checkpoints there. he.\n{Ina:} Correct answer! But how should we pass that level?\n{Rael:} Levels with color signs are generally governed by the leader's account set up by the corresponding local lord. We find the corresponding {leader's account}, and then we can get permission.\n{Ina:} Okay, then let's go to the leader's camp. ?a?aHey, what seems to be the situation ahead, go and see.","伊娜在笔记本上一边写着，一边不时地翻阅以前的记录。\n{雷尔：}刚才那2个士兵的话，听到了吧？\n{伊娜：}嗯，我正记着呢。看伊娜酱万能笔记本的线索整理出来啦。\n第一，英拉大主教发布了全国通缉令，并且包庇是同罪，杰克很难在卡尔提亚国内藏身；\n第二，政府派兵到处搜捕杰克但没有找到。\n第三，卡尔提亚王国的国境封锁了，杰克很难通过普通的道路逃出去。\n第四，之前梦影姐姐说过，霍恩山谷那边有通向别国的秘密通道，一般人不知道；\n第五，两年前曾经有个小王子去过霍恩山谷；\n第六，从我们接触过的杰克来看，他不是个迟钝的人，而且挺敢冒险。\n{雷尔：}伊娜你真细心啊，梦影说的话我都没在意，你居然把这些细节都记下来了。\n{伊娜：}爷爷从小教我的嘛，好记性不如烂笔头。\n{雷尔：}这么说来，线索就清楚了，杰克很可能就是那个两年前去过霍恩山谷的人，那么他就会知道那条秘密通道，我们应该想办法通过那里的关卡去找他。\n{伊娜：}正解！不过，我们到底应该怎么样通过那个关卡呢？\n{雷尔：}带有颜色标志的关卡一般都是由对应的地方领主设立的首领营帐管辖的，我们找到相应的{首领营帐}，就能获得许可。\n{伊娜：}好吧，那么我们去找首领营帐。——咦，前面好像有什么情况，去看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIna: This clumsy basilisk is too slow in the mountains.","伊娜：这个笨拙的蛇鸡怪在山地里行动太慢了。"},
