 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIntroduction (important) The main features and precautions of this map\n1. There are many stories, and players are strongly recommended to pay attention to text messages. The key information will be indicated by {yellow}.\n2. All the information needed to pass the level is given during the game, no need to rely on the guide or map editor.\n3. It is not a BT map, there will be no astronomical force, and there will be no battle that takes a long time. It's easy and not nervous, and it won't be a waste of work just because of taking the wrong steps, or completing certain tasks for a little bit of time, or hitting the back and discovering that the previous mistakes cannot be recovered due to the failure to prompt.\n4. The road is wide and visible, there is no hidden passage, and the items necessary for the main storyline will not be hidden in hard-to-find places (but there may be some side story items or hidden rewards).\n5. The battle does not rely on random numbers. No battle can be won by using random factors such as morale, luck, low probability biological skills, hero upgrade points and other random factors to use SAVELOAD Dafa to win small probability events. If some battles cannot be won after repeated attempts, only one of the following is possible: A , no reasonable tactics are used; B, the time to fight this battle has not yet been reached (you need to complete certain tasks to obtain key magic Treasures/creatures can only win afterwards). C. In the previous other battles, the damage that shouldn't be a big loss was lost, or the key creature that shouldn't be lost was lost.\n6. There is absolutely no need to consider double-C cheating in combat.\n7. In some places, small puzzles containing branch plots are placed, which is interesting. The artifact is also included in the branch. The story in the local map is purely fictitious and has no connection with real characters, groups, or events. All {story plots, poems, dialogues,} { illustrations are original}, any simi larity is purely coincidental. If you have any questions about this map, or find a BUG or design loophole, please feel free to contact the author Liu Xuelian. Contact: {www.gamerhome.net/bbs} Forum's {hero invincible 3} section","开篇导读（重要）\n\n本地图的主要特点及注意事项\n1，故事情节较多，强烈建议玩家留意文字信息。其中关键的信息会用{黄色}提示。\n\n2，通关所需要的所有信息都在游戏过程中给出，不需要依赖攻略或地图编辑器。\n\n3，不是BT地图，不会有天文数字的兵力，不会有需要费很长时间的战斗。轻松而不紧张，不会因为诸如走错几步路，或者完成某些任务超出一点时间，或者打到后面才发现前面由于未给提示做错了而无法挽回，而导致前功尽弃。\n\n4，道路宽阔可见，没有隐蔽的通道，也不会把主线剧情必需的物品藏在很难发现的地方（但是也可能会藏一点支线剧情物品或隐藏奖励）。\n\n5，战斗不依赖随机数，没有任何一场战斗是需要靠士气，幸运，低概率生物技能，英雄的升级加点等随机因素来用SAVELOAD大法搏取小概率事件才能取胜的。如果有的战斗反复尝试也无法取胜，可能的情况只有以下之一：\nA，没有用合理的战法；\nB，尚未到该打这一战的时间（还需要完成一定的任务取得关键的魔法/宝物/生物之后才能获胜）。\nC，在之前的其他战斗中，不该大损的大损了，或者是不该损失的关键生物损失掉了。\n\n6，战斗绝对不需要考虑双C作弊。\n\n7，有些地方安置了包含支线情节的小谜题，有一定趣味性。其中神器也包含在支线中。\n\n本地图中的故事纯属虚构，与现实中的人物，团体，事件并无关联。所有的{故事情节，诗歌，对句，}{插画均为原创}，如有雷同，纯属巧合。\n\n\n如果有关于本地图的任何问题，或者发现了BUG或者设计漏洞，欢迎与作者{柳雪恋}联系。\n联系方式：\n{www.gamerhome.net/bbs}论坛的{英雄无敌3}版块"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIra the Mage","魔法少女伊娜 · 原英文版"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIt looks like a cave here, but the entrance is sealed by a huge flat stone slab. There are many incomprehensible words on the stone slab, and a round hole. However, what is certain is that the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" detector has an obvious response, and the target is under this cave.","这里看起来是个山洞，可是入口被巨大而平整的石板封了。石板上有很多看不懂的文字，还有一个圆孔。不过，可以确信的是，“龙王神力”的探测仪有明显的反应，目标就在这个山洞的下面。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIt may be a trap.","可能是圈套。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nIt seems that he has reached the heart of the illusion. A gloomy giant tree rose straight into the sky, unable to see how high it was. Surrounded by soft vines like tentacles, extending from the giant tree, covering the entire illusion. The water that looks like a pond is blue and black like oil and slurry, and sometimes a bubble bursts out with a grunt.\n{Ina:} What a big tree, is this really a tree? In any case, it looks like a hub here. I yelled to see. Hello~~~~~~~~~! Anyone~~~~~~?\n{Fairy:} Who? you are? ...\n{Ina:} I just passed by and came here by accident. May I ask where is this place?\n{Fairy:} You can actually pass the \"All Souls Fantasy Realm\" safely? It's terrible... The defense I set up was broken by someone...\n{Ina:} Who are you? Where is this place again?\n{Fairy:} Well, let me tell you the truth. Don’t destroy this place first, I can tell you all...\n{Ina:} Uh, I have no plans to destroy this place...\n{Fairy:} Tree\", the tree behind is my ontology. The image of this fairy you see is my clone. I have been growing here for more than 500 years.\n{Ina:} What is the relationship between you and the people in Magic Sakura?\n{Fairy:} Illusory Sakura Township is just another illusion that I made with the virtual enchantment. In order for me to grow taller and stronger, I need a lot of energy, so I let people who enter the \"wanling cave\" stay and work for me. Their labor can provide me with the energy needed for further growth.\n{Ina:} But, those people say that staying is voluntary, isn't it...\n{Fairy:} That was just bewildered by my illusion. What is an ideal society without oppression and exploitation? is it possible? As long as there are selfish and dirty humans in the society, such an ideal society will never be realized. But, as a reward for working for me, I will let them meet in the illusion, just like dreaming.\n{Ina:} Hmm... so it's like this...","看起来似乎已经到了幻境的中心地带。一棵阴郁的巨树直耸入天，看不出到底有多高。周围布满了触手般的柔软的藤蔓，从巨树延伸开去，布满整个幻境。看似池潭的水中，青黑色如油如浆，时而咕噜一声冒出个气泡。\n\n{伊娜：}好大的树啊，这真是树吗？不管怎么说，这里看起来是中枢地带了。我喊喊看。喂~~~~~~~~~！有人吗~~~~~~？\n{妖精：}谁？你是？……\n{伊娜：}我只是路过的，不小心走到这里来了，请问这里是哪里呀？\n{妖精：}你竟然能安全通过“万灵幻境”？太可怕了……我设下的防卫，竟然被人突破了……\n{伊娜：}你到底是谁呀？这里又是哪里？\n{妖精：}好吧，我告诉你实情，你先不要破坏这里，我可以全部告诉你……\n{伊娜：}呃，我没有打算破坏这里啊……\n{妖精：}我叫做“万灵之树”，后面这棵树就是我的本体。你看到的这个妖精的形象是我的分身。我一直生长在这里，已经有500多年了。\n{伊娜：}幻樱乡的人跟你又有什么关系呢？\n{妖精：}幻樱乡只是我用虚结界制作出来的又一重幻境而已。我为了能让自己长得更高，更强，我需要大量的能量，所以我让进入“万灵穴”的人们留下来为我工作，他们的劳动能为我提供进一步生长所需的能量。\n{伊娜：}可是，那些人说留下来是自愿的，难道……\n{妖精：}那只是被我的幻境迷惑了而已。什么没有欺压没有剥削的理想社会？可能吗？只要社会中还有自私的肮脏的人类，这样的理想社会就永远不可能实现。不过嘛，作为为我工作的奖赏，我就让他们在虚幻中满足一下好了，就像是做着美梦一般。\n{伊娜：}唔……原来是这样啊……\n\n"},
