 {"ira-the-mage-3\nMagic Academy\n{Ina:} Hello, Mr. Mage, is there a place to learn magic here? (Turning notes) What is called the Magic Guild...\n{Lecturer:} Kartia City does not open the Magic Guild, only {Magic Academy} is open to the public. I am the lecturer here. If you want to learn 4 magic skills, you can sign up. Each skill requires 2000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} Great, I want to learn everything.\n{Lecturer:} Wait, no. It looks like your profession is \"ranger\", this profession is {Forbidden to learn fire magic}, you can only learn the other\n3.\n{Ina:} Wait, why is it a \"ranger\", isn't it a \"patrolman\"?\n{Lecturer:} That must be a mistake in your translation. The correct translation of \"Ranger\" should be \"Ranger\". Your translation level is too bad, or your knowledge is not enough. Sometimes translators don't have enough professional knowledge to translate proper nouns. It is easy to make mistakes. For example, I often see some translators turn \"Naga\" into \"Snake Girl\" and \"Snake Skin Beast\" into \" \"Bison\", \"Basilisk\" turned \"Lizard\", and so on. This is caused by insufficient professional knowledge.\n{Ina:} There are still translation errors, this should be written down. In this way, the previous translation of jackals into werewolves is also the mistake. That's the case, why should we ban \"rangers\" from learning fire magic?\n{Lecturer:} This is a regulation, nothing more. I only know that this regulation is strictly enforced, and I don't know the reason. If you want to know why, you have to ask the person who made this rule. It's not just for you alone. Other professions also have skills that are forbidden to learn.\n{Ina:} So unreasonable...","魔法学院\n{伊娜：}这位法师先生您好，请问这里有可以学习魔法的地方吗？（翻笔记）叫做魔法行会什么来着……\n{讲师：}卡尔提亚城不开放魔法行会，只有{魔法学院}对外开放。我是这里的讲师。如果要学习4系魔法技能，可以报名。每项技能需付2000金币。\n{伊娜：}太好了，我全部要学。\n{讲师：}等等，不行。看起来你的职业是“游侠”，这个职业是{禁止学习火系魔法}的，你只能学习另外3个。\n{伊娜：}等等，怎么是“游侠”，不是明明是“巡逻兵”吗？\n{讲师：}那一定是你的翻译搞错了，“Ranger”的正确翻译应该是“游侠”，你的翻译水平太烂，或者说知识不够。有时翻译对专业知识了解不够就从事专有名词的翻译，很容易出现错误，比如我经常看到有的翻译把“那加”翻成了“蛇女”，把“蛇皮兽”翻成了“野牛”，把“蛇鸡怪”翻成了“蜥蜴”，等等。这都是专业知识不足造成的。\n{伊娜：}居然还能翻译错误啊，这个要记下来。这么说来之前遇到的把豺狼人翻译成狼人的情况也是这种错误啦。那就算是这样，为什么又要禁止“游侠”学习火系魔法呢？\n{讲师：}这是规定，仅此而已，我只知道严格执行这个规定，并不知道原因。如果你想知道为什么，你得去问制订这个规定的人。并不只是对你一人而已，其他职业也有各自禁止学习的技能的。\n{伊娜：}这么不通情达理啊……"},
