 {"ira-the-mage-3\nMengying holds a white feather in her hand, and tears of pity in her dim eyes.\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying...\n{Mengying:} I'm fine, don't comfort me. I'm not a cowardly person, I won't let Roland's efforts in vain. I used to be naive and thought that I could live a stable and secluded life without interfering in the dispute between the demons and human beings. Now I finally understand that if Solo's ambition is not smashed, it will only cause more people to suffer misfortune. Let's take a look at how to break the barrier in front of us.\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying has a way? We couldn't break it no matter how we tried before.\n{Mengying:} Hard hitting is not acceptable. This structure is eggshell-shaped and has very strong resistance to the outside, but much weaker inside.\n{Freeman:} Ah, this is the so-called \"thin shell structure\". I have learned it in physics class before. The human skull is also strong because of this structure.\n{Ina:} But how can we destroy it from the inside? If you don't break him, you won't be able to get inside at all.\n{Mengying:} Generally speaking, this is the case. However, with the \"dragon king supernatural power\", it is not impossible.\n{Raier:} \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\", we still have a \"Dragon Armor\" in it.\n{Mengying:} It is precisely because the \"Dragon Armor\" is inside that I say it is not impossible. The parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" can resonate with each other. If they are gathered in a very close range, there will be resonance gravitational force between the parts that can break through all resistance. Of course, this enchantment cannot be blocked. Rael, you put on the 8 parts of the Dragon King's supernatural power, and then slowly approach the barrier.\n{Rael:} Is that so? ... Ah, I feel it...\n{Mengying:} Right? Get closer, don't go too fast, and be careful of your body's ability to withstand it.\n{Ina:} Ah, it's already attached to the side of the barrier... wear... through? ...\n{Rael:} I'm coming in...\n{Ina:} Rael, your eyes have changed color...\n{Rael:} Is it the blood of glory? How come, I awakened the blood of glory for the first time without any harm...\n{Mengying:} \"Dragon King Divine Power\" has the ability to awaken the blood of glory, so as long as you wear \"Dragon King Divine Power\", you can Awaken Radiant Blood at any time.\n{Rael:} Then it's easy, then I'm going to attack from the inside, you pay attention to get out of the way.\n{Ina:} Ah, this posture is...\n{Rael:} Holy Light Heaven Sword!\n{Freeman:} Really broke...\n{Ina:} Rael's sword is so handsome...\n{Rael:} Do you want to learn?\n{Ina:} I can't do it, and I haven't practiced swordsmanship, so I can only envy it. What's more, Rael has the blood of glory, so he can be more gorgeous than the ordinary Heavenly Sword used only before... I don't want this, let's go in and look for the \"Dragon Armor\".\n{Freeman:} However, apart from a square array, the dragon armor can't be seen inside.\n{Raier:} Judging from the resonance of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", the \"Dragon Armor\" is in the middle of that square. I just don't know how to get in.\n{Mengying:} Don't act rashly. This formation looked like a \"Four Square Formation of Dunjia\". Although it looked like a few stone walls, it was better than a hundred thousand soldiers.\n{Ina:} Hundred thousand heroes? So what should we do...\n{Mengying:} Don't worry, let me observe. Although \"Dang Jia Si Fang Shu\" is powerful, it is not without its weaknesses. The intensity of its four directions, the difference is very big. It's just that the strong and the weak will continue to alternate, changing with the astronomical phenomenon. I now want to find its weakest side.\n{Ina:} What are sister Mengying drawing...\n{Freeman:} Wait patiently, Master Mengying will solve it.\n{Mengying:} came out. Look. This is the breakthrough road map we should follow. Picture of Mengying:\n{Box} {Rael:} What kind of picture is this, as always, it is illegible.\n{Ina:} I have seen it clearly. Come with me, everyone.","梦影手中攥着一支白羽毛，朦胧的眼中含着忧怜的泪光。\n\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐……\n{梦影：}我，没事，不用安慰我。我也不是什么懦弱的人，我不会让罗兰的努力白费的。以前我真天真，还妄想着不要干涉魔族与人类的纷争就能过着安稳的隐居生活，现在我终于明白了，不把索罗的野心粉碎，只会让更多的人遭遇不幸。我们还是来看看怎么破除眼前的结界吧。\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐有办法？我们之前怎么试都打不破呢。\n{梦影：}硬打是不行的，这个结构是蛋壳形，对外部的抗力非常强，但是内部却要弱得多。\n{弗里曼：}啊，这就是所谓的“薄壳结构”吧。我以前物理课上学到过的呢。人的头骨也正是因为这种结构所以才坚固。\n{伊娜：}可是，怎么样才能从内部破坏它呢，如果不打破他，根本进不到内部啊。\n{梦影：}一般说起来是这样。不过，有了“龙王神力”，就不是不可能了。\n{雷尔：}“龙王神力”，我们还差一件“龙甲”在里面呢。\n{梦影：}正是因为“龙甲”在里面，所以我才说不是不可能。“龙王神力”的部件，是可以相互共鸣的，如果它们聚到了很近的范围内，部件之间就会有能突破一切阻力的共鸣引力，当然，这个结界也无法阻挡。雷尔，你把龙王神力的8个部件穿上，然后慢慢靠近结界。\n{雷尔：}这样吗？……啊，我感觉到了……\n{梦影：}是吧？再慢慢靠近呢，不要太快，当心身体的承受能力。\n{伊娜：}啊，已经贴到结界边上了……穿……穿过了？……\n{雷尔：}我进来了……\n{伊娜：}雷尔，你的眼睛，变色了……\n{雷尔：}是光辉之血吗？怎么会，我第一次在没有受到任何伤害的情况下觉醒了光辉之血……\n{梦影：}“龙王神力”拥有唤醒光辉之血的能力，所以只要穿着“龙王神力”，你可以在任何时候觉醒光辉之血。\n{雷尔：}那就好办了，那么我要从内侧攻击了，你们注意闪开。\n{伊娜：}啊，这个架势是……\n{雷尔：}圣光天霄剑！\n\n{弗里曼：}真的打破了……\n{伊娜：}雷尔的剑招好帅……\n{雷尔：}想学吗？\n{伊娜：}我不行的啦，又没练过剑术，只能羡慕羡慕而已。何况，雷尔有光辉之血，所以才能比之前单单使出普通的天霄剑更华丽吧……不想这个了，我们赶紧进去找“龙甲”吧。\n{弗里曼：}不过，里面除了一个方形的布阵之外，并不能看到龙甲。\n{雷尔：}从“龙王神力”的共鸣来看，“龙甲”就在那个方阵的中间。只是不知该如何进去。\n{梦影：}你们不要贸然行动。这个阵，看起来像是“遁甲四方阵”，虽然看上去只是一些石壁，却胜过十万雄兵。\n{伊娜：}十万雄兵？那我们该怎么办呢……\n{梦影：}别急，让我观测一下。“遁甲四方术”虽然强大，但也不是没有弱点。它的四个方向的强度，差别是非常大的。只是强与弱会不断交替，随着天象而改变。我现在就是要找出它最弱的一面来。\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐在画些什么呢……\n{弗里曼：}耐心等着吧，梦影大师会解决的。\n{梦影：}出来了。看。这是我们应该遵循的突破路线图。\n梦影画的图：{匣}\n{雷尔：}这是什么图，还是一如既往地难以辨认啊。\n{伊娜：}我已经看明白了。大家跟我来吧。\n\n\n\n"},
