 {"ira-the-mage-3\nNear the sea, Ina suddenly found a small boat overturned in the rocky reef.\n{Ina:} Huh? Why is there a boat here? Could it be that it was blown here in yesterday's wind and rain. That was terrible, the people on this boat must not be able to go back, they must be very distressed. Go and see, maybe there is something I can help.","靠近海边，伊娜突然发现一只小船倾覆在乱石礁中。\n{伊娜：}咦？这里怎么会有船？难不成是昨天的风雨中被吹到这里来的。那可惨了，这船上的人肯定回不去了，他们一定很苦恼。去看看吧，也许有什么我能帮忙的。"},
