 {"ira-the-mage-3\nNot far in front, a big man holding a long knife snarled viciously at a woman.\n{Big Man:} Don't rush, hand over all the money quickly, lest the uncle can take the initiative, don't think that the uncle dare not kill people, now the country is in chaos, no one will be in charge of public security. If you honestly hand over the money, the uncle can still let you make a living.\n{Women:} Our family's one-year harvest in exchange for such a small amount of money, give it to you, how will our family live in the future...\n{Big Man:} You can't control how you live your life. If you don't give it, you will kill it now. With you, you don't have to think about your future life!\n{Women:} Help, who will help me~~~~\n{Ina:} It's so shameless, you stop me!\n{Dahan:} What? Little girl, who are you? Do you also want to honor your uncle with your wallet?\n{Ina:} How dare you go in broad daylight... Ah, forget it, don't talk about the old-fashioned lines of these justice partners. In short, I'm here to clean up you.\n{Big Man:} It looks like you can do magic, right, but don't think that only you can, uncle, I am several times better than you.","前面不远处，一个大汉手持长刀，恶狠狠地对着一个妇女咆哮着。\n{大汉：}别磨蹭了，快把钱都交出来，免得大爷出手，别以为大爷不敢杀人，现在国家大乱，根本就不会有人来管治安。你老老实实交出钱来，大爷还能放你一条生路。\n{妇女：}我们家一年的收成换来这么点钱，给你拿去了，我们一家人今后怎么生活呀……\n{大汉：}你怎么生活大爷管不着，你要是不给，现在就宰了你，你也不用想什么今后的生活了！\n{妇女：}救命，谁来救救我~~~~\n\n{伊娜：}太不像话了，你给我住手！\n{大汉：}什么？小丫头，你是谁？你是不是也想拿钱包孝敬大爷？\n{伊娜：}你竟敢光天化日之下……啊，算了算了，不要说这些正义伙伴的老掉牙的台词了。总之，我是来收拾你的。\n{大汉：}看起来你会魔法是吧，不过别以为只有你会，大爷我比你强上几倍。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nNot far in front, a muscular tomb robber was studying a rock wall.\n{Grave Robber:} Damn! It's so strong that you can't break it. This place seems to be an institution, and there must be valuable things behind it. I opened this wall, and we posted it. But how should this mechanism be opened? There is nothing but a hole...","前边不远处，一个筋肉粗壮的盗墓贼正在研究一块石壁。\n{盗墓贼：}靠！这么坚固，砸都砸不开。这个地方看起来是个机关，背后一定有价值连城的好东西。把这块墙壁打开了，俺们就发了。可是这机关该怎么开，除了一个孔，什么都没有……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOn a high platform in front of the stargazers, the seven tower pillars are arranged in the shape of the Orion Betelgeuse. They correspond to: Yellow pillar: Betelgeuse (Orion |á Betelgeuse) White pillar: Betelgeuse (Orion |? Bellatrix) ) Purple column: Betelgeuse (Orion |? Alnitak) Water color column: Betelgeuse (Orion |? Alnilam) Blue column: Betelgeuse (Orion |? Mintaka) Green column: Betelgeuse (Orion |ê Saiph) Black column: Ginseng Suqi (Orion |? Rigel) The last sentence of the signboard refers to this. But the constellation of Orion, formed by the stars, still lacks a head. The next sentence of the signboard, the four-element spiritual method of the star source divine power gathers together, implying that the \"Star Source\" refined by the Holy Doctor Reina with the essence of the four elements of Qi, Fire, Water, and Earth is located in the \"head\" section. According to the arrangement of the seven towers, the current position is exactly the position of Orion's head, \"Lambda Heka\" (Orion |? Heka). Ina gets the power of \"Star Source\".","在观星居前面的一片高台上，七根塔柱排成了猎户座参宿七星的形状，它们分别对应着：\n\n黄色柱：参宿四（猎户α Betelgeuse）\n白色柱：参宿五（猎户γ Bellatrix）\n紫色柱：参宿一（猎户ζ Alnitak）\n水色柱：参宿二（猎户ε Alnilam）\n蓝色柱：参宿三（猎户δ Mintaka）\n绿色柱：参宿六（猎户κ Saiph）\n黑色柱：参宿七（猎户β Rigel）\n\n标示牌的上句\n参宿辉光 七星塔柱映天照\n即是指此。但参宿七星所构成的猎户座尚缺头部。\n\n标示牌的下句\n星源神力 四元灵法聚首齐\n则暗示了圣医雷纳用气火水土四元之精华提练而成的“星之源”位于“首”部。而根据七根塔柱的排列，现在这个位置，正是猎户座的头部“觜宿一”（猎户λ Heka）的位置。\n\n伊娜得到了“星之源”的力量。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOn the gate of the Garden of Truth, a sign read: Opening hours 6:00 AM ~ 10:00 AM\n{Ina:} Is it not open yet? Let's go to {the janitor of the royal library} and ask the time.","真理之园的大门上，一块告示牌写着：\n开放时间\n6:00 AM ~ 10:00 AM\n\n{伊娜：}现在还没到开放时间吗？我们去找{皇家图书馆的看门人}问问时间去。"},
