 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOn the rock in front, sits an old man in a robe with white eyebrows and long beard.\n{Ina:} Ah, isn't this Senior Fengyou?\n{Robe old man:} Fengyou? Have you met my brother?\n{Ina:} Hey, it turns out that you are his junior, you look alike.\n{Robe old man:} I am his junior, my name is Fengxing.\n{Ina:} We are looking for you. Ina talked about defeating the pinates to retrieve the treasures and rescuing Fengyou.","前面的礁石上，坐着一位白眉长髯的长袍老者。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，这不是风游前辈吗？\n{长袍老者：}风游？你们见过我师兄了？\n{伊娜：}咦，原来您是他师弟啊，长得好像呢。\n{长袍老者：}我是他师弟，我叫风行。\n{伊娜：}我们正要找您呢。\n\n伊娜把击败海盗取回宝物以及搭救风游的事情说了一遍。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOn the side of the road, a short man was resting.\n{Ina:} There is someone here, I might as well ask to see if he knows about Kartia. ?a?aThis gentleman, may I ask...\n{Darw:} Who, I haven't seen this lord taking a break. Ah, is it you?\n{Ina:} Mr. Bad Guy!\n{Dawu:} Stupid little girl! What are you doing here? Also disturb the adults to rest.\n{Ina:} I didn't know it was you, but I just wanted to find someone to ask about Kartia.\n{Da Wu:} Hey, then you have to ask the right person. This lord is...\n{Ina:} \"Mirronia's first well-informed, eye-catching, omniscient, omniscience, omniscience, omniscience, sir.\" Well, how many times is this already?\n{Dawu:} Now that you know it, the price is still the same...\n{Ina:} \"Information fee 2000 gold coins\".\n{Da Wu:} It's very straightforward, so I'll talk about it.","路边，一个矮个子正在休息。\n{伊娜：}这边有个人，我不妨问一下，看他知道不知道卡尔提亚的情况。——这位先生，请问……\n{达伍：}谁啊，没见本大人正在休息嘛。啊，是你？\n{伊娜：}坏人先生！\n{达伍：}笨小丫头！你到这里来干什么。还打扰本大人休息。\n{伊娜：}我原先不知道是你，只是想找人问问卡尔提亚的情况。\n{达伍：}嘿嘿，这你就问对人了。本大人正是……\n{伊娜：}“米尔罗尼亚第一消息灵通眼明耳快无所不知无所不晓的达伍大人”。嗯，这已经是第几遍了来着？\n{达伍：}既然你都知道了，那么价钱也依旧……\n{伊娜：}“信息费2000金币”。\n{达伍：}很干脆，那么本大人就说了。\n\n\n\n\n"},
