 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOrans took Ina and the others to take a path and detour to the back of the stargazing house.\n{Olens:} There is a vent here, and the movement in the house can be heard from here. They are talking inside. Ina and others also joined in to listen. There are 2 different voices in the room.\n{Voice A:} It's really a good place, it's high and far away, and it won't be noticed by anyone, and those humans can't control it. Master Chinu, how did you find this place?\n{Voice B:} It happened to be the angel I caught told me. I didn't expect it to be such a strategically located place. With this as a base, our Xiaolong troops can easily fly to any human kingdom in Mirronia. Attacked.\n{Voice A:} Master Chinu is really farsighted.\n{Voice B:} Time is almost up, I have to go back to {Mag Udia} to take this angel over. This guy was defeated by me, although he was temporarily unconscious, but when he wakes up, this place is afraid that he won't be able to trap him. Put him in Magudia's cage and I was relieved.\n{Voice A:} Haha, {\"The dark prison\"}, even the angels can do nothing when they get there.\n{Voice B:} Zach, you are responsible for guarding this place. During my absence, nothing can go wrong.\n{Voice A:} Master Chinu, don't worry.\n{Ina:} No, this Chinu seems to be taking Roland away.\n{Freeman:} Without further ado, let's stop him.","奥兰斯带着伊娜等人抄小路绕到了观星居的背后。\n\n{奥兰斯：}这里有一个通风口，可以从这里听到屋里的动静。他们在里面说话呢。\n\n伊娜等人也凑上来听。屋里有2个不同的声音。\n{声音A：}这里果然是个好地方，又高又远，又不会被任何人发觉，那些人类也管不到这里。齐努大人，您是怎么找到这个地方的？\n{声音B：}正好是我抓的那个天使告诉我的，没想到是个战略位置这么好的地方，有了这里作为基地，我们枭龙部队可以轻易地飞往米尔罗尼亚任何一个人类王国进行袭击了。\n{声音A：}齐努大人真是高瞻远瞩。\n{声音B：}时间差不多了，我得回{玛格乌迪亚}去一趟，把这个天使带过去。这厮被我打败，虽然暂时昏迷，但是啥时候他醒过来的话，这个地方怕是困不住他。把他关到玛格乌迪亚的牢笼里，我才放心。\n{声音A：}哈哈，{“漆黑的牢笼”}，到了那里面，就算天使也无能为力了。\n{声音B：}扎克，你负责守好这里。我不在的这段时间，可不能出什么差错。\n{声音A：}齐努大人放心。\n\n{伊娜：}不好，这个齐努好像要把罗兰带走。\n{弗里曼：}事不宜迟，我们快去截住他。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nOut of the corner of Ina's eyes, she saw someone howling at a rapid speed.\n{Ina:} It looks like this guy is Slander. The speed is really good.","伊娜眼角余光看到有人以飞快的速度呼啸而来。\n{伊娜：}看起来这个家伙就是斯兰德了。速度果然不错。"},
