 {"ira-the-mage-3\nPassing by the classroom, I heard the sound of children's songs coming from inside. A ghost dog has three mouths, six eyes and four legs. The two dogs have six mouths, twelve eyes and eight legs. ?-?- ?-?-","路过教室的旁边，听到里面传来朗朗的儿歌声。\n\n一只冥犬三张嘴，六只眼睛四条腿。\n两只冥犬六张嘴，十二只眼睛八条腿。\n……\n……\n"},
