 {"ira-the-mage-3\nPut away Bimon and replaced it with a basilisk.\n{Ina:} The lecturer at the Academy of Magic said before that it was wrong to turn this thing into a lizard, it should be a basilisk. Fortunately, I have notes down. This guy has 6 legs. It's really not a lizard. The lizard only has 4 legs.","收起了比蒙，换成了蛇鸡怪。\n{伊娜：}之前魔法学院的讲师有说过，这个东西翻成蜥蜴是错的，应该是蛇鸡怪。还好我有笔记下来。这家伙长了6条腿，确实不是蜥蜴嘛，蜥蜴只有4条腿的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nQi Mu looks at each other, ten steps are close to the sky, sad wishes, different roots are connected, two shadows are in the center of Jingxinquan","奇木对望 十步虽近空悲愿\n异根相连 两影正中净心泉"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nQingyunling. Beware of cloud storms.","青云岭。\n小心云暴。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nQueen Lucia","露西亚女王"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nQueen Lucia was hit on the head by Ina's magic, and the crystal crown on her head shattered. The queen suddenly hugged her head in her hands and howled heartbreakingly.\n{Queen:} Ah~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~!\n{Freeman:} What's wrong, it seems something is wrong.\n{Rael:} It seems to be very painful...\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm not doing bad things anymore. But obviously it was the queen who wanted to kill us... After some time, the queen gradually calmed down.\n{Queen:} Me, what did I do, my goodness...\n{Ina:} What's the matter? Her Majesty?\n{Queen:} Thank you for saving me and removing the magic from me.\n{Rael:} Magic? Could it be...\n{Queen:} is \"dominant\" magic. I was manipulated by others, just like a puppet, I became a tool for others, and my words and deeds were completely controlled by others.\n{Ina:} There is such a terrible magic...\n{Rael:} However, as far as I know, this magic must rely on a certain object to be effective. Is it this crystal crown?\n{Queen:} Yes. The magic is in this crystal crown. So it was shattered and the magic was released.\n{Freeman:} But who is it that used such a vicious trick on the queen?\n{Queen:} is a person called Archbishop Yingluck. {Ina & Rael & Freeman:} Archbishop Yingluck? !\n{Queen:} Two months ago, Fendinia was as calm as ever, and Archbishop Yingluck came here. After he saw me, he expressed his admination for me and said he wanted to marry me, but I did not agree. Later, he gave me this crystal crown, saying it was a gift to me, as a proof of his heart. I didn't know there was a fraud, so I tried on the crystal crown, and then he manipulated it.\n{Freeman:} So what role is Gals?\n{Queen:} After I was manipulated, Kurug and Kalidan were inserted into the palace, and the demons came. Their actions seemed to be in line with Archbishop Yingluck. They allowed the demons to rob civilians. , Snatching resources, and planning to murder you when you arrive.\n{Ina:} It turns out that all this is the ghost of Archbishop Yingluck. So is that Kurug also a demon?\n{Queen:} Yes. In addition, they did everything possible to find my treasure \"Longan Ring\".\n{Rael:} Did they find it?\n{Queen:} No. In fact, the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" has been lost by me. Once I wore it to the beach to swim, and it disappeared after landing. From the conversation between Kurug and Kaldan, I heard that it seems that you are also looking for the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", so they plan to use it as a bait to murder you.\n{Ina:} They actually knew we were looking for \"Dragon Eye Ring\"?\n{Queen:} Yes, if I didn't lose the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", I should give it as a gift in return for your salvation. It's a pity...\n{Freeman:} Her Majesty's peace is the best result, and we are not trying to reciprocate. However, although it is said to be lost, we may still have a way to retrieve the \"Longan Ring\".\n{Queen:} Really, that's great, if you find it, treat it as a gift to you. I am going back to the palace now. I will send someone to capture Kurug as soon as possible, and bring to justice all those who have harmed our Fendinia.","露西亚女王被伊娜的魔法击中头部，头上的水晶冠碎裂了。女王突然双手抱头，撕心裂肺地嚎叫起来。\n\n{女王：}啊~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~！\n{弗里曼：}怎么了，好像情况有点不对劲。\n{雷尔：}好像非常痛苦的样子……\n{伊娜：}啊，我不会是做了坏事了吧。可是明明是女王想杀我们的……\n\n一段时间过后，女王渐渐平静下来。\n\n{女王：}我，我做了什么，天哪……\n{伊娜：}怎么回事？女王陛下？\n{女王：}谢谢你解救了我，把我身上的魔法解除了。\n{雷尔：}魔法？难道是……\n{女王：}是“支配”魔法。我被人操纵了，就像木偶一样，成了别人的工具，一言一行完全被人控制着。\n{伊娜：}还有这样可怕的魔法……\n{雷尔：}但是，据我所知，这个魔法必须依凭一定的物体才能生效，难道是这个水晶冠？\n{女王：}对。魔法就在这个水晶冠中。所以它被打碎了，魔法才得以解除。\n{弗里曼：}可是究竟是谁，对女王使用如此阴毒的招数？\n{女王：}是一个被称作英拉大主教的人。\n{伊娜&雷尔&弗里曼：}英拉大主教？！\n{女王：}两个月前，那时芬迪尼亚还是像以往一样的平静，而英拉大主教来到了这里。他见到我之后，对我表达了爱慕之意，说想要娶我，我没有答应。后来他就送给了我这顶水晶冠，说是给我的礼物，作为他心意的证明。我不知道其中有诈，试戴了一下水晶冠，然后，就被他操纵了。\n{弗里曼：}那么加尔斯又是什么角色呢？\n{女王：}在我被操纵之后，库鲁格和卡里丹就被安插进宫了，魔族也来了，他们的行动似乎跟英拉大主教步调很一致，他们纵容魔族劫掠平民，抢夺资源，又在你们到来的时候设计谋害你们。\n{伊娜：}原来这一切又是英拉大主教搞的鬼。那么那个库鲁格也是魔族吗？\n{女王：}是的。另外，他们还千方百计寻找我的宝物“龙眼指环”。\n{雷尔：}他们找到了吗？\n{女王：}没有。其实“龙眼指环”已经被我遗失了。曾经有一次我戴着它去海边游泳，上岸后就不见了。从库鲁格和卡尔丹的言谈中我听到似乎你们也在找“龙眼指环”，所以他们才计划以此为诱饵谋害你们。\n{伊娜：}他们竟然知道我们在找“龙眼指环”？\n{女王：}是啊，要是我没把“龙眼指环”弄丢，真该以此相赠，以报答你们解救之恩。可惜……\n{弗里曼：}女王陛下能平安就是最好的结果了，我们并不是为了要什么报答。不过，虽然说遗失了，不过我们也许还有办法找回“龙眼指环”。\n{女王：}是吗，那太好了，如果你们找到了，就当作是我给你们的谢礼吧。我现在要回宫去了，尽快派人去捉拿库鲁格，把祸害我们芬迪尼亚的人全部绳之以法。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRadia","拉迪亚"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRadia was knocked to the ground and her wings were injured.\n{Ina:} You can't fly now.\n{Radia:} Hmph, you are really amazing, just kill me if you want.\n{Ina:} I don't want to kill you, I just want to ask about the information of \"Dragon Tooth Crown\".\n{Radia:} Do you think I will tell you? At this time, a large army rushed from behind, under the banner of Solandria.\n{Ina:} Looks like this is Holia's support force, right? It's a pity to come a little late\n{Army:} Kill, kill them all!\n{Ina:} Wait, have you made a mistake, why are you attacking us?\n{Army:} The Prime Minister's order will kill you all, not one is left.\n{Ina:} Hey, what's going on...","拉迪亚被打倒在地，翅膀也伤了。\n\n{伊娜：}这下你不能飞了吧。\n{拉迪亚：}哼，你们的确厉害，要杀我就只管杀好了。\n{伊娜：}我不想杀你啦，我只想问问“龙牙冠”的情报。\n{拉迪亚：}你以为我会告诉你吗？\n\n这时，背后一支大军奔袭而来，打着索兰德里亚的旗号。\n{伊娜：}看来这是霍利亚的接应部队吧？可惜来晚了一点。\n{军队：}杀，杀光他们！\n{伊娜：}等等，你们有没有搞错，为什么冲着我们攻击啊？\n{军队：}宰相大人的命令，把你们都杀掉，一个不剩。\n{伊娜：}喂，怎么回事……\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRadia's intelligence.","拉迪亚的情报。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRael and the elders.","雷尔与长老。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRael grabbed Ina. The messenger rode far away at this time.\n{Ina:} Rael, why are you stopping me?\n{Rael:} That's just a errand, it's useless to ask him. On the contrary, it would be troublesome if we ourselves exposed the familiar relationship with Jack. We will be in danger ourselves.\n{Ina:} Jack? It shouldn't be called... Rael winked.\n{Ina:} Ah, I understand. Take notes on this. For safety's sake, we will still use the name Jack in the future...\n{Rael:} At the moment, we'd better find Jack as soon as possible. If he escapes alone again this time, the situation may be very dangerous.","雷尔一把拉住伊娜。而那个差人则在这个时候骑马跑远了。\n{伊娜：}雷尔，你为什么要阻止我？\n{雷尔：}那只是个当差的，问他没什么用。反尔要是我们自己暴露了跟杰克熟识的关系的话就麻烦了。我们自己也会有危险。\n{伊娜：}杰克？不是应该叫……\n雷尔使了个眼色。\n{伊娜：}啊，明白了。这个要记笔记下来。为了安全起见，以后还是使用杰克这个称呼……\n{雷尔：}眼下我们最好尽快找到杰克。如果他这回又是一个人逃出来的话，处境可能会很危险。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRael heard the slight movement and was about to clap his hands to signal when suddenly a flying guy swooped up in the dark. Rael instinctively flicked his sword to block it, and with a ping sound, the sharp claws were held up where they were about to pierce his throat. Although the light is dim and you can't see the opponent, the giant bat wings of this creature dance softly in the air.\n{Rael:} (Is it a vampire? Not like. Since there is only one...) Rael bounced off his opponent, rolled back, dodges the opponent's next hand stab, then kicked his right foot into the air and waved Sword power cut. The opponent was insufficiently prepared for Rael's rapid counterattack, and barely parryed, and was flew about a meter away, but his wings rose up to the sky with a vigorous blow, and Rael's follow-up blow rushed into the air.\n{Voice:} Good skill, although it is a human being, it is not inferior to me in the sense of keenness in the dark...\n{Rael:} Who are you? This voice seems to have been heard somewhere...\n{Ina:} Rael! Don't worry, why don't you give the signal... Look at the trick, the special flare made by little Ina! Ina threw a ball of light to illuminate the hole.\n{Rael:} Ah, it turned out to be you...\n{Ina:} Ladia!","雷尔听到细微的动静，正打算拍手发信号，突然暗黑中一个飞着的家伙猛扑上来。雷尔本能地抽剑格挡了一下，乒的一声响，利爪在几乎就要刺到咽喉的地方被架住了。虽然光线暗看不清对方，但这个生物巨大的蝠翼在空中轻柔地舞动。\n\n{雷尔：}（吸血鬼吗？不像。既然只有一个……）\n\n雷尔弹开对手，一个后滚翻，躲过了对手紧接着的一手猛刺，然后右脚一蹬，腾空而起，挥剑力斩。对手对雷尔迅速的反攻准备不足，勉强招架了一下，被弹飞一丈多远，但翅膀使劲一拍又升到上空，雷尔跟进的一击扑了空。\n\n{声音：}好身手，虽然是人类，不过在黑暗之中感觉的敏锐一点都不逊于我……\n{雷尔：}你是谁？这声音好像在哪听过……\n{伊娜：}雷尔！你不要紧吧，怎么不给信号了啊……看招，伊娜酱特制照明弹！\n\n伊娜扔出一个光球，把洞中照亮了。\n\n{雷尔：}啊，原来是你……\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRael, Freeman, no one, all met here.\n{Freeman:} Everyone did a great job.\n{No one:} Hey, the remaining demons don't have any organization at all. They were scared away by our casual beating. Now the folks can come out to rebuild their homes again.\n{Ina:} It's great.\n{No one:} Thanks to your help, as agreed in advance, I will tell you the location of the \"Dragonbone Greaves\". Go get it. Sailing {to the east} from here, there is an {Isolated Island of Volcanic Rock}, and the \"Dragon Bone Greaves\" is hidden in a cave on that island. However, there are many reefs in the sea, so be careful when sailing.\n{Ina:} Thank you very much, sister.\n{Freeman:} Then I should also say goodbye to Nobody and everyone.\n{Ina:} Hey, where do you want to go?\n{Freeman:} I don't know where to go right now, but I must investigate the shady scene of Archbishop Yingluck.\n{Ina:} Ah, I almost forgot, we still want to ask you what happened to Kartia?\n{Freeman:} In fact, I don't know much, so I was accused of treason inexplicably.\n{Rael:} I think it's better to walk with us as Jack.\n{Ina:} Good idea, how about it, Jack?\n{Freeman:} Well, I'm sorry to trouble you again.\n{Ina:} Let's go, let's go, walking along the road and saying, let's go by boat, and when you get to the boat, you can tell us the details of Kartia.\n{Rael:} Is there a ready-made boat at the pier?\n{Ina:} It doesn't seem to be there, what should I do?\n{Freeman:} Don't worry, my book on local wood engineering also talks about shipbuilding methods. As long as we can find a way to get some {wood}, we can build ships.\n{Rael:} But where do I go to find wood?\n{Ina:} I think of a way. I will work hard.","雷尔，弗里曼，没有人，都在这里会合了。\n{弗里曼：}大家干得漂亮。\n{没有人：}嘿，剩下的那些魔族小鬼，一点组织都没有，被我们随便打打就吓跑了。这下乡亲们又可以出来重建家园了。\n{伊娜：}真是太好了。\n{没有人：}多亏了你们的帮忙，按照事先的约定，我告诉你们“龙骨胫甲”的位置，你们去取吧。从这里开船{向东}，有一个{火山岩的孤岛}，“龙骨胫甲”就藏在那个岛上的地洞里。不过，海里礁石很多，行船时千万要小心。\n{伊娜：}真是谢谢大姐了。\n{弗里曼：}那么我也该跟没有人大姐和各位道别了。\n{伊娜：}咦，你想去哪？\n{弗里曼：}我现在还暂时不知道该去哪，但是我一定要调查出英拉大主教的黑幕。\n{伊娜：}啊，差点忘了，我们还想来问你卡尔提亚是怎么个情况呢？\n{弗里曼：}其实我也知道得不多，莫名其妙地就被扣上了叛国罪名。\n{雷尔：}我看，不如杰克就跟我们同行吧。\n{伊娜：}好主意，怎么样，杰克？\n{弗里曼：}好吧，又要麻烦你们了真是不好意思。\n{伊娜：}走吧走吧，路上边走边说，我们坐船去，到了船上你好好跟我们讲讲卡尔提亚的详细情况。\n{雷尔：}码头有现成的船吗？\n{伊娜：}好像没有耶，这该怎么办？\n{弗里曼：}不用担心，我这本土木工程的书上，也有讲造船的方法。我们只要能想办法搞到些{木材}，就能造船了。\n{雷尔：}不过，要上哪儿去找木材呢？\n{伊娜：}我想想办法。我会努力的。"},
