 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRoin","罗因"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nRoland opened the prison fence with a sword.\n{Roland:} Mengying, I'm here to save you.\n{Mengying:} Roland...and Ina, you are here too...\n{Roland:} Sorry, it was all my fault, for causing you to be captured by the demons. Please blame me...\n{Mengying:} How could it happen? I was careless, and I was fooled because I couldn't see through the fake Roland. I clearly knew that some of the demons could copy the technique, but I didn't expect that he would have the opportunity to impersonate Roland.\n{Roland:} I was caught by them once, maybe it was imitated by him at that time. Anyway, it was my fault. So I have to save you.\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying is okay? Then let's get out of here quickly.\n{Mengying:} Be careful, Victor has arranged organs around this prison.\n{Roland:} Don’t be afraid, we have all arrived here, are you afraid that we can’t get out...\n{Ladia:} Beware of the secret spear! The dense flying guns shot at Ina and others who were protruding from the prison. Ina and Radia used magic to shoot down the flying guns that were shot at them, Rael and Roland used swords to shoot them down, and Freeman bounced off with the umbrella cover they made.\n{Mengying:}~~~~~~~!\n{Ina:} Oh, yes, sister Mengying is injured!\n{Roland:} It's my fault again, I just take care of myself...\n{Mengying:} It doesn't matter, a small injury on the shoulder does not affect walking.\n{Radia:} Here comes again! Be careful, don't stay here for long!\n{Ina:} Ah, for sister Mengying...\n{Mengying:} Roland! The tip of the gun stopped when it was about to touch Mengying's face. Roland blocked the front with his body, several guns penetrated Roland's chest, but did not touch Mengying.\n{Ina:} Ah, Roland...\n{Mengying:} You...why...\n{Roland:} Because of my mistakes, we will be caught in a lot of troubles here. If you have any accidents, how can I face the dream? Sister Heart...\n{Radia:} It's not time to talk, so hurry up, the top mechanism has also moved and is suppressed.\n{Roland:} You go quickly with the dream shadow, hurry, I'm holding it here, I can't hold it down temporarily.\n{Meng Ying:} Roland, you should also go together...\n{Roland:} My heart has been pierced, and only the last bit of strength is left. It is better to use it to protect you from leaving safely. Mengying, you go quickly, leave me alone, if you can go out safely, I won't have any regrets...Quick!","罗兰一剑劈开牢栏。\n\n{罗兰：}梦影，我来救你了。\n{梦影：}罗兰……还有伊娜，你们也来了……\n{罗兰：}对不起，都是我的错，害你被魔族抓走，你责怪我吧……\n{梦影：}怎么会呢，是我自己大意了，没能识破假冒的罗兰，才上了当。我明明知道魔族中有人会仿形术的，就是没想到他居然能有机会仿冒到罗兰。\n{罗兰：}我曾经被他们抓住过，可能就是那时被他仿冒了。不管怎么说，还是我的错。所以说什么我也要把你救出去。\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐没事吧？那么我们快离开这里吧。\n{梦影：}你们小心，这牢的周围被维多布置了机关。\n{罗兰：}不怕，我们都已经到达这里了，还怕冲不出去吗……\n{拉迪亚：}小心暗枪！\n\n密集的飞枪向正从牢中向外突的伊娜等人射去。伊娜和拉迪亚用魔法击落了射向自己的飞枪，雷尔和罗兰用剑打落，弗里曼则用自己制作的伞罩弹开了。\n\n{梦影：}~~~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}糟了，梦影姐姐受伤了！\n{罗兰：}又是我的错，我只顾着自己了……\n{梦影：}不要紧，肩上一点小伤，不影响走路。\n{拉迪亚：}又来了！小心，你们不要在这里久留！\n{伊娜：}啊，冲着梦影姐姐去的……\n{梦影：}罗兰！\n\n枪尖在就要碰到梦影的脸时停住了。罗兰用自己的身体挡在前面，数支枪穿透了罗兰的胸膛，但是没有碰到梦影。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，罗兰……\n{梦影：}你……为什么……\n{罗兰：}因为我的失误，我们才会在这里陷入重重机关，如果你有什么意外，我如何面对梦心大姐……\n{拉迪亚：}现在不是说话的时候，快走啊，顶上的机关也动了，压下来了。\n{罗兰：}你们带着梦影快走，快，这里我顶着，暂时压不下来。\n{梦影：}罗兰，你也一起走啊……\n{罗兰：}我的心脏已经被刺穿了，只剩最后一点力气，不如用来保护你们安全离开。梦影，你快走，不要管我，你能平安地出去，我就没有任何遗憾了……快！\n\n\n\n"},
