 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSeeing Slander's pursuit approaching, Ina suddenly changed direction. Slander couldn't stop and rushed into the sea.\n{Ina:} Hmph, there really is speed but no mobility.","看看斯兰德追击将近，伊娜猛一变向，斯兰德刹不住，冲到海里去了。\n{伊娜：}哼哼，果然是光有速度没有机动性的。"},
