 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSeveral demons appeared in front of them, but there were not many people. Ina and others concealed.\n{Ina:} This guy is so familiar. By the way, it's the one named Radia. We've seen him twice. We haven't reached the Black Wind Valley yet, how could they appear here?\n{Rael:} Listen to what they say first.\n{Demons:} Captain Ladia, it seems that there is really no other way to {Qiman Island} here.\n{Radia:} It really doesn't work, I can only fly over by myself. That Holia wanted to yin us, lied to us to go {Black Wind Valley}, and wanted us to feed the black dragon. We are not so stupid.\n{Demons:} The captain wants to go to {\"Chiman Island} to find {\"Dragon Tooth Crown\"} alone? Will there be any danger?\n{Radia:} Don't worry, I will act on the occasion. Just stand by here. I'll come as soon as I go. If I really encounter something that I can't handle alone, I will come back to discuss with you.\n{Ina:} No, it looks like she wants to fly away, so we hurried to stop her. There are not many people on the other side, so I can handle it.","前方出现了几个魔族的身影，但是人不多。伊娜等人隐蔽起来。\n\n{伊娜：}这家伙好眼熟，对了，就是那个叫拉迪亚的，我们见过两次了。这里还没到黑风谷吧，他们怎么会出现在这里？\n{雷尔：}先听听他们说什么。\n\n{魔族手下：}拉迪亚队长，看起来这边真没有别的路通向{奇曼岛}了。\n{拉迪亚：}实在不行，我只能一个人飞过去了。那个霍利亚想阴我们，骗我们走{黑风谷}，想让我们喂黑龙啊。我们才没那么傻。\n{魔族手下：}队长要一个人去{奇曼岛}找{“龙牙冠”}？会不会有危险？\n{拉迪亚：}你们放心，我会见机行事的。你们就在这里待命吧。我去去就来。如果真的碰到什么我一个人应付不了的事情，我再回来找你们商议。\n\n{伊娜：}不好了，看起来她想飞走，我们赶紧去阻止她。对方人不多，应该能对付吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSeveral farmers and an official on the side of the road were arguing about something.\n{Farmer:} The forest in the south is on fire. Even if your officers and soldiers don't extinguish the fire, don't stop us.\n{Official:} If you say no, you can't. This is the order of the Prime Minister. No one is allowed to come near there.\n{Farmer:} Why? Can you give us a reason? How can you watch the fire but not extinguish it?\n{Official:} The Prime Minister intends to burn up that piece of wood, and then reclaim it for farmland and distribute it to you. Is this still not satisfactory?\n{Farmer:} If it's land reclamation, why don't you let us cut the wood first? So much wood can be sold for a lot of money, it's a pity to burn it like this.\n{Official:} The fire burns faster.\n{Farmer:} It's very early to the second season of planting. What's the use of it soon...\n{Official:} Are you dissatisfied with the decision of the Prime Minister?\n{Farmer:} Caomin dare not. But that piece of forest is also the only way to the province because of Tasia. The traffic was interrupted after the burning. The food in my family has not been sold yet. It will rot after a few days' delay.\n{Official:} Alright, stop wordy. You can grow more food when you open a new land than you can pile at home, so what can you complain about? Sell your extra food to the Prime Minister, 5 gold coins a cart.\n{Farmer:} Ah, the price is too low. I will sell it in the south. A cart of at least 30 gold coins...\n{Official:} Refusing to sell? Then you just wait for it to rot.\n{Farmer:} Okay, I sell, I sell, alas...","路边几个农民和一个官员在争执着什么。\n\n{农民：}南边的森林着火了，就算你们官兵不去灭火，也别拦着俺们啊。\n{官员：}说了不行就是不行，这是宰相大人的命令，任何人不得靠近那里。\n{农民：}为什么？你好歹给我们个理由吧？哪有看着着火却不去灭的？\n{官员：}宰相大人打算把那片树林烧光，然后开垦作农田分给你们，这还不满意？\n{农民：}如果是垦荒，为什么不让俺们先去伐木呢？那么多木材也能卖不少钱啊，就这么烧掉太可惜了。\n{官员：}火烧比较快。\n{农民：}现在离第二季播种还早得很呢，快了又有什么用……\n{官员：}你们对宰相大人的决策不满吗？\n{农民：}草民不敢。但是那片森林也是因塔西亚通向外省的必经之路，这一烧，交通就中断了，我家里屯的粮食还没卖出去呢，多耽搁几天要烂掉啦。\n{官员：}好了别罗嗦了。等开出新地来你能种出的粮食比你家里堆的还多，还有什么好抱怨的。你多出来的粮食卖给宰相大人吧，5个金币一车。\n{农民：}啊，这个价钱也太低了吧，我拉到南方去卖，一车起码30个金币……\n{官员：}不肯卖？那你就等着烂掉好了。\n{农民：}好，我卖，我卖，唉……\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSeveral soldiers in uniforms were hanging out.\n{Soldier A:} I said, if we sneak out like this while standing guard, isn't it too bold, if it is discovered by General Spien Rodri...\n{Soldier B:} It doesn't matter for a while, Spey General Enrodri is still in the headquarters for a meeting, and it won't be over for a while. He has always been very involved in meetings, and the few who stand guard outside will never find out.\n{Soldier C:} That's it. We just came out to catch some eels. The navy's food is too ordinary, and you have to do it yourself if you want to satisfy your taste. Ah, when I think of delicious eels, I can't help but drool... (slobber)\n{Soldier A:} (slobber)\n{Soldier B:} (slobber)\n{Ina:} Yeah, I caught a big eel. Oh.\n{Soldier First:} What! eel! (D?_D?)\n{Soldier C:} There, the sound from behind the sand pile! (D?_D?)\n{Second Soldier:} You run so fast! Wait for me! I'm coming eel! (D?_D?)\n{Ina:} Hey, I lied so easily.\n{Soldiers A&B&C:} Where's the eel? Where is the eel?\n{Ina:} How can there be any eels? If you leave your post without permission, I will punish you on behalf of your chief.","几个穿着统一制服的士兵在闲逛。\n\n{士兵甲：}我说，咱们站岗的时候这么溜出来，是不是太大胆了，要是被斯拜恩罗德里将军发现了的话……\n{士兵乙：}就一小会儿不要紧的，斯拜恩罗德里将军现在还在指挥部里开会，一时半会儿结束不了。他开会向来很投入，外面少几个站岗的根本不会发现。\n{士兵丙：}就是就是。我们只是出来抓些鳗鱼就好。海军的伙食太一般了，想要饱口福就只有自己动手。啊，一想到美味的鳗鱼，我就忍不住口水直流啊……（口水）\n{士兵甲：}（口水）\n{士兵乙：}（口水）\n{伊娜：}耶，抓到好大一条鳗鱼哦。\n{士兵甲：}什么！鳗鱼！(心_心)\n{士兵丙：}那边，沙堆后面传来的声音！(心_心)\n{士兵乙：}你们跑那么快！等等我！鳗鱼我来啦！(心_心)\n{伊娜：}嘿嘿，这么容易就骗过来了。\n{士兵甲&乙&丙：}鳗鱼呢？鳗鱼在哪？\n{伊娜：}哪有什么鳗鱼。你们擅离职守开小差，我代表你们的长官惩罚你们。\n\n\n\n"},
