 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSlander flew back from the other side of the sea. Seeing that there is no road ahead, the terrain here is very narrow, Ina stopped, planning to fight Slander here. Slander flew in front of Ina and descended.","斯兰德又从海那一边飞了回来。看看前边也没有路了，这里地形很狭窄，伊娜停了下来，打算在这里跟斯兰德交手。\n斯兰德飞到伊娜前面，降了下来。\n"},
