 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSolo pointed the \"Sword of Destruction\" at Ina, and a light mark was placed on Ina. Ina suddenly looked very painful, closed her eyes, holding herself trembling, and then Ina's body began to change. His hair turned silvery white, purple-black scales grew on his body, and a pair of huge butterfly wings spread out from behind, faintly shining with lavender fluorescence. When Ina's eyes opened again, their eyes became more blood red than before.\n{Rael:} Ina! {Ina:} Glory saint, obliterate...\n{Rael:} Ina, what's wrong with you? ...\n{Ina:} The glorious saint must be wiped out... Ina waved her fingertips at Rael, and the howling flames exploded a big pit in front of Rael. Rael dodged with difficulty.\n{Rael:} Solo! What did you do to Ina!\n{Solo:} What did I do? I just awakened her. She was originally my biological weapon, this is her true form. With the dark blood, her rejection of the glorious saints is just instinct, so she will attack you without anyone's order, until you die. ——Alright, Eluda No.2, I'll leave it to you to clean up here. Let's play with them as much as you like. I'm going to the ground to implement my hegemony plan.\n{Rael:} Do you want to escape? no way! Look at it, Heavenly Sword!\n{Ina:} Glory saint, obliterate...\n{Freeman:} Rael's nirvana was completely offset by Ina's magic...\n{Solo:} Hahahaha! Are you still capable of chasing me? Your opponent is her.","索罗将“毁灭之剑”指向伊娜，一枚光印打在伊娜身上。伊娜猛然显得十分痛苦，闭上眼睛，抱着自己颤抖，接着伊娜的身体开始变化。头发蜕变成银白色，身上长出紫黑的鳞甲，一对巨大的蝶翼从背后展开，微微闪着淡紫的荧光。伊娜的眼睛再度睁开时，眼珠变得比之前更加血红。\n\n{雷尔：}伊娜！\n{伊娜：}光辉圣族，抹杀……\n{雷尔：}伊娜，你怎么了？……\n{伊娜：}光辉圣族，必须抹杀……\n\n伊娜指尖挥向雷尔，呼啸的烈焰在雷尔面前炸出一个大坑。雷尔艰难地闪躲开。\n\n{雷尔：}索罗！你对伊娜做了什么！\n{索罗：}我做了什么？我只是让她觉醒了而已。她本来就是我的生物兵器，这才是她的真正形态。拥有暗黑之血的她，对光辉圣族的排斥只是本能而已，所以不需要任何人的命令，她也会攻击你，直到你死亡。——好啦，艾露达二号，这边就交给你清理了，跟他们尽情地玩玩吧。我要去地面上了，去实施我的霸业计划。\n{雷尔：}你想逃？没门！看招，天霄剑！\n{伊娜：}光辉圣族，抹杀……\n{弗里曼：}雷尔的必杀技，被伊娜的魔法完全抵消了……\n{索罗：}哈哈哈哈！你现在还有能力追我吗？你的对手是她哦。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSome rubble blocked the way.","一些碎石挡住了去路。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSomething seems to be floating in the sea. Ina and the others took a closer look, and there was a skull face on the water, with red eyes staring at Ina.\n{Ina:} I said don't find me. Skeleton Face still stared at Ina.\n{Ina:} The pinates have been wiped out, you can rest in peace. Skeleton Face still stared at Ina.\n{Ina:} Why are you staring at me? Skeleton Face still stared at Ina.\n{Ina:} Hey, it turns out that this is not a resentful spirit, it's just a pendant. However, how come I look familiar, as if I have seen it somewhere...Ah! Come to think of it, the skeleton painted on the explorer's suicide note is exactly the same as this one. Could this thing be the \"proof of death\"?","海水中像是漂着什么东西。伊娜他们靠近一看，水面上露出一张骷髅脸，两眼冒红光，盯着伊娜。\n\n{伊娜：}我说了别找我啦。\n\n骷髅脸还是注视着伊娜。\n\n{伊娜：}海盗已经被消灭了，你可以安息了啦。\n\n骷髅脸还是注视着伊娜。\n\n{伊娜：}干嘛还盯着我啊？\n\n骷髅脸还是注视着伊娜。\n\n{伊娜：}咦，原来这个不是怨灵啊，只是一个挂件。不过，怎么看着有点眼熟呢，好像在哪里看到过似的……啊！想起来了，那个探险家的遗书上画的骷髅，跟这个一模一样呢。莫非这个东西就是“死神之证”？\n"},
