 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSuddenly Ina saw a familiar figure sitting in a corner on the side of the tavern.\n{Ina:} Ah, it's Mr. Bad! That's great!\n{Duffy:} Huh? Stupid girl, why are you here too, what's so great?\n{Ina:} I was so worried that I couldn't find anyone to ask, so I saw Mr. Bad.\n{Dawu:} Hahaha, I know you will encounter difficulties, so wait here.\n{Ina:} Che, here again, you clearly said, \"Why are you here, too\", obviously you didn't know that we were here.\n{Dawu:} Well, let's not talk about it. What's the problem this time?\n{Ina:} I want to find out how I can see Prime Minister Holia.\n{Darwood:} What? You want to find him? Why are you looking for him?\n{Ina:} You don't need to worry about this.\n{Da Wu:} There are only two kinds of people looking for him. One is to send money to an official, the other is to scold him and get arrested and go to jail. What kind of you are?\n{Ina:} Uh, it turned out to be so, no wonder everyone wouldn't tell me. But I am neither. In short, I'll give you 2000 gold coins, and you can tell me how to find him.\n{Davu:} These years, prices have soared, and the life of this adult has become more and more difficult. The information fee can't be the old price. If you give 3,000 gold coins, this lord will not ask anything and tell you directly how to find him, how about?\n{Ina:} Still raising the price?\n{Da Wu:} Of course, if you find it uneconomical, you can ask someone else.\n{Ina:} All right, I will admit defeat and give you 3000 gold coins.\n{Da Wu:} Well, this lord likes you so happy. Then the Lord said. From here {to the south}, you can reach the capital of Solandria {Intasia}, and you can find him in the palace of the capital. {East side entrance of the palace} There is a {reception room}, you can go there to make an appointment, you can't see it without an appointment. And {reservation fee is 10,000 gold coins}, you should be ready.\n{Ina:} I actually have to pay to see him. I'm really a fan of money. Who the hell is this prime minister, why is he so arrogant and nobody cares, what is the king doing?\n{Davu:} King Harry V was seriously ill six months ago, he has been recuperating in the palace, no longer shows up, and all power is handed over to Holia. So the country became what it is now.\n{Ina:} Oh, this country...Well, thank you very much, Mr. Bad.","突然伊娜看到酒馆一边的角落里坐着一个熟悉的身影。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，是坏人先生！真是太好了！\n{达伍：}嗯？笨小丫头，你怎么也上这儿来了，什么太好了？\n{伊娜：}我正愁找不到人问，就看到坏人先生了。\n{达伍：}哈哈哈，本大人就知道你们会遇到困难了，所以在这里等着。\n{伊娜：}切，又来了，你明明还说“你怎么也上这儿来了”，分明是不知道我们来的。\n{达伍：}这个嘛，不说了。这次又有什么问题啊？\n{伊娜：}我想打听一下怎么才能见到宰相霍利亚。\n{达伍：}什么？你想找他？你找他干嘛？\n{伊娜：}这个你就不用管了嘛。\n{达伍：}找他的人只有两种。一种是去送钱求官的，一种是去骂他然后被抓起来坐牢的，你是哪种？\n{伊娜：}呃，原来是这样，难怪大家都不肯告诉我。不过我哪种都不是。总之，我给你2000金币，你告诉我怎么找他就行了。\n{达伍：}这年头，物价飞涨，本大人生活也越来越困难，这个信息费嘛，也不能还是老价钱了。你要是给3000金币，本大人就啥也不过问，直接告诉你怎么去找他，如何？\n{伊娜：}还涨价啊？\n{达伍：}当然了，你要是觉得不合算，去找别人问也行。\n{伊娜：}好了好了，我认输，给你3000金币就是了。\n{达伍：}嗯，本大人就喜欢你这么痛快。那么本大人就说了。从这里{向南}，可以到达索兰德里亚的首都{因塔西亚}，到首都的王宫就能找到他了。{王宫的东边侧门}有个{接待室}，你可以到那里去预约，不预约是见不到的。而且{预约费要10000金币}，你可要准备好了。\n{伊娜：}居然还要掏钱才能见他，真是财迷心窍到家了。这个宰相到底是什么人，怎么这么嚣张也没人管，国王在干什么？\n{达伍：}国王哈里五世在半年前得了重病，就一直在宫中休养，不再露面，而把一切大权都交给了霍利亚。于是这个国家就变成了如今这个样子。\n{伊娜：}唉，这个国家……好吧，多谢你了，坏人先生。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSuddenly a few disheveled Kartia soldiers ran past, and some of them were injured.\n{Ina:} What's the matter, what are you guys?\n{Soldiers:} The big thing is not good. A Balandian army has attacked from {Nanling Pass}. The Nanling Pass was lost, and the captain was killed. We have to report back to the Wangcheng. If there is no reinforcement to stop the Baland army, they will soon be able to drive straight into the Wangcheng.\n{Ina:} That's not good, we have to think of a way to stop the Barland army.\n{Soldier:} Little girl, don't go to death, or run away. If the Barland army collides with him, all your belongings will be looted. We have to report it quickly, and run away.","突然几个衣冠不整的卡尔提亚士兵仓皇跑过，他们中有的人还负了伤。\n{伊娜：}怎么回事，你们这是？\n{士兵：}大事不好啦，有一支巴兰德军从{南岭关}这边攻过来了。南岭关失守了，队长已经阵亡，我们赶紧要回王城报告，要是没有援军拦住巴兰德军，他们很快能长驱直入攻到王城的。\n{伊娜：}那可不好，我们得去想想办法阻止巴兰德军。\n{士兵：}小姑娘，你可别去送死啊，还是快逃吧，要是让巴兰德军撞见，会把你的财物全部洗劫一空。我们要赶紧去报告了，你们也快逃吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSuddenly, some demons emerged from the sand.\n{Rael:} It's not good, it's an ambush!\n{Freeman:} Has anyone been staring at our course of action?\n{Rael:} It must be someone from the Demon Race.\n{Ina:} Anyway, the only thing to do is to start the fight first.","突然间，一些恶魔从沙地中钻出。\n\n{雷尔：}不好，是埋伏！\n{弗里曼：}难道有人一直在盯着我们的行动路线？\n{雷尔：}一定是魔族的什么人吧。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，只有先开打了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nSuspicious man in black.","可疑的黑衣人。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTalk in a low voice.","小声议论。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTemple of Mirrors. Please observe the order and keep quiet in the temple.","镜之神殿。\n\n参拜请遵守秩序，殿内保持安静。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe Baland Army near Nanling Pass seemed to be waiting for something.\n{Scout:} General Dido, I didn't see the response forces in action.\n{Dido:} It's strange, the agreed time has passed, what the guy Rudd is doing. Should we attack or continue to guard here? ?a?aYou are here to stand by, I will go ahead and take a look.\n{Ina:} This is the boss, a good opportunity, let's start.\n{Dido:} Who? Who are you guys?\n{Rael:} To tell you the bad news, your response troops will not come again.\n{Dido:} What? What are you guys? Is it the Karti runner-up? impossible! How could the Karti runner-up appear in this area? Could it be that Rudd's troops were defeated...\n{Ina:} You guessed it almost 60%.\n{Dido:} Didn't Krant say that Kaldia was in civil strife? How could it be possible to make such a powerful counterattack... Damn, is it possible that the guy wanted to cheat me...\n{Ina:} There is no time to explain to you in detail now. I am going to knock you down now.\n{Dido:} Just kidding. Want to defeat this general just by relying on you? I want to see how capable you are.","南岭关附近的巴兰德军似乎正在等待着什么。\n{侦察兵：}迪多将军，没有看到接应部队行动啊。\n{迪多：}奇怪了，约定的时间已经过了，鲁德那家伙在干什么啊。我们到底该是出击还是继续把守这里。——你们在这里待命，我自己上前面去看看。\n\n{伊娜：}这个是头儿，好机会，我们下手吧。\n{迪多：}谁？你们是什么人？\n{雷尔：}告诉你一个坏消息，你的接应部队不会再来了。\n{迪多：}什么？你们到底是？难道是卡尔提亚军？不可能！这一带怎么可能出现卡尔提亚军，难道鲁德的部队被击溃了……\n{伊娜：}你差不多猜中了六成。\n{迪多：}克兰特不是说卡尔迪亚陷入内乱了吗。怎么可能还能作出这么有力的反击……妈的，难不成那家伙本来就是想坑我一把……\n{伊娜：}现在没时间跟你仔细解释了。我现在就要打倒你。\n{迪多：}开玩笑。就凭你就想打倒本将军？我倒要看看你有多大的本事。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe Centaur was not Ina's opponent at all, and was knocked to the ground by Ina in three hits.\n{Centaur:} Damn it! We can't beat her with so many numbers...\n{Voice:} Stop it! Don't hurt Her Majesty's guests.\n{Centaur:} Ah, it's Lord Kurug, not good...\n{Kruger:} These are the guests invited by Her Majesty the Queen, you must not be rude!\n{Centaur:} Ah, the villain really doesn't know, please forgive me, Lord Kurug.\n{Kurug:} Alright, you can withdraw.\n{Centaur:} Yes.\n{Ina:} Huh? Her Majesty’s guest? Are you talking about us?\n{Rael:} What's the matter?\n{Freeman:} Anyway, he helped us out.\n{Kurug:} Several guests, welcome to the Kingdom of Fendinia. Her Majesty the Queen learned of the arrival of several people, and sent her to greet her. Please forgive me if there is any impatience. Below is the left envoy Kurug in front of the palace.\n{Freeman:} Master Kurug, this is the first time we have come to Fendinia and we have not been invited by anyone. Is it a misunderstanding?\n{Kurug:} Ha ha, your Excellency is the Prince Freeman of Kartia. How can I misunderstand? Of course, there is really no invitation. It’s just that the group of subordinates I saw just now seemed to be making trouble for some of them, fearing that they would get into trouble, so Jizhongshengzhi said this to scare them away.\n{Freeman:} It turned out to be so, thank you Lord Kurug.\n{Ina:} But, those guys seem to be afraid of you, Lord Kurug. It seems that as long as you give an order, you don’t need to move the queen out to make them retreat...\n{Kurug:} Ha ha, I am just a left-hand envoy in front of the palace, not a big man, how can I dare to make a mistake without the backing of Her Majesty . ——Speaking of which, Her Majesty the Queen really wants to invite a few people to the middle of {Royal Palace} for a while, I wonder if several people are willing to cheer?\n{Freeman:} Lord Kurug's words are too polite. How could we ashamedly refuse Her Majesty's invitation? Besides, if it weren't for you to relieve us, we still don't know how long we will be entangled.\n{Ina:} Hey, are you going to the palace? I have never been to a palace in my life, so I really want to see...\n{Kurug:} Then let's go.","半人马根本不是伊娜的对手，三下两下就被伊娜击倒在地。\n\n{半人马：}可恶！我们这么多数量居然打不过她……\n{声音：}你们住手！不许伤害女王陛下的客人。\n{半人马：}啊，是库鲁格大人，不好……\n{库鲁格：}这几位是女王陛下请来的客人，你们不得无礼！\n{半人马：}啊，小人实在不知，请库鲁格大人恕罪。\n{库鲁格：}好了，你们退下吧。\n{半人马：}是。\n{伊娜：}咦？女王陛下的客人？是说我们吗？\n{雷尔：}这是怎么回事？\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，他帮我们解围了。\n{库鲁格：}几位客人，欢迎来到芬迪尼亚王国。女王陛下得知几位到来，派在下前来迎接。如有不周到之处敬请谅解。在下是殿前左使库鲁格。\n{弗里曼：}库鲁格大人，我们是第一次来到芬迪尼亚，也没有受到谁的邀请，不知是不是误会了？\n{库鲁格：}呵呵，阁下就是卡尔提亚的弗里曼王子吧。我怎么会误会呢？当然了，邀请的事情确实是没有，只是在下刚才见到那群下人似乎想找几位的麻烦，怕他们闯祸，所以急中生智这么说，好把他们吓走而已。\n{弗里曼：}原来是这样，太感谢库鲁格大人了。\n{伊娜：}可是，那些家伙好像很怕你耶，库鲁格大人。似乎只要你一声令下，用不着把女王搬出来也能让他们退下……\n{库鲁格：}呵呵，在下只是一个殿前左使，不是什么大人物，没有女王陛下的后盾哪敢造次。——话说回来，女王陛下确实想邀请几位去{王宫}中一会，不知几位肯否赏脸？\n{弗里曼：}库鲁格大人这话太客气了，女王陛下的邀请我们怎么好意思拒绝呢，何况如果不是你给我们解围，我们还不知要被纠缠多久。\n{伊娜：}咦，要去王宫吗？我这辈子还没去过王宫呢，好想去看看……\n{库鲁格：}那么我们走吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe Glow of the Seven Stars, the Pillars of the Seven Stars Reflect the Sky","参宿辉光 七星塔柱映天照\n星源神力 四元灵法聚首齐"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe Holy Doctor Reina and the source of the stars.","圣医雷纳与星之源。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe Holy Land of Tianchi Mountain, irrelevant personnel are forbidden to enter.","天池山圣地，无关人员禁入。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe bandit leader was knocked to the ground.\n{Leader of thieves:} No...General Zelando...General Zelando...\n{Ina:} Well, we are going to find General Zelando, where is he?\n{The thief leader:}...\n{Ina:} Huh? Has died. Forget it, let's find it ourselves.","盗贼头目被打倒在地。\n\n{盗贼头目：}不……西兰多将军……西兰多将军……\n{伊娜：}嗯，我们正要去找那个西兰多将军，他在哪？\n{盗贼头目：}……\n{伊娜：}啊？已经咽气了。算了，我们自己去找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe battle is over. Radia stood up slowly, very laboriously.\n{Ina:} Hey, are you okay?\n{Radia:} I've been using healing magic for a while now, and it's better now. Now can you explain why you are saving me?\n{Ina:} In fact, I found a problem, that is, we are all fooled. Holia wants us to kill each other, and then he sends an army to destroy us all. In addition, you haven't told us the information of the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", what I said I must protect you.\n{Radia:} Well, as your reward for saving me, I will tell you. The \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" is on {Chiman Island} in {Northwest of Solandria}.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much, I didn't expect you to be so loyal. I thought the demons were all despicable villains.\n{Radia:} What a joke, you humans are too prejudiced. No wonder Lord Solo has always said that humans are not good things.\n{Ina:} No, it's just that I've been taught by my elders since I was a child, saying that the demons are very bad. It seems that this matter needs to be re-acquainted, so I will write it down in my notebook first.\n{Ladia:} However, I have to remind you of one thing. The only way to go to Cheman Island is {Black Wind Valley}, where there are many black dragons. If you can't fly, it's better not to go. I can't deal with the black dragon, if you go, it will only become the black dragon's lunch.\n{Ina:} If we don't go at noon, it won't be lunch, right?\n{Radia:}... {Ina:} In fact, you can't deal with them, doesn't mean we can't deal with them. We still won you, didn't we? I will find a way. Thank you for your information.\n{Radia:} Well, I wish you success. Next time we meet, we will still be enemies. Radia's injury had recovered, and she spread her wings and flew away.\n{Ina:} It stands to reason that I shouldn't let her go, but it's strange why I didn't want to stop her from flying away at all.","战斗结束了。拉迪亚非常吃力地缓缓站了起来。\n\n{伊娜：}咦，你不要紧了吗？\n{拉迪亚：}刚才那段时间我一直在使用治疗魔法，现在好些了。现在你们可以解释一下为什么要救我了吧？\n{伊娜：}其实，我发现了一个问题，就是我们都上当了。霍利亚是想让我们之间相互残杀，然后他再派军队来把我们都消灭。另外，你还没告诉我们“龙牙冠”的情报呢，我说什么也要保护你呀。\n{拉迪亚：}好吧，作为你们救我的报答，我告诉你们。“龙牙冠”在{索兰德里亚西北}的{奇曼岛}上。\n{伊娜：}太感谢了，真没想到你那么讲义气。我以为魔族都是卑鄙的坏蛋咧。\n{拉迪亚：}开什么玩笑，你们人类也太偏见了。难怪索罗大人一直说人类都不是好东西。\n{伊娜：}没有啦，只是我从小就被长辈们教过的，说魔族的人都很坏啊。看来这件事情要重新认识一下了，我先记到笔记本上。\n{拉迪亚：}不过，有件事情我必须提醒你们，去奇曼岛的必经之路是{黑风谷}，那里住着很多黑龙，你们不会飞的话还是不要去的好。我尚且对付不了黑龙，你们去的话，只会成为黑龙的午餐而已。\n{伊娜：}我们不在中午的时候去，就不会成为午餐了吧？\n{拉迪亚：}……\n{伊娜：}其实是这样，你对付不了他们，不等于我们对付不了嘛。我们还赢了你是不是？我会想办法的。多谢你的情报了。\n{拉迪亚：}好吧，祝你们成功。下次见面时，我们还会是敌人的。\n\n拉迪亚的伤已经恢复，展开翅膀飞走了。\n\n{伊娜：}按理说我不应该放她走，不过，很奇怪，为什么我刚才一点也不想阻止她飞走呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe big man who was knocked down by Ina before he could make a move passed out.\n{Women:} Thank you this lady for saving me.\n{Ina:} Ah, don't thank me, such a villain, jumped over the street and everyone shouted and beat. By the way, does Auntie know where the leader's camp is?\n{Women:} Not far from here {to the east and north} is the leader's camp set up by Lord Harid. I don't know if it is what you are looking for.\n{Ina:} Thank you, I'll take a look.","未及出手就被伊娜击倒的大汉昏绝过去了。\n\n{妇女：}谢谢这位小姐救了我。\n{伊娜：}啊，不用谢我，这样的恶徒，跳跳过街人人喊打。对了，阿姨知道首领营帐在什么地方吗？\n{妇女：}这里{往东偏北}不远就是哈里德领主设立的首领营帐，不知道是不是您要找的。\n{伊娜：}多谢了，我这就去看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe black mist became thicker and thicker, wrapping around Ina, Ina felt the loss of power.","黑雾越来越浓，缠绕在伊娜周围，伊娜感觉到力量在流失。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe boat was sailing in a narrow waterway. Suddenly a group of black and heavy objects flew over the mountains on the shore, and when they saw the boat, they rushed up.\n{Ina:} Ah, are these monsters coming to us? Hey, this is an attack, I don't know you guys, did you find the wrong person...","船正在狭窄的水道中航行，突然岸边的山上飞过来一群黑压压的东西，见着船就扑了上来。\n{伊娜：}啊，这些怪物是来找我们的吗？喂，这就攻击了啊，我不认识你们耶，你们有没有找错人……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe breakthrough was successful.","突破成功。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe burning trace of a flame split a wide path through the rubble.\n{Ina:} This trace is such a strong flame. I can't do this at all.\n{Freeman:} If anyone can do it, it's Phoenix Phoenix.\n{Ina:} So, he really has been here.","一条火焰的焚烧痕迹把乱石劈开了一条宽阔的通路。\n\n{伊娜：}这条痕迹，好强劲的火焰啊。我完全做不到这个程度呢。\n{弗里曼：}如果说有谁能做到的话，就是不死鸟菲尼克斯了。\n{伊娜：}这么说，他果然是来过这里了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe cave will not be submerged.","洞内不会淹没。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe chief's permission.","首领的许可。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe clamor of the demon army could be faintly heard in the distance, it should be that no one's eldest sister is acting. Ina was overjoyed as she watched the road going around by the sea.\n{Ina:} This is a good terrain for playing griffon and catching chicks, come on!","远处隐约能听到魔族军队的吵嚷，应该是没有人大姐在行动了。伊娜望着海边绕来绕去的路，心中一喜。\n{伊娜：}这正是玩狮鹫抓小鸡的好地形，来吧！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe colors and positions of the fourteen pillars on both sides of the Central Avenue in Huanying Township corresponded to the fourteen dragons of the \"Morrel Zoo\" one by one. They only turned 90 degrees. If the zoo itself is a miniature map of the city, then the position indicated by the fire behind the fairy dragon on the west side of the zoo is behind the purple pillar on the north side of the avenue. Is the secret treasure of Huan Ying Country a part of this shameful statue?","幻樱乡中央大道两旁的十四根柱子，其颜色与位置，与“摩莉尔动物园”十四条龙一一对应，仅仅是转了90度方向而已。如果说动物园本身就是一张城市的缩影地图的话，那么动物园里西侧仙女龙背后的火堆所指示的位置，就是这根大道北侧紫色柱子的后面了。\n\n幻樱乡的秘宝，就是这件其貌不扬的雕像的一部分吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe contradiction that is puzzled.","不解的矛盾。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe dangerous Black Wind Valley.","危险的黑风谷。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe dark crypt awaits visitors like a beast with an open mouth.\n{Ina:} Is there no other way? What is this cave?\n{Rael:} The abnormal movement mentioned by the residents is related to this cave.\n{Freeman:} You see, the walls of this hole are all new rock sections, which shows that it is not natural, and it hasn't been long since it was excavated.\n{Ina:} Ah, let's put it this way...\n{Rael:} The sounds and vibrations that the residents noticed were produced when this hole was drilled!\n{Freeman:} I just don't know, why did the latter dig such a hole at this time?\n{Ina:} Let's go down!\n{Rael:} Huh? Is this decided?\n{Ina:} Otherwise, we won't know the answer. My grandfather taught me a sentence called \"Don't enter Bimeng Cave, Yan De Bimengzi\". Although it is a bit risky, this is the clue we are closest to.","深暗的地穴像张开嘴的恶兽一般等待着来访者。\n\n{伊娜：}没有别的路了吗？这个地洞是什么啊？\n{雷尔：}居民们所说的异动，就是跟这个地洞有关的吧。\n{弗里曼：}你们看，这个洞的墙壁都是崭新的岩石断面，这说明它不是天然的，而且，是刚刚被开凿出来没多久。\n{伊娜：}啊，这么说来……\n{雷尔：}居民们察觉到的声响和震动，就是开凿这个洞时产生的！\n{弗里曼：}只是不知道，那个幕后者为什么要在这个时间开凿这么个洞呢？\n{伊娜：}我们下去吧！\n{雷尔：}唉？这就决定下去了？\n{伊娜：}不然的话，我们也没法知道答案啊。爷爷教过我一句话，叫做“不入比蒙穴，焉得比蒙子”，虽然有点冒险，但是现在我们最接近的线索就是这个了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe defeated werewolves rushed away and fled, one of them dropped his weapon on the ground.\n{Ina:} This weapon looks strange. I'll keep it first. It's a bit of a disadvantage to be bare-handed, so I'm going to fuck a guy too.","被打败的狼人一哄而散逃走了，其中一个还把武器丢在地上。\n{伊娜：}这个武器的样子好奇怪。我先收着吧。赤手空拳有点吃亏，我也来操个家伙。"},
