 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe depths of the forest are very dark.\n{Ina:} Now is not the time to go there, it is important to save Salman and his son first.","森林的深处十分阴暗。\n\n{伊娜：}现在不是去那里面的时候，还是先救萨尔曼父子要紧。"},
