 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe door of the thatched house was half open, and an old man sat on the only bamboo stool and sighed. There is nothing in the room except this bamboo stool. Seeing Ina and others passing by the door, the old man hurriedly greeted.\n{Old man:} This little sister, how about coming to my house to sit down?\n{Ina:} Grandpa, there is no place to sit in your house. There is only a stool for you to sit on.\n{Old man:} Uh, yes, actually...\n{Ina:} Is there any difficulty Grandpa needs help?\n{Old man:} Well, I think back then, I was also a hero who went north and south, punishing evil and promoting good, robbing the rich and helping the poor, and was reused by His Majesty the King, cruising against bandits and monsters and making great fame and fortune...\n{Ina:} However, what the grandpa looks like now is a little bit inconsistent with you. Is what I said just now really true?\n{Old man:} Of course it is true! If you don't believe me, you can check the Kingdom Archives. 70 years ago, the name of Xiongwei General Roque would have appeared in the Kingdom's meritorious service many times-but the Kingdom Archives will not be seen by ordinary people.\n{Ina:} 70 years ago...You were older than my grandfather... Could it be that Rock was you?\n{Old man:} That's right! Although old age is no longer brave, but you see that I am over a hundred years old and still healthy! Just...\n{Ina:} Just?\n{Old man:} You have seen the status quo, now I am so poor that I can't even open the pot. Even sleeping can only rely on this bamboo stool...\n{Ina:} How could this be?\n{Old man:} It's a long story. In fact, 10 years ago, I still had a wealth of money, but later, the Kingdom launched the gladiatorial betting, once a month, every time I go to bet, the result is that more loses than loses, the money gradually disappears.\n{Ina:} Gaming? What's that?\n{Old man:} Little sister, you haven't played. It is to bet a certain amount of money before the game and bet on one side to win. If the side you bet on loses, the money you bet on won't get back; if the side you bet on wins, you can get more money back based on the odds.\n{Ina:} Isn't this just gambling, and deliberately changed her name. Grandpa taught me that gambling is not good.\n{Old man:} It's not gambling, it's gambling!\n{Ina:} It's not the same, and then you lose all your money, and you lose everything.\n{Old man:} It's just my bad luck. Speaking of business, this month's gambling will start in a few days. I was planning to sell this bamboo stool as a last resort. Can you lend me some money so that I don't have to sell bamboo stools and I can have a place to sleep at night. After winning, I will repay you twice.\n{Ina:} What if you lose?\n{Old man:} If you lose, you owe it first, and I will always pay you back in the future. I'm a trustworthy person. As a meritorious person, I can still receive a pension every year, and then I will use the pension to bet and then win back you.\n{Ina:} Absolutely not.","草屋的门半开着，一个老人坐在仅有的一张竹凳上叹着气。屋里除了这张竹凳之外什么都没有了。看到伊娜等人从门外经过，老人赶紧招呼。\n\n{老人：}这位小妹妹，来我家坐坐怎么样？\n{伊娜：}老爷爷，你家里没有坐的地方了啊，只有一张凳子您自己坐着。\n{老人：}呃，也是，其实……\n{伊娜：}莫非老爷爷有什么困难需要帮忙？\n{老人：}唉，想当年，我也是走南闯北的英雄，惩恶扬善，劫富济贫，又得国王陛下重用，讨伐盗寇魔物立下赫赫功勋，可谓名利双收……\n{伊娜：}可是，老爷爷现在的样子，跟您说的有点不太符合耶。刚才说的确实是真的吗？\n{老人：}当然是真的！不信你可以去查王国档案，70年前，雄威将军罗克的名字一定会多次出现在王国的功勋史上——不过王国档案是不会让一般人看的啦。\n{伊娜：}70年前……您比我爷爷还大……难道说那个罗克就是您？\n{老人：}没错！虽然年老力衰不复当年勇，但是你看我年纪过百依然身体矫健！只是……\n{伊娜：}只是？\n{老人：}现状你也看到了，现在我穷得连锅都揭不开了。连睡觉都只能靠这一张竹凳……\n{伊娜：}怎么会这样呢？\n{老人：}说来话长。其实，10年之前，我还有家财万贯，可是后来，王国推出了角斗竞技博彩，每月一次，我每次都去下注了，结果是输多赢少，钱就渐渐地没了。\n{伊娜：}博彩？那是什么呀？\n{老人：}小妹妹你没玩过吧。就是比赛前下注一定的钱，押某一方获胜。如果你押的一方输了，下注的钱就拿不回来了；如果你押的一方赢了，根据赔率可以拿回更多的钱。\n{伊娜：}这不就是赌博嘛，还故意换个名字。爷爷教过我，赌博是不好的。\n{老人：}不是赌博啦，是博彩！\n{伊娜：}还不是一样，然后你就把钱输光了，输得家徒四壁。\n{老人：}那只是我运气不好。说正事，这个月的博彩过几天就要开始了，我本来正打算把这个竹凳也卖掉作最后一搏。你能不能借我点钱，这样我就不用卖竹凳了，晚上就可以有地方睡觉。赢了之后我一定加倍还给你。\n{伊娜：}要是输了呢？\n{老人：}输了就先欠着，以后我总会还你的。我可是讲信用的人。作为功勋人士，我每年还能领一笔养老金呢，到时我拿养老金去下注再赢钱还你。\n{伊娜：}绝对不行。\n"},
