 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe military regulations of the heroes of Longyashan: hand in the possessions before distributing them, and cut off the possessions.","龙牙山好汉军规\n抢到财物先上交再分配，私藏者斩。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe monster was wiped out, and the official in charge of the chief camp dared to poke out of the camp.\n{Official:} Ah, this female hero just wiped out the monster, thank you so much.\n{Ina:} Are you? ......\n{Official:} I am under Lord Khalid, the person in charge of the leader's camp here.\n{Ina:} Great, I'm looking for you.\n{Rael:} But how can there be such a monster here?\n{Official:} Alas, we don't know, there have been several monster attacks in this area recently. Lord Lord is also very troubled. The worst thing is that we have no armed forces. The army was taken away by Archbishop Yingluck, and no soldiers were left behind. We had no way to resist the monster's attack, and we could only watch them run away after snatching the supplies.\n{Rael:} What, the monster is to snatch supplies? But why did Archbishop Yingluck transfer all the army of the local lord?\n{Official:} I don't know about this official.\n{Ina:} I will write it down first, these situations are very abnormal. First, there have been a number of monster attacks in this area recently; second, the monsters aim to grab resources; third, the archbishop Yingluck transferred all the troops of the local lord; fourth, the local officials did not know that the troops were transferred the reason. It's strange, I always feel that there seems to be some connection between these things, but unfortunately there is no clue yet.\n{Official:} By the way, the heroine said just now that she was looking for me, what's the matter?\n{Ina:} Ah, I almost forgot to do business. We want to pass the level on the Horn Valley. Could it be convenient?\n{Official:} No problem, I will write you a hand letter, and the guards at the checkpoint will pass it.\n{Ina:} So it's so easy to pass.\n{Official:} It was originally just a procedure, nothing complicated. In the future, when you encounter the checkpoints set by the lord in other places, you can pass through by just finding the corresponding leader camp account and asking for a souvenir. Note that the {color signs} used by different lords are different.\n{Ina:} Make a note of it. I'm sorry to trouble you, thank you.","怪物被消灭了，首领营帐的负责官员才敢从营帐里探出来。\n\n{官员：}啊，这位女侠刚才消灭了怪物，真是太感谢了。\n{伊娜：}你是？……\n{官员：}我是哈里德领主的属下，这里的首领营帐的负责人。\n{伊娜：}太好了，我要找的就是你。\n{雷尔：}不过，这里怎么会有这样的怪物啊？\n{官员：}唉，我们也不知道啊，最近这一带已经发生了好几起怪物袭击事件了。领主大人也很烦恼。最糟糕的是，我们没有武装力量，军队被英拉大主教抽走了，一兵一卒都没留下，我们没有办法抵抗怪物的袭击，只能眼看着他们抢夺物资之后跑掉。\n{雷尔：}什么，怪物是为了抢夺物资？可是英拉大主教为什么要把地方领主的军队全部调走？\n{官员：}这个下官就不知道了。\n{伊娜：}我先记下来，这些情况都很反常。\n第一，这一带最近发生了多起怪物袭击事件；\n第二，怪物以抢夺资源为目标；\n第三，英拉大主教把地方领主的军队全部调走；\n第四，地方官员不知道军队调走的原因。\n好蹊跷，总觉得这几件事情之间好像会有什么关联，可惜目前还没有线索。\n{官员：}对了，女侠刚才说就是要找我，请问是什么事？\n{伊娜：}啊，差点忘了正事。我们想通过霍恩山谷那边的关卡，不知能不能给个方便？\n{官员：}没问题，我给你们写个手信，给关卡的守卫看了就能通过了。\n{伊娜：}原来这么简单就能通过了啊。\n{官员：}本来就只是一个手续而已，没什么复杂的。以后你们遇到其他地方领主设的关卡，也只要找对应的首领营帐讨个手信就能通行了。要注意不同领主所用的{颜色标志}各不相同。\n{伊娜：}记下来记下来，麻烦你了，多谢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe mountain road here is too steep to climb.","这里的山路过于陡峭，登不上去了。"},
