 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe old man took Ina and Freeman through the outlying courtyard of the city that had been beaten in a mess, and walked into the palace. Encountered a few officials who were in a hurry. When the official looked up and saw the old man, he knelt in panic.\n{Official official:} Ah, your majesty! Are you recovering physically? Something happened! Unidentified armed forces attacked the royal city. The Guards and Lord Holia were defeated. It is too dangerous for you to come back at this time, Your Majesty! Hurry... Hurry up and call someone to protect your majesty's safety!\n{Old man:} What's going on? What is rehabilitation? I have been kept in the hut by the old thief, Holia, and have never been sick!\n{Official official:} Huh? The Prime Minister said that your majesty is not in good health and has been recuperating behind closed doors... Could it be said that...\n{Old man:} That's all fake! Now I have the help of the warriors and finally get rid of imprisonment, now it is time to settle accounts with the old thief and his remnant party. Go ahead and clean up the outside.\n{Official official:} Yes, your majesty!\n{Freeman:} Your Majesty, I didn't expect you to be His Majesty the King.\n{Old man:} Haha, you don't know that I am a king, and you saved me, it's commendable! Yes, I am King Harry V. Half a year ago, I saw that the old thief in Holya was insatiable and insatiable with power, and was about to remove him from the post of prime minister. I didn't expect that he would act first and trick me into kidnapping me. He has been imprisoned until now. I don't know how many bad things he has done in the past six months. ?a?aThis is the treasure room of the old thief. It is estimated that he used his power to search around. Look for it. Is the thing you need in?\n{Freeman:} Thank you so much, Your Majesty.\n{Harry V:} Whatever you say, you saved me, it should be me who thanked me!\n{Ina:} This red orb should be the \"Fire Spirit Orb\", right?\n{Harry V:} Do you only want this thing? You can simply move all the things in this treasure room!\n{Freeman:} No, your Majesty, since this is something Houlia scoured, it should be returned to the people.\n{Harry V:} It makes sense! By the way, I'm so confused, I haven't asked the benefactor's name yet!\n{Freeman:} Your Majesty is so frank, I will not hide it, I am the Prince Freeman of Kartia. This is my friend Ina the magician. Currently Kartia is under the control of Archbishop Yingluck, and the situation is somewhat similar to your country...\n{Harry V:} I will send an army to help you defeat the archbishop or something!\n{Freeman:} Thank you, Your Majesty, for your kindness, but this matter has to be considered for a long time. Firstly, Archbishop Yingluck's ability is indeed much higher than that of Holiya. Secondly, your country's army has become low in combat power due to Holiya's hiring of officials. Thirdly, we currently have other important things to do. Therefore, the kindness of your majesty, we have appreciated it. We have to leave now and meet our companions.\n{Harry V:} Alas, this old thief has messed up my army! Okay, go ahead. I will help you when our country recovers in the future!","老头带着伊娜和弗里曼穿过被打得一塌糊涂的王城外院，往宫殿里面走。迎面遇到几个正在急作一团的仕官。仕官抬头一看到老头，突然惊慌地下跪。\n\n{仕官：}啊，陛下！您身体康复了吗？出大事了！有不明武装攻进王城，禁卫军和霍利亚大人都被打败了，陛下您这个时候回来太危险了！快……快去叫人，保护陛下安全！\n{老头：}怎么回事怎么回事？什么叫康复？我一直被霍利亚那个老贼关在小屋里，从来就没病过！\n{仕官：}啊？宰相大人说陛下身体欠佳，一直在闭门休养……难道说……\n{老头：}那都是假的！现在我得勇士相助终于摆脱囚禁，现在该找老贼和他的残党算帐了。你们快去把外面清理了。\n{仕官：}是，陛下！\n\n{弗里曼：}陛下，没想到您竟然是国王陛下。\n{老头：}哈哈，你们不知道我是国王，还救了我，难能可贵！没错，我是国王哈里五世。半年以前我就看出了霍利亚那老贼贪得无厌，以权谋私，正打算撤了他的宰相职务，没想到他居然先下手为强，用奸计诱骗绑架我，一直囚禁至今。这半年来又不知他做了多少坏事。——这里就是老贼的藏宝室，估计都是他利用权利四处搜刮来的东西吧。找找看吧，你们需要的那个东西在不在里面。\n{弗里曼：}真是太感谢陛下了。\n{哈里五世：}说哪里话，你们救了我，道谢的应该是我！\n{伊娜：}这个红红的圆球，应该就是“火灵珠”了吧？\n{哈里五世：}你们只要这个东西吗？这个藏宝室的东西，你们干脆全部搬走得了！\n{弗里曼：}不，陛下，既然这是霍利亚搜刮来的东西，应该还给百姓才是。\n{哈里五世：}说得有理！对了，我这个老糊涂，还没请教恩人的大名呢！\n{弗里曼：}陛下如此直率，我也不隐瞒了，我是卡尔提亚的王子弗里曼。这位是我的朋友魔法师伊娜。目前卡尔提亚被英拉大主教掌控，情形倒是跟贵国有点相似……\n{哈里五世：}我派军队帮你去打败那个什么什么大主教！\n{弗里曼：}多谢陛下好意，不过这事还要从长计议。一来英拉大主教的能力确实比霍利亚高得多，二来贵国的军队由于霍利亚的卖官用人变成战力低下，三来，我们目前还有其他重要的事情要做。所以，陛下的好意，我们心领了。我们现在还得赶紧离开，去和同伴汇合。\n{哈里五世：}唉，这老贼，把我的军队都搞渣了！好，你们去吧。以后等我国恢复了元气，再来帮你们！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe outlet here is very narrow and can only accommodate one boat in and out. But in a narrow place, there was a boat blocking it horizontally. A young man on the bow was thinking about something.\n{Ina:} The boat ahead, sorry, can you borrow one? Either you come in or go out to sea, don't get stuck in the middle.\n{Young:} Sorry, I don't want to, but I have encountered difficulties.\n{Ina:} What is the difficulty? Can you tell me what to say, maybe I have a way to solve it.\n{Juvenile:} Alas, this is how it is. My father is very old and lives alone at home. I often have to go to sea for work, and there is no way to accompany his old man, so I want to get him some pets to accompany him. A few days ago, I took the opportunity of going to Solandria and caught 5 {Solandria red squirrels} there. This is a local specialty, and I want to take it back to his old man.\n{Ina:} Isn't this pretty good?\n{Junior:} But, I didn't expect those little things to swim! I put them on the boat thinking that it should be safe, so I just sailed back on my own, but I didn't expect them to jump into the sea and swim away on the way. If it hadn't been for the last red squirrel to jump into the water and go away when I was about to enter the port, I would not believe it.\n{Ina:} Uh, the red squirrel is gone. It should be okay to get other pets, right?\n{Juvenile:} But I have asked someone to bring a letter to my father, saying that I had made him 5 {red, jumping, small and cute things}. If I changed to another one, didn't I become a deception to his old man?\n{Ina:} This is not so serious, is it?\n{Juvenile:} So I am hesitating now, should I go to the beach to go home and be reprimanded by my father, or go back to Solandria to catch 5 more. If I go back in this way, my father will definitely be saddened by me, but if I go to Solandria again too far, I can't let his old man wait that long. What should I do is really a dilemma. So I have been thinking about what should be done.\n{Ina:} If you think about it, you should let a passage come out and let other ships pass.\n{Junior:} But, if I go home, I should turn the bow of the boat north, and if I go to Solandria, I should turn the bow of the boat south. How can I turn the bow of the ship casually when I haven't decided which plan to adopt.\n{Ina:} This, let me figure out a solution for you.","这里的出海口很狭窄，只能容得下一只船进出。可是偏偏在狭窄的地方，有一只船横在那里堵着。船头上一个少年在沉思着什么。\n\n{伊娜：}前面的船，不好意思，能借个过吗？你要么进来靠岸，要么出海去，别堵在中间啊。\n{少年：}对不起，我也不想的，但是我遇到了困难。\n{伊娜：}什么困难呢？能不能说来让我听听，也许我有办法解决也说不定。\n{少年：}唉，事情是这样的。我父亲年事已高，一人在家住，我经常要出海工作，没有办法一直陪他老人家，于是想给他老人家弄几只宠物陪他。前些天，我借着去索兰德里亚的机会，在当地抓了5只{索兰德里亚红松鼠}，这是当地的名产了，我就想带回去给他老人家。\n{伊娜：}这不是挺好吗？\n{少年：}可是，我没想到那些小东西会游泳！我把他们放在船上心想应该很安全，就只管自己开船回来了，没想到路上他们跳进海里游走了。如果不是正要进港时看到最后一只红松鼠跳下水一溜远去，我怎么也不会相信。\n{伊娜：}呃，红松鼠没了，再去弄其他宠物应该也可以的吧？\n{少年：}可是我已经托人给父亲带过信了，说我给他弄了5只{红红的，会跳的，又小又可爱的东西}。如果换了其他的，那我不是变成欺骗他老人家了吗？\n{伊娜：}这个，没那么严重吧？\n{少年：}所以我现在正在犹豫，是靠岸回家去被父亲训斥呢，还是回去索兰德里亚再抓5只。就这样回去的话，父亲一定会被我伤心死的，可是如果再去趟索兰德里亚又太远，我不能让他老人家等那么久，怎么办呢，真是个两难的选择。所以我一直在思考，到底应该怎么办。\n{伊娜：}你思考归思考，怎么也该让个通路出来让别的船通过吧。\n{少年：}可是，如果我回家，就应该把船头向北转，如果我要去索兰德里亚，就应该把船头向南转。我还没决定好该采用哪个方案时，怎么能随便调转船头呢。\n{伊娜：}这个，我帮你想想办法吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe passage was blocked by the continuous gushing magma.","通路被不断涌出的岩浆封住了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe path was blocked by a powerful barrier.\n{Ina:} Is this what Radia is talking about?\n{Ladia:} That's right, that's it. I tried bombarding with magic, but I couldn't touch it at all.\n{Ina:} Then if we work together, then the strength can be much larger.\n{Rael:} Well, I'll also help.\n{Ina:} Come on, let's attack with all our strength and try to break it. ?a?alittle Ina super burst bomb!\n{Radia:} Crimson Flame!\n{Rael:} Heavenly Sword!\n{Ina:} No, I'm standing still.","进路被强大的结界阻拦住了。\n\n{伊娜：}这就是拉迪亚所说的结界吗？\n{拉迪亚：}没错，就是这里了，我试过用魔法轰击，完全打不动它。\n{伊娜：}那么如果我们合力呢，这样力量就可以大多了。\n{雷尔：}嗯，我也来帮忙。\n{伊娜：}来吧，大家一起全力攻击，试试能不能打破它。——伊娜酱超级爆裂弹！\n{拉迪亚：}Crimson Flame！\n{雷尔：}天霄剑！\n\n{伊娜：}不行啊，巍然不动呢。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe pitch-black iron cage covered the black tent, and there was no light in it.\n{Ina:} Is it here? Roland? are you here?\n{Weak voice:} Who? Could it be...Ina?\n{Ina:} Great, Roland, are you okay?\n{Roland:} It's okay. I was arrested by the demons, alas, what a shame.\n{Ina:} We will let you out now. Ina searched for the door where the iron cage was not found.\n{Ina:} How can there be no door, forget it, I use magic to destroy it.\n{Freeman:} No. Iron conducts electricity and conducts heat, whether you use lightning or fire, it will hurt Roland.\n{Ina:} So what should I do?\n{Roland:} It's a pity that I don't know where to lose my sword. Otherwise, what kind of iron cage is this waiting...\n{Ina:} Ah, by the way, your sword. Ina handed Roland's sword in.\n{Ina:} You fell when you helped us fight Kurug, we have been looking for you, just want to return the sword to you.\n{Roland:} Ah, it turned out to be my sword, thank you so much. Leave it to me now, you guys step back. Roland swung his sword open the iron cage.","漆黑的铁笼覆盖着黑色的帐篷，里面看不见一点光。\n\n{伊娜：}就是这里吗？罗兰？你在这里吗？\n{微弱的声音：}谁？难道是……伊娜？\n{伊娜：}太好了，罗兰，你没事吧？\n{罗兰：}还好。我居然被魔族抓起来，唉，真是耻辱。\n{伊娜：}我们这就放你出来。\n\n伊娜找了一圈没发现铁笼的门。\n\n{伊娜：}怎么会没有门的，算了，我用魔法破坏它。\n{弗里曼：}不可。铁又导电又导热，不管你用闪电还是火，都会伤到罗兰。\n{伊娜：}那怎么办哪？\n{罗兰：}可惜我的剑不知丢哪里去了，要不然，这等铁笼算什么……\n{伊娜：}啊，对了，你的剑。\n\n伊娜把罗兰的剑递进去。\n\n{伊娜：}你帮我们打库鲁格的时候落下的，我们一直在找你，就是想把剑还给你呢。\n{罗兰：}啊，原来是我的剑，太感谢你们了。下面就交给我吧，你们退后。\n\n罗兰一挥剑就把铁笼劈开了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe plan to stop the demons.","阻止魔族的方案。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe prime minister's invitation.","宰相的邀请。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe proud Silando.","得意的西兰多。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe queen's attack.","女王的攻击。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe reef ahead is so intricate that it seems unsuitable for traffic.","前方礁石错综复杂，看来并不适合通行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe response of the detector.","探测仪的反应。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe road is uneven.","路见不平。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe road is winding.","路很绕。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe road to Chisha Plain passes through a rocky area.","通往赤砂原的道路要经过一片乱石丛生的地带。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe road to Mount Ainar was blocked by a dwarf. The guy yelled excitedly when she saw Ina coming over.\n{Dwarf:} This road is driven by me, and this tree is planted by me. If you want to cross this road, leave the road to buy money.\n{Ina:} Who are you? I haven't seen you before, isn't it from our village?\n{Dwarf:} Don't be scared to death by saying the name of this lord. This lord is the world's unparalleled invincible, bravely to rob the rich and help the poor Mirronia's first car bandit road fighter Dawu lord.\n{Ina:} Oh my goodness, what a long name, I remember it in my notebook first, it's miserable, it's too long to remember, what should I do...\n{Dav:} Hey, I said, little girl, you seem to be still I don't understand my situation. It's a robbery, you know, robbery!\n{Ina:} What is robbery? Tasty?\n{Davu:} You won't grow up so old that you don't even know what the robbery is, do you? I'm dizzy, how come I'm so stupid today.\n{Ina:} I really don't know, ooh, I was said to be stupid again...\n{Davu:} Anyway, you give me 50,000 gold coins, or don't think about it.\n{Ina:} How can this work, how can I have so much money. But I have to go through here if I am in a hurry.\n{Da Wu:} Cut, after explaining for a long time that you still refuse to pay the money obediently, then don't blame the hammer for being rude. If you refuse to give it to me, just grab it.\n{Ina:} Hey, you want to fight. Grandpa told me since childhood that fighting is not good. You are a bad boy. Wait, don't do it...","通往艾拉尔山的道路被一个矮人挡住了。这家伙一见伊娜过来，兴奋地嚷嚷起来。\n{矮人：}此路是我开，此树是我栽，要想过此路，留下买路财。\n{伊娜：}你是谁？我以前没见过你啊，不是我们村的吧？\n{矮人：}本大人的名字，说出来你可别吓死。本大人就是举世无双天下无敌见义勇为劫富济贫米尔罗尼亚第一车匪路霸达伍大人是也。\n{伊娜：}天哪，好长的名字，先记到笔记本上，惨了，太长了记不住，怎么办哪……\n{达伍：}喂，我说，小丫头，你好像还不明白自己的处境嘛。现在是抢劫，知道吗，抢劫！\n{伊娜：}抢劫是什么？好吃吗？\n{达伍：}你不会长这么大了连抢劫是什么都不知道吧？晕了，今天怎么摊上这么个笨蛋。\n{伊娜：}我真的不知道嘛，呜，又被人说笨了……\n{达伍：}总之，你给我50000金币，要不然就别想过去。\n{伊娜：}这怎么行啊，我哪有这么多钱。但是我有急事一定要从这里过才行。\n{达伍：}切，解释了半天你还是不肯乖乖给钱，那就别怪本大人的锤子不客气。不肯给我就硬抢。\n{伊娜：}咦，你想打架啊，爷爷从小告诉我打架是不好的，你是坏孩子。等等啊，别动手啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe rubbish completely blocked the access. Ina tried to bombard with magic, but the dust was flying, but the rocks remained motionless.","乱石完全阻挡了通路。伊娜尝试用魔法轰击，结果弄得沙尘飞扬，乱石却纹丝不动。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe sea ahead is very windy and it looks unsuitable for sailing.","前面的海域风浪很大，看起来不适合行船。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe search of the demons.","魔族的搜寻。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe shape of the hole is very unique, and ordinary things cannot be inserted into it.","孔的形状很独特，一般的东西伸不进去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe ship bumped in the wind and waves, and some gold coins fell into the sea.","船在风浪中颠簸，一些金币掉入海中。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe ship in distress was found.","发现遇难船只。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe short, old and humble houses, there are some cages not far away. A group of people who seem to be staff are busy.\n{Ina:} Excuse me, is Mr. Security Chief here?\n{Education Officer:} We are busy, Mr. Chief Security Officer is not available right now. Do you want to report the crime? Go there to register first.\n{Ina:} Uh, we are not reporting the crime, but there are some things we want to ask Mr. Security Officer.\n{Education Officer:} I'm sorry that several cases have come all at once, and we can't handle them if we don't have much manpower. If it's not for reporting the case, don't bother Mr. Chief Security Officer.\n{Sir:} Let's talk about something first.\n{Education Officer:} Ah, Mr. Security Chief, why are you here? Has the case been handled? {Chief Security Officer:} Nothing. Although the case is clear, there is no manpower available to catch the thief. It's really nerve-wracking. Unexpectedly, several cases were all coming together. Speaking of which, why are you guys looking for me?\n{Ina:} We originally wanted to inquire about some things, you will know if you hear from friends. How about we help catch the thief, or I'm sorry to take up your time. {Chief Security Officer:} Is it possible? It's great that we are worried about the lack of people. You help me deal with this theft case. I can help you with any questions afterwards.\n{Ina:} What kind of case is it? {Chief Security Officer:} A thief stole a pig from the farmer's house, and now fled {northwest direction}. Witnesses have already provided the looks of the thief. We drew a portrait. You can compare it with this portrait. What you have to do is {catch him back}, {recover with the stolen goods}. The family where the pig was stolen is very poor. If they can't get the pig back, their livelihood will be even more difficult in the future.\n{Ina:} I see, I'm going to catch him now.","矮旧简陋的房屋，不远处还有一些牢笼。一群看似工作人员的人们在忙碌着。\n\n{伊娜：}请问，安防长先生在吗？\n{差役：}我们正忙着呢，安防长先生现在没空。你要报案吗？先去那边登记。\n{伊娜：}呃，我们不是报案啦，只是有些事情想向安防长先生打听一下。\n{差役：}不好意思现在案子一下子来了好几件，我们人手不多处理不完，如果不是报案的话，不要打扰安防长先生了。\n{长官：}什么事情，先说说看。\n{差役：}啊，安防长先生，您怎么来了，刚才的案子处理好了吗？\n{安防长：}没呢。虽然案子很清楚，不过就是抽不出人手去抓捕窃贼。真是伤脑筋。没想到几个案子都涌到一起来了。说回来你们几个是什么事情要找我？\n{伊娜：}我们本来是想打听一些事情的，听朋友说您会知道。要不我们帮忙去抓捕窃贼吧，要不然占用你们的时间真不好意思。\n{安防长：}可以吗？我们正愁缺人，真是太好了。你帮我把这个盗窃的案子处理了吧。之后你有什么问题我都可以帮助你。\n{伊娜：}是个什么样的案子呢？\n{安防长：}一个窃贼把农民家的一只猪给偷了，现在向{西北方向}逃窜去了。已经有目击者提供了窃贼的长相，我们画了张画像，你把这画像拿去对照。你要做的就是{把他抓回来}，{连同赃物也追回来}，被偷了猪的那户人家很穷，如果不能要回猪，他们今后的生计就更困难了。\n{伊娜：}我知道了，我这就去抓他。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe situation is grim.","形势严峻。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe skeleton was beaten to pieces, his head, hands and feet were all dropped, and only one breastbone remained basically intact.","骷髅被打得支离破碎，头颅，手脚都掉了，只剩一个胸骨还基本完好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe sky was suddenly overcast and thunder thundered. Then Dou Da's raindrops fell. Ina and others were trying to find a place to shelter from the rain when suddenly a passing shadow fell from the sky.\n{Unidentified:} Damn, it's raining again. I hate the ghostly weather where it rains twice in three days. Ina and the others looked closer and found a demon planted in a mud pit on the ground, with his chin on the ground, embarrassed.\n{Rael:} Demon! {Demon:} Human? who are you? This is the territory of Longyashan heroes. How did you break in?\n{Freeman:} Then how did you break in?\n{Devil:} Longyashan heroes are our people, should I use Chong? It's really useless for these low-powered guys to let strangers in. When I go back, I have to sue them to General Zelando... Well, I still have an urgent matter, so I have to go to {Solandria}. The weather is no longer flying, so I have to wait for the rain to stop. I said, don't tell anyone you have seen me, you know?\n{Ina:} What's going on? Longyashan heroes are in the same group as the demons? Who is General Zelando? What are you doing in Solandria?\n{Devil:} Why are you asking so much? Okay, the rain is getting lighter, I should go now. Fortunately, the rain here doesn't last long...\n{Ina:} You can go if you say you go? This is the territory of the Baland Kingdom, but not the territory of your demons. How can you let you leave like this?\n{Devil:} Why are you talking so much nonsense? Is there any difference between the territory of the Barland Kingdom and the territory of the Demon Race? It's true. Don't bother me, I have to hurry to deliver the letter.\n{Ina:} Hey, don't make a mistake about the balance of power, you are alone, with so many of us, do you want to escape?\n{Demon:} Isn't it? Do you want to fight? I'm not a soldier, I'm just a messenger, don't ask me for fighting.\n{Ina:} I blame you for your bad luck and fall in front of us. It just so happens that you are the breakthrough point of our investigation.","天空突然阴云密布，打起雷来。接着豆大的雨点就砸了下来。伊娜等人正想找地方避雨，突然天上一个掠过的影子栽了下来。\n\n{不明物：}靠，又下雨了，我讨厌这里三天两头下雨的鬼天气。\n\n伊娜等人凑近看，发现一个恶魔栽在地上的泥坑里，下巴着地，窘相十足。\n\n{雷尔：}魔族！\n{恶魔：}人类？你们是谁？这里是龙牙山好汉的地盘，你们怎么闯进来的？\n{弗里曼：}那你又是怎么闯进来的？\n{恶魔：}龙牙山好汉是我们的人，我用闯吗？这群低能的家伙，居然让陌生人闯进来，真是没用。我回去得向西兰多将军告他们的状……唉，我还有急事在身，得去一趟{索兰德里亚}，这天气又不能飞了，只好等雨停。我说，你们千万不要对任何人说看到过我，知道吗？\n{伊娜：}怎么回事怎么回事？龙牙山好汉跟魔族是一伙？西兰多将军是谁？你要去索兰德里亚又是干什么？\n{恶魔：}你问那么多干嘛。好了，雨小了，我该走了。幸亏这里的雨下得都不长……\n{伊娜：}你说走就能走啊？这里是巴兰德王国的地盘，又不是你们魔族的地盘，怎么能让你这样随便就走？\n{恶魔：}你怎么这么多废话啊，巴兰德王国的地盘跟魔族的地盘有区别吗？真是的。别烦我了，我还得赶紧去送信呢。\n{伊娜：}喂，你不要搞错了力量对比，你就一个人，我们这么多人，你还想逃掉啊？\n{恶魔：}不是吧？你们难道想打架？我不是当兵的，我只是个送信的，打架的事情别找我啦。\n{伊娜：}怪就怪你运气不好掉到我们面前，正好你就是我们调查的突破口了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe smoke of the volcano made Ina and others unable to open their eyes, but at this moment, the demon's troops were shot out on both sides.\n{Ina:} Ah, where did these guys come out...\n{Freeman:} No, it seems to be an ambush. Does anyone know that we are coming?\n{Rael:} Hurry up and challenge.\n{Freeman:} Take care to protect the safety of Lord Kalidan.","火山的烟呛得伊娜等人眼睛睁不开，然而就在这时，突然两侧杀出了魔族的部队。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，这些家伙从哪冒出来的呀……\n{弗里曼：}不好，似乎是埋伏。难道有人知道我们要来？\n{雷尔：}赶紧应战吧。\n{弗里曼：}注意保护卡里丹大人的安全。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe soldier's talk.","士兵的谈论。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe soldiers of the demons guarded here.","魔族的士兵把守着这里。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe southeast direction leads to Nanling Pass. The north leads to the Horn Valley.","东南方向通向南岭关。\n北方通向霍恩山谷。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe square round the island is covered with dark camphor trees with dark leaves all around, but there is a distinctive red maple on each side. Connecting the red maple on the opposite side can just draw a red cross that is the same as that on the map of explorer Singh. A circle of black camphor trees also coincides with the black square. The original sign on the map meant this. And the intersection of the two red lines, which is where it is now, seems to be hiding something.","方形的环岛一周都长满了深色叶子的黑樟树，但其中每边上却各有一棵与众不同的红枫。将对边的红枫相连，正好可以画出一个跟探险家辛格的地图上相同的红色的叉。而一圈黑樟树也与黑色的方框相吻合。原来地图上的标识就是这个意思。而两条红线的交叉点，也就是现在所在的这个位置，似乎是藏着什么东西。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe temperature is gradually rising, the surrounding ice continues to melt, and the water converges into a stream on the ground.\n{Ina:} The ground is full of water. If this goes on...\n{Elder:} The terrain is high here, and the water will overflow from the entrance and exit, which is to our village.\n{Ina:} Is the village going to be submerged soon?\n{Elder:} No, the entrance and exit are not big, and the amount of water flowing out is limited. We still have some time to find the Phoenix first.\n{Ina:} Then will it be submerged first? If the ice melts, will this cave be full of water...\n{Freeman:} No. {Ina:} Huh? why?\n{Freeman:} Ice is less dense than water. After the ice melts into water, its volume shrinks. So it turns out that the ice didn't fill the space in the hole, and it was even more impossible after it melted into water.\n{Ina:} Hurry up and take notes. Jack is so knowledgeable.\n{Freeman:} This is the basis of physics. I learned it when I was 10 years old.","温度在渐渐升高，周围的冰不断融化，水在地上汇聚成流。\n\n{伊娜：}地上全是水了耶，这样下去的话……\n{长老：}这里地势高，水会从出入口溢到外面，也就是流向我们的村子。\n{伊娜：}村子很快就要被淹没了吗？\n{长老：}不会，出入口并不大，流出的水量是有限的，我们还有一些时间，赶紧先把不死鸟找到。\n{伊娜：}那么这里面会不会先被淹没呢？要是冰都融化了，这个洞中会不会满是水……\n{弗里曼：}不会的。\n{伊娜：}咦？为什么？\n{弗里曼：}冰的密度比水小。冰融化成水之后，体积是缩小的。所以原来冰都没有填满洞里的空间，融化成水后就更不可能了。\n{伊娜：}赶紧笔记下来。杰克知识真渊博。\n{弗里曼：}这是物理学基础啦，我10岁时就学过了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe terrain is good.","地形不错。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe thief leader.","盗贼头目。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe three are combined, and the magic sword reappears. One step away, dominance lies in the sky. The evil prince Solo left a word.","三位合体，魔剑重现。\n一步之遥，霸业在天。\n\n邪亲王索罗留字。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe translated name of magic.","魔法的译名。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe truth about the tribute.","贡礼的真相。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe two teenagers are arguing about something. Seeing Ina and others coming over, she hurriedly stopped.\n{Young A:} This guy won't know how to pretend to understand, so you come to comment on me.\n{Young B:} Obviously you are talking nonsense, I still want to find someone to judge.\n{Young A:} Okay, then we will let these few people comment on us.\n{Young B:} It's just what I want, so how can you sophis it?\n{Ina:} Hello, may I ask, what's the matter?\n{Young A:} The two of us are betting, what is the name of the flying insect in the tree hole in front.\n{Junior B:} A foreign explorer had visited before and said that there was a kind of flying insect called dragonfly living there, so we wanted to check it out ourselves.\n{Young A:} But we don't understand the words of foreigners. We don't know how to call this flying insect in our language, so we made a bet. look.\n{Young B:} Whoever wins takes 90 units of mercury.\n{Ina:} I don’t know much about foreign languages either. What do you think it should be?\n{Young A:} dragonfly, of course, is a \"dragonfly\". I specifically checked the dictionary, but this guy didn't believe what I said.\n{Young B:} You are dogmatic. The dragonfly is so small and cute, how could it be the same creature as that thing. I also checked the dictionary. Dragon is \"dragon\" and \"fly\" is \"fly\", so its name should be \"\". There is an idiom called \"Dragon Feifengwu\", which is scribbled, and it is as ugly as this flying insect.\n{Young A:} How can you be so literate. Anyway, now we take them as a notary, to confirm it in person.\n{Young B:} Okay, let's go.","两个少年正在争吵着什么。看到伊娜等人过来，连忙叫住。\n\n{少年A：}这个家伙就会不懂装懂，你们来给我评评理。\n{少年B：}明明是你在瞎说，我还想找人评理呢。\n{少年A：}好啊，那么我们就让这几个人给我们评评。\n{少年B：}正合我意，这样看你还怎么狡辩。\n{伊娜：}你们好，请问，是什么事啊？\n{少年A：}我们两个在打赌，赌前面树洞里的飞虫叫什么。\n{少年B：}以前有一个外国的探险家来看过，说那里生活着一种叫dragonfly的飞虫，所以我们想自己也来确认一下。\n{少年A：}但是外国人的话我们听不太懂，不知道这个飞虫用我们的语言该怎么称呼，所以就打了个赌。你看。\n{少年B：}90个单位的水银，谁赢谁拿走。\n{伊娜：}我也不太懂外语耶。你们觉得应该是什么？\n{少年A：}dragonfly，当然是“蜻蜓”了，我特地去查了字典的，可是这家伙居然不相信我说的。\n{少年B：}你这是教条主义。蜻蜓那么小那么可爱，怎么可能跟那东西是同一种生物。我也查过字典了。dragon是“龙”，fly是“飞”，所以它的名字应该叫“龙飞”才是，有个成语叫“龙飞凤舞”，是形容写字潦草，写得就跟这飞虫一样难看。\n{少年A：}哪有你这样望文生义的。不管怎么说，现在我们带上他们作为公证人，亲自去确认一下。\n{少年B：}好，走。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe two teenagers began to dig out the tree hole, which annoyed the dragon flies inside, and a large group of dragon flies came out and flew all over the sky and stinged when they saw people.\n{Ina:} Ah, isn't this a dragonfly? so many.\n{Boy A&Boy B:} Huh? Do you know them?\n{Ina:} Of course, I have used it. Being stung by them will be weakened by magic, please be careful.\n{Junior A&Junior B:} I can't stand it, we withdrew...\n{Ina:} Wait, your bet is still here.\n{Junior A&Junior B:} We have all lost, no one is qualified to take it, let's give it to you.","两个少年开始掏树洞，这下可惹恼了里面的龙蝇，大群的龙蝇钻出来漫天飞舞见人就叮。\n{伊娜：}啊，这不是龙蝇吗？好多啊。\n{少年A&少年B：}啊？你认识它们？\n{伊娜：}当然了，我还使用过的。被它们叮了会中虚弱魔法哦，你们小心。\n{少年A&少年B：}受不了啦，我们撤啦……\n{伊娜：}等等，你们的赌注还在这放着呢。\n{少年A&少年B：}我们都输了，谁也没资格拿，还是给你吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe use of one-way doors.","单向门的使用。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe use of portals.","传送门的使用。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe water world.","水上世界。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe westward route leads to the Koz Peninsula.","向西的航路通向科兹半岛。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe wind and waves are getting bigger and bigger","风浪越来越大"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThe wind is cold and the water is cold.","风萧萧兮易水寒。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere are 2 portals in front, I don't know which way can lead to {Rodanna Mountain} mentioned by Mengying. A short man was standing at the intersection and looking around.\n{Ina:} Let me ask for directions. The gentleman over there...\n{Dalwood:} What's the matter?\n{Ina:} Ah, it's you, Mr. Bad Guy!\n{Dawu:} Ah, stupid girl, why are you here too?\n{Ina:} We have something to go to Rodana Mountain, but don't know which way to go.\n{Davu:} Then you are asking the right person...\n{Ina:} \"This lord is the first Davu lord Mirronia who has the most informed eyes, bright ears, and knows everything\", yes Isn't it?\n{Dawu:} Yeah, do you know all the lines of this lord?\n{Ina:} Last time I remembered it in Ina-chan's universal notebook. Also, are you planning to collect money again after you finish talking?\n{Darwood:} You guessed wrong. This time I don't plan to finish collecting the money this time, I plan to talk about it after collecting the money.\n{Ina:} Cut, I won't give it anymore.\n{Da Wu:} This master expected you to encounter difficulties here, so he kindly came over to help solve the puzzles, don't you be so shameless. It's not easy for this adult to earn some living expenses.\n{Ina:} You clearly asked me just now, \"Why did you come here too\", it means that you didn't know why I came before, and why you changed your words as anticipating that we would come, contradicting yourself.\n{Da Wu:} Well, don't just open it up so straightforwardly, okay, okay, let me just say it first. The road to Rodana Mountain is the east side. Okay, the information fee is 2,000 gold coins as usual.\n{Ina:} I really don't want to give it to you, but, forget it, because you still helped, I'll give it.\n{Da Wu:} Hey, that's right, you have a good reputation, I can help you next time.","前面有2个传送门，不知道哪边能通向梦影所说的{罗德安那山}。一个矮个子正站在路口四处张望。\n\n{伊娜：}我来问个路吧。那边的那位先生……\n{达伍：}什么事？\n{伊娜：}啊，是你，坏人先生！\n{达伍：}啊，笨小丫头，你怎么也上这儿来了？\n{伊娜：}我们有事情要去罗德安那山，正不知道该往哪条路走。\n{达伍：}这你就问对人了……\n{伊娜：}“本大人正是米尔罗尼亚第一消息灵通眼明耳快无所不知无所不晓的达伍大人”，是不是？\n{达伍：}呀，本大人的台词你都知道啦？\n{伊娜：}上次我就记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上了。还有，你是不是还打算说完了后又开口收钱啊？\n{达伍：}你猜错了。本大人这回不打算说完收钱，打算收完钱再说。\n{伊娜：}切，我不给了。\n{达伍：}本大人正是预料到你们会在这里遇到困难，才好心过来帮忙解惑的，你不要这么不给面子嘛。本大人挣点生活费也不容易。\n{伊娜：}你刚才明明问我“你怎么也上这儿来了”，说明你之前不知道我为什么来，怎么又改口成预料到我们会来了，自相矛盾。\n{达伍：}这个，你不要这么直截了当就拆穿啊，好吧好吧，本大人先说就是了。通向罗德安那山的路是东边这条。这下好了吧，信息费照例是2000金币。\n{伊娜：}真不想给你，不过，算了，看在你还是帮了忙的份上，就给了吧。\n{达伍：}嘿，这就对了嘛，你信誉好，下回我还能给你帮忙。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere are many Baland soldiers guarding this crossing.","这一处道口有不少巴兰德军把守着。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere are pits everywhere.","到处是坑。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere are two roads to the west and south. Two goblins guarded the intersection.\n{Ina:} There are two ways, where should I go?\n{Goblin A:} Hey, want to ask for directions?\n{Goblin B:} There are two roads, one is a passage, the other is a dead end, which one do you want to take?\n{Ina:} Of course it's the way.\n{Goblin B:} We can tell you which one is the passage, but we two, one only tells the truth, the other only tells the lie. You can only ask one of us a question.\n{Ina:} This question seems to be something I heard from my grandfather before. I looked through the little Ina universal notebook...\n{Goblin A:} Have you thought about how to ask?\n{Ina:} Hmm. If I ask your partner, he will answer which way should I go?\n{Goblin A:} He will answer you, you should turn around and go back. Hahaha...\n{Ina:} Hmph, I know you guys will play me. There are still writings in Ina Chan's omnipotent notebook. Goblins always like pranks, don't believe them lightly. What only tells the truth and tells the lie, is this hypothesis possible in reality? From the beginning, you just wanted to make me happy and spank you.\n{Goblin A&B:} Ouch, don't hit us. Don't lie to you, it's really better to look back, {the site of Master Chinu ahead}, it's better not to mess with him...\n{Ina:} We are looking for him. Shoot.","前面有向西和向南两条路。两只哥布林守在路口。\n{伊娜：}有两条路，该向哪里走呢？\n{哥布林A：}嘿嘿，想问路吗？\n{哥布林B：}这两条路，一条是通路，一条是死路，你想走哪条？\n{伊娜：}当然是走通路了。\n{哥布林B：}我们可以告诉你哪条是通路，不过我们两个，一个只说真话，一个只说假话。你只能向我们其中一个问一个问题。\n{伊娜：}这个问题我好像以前听爷爷讲过的耶，我翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本……\n{哥布林A：}考虑好怎么问了吗？\n{伊娜：}嗯。如果我问你的伙伴，他会回答我该走哪条路？\n{哥布林A：}他会回答你，你该掉头回去。哈哈哈……\n{伊娜：}哼，就知道你们会耍我。伊娜酱万能笔记本上还有写呢，哥布林总是喜欢恶作剧，不要轻易相信他们。什么只说真话只说假话的，这种假设现实中可能存在吗？你们从一开始就只是想拿我开心而已，打你们屁股。\n{哥布林A&B：}哎哟，别打我们。不骗你，真的是回头比较好啦，{前面是齐努大人的地盘}，你们不要去惹他比较好……\n{伊娜：}我们找的就是他。照打。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a beach to the east of Ainal Village. There are messy reefs everywhere, and ships can't dock at all. However, there are a lot of blue crabs, a specialty of Mirronia. Ina often comes to catch crabs in her free time, so she can not only eat her own food, but also sell them to the fishmonger Ladar who collects aquatic products for a little money. Blue crabs generally hide in the crevices of reefs that can be submerged by the waves. They are not easy to find. They are also difficult to move in the reef clusters, and there is a danger of being washed into the sea by the waves. But these are not easy for Ina, who is light-footed.\n{Ina:} It rained just yesterday, and now it's time for the crabs to come out and move around. There should be a good harvest today.","艾拉尔村的东边有一片海滩。这里到处是杂乱的礁石，船只根本无法停靠。不过这里却盛产着米尔罗尼亚特产的青蟹。伊娜闲暇时经常来抓蟹，既可以自己饱口福，又可以卖给收水产的鱼贩拉达尔大叔赚小钱。青蟹一般躲藏在海浪可以浸到的礁石罅隙里，并不太好找，而且礁石丛中行动也很困难，还有被海浪冲进海里的危险。不过这些都难不倒身轻脚便的伊娜。\n{伊娜：}昨天刚下过雨，现在正是螃蟹们出来活动的时间，今天应该可以大丰收了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a boat parked on the shore, and its sails have been damaged in many places. A big man sat on one side with a sad face, and a saw and other tools beside him.\n{Ina:} Hello, uncle, is this boat yours?\n{Dahan:} Ah, I just built a new ship, but I didn't expect it to be like this...\n{Rael:} So this uncle is a shipbuilder?\n{Dahan:} Yes. I just built a new ship today and I am about to sell it. As a result, an angel came and asked if I could borrow him for a boat.\n{Ina:} Angel! It must be Roland! And then?\n{Shipbuilder:} Then I led him to the boat to see, when suddenly a strange man flew over and attacked the angel. I was so scared that I hurried to the shore. The two of them fought on the boat for a while, and the angel was bare-handed and weaponless, and in the end it was not the opponent of the weirdo. After being defeated, the weirdo took him away. So my boat was beaten to pieces like this.\n{Ina:} The weirdo took him away, where did he get caught?\n{Shipbuilder:} He flew in the direction of {Taslinna Mountain}.\n{Ina:} If you can, sell your boat to us.\n{Shipbuilder:} Hey? Do you want it if the sail is broken?\n{Ina:} Since the boat can still float on the water without sinking, it means that the hull is still intact. If the sail is broken, it's just a little slower. There is no other boat available here. We must hurry to Taslinna Mountain. We can only use your boat.\n{Shipbuilder:} Thank you so much.\n{Ina:} Uncle, do you make a price?\n{Shipbuilder:} Normally I sell a new ship for 6000 gold coins. The sail is broken. I will give you a discount and give you 5000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} Okay, this is 5000 gold coins, then we are going.","岸边停着一只船，船帆已经多处破损。一个大汉坐在一边愁眉苦脸，旁边还摆了锯子等工具。\n\n{伊娜：}这位大叔你好，请问这只船是你的吗？\n{大汉：}唉，我才造好的新船，没想到就被打成这样……\n{雷尔：}原来这位大叔是造船工啊？\n{大汉：}是啊。我今天刚刚造好一只新船，正准备卖呢。结果来了一个天使，问我能不能借他船用。\n{伊娜：}天使！一定是罗兰！然后呢然后呢？\n{造船工：}然后我就领他到船上看，这时突然飞来一个怪人，就朝那个天使攻击了。我吓得赶紧逃到岸上。他们两个在船上打了一会儿，那个天使赤手空拳，没有武器，最终不是那个怪人的对手，被打败了，怪人就把他抓走了。于是我的船就这样被打得破破烂烂。\n{伊娜：}怪人把他抓走，抓到哪里去了呀？\n{造船工：}是朝{塔斯林纳山}方向飞去了。\n{伊娜：}如果可以的话，把你的船卖给我们吧。\n{造船工：}哎？帆破了你们也要？\n{伊娜：}既然船还能浮在水面上不沉，说明船体还是完好的吧。帆破了无非慢一点，这里没有别的船可用，我们必须赶紧去塔斯林纳山，只能用你的船了。\n{造船工：}那真是太感谢了。\n{伊娜：}大叔你开个价呢？\n{造船工：}平常一艘新船我卖6000个金币，这只帆破了，我打点折，5000金币给你们吧。\n{伊娜：}好，这是5000金币，那么我们就出发啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a circular groove on the wall.","墙壁上有一个圆形凹槽。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a deep and far path hidden by the shore.","岸边隐藏着一条深而远的小路。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a deep hole in the middle of the road, which makes the narrow road impossible to pass.","路中间有一个深坑，让本来就狭窄的小路变得无法通过。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a locker with a black tiger pattern on it.","这里放置着一个画有黑虎图案的柜子，上着锁。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a map and a note in the drift bottle. The note read: I got this treasure map, and wanted to drive a boat to hunt for treasure, but unexpected","漂流瓶内有一张地图一张字条。\n字条写着：\n我得此宝图，欲驾船寻宝，不料遭遇海盗。死前置宝图于瓶抛入大海，若有勇士替我报仇，以宝物相赠。\n——探险家辛格"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a piece of floating algae floating on the sea, although it is not as solid as on land, it will not sink if it stays on it temporarily.","海上漂着一片浮藻，虽然不像陆地那样可以结实地踩着，不过暂时停留在上面也不会下沉。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a small hole in the center of a neat stone wall. The tomb thief, who had a lot of strength just now, couldn't break him. Ina tapped a few times.\n{Ina:} It is indeed empty behind. If the \"Eternal Sphere\" is really hidden in there...it seems to have to start from this hole.\n{Rael:} It looks like this might be a lock. We look for any props that can be inserted into this hole.","一块齐整的石壁中央有个小孔。刚才牛力气一大把的盗墓贼也没能砸开他。伊娜轻轻敲了几下。\n{伊娜：}背后确实是空的。如果“永恒之球”真的藏在那里面的话……看来得从这个孔下手。\n{雷尔：}看起来这可能是一个锁。我们找找有没有能伸进这个孔里的道具。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is a waterway to the north of the town, and there is a small piece of land on the opposite side.","城镇的北边有一条水道，对面还有小片陆地。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is an inconspicuous hole between the rocks. There seemed to be some movement inside.\n{Ina:} Is there anyone inside?\n{Voice:} There is no one, but one is blind.\n{Ina:} Blind?\n{Freeman:} They are cave people, many people call them blind.\n{Ina:} It turns out there is such a name, write it down.\n{Freeman:} But this term has a certain contemptuous meaning.\n{Ina:} Hey, then why does he call himself blind?\n{Voice:} Is there something wrong? Anyway, humans and demons look down on us inferior blind men. I have lived here for twenty years, and no one has come to me yet.\n{Ina:} There is no such thing. You have lived here for twenty years, so you must be familiar with this area? We are looking for someone to help as a guide...\n{Voice:} Looking for me? It's really rare that someone came to ask for help. For the sake of you being so worthy of me, I helped. However, the reward is 10,000 gold coins, which is not less.","山岩之间有一个不显眼的地洞。里面似乎有什么动静。\n{伊娜：}里面有人吗？\n{声音：}人没有，瞎子有一只。\n{伊娜：}瞎子？\n{弗里曼：}是洞穴人吧，很多人俗称他们为瞎子。\n{伊娜：}原来还有这样的名字，记下来。\n{弗里曼：}不过这个称呼带有一定轻蔑的含义。\n{伊娜：}咦，那么他为什么自己还称自己是瞎子呢？\n{声音：}有什么不对吗？反正人类也好魔族也好都看不起我们这些下等瞎子。我住在这里二十年了，还没有人来找过我。\n{伊娜：}没有这样的事啦。您在这里住了二十年，那么一定对这一带很熟悉喽？我们正想找人帮忙作向导呢……\n{声音：}找我？居然有人来找人帮忙，真是难得。看在你们这么看得起我的份上，我就帮了。不过，报酬10000金币，这可不能少。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is an old man in a robe with white eyebrows and long beard on the shore.\n{Ina:} Isn't this senior Fengyou?\n{Robe old man:} Fengyou? Have you met my brother?\n{Ina:} You are not a senior Fengyou? Could it be...\n{Robe old man:} I am his younger brother Feng Fei.\n{Ina:} Yes, you look alike. We are looking for you. Ina talked about defeating the pinates to retrieve the treasures and rescuing Fengyou.","岸边有一位白眉长髯的长袍老者。\n\n{伊娜：}这不是风游前辈吗？\n{长袍老者：}风游？你们见过我师兄？\n{伊娜：}您不是风游前辈？莫非……\n{长袍老者：}我是他的师弟风飞。\n{伊娜：}是这样啊，你们的样子好相像呢。我们正要找您。\n\n伊娜把击败海盗取回宝物以及搭救风游的事情说了一遍。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is an unclear cave by the waterway.","水道旁有一个不明眼的洞穴。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is blood in the pool next to it.\n{Ina:} Oh my goodness, it's disgusting... The residents won't really have been killed...","旁边的池里都是血。\n\n{伊娜：}天哪，好恶心……居民不会真的已经被杀光了吧……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is no access ahead, and a huge rock is in the middle. The boulder says: Don't you have eyes? Didn't you see that this is a dead end?","前面没有通路了，一块巨石拦在中间。\n巨石上写着：\n你不长眼睛吗？没看到这里是死路？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is no access ahead, and a huge rock is in the middle. The boulder says: Don't you have eyes? Didn't you see that this is a dead end? The cave people continued to move forward without turning their heads. Go straight through the boulder.\n{Ina:} Hey, it's really over.\n{Rael:} It turns out that this huge rock is just an illusion. But, how did you think of finding a caveman to lead the way?\n{Ina:} Because I take notes, Rael said that the cavemen have no eyes. Look at what's written on this, doesn't it mean that you won't see a dead end without having eyes long. So people who don't have eyes will definitely find a way.","前面没有通路了，一块巨石拦在中间。\n巨石上写着：\n你不长眼睛吗？没看到这里是死路？\n\n洞穴人头都不回继续往前走。直接穿过了巨石。\n{伊娜：}咦，真的过去了耶。\n{雷尔：}原来这巨石只是幻象。可是，你怎么想到找洞穴人来带路呢？\n{伊娜：}因为我有记笔记啊，雷尔说过，洞穴人没有眼睛。你看这上面写的，不就是说不长眼睛就会没看到死路了嘛。所以不长眼睛的人一定会找到通路的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is no access here, only a stone lion statue.","这里没有通路了，只有一尊石狮像。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is no one in the city.","城里没人。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is no worst, only worse.","没有最恶只有更恶。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere is nothing here.","这里什么都没有。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere may be other outlets.","可能有其他出口。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere must be someone.","肯定有人。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere was a chattering sound, and another group of vampires flew up.\n{Ina:} Hey, you can't take advantage of others like this...","一阵叽叽喳喳的声音，又飞来一群吸血鬼。\n{伊娜：}喂，你们不能这么乘人之危啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere was nothing but a stone wall ahead, and it didn't look like a passage.","前方除了一堵石壁之外什么都没有，看起来不像是通路。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThere were many mud-stained corpses on the side of the road. They looked like civilians, and some were still struggling before they died.\n{Ina:} Why...what's going on? Who did this? It's too much...\n{Rael:} It seems that there have been fierce fights, but after all, these people are still defenseless and unable to resist...\n{Freeman:} Generally speaking, near the capital of the kingdom The law and order should be getting better and better. How could such a thing happen? Who killed these people...\n{Ina:} It must be the Balandian army. They are not even their own citizens. Do you grab them all?\n{Freeman:} I feel wrong. Ina, think about it, we have met refugees from Barland before, haven't we? Their property was robbed, but were they killed?\n{Ina:} It doesn't seem to be.\n{Freeman:} If the Balland army were robbing civilians, it would be enough to take away the property, and it should not kill the people?aand, there is one more thing, have you noticed?\n{Rael:} All the people killed were young men, no women and children.\n{Ina:} Really... Then, it's not a robbery, but what is it?\n{Freeman:} I can't figure it out at the moment, but we have to be careful anyway, something must have happened to the Kingdom of Barland that we didn't expect.","路边横着许多衣衫褴褛满身泥渍的尸体，看上去都是平民，有的还保持着临死前挣扎的姿势。\n\n{伊娜：}怎……怎么回事？这是谁干的，太过分了……\n{雷尔：}好像是发生过激烈搏斗的样子，不过终究这些人还是手无寸铁，无力抵抗……\n{弗里曼：}一般来说，靠近王国的都城，治安应该越来越好才是，怎么会发生这样的事情呢，这些人又是被谁杀害的呢……\n{伊娜：}一定是巴兰德军干的吧，他们不是连自己的国民都抢吗。\n{弗里曼：}我觉得不对。伊娜，你想想，之前我们也有遇到过巴兰德的难民是不是？他们财物都被抢了，可是有被杀吗？\n{伊娜：}好像没有耶。\n{弗里曼：}如果还是巴兰德军抢劫平民的话，拿走财物就可以了，应该不至于要杀人灭口——而且，还有一点，你们有没有注意到？\n{雷尔：}所有被杀的人都是青壮年男子，没有老弱妇孺。\n{伊娜：}真的耶……那么说来，不是抢劫，又是什么呢？\n{弗里曼：}目前我也推测不出来，不过，总之我们得小心，巴兰德王国一定发生了什么我们没想到的事情。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is Magic Valley Island. There are many magic traps on the island, don't have enough skills to not enter.","这里是魔谷岛。\n岛上多魔法陷阱，没有足够的本领不要乱闯。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is Rodana Mountain. The terrain here is rugged and bandits are infested. Pedestrians in the past should pay attention to safety. ?a?aThe Governme","这里是罗德安那山。此地地形崎岖，且有盗匪出没，过往行人请注意安全。\n——特里菲亚王国政府"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is a path that is not too wide.","这里是一条不太宽阔的小路。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is called Longyashan.","这里叫龙牙山。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is just a dead cave, without any living creatures.","这里只是一个死寂的洞穴，没有任何活物。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is just a wall, impassable.","这里只是一面墙壁，无法通行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is the Zhushan Island Tunnel. The tunnel is unfinished, for your safety, please detour.","这里是竹山岛隧道。隧道未完工，为了您的安全，请绕行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis is the backyard storage room of the Li Qide family.","这里是李奇德家族的后院储藏室。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis leads to the Calterra Plain.","这里通向卡尔泰拉平原。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis leads to the Horn Valley, do you want to pass?","这里通向霍恩山谷，你想通过吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis leads to the Horn Valley.","这里通向霍恩山谷。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis passage is guarded by the soldiers of the demons","这条通路被魔族的士兵把守着"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis road is nowhere.","此路不通。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis road leads to Intasia.","这条道路通向因塔西亚。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis seems to be a back door, but it cannot be opened. Two lines of text were written on the board: People's parents, taxation, law, military and political affairs, holding thousands of volumes of poems and books, literary arts, rituals, and music.\n{Ina:} Is this the motto of Archbishop Yingluck?","这里似乎是后门，但是无法打开。\n\n木板上写了两行文字：\n\n百姓父母 税法兵政只手握\n万卷诗书 文术礼乐一心通\n\n{伊娜：}这难道是英拉大主教的座右铭？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nThis time I got 1 dragon fly.","这次得到了1个龙蝇。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTianchi Mounta","天池山创世坛"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTo the east is a dense forest.","东边是一片密林。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTo the east leads to Shensha Lake, where boats are not feasible.","向东通往沉沙湖，湖上不可行船。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTomb thief.","盗墓贼。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTribute day.","贡礼日。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nTry to get out.","设法脱身。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUncle Charlie Boutique Shoe Shop","查理大叔精品鞋店"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnderstand geography.","了解地理。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnexplainable problem.","无法解释的问题。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnfortunately, your answer is wrong. However, I will give you a participation award as an encouragement.","很遗憾，你的答案不对。\n不过，还是给你一个参与奖，作为鼓励。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnfortunately, your answer is wrong. However, I will give you a participation award as encouragement.","很遗憾，你的答案不对。\n不过，还是给你一个参与奖，作为鼓励。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnknown enemy.","不明敌情。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnknown place.","未知的地方。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nUnpopular topics.","不受欢迎的话题。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nVillage Chief's House","村长家"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nVillage of Ain","艾拉尔村"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nVision Guard","幻像卫士"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nVisit the Elar Church.","拜访艾拉尔教堂。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWangxiang stone.","望乡石。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWanling Point. The explorer enters with caution.","万灵穴。\n探险者慎入。"},
