 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWhen a group of centaur saw Ina and others, they immediately glared at each other.\n{Centaur:} Outsider! It's an outsider again!\n{Ina:} \"Yes again\", \"Foreigner\"? What does it mean?\n{Centaur:} Since you outsiders appeared, we Fendinia have all changed! All our peaceful lives have disappeared!\n{Ina:} Wait, where does this start? We are here for the first time...\n{Centaur:} I know we are getting irritable now, but this was forced by you! We want to drive away you outsiders!\n{Ina:} Hey, why do you do it before you figure it out, wait...","一群半人马看到伊娜等人，立即怒目相向。\n{半人马：}外来人！又是外来人！\n{伊娜：}“又是”，“外来人”？这是什么意思？\n{半人马：}自从你们外来人出现以后，我们芬迪尼亚全变了！我们从前宁静的生活全部消失了！\n{伊娜：}等等，这话从何说起呀，我们是第一次来耶……\n{半人马：}我知道我们现在也变得暴躁了，但这是被你们逼的！我们要赶走你们这些外来人！\n{伊娜：}喂，怎么还没弄明白就动手呀，等等……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWhen a group of wolves saw Ina coming, they rushed forward with a fierce face.\n{Jackal A:} Human! Human again!\n{Jackal B:} It was they who took our goods just now and took it back!\n{Ina:} Hey, I said, you are wrong, it has nothing to do with me, did the Balland army do it?\n{Jackal A:} Don't lie to us, you are all humans, aren't you all in the same group?\n{Ina:} I'm not in the same group with them, listen to my explanation, Mr. Werewolf...\n{Jackal B:} Wrong! We are not wolfman (wolfman), we are gnoll (gnoll), we and werewolf are completely different races! Your translation is too bad!\n{Ina:} Huh? Is that so? Let me take notes...\n{Jackal Man A:} The hateful human beings have snatched things from us and insulted us by saying the wrong race. Unforgivable! Come on, brothers, give her a beating!\n{Ina:} Hold on, listen to me... The jackals could not help but attack.","一队豺狼人看到伊娜过来，面露凶光扑了上来。\n{豺狼人A：}人类！又是人类！\n{豺狼人B：}刚才就是他们抢走了我们的货物，抢回来！\n{伊娜：}喂，那个我说，你们搞错了吧，跟我没关系啊，是不是巴兰德军干的？\n{豺狼人A：}别骗我们了，你们都是人类，还不都是一伙的？\n{伊娜：}我跟他们不是一伙的啊，听我解释，狼人先生……\n{豺狼人B：}错了！我们不是狼人（wolfman），我们是豺狼人（gnoll），我们跟狼人完全是不同的种族！你的翻译太差了！\n{伊娜：}唉？这样啊？我笔记下来……\n{豺狼人A：}可恶的人类，又抢我们东西，又说错我们的种族来侮辱我们，不可饶恕！兄弟们上，饱揍她一顿！\n{伊娜：}且慢动手，听我说啊……\n豺狼人们不由分说攻了上来。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWhile defeating the last demon, Ina was knocked out by the opponent's attack and fell to the ground head-on.\n{Rael:} Ah, Ina! Are you ok?\n{Freeman:} No reaction at all...\n{Rael:} Ina, wake up!\n{Voice:} I finally knocked you down.\n{Freeman:} Are you, Ladia?\n{Radia:} That's right. I follow your actions and set up an ambush here just to avenge the defeat.\n{Ina:} So that's how it is.\n{Rael:} Ina? you're awake? Are you okay?\n{Radia:} How come? Haven't you been knocked down just now?\n{Ina:} It's fake. Jack said before that it would be great if he could attract people who set up ambushes. I thought that if he pretended to be knocked down, he might be able to succeed.\n{Radia:} You are so despicable that you lied to me in this way...\n{Ina:} Don’t call the thief to catch the thief, okay, you use the ambush to plot against us, it seems to be very upright. Or, let's have a one-to-one contest right now, and we are divided up and down, and no one is allowed to make insidious tricks. How about?\n{Radia:} Okay, just as I wish.","打倒最后一个恶魔的同时，伊娜被对方的攻击击飞出去，倒栽葱一般地摔在地上。\n\n{雷尔：}啊，伊娜！不要紧吧？\n{弗里曼：}完全没有反应……\n{雷尔：}伊娜，你醒醒！\n{声音：}我终于把你打倒了。\n{弗里曼：}你是，拉迪亚？\n{拉迪亚：}没错。我跟踪你们的行动在此设下埋伏，就是为了报上回落败之仇。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样啊。\n{雷尔：}伊娜？你醒了？没事吧？\n{拉迪亚：}怎么会？刚才你不是已经被打倒了吗？\n{伊娜：}假的啦。之前杰克说，如果能把设埋伏的人吸引出来就好了，我想，如果装作被打倒的话，也许能成功。\n{拉迪亚：}你真卑鄙，竟然用这种办法骗我出来……\n{伊娜：}你不要贼喊捉贼好不好，你用伏兵暗算我们倒好像很光明正大似的。要不，我们现在就一对一较量一下，堂堂正正分个高下，谁也不许使阴招，怎么样？\n{拉迪亚：}好啊，正如我所愿。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWhy are there demons?","为什么会有魔族？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\nWidow took a boat from the port in the north. Spin Rodrie walked towards the port to the south. An officer who looked like a subordinate chased after him.\n{Subordinate:} General, where are you going? Let your subordinates bring a team of guards with you.\n{Spain Rodri:} What are you nervous about, you are really shocked by what Widow said. This area is all under the control of our Red Sea Fleet, and there is a checkpoint guard at every interval. Is it easy for the enemy to approach me? If you have free time, go to practice soldiers and be ready to go to war at any time.\n{Sub:} Subordinates will do the training and preparations immediately. But does it really matter that the general is alone?\n{Spain Rodri:} If I told you to go to Windward Mountain alone, would you dare to go?\n{Subordinates:} Subordinates go through fire and water for the generals, what's not to dare.\n{Spain Rodri:} Since you dare, why don't I dare, do you think I'm inferior to you?\n{Subordinates:} Subordinates know their mistakes.\n{Spain Rodri:} Well, you can do what you should do, don't worry about me. To be honest, my motorboat is fast and you can't keep up with me, so it's no use to follow it. And {Yangfengshan Fengshen Altar} only I can enter.\n{Subordinate:} Could the general go to divination?\n{Spain Rodri:} Of course. Remember how we got the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" last time? It was after I went to divination to get a rough position, and then I dispatched the fleet to salvage it. Otherwise, where to fish in the vast ocean. Since there are still 7 parts left this time, it is of course the easiest to find Fengshen for divination.\n{Subordinate:} Hmm. It's rare that Victor was so polite this time, letting the general take the shot first, then of course we are not polite.\n{Spain Rodri:} Do you really think he is polite? He must have gone to find another component of the \"Sword of Destruction\" \"Blue Thunder Ring\" first. But that's all, let him go. As long as we get all the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", it will definitely be better than him. You are here on standby. Once I get the results of the divination, I will organize the fleet to set off.\n{Ina:} Good opportunity, now he is acting alone. However, what is the \"Blue Thunder Ring\", another component of the \"Sword of Destruction\" they just mentioned?\n{Freeman:} Not sure, but it also seems to be a very important thing.\n{Rael:} Maybe it is a treasure as important as the \"Red Star Sword\" and the \"Purple Spirit Shield\"? Now the target has increased again, which side shall we deal with first?\n{Ina:} Of course, I was trying to get the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" first. Taking advantage of the fact that Spann Rodri is alone now, the opportunity is rare. Let's follow, and try to stop him on the road. As for the \"green thunder ring\", {wait until we kill Spann} {Rodri}, and then follow the road that Widow took just now, {walk the northern port} to track it down.","维多从北边的港口乘船走了。斯拜恩罗德里朝南边的港口走去。一个看似部下模样的军官追了上去。\n\n{部下：}将军，您要去哪里？属下带一队卫兵和您一起去吧。\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}紧张个什么，你们真被维多那一席话给吓到了啊。这边一带全部是我们赤海舰队的控制范围，每隔一段就有一个关卡守卫，敌军有那么容易接近我吗？你要是有空闲，去操练士兵去，随时准备出战。\n{部下：}操练和备战的事，属下马上就去办。不过将军独自一人真的不要紧吗？\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}如果我叫你独自去一趟迎风山，你敢不敢去？\n{部下：}属下为将军赴汤蹈火，有什么不敢的。\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}既然你都敢，为什么我不敢，莫非你是觉得我不如你？\n{部下：}属下知错。\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}好了，你干你该干的事去吧，不用操心我这边。说实话，我的摩托艇速度快，你们也跟不上我，所以跟了也白搭。而且{迎风山风神坛}只有我一个人能进去。\n{部下：}将军莫非是去占卜？\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}当然。还记得上次我们怎么捞到“龙牙项链”的吗？就是我去占卜后得到了大致的位置，然后才出动舰队打捞到。要不然茫茫大海上哪捞去。这一回既然还要找剩下7个部件，当然是再去找风神占卜一下最容易了。\n{部下：}嗯。难得维多这回居然那么客气，让将军先出手，那么我们当然不客气了。\n{斯拜恩罗德里：}你们真以为他是客气？他肯定是自己先去找“毁灭之剑”的另一个部件“青雷环”了。不过也罢，随他去吧。我们只要把“龙王神力”全部弄到手，肯定比他功劳大。你就在这里待命，一旦我占卜得到了结果，就组织舰队出发。\n\n{伊娜：}好机会啊，现在他单独行动了。不过，他们刚才说的“毁灭之剑”的另一个部件“青雷环”，又是什么？\n{弗里曼：}不清楚，不过看起来也是个很重要的东西。\n{雷尔：}也许是个跟“赤星剑”，“紫灵盾”一样重要的宝物？这下目标又增加了，我们先对付哪一边？\n{伊娜：}当然是先争取弄到“龙牙项链”了。趁着现在那个斯拜恩罗德里是一个人，机会难得。我们跟上去吧，争取在路上把他截住。至于“青雷环”的事情，{等我们干掉了斯拜恩}\n{罗德里}，再跟着刚才维多走的那条路，{走北边的港口}过去追查。\n\n\n\n"},
