 {"ira-the-mage-3\nZombies are floating on the water. When the ship passed by, the zombie suddenly moved and climbed onto the hull.\n{Ina:} Hey, who are you, so disgusting, so swollen from blisters.\n{Zombies:} PInates~~~~~~~~\n{Ina:} We are not pinates, hello, will you go down?\n{Zombies:} PInates~~~~~~~~\n{Ina:} Although you are also victims, but I'm really sorry, I have to ask you to get off the boat. The pinates have been wiped out, so rest in peace.","水上浮着僵尸。船只经过时，僵尸突然动了起来，攀住船体爬了上来。\n{伊娜：}喂喂，你们是谁啊，好恶心，被水泡得这么肿。\n{僵尸：}海盗~~~~~~~~\n{伊娜：}我们不是海盗啦，喂，你们下去好不好？\n{僵尸：}海盗~~~~~~~~\n{伊娜：}虽然你们也是受害者，不过真的对不住，我得请你们下船哦。海盗已经被消灭了，你们安息吧。"},
