 {"ira-the-mage-3\nefreet: Why is even me called a wizard... genie: Don't listen to them, we belong to the gods, gods! Otherwise, if you are called the fire spirit, I wi","efreet：为什么连我也被叫成精灵了……\ngenie：别听他们胡叫，我们是属于神灵的，神灵！要不然你叫火精灵我还叫蓝精灵了不成，不！我不想跟格格乌扯上关系！"},
