 {"ira-the-mage-3\nwight: I am a ghost. wraith: I am. specter: You are not as high as me. Shade: You are just my inferior form. gespenst: I haven't spoken yet, what are ","wight：我是幽灵。\nwraith：我才是。\nspecter：你们不如我出现率高。\nshade：你们都只是我的下级形态。\ngespenst：我还没发话，你们争个啥？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{A group of little ghosts:} Some humans have come here, hey, you guys, this is the territory of Lord Kairon, if you don't want to die, leave all your belongings!\n{Roland:} I was looking for the beast of Kairon.\n{Boy:} Ah, there are actually angels, it's not good...\n{Roland:} You group of minions, following Kairon and doing a lot of evil, I won't let you go.","{一群小鬼：}有人类闯到这里来啦，喂，你们几个，这里是凯隆大人的地盘，不想死的话，把财物都留下！\n{罗兰：}我找的就是凯隆那个畜生。\n{小鬼：}啊，居然还有天使，不好……\n{罗兰：}你们这群爪牙，跟着凯隆作恶多端，我也不会放过你们。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{A voice comes from above:} Is this lady Ina? As soon as Ina looked up, an angel was looking at Ina holding a drawing.\n{Ina:} I am Ina, may I ask you?\n{Angel:} I finally found it! I am the angel Roland. The hermit Mengying asked me to come to you and drew a portrait of you. But I followed the picture all the way and asked dozens of girls if they weren't...\n{Rael:} Mengying's portrait, this, I thought of the Eternal Orb she painted at the time, which made it difficult for us to find. Let's see what her picture of Ina looks like.\n{Roland:} Look, it looks like this, right? Portrait on the drawing: (^_^)\n{Ina:} As expected...","{一个声音从头顶上方传来：}请问这位小姐是伊娜吗？\n伊娜一抬头，一个天使手持一张图纸正在端详着伊娜。\n{伊娜：}我就是伊娜，请问你是？\n{天使：}终于让我找到了！我是天使罗兰。隐士梦影让我来找你，还画了一张你的肖像图。可是我照着图一路寻找，问了几十个姑娘都不是……\n{雷尔：}梦影画的肖像，这个，我想到了当时她画的永恒之球也让我们找得好苦。让我们看看她画的伊娜是什么样子。\n{罗兰：}你们看，就是这个样子，没错吧。\n图纸上的画像：(^_^)\n{伊娜：}果然……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Alan:} Everyone must be hungry. Let's go to the restaurant to eat something first. follow me.\n{Ina:} Good clean restaurant, awesome.\n{Alan:} Whatever you like to eat, just pick it.\n{Ina:} Hey, why are these dishes not priced? I don't know the price, how can I pick it.\n{Alan:} No money. This is what makes our Magic Sakura Village unique. Everything you need for life, food, clothing, and housing, without money. Everyone works consciously, and the results of labor are distributed according to needs. We no longer need money, a sinful and corrupt thing.\n{Ina:} It's so good, then I'm not welcome. That being said, it's really good to live here.\n{Alan:} Yes, there is no oppression, no exploitation, everyone treats each other as equals, respects each other, and lives a life that everyone can satisfy. Is there anything better than this? Have you changed your mind now?\n{Ina:} Although life here is very good, I still have very important things to do. I can't stay.\n{Allen:} That's good, I'll continue to take you around after eating.","{阿伦：}大家一定饿了吧。我们先到餐馆去吃点东西。跟我来。\n{伊娜：}好干净的餐馆，真棒。\n{阿伦：}你喜欢吃些什么，尽管挑。\n{伊娜：}咦，怎么这些菜都没有标价钱的？不知道价钱多少，我怎么挑呢。\n{阿伦：}不用钱。这就是我们幻樱乡与众不同的地方。一切生活所需，吃，穿，住，都不用钱。大家自觉工作，劳动成果按需分配，钱这种罪恶腐败的东西我们不再需要它。\n{伊娜：}这么好啊，那我就不客气了哦。这么说来，在这里居住确实相当不错耶。\n{阿伦：}是啊，这里没有欺压，没有剥削，大家平等相待，相互尊重，过着让每一个人都能满足的生活，还有比这更好的吗？你现在改变主意了吗？\n{伊娜：}虽然这里的生活是很好，不过，我还有很重要的事情必须去做。我不能留下来。\n{阿伦：}那好，吃完了我继续带你走走。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Alan:} This is our factory. People with technical experience work here. Just work 6 hours a day. Of course, other people will also work in farmland, fishery and other places according to their own specialties.\n{Ina:} Does no one be lazy?\n{Alan:} Being lazy? There is no such word in our dictionary. People who come here will soon be assimilated by everyone and abide by the order here. Why do you want to be lazy? Work is in line with your own interests and specialties, and the results of work are also your own pleasure. Isn’t it a joy to see that you have achieved so many results after a day’s work? Why do you want to be lazy to reduce the results of your work?\n{Ina:} It's so enviable that everyone knows this way.\n{Alan:} So, have you decided to stay now?\n{Ina:} But, I really still have very important things that I must do. I am so sorry.\n{Alan:} It’s okay, we won’t force it, I believe you will forget other so-called important things and stay voluntarily. Ah, by the way, you still don't want to go to the south. It is the \"Pool of All Souls\", a forbidden place, and we never dared to approach it.\n{Ina:} Why don't you dare to come near?\n{Alan:} I don't know, but the seniors have said not to go there.\n{Ina:} Are you not an explorer? You should be interested in novel things, right?\n{Alan:} As the saying goes, \"curiosity killed a hell dog.\" Now that I have such a fulfilling and prosperous life, what risks should I explore? Who knows whether the expedition will succeed or fail, and whether I will lose anything. Compared with this, it is better to be content with the life in front of me. Adventure or something, I don't need it anymore.\n{Ina:} However, with the magician's keen sense, I always feel that there is something abnormal there. I want to see what happened. You don't need to accompany me, I will go by myself.\n{Allen:} Okay, then we will say goodbye. If you decide to stay at any time, you can come to me again at any time.","{阿伦：}这里是我们的工厂。有技工经验的人在这里工作。每天工作6小时即可。当然其他人也会根据自己的特长在农田，渔场等地工作。\n{伊娜：}没有人会偷懒吗？\n{阿伦：}偷懒？我们的字典里没有这样的词。来到这里的人很快就会被大家同化，遵守这里的秩序。为什么要偷懒呢，工作都是符合自己的兴趣和特长的，工作的劳动成果也是自己的乐趣。一天工作下来，能看到自己有那么多成果，不是一件值得高兴的事情吗？为什么要偷懒让自己的工作成果减少呢？\n{伊娜：}大家都能这样认识，真是太让人羡慕了。\n{阿伦：}所以，你现在决定留下来了吗？\n{伊娜：}但是，我真的还有很重要的事，是必须要做的呢。真的不好意思。\n{阿伦：}没关系，我们不会强求，我相信你会有忘记其他所谓重要的事而自愿留下来的时候。啊，对了，再往南边的地方，你还是不要去了，那里是“万灵池”，是禁忌之地，我们从来不敢靠近的。\n{伊娜：}为什么不敢靠近呢？\n{阿伦：}我也不知道，只是前辈们都说那里不要去。\n{伊娜：}你不是探险家吗？应该对新奇的东西感兴趣才对吧？\n{阿伦：}俗话说，“好奇心害死一只地狱犬”。现在我有如此充实富足的生活，还要探什么险呢，谁知道探险会成功还是失败，会不会失去什么，与此相比，还是安于眼前的生活更好。探险什么的，我不再需要了。\n{伊娜：}不过，凭着魔法师的敏锐感觉，我总觉得那里有些什么不正常的气味。我想去看个究竟。你不用陪我了，我自己去。\n{阿伦：}好吧，那么我们就此暂别。如果你什么时候决定留下了，随时可以再来找我。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Allen:} In front of us is the famous scenic spot \"Moryl Zoo\" in Huan Ying Township. The designer of this zoo is Mr. Mend, who is in charge of urban planning. It is said that in this zoo {hiding the map of the secret treasure of the magic cherry town}. We don't know if the legend is true or false, but we are not interested in what secret treasures are at all.\n{Ina:} Yes, I don’t even need money, so what secret treasures do I need.\n{Alan:} There are many dragons in this zoo. Although dragons are generally ferocious animals, here, they have also become very docile. You can go and have a look, it doesn't matter if you touch your head.","{阿伦：}前面是我们幻樱乡著名的景点“摩莉尔动物园”了。这个动物园的设计者就是负责城市规划的门德先生。据说，这个动物园里{隐藏着幻樱乡秘宝的地图}呢。我们也不知道传说是真是假，不过我们对什么秘宝是一点都没有兴趣。\n{伊娜：}也是啊，连钱都不需要，还要什么秘宝呢。\n{阿伦：}这动物园里饲养着许多龙哦。虽然龙一般是凶恶的动物，不过，在这里，他们也已经变得很温顺了。你可以去看看，摸摸头也不要紧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Army:} Find the Ina congregation, kill!\n{Ina:} Come on, not afraid of you.","{军队：}发现伊娜众，杀！\n{伊娜：}来吧，不怕你们。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Aron:} Remember me? I am Aron, the craftsman. I moved to Kozia to settle down. I'm still doing my old business and opening a blacksmith shop. I hope everyone will take care of my business.","{阿隆：}还记得我吗？我是工匠阿隆。我搬到科齐亚来定居啦，还是干我的老本行，开个铁匠铺，望大家多关照关照我的生意啊。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Aron:} This is my workshop. If you have all the wood, take it here. I'll help you make your \"Mountain Bike\".","{阿隆：}这里就是我的车间，如果凑齐了木材，就拿到这里来吧，我帮你们制作“攀山车”。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Aron:} Well, this is the \"Mountain Climbing Bike\". I wish you victory and annihilation of thieves.","{阿隆：}好了，这就是“攀山车”。祝你们旗开得胜，消灭盗贼。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Arrow:} His Royal Highness Prince Freeman, we are unwilling to be the slaves of Archbishop Yingluck. We have fled here. Please let us join.","{箭手：}弗里曼王子殿下，我们不愿意做英拉大主教的奴仆，逃到了这里，请让我们加入吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Auntie Anne:} Did I say that, Auntie, Ina won't accept it?","{安妮大婶：}难道大婶我这么说，伊娜酱还不肯收？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Barland Guard:} This leads to Nanling Pass. No one can pass without the {pass} of Captain Rudd.","{巴兰德军守卫：}这里通向南岭关，没有鲁德大队长的{通行证}，任何人不得通过。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Barrand Army:} Ah, it's not good, even General Dido has been defeated, let's run away. The Barland army stationed at Nanling Pass began to abandon the pass and escape, and was defeated.\n{Ina:} There were so many people just now, and there were not many left so fast.\n{Jack:} So just to take back Nanling Pass in one effort. The remaining enemy troops are few.\n{Ina:} But, there was a strange thing just now, why can't I cast lightning magic?\n{Rael:} Because in this {cursed land} where the bones are piled, the man's magic power will be eroded by the corpse energy, so that {only a minimum of one} {level magic} can be cast. High-level magic including \"lightning\" cannot be cast.\n{Ina:} It turns out that there is such a thing, so let me know sooner. Take notes.","{巴兰德军：}啊，不好了，连迪多将军都被打败了，我们还是快逃吧。\n\n驻守在南岭关的巴兰德军开始弃关逃跑，溃不成军。\n\n{伊娜：}刚才还那么多人，这么快就跑得不剩几个了。\n{杰克：}那么正好一鼓作气把南岭关收回。残余的敌军为数不多了。\n{伊娜：}不过，刚才有个奇怪的事情，为什么我没有办法施放闪电魔法呢？\n{雷尔：}因为在这尸骨成堆的{诅咒之地}上，人的魔力会被尸气侵蚀，以至于{只能施放最低限度的一}\n{级魔法}。而包括“闪电”在内的高级魔法均无法施放。\n{伊娜：}原来还有这样的事情，不早告诉我。笔记笔记。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Barrand Army:} How many of you, which department?\n{Ina:} We are the 9th squad, and we came back to report after our reconnaissance mission.\n{Barrand Army:} Then you go quickly. {Captain Rudd} is waiting for your information.\n{Ina:} Ah, sorry, this, I forgot the position of Captain Rudd...\n{Barand Army:} Fool! Going {southeast} will arrive soon. Okay, go ahead.","{巴兰德军：}你们几个，哪个部门的？\n{伊娜：}我们是第9小队，执行完侦察任务回来报告了。\n{巴兰德军：}那么你们快去吧。{鲁德大队长}正在等着你们的情报呢。\n{伊娜：}啊，不好意思，这个，我忘了鲁德大队长的方位了……\n{巴兰德军：}笨蛋！往{东南方向}很快就到了。好了快去吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Black Dragon Guard:} We are here to guard the hostages on the order of Lord Solo. Want to save people? no way!","{黑龙守卫：}我们奉索罗大人的命令在此看守人质。想救人？没门！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Black Tiger Agent A:} Although I can't beat you, as long as I can buy time for Archbishop Yingluck, it is enough. Long live Archbishop Yingluck! ~~~~~~~~~","{黑虎特工队员A：}虽然我赢不了你，但是只要能为英拉大主教争取时间就够了。英拉大主教万岁！~~~~~~~~~"},
