 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Black Warrior:} Who? Actually broke into here?\n{Ina:} Ah, this costume, I seem to have seen it somewhere, I flipped through my notes...\n{Freeman:} It's the \"Black Tiger Agent Team\"!\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be them, the minions of Archbishop Yingluck!\n{Rael:} It seems that the conjecture behind the scenes is Archbishop Yingluck is correct.\n{Warrior in black:} Oh, it turns out that His Royal Highness Prince Freeman is also there. What a coincidence. Although I don't know how you defeated the monster guarding outside and came here, anyway, you are the ones we are going to catch. Since they are here, it doesn't matter whether you are dead or alive. Pull the archbishop.","{黑衣武士：}什么人？居然闯进这里来？\n{伊娜：}啊，这服装，好像在哪里见过，我翻翻笔记啊……\n{弗里曼：}是“黑虎特工队”！\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是他们啊，英拉大主教的爪牙！\n{雷尔：}看来，幕后主使是英拉大主教的猜想是正确的啊。\n{黑衣武士：}哟，原来弗里曼王子殿下也在啊，真是太巧了。虽然不知道你们是怎么打败外面守卫的怪物闯进这里来的，不过反正你们是我们要抓的人，既然送上门来了，嘿嘿嘿，是死是活都不要紧，收拾了你们去献给英拉大主教。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Broadcast:} Welcome to Star Wish Mountain University to participate in the four-year event \"Snow Love Cup\" academic conference. Members and guests who have not yet entered the venue please hurry up and enter the venue. Visitors who come to watch the copy, please look for seats in front of the big screen in the square, and we will broadcast live events in the venue for you in real time. Please follow the order, walk slowly, don't make noise, don't make noise, don't litter everywhere. Friends who need a drink can buy it at the canteen on the south side of the square.","{广播：}欢迎来到星愿山大学参加四年一度的盛会“雪恋杯”学术大会。现在还没有入场的会员及嘉宾请抓紧时间进入会场。前来观摹的游客请在广场大屏幕前寻找座位，我们会即时为您直播会场内的动态。请大家遵守秩序，稳步慢行，勿吵闹，勿喧哗，勿随地乱丢垃圾。有需要饮料的朋友可到广场南边小卖部购买。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Brother Youni:} Look, there is the pig head family, ah no, the mansion of the Li Qide family.\n{Ina:} What a majestic building...\n{Freeman:} It is worthy of being a rich man. The residence is more luxurious than the palace.\n{Rael:} To be honest, I have never seen such a luxurious building in Ariana.\n{Brother Uni:} Then our brothers will say goodbye here. Next, just go to the front door lobby and find Mr. Butler directly.\n{Ina:} Got it, thank you.","{尤尼兄：}看，那边的就是猪头世家，啊不，李奇德家族的豪宅了。\n{伊娜：}好雄伟的建筑啊……\n{弗里曼：}不愧是大富豪，住宅比王宫还豪华。\n{雷尔：}老实说，我在亚利安尼亚都从没见过这么奢华的建筑。\n{尤尼兄：}那么到这里我们兄弟就告辞了。下面你们去前门大厅直接找管家先生就好。\n{伊娜：}知道了，谢谢你们。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Bruno:} Ah~~~~~~\n{Ina:} You bastard general, I won.\n{Bruno:} Hmph, don't think you can retreat all over after you beat me. In {Kozia City} I have already deployed a heavy army, and there is no possibility for you to break through! Long live Archbishop Yingluck~~~~~ Bruno finished shouting slogans, vomiting blood and fell to the ground.\n{Ina:} Is that just dead? But why is the black fog still lingering... Rael, how is Rael?\n{Freeman:} Fortunately, I bandaged it, but I lost too much blood.\n{Rael:} I'm fine, just win.\n{Ina:} Thank you, Rael. I was supposed to help you find the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", but you were saved... I'm really useless...\n{Rael:} Don't say that, we have been able to go all the way to the present, we have been relying on you help. Don't worry, I'm fine.\n{Freeman:} You might as well rest here for a few days.\n{Ina:} What about you?\n{Freeman:} I must go to Kozia City. Archbishop Yingluck has discovered our intentions, and if he does not go, he will definitely increase troops.\n{Ina:} I want to go too. How can you let you go on an adventure alone.\n{Rael:} Yes, hurry to Kozia City, without further ado...\n{Freeman:} Mr. Rael!\n{Rael:} It's okay, let's go.","{布里诺：}啊~~~~~~\n{伊娜：}你这个混蛋将军，我赢了哦。\n{布里诺：}哼，别以为胜过了我你们就可以全身而退。{科齐亚城}里我已经布下了重兵，你们没有可能突破的！英拉大主教万岁~~~~~\n\n布里诺喊完口号，口吐鲜血倒地。\n\n{伊娜：}就这么死了吗？可是为什么那些黑雾还是挥之不去……雷尔，雷尔怎么样了？\n{弗里曼：}还好，我给包扎了一下，但是失血太多了。\n{雷尔：}我没事，赢了就好。\n{伊娜：}谢谢你，雷尔。本来应该是我帮你去寻找“龙王神力”，结果反到被你救了……我真没用……\n{雷尔：}别这么说，我们能一路走到现在，一直都是靠你的帮助。别担心，我没事的。\n{弗里曼：}你们不如在这里休息几日吧。\n{伊娜：}那么你呢？\n{弗里曼：}我一定要去科齐亚城。英拉大主教已经发现了我们的意图，如果再不去，他一定还会增兵的。\n{伊娜：}我也要去。怎么能让你一个人去冒险。\n{雷尔：}对，赶紧去科齐亚城，事不宜迟……\n{弗里曼：}雷尔先生！\n{雷尔：}没关系，走吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Canteen:} Cool and refreshing, \"Everything is Happy\" brand well spring water, 200 gold coins per bottle.","{小卖部：}清凉爽口，“万事可喜”牌井泉水，每瓶200金币。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Canteen:} How about a bottle?","{小卖部：}怎么样，来一瓶？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Captain Chaser:} Found it, those fools who fled, kill!\n{Ina:} If you want to kill them, pass me first.\n{Captain Chaser:} Who are you? No matter who it is, kill it together!","{追兵队长：}找到了，那些逃跑的愚民，杀！\n{伊娜：}想杀他们，先过我这一关。\n{追兵队长：}你是谁？不管是谁，一起杀了！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Captain Chaser:} Kill all those foolish people who ran away!\n{Ina:} Don't think about it, I won't let you hurt them.\n{Captain Chaser:} An unknown armed? Looks like a bit of strength...\n{Ina:} I understand that it is still too late, if I can, I don't want to do it with you.\n{Captain Chaser:} Hmph, even if you can't beat you, you must first kill those foolish people!","{追兵队长：}杀光那些逃跑的愚民！\n{伊娜：}休想，我不会让你们伤到他们的。\n{追兵队长：}一支不明武装？看起来有点实力的样子……\n{伊娜：}现在明白还来得及，可以的话我不想跟你动手。\n{追兵队长：}哼，就算不能打赢你，也要先把那些愚民杀掉！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Caveman:} Then you take me to where you find the way.","{洞穴人：}那么你们带我去你们要找路的地方吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Chasing soldiers:} Look, there is a team in front of them, yes they are! kill!\n{Ina:} Did you slaughter those unarmed people? I was just trying to clean up you guys.","{追兵：}看，前面有队人马，没错就是他们！杀！\n{伊娜：}就是你们对那些手无寸铁的人屠杀的吗？我正想清理你们呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Chess:} Welcome to Sifang Chess Academy.\n{Ina:} Sifang Chess Court? Where did you hear this name...\n{Chess:} Our Sifang Chess Academy is the most authoritative Go organization on the mainland of Mirronia. It is impossible for anyone who plays Go to know Sifangqiyuan. The name of the Sifang Chess Academy not only represents the square shape of the chess board, but also represents the central position of our chess academy gathering elites from all over the mainland.\n{Ina:} Come to think of it, my grandpa said it. Grandpa used to like to play Go. He taught me a little bit before, but I can't do it at all.\n{Chess:} Since this young lady has also learned some Go, how about joining our chess school?\n{Ina:} This... forget it, I have other important things to do, not to mention that I'm very skilled, maybe not as good as an amateur.\n{Chess:} It doesn't matter, we also have many beginners here. Let's study and study together and promote each other. Or, the young lady might as well visit the tour first, and then make a decision. How about? I am Lin Yu in the early stage, please advise me more.\n{Ina:} This is Ina, please advise.","{棋士：}欢迎光临四方棋院。\n{伊娜：}四方棋院？这个名字好像在哪听过……\n{棋士：}我们四方棋院可是米尔罗尼亚大陆上最权威的围棋机构了。凡是下围棋的人不可能不知道四方棋院。四方棋院其名，既代表了棋盘的四方形状，又代表了我们棋院集聚全大陆四方精英的中心地位。\n{伊娜：}想起来啦，我爷爷说过呢。爷爷以前挺喜欢下围棋的，以前他教过我一点，不过我完全不行呢。\n{棋士：}既然这位小姐也学过一些围棋，不如加入我们棋院如何？\n{伊娜：}这个……还是算了啦，我还有其他重要的事情要做呢，何况我水平很菜的，可能连业余的业余都不如。\n{棋士：}没关系，我们这里也有很多初学者的。大家一起研究学习，相互促进嘛。或者，小姐不如先参观参观，再作决定，如何？我是林羽初段，请多指教。\n{伊娜：}我是伊娜，请多指教。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Chief Security Officer:} Haven't caught the thief yet? Or did not recover the stolen goods?\n{Ina:} Not yet...give me some more time.","{安防长：}还没有抓回窃贼吗？或者没有追回赃物？\n{伊娜：}还没……再给我点时间吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Chief Security Officer:} This is the courtroom. If you catch a thief, bring it in.","{安防长：}这里是审判室，抓到了窃贼就带进来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Child A:} Look at the two guys who came over there.\n{Child B:} Just hit them.\n{Child A:} You must not be as accurate as me.\n{Child B:} Cut, don't speak big words, we bibi. So the two children hit Ina and Rael with stones.\n{Ina:} Hey, kid, how to throw stones at passers-by, it's dangerous!\n{Child A:} Hit him!\n{Child B:} See who hits first!\n{Ina:} Stop it, you guys!","{小孩A：}看那边过来的那2个家伙。\n{小孩B：}就打他们了。\n{小孩A：}你肯定没我打得准。\n{小孩B：}切，别说大话，我们比比。\n于是2个小孩拿石子朝伊娜和雷尔打过来。\n{伊娜：}喂，小鬼，怎么向路人扔石子啊，很危险的！\n{小孩A：}打他！\n{小孩B：}看谁先打中！\n{伊娜：}你们给我住手！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Child A:} Ouch, sorry, next time we dare not.\n{Child B:} Forgive us.\n{Ina:} You are too naughty. Do you know that this is dangerous? What if you hurt a passerby and die?\n{Child A:} We didn't think so much, but just thought it was fun...\n{Child B:} We all blame him for suggesting that he beats someone more accurately.\n{Child A:} Nonsense, I didn't suggest, I just said that I played more accurately than you.\n{Child B:} Isn't that the same thing?\n{Ina:} Okay, stop arguing, don't do such a dangerous thing next time.\n{Child A&Child B:} Got it.","{小孩A：}哎哟，对不起，下回我们不敢了啦。\n{小孩B：}饶了我们吧。\n{伊娜：}你们太顽皮了，知不知道这样很危险的，要是把路人砸伤了砸死了怎么办？\n{小孩A：}我们没想那么多，只是觉得好玩……\n{小孩B：}都怪他提议比谁打得准的。\n{小孩A：}胡说，我没提议，我只是说我打得比你准。\n{小孩B：}这不是一个意思吗？\n{伊娜：}好了别吵了，下次可千万别干这么危险的事了啊。\n{小孩A&小孩B：}知道了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Children:} Ahahaha, I really hide very badly.","{小朋友：}啊哈哈哈，果然我藏得很蹩脚。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Children:} It's really boring to be found after hiding so well.","{小朋友：}藏得这么好还是被找到了啊，真没劲。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Children:} Oh, I was found.","{小朋友：}哎呀，被找到了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Children:} Sure enough, I was found...","{小朋友：}果然还是被找到了……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Civilian:} The next official is a special envoy sent by Prime Minister Holia, who made a special trip to find Hero Ina...\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm not Ina, you are looking for the wrong person. Ahahaha...\n{Civilian:} This, in fact, there was a little misunderstanding, I'm really very sorry. The official is here to clarify this matter and apologize to you.\n{Freeman:} Misunderstanding? What do you say?\n{Civilian:} All blame the demons for their insidiousness, and spread false news to us, saying that Ina and others are actually members of the demons. We believed it to be true at first, so...\n{Fumanli:} Is this a so-called small misunderstanding? Send an army to hunt down, 100,000 bounty wanted, we almost died...\n{Civilian:} I'm really sorry, we later found out the truth and found that it was a rumor from the demons, and immediately ordered the withdrawal of troops. If you don't dislike it, the Prime Minister invites you to come to {Intasia King City} to gather together, and you will pay a lot of money to thank you.\n{Ina:} I'm not interested in losing money. I'm not the kind of person who sees money open. But we really want to meet with him to make these things clear.\n{Civilian:} That's really an honor. When the news of the official status arrives, then go back first, and report to the Prime Minister as soon as possible so that you can catch the wind.\n{Ina:} So, will we not encounter chase again below?\n{Civilian:} Of course. Don't worry, everyone.\n{Ina:} That's great.\n{Civilian:} The next official will take one step ahead and leave.","{文官：}下官是霍利亚宰相大人派来的特使，专程来找伊娜大侠……\n{伊娜：}啊，我不是伊娜，你找错人了吧。啊哈哈哈……\n{文官：}这个，其实，发生了一点小小的误会，真的非常对不起。下官是专门来澄清这件事，并且向你们道歉的。\n{弗里曼：}误会？这话怎么说？\n{文官：}都怪魔族阴险狡猾，向我们散布了假消息，说伊娜等人其实是魔族一伙的。我们一开始信以为真，所以才……\n{弗曼里：}这就是所谓的小小的误会吗？派大军追杀，10万赏金通缉，我们差点命都没了……\n{文官：}真的很抱歉，我们后来查清了真相，发现是魔族的谣言，马上就下令收兵了。如果各位不嫌弃，宰相大人请各位到{因塔西亚王城}一聚，定当重金赔谢。\n{伊娜：}赔钱什么的我不感兴趣啦，我才不是那种见钱眼开的人。不过我们真的要去见见他，把这些事情说说清楚。\n{文官：}那真是不胜荣幸。下官消息送到了，那么就先回去了，赶早报告宰相大人，好为各位接风。\n{伊娜：}那么，下面我们是不是不会再遇到追杀了？\n{文官：}当然。各位只管放心。\n{伊娜：}那真是太好了。\n{文官：}下官先走一步，告辞。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Clio:} Not bad, it came to me smoothly. It seems that I have to show you my true ability. I will end you personally, it is a reward for you to reach me.","{克里奥：}不错嘛，顺利地到我面前了。看来我得让你看看我的真本事了。亲手由我来了结你，是对你能到达我面前的奖赏。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Curator:} Are you finally willing to transfer the collection to me?\n{Ina:} Since you are a collector, then I also want to see if you really have a lot of research in this area. It would be a pity if you give good things to collectors who don't know the goods.\n{Curator:} That's right. Then please show me the collection.\n{Ina:} Do you recognize these two things?\n{Curator:} Let me see... Ah, the young lady is really good. Listen to me in detail. This bowl is \"Long Xiangtian's chess bowl\". Judging from the degree of weathering on the surface of the bowl, it is not very old, it should be a replica. However, although it is a replica, it is by no means ordinary. The casting seal of the Sifang Chess Academy at the bottom of this bowl is accompanied by a plum blossom signature of teacher Long Xiangtian. They are all hand-carved, very delicate, from this craftsmanship. Judging from it, it must have come from the hand of the most famous seal engraver, Kang Tiande. This chess bowl is definitely a rare treasure. Besides, this golden armor is quite old. The \"Silver Winged Flying Eagle\" above is the clan emblem of the ancient hero Aoling. It is quite difficult to imitate the Silver Winged Flying Eagle, let alone a few hundred years ago. The ancient blasphemy heroes had to be copied and cut, so this armor was undoubtedly the authentic piece worn by Aoling. The most important thing is that there is a depression on the left chest. This is the honor armor worn by Aoling at the celebration party after the victory of the third Laval battle. That time, he was mixed in by a hostile assassin. A cold arrow was placed on the chest, which left this dent. The ceremonial armor is not often worn out like the battle armor, so it was originally made very few, and even fewer have been circulated to this day, not to mention that this is the golden armor that once saved Aoling's life. Therefore, this golden armor is unique in its extraordinary historical significance.\n{Ina:} Wow, it's really amazing. Just by observing, you can tell so many detailed evidences. You are really amazing.\n{Curator:} It's nothing. This is just a little bit of experience from my decades of collecting cultural relics. What price does Miss intend to transfer these two pieces to me?\n{Ina:} Since the curator has so much research on the collection of cultural relics, give it to the curator. I'm a magician, and I often have to fight people. Such precious things may become ashes when I keep carrying them on my body. It's better to put them here, Mr. Curator, to better play their value.\n{Curator:} This, how am I embarrassed. No, I can't accept it in vain, you wait, I will find a treasure to exchange with you. Please accept this thing. It was bought from a hunter before and obtained from the unicorn in the Valley of the Beasts. It is said to have a magical effect. But this is not a cultural relic. It is a waste to put it on my side, so please accept it.","{馆长：}终于愿意把藏品转让给我了吗？\n{伊娜：}既然你是收藏家，那么我也要看看你是不是真的对这方面很有研究。如果把好东西给了不识货的收藏家，那就太可惜了。\n{馆长：}说得是。那么请小姐把藏品拿出来给我看看。\n{伊娜：}这两件东西，你是不是认得呢？\n{馆长：}我看看……啊，小姐果然是出手不凡。听我详细说来。这个碗，是“龙翔天的棋碗”，从碗表面的风化程度来看，年代不算很久远，应该是个复制品。不过，虽然是复制品，却绝不一般，这碗底下的四方棋院的铸印，旁边还有一个龙翔天老师的梅花体签名，都是手工雕上去的，非常之细腻，从这个工艺手法来看，肯定是出自当今最著名的篆刻家康天德大师之手。这个棋碗，绝对是个不可多得的珍品。再说这件，这件金甲年代已经相当久远，上面的“银翼飞鹰章”是古代英雄奥铃的族徽，由于银翼飞鹰章的仿制相当困难，更不用说几百年前的古代亵渎英雄要被满门抄斩，所以这件铠甲，是奥铃穿过的真品无疑。最重要的，看左胸这边，有一个凹点，这是第三次拉瓦尔战役胜利之后，奥铃在庆功会上穿的仪仗甲，而那一次被一个敌对派的刺客混入，朝他胸口放了冷箭，才留下的这个凹点。仪仗甲不像战斗甲经常损耗，因此本来就制作得很少，流传至今的更少，更不用说这是曾经救过奥铃性命的那件金甲了。所以，这件金甲，其非凡的历史意义是独一无二的。\n{伊娜：}哇，真的好厉害耶，仅仅是观察一番，就能讲出这么多详细的依据来，你真了不起。\n{馆长：}没什么啦。这只是我从事文物收藏几十年来的一点经验罢了。这两件藏品，小姐打算以什么价格转让给我？\n{伊娜：}既然馆长先生对文物收藏这么有研究，就送给馆长先生吧。我是个魔法师，经常要跟人打仗，这么珍贵的东西一直带在身上说不定哪天就成灰了呢。还是放在馆长先生这里更能发挥它们的价值吧。\n{馆长：}这，这我怎么好意思的。不行，我不能白白收下，你等下，我去找一样宝物来跟您交换吧。这件东西，请您一定收下，这是以前从一个猎人那里买来的，从神兽谷的独角兽身上取得的“神兽之鬃”，据说有神奇的功效。但这件并不是文物，放在我这边实在是浪费，所以请您一定收下它。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Curator:} Welcome to Bohai Exhibition Hall. I am the curator Shen Madou City Fuyun.\n{Ina:} Hello, Mr. Shenma.\n{Curator:} No, my surname is not Shenma.\n{Ina:} Then is the surname God Madou?\n{Curator:} My surname is \"Shen Madou City Fu\". A single name with the word \"cloud\".\n{Ina:} What a terrific surname, I will write it down. Mr. Shen Madou Shifu... Ah, so long, it is easier to call Mr. Curator.\n{Curator:} This is no problem, please come in, let's take a look at my exhibits first?\n{Ina:} This... We are just passing by, not here to visit.\n{Curator:} It's okay, no tickets are needed anyway. I have collected collections from all over the mainland from ancient times to the present, which is guaranteed to make you amazed.\n{Ina:} This...Do you have any other purpose?\n{Director:} What do you say?\n{Ina:} Girl's intuition. You have spared no effort to take me to visit, and you don't charge money. Surely there are any attempts, right?\n{Curator:} Hey, this is actually the case, then I will showdown. I am a collector, and collecting all kinds of cultural relics is my lifelong desire. Seeing that this young lady came from a distant place, there must be some collections that I look forward to very much. If so, I wonder if I can generously transfer it to me, and I will definitely give you a satisfactory return.\n{Ina:} Do you know that I have the collection you want just by coming from another place?\n{Curator:} Collector's intuition.\n{Ina:} What if I didn't?\n{Curator:} I believe that my intuition is not wrong, you said that it is possible that you have not decided whether to transfer it to me. But it's okay, I won't be overwhelmed. When you decide, you can come to me again.","{馆长：}欢迎光临博海展览馆。我是馆长神马兜市福云。\n{伊娜：}你好，神马先生。\n{馆长：}不，我不姓神马。\n{伊娜：}那么是姓神马兜？\n{馆长：}我姓“神马兜市福”。单名一个“云”字。\n{伊娜：}好厉害的姓，我记下来。神马兜市福先生……啊，好长，还是叫馆长先生比较简单一点。\n{馆长：}这个没问题啦，请进吧，先来看看我的展品如何？\n{伊娜：}这个……我们只是路过，不是来参观的啦。\n{馆长：}没关系啊，反正不要门票的。我这里收藏了大陆各地古往今来的藏品，保证能让你叹为观止。\n{伊娜：}这个……你是不是还有什么别的目的？\n{馆长：}此话怎讲？\n{伊娜：}女孩子的直觉。你这么不遗余力地想拉我去参观，又不收钱，肯定有什么企图吧？\n{馆长：}哎，其实是这样，那么我摊牌吧。我是一个收藏家，收集各种文物是我一生的渴求。看这位小姐像是从遥远的外地来的，想必会有一些我非常期盼的藏品吧。如果有的话，不知能不能慷慨转让给我，我一定会给你满意的回报。\n{伊娜：}光是凭我从外地来就知道我有你要的藏品了？\n{馆长：}收藏家的直觉。\n{伊娜：}要是我没有呢？\n{馆长：}我相信我的直觉没有错，你说没有可能是还没有决定要不要转让给我。不过没关系，我也不会强人所难。什么时候你决定了，可以再来找我。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Da Wu:} For the sake of acquaintances, this adult will not charge you a deposit, but the rent must be paid in advance. 5000 gold coins.","{达伍：}看在熟人的份上，本大人就不收你押金了，不过租金要全部先付完。5000金币。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dalv:} Asshole, why did you lose? My lord has been practicing hard these days, thinking that he can win after increasing his speed this time...\n{Rael:} What, do you guys know?\n{Ina:} It's a acquaintance, but it doesn't seem to be... Rael, this guy is a bad guy! He is going to rob!\n{Dawu:} My lord has already washed his hands. Originally, I wanted to be a thief, but it turned out to be unfavorable. The first virgin robbery in my life was defeated by you. The second time I wanted to rob the soldiers of the Barland army, I was robbed. Seeing the atrocities of the Balandian army, I really couldn't bear to go with that kind of person, so this man had no hesitation and was bold and witty and resolutely washed his hands with the golden basin.\n{Ina:} This does not mean that you are a good person, because you found that you have no talent for robbery and gave up, not from the kindness of your heart.\n{Dawu:} All, this adult has always been a high moral character, a pure heart, a kindness and a kindness to help others. If you have any difficulties, this adult will help you settle it.\n{Rael:} Really? We are just trying to find out why the war has suddenly started recently.\n{Dawu:} You ask the right person about this. This lord is Mirronia's first Dave lord who is informed, eyes, ears, omniscience and omniscience. To talk about the cause of the war, we have to start with the heir system of the Kartia Kingdom. Slowly listen to the humanity of this lord.","{达伍：}混帐，怎么还是输了，本大人这几天拼命练习，还以为这次提升了速度之后就可以赢的……\n{雷尔：}怎么，你们认识？\n{伊娜：}算是认识吧，但又好像不算……雷尔，这家伙是坏人！他要抢劫的！\n{达伍：}本大人已经洗手不干啦。本来一心想做个侠盗，结果出师不利，人生的第一次处女劫就被你打败，第二次想去抢巴兰德军的士兵，结果被反抢。看了巴兰德军的暴行，实在不忍心与那种人同流合污，于是本大人义无反顾大义凛然机智果敢英明决断地金盆洗手了。\n{伊娜：}这也不能说明你是好人，因为你是发觉自己没有抢劫的才能才放弃的，而不是出自内心的善良。\n{达伍：}切，本大人向来品德高尚心灵纯洁好善乐施助人为乐。你们要是有什么困难，本大人帮你们摆平。\n{雷尔：}是吗？我们正想打听一下，最近怎么就突然打起战争来了。\n{达伍：}这个你就问对人了。本大人正是米尔罗尼亚第一消息灵通眼明耳快无所不知无所不晓的达伍大人。要说战争的起因，还得从卡尔提亚王国的继承人制度说起。慢慢听本大人道来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dalve:} Are 5,000 gold coins ready? Take it when you're ready. Be sure to return it to this lord after use.\n{Ina:} Don't worry, you don't have to ask again. I will definitely return it to you, I'm not the kind of person who relied on people.","{达伍：}5000个金币准备好了吗？准备好就拿去吧。用完后一定要还给本大人哦。\n{伊娜：}放心啦，不用再三叮嘱了。我一定会还给你的，我才不是那种赖人东西的人呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dalve:} Okay, their base is almost here.\n{Ina:} Mr. Bad, are you right? There is no way ahead.\n{Da Wu:} Hey, you don't understand this. Here is a door that can be opened, using a voice control system. As long as you know the code, you can open the door. My lord heard their signal when the demons opened the door.\n{Ina:} So what is the code?\n{Dawu:} Look at this lord. Sesame, sesame, open the door!\n{Ina:} Nothing happened.\n{Dawu:} Impossible, is it that Lord Ben has a wrong memory?\n{Ina:} Obviously, I remembered it wrong.\n{Dawu:} My lord, try again. Mung beans, mung beans, open the door!\n{Ina:}... {Dalv:} Peanuts, Peanuts, open the door!\n{Ina:}... {Dav:} Nuomi, Nuomi, open the door!\n{Ina:} What, none of them worked.\n{Da Wu:} It's strange, what on earth is it, this lord shouldn't remember it wrong. It should be sesame seeds, but why is it useless...\n{Ina:} I was hungry by you! Sesame, sesame, go ahead! The stone wall moved, revealing a passage.\n{Ina:} Hey, it's open...\n{Davu:} Ahahaha, this lord said it should be Sesame, I remember it correctly...Since the road has been opened, the front is their base after passing here. . The Lord will retire first, and will not be accompanied by the desperate work of attacking the base. Goodbye! Yo...","{达伍：}好了，他们的基地就快到了。\n{伊娜：}坏人先生，你没弄错吗？前面没路了。\n{达伍：}嘿嘿，这你就不懂了吧。这里有一道门可以打开的，用的是声控系统。只要知道暗号，就能把门打开。本大人趁魔族开门的时候听到他们的暗号了。\n{伊娜：}那么暗号是什么？\n{达伍：}看本大人的。芝麻，芝麻，快开门！\n{伊娜：}没动静耶。\n{达伍：}不可能啊，难道本大人记错了？\n{伊娜：}显然是记错了嘛。\n{达伍：}本大人再试试。绿豆，绿豆，快开门！\n{伊娜：}……\n{达伍：}花生，花生，快开门！\n{伊娜：}……\n{达伍：}糯米，糯米，快开门！\n{伊娜：}什么嘛，一个都没效。\n{达伍：}奇怪了，到底是什么呢，本大人不该会记错的啊。应该还是芝麻才对，可是怎么没用呢……\n{伊娜：}我都被你说得饿啦！芝麻，芝麻，快开饭！\n\n石壁移动了，露出一条通道。\n\n{伊娜：}咦，开了……\n{达伍：}啊哈哈哈，本大人就说应该是芝麻的嘛，果然没记错……既然路已开通，过了这里前面就是他们的基地了。本大人就先行告退，去攻打基地什么的玩命的活儿本大人就不奉陪啦。再见！溜溜溜……\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Davu:} According to the tradition of our Kartia Kingdom, the king does not have a crown prince. Instead, at the right time, the king wrote a secret edict to determine who is the heir. The secret edict can only be opened after the death of the previous king. In other words, the princes did not know who would inherit the throne in the beginning. This is done so that the most talented of the princes can succeed to the throne in the future without triggering a fight between the princes. If every prince wants to be a good king in the future, he must study and practice hard, show his talents to the king, and win the king's appreciation of himself.\n{Dawu:} This secret edict is usually written when the king is old or very sick. But this time things changed. The former King Vigel I was less than 50 years old, and he was always in good health, but suddenly died of illness without warning, so that he did not leave the heir's secret edict at all. Now the two princes Enke and Freeman have the possibility of succession. The nobility was divided into two factions, each supporting the prince he supported, but the throne could not be determined for a long time. The two factions of nobles continued to fight and attack each other, but the government affairs of the country were left unmanaged, which caused a mess. Neighboring Barland saw an opportunity, and they had always liked expansion, and they fought over.\n{Dalv:} The fighting strength of our Karti runners-up was not inferior to them, but due to the vacancy of the throne, no unified leadership, chaotic management, and low morale, it led to steadily retreating, and large areas of territory fell into the hands of the Baland Army. If this continues, it is only a matter of time before the city of Kartia, the capital city, is broken.\n{Rael:} So, which prince do you support?\n{Dawu:} No one supports this lord. Those nobles are nothing more than trying to reap the benefits after the prince they support succeeds to the throne, and the talents of this university do not work with them. Okay, I'm done with the information, and it's so hard to talk about. It's not too much to tip this adult 2000 gold coins, right?\n{Ina:} Is this also money? You didn't say you want to collect money before. If we know that you want to collect money, we would rather ask others to go instead of looking for you.\n{Davu:} My lord's wallet was robbed by the Balland army, and now I don't even have any living expenses. I just rely on selling information to fill my stomach. This is the income of labor. Stupid girl, don't you want to push this sir to the path of crime again?\n{Ina:} So it seems that it should be given again, well, okay, then I will give it to you, Mr. Bad. By the way, do you know where the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" is?\n{Dawu:} What is \"Dragon King's supernatural power\"? Never heard of this name, what does that thing look like?\n{Ina:} Actually, I don't know what it looks like. In short, it is a very powerful thing, which seems to be able to revive a country...\n{Davu:} Ahahaha! Stupid girl, you don't know what you want to ask, how can I tell you. In this way, even if you ask Mirronia all over, no one can tell you.\n{Ina:} Bad guys! you made fun at me!\n{Dawu:} This lord is just making fun of you, stupid girl.\n{Ina:} I won't give you the money, pay me back!\n{Dawu:} It's already in hand, you can't take it back, stupid little girl, ahaha...","{达伍：}按照我们卡尔提亚王国的传统，国王是不设王储的。而是在合适的时间，由国王写一封密诏，决定谁是继承人。密诏要等前任国王驾崩后才可以开启。也就是说，各位王子一开始并不知道谁将来会继承王位。这样做是为了让王子中最有才能的人将来能继位，而又不引发王子之间的争位。各位王子如果将来想做个好国王，就要努力学习和实践，展露自己的才能给国王看，以博取国王对自己的欣赏。\n\n{达伍：}这个密诏，一般是在国王年迈或者病重时写下的。但是这次情况却出现了变故。前国王维格尔一世还不到50岁，身体也一向很好，却突然毫无征兆地病逝了，以至于他根本没留下继承人密诏。现在两位王子恩克和弗里曼都有继位的可能。贵族分为两派，各自拥护自己支持的王子，结果王位迟迟不能决定。两派贵族之间不断发生斗争，相互攻击，国家政务却无人管理，搞得一团糟。邻国巴兰德看到有机可乘，一向喜欢扩张的他们就打过来了。\n\n{达伍：}本来我们卡尔提亚军的战斗力不在他们之下，但是由于王位空缺，没有统一领导，管理混乱，士气低下，才导致节节败退，大片领土落入了巴兰德军之手。如果再这样下去，只怕王都卡尔提亚城被攻破只是时间问题。\n\n{雷尔：}那么，你支持哪个王子呢？\n{达伍：}本大人谁也不支持。那些贵族无非是想在自己支持的王子继位后捞到好处罢了，本大人才不与他们为伍。好了，情报提供完了，讲得这么辛苦，给本大人2000金币小费不过分吧？\n{伊娜：}这也要钱啊？你之前又没说要收钱，要是知道你要收钱，我们情愿问别人去也不找你。\n{达伍：}本大人的钱包被巴兰德军抢走了，现在连生活费都没有，就靠卖点情报填饱肚子，这可是劳动所得。笨小丫头，难道你又想把本大人推向犯罪的道路？\n{伊娜：}这么说来好像又是应该给的，唔，好吧，那就给你了，坏人先生。顺便再问一下，你知道不知道“龙王神力”在哪里？\n{达伍：}“龙王神力”是什么？没听过这个名字，那东西长什么样子的？\n{伊娜：}其实，我也不知道那是个什么样子的东西，总之就是一个很强大的东西，好像能使一个国家复兴……\n{达伍：}啊哈哈哈！笨小丫头，你自己都不知道你要问的东西是什么，本大人怎么告诉你啊。这样子你就算问遍了米尔罗尼亚也没人能告诉你。\n{伊娜：}坏人！你取笑我！\n{达伍：}本大人就是取笑你，笨小丫头。\n{伊娜：}不给你钱了，还我！\n{达伍：}已经到手了，你拿不回去了，笨小丫头，啊哈哈……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Davu:} In order to invade the demon world, the hero Aris built a helmet inlaid with black crystals...\n{Ina:} I know this. I also know that this helmet is in the museum of Kartia until It was stolen twenty years ago. Just start after the theft.\n{Davu:} Do you know all this? Then there is no clue for the update.\n{Ina:} Hey, you lied to me again.\n{Dawu:} I didn't lie to you, I don't know how much you know. However, there is a rumor, I don't know if it is true or not. It is said that the helmet has the curse of {Sea Dragon} on it. The Abastians were also killed in a shipwreck. The reason why the helmet was not found after the theft may also be the same. The thieves stole the helmet in the middle of the night and drove a boat to escape from the sea, but the next day, people found their broken boat washed to the shore. Although the corpses and objects could not be found, it is speculated that they were still eaten by the sea dragon.\n{Ina:} Wait, the thief ran away in a small boat late at night. Now that someone has seen it, why don't you catch them?\n{Dawu:} No one saw it, so it's called a legend. He didn't say it must be true. How high the credibility is, this lord can't guarantee it. Believe it or not, you decide for yourself, this adult will collect these 3,000 gold coins.","{达伍：}英雄亚里斯为了攻入魔界，打造了一顶黑水晶镶嵌的头盔……\n{伊娜：}这个我知道的啦，我还知道这头盔放在卡尔提亚的博物馆里，直到二十年前失窃。你就从失窃之后开始讲吧。\n{达伍：}这些你都知道了？那么本大人没有更新的线索了。\n{伊娜：}喂，你又骗我。\n{达伍：}没骗你啊，本大人又不知道你了解到什么程度。不过，有一个传闻，不知道是真是假。据说那顶头盔，上面有{海龙}的诅咒。亚里斯本人也是在一次海难中丧生的。而失窃后头盔之所以没被找到，也可能是同样的情况。窃贼深夜窃得头盔后驾小船从海上逃走，可是第二天，人们发现他们破烂的船被冲到岸边。虽然没能找到尸体和物品，不过，人们猜测他们还是被海龙吃掉了。\n{伊娜：}等等，窃贼深夜驾小船逃跑，既然有人看见了，为什么不抓住他们？\n{达伍：}没人看见啦，所以叫传说。又没说一定是真的。可信度有多高，这个本大人就没法担保了。信还是不信，你自己决定吧，这3000金币，本大人就收好了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Davu:} Not long ago, the little prince Freeman suddenly disappeared. Archbishop Yingluck declared that Prince Freeman was guilty of treason and was wanted nationwide. In this way, the prince Enke succeeded to the throne and became the new king Enke I. The only thing he did after he succeeded was to make Archbishop Yingluck the regent and take all the military and political power of the country.\n{Dawu:} Although Archbishop Yingluck pronounced the little prince Freeman of treason, Freeman also had a certain degree of prestige in the country, and many people did not believe that he would treason. It is only because of the presidency of Archbishop Yingluck that many people just choose to remain silent. There were also a few bold people who dared to speak for the little prince, but they were all arrested and executed by Archbishop Yingluck. At present, the rest of the central government are basically supporters of King Enke I or partisans of Archbishop Yingluck.\n{Dawu:} Archbishop Yingluck knew that although some people didn't say anything, they still wanted to resist him, so he transferred all the army of the local lords and commanded them all. If the local lord had no army, he would naturally have no ability to resist him. In this way, all power from the center to the local level is completely controlled by Archbishop Yingluck, and no one can say \"no\" to him.\n{Dawu:} Archbishop Yingluck continued to eliminate dissidents in the country after he was in power, increased exorbitant taxes and levies, and cultivated a direct line of troops. Although the people are in distress, they dare not speak. This master couldn't stand the tyranny, so he moved to Terracia.","{达伍：}不久之前，小王子弗里曼突然失踪。英拉大主教就宣布弗里曼王子犯叛国罪，全国通缉。这样大王子恩克就顺理成章地继位，成为新一任国王恩克一世。他继位后做的唯一一件事，就是封英拉大主教为摄政王，总揽国家一切军政大权。\n\n{达伍：}英拉大主教虽然宣判小王子弗里曼叛国，但是弗里曼原来在国内也有一定的威信，许多人并不相信他会叛国。只是由于英拉大主教当权，很多人只是选择沉默。也有少数胆大的敢为小王子说话，但都被英拉大主教逮捕并处决了。如今朝中，剩下的基本上都是恩克一世的支持者或者是英拉大主教的党羽。\n\n{达伍：}英拉大主教知道虽然有些人嘴上不说，但心里仍然想着反抗他，因此他把地方领主的军队全部调走，由自己统一指挥。这样地方领主没有了军队，自然也就没有能力反抗他了。这样从中央到地方的一切大权就完全被英拉大主教掌控，没人能对他说“不”字。\n\n{达伍：}大权在握之后英拉大主教在国内不断清除异己，增加苛捐杂税，培养嫡系军队。百姓虽然困苦不堪，却敢怒不敢言。本大人也是受不了暴政，才转移到泰拉西亚来的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Davu:} You don't have money at all, do you?","{达伍：}你不会根本就没带钱吧？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Davu:} You won't fail to come up with 5000 gold coins, will you? Not to mention, this adult will show kindness and give you more favorable lease conditions. You can give 5000 gems.\n{Ina:} Forget it, I'll figure out how to get 5000 gold coins.","{达伍：}你不会拿不出5000金币吧？也罢，本大人就发一把善心，给你更优厚的租借条件。你给5000个宝石也成。\n{伊娜：}算了，我还是想办法弄5000个金币好了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dawu:} Asshole, this lord can't beat a little girl. You dare not confront me openly, always dodging and sneaking around. It's a pity that this lord has never been invincible in his life, but he can't stop you from these insidious moves.\n{Ina:} It's because you are too slow to keep up with me. It's embarrassing to fight. But what exactly is robbery?\n{Dawu:} Robbery is the use of violence to take other people's property. Do you understand? The stupid girl wants this adult to teach you a lesson.\n{Ina:} Hurry up and remember it on the little Ina universal notebook. The so-called robbery is the use of violence...Huh? That's not something bad people do. It turns out you are a bad guy!\n{Da Wu:} Hmph, compared to those in the palace who only know that they are fighting for power, intrigue, and greedy people, this lord is much better!\n{Ina:} Ah, I don't understand it more and more. Anyway, I only know that you are a bad guy now, so if I hit you, there will be no conscience anymore. Well, that's it.\n{Da Wu:} Little girl, there are very few innocent children like you in this world. You should cherish your life and don't let that filthy society take you badly. This lord has other things, let's go ahead.","{达伍：}混帐，本大人居然打不过一个小丫头。你不敢堂堂正正跟我正面交锋，老是躲躲闪闪四处偷袭。可惜本大人一生从无敌手，却挡不住你这些阴招。\n{伊娜：}是你自己动作太慢了呀，根本跟不上我的脚步，这也好意思打架的。不过，抢劫到底是什么呀？\n{达伍：}抢劫就是用暴力强夺别人的财物。明白了不？笨丫头还要本大人给你上课。\n{伊娜：}赶紧记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上。所谓抢劫就是用暴力……啊？那不是坏人才做的事情嘛。原来你是坏人！\n{达伍：}哼，比起宫廷里那些只知道争权夺利勾心斗角贪得无厌鱼肉百姓的行尸走肉，本大人还算是好得多了！\n{伊娜：}啊，越来越听不懂了。反正我现在只知道你是坏人，那么我打了你就没什么良心不安了，嗯，就是这样。\n{达伍：}小丫头，像你这么纯真的孩子，这个世界上已经很少了，你可要好好珍惜自己的生活，别让那个污秽不堪的社会把你带坏。本大人还有其他事情，先走一步了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dawu:} Come and see here. stop! You stay behind, don't follow, keep a distance of more than five steps with this lord, otherwise it will be very dangerous. This narrow road has a strange black device on each side. Have you seen it?\n{Ina:} Yes, one is spherical and the other is flat. These two things are organs?\n{Dawu:} Yes! At this time, you must not let any part of your body touch the straight line connecting the two devices-although you can't see any thread or rope in the middle. Once it is touched, the mechanism will be activated, and the corresponding trap will be opened. It may be a falling rock, a dark arrow, a thorn cone, a sinking well, and so on. At the same time, this equipment will also send out a special frequency alarm of magic fluctuations, so that the two demons can receive and sense it.\n{Freeman:} Ah, this is an infrared sensor, right?\n{Ina:} Huh? Jack knows? Infrared...what is that?\n{Freeman:} Infrared is a kind of light that is invisible to our naked eyes. Of these two devices, the spherical one is an infrared transmitter, and the flat one is an infrared receiver. Once an object touches the connection between the two and the infrared rays are blocked, the receiver will perceive it to activate the trap and issue an alarm.\n{Ina:} It's amazing, Jack even knows this, so he can take notes quickly.\n{Freeman:} It's nothing, this device is often used in important places to guard against theft in our palace.\n{Dawu:} Wait, wait, wait...Stop talking, go on, how do you do business with this lord?\n{Ina:} Yes, just ask Jack, no need to ask you.\n{Freeman:} However, although I know the principle of this equipment, I don't know how to crack it.\n{Da Wu:} Haha, I still want this master to go out. In fact, as long as the switch of this thing is turned off, it will not trigger the trap or sound the alarm. The switch is here, just press it once, but when it is off, be careful not to touch the straight line between the two devices. All right! You see, now my lord is fine no matter how you move between the two devices.\n{Ina:} So that's the way it is...\n{Dalv:} How about, this lord's intelligence is still quite valuable. Next, take a few steps forward, there is one in front, and then you can try it out.","{达伍：}你们来看这边。停！你们靠后，先不要跟上来哦，跟本大人保持五步以上的距离，不然很危险的。这条狭窄的路，两边各有一个黑色的奇怪装置，看到了没有？\n{伊娜：}是呢，一个球形的，一个扁平的，这两个东西就是机关？\n{达伍：}对！这时候，你千万不能让身体的任何一部分触到这两个装置之间相连的直线上——虽然你看不到任何丝线或绳索在中间。一旦触到了，机关就发动了，相应的陷阱就会打开，有可能是落石啊，暗箭啊，刺锥啊，坠井啊，等等。同时，这装备还会发出特殊频率的魔法波动的警报，让那两个魔族接收感应到。\n{弗里曼：}啊，这个是红外线感应器吧？\n{伊娜：}唉？杰克知道？红外线……那是什么？\n{弗里曼：}红外线是一种我们肉眼看不见的光线。这两个装置，球形的那个是红外线发射器，扁平的那个是红外线接收器。一旦有物体触到了两者的连线上，红外线被遮挡了，接收器就会感知，从而启动陷阱和发出警报。\n{伊娜：}好厉害啊，杰克连这个都知道，赶紧笔记下来。\n{弗里曼：}没什么啦，这个装置，我们王宫里常用在重要的地方进行防盗。\n{达伍：}等等等等等等……别说了，你再说下去，本大人的生意怎么做啊。\n{伊娜：}是哦，我问杰克就好了，不用问你了。\n{弗里曼：}不过，我虽然知道这个装备的原理，但是并不知道如何破解它。\n{达伍：}哈哈，果然还是要本大人出马。其实呢，只要把这东西的开关关掉，它就不会触发陷阱和发出警报了。开关在这里，按一下就好了，不过关的时候还是要注意不要触到两个装置之间的直线上。好了！你们看，现在本大人再在两个装置之间随便怎么活动都没事了。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样啊……\n{达伍：}怎么样，本大人的情报还是挺有价值的吧。下面再往前走几步，前面还有一个，然后你做一下试试看。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dawu:} Come with me, there is a mechanism behind here, on this rock wall, watch what I do. If you don't do it right, you will be killed by falling rocks.","{达伍：}跟我过来，这边后面就有一个机关，就在这岩石壁上，看好我怎么做的哦。如果操作不对，你就会被掉下来的石头砸死。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dawu:} Don't worry, this adult will complete the work with guaranteed quality and quantity after receiving the fee.","{达伍：}你放心，本大人收了费用一定保质保量完成工作。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dawu:} Stupid little girl!\n{Ina:} Ah, Mr. Bad Guy! Why are you here, we are still looking for you.\n{Dawu:} My lord knows that you will pass by here, so I just waited here in advance. How's it done? Is it over? Can the \"Water God Boots\" be returned to this lord?","{达伍：}笨小丫头！\n{伊娜：}啊，坏人先生！你怎么在这里，我们还在找你呢。\n{达伍：}本大人知道你们会途经这里，所以就事先在这里等着了。怎么样，事情办完了吧？“水神靴”是不是可以还给本大人了？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Demon Soldier A:} What, General Slander was defeated?\n{Devil Soldier B:} It's true, now there is a mess, and the humans who had been hiding are also resisting at the same time. And they seem to have brought a very powerful new weapon. Our people were shot down before they got close.\n{Demon Soldier C:} Now that there is no strong magic backing from General Slander, and no command, how can we beat those humans, let's escape.\n{Devil Soldier A:} Yes, run away quickly, don't stay here and be stupid. So the demon guarding the gate scattered away noisily.","{魔族士兵A：}什么，斯兰德将军被打败了？\n{魔族士兵B：}是真的啊，现在乱作一团了，那些本来躲藏着的人类也同时起来反抗了。而且他们好像还带了一种很厉害的新武器，我们的人还没靠近就被射倒了。\n{魔族士兵C：}现在没有了斯兰德将军强大的魔法作为后盾，也没有了指挥，我们哪敌得过那些人类，还是逃了吧。\n{魔族士兵A：}对，赶紧逃吧，别留在这里发傻了。\n\n于是守关的魔族乱哄哄地散开了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Derlank:} Well, there seems to be something strange over there? Who is hiding there? come out!\n{Ina:} (Oh, we were discovered? Haven't thought of a good countermeasure...)\n{Mondo:} (You hide here and don't move, I'll go out and negotiate with him alone.) {Ina: } (Brother Mondor, wait, is this too risky...)\n{Mondo:} (Don't worry, I will take care of it.)\n{Mondo:} It's me!\n{Dranke:} Why, do you still want to come to ask for money?\n{Mondo:} Is there no room for negotiation?\n{Derlank:} It's useless what you say, I don't have any money. And I was only ordered to receive the goods, not a customer, it's useless for you to find me.\n{Mondo:} If you really can't give money, that's all. But there is something I want to show you. The \"Purple Spirit Shield\" I gave you is actually flawed.\n{Drank:} What did you say! real or fake?\n{Mondo:} I will draw a schematic diagram for you to see. (Take a piece of kraft paper from his pocket and bit his finger)\n{Dranke:} Hello! You...no pen...but forget it, let me have a look.\n{Mondo:} This is actually the case, draw a circle and curse you! Mundo grabbed Drake who was approaching, and drew two circles on his chest with his bitten fingers.\n{Drank:} Ah~~~~~~! What's the matter, what did you do? I feel good for a while...\n{Mondo:} Draw a circle and curse you. My blood has a sealing effect. After drawing this spell on you with my blood, you can seal your advanced magic. You will not be able to use magic other than first-level magic, of course, including teleportation. Ina! You can come out now, it won't be that difficult to deal with him now.\n{Ina:} Ah... There is a way to say what I just said, it turned out to be like this...\n{Drank:} Quickly unlock me! Otherwise, even if I use first-level magic, a magic arrow can kill you!\n{Mondo:} I refuse, just as you refused to pay me.\n{Dranke:} You! Well, even if you can't solve the seal, I will get your result first! Magic arrow!\n{Mondo:} Ah~~~~~~~~~!\n{Ina:} Brother Mondo!\n{Dranke:} Come again! Magic arrow!\n{Ina:} No! {Mondo:} Um~~~~~~~ It seems almost, my mission is over...\n{Ina:} Brother Mondo! Cheer up! Let me treat you!\n{Mondo:} It's useless, my heart has been penetrated... No matter how powerful the genius doctor is, it can't be saved. You'd better keep your magic power to deal with that guy...\n{Ina:} Why do you want to do this, if you tell us about the plan first...\n{Mondo:} Then you will definitely...stop me...now This is the best thing. I did something stupid... Not only was I deceived, but Solo got... \"Purple Spirit Shield\"... This is what I deserve... Retribution... You saved me at the beginning. My life...I'll give it back to you now...\n{Ina:} Brother Mondo!\n{Mondo:}... {Dranke:} It seems that he is dead. Really entangled guy. Here is your little girl, are you his accomplice? Don't think that if you block my high-level magic, everything will be fine. I am also a demon general under Lord Solo, so I can't use my full strength to clean up your little girl.\n{Ina:} Unforgivable! I want to take revenge for Brother Mondo!","{德兰克：}嗯，那边好像有什么异样的动静？什么人躲在那里？出来！\n{伊娜：}（糟啦，我们被发现啦？还没想好对策呢……）\n{蒙多：}（你们躲在这里先别动，我一个人出去跟他交涉。）\n{伊娜：}（蒙多大哥，等等啊，这样是不是太冒险……）\n{蒙多：}（别担心，我会处理好的。）\n{蒙多：}是我！\n{德兰克：}怎么，你还想来讨钱？\n{蒙多：}就没有一点交涉的余地吗？\n{德兰克：}你怎么说都没用，我并没有钱。而且我只是奉命来收货，并不是主顾，你找我没用的。\n{蒙多：}如果你实在没办法给钱，那也就罢了。不过我有样东西想给你看看，我交给你的那个“紫灵盾”，其实是有瑕疵的。\n{德兰克：}你说什么！真的假的？\n{蒙多：}我画个示意图给你看看。（从衣袋里取出一张牛皮纸，咬破手指）\n{德兰克：}喂！你……笔都没有……不过算了，让我来看看。\n{蒙多：}其实就是这么回事，画个圈圈诅咒你！\n\n蒙多一把抓住凑近来的德兰克，用咬破的手指在他胸前画了两个圈。\n\n{德兰克：}啊~~~~~~！怎么回事，你干了什么？身体好一阵发热……\n{蒙多：}画个圈圈诅咒你啊。我的血拥有封印效果，用我的血在你身上画上这个符咒之后，就能封住你的高级魔法。你将无法使用一级魔法以外的魔法，当然也包括传送。伊娜！你可以出来了，现在对付他不会那么困难了吧。\n{伊娜：}啊……刚才说的会有办法，原来是这样……\n{德兰克：}快给我解开封印！要不然我就算用一级魔法，一个魔箭也能要了你的命！\n{蒙多：}我拒绝，就像你当初拒绝给我报酬一样。\n{德兰克：}你！好吧，就算解不开封印，我也要先把你结果了！Magic arrow！\n{蒙多：}啊~~~~~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥！\n{德兰克：}再来一下！Magic arrow！\n{伊娜：}不要！\n{蒙多：}唔~~~~~~~看来差不多了，我的使命也完结了……\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥！振作一点！我来帮你治疗！\n{蒙多：}没用啦，我的心脏已经被贯穿了……再厉害的神医也救不回来的。你还是留着法力去对付那家伙吧……\n{伊娜：}为什么你要这样做，如果先跟我们说一下计划的话……\n{蒙多：}那你一定会……阻止我吧……现在这样最好了，是我做了傻事……不但自己被骗，还让索罗得到了……“紫灵盾”……这是我应得的……报应……当初你救我的这条命……现在还给你们……\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥！\n{蒙多：}……\n{德兰克：}看来是断气了。真是纠缠不休的家伙。下面是你了小丫头，你是他的同伙吧？别以为封住了我的高级魔法就万事大吉了，我好歹也是索罗大人手下的魔将，收拾你个小丫头还犯不上使用全力。\n{伊娜：}不可原谅！我要为蒙多大哥报仇！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Devil mercenary:} Who? You don’t seem to belong to Solo?\n{Ina:} Are you Solo's subordinates?\n{Devil mercenaries:} No, we are just mercenaries, we will help whoever benefits us in the war. Solo promised to give us a lot of money, and we are planning to join him.\n{Ina:} Don't help Solo, he might destroy the entire continent, in which case we will all be ruined.\n{Devil mercenary:} Yes. As long as you pay me, we can beat him for you.\n{Ina:} Uh, I have to be paid...\n{Mozu mercenary:} Of course, we are living by working hard, we don’t care about justice or evil, aggression or self-defense, we don’t care, whoever gets paid will help. . Solo promised to give us a priceless armor. What are you going to provide us with? If it can match Solo’s offer, we will help you.\n{Ina:} That's it, then I think about it...","{魔族雇佣兵：}什么人？你们好像不是索罗的人？\n{伊娜：}你们是索罗的部下？\n{魔族雇佣兵：}不是，我们只是雇佣兵，谁给我们好处我们就帮谁打仗。索罗答应给我们不菲的报酬，我们正打算去加入他。\n{伊娜：}不要去帮索罗啦，他搞不好会毁灭整个大陆，那样的话我们大家都完蛋。\n{魔族雇佣兵：}可以。只要你给我报酬，我们帮你打他也可以。\n{伊娜：}呃，还要报酬的啊……\n{魔族雇佣兵：}当然，我们就是靠卖命吃饭的，什么正义还是邪恶，什么侵略还是自卫，我们都不管，谁给报酬就帮谁。索罗答应给我们一件价值连城的铠甲，你打算给我们提供什么？如果能与索罗的出价相当，我们就帮你。\n{伊娜：}这样啊，那我想想看……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dragon Guard:} Stop! Are you on the wrong path? Further north is Hailongze, not where you humans should go.\n{Ina:} We are just going there. We are looking for Sea Dragon King.\n{Dragon Guard:} Why should our king want to see you? Go go! Go!\n{Ina:} We must see him for something very important.\n{Dragon Guard:} Don't blame me for being rough if you don't leave.\n{Ina:} Alas, I don’t want to fight with you, but you are unreasonable.","{龙卫兵：}站住！你们走错路了吧？再往北是海龙泽，不是你们人类应该去的地方。\n{伊娜：}我们就是要去那里耶。我们要找海龙王。\n{龙卫兵：}凭什么我们大王要见你们？快走快走！\n{伊娜：}我们有很重要的事一定要见他。\n{龙卫兵：}再不走别怪我动粗。\n{伊娜：}唉唉，我不想跟你打啦，不过是你先不讲理的哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Dream Shadow:} In front is the passage leading to the tomb of Culled VII. Let me first talk about how to use the portal.\n{Ina:} Just walk up to that door, right?\n{Mengying:} This is true. However, do you know that when you are on the portal, you can teleport as long as you {press the space} instead of taking a step to the side and then back. In addition, there is another problem that is easily overlooked. Two-way doors {not necessarily only have 2 exits}. Maybe you will encounter two-way doors with more than 2 exits in the future. You should be careful not to go. Wrong way.\n{Ina:} There is such a mystery, I will write it down, thank you Sister Mengying. Then let's go, Rael.\n{Rael:} But, what does the \"Eternal Sphere\" look like, we don't know yet, so how do we find it?\n{Mengying:} I have seen real objects, and I will show them to you. Mengying drew a picture: ?e\n{Ina:} Great, I followed it and wrote it down in the Ina-chan universal notebook.\n{Rael:} But, isn't this just a simple circle?\n{Mengying:} Yes, the \"Eternal Ball\" is round.\n{Rael:} But if you don't draw it, I know it is round...\n{Ina:} In short, we just bring back all the round things that can be found in the mausoleum. We will work hard.","{梦影：}前面就是通向库里德七世的陵墓的通道。我先讲一下传送门的使用方法。\n{伊娜：}走到那个门上，就可以了吧？\n{梦影：}这是没错。不过，你是否知道呢，当你正处在传送门上时，只要{按空格}，就可以进行传送，而不需要向旁边走一步再走回来。除此之外，还有一个比较容易被人忽视的问题，双向门{不一定只有2个出口}，也许以后你还会碰到有超过2个出口的双向门，那时可要注意别走错路。\n{伊娜：}还有这样的奥妙啊，我记下来，多谢梦影姐姐了。那么我们出发吧，雷尔。\n{雷尔：}不过，“永恒之球”到底是什么样子的，我们还不知道呢，这样如何去找呢？\n{梦影：}我见过实物，我画给你们看。\n梦影画了一个图：○\n{伊娜：}太好了，我照着画下来，记到伊娜酱万能笔记本里。\n{雷尔：}可是，这不就是一个简单的圆形吗？\n{梦影：}对，“永恒之球”就是圆的。\n{雷尔：}可是你不画我也知道它是圆的……\n{伊娜：}总之，我们把陵墓里能找到的圆的东西都带回来就是了。我们会努力的。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Elder:} It's not far ahead. It looks like he can't fly high yet and has a chance.","{长老：}就在前面不远处了。看起来他还不能高飞，有机会。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Elder:} Such a narrow place, Phoenix can't get in. Let's look elsewhere.","{长老：}这么狭窄的地方，不死鸟进不去的。我们去别的地方找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Elephant:} Haven't you gotten the tender branches yet?\n{Ina:} Mr. Elephant, hold on to it a little longer.","{大象：}还没有弄到嫩树枝吗？\n{伊娜：}大象先生你再忍耐一下坚持一下。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{End of the show} Acknowledgements Technical support: Yiyu ({gu7979gu}) Panda ({Inactive}) Test assistance (in no particular order): chwgzsu, eison, emanon, pingmianjihe, ytg0503, ystemni, Anduran combat uniform, attack acceleration , The shadow of the twilight return, trapped. Suggestions for improvement (in no particular order): Gleam, quamarine. And every player. ------by Xuelian Liu, December 2009 ~ May 2011.","{全剧终}\n\n鸣谢\n技术支持：\n有利（{gu7979gu}）\n熊猫（{inactive}）\n协助测试（排名不分先后）：\nchwgzsu，eison，emanon，pingmianjihe，ytg0503，ystemni，安度兰战斗服，攻击加速，暮归之影，陷阵。\n改进意见（排名不分先后）：\nGleam，quamarine。\n\n以及\n每一位玩家。\n\n------by 柳雪恋，2009年12月~2011年5月。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fairy Dragon:} You know, some people call me \"Fairy Dragon\".","{仙女龙：}知道吗，也有人管我叫“精灵龙”。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fairy:} How, how do you plan to punish me? In the eyes of the righteous warrior, my behavior must be despicable. If you can break through the \"all-spirit fantasy realm\", your strength is definitely above me, and maybe you want to kill me easily. However, if you want to say things like \"Now start to reform and rehabilitate and let you have a way out\", please forgive me for rejecting it. I will not change my values by succumbing to force. If you insist on killing me, I will be ready.\n{Ina:} This, I don't know what to do... Whether you are right or wrong, I am getting more and more confused. What if the people in Huanying Township knew the truth? They may be very disappointed, very confused.\n{Fairy:} That's right. There used to be a person who accidentally broke into the \"all-spirit illusion\" and was about to be killed. I couldn't bear to save him. Of course, I had to let him know the truth. But soon he committed suicide. I can understand his despair of reality, especially the despair of returning to reality after experiencing false dreams. So I later made up my mind to delete the memories of all those who broke into here to prevent such a tragedy from happening again.\n{Ina:} So, you are actually kind, this is where I feel contradictory. Since the first time I saw you, I haven't felt any murderous aura. You don’t feel like a wicked person, no, you are not a wicked person at all, but you are indeed deceiving everyone...\n{fairy:} Are you hesitating? This is not like a warrior of justice. When the righteous warrior sees a hypocrite like me, he should happily slay his hands with the belief that \"evil is cut\".\n{Ina:} I am not a warrior at all, I said I just passed by here. Since I'm just passing by, then, I've taken the wrong way, and I've never been here before. I will not tell the people in Huan Ying Township, nor will I tell the outsiders, as if I had never been here.\n{Fairy:} Do you mean that not only do you not kill me, but you also don't even intend to change the state of illusion?\n{Ina:} I'm just a magician, I don't have the power to judge others at all. Although the current situation confuses me, I dare not change it because I can't think of a good way. If once it changes, the situation is worse than it is now, I will do bad things. Grandpa taught me that if I can’t determine whether it’s a good thing or a bad thing and I’m confused, I must first make sure that I don’t do bad things.\n{Fairy:} Thank you... Maybe you still can't fully understand my thoughts and actions, but I still want to say thank you. When did you get inspired and thought of a good way, you are welcome to come here again, and I look forward to your answers. My {a holy grail is buried under the roots}, I can give it to you as a token, as a part of your affirmation and a secret to me in return.","{妖精：}怎么样，你打算如何惩罚我？在正义的勇士心目中，我这样的行为一定很卑鄙吧。你能突破“万灵幻境”，实力肯定在我之上，也许你要杀我易如反掌。不过，如果你想说诸如“现在开始改过自新就放你一条生路”之类的话的话，请恕我拒绝。我不会因屈服于武力而改变自己的价值观，如果你坚持要杀我，我也已经作好了准备了。\n{伊娜：}这个，我也不知道该怎么办才好……你到底是对是错，我越来越迷惑了。如果让幻樱乡的人知道了真相，又会如何呢？他们也许会非常失望，非常迷惘吧。\n{妖精：}没错。以前曾经就有过一个人，误闯入“万灵幻境”，就要被杀死的时候，我不忍心，就去救了他，当然也不得不让他知道事情的真相。但是很快他还是自杀了。我可以理解他对现实的绝望，特别是在经历过虚假的美梦之后重回现实的那种绝望。所以我后来下决心，对所有闯入这里的人，都要删除他们的记忆，以防止这样的惨剧再次发生。\n{伊娜：}所以，你其实又是善良的，这才是我感到矛盾的地方。从第一次见到你起，我就没有感觉到任何杀气。你给我的感觉不像是恶人，不，根本就不是恶人，可是你确实在欺骗着大家……\n{妖精：}你犹豫了吗？这可不像是正义的勇士啊。正义的勇士见到我这样的伪善者，应该是抱着“恶即斩”的信念痛快地下手的吧。\n{伊娜：}我根本就不是什么勇士啦，我说了我只是路过这里而已。既然我只是路过的，那么，就当我走错了一段路，从来就没来过这里吧。我不会告诉幻樱乡的人们，也不会告诉外面的人，就如同我没有来过一样。\n{妖精：}你的意思是，你不但不杀我，而且甚至连改变幻境状态的打算也没有吗？\n{伊娜：}我只是个魔法师，我根本没有审判别人的权力呢。虽然现在的情况让我很困惑，但是我不敢去改变它，因为我想不出好办法来。如果一旦改变，情况比现在更糟，我就做坏事了。爷爷教过我，如果确定不了是好事还是坏事而迷茫的时候，首先要确保自己不做坏事。\n{妖精：}谢谢……也许我的想法和所做所为你依然不能完全理解，不过我还是要说声谢谢。什么时候，你得到了启发，想到了好的方法，欢迎你再次来到这里，我期待着你的答案。我的{树根之下埋着一件圣杯}，我可以把它交给你作为信物，作为你对我一部分肯定和保守秘密的报答。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fatty:} How about it, 20,000 gold coins are already a low price, and I can't usually buy them.\n{Ina:} Hmm... Although I think you may be suspected of extortion, it seems that this academic conference does have the value to observe and copy. Okay, then it's a deal.","{胖子：}怎么样，20000个金币已经是低价了啦，平常还买不到呢。\n{伊娜：}唔……虽然觉得你可能有敲诈嫌疑，不过，似乎感觉这个学术大会也确实有去观摹一下的价值。好吧，那么成交了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fatty:} How about it, 20,000 gold coins are already a low price, and I can't usually buy them.\n{Ina:} Well, I'll think about it again...","{胖子：}怎么样，20000个金币已经是低价了啦，平常还买不到呢。\n{伊娜：}唔，我再考虑考虑……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fatty:} Miss, you must be a great magician, right?\n{Ina:} Hey, the magician is right, it's amazing...how did you know?\n{Fatty:} Hey, based on my professional sense, you can see it at a glance. Since she is a magician, she must be interested in the \"Snow Love Cup\" academic conference to be held at {Sing Wish Mountain University} soon, right?\n{Ina:} Academic conference? what is this?\n{Fatty:} Hey, you don't know yet. Okay, it doesn't matter, let me introduce you. In order to promote the development of magic and strategy and tactics across the continent, sponsored by celebrities from all walks of life, it is held every four years. The most authoritative and influential academic conference on the mainland of Mirronia is the \"Snow Love Cup\" academic conference. At that time, elites from all circles of the magic world will gather to exchange ideas and improve their skills. Not only that, the organizers of the academic conference also provided generous prizes. For you who work as a magician, such opportunities are rare.\n{Ina:} It sounds good, but how can I participate in this academic conference?\n{Fatty:} I have an academic conference membership badge here. As long as you bring this badge, you can participate directly. This badge is hard to get, but for a magician with such a high level of qualifications as you, it is really a loss for the academic conference not to attend. So although I can't bear it, I still want to transfer it to you at a low price. How about 20,000 gold coins?\n{Ina:} Ah, after talking for a long time, I finally understand that you are a \"scalper party\"!","{胖子：}这位小姐，您一定是个了不起的魔法师是吧？\n{伊娜：}咦，魔法师是没错，了不起还算上啦……你怎么知道的？\n{胖子：}嘿嘿，凭我的职业嗅觉，一下就能看出来啦。既然是魔法师，想必小姐一定对不久即将在{星愿山大学}举办的“雪恋杯”学术大会有兴趣吧？\n{伊娜：}学术大会？这是什么？\n{胖子：}咦，您还不知道啊。好吧没关系，我来介绍介绍。为了推动全大陆魔法及战略战术的发展，由社会各界知名人士赞助，每四年举办一次，米尔罗尼亚大陆最权威最有影响力的学术大会，就是“雪恋杯”学术大会了。届时各界魔法界精英都会汇聚一堂，交流切磋，提高技艺。不仅如此，学术大会的主办方还提供了丰厚的奖品。对于以魔法师为职业的您来说，这样的机会不可多得哦。\n{伊娜：}听起来是不错耶，不过这个学术大会要怎么参加呢？\n{胖子：}我这里有个学术大会会员徽章，只要带着这个徽章，就可以直接参加啦。这个徽章很难搞到的哦，不过小姐您这样资质高深的魔法师，不去参加实在是学术大会的损失。所以我虽然舍不得，不过仍然愿意低价转让给您，就20000个金币，怎么样？\n{伊娜：}啊，说了半天我终于明白了，原来你是“黄牛党”！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Feng Fei:} It turned out to be so, thank you very much. The anti-magic cloak is my treasure. Just give this to me. You look like a magician. How about I teach you a high-level magic?\n{Ina:} (+_+ Two eyes are shining) Really, thank you very much, senior.\n{Fengfei:} Then you follow me.\n{Ina:} By the way, there is one more thing, I don't know if I should ask or not. Why didn't Fengyou-senpai refuse to come to you with our boat?\n{Feng Fei:}... {Ina:} Senior Feng Fei doesn't know the reason?\n{Feng Fei:} I know, but I know...\n{Ina:} If it is inconvenient, then forget it.\n{Feng Fei:} Actually, there is nothing serious about it. Brother, he has a problem and often wets the bed. I think he must be afraid that if you find out about this, he will lose face. In fact, we don't think it's a big deal. Everyone is a kid, and there's nothing shameful about children wetting the bed.\n{Ina:} (a 180-year-old kid...)","{风飞：}原来是这样，多谢你们了。抗魔披风是我的宝物。你们把这个给我就行了。看你像是个魔法师呢，我教一个高级魔法给你怎么样？\n{伊娜：}（+_+ 两眼放光状）是吗，太感谢前辈了。\n{风飞：}那么你随我来吧。\n{伊娜：}对了，还有一件事情，不知该不该问。风游前辈为什么不肯跟着我们的船一起来找你们呢？\n{风飞：}……\n{伊娜：}风飞前辈不知道原因吗？\n{风飞：}知道倒是知道……\n{伊娜：}要是不方便说就算啦。\n{风飞：}其实也没什么大事啦。师兄他有个毛病，经常尿床。我想他一定是怕被你们发现这事，面子就丢大了。其实我们觉得没什么啦，大家都是小孩子嘛，小孩子尿床又没什么见不得人的。\n{伊娜：}（一百八十岁的小孩子……）\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fengfei:} Are you ready? Please come here.","{风飞：}准备好了吗？请到这边来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fengxing:} I think about it, what should I give you as a thank you...\n{Ina:} No, seniors are too polite.\n{Fengxing:} Looks like you are a magician, right?\n{Ina:} Huh? It's barely possible, although it's not a long time since I started...\n{Fengxing:} Okay, I thought of giving you something as a thank you.","{风行：}我想想，该给你什么作为谢礼呢……\n{伊娜：}不用啦，前辈太客气了。\n{风行：}看起来你是魔法师吧？\n{伊娜：}唉？勉强算是吧，虽然才入门不久……\n{风行：}好，我想到给你什么作为谢礼了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Firebird:} Human? Seal us here for 99 years... Kill them all!\n{Ina:} What's the matter? What are you talking about?","{火鸟：}人类？把我们封在这里99年……杀光他们！\n{伊娜：}怎么回事？这是在说什么啊？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Fishermen:} Are you guys planning to go to sea?\n{Ina:} Yes.\n{Fishermen:} Never go out to sea! You go another way.\n{Ina:} Hey, why is this?\n{Fishermen:} Recently, a {pinate whirlwind} appeared in this area, which took control of all the waters in this area, not only robbing money, but also killing people. No matter what passing ships, no matter whether they have money or not, they will not let them go. We don't even dare to fish anymore. We are worried about how we will live in the future, alas~~~~\n{Ina:} There are pinates here. The archbishop Yingluck did not send an army to fight against it.\n{Fisherman:} We also complained to the government, but Archbishop Yingluck said that the reefs in this area were so dense that warships could not pass, so he was helpless, so he refused.\n{Freeman:} Hmph, isn't his Black Tiger agent team very capable? How can he try his best to catch the opposition, but don't do anything practical for the people. I don't believe in how capable a wild pinate can make him helpless. Obviously, it's just unwilling.\n{Fisherman:} Alas, this can't be said. In fact, everyone knows it in mind, but they dare not say it clearly, otherwise they might be beheaded.\n{Ina:} Let's go and clean up the pinate. How can he let him go on doing such a foolish thing, so that the people around him can't live.\n{Freeman:} I think so too.\n{Fishermen:} Do you really want to deal with pinates? I do hope that a warrior can kill him, but the pinates are not easy to deal with, and the attack is quick and cruel. You must be careful not to lose your life.\n{Ina:} I will work hard.","{渔民：}你们几位这是打算出海吗？\n{伊娜：}是呀。\n{渔民：}千万不要出海！你们走别的路吧。\n{伊娜：}咦，这是为什么呢？\n{渔民：}最近这一带出现了一个{海盗飞旋风}，把这一带海域都控制了，不仅劫财，而且杀人。不管什么过往船只，不管有钱没钱，一个都不放过。我们连打渔都不敢了，正愁以后的日子怎么过呢，唉~~~~\n{伊娜：}这里居然闹海盗啊。那个英拉大主教怎么也不派军队来清剿。\n{渔民：}我们也向政府投诉了，但是英拉大主教说，这一带海域礁石丛杂，战舰无法通行，他无能为力，就给推辞了。\n{弗里曼：}哼，他的黑虎特工队不是本事很大吗，怎么尽想着抓反对派，却不为老百姓做点实事。我就不信一个野海盗能有多大本事，让他束手无策。分明只是不愿意罢了。\n{渔民：}唉哟，这话可说不得。其实大家心里是有数，可是不敢明说啊，要不然搞不好会被砍头的。\n{伊娜：}我们去收拾那个海盗吧。怎么能让他这样胡作非为下去，害得周围的人们没法过日子。\n{弗里曼：}我也是这么想的。\n{渔民：}你们真的想去对付海盗？我倒是确实希望有勇士能去干掉他，不过那海盗可不好对付，下手又快又狠，你们可千万要小心，别把自己的命也赔了。\n{伊娜：}我会努力的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Foreman:} A good result today, thanks to your help.\n{Ina:} You are welcome, uncle.\n{Foreman:} As a thank you, let me use this Yun Xuesong to help you make something. What do you need?\n{Ina:} No need, we are not helping to repay. Besides, I don't know what I need.\n{Foreman:} Hey, what do you say, how can you not return for help? If you can't decide what you need, let me help you decide. You came to Snow Mountain Island by boat, right? I will make a pair of big oars for you. It will definitely help you.","{工头：}今天成果不错，多亏了有你们帮忙。\n{伊娜：}大叔不用客气。\n{工头：}作为谢礼，我用这云雪松帮你们做一件东西吧。你们需要什么？\n{伊娜：}不用了啦，我们又不是为了报答才帮忙的。何况我也不知道需要什么。\n{工头：}哎，说哪里话，受人帮助怎么能不回报呢。如果你们决定不了需要什么，我来帮你们决定吧。你们是驾船来到雪山岛的对不对，我做一对大桨给你们，一定会对你们有帮助。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Foreman:} Has the manpower been brought?\n{Ina:} Not yet, I will think of a way...","{工头：}人手带来了吗？\n{伊娜：}还没有，我再想想办法……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Foreman:} Oh, you finally brought some people. Great.\n{Ina:} Are these people enough?\n{Worker:} There should be no problem. Continue to work!","{工头：}噢，你终于带人手来了。太好了。\n{伊娜：}这些人够不够了？\n{工人：}应该没问题了。继续开工了！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} After we parted with you that day, I followed General Bruno home. I felt something was wrong on the road. General Bruno left a good road, but took our team around to a remote and desolate mountain road. I asked him how to take this road, and he told me that Archbishop Yingluck and the ministers had agreed to let me go back to the throne. Time is tight and I must hurry as soon as possible. This mountain road is closer, so I left here. Seeing that it will be dark, we are staying in a ruined temple with no one.","{弗里曼：}那天和你们分别后，我就跟着布里诺将军回去了。路上我觉得不对劲，布里诺将军放着好好的大路不走，却带着我们这队人绕到一处偏僻荒凉的山路里。我问他怎么走这条路，他跟我说，英拉大主教和大臣们已经商定让我回去继承王位，时间比较紧，必须尽快赶路，这条山路更近，所以才从这里走。看看天将黑，我们就在一处没人的破庙里住宿。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} As a result, he rushed through a guard in a violent way. Do you have to go all the way in?\n{Ina:} If they are so stubborn, I can't help it. It would be useless to explain to those little soldiers without seeing the Sea Dragon King first.\n{Rael:} But, do you have experience in how to fight dragons?\n{Ina:} We've played against dragons a few times before.\n{Rael:} In the past, we all used the terrain to protect ourselves by obstacles. However, this time the battlefield is at sea, but there are no obstacles for use.\n{Ina:} Ah, this is a problem. what can we do about it? If there are no obstacles, it would be too bad to try hard.\n{Rael:} Actually, I have had the experience of playing against dragons many times before, but I have a little skill.\n{Freeman:} So, I have also learned from the art of war book before, when the dragon faces the double grid soldiers, the calculation of the dragon's breath is often wrong. I don't know if it is the same situation as Rael said. ?\n{Raier:} That's right, it is to use the double grid soldiers as cannon fodder to attract the dragon's breath.\n{Ina:} Do you both know? I don't know. What should I do? Teach me to teach me...\n{Rael:} Let me do it. In fact, it is very simple, that is, let the cannon fodder of the double grid soldier stick to the main force one square, and the direction of the dragon should be opposite. For example, if the dragon is on the right of the main force, let the cannon fodder be on the left of the main force and stick one square. On the contrary, if the dragon is on the left of the main force, the cannon fodder will be on the right. In this way, the dragon thought that he could use the dragon’s breath to attack the cannon fodder and the main force at the same time. Can spray cannon fodder but can't touch the main force. Using this law, the battle against the dragon can greatly reduce losses.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be like this. Although I still can't fully understand it, I will write it down first. Next, look for opportunities to rehearse in actual combat.","{弗里曼：}结果以暴力方式冲过了一关守卫。难道下面都要一路杀进去？\n{伊娜：}如果他们都是那么固执的话，我也没办法啊。不先见到海龙王的话，跟那些小兵怎么解释都没用的。\n{雷尔：}不过，如何跟龙打架，你有经验吗？\n{伊娜：}我们以前也跟龙交手过几次的嘛。\n{雷尔：}以前我们都是利用了地形，靠障碍物保护自己。不过，这回战场都是在海上，可没有障碍物供利用。\n{伊娜：}啊，这是个问题呢。该怎么办呢？没有障碍物的话，硬拼就太吃亏啦。\n{雷尔：}其实我以前也有过多次跟龙交手的经历，倒是有一点小技巧的。\n{弗里曼：}这么说来，我以前也在兵法书上学到过，龙在面对双格兵时，对龙息的计算常常会失误，不知跟雷尔所说的是否是同一个情况？\n{雷尔：}没错，就是利用双格兵作炮灰，吸引龙息喷空。\n{伊娜：}你们两个都知道？就我不知道啊。到底该怎么做？教我教我……\n{雷尔：}我来说吧。其实很简单，就是让双格兵的炮灰贴住自己的主力部队一格，并且要与龙的方向相反。比如龙在主力右边，就让炮灰在主力左边并贴住一格。反之如果龙在主力左边炮灰就要在右边。这样一来，龙自以为可以用龙息同时攻击炮灰和主力，可是飞到攻击位置才发现，它已经无法转身了，这样龙头的位置就与它原来计算的偏差了一格，结果龙息只能喷到炮灰却碰不到主力。利用这个规律，面对龙的作战就可以大大减少损失。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样，虽然还不能完全明白，不过我先记到笔记上。接下来就在实战中找机会演练一下吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} At night, I was arranged to sleep in a wooden house alone. General Bruno told me that there are many thieves in this area and it is not safe. To be on the safe side, lock the door for me. I originally thought that there were always people on guard at night, and they would wake everyone up as soon as they found the thieves. We are a regular army, so how could we be afraid of thieves. But because I felt weird before, I always felt that General Bruno was hiding something from me, and I didn't want him to see that I was suspicious, so I didn't ask. General Bruno has always been shrewd. If he was shown something, he might be on guard against me. As a result, the door was locked by him. I can hear him inside that he has more than one lock.","{弗里曼：}晚上，我被单独安排在一间木屋里睡。布里诺将军跟我说，这一带有不少盗贼出没，不安全，为了保险起见，给我把门锁好。我本来想，卫兵夜里总有人轮班站岗，发现盗贼马上把大家叫醒不就行了吗，我们这支人马是正规军，怎么可能对盗贼害怕呢。不过因为之前就觉得诡异，我总觉得布里诺将军有什么事在瞒我，我也不想让他看出我很怀疑，就没问。布里诺将军一向精明，如果让他看出点什么，他可能会对我加强戒备。于是，门就被他锁上了。我在里面可以听得出来，他还上了不止一把锁。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Before the barrier of the Barland Army.\n{Ina:} It doesn't seem to be too strong, do you break through?\n{Freeman:} Of course, this is a good opportunity to send news to the main forces of the Barland army, so that they can come here to rescue them in discomfort, but at that time we went elsewhere, and all that was left for them was more. Go to the sky at once.","{弗里曼：}前面是巴兰德军的关卡。\n{伊娜：}好像不太强，突破吗？\n{弗里曼：}当然，这正是一个给巴兰德军主力传递消息的好机会，好让他们焦头烂额地跑来这里救援，但那时我们又往别处去了，留给他们的只是再一次扑空。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Did it succeed?\n{Mengying:} Ina's actions have stopped... But Rael seems to have tried his best.\n{Rael:}... {Ina:} Rael...You just killed me just now, why do you need to do this... I'm just a monster created by that bad guy...\n{Rael:} Don't be foolish... …Ina, you are our companion, and we need you.\n{Mengying:} It seems that consciousness has been restored, and Rael's efforts were not in vain.\n{Ina:} I...what should I do...what have I done...\n{Mengying:} There is still no time to entangle this, hurry up and catch up with Solo, while the \"Sword of Destruction\" has not lost control , To destroy him.\n{Ina:} Ah, yes, that bad guy, I won't let him go! ...But where did he go?\n{Freeman:} He said that he was on the ground. Is there a passage here that can lead directly out?\n{Mengying:} I'm afraid there is something like secret road, or secret door of organ.\n{Ina:} Then how do we find it? We are completely unfamiliar with this place. The surrounding pillars are all about the same length, and it feels like we are getting lost...\n{Freeman:} If it is a mechanism, there must be an activation device. You should be able to {find distinctive features} where the boot device is located.\n{Ina:} Okay, that's just looking for it...\n{Rael:} By the way, Ina, can you restore human form?\n{Ina:} Let me try... Ina raised her hands, and the dim low light surrounded her whole body. The butterfly wings were closed, and the scales disappeared. The light dissipated, and the hair and eyes returned to their normal colors.\n{Ina:} Yes, that’s great, you don’t have to be a monster all the time.\n{Mengying:} Sure enough, as Solo said, you have a strong ability to control the \"dark blood\"... so I can rest assured.","{弗里曼：}成功了吗？\n{梦影：}伊娜的行动停止了……不过雷尔似乎也用尽了全力。\n{雷尔：}……\n{伊娜：}雷尔……刚才你杀了我就行了，何必要这样……我只是那个坏蛋造出来的怪物而已……\n{雷尔：}别说傻话……伊娜，你是我们的同伴，我们需要你。\n{梦影：}看来恢复意识了，雷尔的努力没有白费。\n{伊娜：}我……我该怎么办……我都做了些什么……\n{梦影：}现在还没有时间纠结这些，赶快去追上索罗，趁“毁灭之剑”还没有失控，把他消灭掉。\n{伊娜：}啊，对，那个坏蛋，我不会放过他！……不过他跑到哪里去了？\n{弗里曼：}他说到地面上去了，这里有通道能直接通出去吗？\n{梦影：}恐怕有什么密道之类的吧，或者机关暗门什么的。\n{伊娜：}那该怎么找啊，我们对这里完全不熟悉，四周的柱子都长得差不多，感觉要迷路的样子……\n{弗里曼：}如果是机关的话，必然会有启动装置，启动装置所在处应该能{找到与众不同的特征}。\n{伊娜：}好吧，那也只有找找看了……\n{雷尔：}对了，伊娜，你还能恢复人类的形态吗？\n{伊娜：}我试试看……\n\n伊娜双手高举，朦胧的弱光包围全身。蝶翼收了起来，鳞甲也消失不见。光芒散去，头发和眼睛也恢复了平常的颜色。\n\n{伊娜：}可以呢，太好了，不用一直当怪物了。\n{梦影：}果然，如索罗所说，你有很强的制御“暗黑之血”的能力……这样我就放心了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Fortunately, the cabin was very dilapidated, and the wooden boards in some places were rotten. I quickly peeled away the wooden boards in the back corner and made a hole the size of a dog hole, and sneaked out. . Then I went into hiding to see what tricks General BBruno wanted to play.","{弗里曼：}好在那间小木屋非常的破旧了，有些地方的木板已经腐朽，我很快偷偷扒开了后面墙角跟的木板，弄出个狗洞大小的窟窿，偷偷溜了出去。然后我就躲起来，看布里诺将军想耍什么花招。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Go southeast through here to reach Billersberg.","{弗里曼：}通过这里向东南就能到达比勒斯勃格了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Herald is located in the {West Coast} area. There may be some {checkpoints} on the road with standing defenders, which need to be forcibly broken through, but the force will not be too much.\n{Ina:} Understood, leave it to me.","{弗里曼：}海拉尔德位于{西方沿海}地区。路上可能会有一些{关卡}有常备守军，需要强行突破，不过兵力不会太多。\n{伊娜：}了解了，交给我吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Here we are, Hylard City!\n{Ina:} Looks like there is a defender, is it a force attack?\n{Freeman:} It seems a bit unexpected to me. I thought the defenders should be very weak...\n{Ina:} And how could it be these guys. It's the same as the dragon summoned by the Demon Race called Gals... Is it Demon Race again?\n{Guardian General:} Yes, I am the demon general Fares. Who are you guys? Come to my jurisdiction with arms?\n{Ina:} A place under your jurisdiction? what happened? Isn't this the territory of the Kingdom of Barland? When did it become your jurisdiction?\n{Farez:} Huh? It seems you don't know yet. Archbishop Yingluck has commanded the two armies and assigned the area of Helald to me for garrison.\n{Freeman:} What is the relationship between Archbishop Yingluck and Mozu?\n{Farez:} I don't know what the relationship is, anyway, Lord Solo told me that he is his own. If you want to know, it is better to ask him personally. I have no interest in him, he is just a temporary collaborator for me. Having said that, who are you? What do you have to do with Archbishop Yingluck? What are you doing here with arms?\n{Freeman:} (Ina, do you have a chance of winning the siege?)\n{Ina:} (I think it should be possible, I will work hard. Moreover, there is a strong reaction on the Dragon King's divine power detector.)\n{Rael:} (Look at the sword in his hand, is it a part of the Dragon King's supernatural power?)\n{Ina:} (Roland said that the Demon Race has already got some parts, which is true. Then he should be treated more. Down.)\n{Freeman:} Then I have a showdown. I am Prince Freeman, who is being captured by Archbishop Yingluck. We are here to capture Herald.\n{Farez:} Ahahaha...It's so interesting. Unexpectedly, the person whom Archbishop Yingluck tried every possible means to look for was in front of me, and he wanted to take the initiative to attack the door. Come!\n{Devil messenger:} What's the general command? {·¨à×?1￡o}?????ì·éè￥±¨??ó￠à-′ó?÷?ì￡??μ?￥à??üí?×ó?üμ?o￡à-??μ?à′á?￡??ò·¨à×?1?íé??íê?ê°á???￡?è???2?ó?àíê|?ˉ?úá?￡??íμè×??òμ?o????￠?íDDá??￡?3±??1??????￡???òa?ò?òμ????÷?òò??-?òμ?á?￡?ííò?μ??í?????íè￥?￡ {???§2?ê1￡o}ê?￡? {·¨à×?1￡o}o?á?￡?í?×óμ???￡??????ò?íD|?é′óà?á??￡?ò?á???é?üμ?°?????×?°óμ?ó￠à-′ó?÷?ì??à?￡?2?1y￡?òaê??ò2?D?D???ê?oYá?°???′ò?àá?￡???ò2±e1??ò￡?°?1t1t1t?￡???μòa1￥3?￡????íà′°é?￡ {?￥à??ü￡o}?yè??ò?ù???￡?ò?1?ú?????′°??aà?μ??é±¨í¨?a??ó￠à-′ó?÷?ì￡?????μ??????′??o??￡ {òá?è￡o}?1óD￡?????ê2?′???′×?D?￡???ó?μ???D?ê???￡??ò?????°?ú????μ??§×?′òμ?ê±oò?íáì?ì1yá?￡????íóD?????ü??μ??-?éá??￡ {·¨à×?1￡o}±e°??ò?úò?°?μ??§???àìá2￠???￡ò2Dí??????ìy1y{?°?eμˉí??±·¨à×?1}μ???o?°é?￡??1??μ￡??ò?íé??íè?????3￠3￠?òμ????D?￡","{弗里曼：}到了，海拉尔德城！\n{伊娜：}看样子有守军唉，强攻吗？\n{弗里曼：}好像有点出乎我的意料，本来觉得守军应该很弱的……\n{伊娜：}而且怎么会是这些家伙啊。跟以前那个叫加尔斯的魔族召出来的龙一样……难道又是魔族？\n{守城将领：}没错，我是魔将军法雷斯。你们是什么人？带着武装跑到我管辖的地方来？\n{伊娜：}你管辖的地方？怎么回事？这里不是巴兰德王国的地盘吗？什么时候变成你管辖了？\n{法雷斯：}嗯？看来你还不知道嘛。英拉大主教已经统领两国军队，把海拉尔德这块地方分给我驻防了。\n{弗里曼：}英拉大主教跟魔族到底是什么关系？\n{法雷斯：}什么关系我也不知道，反正索罗大人告诉我他是自己人。你们想知道的话不如去找他本人问问好了。我对他可没什么兴趣，他对我来说只是一个临时的合作者而已。话说回来，你们是谁啊？打听这打听那的，你们跟英拉大主教有什么关系？带着武装来这里又是干什么？\n{弗里曼：}（伊娜，攻城你有胜算吗？）\n{伊娜：}（我想应该可以吧，我会努力的。而且龙王神力的探测仪上又有强烈的反应了。）\n{雷尔：}（看他手里拿的剑，难道是龙王神力的部件？）\n{伊娜：}（罗兰说过魔族已经得到了一些部件，果然是真的啊。那么更应该把他打倒了。）\n{弗里曼：}那么我就摊牌了。我是英拉大主教正在四处捉拿的弗里曼王子。我们来这里就是来攻下海拉尔德的。\n{法雷斯：}啊哈哈哈……真是太有意思了。没想到英拉大主教千方百计寻找的人竟然就在我眼前，而且还想主动攻上门来。来人！\n{恶魔差使：}将军有何吩咐？\n{法雷斯：}你赶快飞去报告英拉大主教，说弗里曼王子跑到海拉尔德来了，我法雷斯马上就收拾了他，让他不用劳师动众了，就等着我的好消息就行了。顺便还告诉他，他要我找的东西我已经找到了，晚一点就给他送去。\n{恶魔差使：}是！\n{法雷斯：}好了，王子殿下，下面我就笑纳大礼了。我会尽可能地把你活着绑到英拉大主教那里，不过，要是我不小心下手狠了把你打死了，你也别怪我，啊哈哈哈。你说要攻城，那就来吧。\n{弗里曼：}正如我所愿。我还在想怎么把这里的情报通知给英拉大主教，没想到你那么配合。\n{伊娜：}还有，你凭什么那么自信，你用的那些手下，我们之前跟其他的魔族打的时候就领教过了，早就有对付它们的经验了。\n{法雷斯：}别把我跟一般的魔将相提并论。也许你们没听过{“火弹王”法雷斯}的名号吧。没关系，我马上就让你们尝尝我的绝招。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Here, let's ask for information first. {There is a small village to the west}, we can go and take a look.","{弗里曼：}到了这里，我们先打听打听情报吧。{往西面有个小村庄}，我们可以过去看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} How about, you have heard the conversations of those on the road.\n{Ina:} Well, I recorded it all. First, the forest is the only way to Intasia; second, Holia knows where we will pass, and even knows the time we have passed; third, he deliberately set fire to the forest, claiming to be reclaiming farmland ; Fourth, if it is to reclaim farmland, the current season is not appropriate; Fifth, he gave up the huge income of worship in order to set fire; Sixth, he loves money like life, only when he can get greater benefits Give up the income of worship. Sure enough, Holiyah did it, and from this it can be seen that his claim to cultivate farmland is obviously a lie. He knew that it was our only way, so he burned us. Even at the expense of worship income. But if we kill us, can we really get more benefits than the income of worship?","{弗里曼：}怎么样，路上那些人的对话，都听到了吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我都记录下来了。\n第一，那片森林是通向因塔西亚的必经之路；\n第二，霍利亚知道我们会经过那里，甚至知道我们经过的时间；\n第三，他故意放火烧林，声称是开垦农田；\n第四，如果是开垦农田，现在的时令并不合适；\n第五，他为了放火，放弃了礼拜节的巨大收入；\n第六，他爱财如命，只有当能获得更大利益时才会放弃礼拜节的收入。\n果然是霍利亚干的没错，而且由此可见，他声称是为了开垦农田显然是说谎。他明知道那是我们的必经之路，所以才烧我们。甚至不惜牺牲礼拜节的收入。可是，干掉我们，真的能获得比礼拜节收入更大的利益吗？\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} I don't know how the domestic situation is now. It is far from Karti Asia, and there is no news at all.\n{Ina:} Let's go back and inquire about it.\n{Rael:} It may be too dangerous to return to Kartia now.\n{Freeman:} Can't go back to Kartia, but we can go to {the neighboring country to the west of Kartia}. There will be no minions of Archbishop Yingluck, and it is close to Kartia and easy to move.\n{Ina:} Okay, then when we get the \"Dragonbone Greaves\", let's go to Terracia.","{弗里曼：}不知道现在国内的情况怎么样了，这里离卡尔提亚太远，一点消息都没有。\n{伊娜：}我们回去打听一下好了。\n{雷尔：}现在回到卡尔提亚可能太危险。\n{弗里曼：}不能回卡尔提亚，不过我们可以先去{卡尔提亚西边的邻国泰拉西亚}。那里不会有英拉大主教的爪牙，离卡尔提亚又近，方便行动。\n{伊娜：}好，那么等我们取到“龙骨胫甲”后，就去泰拉西亚吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} I understand the meaning of these two lines. \"Parents of the common people, tax law, military and political affairs are only in one hand\", this is the word \"official\". \"Ten thousand volumes of poems and books, literary arts, rituals, music, one mind\", this is the word \"talent\". Taken together, it should be the word \"official talent\".\n{Ina:} Because it is written on a wooden board, add a wooden word next to it, and it becomes the word \"coffin\"?\n{Freeman:} So this is actually a code word for cracking the mechanism. Everyone compounded the coffin that they had just obtained from the depths of the passage to the door, and the door opened.","{弗里曼：}我了解到这两行字的含义了。“百姓父母，税法兵政只手握”，这是说的一个“官”字。“万卷诗书，文术礼乐一心通”，这是说的一个“才”字。合起来，应该是“官才”二字吧。\n{伊娜：}因为是写在木板上的，于是各加个木字旁，就成了“棺材”二字啦？\n{弗里曼：}所以这其实是破解机关的暗语。\n\n大家把刚才从通道深处取得的棺材复合到门上，门开了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} In the middle of the night, a few thieves appeared, all dressed in black, sneaking into the cabin where I was supposed to stay. They were not stopped by any guards, which makes me even more surprised. They don't even observe the surroundings or send anyone to watch the wind, they just listen to the movement inside the house. One of them said that there was no movement, and he should have fallen asleep. The other said, let's do it then.","{弗里曼：}深夜里，来了几个盗贼模样的人，都穿着一身黑衣，潜入到我本来应该待的小木屋旁边。他们竟然没有被任何卫兵阻拦，这更让我感到奇怪。他们甚至也不观察周围，也不派人望风，就直接探听屋里面的动静。其中一个说，没动静了，应该是睡着了。另一个说，那么下手吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Ina, aren't you scared at all?\n{Ina:} What the person said just now was that \"mostly he won't come back\", and he didn't say that he won't come back, right?\n{Freeman:} Yes, if you want to talk about the precedent of having been there and then coming back, there has been before.\n{Ina:} Someone came back, who is it? Tell me about it.\n{Freeman:} I also saw it in the Anecdote, saying that more than 70 years ago, there was a man named Chris Fayong who disappeared in the death triangle and returned after three years. However, after this man came back, he kept silent about the three years of his disappearance, and no one knew what happened to him during this period. Moreover, not long after he came back, he committed suicide.\n{Ina:} Why is this happening. It sounds so sad.\n{Freeman:} So, I never wanted to tell you the legend about the \"death triangle\".\n{Ina:} But, aren't you afraid now? And Rael, are you not afraid? If you really can't come back, it's better to stay here first, let me find out what happened alone, and then go with you after confirming the safety.\n{Rael:} I think it's easier and safer for us to act together. Sometimes you are too reckless and often hit and hit by mistake.\n{Ina:} I also said that I made a mistake by mistake, that's intuition, intuition. And I just hit it right.\n{Freeman:} In fact, I still think that the demon world entrance is more credible. Otherwise, I won't be here with you. What sea monsters, aliens, no one has seen them, they may have been fabricated. The demons may sometimes come and go through here, leaving rumors.\n{Ina:} It would be nice to ask Radia to ask clearly last time. But it doesn't matter, Jack is so sure, what else am I worried about. Jack can't go wrong.","{弗里曼：}伊娜你一点都不怕么？\n{伊娜：}刚才那人说的是去了“多半回不来”，没说一定回不来，是不是？\n{弗里曼：}对，如果要说去过了又回来的先例，以前倒是有过。\n{伊娜：}有人去了回来的，是谁啊？给我讲讲。\n{弗里曼：}我也是在逸闻录上看到的了，说70多年前，曾经有一个叫克里斯·费昂的人，曾经消失在死亡三角，过了三年后又回来了。不过，这个人回来之后，对他消失的三年间的事情一直绝口不提，任何人都不知道这段时间在他身上发生了什么。而且，他回来后没过多久，就自杀了。\n{伊娜：}为什么会这样呢。听起来真伤感。\n{弗里曼：}所以，我一直不想把关于“死亡三角”的传说讲给你听。\n{伊娜：}不过，现在你不怕吗？还有雷尔，你也不怕吗？如果真的去了回不来，不如你们先留下，让我一个人去探明个究竟，确认安全之后再跟你们一起去。\n{雷尔：}我觉得我们还是一起行动更加容易安全，你一个人有时太冒失，常常误打误撞。\n{伊娜：}又说我误打误撞了，那可是直觉耶，直觉。而且我都是撞对的哦。\n{弗里曼：}其实我还是觉得魔界入口这个说法更可信些。要不然也不会跟你们到这了。什么海怪啊，异星人啊，没有任何人看到过，可能都是捏造出来的。而魔族有时可能会通过这里来往，从而留下传言。\n{伊娜：}要是上回向拉迪亚问问清楚就好了。不过没关系，杰克这么有把握，我还担心什么呢。杰克是不会出差错的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} It's done. Put this device on the \"Observing Eye\".\n{Radia:} Alright. Go, find the way deep in the altar.","{弗里曼：}完成了。把这个装置安到“观察之眼”身上吧。\n{拉迪亚：}好了。去吧，把祭坛深处的通路找出来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Just dig a tunnel from here to the underground library. While Archbishop Yingluck is out now. Hope to find my brother.","{弗里曼：}就从这里挖地道通向地下书库吧。趁现在英拉大主教外出的时候。希望能找到我哥哥。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Kozia City is the core city of the Koz Peninsula. If it can be taken here, it will be an ideal base for fighting against Archbishop Yingluck. However, it is now heavily garrisoned...\n{Ina:} Don't worry, there will be a way to attack. I will work hard.","{弗里曼：}科齐亚城是科兹半岛的核心城市，如果这里能拿下来，将会是对抗英拉大主教的理想的根据地。不过，现在却是重兵驻防……\n{伊娜：}不用担心，会有办法攻下来的。我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Let's separate now. Thank you very much this time. By the way, didn't Ina want to learn magic? If you accept this ambassador ribbon, you can enter and leave the {Royal Academy} in Kartia City, where you can learn {Elementary Wisdom Art} and\n{Magic Arrow}. {Ina:} Great. Thank you, Your Royal Highness. I {must learn}.","{弗里曼：}我们就此分别吧。这次真的很感谢你们。对了，伊娜不是想学魔法吗？你收下这个大使勋带，就可以出入卡尔提亚城的{皇家书院}了，那里可以学到{初级智慧术}和{魔箭}。\n{伊娜：}太好了。谢谢你，王子殿下。我{一定要去学}。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Mr. Orans, the place where you live is called \"Star Gazebo\". Is it because the mountain is so high that you can see the stars when you look up?\n{Olens:} This is also one of the reasons. But the name was given by the master. During his lifetime, Master not only liked medicine, but also studied astronomy. He has made long-term observations of the brightest constellation {\"Orion\"} in the whole day, and has left quite a lot of observation records.\n{Ina:} So amazing, she is indeed a wise doctor.","{弗里曼：}奥兰斯先生，你居住的地方叫做“观星居”，是不是因为山很高，抬头就能看到星星呢？\n{奥兰斯：}这也是原因之一。不过这个名字是师父取的。师父生前不但喜欢医学，而且还对天文学很有研究。他对全天最亮的星座{“猎户座”}进行了长时间的观测，并且留下了相当多的观测记录哦。\n{伊娜：}好厉害，果然是博学多才的圣医呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} News of the attack on Helald should not be long before Archbishop Yingluck hears. However, when the forces of Archbishop Yingluck came to rescue Herald, we had already gone in another direction.\n{Ina:} However, the news that the demons sent to Archbishop Yingluck just now is that he can take us down. Will Archbishop Yingluck really come to rescue?\n{Freeman:} Certainly. Archbishop Yingluck has always been very cautious in his work. Moreover, judging from the words of the guy named Fares just now, he is relatively estranged from Archbishop Yingluck, and Archbishop Yingluck has no reason to trust him.\n{Ina:} But, did you pay attention? He said just now that the things Archbishop Yingluck asked him to find have been found and will be sent soon. What does this mean? The thing you are looking for should not refer to you, Jack.\n{Rael:} Could it be, \"Red Dragon Sword\"?\n{Ina:} Ah, yes, this guy is holding the Chilong Sword, which is exactly the part of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" we are looking for. Could it be said that Archbishop Yingluck is also looking for this thing?\n{Rael:} Archbishop Yingluck is also looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\", and the Demon is also looking for...\n{Freeman:} And Archbishop Yingluck and the Demon clearly have a certain connection. Maybe, behind the scenes, the opponent who wanted to find \"Dragon King Divine Power\" was the same. Although we still don't know who it is, the more we searched for clues that diverged, now we are gradually gathering.\n{Rael:} Will it be the evil prince Solo that the Demon Race said?\n{Freeman:} I don't know, now we have no basis for speculation at all. Maybe it was him, maybe there was someone above him.\n{Ina:} Let me sort out the clues so far. First, the Archbishop Yingluck, the Kingdom of Barland, and the demons have a subtle relationship between them. At least they are in an alliance when dealing with us. Second, there is an opponent who wants to find the \"dragon king supernatural power\". Solo, the evil prince of the Demon Race, is one of the suspects; Third, our opponents have huge plans and powerful treasures, but the treasures still need certain means to be unblocked.\n{Rael:} A good summary. Indeed, so many clues we have before can be explained as one of these few pieces of content. Ina is really amazing.\n{Ina:} Aha, I'm just diligent in writing.\n{Freeman:} Because of this, Ina will not miss any clues, and our clues can be so comprehensive. Next, in order to learn more, let's go to the royal city {Bilesberg} of the Kingdom of Barland. From here, march in a roundabout {southeast} through the hinterland of the Kingdom of Barland.\n{Ina:} Roundabout? Don't you just kill it directly?\n{Freeman:} The terrain in this area is complicated, and we deliberately walked in the inconvenient swamp. This is a good opportunity to make the Archbishop Yingluck's troops suffer. We must not only achieve our operational goals, but also The chasing soldiers of Archbishop Yingluck should be led by the nose. If they are dragged down in this area, they can no longer pose a threat to us.\n{Ina:} Jack is amazing. Okay, let's go.","{弗里曼：}海拉尔德被攻打的消息应该用不了多久就会传到英拉大主教的耳朵里。不过，等到英拉大主教的部队赶来救援海拉尔德的时候，我们已经往另一个方向去了。\n{伊娜：}不过，刚才那个魔族向英拉大主教传递的消息是他能拿下我们啊，英拉大主教真的会来救援吗？\n{弗里曼：}肯定会。英拉大主教这人做事向来十分小心谨慎，何况从刚才那个叫法雷斯的家伙的言辞来看，他跟英拉大主教的关系比较疏远，英拉大主教更加没有理由信任他。\n{伊娜：}不过，你们有没有留意，刚才他还说，英拉大主教要他找的东西已经找到了，很快就送去，这又是什么意思呢？这个要找的东西，应该不是指杰克你。\n{雷尔：}难道会是，“赤龙剑”？\n{伊娜：}啊，对耶，这家伙手上拿着赤龙剑，正是我们要找的“龙王神力”的部件。难道说，英拉大主教也要找这个东西？\n{雷尔：}英拉大主教也在找“龙王神力”，而魔族也在找……\n{弗里曼：}并且英拉大主教与魔族明显有着一定的联系。说不定，在幕后想找“龙王神力”的对手是同一个。虽然现在还不知道是谁，不过，之前我们越搜索越发散的线索，现在开始渐渐收拢了。\n{雷尔：}会是魔族所说的邪亲王索罗吗？\n{弗里曼：}不知道，现在我们根本没有推测的根据。也许是他，也许他上头还有人。\n{伊娜：}我把到目前为止的线索都整理下吧。\n一，英拉大主教，巴兰德王国，魔族，他们之间有着微妙的关系，至少在对待我们的时候是处于同盟的状态；\n二，有一个对手想找“龙王神力”。魔族的邪亲王索罗是嫌疑人物之一；\n三，我们的对手有庞大的计划和强大的宝物，但宝物还需要一定的手段才能解封。\n{雷尔：}好精炼的总结。确实如此，我们之前的那么多线索，都可以解释为这几条内容之一。伊娜果然很厉害。\n{伊娜：}啊哈，我只是勤于动笔而已。\n{弗里曼：}正因为这样，伊娜不会漏过任何一点蛛丝马迹，我们的线索才能这么全面。下面，为了了解到更多的信息，我们前往巴兰德王国的王城{比勒斯勃格}吧。就从这里向{东南}迂回行军，穿过巴兰德王国的腹地。\n{伊娜：}迂回？不直接杀过去吗？\n{弗里曼：}这一带地形复杂，我们故意走行军不便的沼泽，正是让英拉大主教的部队脚头吃点苦头的好机会，我们不但要一边达成我们的行动目的，另一方面也要把英拉大主教的追兵牵着鼻子走。在这一带把他们拖累了，他们就无法对我们再构成威胁。\n{伊娜：}杰克真了不起。好，我们出发。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} No, I tried to forcibly advance, but was pushed back by the upstream.","{弗里曼：}不行啊，尝试强行前进，又被逆流给推回来了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Not long afterward, I heard the news that Archbishop Yingluck wanted me. So I absconded to Trifia for a while. As a result, it happened to be attacked by the demons. Then I met you soon.\n{Ina:} It turns out that there is still such a complicated situation. I wrote it all down. Let me sort it out and see what we can get based on the current information.","{弗里曼：}后来没多久，就听到了英拉大主教通缉我的消息。于是我就潜逃到了特里菲亚先避一避。结果正好遇到了魔族的袭击。然后不久就遇到了你们。\n{伊娜：}原来还有这么复杂的情况。我都记下来了。下面我来整理一下，看看根据目前这些信息，我们能得到些什么。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Now I am more and more worried about my brother's safety. Judging from what Bruno said, Archbishop Yingluck hadn't paid attention to his brother at all. It looks like his situation is very bad.\n{Rael:} Maybe under house arrest, or in the worst case, may have been killed...\n{Ina:} Ah, don't say it so terrible.\n{Freeman:} I want to confirm it. If my brother is still alive, I want to talk to him. If he can be persuaded to oppose Archbishop Yingluck together, maybe the situation will be changed a lot.\n{Rael:} But now if you return to Kartia, it is still very dangerous.\n{Freeman:} Of course you can't go back head-on. I thought of an {underground library} in the north of the city of Kartia. This library was owned by Archbishop Yingluck. My brother used to study there most of the time when he was alone. I want to {dig a tunnel} to find him in that underground library.\n{Ina:} Since it is the library owned by Archbishop Yingluck, will he himself be in it?\n{Freeman:} Of course it might be. However, I have sent some peasant brothers to reconnaissance. The news they got is that tomorrow, Archbishop Yingluck said he would go out and canceled the upper court. In this case, it is an opportunity.\n{Ina:} Okay, then we will go to the underground library to find your brother tomorrow.","{弗里曼：}现在我越来越担心哥哥的安危了。从布里诺所说的情况来看，英拉大主教根本没把哥哥放在眼里。看起来他的情况很不妙。\n{雷尔：}也许被软禁，或者最坏的情况，有可能已经被杀了……\n{伊娜：}啊，不要说得那么可怕啦。\n{弗里曼：}我想去确认一下。如果我哥哥还在的话，我想跟他谈谈，如果能说服他一同反对英拉大主教，也许局面会大有改观。\n{雷尔：}可是你现在如果回到卡尔提亚依然很危险。\n{弗里曼：}当然不能正面回去。我想到了卡尔提亚王城的北面有个{地下书库}，这个书库是归英拉大主教所有的，哥哥以前一个人时大部分时间都在那里读书。我想{挖个地道}到那个地下书库里去找他。\n{伊娜：}既然是英拉大主教拥有的书库，那么他本人会不会也在里面呢？\n{弗里曼：}当然有可能会在。不过，我已经派了一些农民兄弟去侦察了，他们得到的消息是，明天英拉大主教说要外出，取消了上朝。这样的话，就是个机会了。\n{伊娜：}好，那么明天我们一起去那个地下书库找你哥哥。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Now we have basically discussed the battle plan. At present, the demons seem to be looking for a treasure called \"Dragonbone Greaves\" in this area...\n{Ina:} Ah, do you know the \"Dragonbone Greaves\"?\n{No one:} \"Dragon Bone Greaves\" is the family heirloom of my grandfather's uncle's father-in-law. In fact, it is of little use to us, but the demons want it and absolutely can't give it to them.\n{Rael:} So where is the \"Dragonbone Greaves\" now?\n{No one:} My foresight two years ago, when I hid it in another place, and didn't tell anyone. So Mozu Kuang knew that it was in my house, and they were desperately searching in this area, and they couldn't find it even if they died.\n{Ina:} In fact, we are also looking for this thing, it is also very important to us.\n{No one:} Is that so? Well, if you help us defeat the demons, I will take this thing as a gift.\n{Rael:} Is this okay? This is a heirloom treasure...\n{No one:} If we are killed by the demons, then any treasure is meaningless, so you are welcome.\n{Freeman:} Wait a minute, I won't be too late to discuss the matter of gratitude. The top priority now is to implement our combat plan.\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm sorry... Please tell me, I'll take the record.\n{Freeman:} There is a general of the Demon Race called {Slander}, who is the leader of the Demon Race army leading this area. His magic is very powerful. Our plan is to find an opportunity to get rid of him. If you get rid of him, the rest of Xiaoluo shouldn't be afraid. No one's eldest sister took a few residents to move in the direction of the mountain first to attract their attention. You equip the crossbow I made according to this book. As long as Slander is not there, it shouldn't be a problem to deal with the small soldiers.\n{No one:} Well, this task is left to us.\n{Freeman:} At the same time, I posted these cards to the places where the demons often patrol. It said, \"Dragonbone Greaves\" was taken to the beach by a girl who ran very fast.\n{Rael:} Isn't it too dangerous to post to a place where the demons often move? Leave this task to me.\n{Freeman:} I thought about doing it myself because of danger, Mr. Rael, are you really okay?\n{Rael:} I'm still good at it, trust me. You are the indispensable commander-in-chief here, so it's better not to venture out.\n{Freeman:} Well, then I beg you. finally, Ina went to {the seaside} at the same time and led Slander over alone. Because the road by the sea is relatively winding and difficult to walk, Slander should not be able to lead his troops to chase him. He is likely to use flying magic to chase Ina alone, and then Ina will find a chance to plot against him.\n{Ina:} He can fly...\n{Freeman:} I know that Ina has good feet, so I came up with this plan. Ina, do you think it's okay?\n{Ina:} Don't worry, I will work hard, leave it to me.\n{Freeman:} Then Mr. Rael will take these cards first.","{弗里曼：}现在我们基本把作战计划商量好了。目前魔族好像在这一带找一件叫做“龙骨胫甲”的宝物……\n{伊娜：}啊，你们知道“龙骨胫甲”？\n{没有人：}“龙骨胫甲”是我爷爷的舅舅的丈人的家传之宝，其实对我们也没多大用处，但是魔族想要，绝对不能给他们。\n{雷尔：}那么现在“龙骨胫甲”在哪里呢？\n{没有人：}我两年前的先见之明啊，当时我把它藏到了另一个地方，并且没有告诉任何人。所以魔族光知道在我家，就在这一带拼命找，找死他们也找不到。\n{伊娜：}其实，我们也在找这件东西，它对我们也很重要。\n{没有人：}这样啊？那么正好，如果你帮我们打败了魔族，我就拿这件东西作为谢礼赠送。\n{雷尔：}这样好吗？这可是传家宝物……\n{没有人：}如果我们被魔族杀死，那么什么宝物都没有意义了，所以你们不用客气。\n{弗里曼：}等一下，谢礼的事情以后再谈不迟，现在当务之急是执行我们的作战计划。\n{伊娜：}啊，对不起……请讲，我作记录。\n{弗里曼：}魔族有一个将军叫{斯兰德}，是率领这一带的魔族军队的首领，他的魔法非常强大。我们的计划就是找机会除掉他。如果把他干掉了，剩下的小喽罗都不足为惧。没有人大姐带几个居民先往山里方向移动，吸引他们的注意，你们装备上我照这本书制作的连弩，只要斯兰德不在，对付小兵应当不成问题。\n{没有人：}好，这个任务交给我们了。\n{弗里曼：}同时我把这些卡片贴到魔族经常巡逻的地方去，这上面写着，“龙骨胫甲”被一个跑得很快的女孩带到海边去了。\n{雷尔：}要贴到魔族经常活动的地方，是不是太危险了？这个任务交给我吧。\n{弗里曼：}就是因为危险我才考虑自己做的，雷尔先生，你真的没问题？\n{雷尔：}我身手还是不错的，相信我。你是这里不可缺少的总指挥，还是不要出去冒险的好。\n{弗里曼：}好吧，那么就拜托你了。最后，伊娜在同一时间往{海边}去，把斯兰德单独引过来。因为海边的路比较绕，有点难走，斯兰德应该没法带兵一起追，他很可能利用飞行魔法单独追击伊娜，然后伊娜就找机会暗算他。\n{伊娜：}他还会飞啊……\n{弗里曼：}我知道伊娜脚力很好，所以想出了这个计划，伊娜你觉得可以吗？\n{伊娜：}放心，我会努力的，交给我吧。\n{弗里曼：}那么雷尔先生先把这些卡片收下吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Said it is a VIP seat, but it is actually closer to the stage.\n{Ina:} Only then can I see it more clearly. You see, how handsome is the dance of Brother Youni...\n{Rael:}... {Ina:} Huh? Rael, where are you looking? Don't you like street dancing? How do you look aside?\n{Rael:} Shhhhhhhhhhhhh, the two masked men on the left look a little suspicious. Why do you have to cover your face while watching the show?\n{Mask A:} I said the captain, is it really okay for us to watch this show? We are performing official duties.\n{Masked Man B:} You less nonsense. How could you miss the concert of the Yuni brothers? I am a loyal fan of them.\n{Mask A:} But what about our official business? Go to Li Qide for that longan ring. If you don't do your official business well, Lord Solo will blame it...\n{Mask Man B:} You fool! If you don't know how to appreciate it, how can you be so stupid to tell us all about our tasks, what should we do if we are heard?\n{Mask A:} The music is so loud, no one should notice us talking. And this is the VIP seat, it should be fine if there are not many people...\n{Ina:} We have heard it. Are you demons?\n{Mask A:} Huh? You are?\n{Ina:} Don't worry about who we are, you dare to get involved in the concert venue of the Youni Brothers to make trouble, unforgivable!\n{Masked Man B:} We didn't make trouble, okay.\n{Ina:} Then do you dare to uncover the headscarf.\n{Masked Man B:}...\n{Masked Man A:} Captain, what should I do? If it is revealed, the appearance of our demons will be exposed...\n{Mask B:} You stupid, you will die if you don't tell it! How can I stand on your stupid subordinates...\n{Mask A:} Captain, you can withdraw first, I'll find a way to hold them.\n{Masked Man B:} There is no way, only this, I will flash first, and then hand it to you.\n{Rael:} Want to run? I still have me here. Rael leaped forward, stopped in front of the masked man trying to escape, drew his sword and aimed at him.\n{Mask A:} The one with the sword, get out of the way! Don't look at who is in my hands now? On the stage, a demon put a knife against Yuni's brother's neck. His turban had fallen to one side, revealing a red face with double horns. The audience rioted. Brother Unico on the stage is at a loss.\n{Ina:} Ah, despicable! It actually ruined the performance, and also used the Youni brothers as hostages.\n{Demon A:} Did you hear that, the one with the sword, get out of the way!\n{Rael:} Well, since there is no other way, I can only let go of this one. We cannot let innocent people get involved.\n{Mask B:} Hey, I said, it's okay to take them as hostages, but if you dare to hurt my idol Brother Youni, I will fight you desperately. It's flashing, everyone will have a period later!\n{Demon A:} Hey, Captain, you are making it difficult for me. If I can't hurt the hostage, this is a fart hostage! They would beat me without any worries. ?a?aForget it, the captain has already gotten away.\n{Ina:} Let that escape.\n{Rael:} If I knew this was the case, I wouldn't let him go.\n{Ina:} The rest is...\n{Demon A:} Ah, I... can't hurt the hostages, and there is nowhere to escape, there is no way, I can only start first!","{弗里曼：}说是贵宾席，其实就是离舞台更近一些吧。\n{伊娜：}这样才看得更清楚啊。你们看，尤尼兄弟的舞姿有多帅啊……\n{雷尔：}……\n{伊娜：}唉？雷尔，你在看哪里？你不喜欢街舞吗？怎么往旁边看？\n{雷尔：}嘘……小声，左边那两个蒙面人，看上去有点可疑。为什么来看演出却要把脸遮起来？\n\n{蒙面人A：}我说队长，我们来看这演出真的好吗？我们可是在执行公务中啊。\n{蒙面人B：}你少废话。尤尼兄弟的公演怎么能错过。我可是他们忠实的粉丝。\n{蒙面人A：}可是我们的公务怎么办？要去找李奇德要那个什么龙眼戒。如果不把公务办好，索罗大人怪罪下来……\n{蒙面人B：}你个笨蛋！你不懂得欣赏也就罢了，怎么笨到把我们的任务都说出来啊，给人听到怎么办？\n{蒙面人A：}音乐声音这么大，应该没人注意到我们说话吧。而且这里是贵宾席，人不多应该没事……\n\n{伊娜：}我们已经听到了哦。你们是魔族吧？\n{蒙面人A：}啊？你们是？\n{伊娜：}我们是谁你就不用管了，你们居然敢混入尤尼兄弟的公演会场来捣乱，不可饶恕！\n{蒙面人B：}我们没捣乱好不好。\n{伊娜：}那你们敢不敢把头巾揭开啊。\n{蒙面人B：}……\n{蒙面人A：}队长，怎么办？要是揭开了，我们的魔族的长相就会暴露了……\n{蒙面人B：}你个笨蛋，你不说出来会死啊！我怎么摊上你这么个笨蛋部下……\n{蒙面人A：}队长你先撤吧，我来想办法拖住他们。\n{蒙面人B：}没办法了，只有这样了，我先闪了，后面交给你。\n{雷尔：}想跑？这儿还有我呢。\n\n雷尔飞身一跃，拦在试图逃跑的蒙面人前面，抽出剑来对准了他。\n\n{蒙面人A：}拿剑的那个，让开！也不看看现在谁在我手里？\n\n舞台上，一个恶魔用刀抵住了尤尼弟弟的脖子。他的头巾已经掉在一边，露出长着双角的红色的脸。观众骚乱起来。舞台上的尤尼哥哥不知所措。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，卑鄙！居然破坏了演出，而且还用尤尼兄弟做人质。\n{恶魔A：}听到没有，拿剑的，让开！\n{雷尔：}好吧，既然这样没办法了，我只能放走这一个了。我们不能让无辜的人牵连进来。\n{蒙面人B：}喂，我说，拿他们做人质可以，不过你要是敢伤害我的偶像尤尼兄弟，我跟你拼命。闪啦，各位后会有期！\n\n{恶魔A：}喂，队长，你这是叫我难办啊。如果我不能伤害人质，这还叫屁的人质啊！他们就会毫无顾虑地揍我了。——算了，队长已经脱身了就好。\n\n{伊娜：}让那个逃掉了。\n{雷尔：}早知是这样，我就不放走他了。\n{伊娜：}那么剩下的就是……\n{恶魔A：}啊，我……不能伤害人质，又没地方可逃，没办法了，只能先下手为强！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} So you killed the father too! You rebel!\n{Yingla:} Rebel? Hahaha! Don't make a mistake, now the rebel is you. Why do you think I am willing to tell you everything now? Because you can't escape. I will solve you now, and then blame you for all the chaos in the country, so no one will dare to oppose me.\n{Ina:} Don’t think about it! I won't let you succeed!\n{Freeman:} Ina, don't mess around. Archbishop Yingluck was the strongest magician in the country a long time ago. You are not his opponent at all now.\n{Ina:} Ah, what should I do?\n{Freeman:} Let’s {find a way to get out of here}. Now that everything is clear, my purpose of coming here has been achieved. Archbishop Yingluck’s account, when we become stronger in the future, we will naturally come to him again.","{弗里曼：}原来父王也是你杀的！你这个逆贼！\n{英拉：}逆贼？哈哈哈！可别弄错了，现在逆贼可是你自己哦。你以为我为什么现在愿意把一切都告诉你？因为你逃不出去了。我现在把你解决掉，然后把国家的混乱都归罪于你，就不会再有人敢反对我了。\n{伊娜：}休想！我不会让你得逞的！\n{弗里曼：}伊娜，不要乱来，英拉大主教很久以前就是全国最强的魔法师了，你现在根本不是他的对手。\n{伊娜：}啊，那怎么办？\n{弗里曼：}我们{先想办法离开这里}吧。既然事情都弄清楚了，我来这里的目的也就达到了。英拉大主教的帐，等我们以后实力更强了自然会再来找他算。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Speaking of which, there is also a prehistoric ruin near here.\n{Ina:} Is this the tall and pointed behemoth next to us?\n{Freeman:} Well, its name is \"Tima Space Center\".\n{Ina:} Uh, what does this name mean? \"Aerospace\", a word I have never heard of...\n{Freeman:} Actually, I don't know much. There are some legends about this thing, saying that this thing actually allows people to fly to the stars.\n{Ina:} It's amazing! However, the star is so small, how can a person stand up? Isn't it easy to fall off?\n{Freeman:} It's just a legend. I don't know if it's true or not. However, being able to fly to the stars is really fascinating. It would be great if I could realize this dream one day...","{弗里曼：}说起来，这边附近也有一个史前遗迹呢。\n{伊娜：}就是我们旁边这个又高又尖的庞然大物吗？\n{弗里曼：}嗯，它的名字叫“蒂玛宇航中心”。\n{伊娜：}呃，这个名字是什么意思啊？“宇航”，从没听说过的词……\n{弗里曼：}其实我也不太清楚。有一些传说关于这个东西的，说这东西居然能让人飞到星星上去。\n{伊娜：}太神奇了！可是，星星那么小，人怎么站得上去呢，不是很容易就摔下来了吗？\n{弗里曼：}传说而已，是真是假还不知道呢。不过，能飞到星星上去，这的确很让人神往啊。如果有朝一日我能实现这个梦想就好了……\n\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} Sure enough, Ina has a way to eliminate the Dragoon troops, and we can continue to implement the original plan. Then let's set off to {Billersberg}.","{弗里曼：}伊娜果然有办法，把龙骑兵部队消灭了，我们就可以继续实行原来的计划了。那么就向{比勒斯勃格}出发吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} The barrier of the Barland Army is not far away. Our mode of action should be changed from sneaking in before, to a surprise attack that is too fast to cover our ears. In this way, all the way to the city of Hylard, let them know our existence.","{弗里曼：}巴兰德军的关卡不远了。我们的行动方式要从之前的偷偷潜入，改为迅雷不及掩耳之势的奇袭。就这样一路直捣海拉尔德城，让他们知道我们的存在。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} The ice around it seems to be melting.\n{Ina:} Yes, the water on the ground has flowed into a river. If this goes on...\n{Elder:} In the worst case, if all the ice here melts, the village we live in will be completely submerged.\n{Ina:} This, how can this be, it's all my fault...\n{Freeman:} Is there any way to stop the melting of the ice?\n{Elder:} If all the power of the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is suppressed, it should be able to prevent the melting of ice. The power of the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" exists in the enchantment in the form of various flame-like creatures. Only by destroying all of them can the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" be stopped.\n{Ina:} Great. There is still a way to prevent the melting of ice. Let's find out all the flame creatures in the enchantment.\n{Elder:} No! {Ina:} Huh?\n{Elder:} What you have to do now is to quickly find the Phoenix Phoenix and defeat him.\n{Ina:} But everyone’s village...\n{Elder:} Which is more important for the safety of a village or the safety of the entire continent of Mirronia? Don't I need to explain? The Phoenix is now in a state of just being more awake. Give him a moment to breathe, and he will be more powerful, and you will be less likely to win. As a guardian, I have not been able to protect this enchantment. Now that I have something to do, I have no intention of thinking about my village!\n{Ina:} Elder...Woo...It's obviously my fault, the elder still said so...\n{Elder:} Now you are the only one who can defeat the Phoenix before it fully recovers. Don't hesitate, go ahead!\n{Ina:} I understand, I will work hard!","{弗里曼：}四周的冰，似乎正在融化。\n{伊娜：}是啊，地上水流成河了，这样下去的话……\n{长老：}最坏的情况，这里的冰全部融化光，那么我们住的村子也就会全部被淹没了。\n{伊娜：}这，这怎么可以，都是我的错……\n{弗里曼：}有什么办法能阻止冰的融化吗？\n{长老：}如果把“火灵珠”的力量全部扼止住的话，应该能阻止冰的融化。“火灵珠”的力量在结界中以各种火炎类生物的形式存在，只有把他们全部消灭，才能扼止住“火灵珠”。\n{伊娜：}太好了，还有办法能阻止冰的融化，我们这就去找出所有结界中的火炎生物吧。\n{长老：}不！\n{伊娜：}唉？\n{长老：}现在你要做的，是赶紧找到不死鸟菲尼克斯，并且击败他。\n{伊娜：}可是，大家的村子……\n{长老：}一个村子的安危，和米尔罗尼亚整个大陆的安危，哪个更重要？不用我解释吧？不死鸟现在处于刚刚更醒的状态，多给他一刻喘息的时间，他就会多一分强大，你就会少一分胜算。作为守护者，我没能保护好这个结界，事到如今，还有什么心思去考虑自己的村子！\n{伊娜：}长老……呜……明明是我的错，长老还这么说……\n{长老：}现在你是唯一有可能在不死鸟完全恢复前打败他的人。别犹豫了，赶快前进！\n{伊娜：}我明白了，我会努力的！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} The intelligence is here. The main force of Barland's army has gone to Helald, but they rushed to the air. Now it's time to come here. We let them follow us to practice leg strength.","{弗里曼：}情报来了。巴兰德军的主力已经向海拉尔德去了，不过他们扑了个空。下面该朝这边来了吧。我们就让他们跟着我们练练腿劲。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} The news of Helald's fall must have reached the ears of Archbishop Yingluck. While he was mobilizing the army, we could cross the hinterland of the Kingdom of Barland and head south, directly attacking the royal city of Bilesberg.\n{Ina:} Well, leave it to me. My marching speed can finally come in handy at this time.\n{Freeman:} There may still be some defenders along the way, we fight and go, the sooner the better, don't delay with them.","{弗里曼：}海拉尔德失陷的消息想必已经传到英拉大主教耳朵里了。趁着他调动大军的时候，我们可以以迅雷不及掩耳之势穿越巴兰德王国的腹地南下，直接奔袭王城比勒斯勃格。\n{伊娜：}嗯，交给我吧。我的行军速度在这个时候终于能派上用处啦。\n{弗里曼：}沿途可能还是会碰到一些守军，我们且战且走，越快越好，不要跟他们拖延时间。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} There are organs in the water, please be careful!","{弗里曼：}水里面也有机关，大家小心！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} There is a prehistoric site here, which can be regarded as one of the sights of Mirronia. Have you heard of it?\n{Rael:} I'm from another continent, of course I don't know.\n{Ina:} I flipped through it... There is no in the little Ina universal notebook, and it seems that Grandpa hasn't told me about it either.\n{Freeman:} This is the huge object to the west of us.\n{Ina:} The shape of this thing is really peculiar.\n{Rael:} It's a bit like a boat, but not like it. Not even a mast. Besides, it looks like it's made of metal, so it shouldn't float on the water, right?\n{Ina:} Can this thing be launched? It seems to be stranded now...\n{Freeman:} I don't know if this thing can be launched. Its official name is \"Sylvia Aircraft Carrier\". As for whether it is a boat or not, and what purpose it is used for, there is no record of any remaining documents. Archaeologists also have their own conjectures, and there are different opinions. It is said that some archaeologists went up to examine it carefully and were shocked by the sophisticated equipment inside. It is therefore speculated that people in the past may have a civilization that surpassed ours. Unfortunately, no one knows the purpose of this thing.\n{Ina:} So, what do you think this is Jack?\n{Freeman:} Even the archaeologists don't know it, and I'm even less qualified to guess at random. But I personally still tend to think that this is a boat.\n{Rael:} Not to mention the purpose. If it is a boat, there are two points that cannot be explained. One is how metal can float on the water, and the other is how the boat's power comes from if there is no mast, and there is no surrounding area. paddle.\n{Freeman:} The first question is easy to say, even if it is metal, as long as the inside is hollow, it can make the whole density smaller than water and float on the water. Have you ever had such experience? The iron pot and iron basin we use can float on water. This is the same principle.\n{Ina:} Really, when I think of it, when I was a child, I helped my grandpa wash the pot by the river, but I kept putting the pot on the water for a long time and didn't clean it well. My grandpa criticized it...\n{Raier:} Haha, it turns outòá?èê??a?′í??¤μ?o￠×ó?￡ {òá?è￡o}2?DíD|￡? {à×??￡o}??￡?μú?t???êìa￡??ü???ü?aêí?e￡? {?￥à??ü￡o}?ò?ú??￡?ê?2?ê?óDê2?′·?á|2?á|ò?íaμ??????ˉá|?éò?1?′?ê1ó???￡???êμ???ú1¤3ì?§à?óDoü?à?úDμ??ó?μ?á?èè?ˉá|￡?è?1?°??aó|ó?μ?′?é?￡?ê?·?ò2?éò???￡?μ±è??a??ê??òμ?ò???11??￡?ò?oóóD?ú?á￡??ò??êμ?ù?′?′?￡ {òá?è￡o}?ü??o?à÷o|￡????ú′yê2?′ê±oò?ü???ü×?3?ò???2?ó?·?2?ó??°ò2?ü?ˉμ?′?à′?￡","{弗里曼：}这里有一处史前遗迹，也算是米尔罗尼亚的名胜之一了，你们有听过吗？\n{雷尔：}我是其他大陆来的，当然不知道了。\n{伊娜：}我翻我翻……伊娜酱万能笔记本上没有耶，看来爷爷也没跟我说过。\n{弗里曼：}就是我们西边这个巨大的物体了。\n{伊娜：}这个东西造型确实挺奇特呢。\n{雷尔：}有点像船，又不像。连桅都没有。而且，像是金属制的，应该没法浮在水上吧？\n{伊娜：}这东西能下水？现在貌似搁浅中嘛……\n{弗里曼：}我也不知道这东西能不能下水。它的正式名称叫做“斯尔维亚号航空母舰”。至于是不是一只船，以及作什么用途，现在没有任何存留的文献有记载。考古学家们也是各有各的猜想，众说纷纭。据说有考古学家登上去仔细考查过，为里面的精密的设备大感震惊，因而推测远古以前的人们或许拥有超越我们的文明也说不定呢。可惜的是目前也没有任何人能知道这东西的用途。\n{伊娜：}那么，杰克你认为这是个什么呢？\n{弗里曼：}连考古专家都不清楚，我就更没资格乱猜了。不过我个人还是倾向于认为这是一只船。\n{雷尔：}且不说用途如何，如果是船的话，有两点没法解释，一个是金属如何能浮在水上，还有一个是没有桅的话船的动力从哪来呢，周围也没有桨。\n{弗里曼：}第一个问题好说，就算是金属，只要里面是空心的，就可以让整体的密度比水小而浮在水上。你们有没有过这样的经验？我们用的铁锅铁盆，是可以浮在水上的哦，这也是同样的原理。\n{伊娜：}真的耶，想起来我小时候帮爷爷在河边刷锅，结果一直把锅放在水上玩半天都没刷好，还被爷爷批评了……\n{雷尔：}哈哈，原来伊娜是这么顽皮的孩子。\n{伊娜：}不许笑！\n{雷尔：}那，第二个问题，杰克能解释吗？\n{弗里曼：}我在想，是不是有什么风力槽力以外的其他动力可以供船使用呢？其实现在工程学里有很多机械都用到了热动力，如果把这应用到船上，是否也可以呢？当然这只是我的一个构想，以后有机会，我想实践看看。\n{伊娜：}杰克好厉害，真期待什么时候杰克能做出一只不用帆不用桨也能动的船来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} There is a vast inland sea between Terracia and Solandria. However, although it is vast, it is not convenient to travel by boat, because there are quite a lot of islands and reefs in this sea area. Sometimes you have to go around close at hand. If the ship handling skills are not good enough, it is easy to hit the rocks.\n{Ina:} Jack's geography is really strong.\n{Freeman:} An overview of the geography of Mirronia, this is a compulsory course when we were in middle school.","{弗里曼：}泰拉西亚和索兰德里亚之间，是一片辽阔的内海。不过，虽然辽阔，行船却并不方便，因为这片海域岛礁相当的多。有时近在咫尺的地方却不得不绕行。操船技术如果不够好，也很容易触礁。\n{伊娜：}杰克的地理真强。\n{弗里曼：}米尔罗尼亚地理概况，这是我们上中学时的必修课啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} They piled some firewood on the side of the cabin, then lit a torch and threw it on, and then the few people slipped away. The cabin quickly ignited a raging fire. At this time, a soldier yelled and caught fire. Soon everyone woke up. General Bruno never appeared. The soldiers didn't know what to do. There was no water source nearby, and they couldn't put out the fire. Taking advantage of the chaos, no one paid attention to the surroundings, so I ran away by myself.","{弗里曼：}他们在小木屋边上还堆上一些木柴，然后就点了个火把丢上去，然后那几个人就溜走了。小木屋很快就燃起熊熊大火。这时有士兵喊起来，着火了。很快大家都醒了。布里诺将军却一直没出现。士兵们也不知道怎么办，附近并没有水源，他们也没法灭火。趁着乱，没人注意周围，我就自己逃走了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} This should be Port Rosen. It just so happens that there are boats available. If you flee to Kozia by sea, you will not be caught again.\n{Man A:} Thank you heroes for thinking so thoughtfully for us, but we have never been on a boat, and we are a little worried...\n{Man B:} If we encounter big storms or pinates...\n{Rael:} And they may not know how to sail.\n{Ina:} Hmm...I'll take a part from the army and go back with them. These fighters are all experts who have experienced all kinds of battles on land and sea with me. Whether it is sailing a boat or acting as a bodyguard, there is no problem.","{弗里曼：}这里应该就是罗森港了。正好也有船可用。你们从海路逃去科齐亚，就不会再被抓到了。\n{男子A：}谢谢英雄们为我们想得这么周到，可是我们没坐过船，有点担心……\n{男子B：}如果遇到大风浪，或者遇到海盗什么的……\n{雷尔：}而且他们可能还不会驾船吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯……我从部队中抽调出一部分，跟他们一起回去吧。这些战士都是跟我经历过海上陆上各种大小战斗的能手，不管是驾船还是当保镖，都没有问题的。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} This should be the gateway to the outside. There are signs of movement on this wall and footprints on the ground. Try to mount the metal disc we just got in the middle of the distinctive lighthouse, and it might be able to open it.","{弗里曼：}这里应该就是通向外面的通道没错了。这面墙有移动过的痕迹，而且地上有脚印。把我们刚才在与众不同的灯塔中间取得的金属圆盘镶上去试试，说不定就能打开了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Freeman:} We are not far from the coast.\n{Rael:} There is movement, hidden!\n{Freeman:} People from the Black Tigers!\n{Ina:} Listen to what they say.\n{Srael:} Captain Byron, Prince Freeman is currently active in this area. One of our team members has died, and the signal he painted before his death has been found by us.\n{Byron:} Archbishop Yingluck is really wise, and he wants to pass here. But this is the only way to the coast. As long as I stay here, he will never pass.\n{Sreier:} However, I can't just wait and see, I will continue to send people to search.\n{Byron:} Yes, once you find his trace, you will chase him, Sraer, and I will guard this intersection, so it will be difficult for him to fly.\n{Sraer:} Don't worry, the captain, there is my Freelander Sraer. Once he catches him, he has no chance to resist and he will be killed by me.","{弗里曼：}我们离海岸不远了。\n{雷尔：}有动静，隐蔽！\n{弗里曼：}黑虎特工队的人！\n{伊娜：}听听他们说些什么。\n\n{斯蕾尔：}拜伦队长，弗里曼王子目前在这一带活动已经可以确信了。我们有一个队员已经牺牲了，他死前画下的信号已经被我们找到。\n{拜伦：}英拉大主教果然英明，算到他想通过这里。不过通往海岸的必经之路只有这一条，我只要把守在这里，他就休想通过。\n{斯蕾尔：}不过，也不能光是守株待兔，我还是继续派人搜索。\n{拜伦：}对，一旦找到了他的踪迹，斯蕾尔你就去追击他，而我就死守这个路口，这样量他插翅也难飞。\n{斯蕾尔：}队长放心，有我神行者斯蕾尔在，一旦逮着他，他根本没有反抗的机会就被我干掉了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{General:} Stop. In front of it is the Royal City of Intasia, and no one is allowed to enter. I am Roin, the commander of the Janissaries.\n{Ina:} Is Prime Minister Holia in there?\n{Roin:} The Prime Minister is inside. But if you want to see the Prime Minister, you need to make an appointment. Don't you know about this procedure?\n{Ina:} Ah, we are priests who come from afar to participate in worship.\n{Roin:} Nonsense! A forest on the only way to the province was burned by the Prime Minister, and now it is impossible to pass through. How could the priests of other places come now?\n{Ina:} Really? We came a few days in advance. How could the Prime Minister set fire to the main traffic arteries? You won't lie to us?\n{Roin:} Cheer, this general is a confidant of the Prime Minister, and I can know more or less about the Prime Minister. How can I lie to you? In order to get rid of Ina and others, the Prime Minister had no choice but to make this move. Because the army couldn't beat them, they thought of this strategy, tricked them into passing through the woods, and then set fire to them as they passed. The Prime Minister also asked us to unify our stance with the outside world, saying that it was for the purpose of reclaiming farmland.\n{Ina:} That's it. But it costs such a big price to get rid of Ina and the others, even if the festival is not required, isn't it uneconomical?\n{Roin:} The Prime Minister never does anything uneconomical. How can his strategy be comparable to you? In fact, as long as the Prime Minister can get rid of Ina, the Mozu promised a huge bounty, which is much higher than the income of the festival. Regarding this matter, Lord Prime Minister only tells us a few cronies who know about it, and don't tell others, otherwise, if people know that Lord Prime Minister is trading with the demons, the public's reputation will be bad.\n{Ina:} But you told us all this.\n{Roin:} Ah, oh, I actually said it all. This is terrible. For such an important matter, if you let the Prime Minister know that I missed my mouth, I will definitely be punished. I don't know how much money I have to put in order to let the Prime Minister calm down. This is the seventh time I have leaked my mouth. ...Yes, huh, the Prime Minister has been teaching me, \"The dead can't speak\". Now as long as you silence you, no one will know these things.\n{Ina:} Hey, how can you be like this? Anyway, you are also a general. How can you kill innocent people in order to cover up your mistakes?\n{Roin:} What's the matter with the general? Which general did not charge the Prime Minister with enough money to be promoted? If you were punished for a little mistake, wouldn't all the money you stuffed before be spent in vain? Killing a few civilians by mistake, this kind of thing can be settled with a small amount of money, and it is not worth mentioning compared to the cost of courting the Prime Minister! Okay, don't worry, I will pay 100 gold coins to each of your family members afterwards. kill!","{将军：}站住。前面是因塔西亚王城了，无关人等不得进入。我是禁卫军统领罗因。\n{伊娜：}请问霍利亚宰相大人在不在里面呢？\n{罗因：}宰相大人在里面。不过想见宰相大人要预约，这个程序，你们不知道吗？\n{伊娜：}啊，我们是远道而来参加礼拜节的神官啦。\n{罗因：}胡说！通向外省的必经之路上的一片森林被宰相大人派人烧了，现在根本不能通行，其他地方的神官现在怎么可能来得了？\n{伊娜：}真的假的？我们提前几天就来了啦。宰相大人怎么会放火烧交通要道呢？你不会骗我们吧？\n{罗因：}切，本将军可是宰相大人亲手提拔的亲信，宰相大人的事情，我多少都能知道。怎么会骗你们？宰相大人为了除掉伊娜等人，不得已才出此下策。因为军队打不过他们，就想了这个计谋，诱骗他们经过那片树林，然后在他们经过时放火。宰相大人还要求我们对外统一口风，就说是为了开垦农田呢。\n{伊娜：}这样啊。可是为了除掉伊娜等人就花这么大的代价，连礼拜节都不要了，是不是不太合算？\n{罗因：}宰相大人从来都不做不合算的事情。他的谋略哪是你们能比的。实际上是这样，只要宰相大人能除掉伊娜，魔族许诺了巨额赏金，比礼拜节的收入高多了。这个事情啊，宰相大人只给我们几个亲信知道，对别人都不告诉的，要不然让人知道了宰相大人跟魔族进行交易，老百姓的风评就不好了。\n{伊娜：}可是你却把这些都告诉我们了耶。\n{罗因：}啊，糟了，我居然都说出来了。这下惨了，这么重要的事情，如果让宰相大人知道我说漏了嘴，一定会被处罚的，又不知我要塞多少钱才能让宰相大人息怒，这已经是我第7次说漏嘴了啊……有了，哼，宰相大人一直教导我的，“死人是不会说话的”，现在只要把你们灭口了，就不会有人知道这些事情了。\n{伊娜：}喂，你怎么能这样啊，好歹你也是一个将军，怎么能为了掩饰自己的错误就滥杀无辜？\n{罗因：}将军怎么了，哪个将军不是向宰相大人塞了足够多的钱才晋升上来的？如果因为一点错误被处分，之前塞的钱不就全部白花了吗？误杀几个平民什么的，这种事情只要花点小钱就能平息，比起讨好宰相大人的花费来说根本不值得一提！好了，你们只管放心，事后我会给你们家属每人100金币的赔偿金的。杀！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Gentleman:} I have a trouble. I have been in love with a girl for many years, but I have been unable to produce a diamond to make her an engagement ring. What should I do?\n{Ina:} If you are in love, you will get married. Why do you still need diamonds?\n{Gentleman:} I'm also a gentleman. I still have to talk about face. If I can't even get the diamonds out of the proposal, where should I put my face...\n{Ina:} None of the people in my village seem to be able to afford it. Diamonds, don't they get married in the same way.\n{Gentleman:} Hey, you can't say that. After all, I am a gentleman, and I can also be regarded as the upper class of society. How can people compare with the poor if they look up high. In the future, I will go to the class reunion. If my wife doesn't even have a diamond ring, I won't be laughed at by them.\n{Ina:} What a joke about this, comparison is not desinable. Grandpa taught me since I was a child. Money is not one's own, and there is nothing worth showing off and comparison. What's more, the money of most wealthy people is not their own labor income. It is just sugar daddy, inheriting parents, or breaking households. People who really work hard to get rich will not show off, because he knows how much hardship is hidden behind the rich. In contrast, knowledge, knowledge, talent, and craftsmanship, these things that are completely one's own, can't be stolen by anyone, so they are worthy of pride.\n{Gentleman:} Although that's what I said, I still hope to have a diamond. Can you help me?\n{Ina:} I won't help you.","{绅士：}我有一个烦恼。我跟一个姑娘相爱已经多年了，可是，我一直拿不出一颗钻石来给她做定婚戒指。这让我怎么办才好呢？\n{伊娜：}如果你们相爱，就结婚呗，为什么还一定要钻石？\n{绅士：}怎么说我也是一个绅士，面子还是要讲的，如果求婚连钻石都拿不出来，那脸往哪来搁啊……\n{伊娜：}我村里的人好像没有一个买得起钻石的，他们不是也照样结婚嘛。\n{绅士：}唉，话不能这么说呀，毕竟我是绅士，也算是社会的上层人，所谓人往高处看，怎么能跟穷的比呢。以后我去参加同学会，要是老婆连钻戒都没，还不是要被他们笑话死啊。\n{伊娜：}这有什么好笑话的啦，攀比之风不可取，爷爷从小就教我的。钱财不是自己的东西，没什么值得炫耀攀比的，何况大多数有钱人的钱并不是自己劳动所得呢，只是傍大款啊，继承父母啊，或者爆发户之类。真正勤劳致富的人并不会炫耀的哦，因为他知道富裕的背后隐含着多少辛苦。相比之下，学问，知识，才华，技艺，这些完全属于自己的东西，谁也偷不走的，才值得自豪吧。\n{绅士：}虽然话是这么说，不过，我还是希望能有一颗钻石啊，能不能帮帮我呢？\n{伊娜：}我才不帮你呢。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Gentleman:} I still hope to have a diamond, can you help me?\n{Ina:} I won't help you.","{绅士：}我还是希望能有一颗钻石啊，能不能帮帮我呢？\n{伊娜：}我才不帮你呢。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ghost:} Although this speed necklace is not a treasure, it should be useful to you.","{鬼魂：}这个极速项链，虽然算不上珍宝，不过，应该会对你有用。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ghost:} Don't kill me! Do not kill me! I'll give you all the money! Don't kill me!\n{Ina:} Ah, is this a resentful spirit?\n{Ghost:} Don't kill me! Do not kill me! I'll give you all the money! Don't kill me!\n{Rael:} It looks like this is an innocent person killed by a pinate.\n{Ghost:} Don't kill me! Do not kill me! I'll give you all the money! Don't kill me!\n{Ina:} Hey, can you only say this?\n{Ghost:} Don't kill me! Do not kill me! I'll give you all the money! Don't kill me!\n{Ina:} Well, although you are very pitiful, there is no way to pester people here. The pinates have been wiped out by me, and I have avenged you. You also go back to heaven.\n{Ghost:} Don't kill me! Do not kill me! I'll give you all the money! Don't kill me!","{幽灵：}不要杀我！不要杀我！钱统统给你！不要杀我啊！\n{伊娜：}啊，这是怨灵？\n{幽灵：}不要杀我！不要杀我！钱统统给你！不要杀我啊！\n{雷尔：}看起来这是被海盗杀死的无辜的人啊。\n{幽灵：}不要杀我！不要杀我！钱统统给你！不要杀我啊！\n{伊娜：}喂，你只会说这一句话吗？\n{幽灵：}不要杀我！不要杀我！钱统统给你！不要杀我啊！\n{伊娜：}好吧，虽然你很可怜，不过赖在这里缠人也不是办法。海盗已经被我消灭了，算是给你报过仇了。你也回天国去吧。\n{幽灵：}不要杀我！不要杀我！钱统统给你！不要杀我啊！\n\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ghost:} I finally got home.","{鬼魂：}终于到家了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ghost:} We have no money, let us go!\n{Ina:} Alas, it's the poor victim again.\n{Ghost:} We have no money, let us go!\n{Ina:} Will you let me go?\n{Ghost:} We have no money, let us go!\n{Ina:} Alas, it doesn't make sense.\n{Ghost:} We have no money, let us go!","{幽灵：}我们没有钱，放过我们吧！\n{伊娜：}唉，又是可怜的被害者。\n{幽灵：}我们没有钱，放过我们吧！\n{伊娜：}你们放过我好不好？\n{幽灵：}我们没有钱，放过我们吧！\n{伊娜：}唉，说不通。\n{幽灵：}我们没有钱，放过我们吧！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ghost:} What? A brother is missing?\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm sorry...\n{Ghost:} I have warned you again and again that we can't lose one of our brothers. Now you are dead, you have no choice but to read files.","{鬼魂：}什么？有兄弟不见了？\n{伊娜：}啊，对不起……\n{鬼魂：}我一再警告过你的，不能让我们兄弟少了一个。这下你死定了，你除了读档之外别无选择。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Girl:} Are you from outside?\n{Ina:} Yeah. {Girl:} Another guest is here~~~~~~!\n{Ina:} Wait a minute, is this?\n{Girl:} Let’s prepare a welcome party for my sister.\n{Ina:} I haven't figured out what's going on...\n{Girl:} You just come with us.","{女孩：}你们是外面来的人？\n{伊娜：}是啊。\n{女孩：}又有客人来了~~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}等一下，这是？\n{女孩：}我们这就给姐姐准备欢迎会。\n{伊娜：}我还没搞明白是怎么回事呢……\n{女孩：}你跟我们来就是了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Girl:} This is the Horn Valley, the valley is cold and desolate, did the two go the wrong way?\n{Ina:} Ah, we are just coming to Horn Valley. Let's find a hermit named Mengying.\n{Girl:} I am Xinxue, the apprentice of Master Mengying, and I am responsible for driving the door away for the master. The master stayed deep in Jian and didn't want to be disturbed, so he lived in seclusion in this deserted place. Please come back.\n{Ina:} We have very important things to ask him, very important, very important, and it is related to the rise and fall of a country...\n{Xinxue:} The master has long been determined to stay away from the world, the rise and fall has nothing to do with him.\n{Ina:} But it has something to do with us. Let's ask a question and leave after asking, can we?\n{Xinxue:} No way.\n{Ina:} This matter is really important to us, this sister shouldn't be so tough.\n{Xinxue:} Saying no is no good.\n{Ina:} Uh, why is this... Rael, come here, hurry up, run!\n{Xinxue:} Do you want to force yourself? No doors!","{少女：}这里是霍恩山谷，谷内寒冷荒凉，两位是不是走错路了？\n{伊娜：}啊，我们就是要到霍恩山谷来着。我们来找一位叫梦影的隐士。\n{少女：}我是梦影师傅的徒弟心雪，负责替师傅把门赶走拜访的人。师傅深居简出不愿意被人打扰，所以才隐居在这荒无人烟的地方。你们还是请回吧。\n{伊娜：}我们有十分重要的事情要请教他，很重要很重要，事关一个国家的兴亡……\n{心雪：}师傅早已决心远离世事，兴亡盛衰与他都没有关系了。\n{伊娜：}可是跟我们有关系啊。我们就请教个问题，问完就走，行不行？\n{心雪：}不行。\n{伊娜：}这事真的对我们很重要啦，这位姐姐不要这么强硬啦。\n{心雪：}说不行就是不行。\n{伊娜：}呜，怎么这样……雷尔，这边来，快，用跑的！\n{心雪：}你们想硬闯？门都没有！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Grave Robber:} No, no, I don't know anything about institutions. There is really no way, I used all my strength to smash, and I don't believe that you can't break the wall!\n{Ina:} Stop it!\n{Grave Robber:} Huh? Why stop?\n{Ina:} Are you stupid? How can there be such a smash, if you really smash it desperately, this tomb road has shaken you, and we will all be buried here alive.\n{Grave Robber:} It makes sense, then what do you say? ?a?aAh, no, who are you? Why did you break here?\n{Ina:} So you discovered that we are strangers...\n{Grave Robber:} No matter who you are, don't even want to touch my treasure. I can't smash this wall, I'll smash you first!","{盗墓贼：}不行不行，俺对机关一窍不通。实在没办法，俺就使出全部力气砸了，就不信砸不开你个破墙！\n{伊娜：}住手！\n{盗墓贼：}嗯？为什么要住手？\n{伊娜：}你笨伐？哪有这么砸的，你要真的拼命砸，这墓道给你震塌方了，我们都要被活埋在这里。\n{盗墓贼：}有道理，那你说该怎么办？——啊，不对，你们是谁？怎么会闯到这里来的？\n{伊娜：}原来你这才发现我们是陌生人啊……\n{盗墓贼：}不管你们是谁，别想碰俺的财宝。砸不开这墙，俺先把你们砸烂！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Grave Robber:} What's going on! Who are you two? Didn't Hank catch the wind at the door? How could he let others in...\n{Ina:} It turned out that the guy at the door who was beaten to the ground by us was called Hank. Are you a group?\n{Grave Robber:} Damn, broke in privately to steal our treasures, and beat our brothers...\n{Ina:} Have you made any mistakes? It is you who broke in privately, here It's someone else's tomb, not your home. And just now, your brother couldn't help but did it first, otherwise we don't want to fight...\n{Grave Rogue:} Stop talking nonsense, my brothers discovered this place first, this place is ours, and all the treasures here belong to ours!\n{Ina:} Hey, don't rush to do it... No matter how it is a virtue, there is really a brother who has a brother.","{盗墓贼：}怎么回事！你们2个是谁？汉克不是在门口把风的吗，怎么会放别人进来……\n{伊娜：}原来门口那个被我们打趴下的家伙叫汉克啊。你们是一伙的喽？\n{盗墓贼：}他娘的，私自闯进来抢俺们的宝藏，还殴打俺们的兄弟……\n{伊娜：}话说你有没有搞错啊，私自闯进来的是你们唉，这里是别人的陵墓，又不是你家。而且刚才是你兄弟不由分说先动手的，要不然我们才不想打架……\n{盗墓贼：}少废话，俺们兄弟先发现的这里，这里就是俺们的，这里的宝物全是俺们的！\n{伊娜：}唉，别急着动手啊……怎么都一个德性，真是有其弟必有其兄。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} Ah, isn't this Master Melia? What brought you here.\n{Mengying:} Sorry, I'm just a little urgent, I want you to make it easier. I need to borrow the \"Sword of Creation\".\n{Guard:} Since Master Melia speaks, of course there is no problem. I will fetch it now.\n{Mengying:} Thank you, I’m sorry to trouble you.\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying is so amazing...\n{Rael:} It must have been something extraordinary.\n{Mengying:} Don’t ask me about my past, the bitter past, I don’t want to bring back memories, otherwise I won’t live in seclusion.\n{Ina:} Well, I won't ask.\n{Mengying:} After we get the \"Sword of Creation\", we can't do it here. The destructive power of the two swords is very large and will damage the Holy Land of Tianchi Mountain. We {find another place} Go do it.\n{Ina:} Find another place, um, that's fine.\n{Guard:} Master Melia has been waiting for a long time. \"The Sword of Creation\" is here. Excuse me, how long can I get back?\n{Mengying:} This... I think about it...\n{Ina:} Maybe it won’t come back yet...\n{Guard:} What! What do you mean?\n{Mengying:} Ina, I told you not to say anything, what about you...\n{Ina:} But, I don't think it's good to lie. We asked them to borrow something, and we could see that the \"sword of creation\" was very important to them. If you don't tell them the truth of the matter...\n{Mengying:} Sometimes you have to understand strategy and not be too honest. These guys are stubborn to death, if you tell them the truth, they won't give it to you.\n{Guard:} What the hell is going on, Master Melia? Are you trying to lie to us?\n{Mengying:} Well, so far, I can only tell you the seriousness of the situation.","{守卫：}啊，这不是梅丽亚大人吗？什么风把您给吹来了。\n{梦影：}对不起，我只是有点急事，想请你们行个方便。我需要借用一下“创世之剑”。\n{守卫：}既然梅丽亚大人开口，当然没问题。我这就去取来。\n{梦影：}多谢，麻烦你了。\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐好厉害……\n{雷尔：}曾经一定是什么了不得的人物。\n{梦影：}我的曾经，你们就不要问了，辛酸的往事，不太想勾起回忆，要不然我也不会隐居起来。\n{伊娜：}好吧，我就不问了。\n{梦影：}等下得到了“创世之剑”之后，我们不能在这里动手，两剑相击产生的破坏力非常大，会把天池山圣地损坏的，我们{另找一处地方}去动手。\n{伊娜：}另找一个地方啊，嗯，也好。\n{守卫：}让梅丽亚大人久等了。“创世之剑”在此。请问，多久能还回来呢？\n{梦影：}这个……我想想……\n{伊娜：}可能还不回来了也说不定耶……\n{守卫：}什么！什么意思？\n{梦影：}伊娜，我叫你别说的，你怎么……\n{伊娜：}可是，我觉得说谎不好啊。我们是问他们借东西，而且看得出来“创世之剑”对他们而言非常重要。如果不告诉他们事情的真相的话……\n{梦影：}有的时候要懂得策略，不能太老实。这些家伙固执得要死，要是告诉他们真相，他们才不会给你呢。\n{守卫：}到底是怎么回事，梅丽亚大人？难道你想骗我们？\n{梦影：}好吧，事到如今，我也只有把事态的严重性告诉你们了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} Go...what a joke! You want to use the \"Sword of Creation\" to destroy the \"Sword of Destruction\"! In this case, if the \"Sword of Destruction\" can be destroyed, the \"Sword of Creation\" will also be crushed! How does this work!\n{Mengying:} So I tell you that the situation is serious, because Solo has unblocked the \"Sword of Destruction\". If you don't destroy it, there is no other way to stop the \"Sword of Destruction\". Maybe the whole world will be destroyed. Therefore, we had no alternative but to make this move.\n{Guard:} However, it is absolutely unacceptable to pay for the \"Sword of Creation\" for this. Even Master Melia, I can't give it!\n{Ina:} Do you prefer to watch the world be destroyed?\n{Guard:} What if the world is destroyed, as long as we have the \"creation sword\" in hand, we can recreate a new world on the ruins of destruction. The world hasn't been destroyed before, isn't it just like this one after another? Thousands of years ago, those human beings who had mastered a high degree of civilization even had the ability to send themselves to the universe, but they killed each other for their own selfish desires, and finally evolved into a nuclear war, which destroyed the entire world. Or do we rely on this \"sword of creation\" to recreate and appear in this world on the dead earth?\n{Ina:} Do you want to say that the lives and deaths of so many people have nothing to do with you? Don't you feel worthy of pity at all?\n{Guard:} Since you are friends of Master Melia, we can make an exception to let you stay here to avoid dying in the destruction of the world. After we have created a new world, you will go back. There should be no comments, right?\n{Ina:} No, I'm not worried about my own life or death. I don't want to watch others die, Auntie Anne, Uncle John, Uncle Robert, Uncle Lederman, and Mr. Bad...\n{Guard:} Stop it! Allowing you to stay here is an exception in the face of Master Melia. The number of people cannot be increased.\n{Ina:} That’s not what I meant! I mean, why must we let the world be destroyed, when there is clearly a way to save it? As long as the \"Sword of Destruction\" is destroyed, won't everyone be safe? Why can't you understand?\n{Guard:} Why do you want to take the \"sword of creation\" for such a small amount of human life? After all, human beings are just the dust of history. For their lives, sacrifice the \"creation sword\"? You are too unreasonable.\n{Mengying:} Look, I said, they are so stubborn that they don't make sense at all.\n{Ina:} Woo...how could this happen, I thought it would be enough to tell the truth...\n{Mengying:} Now there is no other way, if your mood to save everyone is real, then show it Show him, use your strength to grab the \"Sword of Creation\".\n{Ina:} Is this... okay?\n{Mengying:} How about you spend a few days and nights with him? It won’t be useful even if you spend a few days and nights.\n{Ina:} Well, since sister Mengying said so, I have only this choice. It's rude, Mr. Guard.","{守卫：}开……开什么玩笑！你们想用“创世之剑”去破坏“毁灭之剑”！这样的话，如果“毁灭之剑”能够破坏，“创世之剑”也一样要粉碎！这怎么行！\n{梦影：}所以我跟你说事态严重，因为索罗把“毁灭之剑”解封了，如果不破坏它，没有其他办法阻止“毁灭之剑”，也许整个世界都会被毁灭。所以我们也是不得已才出此下策。\n{守卫：}但是，要为此赔上“创世之剑”，绝对不能接受。即使是梅丽亚大人，我也不能给！\n{伊娜：}难道，你就情愿看着世界被毁灭吗？\n{守卫：}世界毁灭了又怎么样，只要我们还有“创世之剑”在手，就可以在毁灭的废墟上重新创造新的世界。世界以前又不是没有毁灭过，不就是这么一次次轮回过来的吗？数千年前，那些已经掌握了高度文明的人类，甚至有了能力将自己送上宇宙，可是他们为了自己的私欲，互相残杀，最后演变成了核战争，把整个世界都毁灭了，后来不还是我们依靠这“创世之剑”，在已经死亡的大地上重新创造出现在这个世界吗？\n{伊娜：}你想说，那么多人的生死，都与你无关吗，你都一点不觉得值得怜悯吗？\n{守卫：}你们几位既然是梅丽亚大人的朋友，我们可以破例让你们居留于此地，以免在世界毁灭中死去。等我们创造了新的世界之后，你们再回去。这样总该没有意见了吧？\n{伊娜：}不，我不是为自己的生死担心，我更不愿意眼睁睁地看着别人死去，安妮大婶，约翰大叔，罗伯特大叔，莱德曼大爷，还有坏人先生……\n{守卫：}打住打住！允许你们几个居留于此已经是看在梅丽亚大人的脸面上破例了。不能再增加人数了。\n{伊娜：}我不是这个意思啦！我是说，为什么一定要放任世界被毁灭，在明明还可能有办法挽救的情况下？只要破坏了“毁灭之剑”，大家不就都可以安全了吗？你怎么就不能理解呢？\n{守卫：}为什么要为了那么点人的性命搭上“创世之剑”？人类说到底只是历史的尘埃而已，为了他们的性命，牺牲“创世之剑”？你也太不可理喻了。\n{梦影：}看吧，我就说了，他们固执得很，根本说不通的。\n{伊娜：}呜……怎么会这样，我还以为说出实情就可以了的……\n{梦影：}现在没有别的办法了，如果你想救大家的心情是真实的，那么就展现给他看看吧，用你的实力，去强夺“创世之剑”。\n{伊娜：}这……这样好吗？\n{梦影：}要不然你再陪他磨上几天几夜的嘴皮子？就算磨上几天几夜也不会有用的。\n{伊娜：}好吧，既然梦影姐姐这么说了，我也只有这一个选择了。失礼了，守卫先生。\n\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} No one is allowed to go to sea on the tribute day.","{守卫：}贡礼日任何人不准出海。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} Now is the time to drill. If there is no special task, you can go back to your own department.","{卫兵：}现在是操练时间，如果没有特别任务的话，你们回到自己所属部门去。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} So you are the guests of Prince Freeman. Since you have the \"Ambassador Ribbon\", please pass it.","{卫兵：}原来你们是弗里曼王子的客人啊，你们既然有“大使勋带”，那么就请通过吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} This is the Autonomous Prefecture of Belentania. Armed personnel cannot enter.","{守卫：}这里是贝伦塔尼亚自治州。武装人员不能入内。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} This is the Autonomous Prefecture of Belentania. Armed personnel cannot enter.\n{Ina:} We are not armed men. We are businessmen. We came here to do business with the Li Qide family. This is a letter of recommendation.\n{Guard:} Hmm... Since there is a letter of recommendation, of course we can't stop the guests of the Li Qide family. However, weapons and dangerous goods cannot be brought in. You must keep the axe.","{守卫：}这里是贝伦塔尼亚自治州。武装人员不能入内。\n{伊娜：}我们不是武装人员啦，我们是商人，来这里是找李奇德家族做生意的。这是推荐信。\n{守卫：}唔……既然有推荐信，李奇德家族的客人我们当然不能阻拦。不过，武器及危险品不能带入，你们必须把那个斧头留下。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} This is the Red Sea Fleet checkpoint. Only carry the \"Navy Outpost Pass\" to pass.","{守卫：}这里是赤海舰队检查站。只有携带“海军前哨通行证”才能通过。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} This is the north port of the base. What are you doing here?","{卫兵：}这里是基地北港口。你们来这里干什么？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guard:} This leads to Kartia {Royal Academy}. Irrelevant personnel are not allowed to enter.","{卫兵：}这里通向卡尔提亚{皇家书院}。无关人员不得入内。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guardian:} Only 1,000 gold coins are required to visit the \"Star Axis\".","{门卫：}参观“星轴”只要门票1000金币哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guardian:} This is the historical site \"Star Axis\", which has been declared as a national cultural heritage. If you are interested, you might as well visit it.","{门卫：}这里是历史遗迹“星轴”，已经申报了国家文化遗产啦。各位感兴趣的话，不妨参观一下。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Guardian:} We are guarding the Royal Library on the order of Archbishop Yingluck, and other people are not allowed to enter without the permission of the archbishop, even Prince Freeman.\n{Ina:} Not so, I just want to visit and learn.\n{Guardian:} The Royal Library is not a place where inferior civilians like you can study. It is more appropriate to recommend you to the {Garden of Truth} outside the door to study.\n{Ina:} Why do you look down on people so much!\n{Guardian:} If we don't leave yet, we are chasing the guests. Don't blame us for using violence.","{门卫：}我们奉英拉大主教的命令把守皇家图书馆，闲杂人等未经大主教的许可不得进入，即使是弗里曼王子也不例外。\n{伊娜：}不至于吧，我只是想参观学习一下。\n{门卫：}皇家图书馆不是你这样的下等平民可以学习的地方，推荐你到门外的{真理之园}去学习比较合适。\n{伊娜：}你怎么这么瞧不起人！\n{门卫：}还不走，我们逐客了，别怪我们使用暴力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Host:} Haven't found all 5 children? Please continue to work hard.","{主持人：}还没有找齐5个小朋友吗？请继续加油哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Host:} If all 5 kids are found, please come here.","{主持人：}如果5个小朋友都找到了，请到这里来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Host:} Then the award-winning interactive activity at Corberos Kindergarten has officially started. The first project is hide and seek. Participants are asked to find {5 children hiding somewhere in the kindergarten}. All the friends found go to the previous {Mushroom House} to participate in the activities of the next project.","{主持人：}那么科尔伯洛斯幼儿园有奖互动活动正式开始。第一个项目是捉迷藏。请参与者把{5个藏在幼儿园内某处的小朋友}找到。全部找到的朋友到前面的{蘑菇屋}里参加下一个项目的活动。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Host:} You finally found 5 kids. Congratulations. Then we move on to the next project. Questions are given by children.\n{Children:} Can you read the nursery rhymes we read in the classroom, sister?\n{Ina:} Ah, I will. A ghost dog has three mouths, six eyes and four legs.\n{Children:} My title is about this nursery rhyme. Sister, listen carefully. A dog with DC open mouth, CDA with eyes, DB with legs, B dog with DE, open mouth, FDB with eyes, CDA with legs A*B=?\n{Moderator:} Okay, the problem came out. Participants are asked to take this badge and go to the place where you think the correct answer is in exchange for a prize.","{主持人：}你终于找齐了5个小朋友。恭喜。那么我们进入下一个项目。由小朋友来出题。\n{小朋友：}我们在教室里念的儿歌，姐姐你会念吗？\n{伊娜：}啊，我会。一只冥犬三张嘴，六只眼睛四条腿。\n{小朋友：}我的题目就是关于这个儿歌的。姐姐你听好了。\n\nA只冥犬DC张嘴，CDA只眼睛DB条腿\nB只冥犬DE张嘴，FDB只眼睛CDA条腿\nA*B=？\n\n{主持人：}好，问题出来了。请参与者拿上这个徽章，到你认为正确的答案处去换取奖品。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Hunter:} Before the barrier of the Barland Army, they will not let you pass. If you don't want to be robbed of your property, don't go here.\n{Ina:} I am not afraid of the villains of the Barland army. If I encounter them, I will teach them a lesson.\n{Hunter:} Really? Then you first try to see if you can beat me. If you can't even win with me, you will definitely not be able to beat the Barland army over there.\n{Ina:} Are you good? Can I use magic?\n{Hunter:} I'm not that good, but I don't think I have a small number of people, but I will have a high morale. So if you don't use magic, you won't be able to beat me.\n{Ina:} Doesn't morale rise depend on luck?\n{Hunter:} Haha, it looks like luck on the surface, but you can try it. I guarantee 100% morale after attacking you for the first time. You can try whatever you want.\n{Ina:} Really? I would like to take a look.","{猎人：}前面是巴兰德军的关卡，他们不会放你们通过的。你们如果不想被抢财物的话，还是别打这儿走了。\n{伊娜：}巴兰德军那群恶棍，我可不怕他们，如果碰到了，我就教训他们一顿。\n{猎人：}是吗？那么你先来试试能不能赢过我。如果你连我都赢不了，肯定打不过那边的巴兰德军。\n{伊娜：}你很厉害吗？我能不能用魔法？\n{猎人：}我不算厉害吧，不过，别看我人少，我可是会士气高涨的哦。所以你要是不用魔法不见得能赢我。\n{伊娜：}士气高涨不是要看运气的吗？\n{猎人：}哈哈，表面上看起来是运气，不过，你可以来试试，我保证第一次攻击你后100%士气高涨，随便你怎么试都行。\n{伊娜：}真的假的？我倒想领教一下看看呢。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ice Elf:} The barrier is destroyed, intruder, kill!\n{Ina:} Wait, what's the matter?\n{Ice Elf:} Kill!","{冰精灵：}结界被破坏了，入侵者，杀！\n{伊娜：}等等，怎么回事？\n{冰精灵：}杀！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} \"Dragon Eye Ring\" should be near here.\n{Rael:} There is a sandy beach on the seashore, and there are many shell fragments. If it is mixed in the sand, it may not be easy to find. You can't dig three feet.\n{Freeman:} The queen lost it while swimming. If she was washed on this beach, she wouldn't be buried very deep.\n{Ina:} Well, I have a way. Ina took off her shoes and started running laps on the beach.\n{Freeman:} Take off your shoes? What is this for?\n{Ina:} \"Dragon Eye Ring\" should be a ring-shaped thing. When you take your shoes off and kick with your feet in the sand, it will be easier for the ring-shaped objects to hang on your toes.\n{Rael:} Great idea! I am coming too.\n{Ina:} Rael, you can't do it, you see that your toes are so thick, it's impossible to fit a ring the size of a ring.\n{Rael:} None of us have seen the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", who knows how big it is, try again.\n{Freeman:} Then I will come too.\n{Ina:} Oops! {Rael:} What's wrong?\n{Ina:} My toe hurts, and it's a hard thing. Look at it.\n{Rael:} This is the \"Longan Ring\"?\n{Ina:} It was bigger than I thought.","{伊娜：}“龙眼指环”应该就在这里附近了吧。\n{雷尔：}海边一片沙滩，贝壳碎片什么的也很多，如果是混在沙地里面，恐怕不太好找。总不能挖地三尺吧。\n{弗里曼：}女王在游泳时遗失的，如果被冲到这沙滩上，不会埋得很深吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我有个办法。\n伊娜脱掉鞋子，开始在沙滩上跑圈。\n{弗里曼：}脱掉鞋子？这是干什么？\n{伊娜：}“龙眼指环”应该是个环形的东西吧。把鞋脱了，用脚在沙子里踢的时候，环形的东西就会比较容易挂到脚趾上啊。\n{雷尔：}好主意！我也来。\n{伊娜：}雷尔你不行的啦，你看你脚趾那么粗，戒指大小的环没可能套得上去的。\n{雷尔：}我们都没见过“龙眼指环”，谁知道它多大呢，试试再说。\n{弗里曼：}那么我也来。\n{伊娜：}哎呀！\n{雷尔：}怎么了？\n{伊娜：}脚趾好痛，挂到个好硬的东西耶。你们看。\n{雷尔：}这个就是“龙眼指环”？\n{伊娜：}果然比我想像的要大耶。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} \"Dragon Eye Ring\" should be right in this direction.","{伊娜：}“龙眼指环”应该是在这个方向没错了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} \"Hailongze\", it seems we are still in the right place.\n{Rael:} You just hit and hit by mistake.\n{Ina:} Not really. Girls are intuitive.\n{Freeman:} Anyway, it's good to have a direction.","{伊娜：}“海龙泽”，看来我们还是走对地方了。\n{雷尔：}你简直就是误打误撞嘛。\n{伊娜：}才不是呢。女孩子可是有直觉的哦。\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，有方向了就好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} (It seems that we have circulated most of the library. Still there is no one.)\n{Rael:} (Maybe he didn't come to read today?)\n{Freeman:} (Let's look for it again .Until I look it up.)","{伊娜：}（似乎我们已经把大半个书库转遍了吧。还是一个人影都没有。）\n{雷尔：}（也许他今天没来读书？）\n{弗里曼：}（我们再找找。找遍为止。）"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} (Jack, where does your brother usually read in the library?)\n{Freeman:} (I don't know, he seems to read all books. Let's find them all.)","{伊娜：}（杰克，你哥哥一般在书库的哪里读书的呢？）\n{弗里曼：}（我也不清楚，他似乎什么书都读。我们全部找一遍吧。）"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} A mess of stone forest, completely lost. What should we do, how can we find the way forward?\n{Rael:} If there is a way, you may be able to find the way by following the traces of others.\n{Ina:} But the ground is full of hard rocks, there is no way to leave footprints. What's more, the female devil used to fly and would not have footprints.","{伊娜：}一片乱石林，完全迷路了耶。怎么办，到底该怎么走才能找到向前的通路呢？\n{雷尔：}如果有路的话，循着别人走过的痕迹也许能找到路。\n{伊娜：}可是地上都是硬石，根本留不下脚印。何况那个女恶魔是用飞的，也不会有脚印。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} A strange crystal fell from the demon just now. What is this thing, it shouldn't be something in this temple, the color is different, this color is red.\n{Rael:} Seems to be an important prop.\n{Freeman:} Put it away first. This is not the time to study this thing. Go to Salman and his son first.\n{Ina:} Well, as long as they are safe.","{伊娜：}从刚才的魔族身上掉下来一个奇怪的水晶体，这个东西是什么，应该不是这个神殿里面的东西，颜色不一样呢，这个颜色红红的。\n{雷尔：}看起来是个重要的道具。\n{弗里曼：}先收着吧。现在不是研究这个东西的时候。先去找萨尔曼父子。\n{伊娜：}嗯，只要他们平安就好。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} According to the records of Ina-chan's universal notebook, {Uncle Lederman's house} is from here {to the west}. Let's go slowly. Fortunately, it's not too far.\n{Rael:} I really appreciate you, Ina. I don't know how to thank you.\n{Ina:} Don't be so polite. Helping people in difficulty is what everyone should do. If you really intend to thank me, it's better to tell me about you.\n{Rael:} Are you really going to know? Knowing it will do you no good.\n{Ina:} Stop selling it, just talk about it.\n{Rael:} Well, since you saved me, I shouldn't hide anything from you. The thing is like this. My hometown, my country, is occupied by the monsters of the demons. They slaughtered mankind, robbed wealth, and killed all the rebels.\n{Ina:} Too much...\n{Reel:} Originally, I organized a team to fight to the end, but the enemy was too strong. They had a magician with boundless power, the dark prince Pallas, we were not them at all. Opponent. Many of my companions died. Originally, I planned to fight to death like them, but they told me that the glorious saints with the Augustine surname could not just die like this. I must live. As long as I live, I have the hope of defeating the demons. . But the demons hunted and killed me everywhere in the entire Aryanian continent. Gradually, I became nowhere to hide. Later, with the help of my companions, in a dark and stormy night, I secretly drove away in a small boat. To Ariana. I didn't know how many days of drifting in the vast sea, but the wind became stronger and stronger. Fortunately, I had seen the land, but my boat couldn't stand it. I wanted to find a tidal flat to dock, but I couldn't control the boat at all. I was blown into the rocks on the shore, the boat was completely destroyed, and my leg was hurt. I tried desperately to climb from the boat to the shore until dawn, and then I met you.\n{Ina:} Very poor. It turns out that you are here for refuge.\n{Rael:} No, I came here with another purpose. I must find something. With that thing, I can defeat the dark prince Pallas and revive my country.\n{Ina:} Great, I will help you find it.\n{Rael:} No, I will look for it myself after I recover. This matter cannot involve you. Besides, the demons will definitely chase me after they find out that I have escaped. You don't know how terrible they are. If you are with me, you will be in danger and you may even die. I can't hurt innocent people.\n{Ina:} Maybe I really don't know how terrible your enemy is. However, they can't forgive them for doing such an excessive thing. You are a great person. In order to rejuvenate your country, you are struggling with difficulty alone, and you don't want to hurt others. However, now that I know such a thing, how can I stand by and watch. Even a little bit is fine, I hope I can help you do a little bit of meager efforts to revive your country.","{伊娜：}根据伊娜酱万能笔记本的记载，{莱德曼大爷家}是从这边{往西}走。我们慢慢过去吧。还好不太远。\n{雷尔：}真的很感激你，伊娜。不知道该怎么谢你才好。\n{伊娜：}不用这么客气啦，帮助有困难的人是每个人应该做的事情呀。如果你当真打算谢我，不如还是把你的事情告诉我。\n{雷尔：}你真的打算知道吗？知道了对你没什么好处。\n{伊娜：}别卖关子了，说吧说吧。\n{雷尔：}好吧，既然你救了我，我也不该对你隐瞒什么。事情是这样的。我的故乡，我的国家，被魔族的怪物们占领了。他们屠杀人类，抢夺财富，并且对所有的反抗者斩尽杀绝。\n{伊娜：}好过分……\n{雷尔：}原先我组织了一队人马想要反抗到底，但是敌人太强大，他们有一个法力无边的魔道师，暗黑王子帕拉斯，我们根本不是他们的对手。很多同伴牺牲了，本来我也打算像他们一样战死，但是他们告诉我，身背着奥古斯丁姓氏的光辉圣族不能就这样死去，我必须活下去，只要我活着，就有打倒魔族的希望。但是魔族在整个亚利安尼亚大陆到处追杀我，渐渐地我变得无处藏身，后来，在同伴的帮助下，在一个风雨交加的黑暗的夜晚，我一个人偷偷地驾着小船逃离了亚利安尼亚。在茫茫大海上也不知漂了多少天，后来风越来越大，好在我已经看到了陆地，但是我的船顶不住了，本来想找一处滩涂靠岸，但完全操控不了船，被吹到岸边礁石里，船也完全毁了，我的腿也撞伤了，我拼命从船里向岸边爬，直到天亮才终于到了岸上，然后我就遇到了你。\n{伊娜：}好可怜。原来你是来这里避难的啊。\n{雷尔：}不，我来到这里，还有一个目的，我必须找到一件东西，有了那件东西，我就可以打倒暗黑王子帕拉斯，复兴我的国家。\n{伊娜：}太好了，我也帮你一起找。\n{雷尔：}不行，我伤好了之后自己去找，这事不能把你牵连进去。何况魔族的人发现我逃跑了之后一定会追来的。你不知道他们有多么可怕。如果你跟我在一起，会遇到危险，甚至可能会丧命。我不能连累无辜的人。\n{伊娜：}也许我确实不知道你的敌人有多可怕。不过，他们做了那么过分的事，绝对不能原谅。你是个伟大的人，为了复兴自己的国家，一个人艰难地闯荡，还不想连累别人。不过，既然知道了这样的事，我怎么能袖手旁观。即使一点点也好，我希望我能帮你尽一点点微薄之力，去复兴你的国家。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} According to the records of the Ina-Jan Universal Notebook, following this road, you can reach the capital of our Kartia Kingdom-{Car} {Ti}{Asia City}. Grandpa told me this before, but I have never been there.","{伊娜：}根据伊娜酱万能笔记本的记载，沿着这条路，就能到达我们卡尔提亚王国的首都——{卡尔}\n{提}{亚城}了。这是爷爷以前告诉我的，不过我还从来没有去过呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After a series of monster attacks, I am more convinced that this matter has something to do with Archbishop Yingluck.\n{Rael:} Why? {Ina:} Because he was attacked by monsters in the underground library, it has something to do with him. And being attacked by monsters on Black Rock Island also has something to do with him. Earlier, in Kartia, Lord Khalid was attacked by a monster in front of his camp, which was caused by him indirectly. I remember it in my Ina-chan universal notebook.","{伊娜：}经过一连串怪物的攻击，我更加确信这事跟英拉大主教有关了。\n{雷尔：}为什么？\n{伊娜：}因为之前在地下图书馆被怪物攻击，就跟他有关系。还有在黑岩岛被怪物攻击也跟他扯得上。还有更早的，在卡尔提亚，哈里德领主的营帐前被怪物攻击，也是他间接造成的。我的伊娜酱万能笔记本上都记着呢。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After defeating two tomb robbers, the \"Eternal Orb\" was still not found.\n{Rael:} Should we search carefully for the places they dug in this area? Ina, why are you rushing in, maybe it's here?\n{Ina:} Why do you want to go inside in a hurry? This is a decision I made based on the clues I've gotten from Ina-chan's Universal Notebook. First, there are still a lot of excavations in it. Second, according to Rael’s speculation, someone must have moved where there are excavations. Third, the second tomb thief just said \"My brothers\". If there are only two brothers, he should say \"my brother\" instead of using the plural; therefore, they must have other accomplices digging deeper. First clean up all their accomplices, even if the \"Eternal Ball\" is in this area, we still have enough time to come back and look for it. What if the \"Eternal Sphere\" is inside? It's troublesome if they find it first.\n{Rael:} Oh, that's amazing. Ina is really smart and logically clear.\n{Ina:} Hey, I was praised again...","{伊娜：}干倒了两个盗墓贼，还是没有找到“永恒之球”。\n{雷尔：}我们是不是该把这一带他们挖掘过的地方仔细搜寻搜寻？伊娜，你怎么急着往里走，也许就在这一带呢？\n{伊娜：}为什么要急着往里走，这是我根据伊娜酱万能笔记本目前得到的线索作出的决定。\n第一，往里面还有很多挖掘的痕迹；\n第二，根据雷尔刚才的推测，有挖掘痕迹的地方必定有人动过；\n第三，刚才第二个盗墓贼说了一句“俺们的兄弟”，如果只有两兄弟的话，他应该说“俺的兄弟”，而不该使用复数；\n所以，他们肯定还有其他的同伙，在更深处挖掘财宝。先把他们的同伙全部清理干净了，即使“永恒之球”在这一带，我们也有足够的时间回来找。要不然万一“永恒之球”在更里面呢？被他们先找到了就麻烦了。\n{雷尔：}嚯，好厉害，伊娜果然聪明过人而且逻辑明确条理清晰啊。\n{伊娜：}咦，又被夸奖了……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After eliminating Kairon, Roland should part with us.","{伊娜：}消灭了凯隆之后，罗兰也就该跟我们分别了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After entering Belentania, the next step is to find the residence of the Li Qide family.\n{Freeman:} Since the Ritchie family is so famous, it should be easy to ask about it here.\n{Ina:} Yes, let's find someone to ask first.","{伊娜：}进入了贝伦塔尼亚，接下来就是要找李奇德家族的住处了。\n{弗里曼：}既然李奇德家族那么有名，在这里一带应该很容易问到的吧。\n{伊娜：}对，我们先找人问问。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After getting rid of the two guys who chased Radia, you can feel a little more at ease now. So shall we move on to find Oradea?\n{Raier:} Well, it seems that there is a new light on the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" detector.\n{Ina:} It seems that if you continue to move forward, you can still find the parts of the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\"? Could it be that Radia was hunted down for this? Let's go quickly.","{伊娜：}除掉了那两个追杀拉迪亚的家伙，现在可以稍微安心一点了吧。那么我们继续前进去寻找拉迪亚吗？\n{雷尔：}嗯，好像“龙王神力”的探测仪上又有新的灯亮了。\n{伊娜：}看来继续向前还能找到“龙王神力”的部件？难道拉迪亚是为了这事被追杀的？走，我们赶紧去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After going around the three pillars most of the time, I still can't see what it is. Ladia did not say whether the \"Spirit Gathering Pagoda\" is one or three, and we have never seen what the \"Spirit Gathering Pagoda\" looks like. What should we do...\n{Freeman:} Hmm... Let me see...\n{Rael:} There are artificial traces, at least, this is artificially built, not a natural stone pillar.\n{Ina:} Come on, no matter if it is or not, let me blast these three pillars first. If I get it right, you're done.\n{Freeman:} Hold on, don't do it!\n{Ina:} Huh? {Freeman:} I think these three pillars are definitely not \"Gathering Towers\".\n{Ina:} Why?\n{Freeman:} Archbishop Yingluck is in the cave, and we haven't met him yet. What does this show?\n{Ina:} Well, that means we haven't reached the deepest point yet, so it's like this...\n{Freeman:} Not only that, but one more thing. These three pillars are connected to the top of the cave, which cannot be called a tower. From an architectural point of view, it looks like a load-bearing column...\n{Ina:} What is a load-bearing column?\n{Rael:} Let's put it this way, it's like the backbone that supports the building not to fall. Without them, the house would collapse.\n{Ina:} This note comes down?ahuh? So if I blow them up...\n{Rael:} This hole may collapse, and we will be buried here.\n{Ina:} Woo...I almost made a mistake...\n{Rael:} Since this is not what we are looking for, let's move on.\n{Freeman:} However, since the load-bearing column can be seen here, our position should be near the center of the cave. Calculating this way, you can roughly estimate how far the deepest point is.\n{Ina:} Oh my god, that is to say, we only got to the middle after walking for so long?","{伊娜：}绕了那三根柱子转了大半圈，还是看不出是啥。拉迪亚也没说“聚灵塔”到底是一根的还是三根的，而我们又没见过“聚灵塔”长什么样，这怎么办哪……\n{弗里曼：}嗯……我看看……\n{雷尔：}有人工的痕迹，至少，这是人为砌出来的，不是天然石柱。\n{伊娜：}得了，不管它是不是，我先把这三根柱子炸了再说吧，如果蒙对了，就大功告成啦。\n{弗里曼：}慢着，别动手！\n{伊娜：}咦？\n{弗里曼：}我觉得这三根柱子肯定不是“聚灵塔”。\n{伊娜：}为什么啊？\n{弗里曼：}英拉大主教就在洞里，而我们还没有碰到他，这说明了什么？\n{伊娜：}唔，那就是说我们还没有到达最深处，原来是这样……\n{弗里曼：}不止如此，还有一点。这三根柱子，上方与洞顶相连结，这是不能称为塔的。倒是从建筑学的角度看，像是承重柱……\n{伊娜：}承重柱又是什么？\n{雷尔：}这么说吧，就好比是支撑着建筑物不倒的筋骨。如果没有它们，房子就要塌掉。\n{伊娜：}这个笔记下来——唉？那么如果我把它们炸掉的话……\n{雷尔：}这个洞可能就会塌方，我们就被埋在这里了。\n{伊娜：}呜……我差点犯错误……\n{雷尔：}既然这不是我们要找的目标，还是继续向前吧。\n{弗里曼：}不过，既然这里能看到承重柱，那么我们的位置应该是在地洞的中心附近吧。这样算起来，倒是可以大致估计一下最深处还有多远。\n{伊娜：}天哪，也就是说，我们走了这么久才只是到中间呀？\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After removing these fire monsters, can the ice be prevented from melting?\n{Elder:} Yes, the cold has been restored, and the remaining ice will not melt anymore.\n{Ina:} Great, I finally saved everyone's village.\n{Elder:} Compared to this, the more important thing is, do you really plan to pursue the Phoenix Phoenix?\n{Ina:} Of course. He ran away under my nose. In other words, it was caused by my mistake. I have to make up for it myself.\n{Elder:} Once Phoenix regains full strength, it will be very scary. You must be careful.\n{Ina:} Thank you elder for reminding. I think there will be a way. I will work hard.\n{Freeman:} Didn't the elder stop Ina this time? When the elder had to deal with the phoenix who had exhausted his vitality before, he said that it was self-defeating, but this time he was likely to deal with the phoenix who had regained his full strength, but he just said to be careful?\n{Elder:} Haha. Through this series of battles, I have a hunch, maybe, this little girl can really surpass the legendary warrior back then.\n{Ina:} Huh? Elder, don't make a joke, look at me too high...\n{Elder:} Are you kidding? Maybe it is, maybe not. In short, the future is perilous, whether it is a blessing or a curse, it depends on you. May Augustine, God of Radiance, bless you.\n{Ina:} Okay, thank you elder. Then let's head towards {Akasha Plain} in the north of {Kozia}.","{伊娜：}清除了这些火怪之后，是不是就能阻止冰的融化了。\n{长老：}没错，寒气已经恢复了，剩下的冰不会再融化了。\n{伊娜：}太好了，总算是保住了大家的村子。\n{长老：}比起这个来，更重要的事情是，你们真打算去追击不死鸟菲尼克斯？\n{伊娜：}那当然。他在我眼皮底下逃走的，怎么说也是我的失误造成的，我得自己去弥补。\n{长老：}一旦菲尼克斯恢复了全部的实力，将会非常恐怖，你们一定要小心。\n{伊娜：}谢谢长老提醒。我想，会有办法的。我会努力的。\n{弗里曼：}这次长老没有阻止伊娜？之前要对付元气耗尽的不死鸟时长老说这是自不量力，而这回很可能要对付恢复全力的不死鸟，却只是说要小心？\n{长老：}哈哈。通过这一连串的战斗，我有一种预感，也许，这小丫头真能超过当年的传奇勇士也说不定。\n{伊娜：}唉？长老别开玩笑，太高看我啦……\n{长老：}玩笑吗？也许是，也许不是。总之，前程危机四伏，是福是祸，就看各位自己了。愿光辉之神奥古斯丁保佑你们。\n{伊娜：}好吧，谢谢长老。那么我们就向{科齐亚}北方的{赤砂原}进发吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} After traveling around in Kartia, this detector never turned on. Is this thing really good? Anyway, let's look for places that we haven't been to before. --Ugh? The front is very lively, what's the strange thing? Go over and take a look.","{伊娜：}在卡尔提亚国内兜了一圈，这个探测仪一次都没亮过。这东西真的灵吗？不管怎么说，我们再到一些以前没去过的地方找找看好了。——唉？前面挺热闹，有什么稀奇事啦？过去看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah! With a bang, the pit on the ground made Ina stomped and fell down.\n{Ina:} The wicked tomb thief, dug a hole in the road...\n{Rael:} Didn't you get hurt?\n{Ina:} I grew up tumbling and tumbling. What is this, oh, it hurts... Hey, there seems to be a spell on the stone slab under this pit? I write it down.","{伊娜：}啊哟！\n咚的一声，地上的坑让伊娜一脚踏空摔倒了。\n{伊娜：}缺德的盗墓贼，把坑挖在路当中……\n{雷尔：}没受伤吧？\n{伊娜：}我从小跌爬滚打长大的，这点算什么，哎哟，痛痛……咦，这坑下面的石板上好像有什么咒文？我记下来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, I saw the magic temple again. I want to learn more magic. It turns out that this is the \"blindness\" magic...\n{Monk:} Wrong, this is \"blind\" magic, which just means \"blindness\", written as \"blindness\", your translation is superfluous.\n{Ina:} Isn't it the same?\n{Monk:} It's the same for most creatures, but think about it, when you meet a cyclops, he has only one eye. How can you go blind? For another example, when you encounter a Hydra, it has a total of 18 eyes with 9 heads. If you only lose sight of 2 of them, what's the point? A more extreme example, such as the dragon fly, which has tens of thousands of compound eyes. If you can only \"blind both eyes\", you will be exhausted before you completely blind him...\n{Ina:} Uh, It turns out that there are still so many creatures that don't have two eyes. This should be noted down.\n{Monk:} I hate some translators superfluous to the translation of magic. Obviously, two words can express accurately, so if you have to put together four words, it will be nondescript. For example, I have seen some people translate \"accelerate\" into \"accelerate attack.\" Why do I have to use acceleration to attack? Can't I accelerate when I escape? For another example, \"fireball\" translates to \"lianzhu fireball\". There is obviously only one fireball, so where does the renzhu come from? There are also things like \"slowing down\" turned into \"sluggish Dafa\", which is clearly a level 1 magic, a small law, where's the Dafa. The most absurd translation is \"counterstrike\". The idiom \"counterstrike\" means one hits one's own person. The effect of this magic counterstrike is obviously to increase the number of counterstrikes, which is completely inconsistent with the meaning of the idiom. The translator did not understand the meaning of the idiom and used the idiom in order to make up four characters. There are many such examples. If you have just started to learn these magics, you must put an end to this kind of incorrect translation early and keep in mind the correct translation method.\n{Ina:} Well, I wrote it all down.","{伊娜：}啊，又看到魔法圣殿了。我要学习更多的魔法。原来这就是“双目失明”魔法……\n{修道士：}错了，这是“blind”魔法，仅仅是“失明”的意思，写成“双目失明”，你的翻译画蛇添足了。\n{伊娜：}这不是差不多的吗？\n{修道士：}对大部分生物来说是差不多，但是你想想，当你遇到独眼巨人的时候，他只有一个眼睛，你怎么去双目失明？再比如你遇到九头蛇的时候，它9个头一共18只眼睛，你要是只失明其中2个，顶什么用？更极端的例子，比如龙蝇，它有上万只复眼，如果你只能“双目失明”的话，还没等你把他完全失明你就先累死了……\n{伊娜：}呃，原来还有那么多生物不是2只眼睛的，这个要笔记下来。\n{修道士：}我很厌恶一些翻译者对魔法的翻译进行画蛇添足。明明两个字就能表达准确的，非要凑四个字，弄得不伦不类。比如我看到有的人把“加速”翻译成“攻击加速”，我干嘛加速一定要用来攻击啊，我逃跑就不能加速么？再比如“火球”翻译成“连珠火球”，明明只有一个火球，哪来的连珠。还有像“减速”翻成了“迟缓大法”，明明是个1级魔法，是小法，哪来的大法。最荒唐的翻译要数“反戈一击”了，“反戈一击”这个成语的意思是自己人打自己人，而这个魔法counterstrike的效果明明是增加反击次数，与成语的意思完全不符，根本就是翻译者不懂成语的意义为了硬凑四字乱用成语。这样的例子还有不少。如果你是才开始学这些魔法，一定要从早杜绝这种翻译不正的现象，牢记正确的译法。\n{伊娜：}好吧，我都记下来了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, how come there are cavemen here...\n{Rael:} The cavemen originally lived in the caves.\n{Ina:} Then you don't have to fight at us, hey, forget it, I'll use blindness magic, trap them for a while, we just leave after we get the things.\n{Rael:} Cavemen are not affected by blind magic. Because they are born without eyes.\n{Ina:} No eyes? How did they see us?\n{Rael:} They can't see us at all, as long as they feel it.\n{Ina:} Isn't this troublesome, it's painful to not have eyes.\n{Rael:} A creature born without eyes will not feel any pain without eyes. For example, we humans are born unable to hear ultrasound or see infrared rays. Do you feel painful?\n{Ina:} Ultrasound? infrared? what is this?\n{Freeman:} I can teach you this, I have studied physics. However, before that, we'd better take care of these cavemen first, or they might be eaten by them.","{伊娜：}啊，这里怎么会有洞穴人……\n{雷尔：}洞穴人本来就是生活在地洞里的。\n{伊娜：}那也不用冲着我们就打吧，唉，算了，我使个失明魔法好了，困住他们一小会儿，我们拿完东西就走就是了。\n{雷尔：}洞穴人不受失明魔法影响的。因为他们天生就没有眼睛。\n{伊娜：}没有眼睛？他们怎么看见我们的呢？\n{雷尔：}他们根本看不见我们啊，只要感觉到就可以了。\n{伊娜：}这样岂不是很麻烦，没有眼睛多痛苦啊。\n{雷尔：}生来就没有眼睛的生物，是不会觉得没眼睛有什么痛苦的。就比如我们人类生来就听不见超声波，看不见红外线，你会觉得痛苦吗？\n{伊娜：}超声波？红外线？这是什么？\n{弗里曼：}这个我可以教你，我学过物理的。不过，在这之前，我们最好先把这些洞穴人打理一下，要不然恐怕会被他们吃掉。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, it's a difficult mountain road. Is this the Rodana Mountain?","{伊娜：}啊，好难走的山路，这边就是罗德安那山吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, see the light, exit! There are really other outlets. Now that it's all here, let's go up and take a look.","{伊娜：}啊，看到亮光了，出口！真的有别的出口。既然到都到这里了，还是上去看看吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, the guy in the barracks over there is Captain Rudd, right?\n{Rudd:} Huh? What are you guys doing sneakily? Looking around at the door of the captain's barracks.\n{Ina:} We are the 9th team, come back to report...\n{Rudd:} Nonsense! You are not under the banner of the captain of this squadron without shouting the password when you enter the door. Who are you guys anyway?\n{Ina:} Huh? There is also a password. The army is really complicated. Now that it has been exposed, there will only be a fight.","{伊娜：}啊，那边营房里那个头儿模样的就是鲁德大队长吧？\n{鲁德：}嗯？你们几个鬼鬼祟祟地在干什么？在本大队长的营房门口东张西望的。\n{伊娜：}我们是第9小队，回来报告……\n{鲁德：}胡说！进门都不喊口令，你们才不是本大队长旗下的人。你们到底是谁？\n{伊娜：}啊？还有口令啊。军队里真是复杂。既然暴露了，那就只有开打了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, the level in front, is Solandria Army?\n{Military:} The Prime Minister has an order, if Ina and the gang want to pass, it doesn't matter if they are killed! Ina is a magician, but our level is forbidden. As long as we guard the level, they will not be our opponents.","{伊娜：}啊，前面的关卡，是索兰德里亚军？\n{军人：}宰相大人有令，如果伊娜一伙人想通过，格杀勿论！伊娜是个魔法师，但我们的关卡是禁魔的，只要我们守好关卡，他们就不是我们的对手了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, the one in front is not... Sister Mengying?\n{Mengying:} I have been waiting for you here for a long time.\n{Ina:} We are also looking for you.\n{Mengying:} Let’s not talk about anything else, I heard that you have already found the other 8 parts of \"Dragon King Divine Power\".\n{Ina:} Yes, only the last \"Dragon Armor\" is left.\n{Dream Shadow:} \"Dragon Armor\" is hidden in the barrier by Solo, and the barrier is difficult to destroy. But I have a way, you give me the other 8 pieces, and I can use them to open the barrier.\n{Ina:} Really? Great.\n{Mengying:} Give it to me then.\n{Ina:} Hmm... I'm looking for it... Oh, we have so many necklaces confiscated here. I don't remember which one is the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\". Sister Mengying drew a picture of \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" for me to see and compare.\n{Mengying:} Good.\n{Ina:} So that's it. Sister Mengying's paintings are really lifelike. It's easy to find now.","{伊娜：}啊，前面的那不是……梦影姐姐？\n{梦影：}我在这里等你们好久了。\n{伊娜：}我们也正想找你呢。\n{梦影：}别的先不说，听说你们已经找齐了另外8件“龙王神力”的部件了吧。\n{伊娜：}是啊，只差最后一件“龙甲”了。\n{梦影：}“龙甲”被索罗藏在结界中了，结界很难破坏。不过我有办法，你把另外8件给我，我可以用它们打开结界。\n{伊娜：}是吗？太好了。\n{梦影：}那么快给我吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯……我找找啊……糟了，我们这里收缴到的各种项链太多了，不记得哪个是“龙牙项链”了耶。梦影姐姐画个“龙牙项链”的图给我看看对照下。\n{梦影：}好。\n{伊娜：}原来就是这个啊，梦影姐姐画得真是逼真呢，这下很容易就找到了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, there are Balanders blocking the way here too. There is no other way, kill it and kill it.\n{Rael:} This time the opponent looks like a magician, be careful, {the opponent will use attack magic}.","{伊娜：}啊，这边也有巴兰德军挡路。没办法了，杀也要杀过去。\n{雷尔：}这次的对手看上去像是魔法师，小心啊，{对方会用攻击魔法}。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, there are so many bones in this area, so scary, oh...\n{Jack:} This must have been left by the fierce battle between the defenders of Nanling Pass and the Baland Army. Many soldiers died...\n{Ina:} Unforgivable that the Barland army killed so many people! I want to avenge them!","{伊娜：}啊，这一带怎么好多尸骨，好吓人啊，呜……\n{杰克：}这一定是南岭关的守军与巴兰德军激战留下的，好多战士牺牲了啊……\n{伊娜：}巴兰德军杀了这么多人，不可原谅！我要替他们报仇！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, this is the demons?\n{Demon Scout:} Human? No, I was found...\n{Ina:} Do you want to run? This will not work.\n{Demon Scout:} You can't see me, you can't see me...","{伊娜：}啊，这是魔族？\n{魔族侦察员：}人类？不好，被发现了……\n{伊娜：}你想跑？这可不行。\n{魔族侦察员：}你看不见我，你看不见我……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, this is?\n{Rael:} Dragon!\n{Freeman:} The elite troops that Chinu said are really dragons?\n{Ina:} But there is only one, it doesn't matter, it can be dealt with.\n{Freeman:} There will not be only one, I think there should be more in the future.","{伊娜：}啊，这是？\n{雷尔：}龙！\n{弗里曼：}齐努所说的精锐部队，真的是龙？\n{伊娜：}可是只有一只，不要紧，能对付得了。\n{弗里曼：}不会只有一只的，我想后面应该还会有更多。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, what is this huge monster?\n{Rael:} Chilong! How can there be a red dragon here...\n{Ina:} Wow, this is the legendary dragon. I finally saw the real thing, so moved...\n{Rael:} Now it's not the time to be moved, that guy seems to think Tear us apart. From the climate, it is not supposed to be a place where a red dragon lives. Someone must have summoned it. It seems that we are really unwelcome to break in.\n{Ina:} Could it be that the man called Mengying summoned it? So he must be very good, maybe he can teach me some magic.\n{Rael:} You should first think about how to deal with this guy, he is so violent, it doesn't look like he is willing to let us go.\n{Ina:} I will find a way, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}啊，这个巨大的怪物是什么？\n{雷尔：}赤龙！这里怎么会有赤龙……\n{伊娜：}哇，这就是传说中的龙啊，终于见到实物了，好感动……\n{雷尔：}现在可不是感动的时候，那家伙看上去想把我们撕碎。这里从气候上看不该是有赤龙居住的地方，一定是有谁召唤出来的，看来我们闯进来真的不受欢迎。\n{伊娜：}莫非就是那个叫梦影的人召出来的？这么说他一定很厉害，说不定能教我点魔法。\n{雷尔：}你还是先想想怎么对付这个家伙吧，它那么暴躁，不像是愿意放我们过去的样子。\n{伊娜：}我会想办法的，我要努力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, what is this, such a big one...\n{Rael:} Is it possible to be a so-called sea monster?\n{Ina:} Isn't it as powerful as you imagined, can such a thing make so many people go without return? Watch me come and clean him up.","{伊娜：}啊这是什么，好大一只……\n{雷尔：}难不成就是所谓的海怪？\n{伊娜：}没有想像中的厉害嘛，这么一只东西就能让那么多人有去无回？看我来收拾了他。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, what's floating on the water is...\n{Rael:} They are all corpses...\n{Ina:} It's disgusting...\n{Freeman:} The water on the front is also all...Although Radia said that there are bones everywhere in the cave, but he still didn't expect it to be so scary...","{伊娜：}啊，水上漂着的是……\n{雷尔：}都是尸体……\n{伊娜：}好恶心……\n{弗里曼：}再往前的水面上也全都是……虽然拉迪亚说过洞的里面遍地尸骨，不过还是没想到这么恐怖……\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Ah, where is this?\n{Freeman:} I don’t know, I’ve never been to this place before, and there is still a passage in the underground library that leads to such a place...\n{Rael:} Why do I always feel that there is an uneasy atmosphere here . Anyway, everyone should be careful.","{伊娜：}啊，这是到了哪儿啊？\n{弗里曼：}我也不知道啊，我从来没来过这个地方，地下书库里竟然还有通道通到这样的地方来……\n{雷尔：}为什么我总觉得这里有股不安的气氛。总之大家要小心了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alas, I asked a lot of people, but none of them knew.\n{Rael:} It seems that the people here don't understand either. Let's find out about the situation of the war first.\n{Ina:} Huh? The short guy over there isn't...\n{Dalv:} Ah! The stupid girl who doesn't understand robbery!\n{Ina:} Mr. Bad Guy with a long name!\n{Darwood:} Duel! My lord wants Yixue the shame of being defeated by you last time! This lord is now much better than last time.\n{Ina:} Hey, wait...\n{Davu:} You have no chance to beg for mercy now!","{伊娜：}唉，问了好多人，没一个人知道的。\n{雷尔：}看来这里的人也不了解。我们还是先打听下战争的情况吧。\n{伊娜：}唉？那边的矮个子不是……\n{达伍：}啊！不懂抢劫的笨小丫头！\n{伊娜：}名字很长的坏人先生！\n{达伍：}决斗！本大人要一雪上次被你击败的耻辱！本大人现在可比上次强多了哦。\n{伊娜：}喂，等等……\n{达伍：}你现在想求饶也没机会了！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alas, along the way, there are ghosts and zombies, many people killed by pinates. That pinate is really a pervert, how could such a person be born in this world.\n{Freeman:} There are all kinds of people in this world. In fact, no matter how evil the pinate was, he at least showed it, and didn't hide anything. There are some people who are actually more evil in their hearts than pinates, yet they pretend to be good people, making them undetectable.\n{Ina:} Huh? Could it be said that Jack has met more evil people?\n{Freeman:} In the court, there are more than one or two people who are worse than pinates. PInates kill people one by one, and some bureaucrats can make the people of a country suffer in order to fight for power or to satisfy their own desires. Those fish-and-meat people look like a person, but they are not necessarily better than pinates in their hearts.\n{Ina:} This seems to have heard similar words somewhere. I looked through the Ina-Jiang Universal Notebook~~~~~~~ Ah, I found it. That bad guy Darwood once said it too. However, since you know that some bureaucrats are bad guys, why not get rid of them?\n{Freeman:} I really want these people in the court to disappear. But they colluded with each other. Many of them were officials promoted by Archbishop Yingluck, and many of them had nepotism. No one dared to move them.\n{Ina:} The result is still related to Archbishop Yingluck. When we defeat him, we must get rid of those villain ministers. I believe Jack can do it.","{伊娜：}唉，一路过来，又是幽灵又是僵尸的，好多被海盗杀死的人。那海盗真是个变态，这个世界上怎么会生出这样的人啊。\n{弗里曼：}这个世界上什么样的人都有。其实海盗再怎么恶，他至少都表露出来了，没有隐藏着什么。而有一些人，其实内心比海盗更恶，却装得像个好人，让人无法察觉。\n{伊娜：}唉？难道说杰克碰到过更恶的人？\n{弗里曼：}宫廷之中，朝野上下，比海盗更恶的人又何止一二。海盗杀人是一个一个杀的，而有的官僚为了争权夺利或者满足自己的私欲可以让一个国家的百姓受难。那些鱼肉百姓的人，看上去一个个人模人样的，可是内心却不见得比海盗好。\n{伊娜：}这话好像在哪里听过类似的。我翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本~~~~~~~啊，找到了。那个坏人先生达伍曾经也说过呢。可是，既然知道了有些官僚是坏人，为什么不除掉他们呢？\n{弗里曼：}我确实很想让朝庭里的这些人都消失。可是他们之间相互勾结，有不少人还是英拉大主教提拔上来的权臣，很多人之间都有裙带关系，没有人敢动他们啊。\n{伊娜：}结果还是和英拉大主教有关。等我们打败了他，一定要除掉那些恶棍大臣们。我相信杰克可以做到。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alas, there are no people in this city, only monsters. Can only continue to search. I will work hard.","{伊娜：}唉，这城里也没有人，只有怪物。只能继续搜寻了。我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, I'm basically fine now, let me down, Rael.\n{Rael:} Is it really okay?\n{Ina:} Really.\n{Rael:} Okay, come down.\n{Ina:} I'm so embarrassed. Could you carry me for so long, I'm very heavy, right? ...\n{Rael:} Well, it's really heavy. Who told you to eat so much at every meal?\n{Ina:} Hello! How can you say that, you should say \"not sinking at all\". When I was a kid, when Grandpa was carrying me, he never said he was heavy.\n{Rael:} Of course you were lighter when you were a kid.\n{Ina:} Oh, I won't tell you anymore, it's not interesting at all. Let's continue to look for clues to the \"Green Thunder Ring\".","{伊娜：}好了啦，我现在基本上没问题了，放我下来吧，雷尔。\n{雷尔：}真的没问题了？\n{伊娜：}真的啦。\n{雷尔：}好，下来吧。\n{伊娜：}真是太不好意思了，麻烦你背我这么久，我很沉的吧？……\n{雷尔：}嗯，确实很沉。谁让你平时每餐都吃那么多。\n{伊娜：}喂！你怎么可以这样说，你应该说“一点也不沉”才对嘛。我小时候，爷爷背着我的时候，他从来不说沉的呢。\n{雷尔：}你小时候当然比现在轻啦。\n{伊娜：}呜，不跟你说了，一点都不有趣。我们还是继续去寻找“青雷环”的线索吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, Kairon is finally wiped out. We should consider the next step.","{伊娜：}好了，凯隆终于消灭了。我们该考虑下一步行动了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, finally broke through. Next is {take a boat to the Koz Peninsula}.","{伊娜：}行了，终于突破了。下面就{乘船去科兹半岛}了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, the \"Dragon Shield\" is in hand, now it's time to consider Jack's problem.\n{Freeman:} Actually, I have been thinking about it all along the way. Archbishop Yingluck controls power and the army and suppresses those who oppose him. This way, he will not get the support of the general public. But now I don't have enough strength to confront him head-on. If I enter the area under his control, it will be like throwing himself into a trap, but I can't let him manipulate the country and let the country's turmoil decline. If you can find a way to strengthen your own strength first, so that the people who oppose him and those who support me will unite, then you can compete with him in the future.\n{Ina:} Just now, you said that Kairon can hide in a swamp that is difficult for the army to enter. Can we use the same method to find a place that is difficult for Archbishop Yingluck's army to enter, occupy the territory there, develop strength, and fight against Archbishop Yingluck?\n{Freeman:} Yes! Armed separatism! I think so too. In the north of Kartia, there is indeed such a suitable place, that is {Koz Peninsula}. The place is sparsely populated, the terrain is complex, and the land is only connected by narrow passages, making it easy to defend and difficult to attack. There should be a good choice as a base.\n{Ina:} Great, then let's set off for the Koz Peninsula.\n{Freeman:} But we cannot pass through Kartia. It is safer only to sail past the sea. But even so, we still need to go through {Carterra Plain} to reach the sea.\n{Ina:} The Calterra Plain? Is this name a combination of Kartia and Terracia?\n{Freeman:} Well, because it's sandwiched between Kartia and Terracia, it's named after. Although this area is a plain, it is very barren. Because it is often flooded, there are few people living in it, and it is not subject to the control of the two countries.","{伊娜：}好了，“龙盾”拿到手了，下面该考虑杰克的问题了。\n{弗里曼：}其实我路上一直在考虑了。英拉大主教控制着权力和军队，镇压反对他的人，他这样是不会得到广大民众的支持的。但是现在我没有足够的实力与他正面对抗，如果进入他控制的地区如同自投罗网，可是又不能任由他操纵这个国家，让国家动荡衰落下去。如果能想办法先壮大自己的力量，让反对他的人和本来就支持我的人都联合起来，以后就可以跟他抗衡了。\n{伊娜：}刚才你说过，凯隆就是因为盘踞在军队难以进入的沼泽，才能藏身在那里自霸一方。如果同样的办法我们能不能用呢，去找一个英拉大主教的军队难以进入的地方，在那里占据地盘，发展实力，跟英拉大主教分庭抗礼？\n{弗里曼：}对！武装割据！我也是这么想的。卡尔提亚的北方，的确有这么一个合适的地方，那就是{科兹半岛}。那里人烟稀少，地形复杂，与陆地仅有狭窄的通路相连，易守难攻。那里应该是作为根据地的不错的选择。\n{伊娜：}好极了，那么我们就出发去科兹半岛吧。\n{弗里曼：}但是我们不能从卡尔提亚境内通过。只有从海上行船过去才比较安全。不过即使如此，我们还是需要经过{卡尔泰拉平原}才能到达海边。\n{伊娜：}卡尔泰拉平原？这名字是卡尔提亚和泰拉西亚的合称吗？\n{弗里曼：}嗯，因为夹在卡尔提亚与泰拉西亚之间，所以得名。这块地方虽然是平原，却很荒芜，由于经常被洪水淹没，几乎没有什么人居住，也不受两国的管制。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, there are no demons around now.\n{Rael:} But I'm afraid when they will come again. Well, I stay here and watch. You {go back to Holia} to get {\"Fire} {Spirit Orb\"}.\n{Freeman:} Mr. Rael wants to stay alone?\n{Rael:} That's the only way. Don't worry, I am also a warrior with many battles and there will be no problems.\n{Ina:} Does it really matter?\n{Rael:} Now is not the time to hesitate, if you are really worried about me, it is better to quickly get the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".\n{Ina:} Understood, Rael, you have to be careful. I will be back soon and I will work hard.","{伊娜：}好了，这下周围没有魔族了。\n{雷尔：}但是就怕什么时候他们再来人。这样吧，我留下来在这里看着。你们{回去找霍利亚}取{“火}\n{灵珠”}。\n{弗里曼：}雷尔先生要一个人留下？\n{雷尔：}只能这样了。你们放心好了，我也是身经百战的战士，不会有什么问题的。\n{伊娜：}真的不要紧吗？\n{雷尔：}现在不是犹豫的时候，如果你真的担心我，不如赶紧去把“火灵珠”取来。\n{伊娜：}明白了，雷尔你要小心。我很快就会回来的，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Alright, we can put on some of their uniforms so that we can easily move around in their base. But we have to be careful, {do not damage these uniforms}, otherwise it will be troublesome.","{伊娜：}好啦，我们把他们几个的制服穿上，就可以方便地在他们基地内部活动了。不过我们也要小心，{千万不能把这些制服损坏了}，不然就麻烦了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although \"Dragon Armor\" is also very important, according to Radia's intelligence, it seems that there will be no change for the time being. The situation of the \"Green Thunder Ring\" is still worrying, and Solo's people can't get it first.","{伊娜：}虽然“龙甲”也很重要，不过根据拉迪亚的情报，看起来暂时不会有什么变故。还是“青雷环”的情况让人不放心，不能让索罗的人先得到它。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although I don't understand what Radia is saying, I think the situation seems to be worse.\n{Freeman:} Yes, the movements of the demons are getting bigger and bigger. Now they have to watch out for Archbishop Yingluck and the demons, and at the same time try to find the remaining parts of the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\".\n{Ina:} Roland said before that the Demon Race is also looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\" and has already obtained some parts. Is there any connection between these things?\n{Rael:} We can’t be sure what the Demon Race wants to do, unless we can go to the Demon Realm to find out.\n{Ina:} Devildom? Can we go?\n{Freeman:} You don't really want to go, do you? The entrance to the devil world is said to be a place called {\"Triangle of Death\"}, not to mention that we don't know where it is. Even if we know it, there is a high probability that a living person will die through the passage vortex.\n{Ina:} But the demons can come out from there without dying?\n{Freeman:} There is a treasure that can protect those who pass through the whirlpool from harm, and that is the mineral black crystal rich in the Devildom. But this thing may be difficult for us to get.\n{Ina:} In short, there is a way, right? That's good. Jack, you are so good, you know so many things.\n{Freeman:} When I was in school, it was mentioned in the history textbook. After all, humans and demons have been in constant conflict for hundreds of years. More than two hundred years ago, {Hero Aris} created a {helmet studded with black crystals}, wore it and attacked the demon world, defeating the demon prince Sander who was vainly trying to dominate at the time. After that, the demon tribe settled down for a long time. time.\n{Ina:} So where is that helmet now? Can we borrow it and use it?\n{Freeman:} Originally, after the death of the hero Aris, it was kept in the Kartia Museum, but...\n{Ina:} That’s great, it turned out to be in Kartia... {Freeman: }But it was stolen as early as twenty years ago, and its whereabouts are now unknown. So I haven't seen it since I was born.\n{Ina:} Ah, how come, I thought there was hope. But despite the theft, at least that thing should still exist, maybe we can find it.\n{Rael:} Are you really going to find it?\n{Ina:} Well, let me try, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}虽然不是很明白拉迪亚说的东西，不过我觉得情况好像更糟糕了。\n{弗里曼：}是啊，魔族的动作越来越大，现在又要提防英拉大主教又要提防魔族，同时还要设法找到剩下的“龙王神力”的部件。\n{伊娜：}以前罗兰说过，魔族也在找“龙王神力”，而且已经得到了一些部件，这事情之间会不会有联系呢？\n{雷尔：}我们没法确定魔族到底是想干什么，除非能去魔界看个究竟。\n{伊娜：}魔界？我们能去吧？\n{弗里曼：}你不会真的想去吧？魔界的入口，传说是一个叫做{“死亡三角”}的地方，且不说我们不知道它在哪里，就算知道了，活人穿过通道漩涡也有很大的机率会死掉。\n{伊娜：}但是魔族却可以从那里出来而不死掉？\n{弗里曼：}有一种宝物可以保护穿过漩涡的人不受伤害，那就是魔界盛产的矿物黑水晶。不过这个东西我们恐怕很难弄到。\n{伊娜：}总之就是有办法的对不对？那就好了。杰克你真厉害，知道那么多事情。\n{弗里曼：}我上学的时候，历史课本上有提到过。毕竟几百年来，人类与魔族一直是冲突不断。两百多年前，{英雄亚里斯}打造了一顶{镶着黑水晶的头盔}，戴着它攻入魔界，击败了当时妄图称霸的魔亲王桑德，之后魔族安份了很长时间。\n{伊娜：}那么那个头盔现在在哪里？我们能不能借来用一下？\n{弗里曼：}本来在英雄亚里斯去世后，一直收藏在卡尔提亚博物馆的，可是……\n{伊娜：}那真是太好了，原来就在卡尔提亚……\n{弗里曼：}可是早在二十年前就失窃了，现在下落不明。所以我从出生起就没见过一眼。\n{伊娜：}啊，怎么这样，本以为就有希望了呢。不过虽然说失窃，至少那件东西应该还存在着，也许我们能找得到呢。\n{雷尔：}你真的打算找吗？\n{伊娜：}嗯，我试试吧，我会努力的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although I think 5 is a bit less, but, um, so be it, please help.\n{Owner:} Okay, no problem. Please wait.","{伊娜：}虽然觉得5个有点少，不过，嗯，就这样吧，拜托你帮忙了。\n{店主：}好，没问题。请稍等。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although Radia told me not to go, I obviously couldn't let it go. Huh, the intercom has a sound again?\n{Ladia:} Ina, run, Archbishop Yingluck is here! Run! Ah~~~!\n{Ina:} What's the matter, Radia?\n{Radia:} Let go of me~~~~~! What kind of magic is this, I can't get rid of it~~~~\n{Voice:} Hey, I was using this tool to talk to them. But you don't know, the radio is easy to track and locate, you use this tool, I can easily find out where you are through the tracking device...\n{Ina:} Ah, this voice is...\n{Radia :} Run...\n{Ina:} It really is Archbishop Yingluck!\n{Yingla:} The little girl over there, I heard that you have already got the \"Blue Thunder Ring\", right? If you still want your friend to live, come and exchange it with me.\n{Radia:} Leave me alone, Ina, run away!\n{Yingla:} Shut up, I'm talking about a deal with them, please be quiet!\n{Radia:} Ah~~~~~~!\n{Ina:} You, don't bully Radia!\n{Yingla:} No problem. As long as you hand over the \"Blue Thunder Ring\" to me, I can let her go.\n{Ina:} How do you make me believe that you will keep the promise?\n{Yingla:} Hey, you don't trust me. I am also an archbishop, so I won't make fun of my credibility for such a trivial matter. Is the little prince on your side? You ask him, have I ever failed to do what I promised?\n{Freeman:} In my impression...it really doesn't...\n{Yingla:} How about it, believe me now, right?\n{Ina:} Okay, how can I leave it to you?\n{Yingla:} You can just put it on the side of the road, and my subordinates will pick it up. Anyway, you are not far from me near here. When I get the \"Green Thunder Ring\", I will let your friend go. If you want to commit fraud, then I can't guarantee your friend's safety.\n{Ina:} Okay, I promise you. But you must let Radia go, don't break your promise.\n{Yingla:} Don't worry about this.","{伊娜：}虽然拉迪亚叫我不要去，不过我显然不可能对此放任不管。咦，对讲机又有声音了？\n{拉迪亚：}伊娜，快跑，英拉大主教就在这里！快跑！啊~~~！\n{伊娜：}怎么了，拉迪亚？\n{拉迪亚：}放开我~~~~~！这是什么魔法，挣脱不了~~~~\n{声音：}嘿嘿，原来在用这个工具跟他们通话。不过你不知道吧，无线电是很容易被跟踪定位的，你使用这个工具，我通过跟踪设备可以很容易找出你的所在……\n{伊娜：}啊，这个声音是……\n{拉迪亚：}快跑啊……\n{伊娜：}果然就是英拉大主教！\n{英拉：}那边的小丫头，听说你们已经得到“青雷环”了是不是？如果还想你的朋友活命的话，过来和我做一个交换吧。\n{拉迪亚：}别管我，伊娜，你快跑！\n{英拉：}闭嘴，我在跟他们谈交易，你给我安静点！\n{拉迪亚：}啊~~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}你，不许欺负拉迪亚！\n{英拉：}没问题。只要你们把“青雷环”交给我，我就可以放了她。\n{伊娜：}你怎么让我相信你会守约呢？\n{英拉：}哎，你不信任我啊，我怎么说也是大主教，不会为这种小事拿自己的信誉开玩笑。小王子在你那边吧？你问问他，我以前有没有过答应了的事情不做到的？\n{弗里曼：}印象中……确实是没有……\n{英拉：}怎么样，这下相信我了吧？\n{伊娜：}好吧，我要怎么交给你？\n{英拉：}你就放在路边就可以了，我的部下会去取来。反正你们也就在这附近离我不远。等我得到了“青雷环”，我就会放了你朋友。如果你要使诈，那么我就不能保证你朋友的安全了。\n{伊娜：}好，我答应你。不过你一定要放了拉迪亚，不许食言。\n{英拉：}这个你放心。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although he defeated General Zelando, the news about the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" is still only as much as what they had said before. \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" seems to be in Solandria.\n{Freeman:} I'm afraid I must take a boat to Solandria. You can go from {Southwest Coast of Terracia}. Shall we go to Solandria now?\n{Ina:} Wait, they said, it seems that to obtain the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", something called the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is necessary. Master Hollier wanted this thing, and Silando agreed to give it to him. And this \"Fire Spirit Orb\" was not delivered to Holia's hands. It was still in the cave, in the hands of the female demon named Radia.\n{Raier:} Judging from the letters intercepted before, it is indeed not sent yet.\n{Ina:} This hole seems to be quite big, so let’s {look inside first to find the female devil}.","{伊娜：}虽然打倒了西兰多将军，可是关于“龙牙冠”的消息，仍然只有之前听他们说的那么点。“龙牙冠”似乎是在索兰德里亚。\n{弗里曼：}要去索兰德里亚恐怕一定得坐船去了。从{泰拉西亚西南沿岸}出发可以过去。我们现在去索兰德里亚吗？\n{伊娜：}等等，他们说了，要取得“龙牙冠”似乎必须要一个叫“火灵珠”的东西。这个东西霍利尔大人想要，而西兰多答应了给他。而这个“火灵珠”，并没送到霍利亚的手中，现在仍在洞里，在那个叫拉迪亚的女恶魔手里。\n{雷尔：}从之前截获的信件看，也确实是还没有送出。\n{伊娜：}这个地洞好像还很大，我们还是{先向里去找出那个女恶魔}吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Although it is not clear whether these demons are related to the demons who chased Rael, I think we should be more concealed. Put on the clothes of the thief you picked up earlier, so that you won't be easily recognized.","{伊娜：}虽然不清楚这些魔族同追杀雷尔的魔族是不是有关联，不过，我觉得我们还是隐蔽一点的好。把之前捡来的盗贼的衣服穿上吧，这样可以不容易被认出来一点。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} As a result, I was fooled by the little black, and spent a lot of money, but still did not ask about Kartia. But I really dare not go to that village. I can't control my wallet once I go, so I can ask someone to say hello elsewhere.","{伊娜：}结果被那个小黑忽悠了一圈，钱花了不少，却还是没问到卡尔提亚的消息。不过那个村子我是真不敢去了，去了就管不住钱包，再去别的地方找人问问好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} As a result, there is still no news of \"Dragon King's supernatural power\". It seems that this is not something ordinary people know, even no one in a big city like Kartia City knows.\n{Rael:} But at least we now know the cause of the war. It seems that the current situation in the Kingdom of Kartia is very critical, worse than imagined.\n{Ina:} It would be nice if I could help.\n{Rael:} The court struggle is very complicated, and you can't intervene. Who do you want to help? You don't even know who is good or who is evil.\n{Ina:} Then it's okay to be able to do at least something I can do, such as defending against the Barland army.\n{Rael:} Just because you want to fight the Barland army? If you encounter regular troops, it won't be as easy to deal with as the stragglers we encountered before. If the enemy is swarmed by hundreds of soldiers, what good is you a commander of a polished rod?\n{Ina:} At least I have to learn more magic so that I can be stronger, and I will work hard. ?a?aBy the way, {Kartia City}, there should be a place where you can learn magic, I'll ask.","{伊娜：}结果还是没有“龙王神力”的消息。看起来这不是普通人知道的东西啊，连卡尔提亚城这样的大城市都没人知道。\n{雷尔：}不过至少现在知道了战争的原因了。看起来卡尔提亚王国现在形势很危急，比想像的还要糟。\n{伊娜：}要是能帮上点什么忙就好了。\n{雷尔：}宫廷斗争很复杂的，不是你能插手的。你想帮谁？你连谁善谁恶都不清楚。\n{伊娜：}那么至少能做一点我能做的事情也好呀，比如抵御巴兰德军。\n{雷尔：}就凭你就想与巴兰德军战斗啦？如果遇到正规部队，可不会像我们之前碰到的三三两两的散兵游勇那么好对付了。敌人要是成百上千的士兵一拥而上，你个光杆司令顶什么用啊。\n{伊娜：}至少我要学更多的魔法，这样就可以更强，我会努力的。——对了，{卡尔提亚城里}，应该会有能学魔法的地方吧，我去问问看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Barland Army, I see it.\n{Rael:} Hidden! The two hid behind the rock.\n{Rael:}15 soldiers, and a man who appeared to be the Karti runner was tied up.\n{Soldier A:} General Krant was really resourceful. He sent a troop over the snow-capped mountains to the back of Nanling Pass, attacking on both sides, and the Nanling Pass, which Kartia believed to be impenetrable, was easily breached.\n{Soldier B:} This is not the time to worship General Krant, and he is not our superior. If we let General Krant take the lead, we would lose. We have to give some credit to General Dido before we can get more trophies.\n{Soldier C:} Hey, isn't this just God's favor for us? Although the guy we caught just now has a very strict mouth, he would not say his identity if he flicked him with a whip. However, judging from the epaulettes he wore, Definitely a big shot. We must have done a lot to catch him back.\n{Soldier A:} But our 9th squadron is here to carry out the reconnaissance mission, to figure out the terrain from here to Kartia city, so that the army can hit the enemy's nest all the way. Is it for this captive to give up the ongoing mission?\n{Soldier B:} Are you stupid? It is our credit to take this prisoner back. It is the credit of General Krant that the reconnaissance is done and the army can capture the city of Kartia. If you don't have the credit for getting it yourself, then go to make wedding dresses for others. Let's take this guy back first, lest Ye Changmeng's over-cooked duck will fly away.","{伊娜：}巴兰德军，看到了。\n{雷尔：}隐蔽！\n两人躲到了岩石后面。\n{雷尔：}15个士兵，还绑了一个看上去是卡尔提亚军的人。\n\n{士兵A：}克兰特将军果然是足智多谋，把一支部队翻过雪山送到南岭关背后，两面夹击，卡尔提亚自以为固若金汤的南岭关就这么轻易的被攻破了。\n{士兵B：}现在不是崇拜克兰特将军的时候，他又不是我们的上司。如果让克兰特将军拿了头功，我们就亏了。我们得为迪多将军建些功劳，到时才能分到更多战利品。\n{士兵C：}嘿，这不正是上天眷顾我们嘛，我们刚才抓的这家伙，虽然嘴很严，用鞭子抽他都不肯说出自己的身份，不过，从他佩戴的肩章来看，绝对是个大人物。我们把他抓回去，一定是个大功劳。\n{士兵A：}可是我们第9小队是来执行侦察任务的，把这里到卡尔提亚城的地形摸清楚，好让大军一路直捣敌巢。难道为了这个俘虏，放弃正在进行中的任务？\n{士兵B：}你傻伐？把这俘虏带回去，是我们的功劳。把侦察做好了，让大军攻取卡尔提亚城，就是克兰特将军的功劳了。哪有自己到手的功劳不要，再去为别人做嫁衣的。我们还是先把这家伙押回去，免得夜长梦多煮熟的鸭子再飞掉。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Barland's troops are everywhere. It seems that our Kartia Kingdom is not doing well.\n{Rael:} Be careful of the Pegasus rider in front.\n{Ina:} There are such soldiers in the Barland army. But if you hit it with lightning, you can also shoot it down, right?\n{Rael:} This is not necessarily true. Pegasus has a special ability that can make the enemy {increasing the consumption of mana required to cast magic}, so if the mana is not enough, the lightning cannot be shot at all.\n{Ina:} So troublesome. Take notes quickly.\n{Rael:} Have you figured out how to deal with them?\n{Ina:} Not yet, but I will always find a way. I want to work hard.","{伊娜：}到处都是巴兰德的军队啊，看样子我们卡尔提亚王国情况不妙。\n{雷尔：}小心前面的飞马骑士。\n{伊娜：}巴兰德军队里还有这种兵啊。不过如果用闪电打，应该也可以击落吧？\n{雷尔：}这就不一定了。飞马有一种特殊的能力，能让敌方{施放魔法需要的魔力消耗量增加}，所以如果魔法值不够的话，闪电是根本打不出来的。\n{伊娜：}这么麻烦啊。赶紧做笔记。\n{雷尔：}你想好怎么对付他们了吗？\n{伊娜：}还没有，不过我总会有办法的。我要努力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Basically no SWAT team can be seen here.","{伊娜：}到了这里基本上就看不到什么特警队了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Brother Mundo said that Eldria is in the north of this town. Is it possible to walk from here?","{伊娜：}蒙多大哥说埃尔德里亚在这个城镇的北方，从这里走是不是可以到达呢？\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Brother, do you know where Aris’ helmet is?\n{Man:} Isn’t the legend stolen?\n{Ina:} Someone finally knows, great! So where is it?\n{Man:} Do you think I am a thief? Do you even know this?\n{Ina:} No, that's not what I meant... I'm sorry!","{伊娜：}这位大哥，请问您知道亚里斯的头盔在哪里吗？\n{男子：}不是传说被盗了吗？\n{伊娜：}终于有人知道了，太好了！那么它在哪里呢？\n{男子：}你以为我是贼？连这都知道？\n{伊娜：}不，不是这个意思……对不起！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} But I still can't spend so much money.\n{Owner:} It's okay, it's up to you to buy it deliberately, I keep things for you, and I won't sell other people's 50,000 gold coins.","{伊娜：}可是我还是拿不出这么多钱唉。\n{店主：}没关系，看您成心买，东西我给你留着，别人出50000金币我也不卖。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} But, I don't seem to have enough money. Let me think of a way to talk about it.","{伊娜：}可是，我好像钱不够呢。还是让我想想办法再说吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} But, now we don't even know who attacked Roland...\n{Rael:} We don't know what enemies he has, except for Kairon, who has been wiped out.\n{Freeman:} But, is it possible that he has offended Archbishop Yingluck because he saved us?\n{Raier:} does not rule out this possibility.\n{Ina:} Oh, then we should take the initiative to solve this matter, and not let him get involved.","{伊娜：}不过，现在我们连袭击罗兰的人是谁都不知道……\n{雷尔：}我们并不知道他有什么敌人，除了已经被消灭的凯隆。\n{弗里曼：}不过，有没有可能是因为他救了我们，而得罪了英拉大主教的人呢？\n{雷尔：}也不排除这个可能。\n{伊娜：}哎呀，那么我们更加应该主动去解决这件事，不能让他被连累了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} By the way, Little Hei, we want to ask a question.\n{Little Hei:} Whatever matter, just say it.\n{Ina:} Do you know what happened in neighboring Kartia recently? Who is the king now?\n{Little Hei:} I'm just a small tour guide, I don't care about politics or anything. Or I will take you to the village and ask, maybe someone will know.\n{Ina:} Good too.","{伊娜：}对了，小黑，我们想打听个问题。\n{小黑：}什么事情，您尽管说。\n{伊娜：}你知道不知道邻国卡尔提亚最近发生了什么事？现在国王是谁啊？\n{小黑：}我只是一个小小的导游，对政治什么的不关心的。要不我带各位去村里问问，也许有人会知道。\n{伊娜：}也好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} By the way, how do we ask for \"Fire Spirit Orb\" from Holia?\n{Freeman:} The first thing to consider is how we should explain that we came back alive from his army. According to his plan, we should have been killed. Of course, maybe there is no need to explain anything at all, you see, someone has come to welcome us.\n{Army:} Master Holia has an order, it doesn't matter if you find Ina and other characters to kill!","{伊娜：}话说，我们怎么向霍利亚要“火灵珠”呢？\n{弗里曼：}首先要考虑的是，我们要怎么解释我们从他的大军刀下活着回来吧。按照他的计划，我们应该已经被灭杀了。当然，也许根本不需要解释什么，你看，有人来欢迎我们了。\n\n{军队：}霍利亚大人有令，找到伊娜等人格杀勿论！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} By the way, that demon Kairon, he also wants to grab the parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", so is he also instigated by the Demon Race?\n{Roland:} It should not be. Kairon is just a savage, he never listens to anyone's command, do whatever he wants, do whatever he wants. Grabbing the \"Dragon Shield\" was only because of interest in that treasure. What's more, this happened two years ago, and it was only recently that the Mozu wanted to find the \"Dragon King Divine Power\".\n{Ina:} Okay, then I will sort out the known information in Ina-chan's universal notebook. First, the demons are looking for the \"dragon king supernatural power\"; second, the demons send scouts to Terracia to find them; third, Roland's enemy, Kairon, is in Terrasia; fourth, Kairon robbed them two years ago \"Dragon Shield\"; Fifth, Kairon is not part of the demons. Well, the conclusion is here! What the Mozu is looking for is the \"Dragon Shield\", and Kairon will not give the \"Dragon Shield\" in his hand to the Mozu. Then we can use this detector to find him. Can't let the demons get ahead.","{伊娜：}对了，那个恶魔凯隆，他也想要抢“龙王神力”的部件，那么他是不是也受魔族指使的呢？\n{罗兰：}应该不是。凯隆只是个野人，从不听任何人的指挥，自己想做什么就做什么，为所欲为。抢“龙盾”仅仅是因为对那件宝物感兴趣而已。何况这事是两年前的了，而魔族想找“龙王神力”还只是最近的事。\n{伊娜：}好，那么我把伊娜酱万能笔记本上已知的信息整理一下。\n第一，魔族在找“龙王神力”；\n第二，魔族派侦察到泰拉西亚来找；\n第三，罗兰的仇人凯隆在泰拉西亚；\n第四，凯隆两年前抢走了“龙盾”；\n第五，凯隆并不是魔族一伙的。\n嗯，结论出来了！魔族找的就是“龙盾”，而凯隆并不会把手里的“龙盾”交给魔族。那么我们就可以用这个探测仪找到他。可不能让魔族抢了先。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} By the way, we have Yun Xuesong's oar, can we use this?\n{Freeman:} The hardest wood on the mainland, this is really where it comes in. Just try this. Everyone is ready and draw together.\n{Sailor:} Hey Zuo hey~~~~~!\n{Ina:} Passed!","{伊娜：}对了，我们有云雪松的桨啊，用这个可不可以？\n{弗里曼：}大陆上最硬的木材，这还真是它的用武之地啊。就用这个试试吧。大家准备好，一齐划。\n{水手：}嘿佐嘿~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}通过了耶！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Carridan, what's going on? You make it clear!\n{Karidan:} Oh, yeah, I didn't expect that you even won the Crystal Dragon. Okay, look at... Kalidan took off his hat and tore off his fake face, revealing the face of a demon with horns.\n{Freeman:} Are you... actually a demons?\n{Carridan:} Yes, maybe it is more appropriate for you to call me Gals.\n{Ina:} So Gals is you. Disguised as an official, hiding by the Queen's side, and providing false information to lure us into ambush, what on earth do you want to do?\n{Galce:} What else do you want to do? Of course it is to kill you.\n{Ina:} The crystal dragon you are proud of has also been defeated by us. Is there any other trick?\n{Galce:} Hmph, you seem to be a magician, right, but don't think I really can't magic, it's just a lie to make you underestimate me. Not only that, I also have a considerable number of troops. I personally fight with you, you may not be my opponent.","{伊娜：}卡里丹，这是怎么回事？你说清楚！\n{卡里丹：}啊呀呀，没想到你们居然连水晶龙也赢了。好吧，你们看着……\n\n卡里丹摘掉帽子，撕下了假脸皮，露出了长着角的魔族的脸。\n\n{弗里曼：}你……竟然是魔族？\n{卡里丹：}没错，或许，你们还是叫我加尔斯更合适些。\n{伊娜：}原来加尔斯就是你啊。竟然伪装成官员隐藏在女王身边，还提供错误的情报引诱伏击我们，你到底想干什么？\n{加尔斯：}想干什么，还用说吗，当然是杀了你们。\n{伊娜：}你引以为豪的水晶龙也被我们打败了，还有什么招数吗？\n{加尔斯：}哼哼，你好像是魔法师是吧，不过别以为我真的不会魔法，那只不过是为了让你们低估我而编造的谎言而已。不仅如此，我还有数量可观的部队。我亲手跟你交战，你不见得是我的对手。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Coming here, things that can fly are really hard to wrap around...\n{Freeman:} I am puzzled now, we have been ambushed twice, and the enemy must know that we are coming. And, have you noticed, how many monsters have attacked us just now?\n{Ina:} It adds up to a few hundred.\n{Freeman:} How many people are in a squadron?\n{Ina:} I don't know about this...\n{Reel:} There are only dozens of people in a squadron. Now the number of enemies that have appeared is far more. There is a problem with the previous intelligence.\n{Ina:} Make a note of it. That being said, I am going to look through the Ina-chan universal notebook, and there are quite a few suspicious points recorded before. Doubt one, the back door of Archbishop Yingluck leads here; Doubt two, Kurug knows Jack and knows we are coming; Doubt three, Kurug's statement is inconsistent with the Centaur's statement; Doubt four, the queen and Kurug There is an error in the intelligence given to us; Doubt 5, the Demon's method of calling reinforcements at this time is very unnatural; Doubt 6, we encountered an ambush; Doubt 7, Kalidan is missing; Add a doubt 8, which is now used by the detector The reaction was not as strong as before at the entrance of the cave. ?a?aFrom the above, what can we draw?\n{Freeman:} I suddenly have a feeling that the unnatural intelligence of the Mozu called reinforcements seems to have been given to induce us to act quickly. In this way, we can't wait, and will not calmly think about and respond.\n{Rael:} Could it be that this is a trap?\n{Freeman:} If it's a trap, who is the person who will be trapped, and why is he doing this? There is no reason for the queen to take the knife to kill, she has no grudges against us at all.\n{Ina:} Anyway, the most direct way to find out now is still {find Gals}. We only need to ask him why he ambush us, and it should be clear. Let's go.\n{Freeman:} I think so too, but be careful, there may be an ambush.","{伊娜：}冲过来了，会飞的东西果然很难缠……\n{弗里曼：}我现在很疑惑，我们已经遭了两次埋伏了，敌人一定是知道我们要来。而且，你们注意到没有，刚才袭击我们的怪物总共有多少数量？\n{伊娜：}加起来有几百了吧。\n{弗里曼：}一个中队是多少人？\n{伊娜：}这个我不知道耶……\n{雷尔：}一个中队也就几十人而已，现在敌人已经出现过的数目就远远不止了。之前的情报有问题。\n{伊娜：}记下来记下来。这么说，我来翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本，之前记录的疑点也相当的多呢。\n疑点一，英拉大主教的后门通向这里；\n疑点二，库鲁格认识杰克，而且知道我们要来；\n疑点三，库鲁格的说法与半人马的说法不一致；\n疑点四，女王和库鲁格给我们的情报有差错；\n疑点五，魔族这个时候叫援军的做法很不自然；\n疑点六，我们遇到了埋伏；\n疑点七，卡里丹不见了；\n再加上一条疑点八，现在探测仪的反应反而不如之前在洞口时的强。\n——从以上这些，我们能得出什么？\n{弗里曼：}我突然有种感觉，魔族叫援军这条很不自然的情报，似乎是为了引诱我们赶紧行动而给出的。这样我们就会迫不及待，而不会从容思考应对。\n{雷尔：}难道说这是个圈套？\n{弗里曼：}如果是个圈套的话，下套的人又是谁呢，他为了什么要这么做呢？女王没有理由要借刀杀人，她跟我们根本无怨无仇。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，现在最直接的找出答案的办法，仍然是{找到加尔斯}。我们只要问他，为什么会埋伏我们，应该就弄清楚了。走吧。\n{弗里曼：}我也是这么想的，但是要小心，说不定还有埋伏。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Crossing the border, there is really no defense. He came here without any battle.\n{Freeman:} As I expected, Archbishop Yingluck did not expect us to leave here. Once he enters the hinterland of the Barland Kingdom, it will not be so easy for him to intercept us at that time.\n{Ina:} Jack is so good.\n{Rael:} Where is Jack going to march next?\n{Freeman:} I plan to raid the important town of Barland\n{Hellald}. {Ina:} Doesn't this allow them to discover our whereabouts?\n{Freeman:} is to let them discover. Our purpose here is to divert the attention of Archbishop Yingluck from the Koz Peninsula. So when we make trouble here, he will not care about the Koz Peninsula, but will come back and arrest us wholeheartedly, so that the people there will not be affected. And here we can rely on high-speed and flexible transfer to get rid of his army, this is Ina, your specialty.\n{Rael:} Jack is really good at strategic planning and thoughtful. I can't tell at all that it's someone younger than me. If you could have an army at the beginning, maybe the situation would not have fallen to the present.\n{Ina:} But it is not too late. I am confident to help you two restore your country. I will work hard.\n{Freeman:} Thank you Ina, the success of the battle during this period is mainly due to you.\n{Ina:} Don't praise me, sorry. Ok? There seemed to be a weak reaction on the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" detector, and there was no movement for a long time, and there seemed to be a component in this area.\n{Rael:} It would be great if you can find it by the way, but let's act first according to Jack's plan. We can't delay now. We must first achieve the goal of a successful raid.","{伊娜：}穿过国境，果然没有什么防卫啊。居然没打什么仗就顺利地过来了。\n{弗里曼：}正如我所料，英拉大主教没料到我们会从这里走。一旦进入巴兰德王国的腹地，到时他再想截到我们就没那么容易了。\n{伊娜：}杰克好厉害耶。\n{雷尔：}接下来杰克打算向哪边进军呢？\n{弗里曼：}我打算突袭巴兰德的重镇{海拉尔德}。\n{伊娜：}这样的话不是就让他们发现我们的行踪了吗？\n{弗里曼：}就是要让他们发现。我们来这里的目的是为了把英拉大主教的注意力从科兹半岛转移开。所以我们在这里闹出事情来，他就不会顾及科兹半岛了，而是会全心全意回来抓我们，那里的民众就不会被连累。而我们在这里可以靠高速灵活的转移来甩开他的大军，这就是伊娜你的特长啦。\n{雷尔：}策略谋划方面杰克真是很在行，也想得周到。一点都看不出是个年纪比我还小的人。如果一开始你能有一支军队的话，也许情况早就不至于落到现在这样了。\n{伊娜：}不过现在还不晚，我有信心帮助你们两个恢复你们的国家，我会努力的。\n{弗里曼：}谢谢伊娜，这段时间来的作战成功主要还是你的功劳啊。\n{伊娜：}别夸我啦，不好意思的耶。嗯？“龙王神力”的探测仪上似乎有微弱的反应，好久没动静了，这一带看来还有一个部件。\n{雷尔：}如果能顺便找到的话那就太好了，不过还是依杰克的计策先行动吧，我们现在不能耽搁，先要达成突袭成功的目标才好。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Dig out something like a pendant, what is this? It seems to be useful, put it away first.","{伊娜：}挖出一个像挂件的东西，这是什么呢？好像会有用，先收着吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Do you find it strange, why are the trees in this area withered? The demon just said that there is a lot of rain in this area, and the trees should be very dense.\n{Freeman:} From a climate perspective, it should be a rainforest climate, hot, humid, and rainy. There really shouldn't be a lot of dead trees. And these trees were so black that they were burnt.\n{Ina:} Could it be that there was a fire here?\n{Rael:} Ina, you can light a fire and try.\n{Ina:} I can't light it up at all, it's so damp.\n{Rael:} That's it. The environment here is very humid and it is difficult to catch a fire, let alone burn such a large area.\n{Ina:} Well, then it's not burned, is it smoked?","{伊娜：}你们有没有觉得很奇怪，为什么这一带的树都枯了呢？刚才那个恶魔也说了，这一带下雨很多，应该树木很茂密才对。\n{弗里曼：}从气候上来说，这里应该是雨林气候吧，热，湿，多雨，确实不应该出现树木大片枯死的情况。而且这些树木枯得发黑，简直就像是灼烧过的一样。\n{伊娜：}难道说这里发生过火灾？\n{雷尔：}伊娜，你点个火试试。\n{伊娜：}根本点不起来耶，潮湿得厉害。\n{雷尔：}这就是了，本身这里环境就非常潮湿，起火都很难，不要说烧掉这么大一片了。\n{伊娜：}唔，那么不是烧的，难道是熏的不成？\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Do you think it's weird? In the vicinity of the capital city, there is no prosperous market, but there are chasing soldiers everywhere?\n{Rael:} It's really strange.\n{Freeman:} Ask those people, do they know something?\n{Man A:} This is not the case here! But recently everything in the market has been destroyed!\n{Freeman:} Who did it? Why destroy?\n{Man A:} We don't know anything. If we did, we might have left here a long time ago, so we won't wait until they are caught.\n{Freeman:} Was there nothing unusual before the incident?\n{Man B:} So, have you noticed one thing? That weird sound...\n{Man A:} Ah, do you mean that sound?\n{Ina:} Sure enough, something strange?\n{Man A:} If you want to say yes, there was often a strange rumbling in the west of the city a while ago, and sometimes the ground was trembling clearly in this area.\n{Rael:} Does this sound like an earthquake?\n{Man A:} It won't be an earthquake. Our ancestors have lived here for more than ten generations, and have never heard of an earthquake here.\n{Ina:} What could it be?\n{Man A:} We don't know...\n{Freeman:} Anyway, this is suspicious.\n{Ina:} Well, after we send them back to the city, it is necessary to investigate where they said.","{伊娜：}大家有没有觉得很奇怪？在首都城的附近，没看到一点繁荣的街市，却到处是打打杀杀的追兵？\n{雷尔：}确实很奇怪。\n{弗里曼：}问问那些人，是不是知道些什么？\n{男子A：}这里本来不是这样的！可是最近街市什么的都被破坏了！\n{弗里曼：}什么人干的？为什么要破坏？\n{男子A：}我们什么都不知道啊，如果知道的话也许早就离开这里了，才不会等到被他们抓。\n{弗里曼：}难道事发之前什么异样都没有吗？\n{男子B：}这么说来，有一件事你察觉到没有？那个诡异的声响……\n{男子A：}啊，难道你是说，那个声音？\n{伊娜：}果然有异样的事情？\n{男子A：}如果要说有的话，就是前一阵子在城的西面常有奇怪的轰响，有时这一带甚至能明显感觉到地面在颤动。\n{雷尔：}这个，听起来像是地震？\n{男子A：}不会是地震，我们家祖祖辈辈在这里生活了十几代人，还从没听说这里会发生地震。\n{伊娜：}那会是什么呢？\n{男子A：}我们不知道啊……\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，这一点很可疑。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我们把他们送回城里之后有必要去他们所说的地方调查一下。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Drake, don't run! Don't fall for the remuneration you owe Brother Mondo.\n{Dranke:} Stop them for me!\n{Subordinate:} Yes!\n{Ina:} What's the matter, where did you suddenly move out so many subordinates?\n{Derlank:} Are you surprised at my teleportation magic? It seems that you are nothing more than that, you still want to collect debts for this.\n{Ina:} She used violence to force her account!","{伊娜：}德兰克，你别跑！你欠蒙多大哥的报酬别赖帐啊。\n{德兰克：}给我拦住他们！\n{部下：}是！\n{伊娜：}怎么回事，你从哪里突然搬出来那么多部下？\n{德兰克：}对我的传送魔法很吃惊吗？看来你们也不过如此，就这点本事还想来讨债。\n{伊娜：}强行赖帐，居然还使用暴力！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Dressup is complete!","{伊娜：}换装完毕！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Excuse me, where is there a pier near here?\n{Locals:} Go {southeast direction} and you will find it in {Shilan Village}.\n{Ina:} Thank you.","{伊娜：}请问，这里附近哪里有码头呢？\n{当地人：}向{东南方向}走，到{史兰村}就有。\n{伊娜：}谢谢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Excuse me...\n{Middle-aged man:} I am Zola Salman, the priest here.\n{Ina:} Ah, sure enough you are here. I'm Ina, please advise.\n{Zola:} Just now I saw that you killed the invading demons, thank you very much.\n{Ina:} Hey, you saw us.\n{Zola:} Of course, I can see everything in the temple. I know he must have come for the \"longan ring\" in our hands. So my son and I took two rings, one real and one fake, and moved in opposite directions, in order to find an opportunity for at least one of them to leave safely.\n{Ina:} There are real and fake?\n{Zola:} After getting the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", we used the mirror of the temple to copy a ring with exactly the same appearance. Look, the one I have now is fake. Okay, let's go out and talk about the details. Maybe the demons will send people here, so it's not suitable to stay here for a long time.","{伊娜：}请问您是……\n{中年男子：}我是佐拉·萨尔曼，是这里的司祭。\n{伊娜：}啊，果然您就在这里。我是伊娜，请多指教。\n{佐拉：}刚才我看到你们干掉了那个入侵的魔族了，真是十分感谢。\n{伊娜：}咦，您看到我们啦。\n{佐拉：}当然，神殿里的每一处我都能看到。我知道他一定是为了我们手中的“龙眼戒”而来。所以我和儿子两人将一真一假两枚戒指分别带着向相反方向移动，以便找机会至少让一人能安全脱离。\n{伊娜：}还有真的和假的？\n{佐拉：}拿到“龙眼戒”之后，我们用神殿之镜复制了一枚外观完全一样的戒指，看，我现在拿的这枚就是假的。好了，详细的情况我们出去再说吧。搞不好魔族还会派人来，此地不宜久留。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Find another \"Mane of the Divine Beast\", but where do you go to find it?\n{Uncle Charlie:} If you really can't find it, it's up to the customer to identify the goods. You give 1 billion gold coins, and I will hand you the shoes.\n{Ina:} Forget it, I'll look for \"The Mane of the Divine Beast\". One billion gold coins, even if I get so many, I will be crushed to death.","{伊娜：}再找一条“神兽之鬃”啊，可是要上哪去找呢？\n{查理大叔：}如果实在找不到，看在客人您识货的份上，您给10亿个金币，我这就把鞋交给您。\n{伊娜：}算了，我还是去找“神兽之鬃”吧。10亿个金币，我就算弄得到那么多，也要被压死。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} First, the purpose of the man in black is not to make money, but to kill you. This is not like an ordinary thieves; second, the man in black is not blocked by soldiers, indicating that the guards were not at their posts at the time On; Third, the people in black are not worried about being discovered, indicating that they know that the guards will not come to stop them. The Kartiya Kingdom Army has always had strict military discipline. If there is anything that can allow soldiers to leave their posts, then there is only one possibility, which is the order of their superiors. And their boss is Boo\nGeneral Bruno. General Bruno was the only one who could move the guards away. He should have been the only one who knew that the guard was not at the post. But the man in black also knew that the guard was not at his post. Therefore, the man in black and General Bruno must be colluding accomplices. This is the first conclusion.\n{Freeman:} I doubted that too. When you say this, I am even more convinced.","{伊娜：}\n第一，黑衣人的目的不是钱财，而是想置你于死地，这一点并不像普通的盗贼；\n第二，黑衣人没有被士兵阻拦，说明卫兵当时并不在岗位上；\n第三，黑衣人并不担心被发现，说明他们知道卫兵不会来阻止他们。\n卡尔提亚王国军向来军纪严明，如果说有什么事情能让士兵离开岗位，那么只有一个可能，就是上司的命令。而他们的上司，就是布\r\n里诺将军。布里诺将军是当时唯一能把卫兵调开的人。本来应该只有他知道当时卫兵不在岗位上。\n可是黑衣人也知道卫兵不在岗位上。\n所以黑衣人与布里诺将军一定是串通好的同伙。这是第一个结论。\n{弗里曼：}我也这么怀疑过。你这么一说，我更加确信了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Found it! This is it! Map of the explorer Singh. This is what we picked up before we encountered the pinate whirlwind. However, this picture is not very understandable. Why did he write a crooked \"Tian\" character?\n{Raier:} This doesn't seem to be the word \"Tian\". Otherwise, why are the two pens slanted? And the colors are different. This is clearly a red cross drawn in a black box.\n{Ina:} This must mean something. I think about it, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}找到了！就是这个！探险家辛格的地图。这是我们在遇到海盗飞旋风之前捡到的。可是，这图不怎么看得懂耶。他怎么写了一个歪歪扭扭的“田”字？\n{雷尔：}这个好像不是“田”字吧。要不然里面两笔怎么是斜的呢。而且颜色也不一样。这分明是在一个黑色的方框里面画了一个红色的叉而已。\n{伊娜：}这一定代表着什么意思吧。我想想，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} From this cave, you will be able to reach Black Rock Island. Alas, the detector is brighter than before, it seems correct.","{伊娜：}从这个地洞过去，就能到黑岩岛了吧。唉，果然探测仪比之前亮了些呢，看来没错。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} From this point of view, the prime minister, Holia, is really not a good person. He sells officials and is greedy for money, and he sells his sovereignty to trade with the demons. The people didn't like him either.\n{Freeman:} However, in order to successfully obtain information on the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" and \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", when we wait to see him, it is best not to show any disgust.\n{Ina:} This...I will try my best.","{伊娜：}这么看来，那个宰相霍利亚还真不是个好人唉。又卖官又贪财，还出卖主权跟魔族交易。民众也都不喜欢他。\n{弗里曼：}不过，为了顺利地弄到“火灵珠”及“龙牙冠”的情报，我们等下见到他时，最好不要表露出什么厌恶的情绪才好。\n{伊娜：}这个……我尽力吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Goodbye, Solo. You have been thinking about dominance all day, trying everything you can to resurrect the \"Sword of Destruction\", and this is the end in the end...\n{Rael:} Great, if you kill Solo, the \"Sword of Destruction\" will stop, right?\n{Mengying:} No, once the \"Sword of Destruction\" is unblocked, it will not stop. Although it is quiet for the time being, once the next person gets it, that person will become like Solo again.\n{Ina:} Is there no way to solve it? Seal it again?\n{Mengying:} Impossible, no one in the world has such a powerful mana that can do this. We must know that it took more than 10 years for the Holy King Adrian to complete the seal on the \"Sword of Destruction\"...\n{Freeman:} Ah, it turns out that the person who sealed the \"Sword of Destruction\" was the Holy King. Adrian, the legendary saint... It's a pity that a lot of his magic has been lost...\n{Mengying:} It was not lost, but he destroyed all the information himself. He has never accepted an apprentice in his entire life, just worrying that the unbalanced magic will bring disaster to the world. The world seemed too fragile in front of his magic.\n{Ina:} Is his magic more powerful than the \"Sword of Destruction\"?\n{Mengying:} Many times more powerful. Therefore, he has the ability to seal the \"Sword of Destruction\". And since his death to the present, in hundreds of years, no one has ever achieved even one percent of his ability. What's more, even if it can reach 1%, what's the use? It took Saint King Adrian ten years to complete the seal. It would take a thousand years for a person with only one% of his ability, but who can survive? millennium.\n{Rael:} In other words, there is no way to seal it again?\n{Mengying:} Yes, that's what it means.\n{Freeman:} So is there a way to destroy it?\n{Mengying:} \"The Sword of Destruction\" is a divine tool. If you want to destroy it, you need a stronger divine tool than him.\n{Ina:} Isn't \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" good?\n{Mengying:} \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" is far worse than \"Sword of Destruction\". If you don't believe me, try it, the \"Sword of Destruction\" can easily slash the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". This is proof.\n{Rael:} Don't try anymore.\n{Ina:} So, what is a more powerful artifact than the \"Sword of Destruction\"?\n{Mengying:} As far as I know, there is no such thing in this world. The \"Sword of Destruction\" is the supreme artifact that is called the \"Birth and End of the World\" together with the \"Sword of Creation\".\n{Freeman:} So, there is at least one artifact equivalent to the \"Sword of Destruction\"?\n{Mengying:} That's right. Wait, do you want to use the \"sword of creation\" to destroy the \"sword of destruction\"?\n{Freeman:} Since it is an artifact of the same level, it should be promising, right?\n{Mengying:} I don't know, but if it can, it's just the result of the two swords being destroyed together.\n{Ina:} So, there is still hope? Even if they die together, it is better than letting the \"Sword of Destruction\" continue to destroy the world. Shall we give it a try?\n{Mengying:} It is only theoretically possible. In fact, I'm afraid it can't be done. What kind of power is needed to make the two artifacts fight together is not something we can imagine.\n{Ina:} Since dreaming is useless, let's try it out. Is there any way I will find out after trying it. Anyway, I will not give up hope, I will work hard.\n{Freeman:} Yes, if you don't try, you will only wait for the \"Sword of Destruction\" to destroy the entire world. Instead of this, even if it is hopeless, we should try it.\n{Mengying:} Well, the \"Sword of Creation\" is in {Tianchi Mountain}, I will take you there. Let's {go ahead} by sea first.","{伊娜：}再见了，索罗。你整天想着称霸，想尽一切办法复活“毁灭之剑”，最后就是这样的下场……\n{雷尔：}太好了，干掉了索罗，“毁灭之剑”就会停止了吧？\n{梦影：}不，“毁灭之剑”一旦解封，就不会停止了。虽然暂时是安静的，但是一旦有下一个人得到它，那个人又会变得跟索罗一样。\n{伊娜：}没有办法解决了吗？再次把它封印？\n{梦影：}不可能，现在全世界也没有一个人有如此强大的法力能做到这件事。要知道当年圣王阿德里尔尚且花了10年多的时间才完成了对“毁灭之剑”的封印……\n{弗里曼：}啊，原来以前封印“毁灭之剑”的人是圣王阿德里尔啊，传说中圣人……可惜他的很多魔法失传了……\n{梦影：}不是失传，而是他自己销毁了所有资料。他一生都没有收过徒弟，就是担心过于失衡的魔法给世界带来灾难。这个世界在他的魔法面前显得太脆弱了。\n{伊娜：}他的魔法比“毁灭之剑”的威力还要厉害吗？\n{梦影：}还要厉害许多倍。因此他才有能力封印“毁灭之剑”。而自从他去世到现在，几百年来再也没有出现过任何一个人达到哪怕是他的百分之一的能力。而且，就算是能达到百分之一又有什么用，圣王阿德里尔花了十年才完成封印，一个能力只有他百分之一的人就要花一千年，可是谁活得了一千年。\n{雷尔：}也就是说，根本没有办法再次封印了？\n{梦影：}对，就是这个意思。\n{弗里曼：}那么有没有办法破坏它呢？\n{梦影：}“毁灭之剑”是神器，如果要破坏它，就需要比他更强的神器才可能做到。\n{伊娜：}“龙王神力”不行吗？\n{梦影：}“龙王神力”比“毁灭之剑”差太远了。不信你试试，“毁灭之剑”可以轻松地砍伤“龙王神力”，这就是证明。\n{雷尔：}还是不要试了。\n{伊娜：}那么，比“毁灭之剑”更强的神器，是什么呢？\n{梦影：}据我所知，这个世界上并不存在这样的东西。“毁灭之剑”是与“创世之剑”并称为“世界的诞生与终结”的最高神器了。\n{弗里曼：}这么说，至少还有一件与“毁灭之剑”相当的神器了？\n{梦影：}没错。等等，难道你是想，用“创世之剑”去破坏“毁灭之剑”吗？\n{弗里曼：}既然是同一级别的神器，应该是有希望的吧？\n{梦影：}我也不知道，但是如果真的可以，也只是两剑同归于尽的结果吧。\n{伊娜：}这么说，还是有希望的喽？就算同归于尽，也比放任“毁灭之剑”继续破坏世界的好。我们试一试吧？\n{梦影：}仅仅是从理论上讲有这个可能而已。实际上恐怕根本做不到。要使两神器相拼，需要什么样的力量，这不是我们空想就能达到的。\n{伊娜：}既然空想没用，那就去实际试试啊。有没有办法，试过之后才知道。不管怎么说，我不会放弃希望的，我会努力的。\n{弗里曼：}是啊，如果不去尝试，结果只有坐等“毁灭之剑”破坏整个世界了。与其这样，哪怕是再渺茫的希望，我们也该去试试。\n{梦影：}好吧，“创世之剑”在{天池山}，我带你们去。我们先{往前}走海路吧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Has it finally broken through...\n{Rael:} You said that you finally have a clue?\n{Ina:} Well, I wrote down what they said:\n1. I was overtaken, I was overtaken...\n2. Run, run...\n3. Run... Run...\n4. Go Where did it go... Five, the chase came, it's over...\n{Freeman:} It seems that the order we encountered is exactly the opposite, so it should be right to put these words in reverse order.\n{Ina:} Yes, the original order should be like this: One, the chase is here, it's over... Two, where to go... Three, run...Run... Four, run...Run ... Fifth, was caught up, was caught up... So, these people were escaping all the way, being chased and killed all the way, and finally being overtaken.\n{Freeman:} And it seemed that they knew that if they were caught up, they would not escape, so they fled in a panic. But what exactly are their identities, and who are they who are chasing them? Why does this happen near the capital?\n{Ina:} I don't know these yet, but at least one thing is that we are walking against the route they escaped, so if we walk down here, we should be able to find the answer.\n{Rael:} We originally planned to go in this direction. In that case, is the place where they escaped...\n{Freeman:} Yes, it should be {Billersberg}.","{伊娜：}终于突破了吗……\n{雷尔：}刚才你说终于有点头绪了？\n{伊娜：}嗯，我把他们说的话都记下来了：\n一，被追上了，被追上了……\n二，快跑，快跑……\n三，跑……跑……\n四，要跑到哪里……\n五，追兵来了，完了……\n{弗里曼：}看起来，我们遇到的顺序正好是反的，把这些话反过来排序一下应该就对了。\n{伊娜：}没错，本来的顺序应该是这样的：\n一，追兵来了，完了……\n二，要跑到哪里……\n三，跑……跑……\n四，快跑……快跑……\n五，被追上了，被追上了……\n所以，这些人是在一路逃跑，一路被追杀，最终被追上了。\n{弗里曼：}而且看起来他们知道如果被追上就难逃一死，所以慌不择路地逃。不过，他们的身份到底是什么呢，追杀他们的人又是谁？在首都附近为什么会出现这样的事情？\n{伊娜：}这些我还不知道，不过至少有一点，我们是在逆着他们逃出来的路线走，那么我们沿着这里走下去，应该能找到答案。\n{雷尔：}我们本来就打算朝这个方向走吧。这么说来，他们逃出来的地方难道是……\n{弗里曼：}没错，应该就是{比勒斯勃格}。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Have any of you seen Senior Fengyou?\n{Freeman:} Didn't see, he was not resting in the cabin?\n{Ina:} There is no one in the cabin.\n{Rael:} But I heard a strange noise just now, like someone was using magic, I thought Ina was practicing.\n{Freeman:} Could it be that Senior Fengyou used magic? Let's go and take a look at the cabin. The three of them came to the cabin where Fengyou was just now and saw a note on the bed: Thank you very much for your kind help. I'm really sorry to rely on the boat again to add to your burden. I used Teleportation Dafa to leave first. If you have the opportunity to {in this sea} meet my {two juniors} wind and wind, trouble {hand over the anti-magic cloak and anti-magic chain}. Don't worry about me, everyone, I can gradually recover after I have the magic weapon.\n{Ina:} So, he left on purpose. But it's really strange, why didn't he stay on the boat and go to find his junior brother, wouldn't that be good?\n{Freeman:} I think he must have his own reasons.\n{Ina:} Anyway, we'd better {find} his two juniors {as soon as possible}, {and then go to} the Koz Peninsula.","{伊娜：}你们谁看到风游前辈了吗？\n{弗里曼：}没看到，他没在船舱里休息着？\n{伊娜：}船舱里一个人都没有耶。\n{雷尔：}不过我刚才听到了一阵奇怪的响声，像是有人在用魔法，我还以为伊娜在练习呢。\n{弗里曼：}难道是风游前辈用了魔法？走，我们去船舱看看。\n\n三人来到刚才风游所在有船舱，看到床上留着一张字条：\n各位好心搭救，已经万分感谢，实在不好意思再赖在船上给你们增加负担。我用传送大法先离开了。如果你们有机会{在这片海域}遇到我的{两位师弟}风行与风飞，麻烦{将抗魔披风和抗魔链转交}。各位不用担心我，我有了法宝之后能逐渐恢复的。\n\n{伊娜：}这么说，他是故意离开的。不过真是奇怪，为什么他不留在船上一起去找他的师弟呢，那样不是挺好吗？\n{弗里曼：}我想他一定有他自己的原因吧。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，我们最好{尽快找到}他的两位师弟，{然后再前往}科兹半岛。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Having entered this deep and detoured a lot, I still haven't found any clues.\n{Freeman:} Such a deep cave, generally speaking, is likely to have other exits.\n{Ina:} Ah, that said, can the female devil escape from another exit? This is bad, she will send the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" to Solandria.\n{Freeman:} We are not sure if there are any other outlets, so let's look forward to it. If there really is another way out, I can only go to {Solander} {ria} to chase her.","{伊娜：}已经进了这么深，也绕了不少路，还是没找到任何线索。\n{弗里曼：}这么深的洞穴，一般来说，很可能是有别的出口的。\n{伊娜：}啊，这么说，那个女恶魔岂不是能从别的出口逃出去？这样就糟了，她会把“火灵珠”送到索兰德里亚。\n{弗里曼：}有没有别的出口我们现在还不确定，再往前找找吧。如果真有别的出口，只能去{索兰德}\n{里亚}追她了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hello, brother, do you often come here to drink?\n{Guest:} Hello, little sister. I come every day, the environment here is good, and I can always meet people from all over the world. And I like the Portorico here.\n{Ina:} Looks like you are also human?\n{Guest:} To be precise, I am a mixed race, with human ancestry. My grandfather is human.\n{Ina:} We are here for the first time, and we don't know much about the situation here. I wonder if I can ask my eldest brother for advice.\n{Guest:} You are welcome. What to say. Just say if there is anything I can help.\n{Ina:} Thank you, brother. My name is Ina, please advise.\n{Guest:} My name is Mundo Fyon.\n{Ina:} Huh, Feang? This name seems to have been heard before, and I flipped through the notes...Ah, Chris Fayong...\n{Mondo:} That's my grandpa's name, how would you know it?\n{Ina:} Hey, are you the grandson of Chris Fayong? I heard about your grandfather from Jack. It is said that he is one of the few people who have been to the demon world and then returned...\n{Mondo:} Yes, I also listened to my grandma. Although grandpa arrived in the demon world, But he was homesick, and finally decided to go back. Grandma kept persuading him not to go back. He didn't listen. After going back, there was no news.\n{Ina:} Sorry, I mentioned a bitter past.\n{Mondo:} It's okay, I'm okay, because I was not born at that time and didn't know what grandpa looked like, so there was nothing sad about it. In fact, many of the humans who came to the Demon Realm have settled here, and basically everyone is unwilling to go back.\n{Ina:} It turns out that those who crossed the triangle of death are still alive.\n{Mondo:} Yes, so there are actually a certain number of human inhabitants here, and everyone is not considered to be outsiders.\n{Ina:} No wonder we didn't attract much attention when we came here... But why don't everyone want to go back?\n{Mondo:} Of course everyone thinks it is better here. Although the diet may not be right for the taste, although the environment is a bit strange, and there are even some unknowable natural disasters or beasts, it is still much better than the human society full of corruption and harsh government. Hasn't an ancient philosopher said, \"The harsh government is stronger than the dragon.\" The harsh government is more powerful than the dragons that can destroy the town. Who wants to go back there?\n{Ina:} So, it does make sense... But is there no corruption in the governance of the Demon Realm?\n{Mondo:} To be precise, there is no real governance in the devil world. We live here mostly in tribes. Although there are some tribal autonomy committees similar to the township government, most of them are organized spontaneously by the residents. Some tribes have leaders, some do not. In general, the residents are still self-reliant, fighting against nature, disasters, and beasts to obtain the right to survive. There is no guarantee, and they are all on their own. For example, like me, I'm a transport merchant, and I often get in danger for the purpose of transporting goods, so I might not be careful one day. On the other hand, most of the residents here are more frank and straightforward, speaking bluntly, there is no intrigue and conspinacy-of course, because of this, it is also easy to quarrel and even direct their opponents to the outcome. For example, yesterday there were two guests arguing here. The reason was that one guest laughed at the other guest for having a crooked corner, and the other party moved his hand in anger and stabbed him to death.\n{Ina:} Ah... It's cruel... After such a thing has happened, can we continue to operate here? Will the family members of the deceased come to trouble?\n{Mondo:} If you die, you will die, just drag the body out and bury it. The family of the deceased would not say anything. Because the law of the world is like this. You angered the other party but failed to protect yourself. No one would sympathize with such a death. If you are not strong enough or smart enough, you should not cause trouble.\n{Ina:} It sounds a bit ruthless...\n{Mondo:} Haha, the humans who first came here may indeed be uncomfortable. But it will be better after a long time.\n{Ina:} But, I heard that there are also kings in the devil world? Who is the evil prince Solo?\n{Mondo:} This person is indeed more famous recently, but he is just the leader of a tribe with strong military power. Some tribes clung to him, and some strong men went to serve him as soldiers in order to make a living. Although he proclaimed himself king, he can't control us. He seems to be more interested in the human kingdoms. He likes what he does, and it has nothing to do with us anyway. Sometimes he will come to our tribe to brag about what kind of results he has achieved, draw some aggressive guys to join his team, but most people will not believe him, we still live our lives.\n{Ina:} I heard that he got an amazing treasure.\n{Mondo:} Who knows if it's true or blown it. We don't care. Even if he got the League of Angels, I am not interested in understanding. If you are interested, you can ask our {Chief Security Officer}.\n{Ina:} What is the chief security officer?\n{Mondo:} The tribal security officer, he is responsible for leading and organizing the tribal police team to deal with criminal activities such as theft and robbery. You can find it by walking {west} from here.\n{Ina:} Thank you, Brother Mondo.\n{Mondo:} I talk a lot as soon as I drink, and I never finish talking, I hope it doesn't bother you.\n{Ina:} Where and where, I have benefited a lot.","{伊娜：}大哥你好，你常来这儿喝酒吗？\n{客人：}小妹妹你好。我天天都会来，这里的环境不错，还总是能见到来自各地的人。而且我喜欢这里的波多利酒。\n{伊娜：}看起来你也是人类？\n{客人：}准确地说我是个混血，有人类的血统。我爷爷是人类。\n{伊娜：}我们第一次来这里，还不太了解这里的情况，不知能不能请大哥指点指点。\n{客人：}客气。说哪里话。有什么我能帮忙的只管说好了。\n{伊娜：}谢谢大哥。我叫伊娜，请多指教。\n{客人：}我叫蒙多·费昂。\n{伊娜：}咦，费昂？这名字好像听到过，我翻翻笔记……啊，克里斯·费昂……\n{蒙多：}那是我爷爷的名字，你怎么会知道？\n{伊娜：}咦，你是克里斯·费昂的孙子？你爷爷的事，我是从杰克那里听来的，据说他是为数不多到过魔界又返回的人……\n{蒙多：}没错，我也是听奶奶说起的，爷爷虽然到了魔界，但是一直很思乡，后来终于决定要回去，奶奶一直劝他不要回去，他不听，回去之后就一直没有音讯了。\n{伊娜：}对不起啊，提起了辛酸的往事。\n{蒙多：}没关系，我还好啦，因为那时我还没出生，根本不知道爷爷长什么样，所以也没什么悲伤的。其实来到魔界的人类，在这里定居下来的有不少，大家基本上都是不愿意回去的。\n{伊娜：}原来那些穿过死亡三角的人，都还活着呀。\n{蒙多：}是啊，所以这里其实有一定数量的人类居民，大家也不当他们外人。\n{伊娜：}难怪我们来这里时也没有引起什么注意……不过为什么大家不愿意回去呢？\n{蒙多：}当然是大家觉得这里更好啦。虽然饮食可能不太对口味，虽然环境有点异样，甚至还有一些不可知的自然灾害或猛兽侵袭，但是，比起充满了贪腐和苛政的人类社会来说，还是要好得多。不是有一位古代的哲学家说过吗，“苛政猛于龙也”，苛政比那些可以毁灭城镇的巨龙们还厉害，谁还愿意回到那里去呢。\n{伊娜：}这么说来，确实有道理耶……不过魔界的治理，没有腐败现象吗？\n{蒙多：}准确地说，魔界还没有真正意义上的治理。我们这里多以部族为单位聚居，虽然也有一些类似于乡政府的部族自治委员会，不过那大多是居民自发组织的。有的部族有首领，有的没有。大体上居民们还是自力更生，与自然，与灾害，与猛兽，搏斗竞争，取得生存的权利，没有保障，全靠自己。比如像我吧，是个运输商人，也经常为了运送货物出没于危险之中，说不定哪天就不当心挂了。另一方面，这里的居民大多比较坦诚直率，直话直说，没什么勾心斗角阴谋算计的——当然，因为如此，也很容易发生争吵甚至直接动手把对手结果了。比如昨天这里就有两个客人争执起来，原因是一个客人嘲笑另一个客人角长歪了，对方一气之下就动了手，把他刺死了。\n{伊娜：}啊……好残酷……发生了这样的事，这里还能继续营业？死者的家属也不会来找麻烦？\n{蒙多：}死了就死了，把尸体拖出去埋了就是了。死者家属也不会说什么。因为世间的法则就是如此。你激怒了对方却没有保护好自己，这样的丧命没有人会同情。如果不够强大或者不够机敏就不该去惹是生非的。\n{伊娜：}听起来有点无情呢……\n{蒙多：}哈哈，初来这里的人类确实可能会不太习惯。不过时间久了就好了。\n{伊娜：}不过，我听说魔界不是也有王吗？邪亲王索罗，是个什么人物？\n{蒙多：}这个人啊，确实最近比较有名，不过他也就是某个军事力量强的部族的首领而已。也有一些部族依附了他，也有一些壮丁为讨生计去给他当兵。虽然自封了王，不过他可管不到我们。他似乎对人类的那些王国更有兴趣。他爱咋咋的，反正跟我们可没什么关系。他有时会到我们的部族来吹嘘自己取得了什么什么样的战果，拉拢一些好斗的家伙们去加入他的队伍，不过大多数人不会相信他，我们还是过我们的日子。\n{伊娜：}听说他得到了一件很了不得的宝贝啊。\n{蒙多：}谁知道是真的还是吹的呢。我们可不关心。他就是得到了天使联盟我也没兴趣去了解。你要是有兴趣的话，可以去问问我们的{安防长}。\n{伊娜：}安防长是？\n{蒙多：}部族的治安负责人，他负责带领和组织部族民警队处理偷盗抢劫等犯罪活动。从这里往{西边}走就能找到。\n{伊娜：}谢谢蒙多大哥了。\n{蒙多：}我这人一喝酒就话多，一说没个完，希望没烦到你。\n{伊娜：}哪里哪里，我受益匪浅呢。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hello, may I ask...\n{Young man:} I am Zad Salman, the priest here.\n{Ina:} I finally found you, great. I'm Ina, please advise.\n{Zade:} Thank you for helping to kill the invaders of the Demon Race.\n{Ina:} Hey, you all know...\n{Zade:} Of course, I can see everything in the temple. I guessed that they came for the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", so my father asked me to take the real \"Dragon Eye Ring\" and try to escape. He brought a copy of the fake \"Dragon Eye Ring\" and walked in the opposite direction to attract the demons. Family. Fortunately, you arrived in time to avoid our troubles. Let's go out and talk about the details.","{伊娜：}你好，请问……\n{青年男子：}我是扎德·萨尔曼，是这里的司祭。\n{伊娜：}终于找到你了，太好了。我是伊娜，请多指教。\n{扎德：}谢谢你们帮忙干掉了魔族的入侵者。\n{伊娜：}咦，原来你都知道啊……\n{扎德：}当然，神殿里的情况我都能看到。由于猜测他们是冲着“龙眼戒”而来的，所以父亲让我把真的“龙眼戒”带着设法逃走，他自己带了一枚复制的假“龙眼戒”朝反方向走去吸引魔族。好在你们及时赶到，避免了我们遭遇麻烦。详细的情况我们出去再说吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hello, sister, do you know where Aris’ helmet is?\n{Women:} What? Do you want to peep at night privately? Little girl, don't learn well at a young age, fight!\n{Ina:} Oh, elder sister, stop, you made a mistake...\n{Women:} Fight! See you still peeping!","{伊娜：}大姐您好，请问您知道亚里斯的头盔在哪里吗？\n{妇女：}什么？你想夜里私自偷窥？小丫头，年纪轻轻不学好，打！\n{伊娜：}哎哟，大姐住手，您搞错了啦……\n{妇女：}打！看你还偷窥！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Here comes again, sea monster... This time a lot...Well, I admit that you are not that good. This amount can really make many people go back and forth. But it's not enough to deal with me.","{伊娜：}又来了，海怪……这次好多……好吧，我承认你们不是那么菜。这个数量确实能让不少人有去无回了。不过对付我还不够的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Here it is, right here. But, is this really a royal city? How it looks like a prison...\n{Man A:} We don't know how it suddenly became like this...","{伊娜：}到了，就是这里吧。可是，这真是王城吗？怎么看上去像座监狱……\n{男子A：}我们也不知道怎么就突然变成这样了……\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Here {to the west}, you can reach a port called {Port Salon}, where you can sail directly to the sea by boat.","{伊娜：}这边{向西}，就能到一个叫{塞伦港}的港口，在那里坐船可以直接驶向外海了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, a big guy came out this time. But why are the little things gone?\n{Jack:} Summoning can only summon one type of creature at the same time. If you summon another, the previously summoned one will disappear.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be like this. Take notes.","{伊娜：}咦，这次出来个大家伙。不过刚才的小东西怎么没了？\n{杰克：}召唤术同时只能召唤一种类型的生物，如果你召唤了另一种，之前召唤的一种就会消失。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样。笔记笔记。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, does this terrain look a bit familiar? But I have never been to this place before.\n{Rael:} Seems like I saw it on a map.\n{Ina:} Ah, yes, it seems to be a map. I'm looking for it, I'm looking for it.","{伊娜：}咦，这个地形，是不是觉得看起来有点熟悉啊。可是我从来没有来过这个地方耶。\n{雷尔：}好像是在哪张地图上看到过的。\n{伊娜：}啊，对了，好像是地图。我找找我找找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, haven't everyone here yet?","{伊娜：}咦，人还没有到齐吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, is the uniform damaged? It's troublesome now.","{伊娜：}咦，制服有损坏了吗？这下子麻烦了耶。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, look at everyone, who is standing on the cliff over there?\n{Rael:} Carridan!\n{Karidan:} Ahahaha, the warriors of Prince Freeman really had two chances, and they were able to break through two ambushes to come here.\n{Freeman:} What does this mean?\n{Karidan:} If you can beat these dragons, I will explain further. However, I don't think you have any chance to win. Kalidan waved his hand and 8 crystal dragons rushed towards Ina.","{伊娜：}咦，大家快看，那边站在山崖上面的人是谁？\n{雷尔：}卡里丹！\n{卡里丹：}啊哈哈哈，弗里曼王子的勇士们果然有两下子，能够突破两次埋伏来到这里。\n{弗里曼：}这话是什么意思？\n{卡里丹：}如果你们能打得赢这些龙龙，我再进一步解释。不过，我想你们应该没什么机会打赢吧。\n\n卡里丹手一挥，8条水晶龙奔向了伊娜。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, look at the paper pasted on the tree over there. The half black and half white circular pattern on it seems to have been seen somewhere... I flipped through the notes... I found it, it's not Is Fengyou the symbol used by their brothers? Rael said it was called Tai Chi Tu.\n{Rael:} I can see it here too. Could it be that they have also been here, or is their training place nearby?\n{Ina:} Then maybe I can see their training? In fact, I am still quite interested in their {Teleport} spells. Even short-distance teleportation within the range of the battlefield would be very useful to me.\n{Freeman:} I'm afraid it's not that easy. Taoist practice places are generally {very hidden}, which is not easy to find.","{伊娜：}咦，你看那边树上贴着的那个纸是什么，上面的一半黑一半白的圆形图案好像在哪见过……我翻翻笔记啊……找到了，这不是风游他们师兄弟用的符号吗？雷尔说过叫太极图来着。\n{雷尔：}这里也能看到，莫非他们也来过这里，或者干脆他们的修练地就在附近？\n{伊娜：}那么也许我可以看到他们的修练？其实我对他们的{传送}法术还是挺感兴趣的。哪怕只是战场范围内的短距离传送，也会对我很有用吧。\n{弗里曼：}恐怕没那么容易吧，道士的修练地一般都{很隐蔽}，不太好找的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, really, the morale must be high for the first time, why is this?\n{Hunter:} I summarize the reason in one sentence: {All random events are pseudo-random}. Under certain conditions, pseudo-random can be transformed into non-random.\n{Ina:} It's a bit esoteric, don't understand. Anyway, I will take notes first.\n{Hunter:} For example, you can simply pay attention to {what week is every week, what month is every month}, maybe you will understand a little bit about the meaning of my words.","{伊娜：}咦，真的耶，第一次肯定士气高涨，这是为什么？\n{猎人：}原因我用一句话概括：{所有的随机事件都是伪随机}。在一定的条件下，伪随机都是可以使之转化为不随机的。\n{伊娜：}有点深奥，不明白。不管怎么说，我先笔记下来。\n{猎人：}举个例子吧，你可以简单地留意一下，{每周都是什么周，每月都是什么月}，也许你就会稍微了解一点我的话的含义了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, there are advertisements in this place too.\n{Rael:} Why, do you also want to write down the advertisement?\n{Ina:} Well, write it down, maybe it's really useful in the future.","{伊娜：}咦，这个地方居然也有广告呢。\n{雷尔：}怎么，广告你也要记下来吗？\n{伊娜：}嗯，记下来再说，没准以后真的用得着呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, there are some stone statues here.\n{Rael:} Be careful, it's an organ!\n{Ina:} Ah, the stone statue is moving!","{伊娜：}咦，这边有一些石像呢。\n{雷尔：}小心，是机关！\n{伊娜：}啊，石像动起来了！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, this pit is...\n{Rael:} Be careful, get down, everyone! A large number of magic elements shoot out from the pit, cutting the surrounding rocks and trees into regular polygons.\n{Freeman:} Is this a magic trap?\n{Ina:} It seems that we will not be able to pass without cleaning up these things.","{伊娜：}咦，这个坑是……\n{雷尔：}小心，大家趴下！\n\n大量的魔法元素从坑中射出，把周围的岩石，树木都削成了规则的多边形。\n\n{弗里曼：}这就是魔法陷阱吗？\n{伊娜：}看来不把这些东西清理掉我们是没法通过了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, what are these things? A group of fluttering...\n{Freeman:} Seems like bats? Ah no, it's a vampire...\n{Rael:} There will always be something like this in the cave, everyone is ready to fight.","{伊娜：}唉，这些是什么东西啦？扑啦扑啦的一群……\n{弗里曼：}好像是蝙蝠？啊不，是吸血鬼……\n{雷尔：}地洞里多少总会有些这样的东西，大家准备应战。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, what exactly is in this cabinet? What a golden armor. The coat of arms on A, seems to have been seen somewhere, I looked through the Ina-chan universal notebook to see...Where is it...Ah, I found it! The Silver Winged Eagle, the clan emblem of the hero Aoling more than five hundred years ago, so this armor is the golden armor worn by the hero Aoling? The people from the Black Tigers have hidden such good things here...","{伊娜：}咦，这柜子里放的到底是什么东西呢？好一件金光闪闪的铠甲。甲上的纹章，好像在哪见过，我翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本看看……在哪呢在哪呢……啊，找到了！银翼飞鹰章，五百多年前的英雄奥铃的族徽，这么说来，这件铠甲是英雄奥铃穿过的金甲？黑虎特工队的人在这里藏了这么好的东西……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, where did the \"Red Star Sword\" go? I should bring it with me...","{伊娜：}咦，“赤星剑”到哪里去了呢，应该带在身上的……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, why did you summon such a small thing.\n{Rael:} Your magic power is too low now, you only have such a little ability.\n{Ina:} Can this thing come in handy? But now there is no other way, it can only be this way. I want to work hard.","{伊娜：}咦，怎么才召唤出来这么一个小东西。\n{雷尔：}你现在魔力太低啦，只有这么点能力。\n{伊娜：}这个东西能派上用处吗？但是现在也没有别的办法了，只能这样了。我要努力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey, why is Rael missing? It's good to wait here.\n{Freeman:} He doesn't seem to be seen nearby. Ah, someone fell to the ground over there.\n{Ina:} Rael? Ah, no, people who I don't know seem to have died.\n{Freeman:} Judging from the costume, it seems to be a local aboriginal.\n{Ina:} Does this person's death have anything to do with Rael?\n{Freeman:} What's going to happen?\n{Ina:} Probably not, his eyes are very firm, I believe him, nothing will happen. Let's take a look at this slate first. The \"Fire Spirit Orb\" was inserted into the round hole on the stone slab, and the stone slab opened slowly with a mechanical sound, exposing the deep cave behind it.","{伊娜：}咦，雷尔怎么不见了？说好在这里等的。\n{弗里曼：}附近好像都没有看到他。啊，那边有个人倒在地上。\n{伊娜：}雷尔？啊，不是，不认识的人，好像已经断气了。\n{弗里曼：}从装束来看，似乎是当地的土著居民。\n{伊娜：}这个人的死，难道跟雷尔有什么关系？\n{弗里曼：}该不会出什么事吧？\n{伊娜：}应该不会，他的眼神很坚定，我相信他，不会有事的。我们还是先来看看这块石板吧。\n\n把“火灵珠”嵌入到石板上的圆孔中，石板在一阵机械声中徐徐地开启了，露出了背后深邃的山洞。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hey...\n{Rael:} What's wrong?\n{Ina:} Guess what I found. Look over there.\n{Freeman:} Ah, this is...\n{Rael:} The boat that Spien Rodrigo was in!\n{Ina:} So, he must still be inside. Let's smash the boat first so that he can't go back.\n{Freeman:} Wait...\n{Ina:} What happened to Jack?\n{Freeman:} Such a good thing, it's a pity that it's so smashed. I also want to see its structure, why it can run so fast...\n{Rael:} But we don't have time to study this now. In case if he ran away...\n{Ina:} Yes, yes, if he ran away, we would lose a lot.\n{Freeman:} That's right... Forget it, it's smashed (>_<)\n{Ina:} I'm sorry, Jack.\n{Rael:} Let me do it.\n{Ina:} After disposing of the boat, the next step is to catch turtles in the urn.\n{Rael:} But, it seems we can't get in.\n{Ina:} Well, we can't get in, and he can't escape. The conditions are equal. At least we are not at a disadvantage. Then it's {find a way to get him out}.","{伊娜：}嘿嘿……\n{雷尔：}怎么了？\n{伊娜：}你们猜我找到了什么。看那边。\n{弗里曼：}啊，这是……\n{雷尔：}斯拜恩罗德里乘坐的小艇！\n{伊娜：}所以啦，他肯定还在里面。我们先把这个小艇砸了，这样他就回不去了。\n{弗里曼：}等等……\n{伊娜：}杰克怎么了？\n{弗里曼：}这么好的东西，就这么砸了多可惜。我还想看看它的构造，为什么能跑得那么飞快……\n{雷尔：}可是我们现在没时间研究这个吧。万一要是被他跑了……\n{伊娜：}对啊对啊，他要是跑了我们就亏大了。\n{弗里曼：}话是这么说没错……算了，砸了吧(>_<)\n{伊娜：}对不住了，杰克。\n{雷尔：}我来动手。\n{伊娜：}处理掉了小艇，接下来就是瓮中捉鳖了。\n{雷尔：}不过，好像我们没法进去啊。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我们没法进去，他也没法逃走，双方条件是对等的嘛，我们至少不处于下风。然后就是{想办法引他出来}才好。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hmm... After passing through the portal, I felt a strong energy pressure.\n{Rael:} Hurry up as Salman and his son said, use magic to offset the excess energy difference. Otherwise, everyone's body will be overwhelmed.\n{Ina:} Okay, leave it to me.","{伊娜：}唔……穿过了传送门，感受到好强的一股能量压迫。\n{雷尔：}赶紧照萨尔曼父子所说，用魔法抵消掉过剩的能量差吧。不然大家的身体会吃不消的。\n{伊娜：}好，交给我吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Hmm... I see, there are also two black devices here, so I'll turn them off. ?a?aThat's it.\n{Dawu:} It really is a famous teacher who has made great disciples. With the guidance of a teacher like this, you will soon learn it. Alright, then you should take care of yourself, and I will retire first.\n{Ina:} Hey, don't you go with us?\n{Da Wu:} Don't be kidding, this lord has already been caught by those two demons once, if you are with you, next time you meet them, I will definitely not leave this lord alive again. It's better for my lord to leave this ghost place as soon as possible, otherwise there are not enough lives to pay.","{伊娜：}嗯……看到了，这边也有两个黑色的装置，那么我来关掉它。——这样就可以了吧。\n{达伍：}果然是名师出高徒。有本大人这样的老师的指点，你很快就学会了嘛。好啦，那么下面你们就自己保重吧，本大人先行告退。\n{伊娜：}唉，你不跟我们一起走啊？\n{达伍：}别开玩笑了，本大人已经被那两个魔族抓住过一次了，如果跟你们一起，下回碰到他们肯定不会再留本大人活口了。本大人还是趁早离开这鬼地方的好，要不然有几条命都不够赔的。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How about taking these little things back as pets for you? 5 red, jumping, small and cute things. All the conditions are met, right?\n{Young:} Ah, really. If you take them back, you won't be told by his elders. Thank you so much. I will go back now. The boy adjusted the bow and drew ashore. The waterway was finally unblocked.","{伊娜：}这些小东西给你拿回去作为宠物怎么样？5只红红的，会跳的，又小又可爱的东西。条件都符合吧？\n{少年：}啊，真的耶。带它们回去，就不会被他老人家说什么了。真是太感谢你了。我这就回去了。\n\n少年调过船头靠岸去了。水路终于畅通了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How about these, the shrub branches and leaves I found elsewhere are definitely not oak trees...\n{Elephant:} Go on, go on...\n{Ina:} Wow, eat well...\n{ Elephant:} Let's go, let's go...\n{Ina:} I finished eating so soon...\n{Elephant:} Huh... Life, ah no, the fastest thing in an elephant's life is to enjoy a big meal. Now I feel strong again. Tell you guys. Never trust squirrels in the future. Squirrel told me a few days ago that there are many, many delicious things here. I was fooled by him, but I ran over excitedly. After I came, I found out that there was nothing but oak trees here.\n{Freeman:} Squirrels like to eat acorns. There are indeed many delicious things for them.\n{Elephant:} Don't speak for him! Anyway, I won't believe him anymore. Next time I want to make him hungry for a few days here by himself, and see if he dare to lie to me in the future, hum... By the way, can you do another good thing to help me weigh.\n{Ina:} How do you call it? You are so big, I'm afraid there is no such big scale anywhere.\n{Elephant:} This is simple. Just do as I said. Go to the river bank over there first.\n{Ina:} Oh.\n{Elephant:} Then call a boat.\n{Ina:} How do you know that I am a magician and know how to call ship?\n{Elephant:} How could I know. But if you don't call it, I can't call it.\n{Ina:} Well, well, you are good.\n{Elephant:} Then I get to the boat first. Look at the draught of the ship, and draw a mark on the position where the water surface is immersed in the hull.\n{Ina:} It's done.\n{Elephant:} I'm down. Then you put the stones on the boat and see how many stones you put, so that the draught of the boat can reach the mark as before. So my weight is just how many stones.\n{Ina:} This method is really good. I have to write it down.\n{Freeman:} There are 78 stones in total.\n{Elephant:} What! Did you count wrong!\n{Rael:} I counted 78 yuan.\n{Elephant:} No, it's impossible...\n{Ina:} What's the matter?\n{Elephant:} I only weighed it once before coming here, and there were only 46 stones that time. How could it be possible that I have been hungry for a few days and my weight has risen without losing weight... This is really weird...\n{Ina:} I said, Mr. Elephant, I know what's going on. The stone you used last time is bigger than the stone here.\n{Elephant:} I don't care about the size of the stone. In short, my weight has increased, so there must be a problem in it.\n{Ina:} How can this be ignored, the stone is smaller, and of course the same weight is more.\n{Elephant:} But no matter what, my weight was 46 before, but now it is 78. Is that right? So my weight has increased.\n{Ina:} Forget it, in that case, there seems to be only one way to convince you.\n{Rael:} Ina, what the hell did you think of?\n{Ina:} Look at the move! little Ina is a strong binding bomb! Pop~~~~~!\n{Freeman:} The stones were glued together, and the two pieces became one piece. In this way...\n{Ina:} In this way, it is 39 yuan. Weigh it again.\n{Elephant:} Oh, it was finally right this time. My weight has dropped. Before it was 46, now it is 39. Go back and find the squirrel to make a claim. Thank you all. By the way, let me do you a favor too. Are there any difficulties?\n{Ina:} After a lot of effort, there is still something in return. Could Mr. Elephant tell us how to get to\n{Eldria}? {Elephant:} I can't take you there, I can't swim.\n{Ina:} So you know how to get there? Just tell us the route.\n{Elephant:} As long as you can find a way to {cross the station of the Red Sea Fleet from the water}, you can reach it. However, the Red Sea Fleet is very arrogant and does not allow all other ships to appear within their range of activities, so you'd better find other ways to cross the water.\n{Ina:} Yes, I understand, thank you Mr. Elephant.\n{Elephant:} Thank you too. I should go back too.","{伊娜：}这些怎么样，我去别处找来的灌木枝叶，肯定不是橡树啦……\n{大象：}吧喳吧喳……\n{伊娜：}哇，吃得好快耶……\n{大象：}吧喳吧喳……\n{伊娜：}这么快就吃完了……\n{大象：}呼呼……人生，啊不，象生最快活的事情莫过于享受大餐了。这下我又有劲了。跟你们说啊。以后千万不能相信松鼠。前几天松鼠跟我说，这里有很多很多好吃的东西，我上了他的当，结果就兴冲冲地跑来了，来了之后才发现，这里除了橡树，什么都没有。\n{弗里曼：}松鼠喜欢吃橡子，这里对他们来说确实是有很多好吃的没错呀。\n{大象：}你不要替他说话！反正我是不会再相信他了。下次我要让他自己到这里来饿上几天，看他以后还敢不敢骗我，哼哼……对了，你们能不能再做件好事，帮我称称体重。\n{伊娜：}怎么称法呀？你这么大，恐怕哪儿也没有这么大的秤吧。\n{大象：}这个简单。你们照我说的做就好了。先到那边的河岸边去。\n{伊娜：}哦。\n{大象：}然后召一只船。\n{伊娜：}你怎么知道我是魔法师，会用召船术啊？\n{大象：}我怎么可能知道。但是你不召还能我召不成，我又不会。\n{伊娜：}唔，好吧，算你厉害。\n{大象：}然后我先到船上去。你们看船的吃水多少，在水面浸到船体的位置画一个记号。\n{伊娜：}画好了。\n{大象：}我下来啦。然后你们把石头放到船上，看放多少颗石头，船的吃水能跟刚才一样到记号那边。那么我的体重就是多少颗石头了。\n{伊娜：}这个办法真好。我得记下来。\n{弗里曼：}一共是78块石头。\n{大象：}什么！你有没有数错！\n{雷尔：}我数了也是78块。\n{大象：}不，不可能……\n{伊娜：}怎么回事？\n{大象：}我来这儿之前才称过一次的，那回只有46颗石头啊。怎么可能饿了几天，体重不降反而上升了呢……这个实在是太奇怪了……\n{伊娜：}我说啊，大象先生，我知道是怎么回事了。你前一次称用的石头，比这里的石头大吧。\n{大象：}石头大小我不管，总之我的体重是上升了，这里面就一定有问题。\n{伊娜：}这怎么能不管呢，石头小了，当然同样的重量块数就多了啊。\n{大象：}可是不管怎么样，我之前体重是46颗，而现在是78颗，这没错吧？所以我的体重是增加了。\n{伊娜：}算了，既然这样，看来只有一个办法叫你信服了。\n{雷尔：}伊娜你又想到什么鬼主意了？\n{伊娜：}看招！伊娜酱强力粘合弹！啪~~~~~！\n{弗里曼：}石头粘起来了，两块变成了一块，这样一来……\n{伊娜：}这样一来就是39块了。再称一次吧。\n{大象：}哦，这次总算是对了，我的体重下降了，之前是46颗，现在是39颗了。回去找松鼠索赔去。谢谢你们了。对了，我也帮你们一个忙吧，有什么困难没有？\n{伊娜：}费了好大劲，总算还有所回报。大象先生能不能告诉我们怎么才能到达{埃尔德里亚}？\n{大象：}我不能带你们去，我不会游泳。\n{伊娜：}这么说你知道怎么去？告诉我们路线就行。\n{大象：}你们只要能想办法{从水上穿过赤海舰队的驻地}，就可以到达了。不过，赤海舰队很嚣张的，不允许一切其他船只出现在他们的活动范围之内，所以你们最好想其他办法渡水。\n{伊娜：}是这样啊，明白了，谢谢大象先生。\n{大象：}也谢谢你们啦。我也该回去了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How can there be a resident here?\n{Ghost:} This is what King Jaya deployed. His minions are stationed here, but he doesn't seem to be there.","{伊娜：}这边怎么会有驻地？\n{鬼魂：}这就是查亚大王布设的，他的爪牙驻守在这里，不过他本人好像不在。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How come there are soldiers here? And it's not like a soldier in the Kingdom of Kartia. Soldiers used to pass through our village when they went to fight bandits. I have seen that the military uniforms of the Kingdom of Kartia are not like this.\n{Rael:} Then which country's military uniform is this?\n{Ina:} I don't know either. It would be strange for foreign soldiers to come here.\n{Soldiers:} Who are you two? What are you doing here?\n{Ina:} I should ask you, who are you and why are you here? We are just passersby.\n{Soldiers:} Lao Tzu is a soldier in {Balland Kingdom}. If you are civilians, ask Lao Tzu to search your luggage, and you can let you go there without any dangerous items.\n{Ina:} Why? You are not from our country, so why should you be searched?\n{Soldiers:} Our country has declared war on Kartia! At present, this area has been controlled by our army, so in order to prevent Kartia soldiers from passing by, all must be searched.\n{Ina:} What, declare war, what does this mean?\n{Rael:} is the state where one country declares war against another country. In other words, your country and the Kingdom of Barland are now at war.\n{Ina:} Oh, that's it, remember it in Ina-chan's universal notebook...\n{Soldier:} Okay, don't be wordy, bring your backpack. ... Hey, there is still some money in the bag.\n{Ina:} Hey, money is not a dangerous thing, why did you take my wallet, and I brought it to you, what shall we eat for dinner? give me back!\n{Soldiers:} I care if you have food and what to do, you are just the people of the enemy country and the target of our plunder. I'm polite if I didn't want your life, and still want to pay you back?\n{Ina:} No, you are a big bad guy. If you don't return my wallet, I would be welcome.","{伊娜：}这里怎么会有士兵？而且不像是卡尔提亚王国的士兵啊。以前有士兵去打山贼时经过我们村，我见过的，卡尔提亚王国的军装不是这个样子的。\n{雷尔：}那么这是哪国的军装？\n{伊娜：}我也不知道。外国的士兵来到这里本来就很奇怪吧。\n{士兵：}你们2个是什么人？在这里干什么？\n{伊娜：}该我问你才对，你是什么人，为什么出现在这里？我们只是路人。\n{士兵：}老子是{巴兰德王国}的军人。你们如果是平民，让老子搜查一下行李，没有带危险物品才可以放你们过去。\n{伊娜：}凭什么啊？你又不是我们国家的人，为什么要给你搜查？\n{士兵：}我国已经向卡尔提亚宣战了！目前这一带已经被我国的军队控制，所以为了防止有卡尔提亚的军人混过去，必须对所有人进行搜查。\n{伊娜：}什么，宣战，这是什么意思？\n{雷尔：}就是一个国家对另一个国家宣布发动战争的状态。也就是说，你们国家和巴兰德王国现在处于战争中。\n{伊娜：}哦，是这样，记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上……\n{士兵：}好了别罗嗦了，背包拿来。……嘿嘿，原来包里还是有点钱的。\n{伊娜：}喂，钱不是危险物品吧，干嘛拿走我的钱包，给你拿去了我们晚饭吃什么呀。还给我！\n{士兵：}老子管你们有没有饭吃干什么，你们只是敌国的百姓，是我们掠夺的目标。没要你们的命就算客气了，还想要还你钱？\n{伊娜：}不行，你是大大的坏人，如果你不还我钱包，我可要不客气了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How did these iron sheets move...\n{Freeman:} It looks like a mechanism.\n{Rael:} Since there is a mechanism, it means that we are on the right path.","{伊娜：}这些铁皮怎么动起来了……\n{弗里曼：}看上去像是机关吧。\n{雷尔：}既然有机关，说明我们走对路了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} How far is it to Solandria?\n{Freeman:} I'm afraid there is still a lot of voyage.\n{Ina:} I think we are at a loss. We went by boat. In order to avoid the islands and reefs, we had to go around and take such a tortuous route, but the female devil could fly, so she could pass directly. In this way, we are even more unlikely to catch up with her.\n{Freeman:} In other words, it is very likely that we can't stop her from handing the \"Fire Orb\" to Holia. Then the demons will look for the clues of the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" in Solandria. Once they find it, they are likely to immediately get rid of Horia and retrieve the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".\n{Ina:} So what should we do?\n{Freeman:} Anyway, you can't go wrong with Solandria. We still have two ways to stop the demon's plan. One is to find Horia first and find a way to make him give up the deal with the Demon, or simply obtain the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" from him; the other is to find the clue of the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" before the Demon.\n{Ina:} Hmm, I wrote it down, so which of these two methods should we use?\n{Freeman:} I am afraid we still have no way to be sure. Only after Solandria, let's see how the situation changes according to circumstances. I tend to find a way to control the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" first, because according to previous demons' conversations, this thing is the key to obtaining the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\". If the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is controlled, the Demon Race cannot take it away even if it finds the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\".","{伊娜：}到索兰德里亚还有多远呢？\n{弗里曼：}恐怕还有不少航程。\n{伊娜：}我觉得我们很亏啊。我们乘船去，为了躲避岛礁要左绕右绕，走了那么曲折的路线，可是那个女恶魔会飞的，直接就能过去了。这样一来我们更加不可能追得上她啦。\n{弗里曼：}也就是说，很有可能我们没法阻止她把“火灵珠”交给霍利亚了。然后魔族就会在索兰德里亚寻找“龙牙冠”的线索，一旦找到，他们很可能就会立即除掉霍利亚，取回“火灵珠”。\n{伊娜：}那么我们该怎么办呢？\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，前往索兰德里亚是不会错的。我们还有两个办法阻止魔族的计划。一个是先找到霍利亚，想办法让他放弃跟魔族的交易，或者干脆从他手中取得“火灵珠”；还有一个办法就是先于魔族找到“龙牙冠”的线索。\n{伊娜：}嗯嗯，我记下来了，那么这两个办法中，我们应该采用哪一个呢？\n{弗里曼：}现在我们恐怕还没有办法确定。只有等到了索兰德里亚之后，再看情况随机应变吧。我倾向于先想办法控制“火灵珠”，因为根据之前魔族的谈话，这个东西是取得“龙牙冠”的关键。如果把“火灵珠”控制住，魔族即使找到了“龙牙冠”也无法取走。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} However, although I wanted to find the hero's helmet, I didn't have a clue at all. There are no clues at all.\n{Rael:} Have you discovered this problem now...\n{Freeman:} We have passed through the red sand plains, and finally there is a muddy ground.\n{Ina:} Well, then there should be people living in front, we can find some people to ask.","{伊娜：}不过，虽然说想找那个英雄的头盔，可是完全没有头绪啊。一点线索都没有。\n{雷尔：}你现在才发现这个问题吗……\n{弗里曼：}我们已经穿过赤砂原了，终于有泥地了。\n{伊娜：}嗯，那么前面也应该有人居住吧，我们可以找些人问问看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh... finally docked. Those navies are also really difficult. Okay, let's start thinking of a way to find the prime minister, Holia.","{伊娜：}呼……总算靠岸了。那些海军也真是难缠啊。好了，下面开始想办法去找那个宰相霍利亚吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh? Are there enough people? Let's go back and look for...","{伊娜：}咦？人数不足了吗？我们再回去找找看……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh? Is this the sound of a walkie-talkie? Radia?\n{Radia:} Ina, can you hear me?\n{Ina:} Can you hear it, this thing is really easy to use.\n{Radia:} I got the news of \"Dragon Armor\". Solo placed him on {Huangyan Island}. However, due to his strong barriers, I have no way to obtain \"Dragon Armor\".\n{Ina:} Where is that {Huangyan Island}? I will go over to see if there is any way.\n{Radia:} It's on the west side of {Qingyunling}, {passing through an underground plain}, you can reach it.","{伊娜：}唉？这是对讲机的声音？拉迪亚？\n{拉迪亚：}伊娜，听到吗？\n{伊娜：}能听到呢，这东西真好用。\n{拉迪亚：}我得到“龙甲”的消息了。索罗把他放置在了{黄岩岛}上。不过由于他设置了很强的结界，我没有办法取得“龙甲”。\n{伊娜：}那个{黄岩岛}在哪里？我过去看看有没有什么办法。\n{拉迪亚：}就在{青云岭的西边}，{穿过一片地下平原}后就能到达。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh? The uncle sitting on the stump is so familiar.\n{Uncle:} little Ina! Why are you here?\n{Ina:} It turned out to be Uncle John. Why have you never returned to the village? I'm waiting to help you move the goods. I have waited for several days and I haven't seen you back.\n{Uncle John:} Oh, don't mention it. I was entering the cargo and planning to return to the village. I didn't know where to kill a group of Baland soldiers. They could not help but snatch my cargo along with the carriage. I had trouble with my legs and feet, so I had to ask you for help when moving the goods. Now they took my car away, and they didn't leave me any money. How can I go back?\n{Rael:} As expected, the Barland army is like robbers, just like the ones we encountered before.\n{Uncle John:} So you guys also met, have you robbed anything? Who is this brother again?\n{Ina:} We met quite a few Barland troops, but I drove them away. This is Rael, who came from a long distance. He came here to find something called \"Dragon King Divine Power\", so I helped him find it together. Uncle John often goes to Cartia to buy goods. He should be knowledgeable. Do you know what this is?\n{Uncle John:} Never heard of it at all, sorry for not being able to help.\n{Ina:} It's okay. Let's continue to inquire about it ourselves. The uncle's legs are not good, so let's escort the uncle back now.\n{Uncle John:} No, no, since you still have things, how can I delay you. I walked slowly by myself, and it took two more days at most.\n{Raier:} Since the uncle has bad legs and feet, he walked too reluctantly. When I hurt my leg, I fully realized the pain of not being able to walk. It's better to rent a carriage to take the uncle back to the village.\n{Ina:} Yes. There is a car just over there. Hey--! Mr. Coachman over there--!\n{The coachman:} Come here! Where is the guest officer going?\n{Ina:} How much does it cost to send this uncle to Ellar Village?\n{The coachman:} Ailar Village, 1500 gold coins. However, the road to the village of Ainar here has to pass through an area controlled by the Baland forces, which is too dangerous. Don't let me go there anymore.\n{Ina:} Uncle John's legs are not good, and he can't go back so far by himself, otherwise we don't want to ask Mr. Coachman for help. I also know that Mr. Coachman is embarrassed, but now there is no other way. I beg you Mr. Coachman. I double the car money and give you 3000 gold coins, okay?\n{The coachman:} It's not awkward... Well, in this case, I can't refuse for the sake of money. My car was fairly fast, so I took a detour to avoid the forces of the Barland army, and there should still be a way to reach the village of Ainar.\n{Ina:} Thank you Mr. Coachman.\n{Uncle John:} little Ina, thank you so much. Uncle will pay you back the car next time.\n{Ina:} No, uncle, uncle has suffered heavy losses after so many goods have been stolen, how can I ask uncle to return the car. I just help the uncle share some losses.","{伊娜：}唉？这树桩上坐着的大叔好面熟。\n{大叔：}伊娜酱！你怎么来这里了？\n{伊娜：}原来是约翰大叔啊。你怎么一直都没回村呢？我等着帮你搬货物等了好几天了也不见你回去。\n{约翰大叔：}唉，别提了，我正进了货物打算回村，不知从哪里杀出来一帮巴兰德军，不由分说把我的货物连同马车一并抢走了。我本来就腿脚不灵便，所以搬货物才要请你帮忙的，这下他们把我的车都抢走了，而且一点钱都没留给我，我怎么回去啊。\n{雷尔：}巴兰德军果然都是跟强盗一般，就跟我们之前遇到的那些一个样。\n{约翰大叔：}原来你们也遇到了啊，有没被抢掉东西？这位兄弟又是？\n{伊娜：}我们遇到了不少巴兰德军，不过都被我打跑了。这位是雷尔，是从很远的地方来的，他来这里是为了要找一样叫做“龙王神力”的东西，所以我帮他一起找。约翰大叔经常去卡尔提亚城进货，应该见多识广，知不知道这是什么呢？\n{约翰大叔：}完全没有听说过，抱歉帮不上忙。\n{伊娜：}没关系。我们自己继续打听好了。大叔腿脚不好，这会儿我们还是先护送大叔回去吧。\n{约翰大叔：}不用不用，你们既然还有事情，我怎么好耽误你们。我自己慢慢走，最多多花两天时间而已。\n{雷尔：}大叔既然腿脚不好，自己走太勉强了。我腿伤了的时候充分体会到不好走路的痛处。不如租辆马车送大叔回村去吧。\n{伊娜：}对。正好那边就有辆。喂——！那边的车夫先生——！\n{车夫：}来喽！请问客官要去哪？\n{伊娜：}送这位大叔到艾拉尔村，要多少钱？\n{车夫：}艾拉尔村啊，1500金币。不过，这边到艾拉尔村的路上要经过被巴兰德军控制的地区，怕是太危险啊。还是不要让我去那里了吧。\n{伊娜：}约翰大叔腿脚不好，这么远的路自己走不回去，要不然我们也不想请车夫先生帮忙的。我也知道车夫先生为难，不过现在也没别的办法，算我恳求您了车夫先生。我加一倍车钱，给您3000金币，好不好？\n{车夫：}这使不得啊……唉，既然这样，看在钱的份上，我也不好推辞了。我的车还算快，我就绕点路，避开巴兰德军的势力，应该还是有办法到达艾拉尔村的。\n{伊娜：}谢谢车夫先生了。\n{约翰大叔：}伊娜酱，太感谢你了，下回大叔会把这车钱还你的。\n{伊娜：}不用啦大叔，大叔那么多货物被抢走了已经损失惨重，我怎么能再要大叔还车钱。我只是帮大叔分担点损失而已。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh? What does the couplet written next to this mean?\n{Freeman:} Let me see... a good sentence. The red pupil was silver-haired, and the blood demon flew into the sky. Purple wings and black shirt, dreams of butterflies and dances reflect the sky.\n{Mengying:} This is the prophecy left by the altar master in front of Tianchi Mountain. Although no one understands the meaning. It is said that this prophecy describes the law of a young girl who changed the world by her own wishes sometime in the future.\n{Ina:} It's amazing! Can a person's wish be so strong?\n{Mengying:} Of course, everyone's wish can become extremely powerful, as long as he has hope.","{伊娜：}唉？这旁边写的一副联，是什么意思呢？\n{弗里曼：}我看看……好句啊。\n\n赤瞳银发，血魔翩飞灼空际。\n紫翼黑衫，梦蝶恋舞映天霄。\n\n{梦影：}这是天池山前代坛主留下的预言呢。虽然没有人明白其中的含义。据说这则预言，是描述了以后某个时间里，一位少女靠着自己的心愿改变了世界的法则。\n{伊娜：}太了不起了！一个人的心愿，可以这么强大吗？\n{梦影：}当然可以，每个人的心愿都可以变得无比强大，只要他拥有希望。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Huh? Where did Roland go?","{伊娜：}咦？罗兰上哪儿去了？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I can't get in without a membership card or guest card.","{伊娜：}没有会员证或嘉宾证看来进不去呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I can't stand the cold anymore, so let's do it later.","{伊娜：}实在冻得受不了了，还是以后再来吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I can't stand you anymore. Give this to you.\n{Youth:} Ah, cloak, gloves, really, wearing these two, I will have a full detective appearance.\n{Ina:} Then...\n{Youth:} Then I can finish investigating the murder. In fact, I've been doing it well before.\n{Ina:} How can there be any murder? Who was killed?\n{Youth:} Look, isn't there a body of the dead over there?\n{Ina:} That, it seems to be just the body of a statue...\n{Youth:} That must be the illusion caused by the murderer who petrified the dead in order to cover people's eyes. The murderer was extremely cruel. Not only did he mutilate the victim, cut off his head, hands and feet, so that we could not identify the identity of the deceased, and even petrified the deceased to confuse us.\n{Ina:} Then why is there only one body, where are the other parts of the body?\n{Youth:} There are wolf footprints nearby. The other part must have been taken away by the wolf. From this point of view, the wolf is also a plan arranged by the murderer to destroy evidence.\n{Ina:} What does the wolf want the stone statue for?\n{Youth:} Apparently the wolf took away the head, hands and feet of the corpse before the victim was petrified. In the end, there was only one body, and the murderer could not deal with it, so he could only petrify it and disguise it as a statue.\n{Ina:} What is the petrochemical method?\n{Youth:} Medusa's eyes.\n{Ina:} Medusa wants to petrify people, and needs people to see her. Once there was a fairy dragon who blinded her eyes in order to deal with Medusa, and then petrification was completely useless to him. If you are blind and won't be petrified, how can a body without a head be petrified?\n{Youth:} This, let me think about it...\n{Ina:} There is another very important point that you have overlooked. Look at the neck of this statue.\n{Youth:} Any clues?\n{Ina:} If it was decapitated, there should be a part of the neck that is connected to the body, right? But for this statue, this position of the neck is sunken. Whether it is a knife or an axe, it can't be done like this, right?\n{Youth:} So how can it be done?\n{Ina:} If this is part of an assembled statue, it would be easy to explain. So, the murder is just your wishful thinking, it's just a statue at all.\n{Youth:} But, if there is no murder, how can I be a detective?\n{Ina:} There is one thing you don't put the cart before the horse. A detective is a profession that solves cases, punishes the murderer, and reduces crime. You can't hope to have a case without a case, just like a doctor wants others to get sick. This is against professional ethics. If this is not clear, blindly obsessed with detective novels, it is easy to get confused. There have been such cases. Someone was obsessed with detective novels and imitated the plot, but instead of becoming a detective, he became a criminal.\n{Youth:} I see! I will definitely not become that kind of person! Today's lesson is deeply in my heart, and I won't do such a foolish thing in the future. I am leaving, bye!\n{Ina:} I slipped so fast. I hope he can really learn his lesson and stop messing around. Well, this statue actually looks pretty good, it's a pity to be abandoned here, it's better to put it away.","{伊娜：}真是受不了你了，这个给你吧。\n{青年：}啊，披风，手套，真的啊，穿戴上这两样，我就有了十足的侦探模样了。\n{伊娜：}然后呢……\n{青年：}然后我就可以把这个杀人事件调查完啦。其实我之前已经进行得八九不离十了。\n{伊娜：}哪有什么杀人事件呢？谁被杀了？\n{青年：}你看，那边不是有死者的躯体吗？\n{伊娜：}那个，好像只是个雕像的躯体吧……\n{青年：}那一定是凶手为了掩人耳目，将死者石化，给我们造成的错觉。凶手极其残忍，不但将被害人肢解，砍去了脑袋和手脚，让我们无法辨认死者的身份，甚至还将死者石化来迷惑我们。\n{伊娜：}那为什么只有一个躯体，尸体的其他部分到哪里去了呢？\n{青年：}附近有狼的脚印。其他部分一定是被狼叼走了。由此看来，狼也是凶手安排好的销毁证据的计划。\n{伊娜：}狼要石像做什么？\n{青年：}显然狼是在被害人被石化前，就把尸体的头和手脚都叼走了啊。最后只剩下一个躯体，凶手没法处理，只能将其石化，伪装成雕像。\n{伊娜：}石化的方法是什么？\n{青年：}美杜莎的眼睛。\n{伊娜：}美杜莎要把人石化，需要人看到她。曾经有一只仙女龙，为了对付美杜莎，自己弄瞎了双眼，然后石化就对他完全无效了。既然瞎掉了不会被石化，那么完全没有头部的躯体，又怎么会被石化呢？\n{青年：}这个，我再想想……\n{伊娜：}还有很重要的一点你忽视了哦。你看这个雕像的的颈部。\n{青年：}有什么线索吗？\n{伊娜：}如果是被斩首的，应该会留有一部分与躯体相连的半截颈部吧？可是这个雕像呢，颈的这个位置是凹陷下去的，不管是刀子还是斧头，都做不到这样吧？\n{青年：}那么怎么才能做到？\n{伊娜：}如果这是一个组装雕像的一部分，那就很好解释了啊。所以说啦，什么杀人事件，只是你一厢情愿的假想而已，这根本只是一个雕像而已嘛。\n{青年：}可是，如果没有杀人事件，我怎么当侦探啊？\n{伊娜：}有一点你不要本末倒置哦。侦探，是侦破案件，惩罚凶手，减少犯罪的职业。你不能没有案件时希望出案件，就像医生希望别人多生病那样，这是违背职业道德的。如果这一点不弄清楚，一味地迷信侦探小说，很容易走火入魔。曾经就有这样的例子，有人因为痴迷侦探小说，模仿其中的情节，结果没成为侦探，反而成了罪犯。\n{青年：}我明白了！我一定不会成为那样的人！今天的教训我深刻铭记在心，以后不会干这样的傻事了。我走了，再见！\n{伊娜：}溜得好快。希望他真的可以吸取教训不再乱来就好了。嗯，这个雕像其实看上去不错啦，废弃在这里挺可惜的，不如收起来好了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I defeated you, Chinu.\n{Chinu:} Well, to the effect, I admit that I underestimated the enemy and didn't bring the most elite troops... Hmph, just do it if you want to kill me.\n{Ina:} I still want to ask you something, why did you attack the stargazing dwellings, and also said that you can attack any human country on land. What does this mean?\n{Chinu:} You know a lot. Our boss has a great plan in progress. The looting of resources before is just to build the altar. But this is only part of the plan. In the future, our goal will never be limited to one or two kingdoms, perhaps the entire continent of Mirronia, or even larger. I will never tell you these things.\n{Ina:} What a big ambition... But what exactly is the purpose of the sacrifice?\n{Chinu:} I won't tell you. Lord Solo needs to wake up a treasure that has been in the dust for many years, and for this, I need to sacrifice a large number of top-quality living sacrifices, so I searched for the sacrifices everywhere. The power of that treasure is enough to destroy... While speaking, a lightning bolt suddenly struck Qi Nu in the middle. Qi Nu was immediately knocked to the ground. A demon girl with wings appeared in the air.\n{Demon Woman:} Damn Chinu, if you lose, you should apologize to Lord Solo with death, and what you are doing so much. If you don't deal with you, you are afraid that there will be a mole on Lord Solo's ass. I have to tell them.\n{Chinu:} No...Ladia...I can't say anything...\n{Ina:} Who are you? He seems to be a member of the Demon Race, do you want to fight us?\n{Radia:} No, I will go back now. In order to slash this big mouth, I have used up the magic value. I will fight with you next time. If you can live to meet next time... Devil Girl One Fly away when you flap your wings.\n{Ina:} I escaped, I can fly, but forget it, let's save Roland first, at least we already know where he is.\n{Chinu:} There is one more thing... I will never... tell you... On the way to the \"dark cage\"...... My most elite... Xiaolong troop... has been stationed in... ...There is...you...absolutely...can't beat...Chinu let out his breath after saying this.","{伊娜：}打败你了，齐努。\n{齐努：}唔，大意了，我承认我有点轻敌，没把最精锐的部队带来……哼，你们要杀我就动手好了。\n{伊娜：}我还想问你话呢，你为什么要去攻击观星居，而且还说什么可以袭击陆地上任何一个人类国家，这到底是什么意思？\n{齐努：}你知道得不少嘛。我们老大有一项伟大的计划正在实施中，之前劫掠资源都只是为了建造祭坛。不过这只是计划的一部分而已。将来我们的目标绝不会局限于一两个王国，也许是整个米尔罗尼亚大陆，甚至更大。这些事情，我是绝对不会告诉你的。\n{伊娜：}好大的野心……不过祭祀又具体是干什么用的呢？\n{齐努：}我才不会告诉你呢。索罗大人需要唤醒一件尘封多年的宝物，为此需要祭上大量极品的活祭，所以我才四处搜捕祭品。那件宝物的力量足以毁灭……\n\n说话间，突然间一道闪电从空中劈下，正中齐努。齐努立即被击倒在地。一个长着双翼的恶魔女子出现在空中。\n{恶魔女子：}该死的齐努，输了就该向索罗大人以死谢罪，还罗嗦那么多干什么，再不把你处理掉，你只怕连索罗大人屁股上什么位置长了颗痣都要告诉他们了。\n{齐努：}不……拉迪亚……我什么都不会说的……\n{伊娜：}你是谁？看起来也是魔族的人，想跟我们交手吗？\n{拉迪亚：}不，我这就回去了，为了劈这个大嘴巴，我已经把魔法值用光了，下次再跟你们交手，如果你们能活到下次见面的话……\n\n恶魔女子一拍翅膀就飞远了。\n\n{伊娜：}逃了啊，会飞的真赖皮，不过算了，现在我们还是先去救罗兰吧，至少已经知道他在哪了。\n{齐努：}还有一件事情……我绝对不会……告诉你们……在通向“漆黑的牢笼”……的路上……我最精锐的……枭龙部队……已经驻守在……那里了……你们……绝对……打不过的……\n\n齐努说完这些就咽了气。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I don't know where this mountain road leads, but I always think I should go. But it's too cold. No sable clothes or lighters are good, Jack, can you do anything about it?\n{Freeman:} Uh, let me think about it... I seem to remember that I learned a chemical method before to keep warm, but I don't remember it very clearly. It seems that I still need materials...\n{Ina:} What is needed ?\n{Freeman:} It takes charcoal, saltpeter, and sulfur to make it work.\n{Ina:} It's easy to talk, I have these materials.\n{Freeman:} Then I will try, I hope I remember nothing wrong... Boom~~~~! After the explosion, everyone present became dark.\n{Freeman:} Sorry, I still remember a bit wrong as expected, now I want to come, this is the formula of black powder... Are you okay? Fortunately, the dose is not large.\n{Ina:} Uh...It's miserable, but it's really not that cold...","{伊娜：}这条山路不知通向哪里的，但我总觉得应该去一趟。可是太冷了啦，什么黑貂皮衣，什么打火机，都不顶用啦，杰克，你有没有什么办法？\n{弗里曼：}呃，我想想……似乎记得以前我是学到过一种化学方法，可以取暖的，不过记得不是很清楚了，好像还需要材料……\n{伊娜：}需要什么？\n{弗里曼：}要有木炭，硝石，硫磺，才能做得起来。\n{伊娜：}好说好说，这些材料我有带的。\n{弗里曼：}那么我来试试啦，希望我没记错什么……\n\n轰~~~~！爆炸声过后，在场的所有人都变得黑乎乎的。\n\n{弗里曼：}对不起，我果然还是有些记错，现在想来，这是黑火药的配方……大家没事吧？还好剂量不大。\n{伊娜：}呜……好惨耶，不过确实不怎么冷了……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I finally got rid of Gals. I didn't expect that he was the right envoy of the queen's palace. This guy is much more powerful than expected...\n{Freeman:} The force is far more than a squadron, and Gals is clearly magical. There is too much discrepancy with the information the queen gave us.\n{Ina:} And the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" is not in his hands. Ugh? This is...\n{Rael:} The response of the detector has become stronger!\n{Ina:} So, the \"Longan Ring\" should be in this direction. Go, let's find it.","{伊娜：}总算干掉了加尔斯，真没想到，他就是那个女王的殿前右使。这家伙比预计的厉害得多啊……\n{弗里曼：}兵力远不止一个中队，而且加尔斯明明是会魔法的。跟女王给我们的情报出入太大了。\n{伊娜：}而且“龙眼指环”也并不在他手里。唉？这是……\n{雷尔：}探测仪的反应变强了！\n{伊娜：}这么说，“龙眼指环”应该在这个方向才对。走，我们去找找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I finally won. It turns out that Pegasus still has this ability. It takes 12 mana for me to cast lightning. If it's only 10 o'clock, it really can't be released.\n{Rael:} So, if you want to fight various troops or monsters, you need to fully understand the opponent's {stricks}. There are also many creatures with all kinds of strange abilities.\n{Ina:} I want to learn, and I must remember these, so as to help Rael rejuvenate the country. I will work hard.","{伊娜：}总算赢了，原来飞马还有这种能力，让我施放闪电需要消耗12点魔法值。如果只有10点的话还真的放不出来。\n{雷尔：}所以，想要和各种各样的军队或者怪物交手，还需要充分了解到对方的{特技}。还有不少生物拥有各式各样奇怪的本领呢。\n{伊娜：}我要学习，一定要好好记住这些，这样才能帮助雷尔复兴国家。我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I found you, your name is Chinu, isn't it? Where is Roland? Let him go soon.\n{Chinu:} Huh? It's not easy for humans to come here. Roland is the angel I caught? I'm sorry I haven't asked his name yet. He is not here now, I put him in {\"black cage\"}. He is an important sacrifice, how can he let it go?\n{Ina:} What? Sacrifice?\n{Chinu:} Our boss wants to engage in an important ceremony that requires some advanced creatures as a living sacrifice. I happened to encounter an angel on the road, so I caught him. As a sacrifice, angels should be effective. And ordinary people like you, we still look down on it. I can't tell you these things.\n{Ina:} Too much. Who is your boss?\n{Chinu:} Our boss is the evil prince Solo of the Demon Realm, so I won't tell you.\n{Ina:} Uh, don't tell me to pull it down, I wrote it down anyway. So where is that \"dark cage\"? I'm going to save Roland.\n{Chinu:} I can't tell you this, it's at the end of a snowy field that the passage behind me reaches}. Moreover, I will not let you pass from here.\n{Ina:} Even if you don't stop me, I want to give you a few shots, you are really bad. Grandpa said, never be merciful to bad guys. If you want to stop me, you are even more asking for it.\n{Chinu:} Haha, the tone is not small. I know that if you can get here, you must have defeated many of my men, but I am afraid that you have not seen my most elite Xiaolong troops.","{伊娜：}找到你了，你叫齐努是吧？罗兰在哪里？快把他放了。\n{齐努：}嗯？有人类闯到这里来了，不简单嘛。罗兰是我抓的那个天使？不好意思我还没问过他的名字。他现在可不在我这儿啊，我把他关到{“漆黑的牢笼”}里去了。他是件重要的祭品，怎么能放了呢？\n{伊娜：}什么？祭品？\n{齐努：}我们老大要搞一个重要的仪式，需要一些高级生物作为活祭，我碰巧路上遇到个天使，就把他抓了。天使作为祭品，效果应该不错。而像你们这等普通人，我们还看不上呢。这些事情，我可不能告诉你。\n{伊娜：}太过份了。你的老大是谁啊？\n{齐努：}我们老大是魔界的邪亲王索罗大人，我才不会告诉你呢。\n{伊娜：}呃，不告诉我拉倒，反正我记下来了。那么那个“漆黑的牢笼”到底在哪里？我要去救罗兰。\n{齐努：}这个也不能告诉你，就在{我后面的通道所到达的一片雪原的尽头}。而且，我可不会让你们从这里通过。\n{伊娜：}你就算不拦我，我也想抽你几下，你实在是坏透了。爷爷说过，对坏蛋绝不能手软。你要拦我就更加是自找了。\n{齐努：}哈哈，口气不小。我知道你能闯得到这里一定是打败了很多我的手下，不过，我最精锐的枭龙部队，恐怕你还没见识过吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I know this question. Panjiao Qu four is a dead move. The spot of the eye is here.\n{Lecturer:} This lady was the first to answer correctly. This is the prize: an imitation of Long Xiangtian's chess bowl. Although it is an imitation, it is produced and sold in limited quantities by our Chess Academy. The bottom of the bowl has the stamp of our Sifang Chess Academy. It is a rare souvenir. I wish you a better chess skill, Miss.","{伊娜：}这个题我知道。盘角曲四是死棋。点眼的位置就在这里。\n{讲师：}这位小姐第一个答对。这是奖品：龙翔天的棋碗——的仿制品。虽然是仿制品，不过这是我们棋院限量制作发售的，碗底有我们四方棋院的铸印，是件不可多得的纪念品哦。祝愿小姐棋艺更上一层楼。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I ran westward so much in one breath.\n{Freeman:} This almost crosses the Kingdom of Terracia.\n{Ina:} Look, the detector is responding.\n{Rael:} The faint light, it seems that we are still in the right place, at least we are approaching the \"Dragon Shield\".","{伊娜：}一口气向西奔袭了这么多。\n{弗里曼：}这几乎是横穿了泰拉西亚王国了。\n{伊娜：}看，探测仪有反应了。\n{雷尔：}微弱的亮光，看来我们还是走对地方了，至少是在靠近“龙盾”。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I really don't have the collection you want.\n{Curator:} You didn't show it to me, how do you know if I want it or not?","{伊娜：}我真的没有你想要的藏品啦。\n{馆长：}你都没拿出来给我看，怎么知道我想不想要呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I searched it all over, but there was no one.\n{Rael:} But there is a two-way door in the corner here.\n{Ina:} The two-way door in the underground library of Archbishop Yingluck, shall we go in?\n{Freeman:} Go, even if I have the last hope, I will try my best to find it.","{伊娜：}找遍了，一个人都没有。\n{雷尔：}可是这边角落里有一个双向门。\n{伊娜：}英拉大主教的地下书库里的双向门，我们进去吗？\n{弗里曼：}走，哪怕最后一点希望，我也要尽力去找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I see, the spherical thing, is this the \"Eternal Sphere\"...","{伊娜：}看到了，球形的东西，这个是不是就是“永恒之球”呢……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I think of a way, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}我再想想办法，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I walked so deep and still didn't see a single person. Should we go further in?\n{Rael:} Did you pay attention to the street sign just now?\n{Ina:} The street sign says \"No one is hiding in this tunnel\"...\n{Rael:} So it must be someone, otherwise who wrote those words.\n{Ina:} Makes sense. Then move on.","{伊娜：}走进这么深了，还是没有看到一个人。我们要不要再往里走呢？\n{雷尔：}你注意刚才的路牌了吗？\n{伊娜：}路牌上写着“没有人躲在这个地道里”……\n{雷尔：}所以肯定是有人的，不然那些字是谁写的呢。\n{伊娜：}有道理。那么继续向前。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I was chased all the way, it was really hard. Although those troops are not our opponents yet. But if I really want to kill Intasia like this, I can't imagine it. I'm hungry. Take a break first-huh? No, another team came in front.\n{Freeman:} Wait, this team doesn't seem to be here for a fight. It's unarmed. The leader seems to be a civilian.\n{Ina:} So that's it, huh, breathe a sigh of relief, I'm so nervous.","{伊娜：}一路过来都在被追打，真是吃力。虽然那些军队还不是我们的对手。不过如果真要这么杀到因塔西亚去，真是不敢想像。我肚子都饿啦。休息一下先——唉？不行，前面又来了一队人马。\n{弗里曼：}等下，这队人好像不是来打架的，没带武装，带头的人似乎是个文官。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样啊，呼，松一口气，我紧张死了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I was chased by things flying around all the way. It was really choking...\n{Rael:} Beware of the front, there is more!\n{Ina:} Ah, what is this...\n{Freeman:} Bone Dragon!\n{Ina:} Gulong? I don't read martial arts novels...\n{Freeman:} The bone dragon is not a natural creature, but a monster created by an evil wizard. Its strength is much stronger than what we have encountered before... {Ina: }Really, ahaha, but now I can't escape it...","{伊娜：}一路上到处都被飞来飞去的东西追杀，真是够呛了……\n{雷尔：}当心前面，还有！\n{伊娜：}啊，这是什么东西……\n{弗里曼：}骨龙！\n{伊娜：}古龙？我不看武侠小说的啦……\n{弗里曼：}骨龙不是自然的生物，是邪恶的法师制造出来的怪物，它的实力可比我们以前碰到的东西强多了……\n{伊娜：}是吗，啊哈哈，可是现在好像逃不掉了耶……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I will pay you back, let me look for it again.","{伊娜：}我会还你的，让我再找找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I won, so tired, and sure enough the number of enemies is hard to deal with.\n{Rael:} It's amazing to let you win. I never thought that you could still fight in this way.\n{Ina:} Am I good? Ahaha, I'm a little embarrassed to be praised... Let's hurry up and see the person caught. ?a?aAre you okay with this adult? First tie it loose...\n{Man:} Thank you for saving me. But don't call me an adult, call me F... ah, no, just call me Jack.\n{Ina:} But I heard from the guys in Barland just now, you are a big man.\n{Jack:} They got it wrong, I'm just a little officer. I was accidentally caught by them while performing a task.\n{Rael:} Since he is an officer, is Mr. Jack trying to prevent the Baland army from attacking?\n{Jack:} I think so, but there seems to be no good strategy at the moment.\n{Ina:} Wait, wait, Ina's all-purpose notebook is here. Let us sort out the information we have so far. First, Nanling Pass has been conquered by the enemy; second, the enemy seems to have a very capable man named General Krant; third, the enemy does not seem to be very united, and likes to win credit for themselves instead of Fight the enemy together; fourth, the people I defeated just now belonged to the 9th squad; fifth, there was an enemy army that climbed the snow-capped mountains and got here. From this information, what can we get?\n{Jack:} The number of troops who came here over the snow-capped mountains will not be too many, and the same is true from what I have learned. It would be great if there could be an army to wipe out this group of pioneers...\n{Ina:} Then we will attack the command of this enemy army, as long as the command is killed, they just think of self-conscious Qiubai. We will be messed up.\n{Rael:} Good fellow, you are getting bolder and bolder, Ina. How do you find the enemy's headquarters?\n{Ina:} Search hard, you can always find it.\n{Rael:} What if there are more enemy troops on the way?\n{Ina:} I think about it, there will always be a way, and I will work hard.","{伊娜：}赢了，好累，果然敌人数量一多就不好对付了。\n{雷尔：}居然让你胜了，好厉害，我从来没有想过你还能采用这种方式进行战斗。\n{伊娜：}我很厉害吗？啊哈哈，被夸得有点不好意思……还是赶紧去看看被抓住的那个人吧。——这位大人您没事吧？先把绑给松了……\n{男子：}谢谢你救了我。不过不要管我叫大人，管我叫弗……啊，不，管我叫杰克就可以了。\n{伊娜：}可是刚才听巴兰德的家伙们说，你是个大人物唉。\n{杰克：}他们搞错了吧，我只是个小军官而已。在执行任务时不小心被他们抓了。\n{雷尔：}既然是军官，那么杰克先生是不是要阻止巴兰德军攻过来呢？\n{杰克：}想是这么想，不过好像目前并没有什么良策。\n{伊娜：}等等等等，伊娜酱的万能笔记本来了。让我们把目前得到的情报整理一下。\n第一，南岭关已经被敌军攻克了；\n第二，敌军好像有一个叫克兰特将军的人很能干；\n第三，敌军好像并不很团结，喜欢为自己争功劳，而不是齐心对敌；\n第四，刚才我打败的那些人属于第9小队；\n第五，有一支敌军是翻过雪山深入到这里的。\n从这些情报来看，我们能得到些什么？\n{杰克：}翻过雪山来到这里的那支部队人数不会太多，从我了解到的情况也是如此。如果能有一支军队把这批先头部队消灭掉就好了……\n{伊娜：}那么我们去袭击这支敌军的指挥部，只要把指挥干掉了，他们这些只想着自顾自的丘八们一定会乱的。\n{雷尔：}好家伙，你越来越大胆了啊，伊娜。你怎么找到敌人的指挥部？\n{伊娜：}使劲找，总能找到的。\n{雷尔：}如果途中遇到更多的敌军呢？\n{伊娜：}我想想，总会有办法的，我会努力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'll save him.\n{Rael:} Hey, you are crazy, the other party is 15 people, how do you deal with it?\n{Ina:} I know that hard work is not their opponent, but will I stand stupidly with them? As long as I am a little faster, even a little bit, I can avoid being besieged by many people, and I have a chance of winning.","{伊娜：}我去救他。\n{雷尔：}喂，你疯了，对方是15个人，你怎么对付？\n{伊娜：}我知道硬拼不是他们的对手，但是我会傻呆呆地站着跟他们硬拼吗？我只要速度上快一点点，哪怕是一点点也可以，就可以避免被多人围攻，就有胜算了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'll try again if there is any other summoning technique available.","{伊娜：}我再来试试还有没有别的召唤术可以用。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'm already close to Kartia city, so I can't see the Barland army in this area.\n{Rael:} Then the team of soldiers who passed by just now is the Karti runner-up?\n{Ina:} Well, our soldiers in Kartia will not steal money from civilians.\n{Rael:} It seems that the Karti runner-up can still defend this area, so the Barland army cannot be seen. Let's go to Kartia City. One is to understand the situation of the war, and the other is to ask if anyone knows the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\".","{伊娜：}已经靠近卡尔提亚城了，这一带看不到巴兰德军了嘛。\n{雷尔：}那么刚才过去的那队士兵是卡尔提亚军吗？\n{伊娜：}嗯，我们卡尔提亚的军人可不会抢平民的钱。\n{雷尔：}看来这一带卡尔提亚军还能守住，所以见不到巴兰德军。我们快去卡尔提亚城吧。一来了解下战争的情况，二来问问有没有知道“龙王神力”的人。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'm back! Both the thief and the pig were brought. {Chief Security Officer:} Great, it helped us a lot. Black hair, you take this guy to the courtroom. Go and return this pig to the informant.\n{Education:} Yes. {Chief Security Officer:} Then if you have anything you need to ask, just talk about it.\n{Ina:} We want to ask about the evil prince Solo. {Chief Security Officer:} That guy...\n{Ina:} What's the matter, is there anything inconvenient to say? {Chief Security Officer:} Nothing. The last time that guy came to us for a sensational speech, he took away several of our strong men and made us nervous now. Feeling very upset with him. What exactly do you want to know?\n{Ina:} I want to ask two things. One is that he has gotten some incredible treasures, and the other is that he seems to have gotten 2 parts of \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\". Where are these 2 parts. {Chief Security Officer:} I really don't know what he got. very sorry. Although we did hear that he was doing some treasures, it seems that no one in our area knows the truth.\n{Ina:} You don't know either... {Chief Security Officer:} However, I heard a little clue about the parts of \"Dragon King Divine Power\". One of them, the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\", was fished out of the sea by his adminal {Spain Rodri} some time ago. This guy went to {Bataan City} in {west} two days ago, which was a stronghold of Solo. Maybe it's still there now. I don't know the other thing.\n{Ina:} So how do I get to Bataan from here? {Chief Security Officer:} From here, head south to the beach, and then take a boat to the west. But...\n{Ina:} But? {Chief Security Officer:} The road will pass through areas where sea monsters are infested. It is the season of sea monster activities, which is very dangerous. Business travelers who usually take this route usually wait for the sea monster's hibernation season to pass. Of course, there will be brave people who take the risk to force a breakthrough, or want to try their luck and just can't hit the sea monster, but the general result is that there is no return. If you want to go, I will not stop you, good luck.\n{Ina:} Thank you, Mr. Chief Security Officer, you have also helped me a lot.","{伊娜：}我回来了！窃贼和猪都带来了。\n{安防长：}太好了，帮了我们大忙了。黑毛，你把这家伙带去审判室。这只猪就去还给报案人吧。\n{差役：}是。\n{安防长：}那么你们有什么需要问的，就只管说吧。\n{伊娜：}我们想问问关于邪亲王索罗。\n{安防长：}那个家伙啊……\n{伊娜：}怎么了，有什么不方便说的吗？\n{安防长：}没什么。那个家伙上次来我们这里搞煽情演说，拉走了我们好几个壮丁，弄得我们现在人手紧张。对他感觉很不爽。你具体想知道哪些？\n{伊娜：}我想问2件事，一个是他得到了什么了不得的宝物，还有一个是他似乎得到了2件“龙王神力”的部件，这2件部件在哪里。\n{安防长：}他得到了什么东西我还真不知道。很抱歉。虽然我们也确实听闻他有在搞什么宝物，但是似乎我们这一带的人没人知道真相。\n{伊娜：}你们也不知道啊……\n{安防长：}不过，关于“龙王神力”的部件，我倒是听到一点线索。其中的一件，“龙牙项链”，是他手下的海军上将{斯拜恩罗德里}前些时候从海里捞出来的。这家伙前两天去了{西边}的{巴塔安城}，那是索罗的一个据点。现在说不定还在那儿。另一件我也不清楚了。\n{伊娜：}那么从这里去巴塔安城该怎么走呢？\n{安防长：}从这里向南到海边，然后坐船向西就可以到。不过……\n{伊娜：}不过？\n{安防长：}路上会经过海怪出没的区域。现在正是海怪活动的季节，很危险。平时走这条路的商旅一般会等海怪冬眠的季节过去的。当然，也会有勇敢的人冒险去强行突破，或者想碰运气正好撞不到海怪，不过一般结果都是有去无回。如果你要去，我也不会阻拦你，祝你好运。\n{伊娜：}谢谢安防长先生，您也帮了我大忙了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'm looking for it, where is the anti-magic chain?","{伊娜：}我找找，抗魔链在哪里呢？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'm looking for it, where is the anti-magic cloak?","{伊娜：}我找找，抗魔披风在哪里呢？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} I'm sorry to disturb you. Excuse me, in which direction is the pier? We want to go to sea...\n{Assembler:} Little girl, are you a foreigner? Now is the day of tribute, no one can go to the sea.\n{Ina:} Huh? why? What is the tribute day?\n{Convener:} This is the annual tribute to {Sea Dragon King}, in order to pray for good weather in the coming year...\n{Ina:} Ah, that's how it is. But why should we prohibit going to sea?\n{Assembler:} Because the tribute will be carried by a boat to be dedicated to the Sea Dragon King, and then the Sea Dragon King will be swept into the bottom of the sea with a big wave. If you go to sea, you will definitely die.\n{Ina:} But it's okay, I'm a magician and can handle it.\n{Assembler:} Okay, don't make any trouble. We are still busy preparing. If time is lost, the year will be over. At this time, a little boy next to him secretly pulled Raina's clothes corner.\n{Boy:} Sister Magician, come here.","{伊娜：}对不起打扰一下，请问，码头在哪个方向？我们想出海……\n{集会者：}小姑娘，你是外地人吧？现在是贡礼日，任何人不得出海。\n{伊娜：}唉？为什么？贡礼日又是什么？\n{集会者：}这是一年一度向{海龙王}上贡的日子，为了祈求来年风调雨顺……\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是这样啊。可是，为什么要禁止出海呢？\n{集会者：}因为贡礼要用船载了去献给海龙王，然后被海龙王用大浪卷入海底。你要是出海的话必死无疑。\n{伊娜：}不过没关系耶，我是魔法师，可以应付的。\n{集会者：}好了你别添乱了，我们还忙着准备呢，要是耽误了时间，这一年可就完蛋了。\n\n这时，旁边一个小男孩偷偷地拉拉伊娜的衣角。\n\n{男孩：}魔法师姐姐，你过来一下。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} If this piece of ice can be removed, it will be able to pass through here, and there will be no need to detour from a distance.\n{Rael:} This is simple, leave it to me, I can just break it up.\n{Ina:} Rael be careful!\n{Rael:} Ouch, the ice is so hard, it looks like it is some years old, but it won't move.\n{Ina:} Let's think of another way. For example, grill it on fire to melt it.\n{Rael:} Don't mess around, if you use fire magic here, the ship will be burned.\n{Ina:} Magic really cannot be used, and setting fireballs on the ship is too dangerous. However, the \"lighter\" given by the previous uncle can still be used. This flame is small and easy to control, and will not ignite to the side.\n{Rael:} Can such a small flame melt such a large ice floe?\n{Freeman:} Don't melt everything, just a little bit on the side. The ice floe gets stuck here because its width is a little bit larger than the passage here. As long as his width is reduced a little, he can be carried away by the water smoothly.\n{Ina:} Jack is so good, I thought about it...\n{Freeman:} Didn't you expect it? I thought you thought the same as me.\n{Ina:} I just wanted to eliminate it all...\n{Freeman:} If it is all eliminated, maybe ten days and twenty days may not be enough, and the fuel for this lighter will not last for that long.\n{Ina:} I didn't expect it to take so long... Fortunately, Jack came up with a good idea. Now he only needs to melt the stuck point on the side.","{伊娜：}要是能把这块浮冰去除掉的话，这里就能通行了，不用再从远处绕道了呢。\n{雷尔：}这个简单，交给我，我把它劈碎就可以了。\n{伊娜：}雷尔小心！\n{雷尔：}哎哟，好硬的冰，看起来有些年头了，居然砍它不动。\n{伊娜：}还是想别的办法吧。比如用火烤一下，让它融化掉。\n{雷尔：}别乱来啊，如果你在这里用火系魔法，船会被烧掉的。\n{伊娜：}魔法确实不能使用，船上放火球什么的都太危险了。不过，之前的那位大爷给的这个“打火机”，还是可以使用的哦。这个火苗小而且容易控制，不会点燃到旁边。\n{雷尔：}这么小的火苗，能融化这么大的浮冰吗？\n{弗里曼：}不用融化全部，只要边上一点就可以了。浮冰会卡在这里是因为它的宽度比这里的通道大了那么一点点。只要让他的宽度削减一点，就能顺利地被水流带走了。\n{伊娜：}杰克好厉害，这都想到了……\n{弗里曼：}你没想到吗？我还以为你也是跟我一样想的。\n{伊娜：}我本来只是想把它全部化掉……\n{弗里曼：}全部化掉的话，也许十天二十天都不一定够，而且这个打火机的燃料也支持不了那么久。\n{伊娜：}原来要这么久啊，真没想到……幸亏杰克出了好主意，这下只要把边上卡住的那一点融化掉就可以啦。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} In order to deal with that Captain Rudd, I have to try the summoning technique in this book.","{伊娜：}为了对付那个鲁德大队长，我得试试这书上的召唤术了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} In order to make this city more prosperous, I also come to invest in the city.","{伊娜：}为了让这座城市更加繁荣，我也来为城市投资吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} In this way, we already have 6 parts of \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\".\n{Radia:} I know where the remaining three are.\n{Ina:} Huh? Good efficiency...\n{Radia:} The \"Longan Ring\" is in the hands of the {jeweler Lee Kidd Family} in Solandria. The \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" and \"Dragon Armor\" had already been obtained by Solo's men first. I suggest you to find \"Longan Ring\" first. As for the other two items, I will first find a way to find out the details, and then consider how to capture them.\n{Ina:} Doesn't Radia act with us?\n{Ladia:} It is more convenient for me to sneak into the demon world alone, but it is better to act separately.\n{Ina:} That's right, then let's go to Solandria again. Where is the man named Li Qide in Solandria?\n{Freeman:} The Richide family, speaking of it, they also have a little reputation in Mirronia. Many of the decorations in the Kartia Palace were bought from them. If I remember correctly, their family should live in {Belemtania Autonomous Prefecture in the south of Solandria}.\n{Radia:} That's right. However, the Berentania Autonomous Prefecture has relatively strict security. If you go directly, you may be stopped by the guards at the checkpoint. You pretend to be merchants, saying that you are going to do business with the Li Qide family, and then show this letter of introduction to the guards, and they will let you go.\n{Ina:} Hey, what is this letter of introduction?\n{Radia:} Of course it was forged. In fact, Solo's men were planning to use this method to get in, so they made some fake letters of introduction, and I stole one.\n{Ina:} Solo's men...\n{Ladia:} Of course, they are also desperately looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\", so you have to hurry up, don't let them get ahead.","{伊娜：}这样一来，我们已经有6件“龙王神力”的部件了。\n{拉迪亚：}剩下的三件，我也知道在哪里。\n{伊娜：}啊？好效率哦……\n{拉迪亚：}“龙眼戒”在索兰德里亚的{珠宝商李奇德家族}手中。而“龙牙项链”和“龙甲”已经先被索罗的手下得到了。我建议你们先去找“龙眼戒”。至于另两件，我先去想办法摸清底细，然后再考虑如何夺过来。\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚不跟我们一起行动吗？\n{拉迪亚：}我单独行动潜入魔界比较方便，还是分头行动的好。\n{伊娜：}说得也是呢，那么我们就再去一趟索兰德里亚吧。那个叫李奇德的人，在索兰德里亚的哪里呢？\n{弗里曼：}李奇德家族啊，说起来，他们在米尔罗尼亚也是有一点名气的。卡尔提亚王宫里的不少装饰品就是找他们买的。如果我没记错的话，他们家族应该是住在{索兰德里亚南部的贝伦塔尼亚自治州}。\n{拉迪亚：}没错。不过，贝伦塔尼亚自治州的警备比较严，你们直接去恐怕会被关卡的守卫拦住。你们装成商人，说是去找李奇德家族做生意的，然后向守卫出示这个介绍信，他们就会放你们过去。\n{伊娜：}咦，这个介绍信是？\n{拉迪亚：}当然是伪造的了。其实索罗的手下正打算用这个办法混进去，所以制作了一些假的介绍信，我就偷了一封出来。\n{伊娜：}索罗的手下……\n{拉迪亚：}当然，他们也在拼命找“龙王神力”，所以你们要赶快了，别让他们抢先。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Inside this hole, it's a bit narrow.\n{Freeman:} It doesn't look big.\n{Rael:} But still be careful.\n{Ina:} Beware of the ambushes of the demons? Those two fool's men probably haven't found this hole yet.\n{Rael:} I think the thing to be careful is that this fellow Radia, don't rush out like the last time, almost killed by me as an enemy.","{伊娜：}这洞里面，有点狭窄呢。\n{弗里曼：}看起来并不大。\n{雷尔：}不过还是要小心。\n{伊娜：}小心魔族的伏兵吗？那两个傻瓜的部下们应该还没发现这个洞吧。\n{雷尔：}我觉得，要小心的是拉迪亚这家伙，别再像上次那样冷不丁地杀出来，差点被我当成敌人干掉。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is Black Rock Island this place?\n{Karidan:} That's right.\n{Ina:} But I didn't see the shadow of the demons...\n{Karidan:} Their camp is {not far in front}. I didn't see it better, maybe I was taking a nap now, and I caught them off guard.","{伊娜：}黑岩岛就是这个地方吗？\n{卡里丹：}没错。\n{伊娜：}可是并没有看到魔族的影子啊……\n{卡里丹：}他们的营帐就在{前面不远}的地方。没看到更好，也许现在正在睡午觉呢，打他们个措手不及。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is Lord Lederman here?\n{Lederman:} It's Ina, what's the matter? Could it be a mountain climbing and fall again?\n{Ina:} It wasn't because of Ron that kid that I fell last time. How could I fall because of my agility. This time I want to ask Uncle Lederman to help heal this gentleman's leg injury.\n{Lederman:} Yo, this guy is not from our village. Inachan, you are not bad, where can you come to such a handsome guy?\n{Ina:} Uncle, don't make people happy, he died while driving a boat alone and was found by me by the sea. Because of the leg injury, you have come to the uncle.\n{Lederman:} Come, lie down on the bed here, let me see your legs. Oh, the wound is bad, and the wound is infected. Fortunately, I came in time, I am afraid I will have to amputate a few hours later. ?a?aHowever, the injury is still too serious. I can only deal with it briefly now and keep his leg. If he wants to quickly regain his mobility, he needs {green heart grass}. Otherwise, he has to lie in bed for at least three months.\n{Ina:} What is Green Heart? Well, quickly take out the little Ina universal notebook to write down.\n{Lederman:} This is a herbal medicine that grows on {Ellar Mountain}, which is quite effective in treating trauma. It's a pity that I'm too old to climb the mountain anymore. When I was young, I used to go to the mountains to pick them.\n{Ina:} Then leave it to me, and I will go to the mountain to gather green grass for you.\n{Lederman:} Although I am sorry to trouble Ina Chan, but now it is not too late, I have to trouble you to take a trip. I'm sorry.\n{Ina:} What did the uncle say, I trouble you, uncle. I'm going now. ?a?aWell, you must record everything frequently, so that you don't get lost. Record the tasks to be done in the \"{Adventure Log}\" chapter of Inachan's Universal Notebook. You can check what you need to do at any time in the future. Up.","{伊娜：}莱德曼大爷在吗？\n{莱德曼：}是伊娜酱啊，有什么事吗？该不会又是爬山摔伤了吧？\n{伊娜：}上次还不是为了罗恩那个小鬼才摔伤的，我自己身手这么敏捷怎么可能摔了嘛。这次是想请莱德曼大爷帮医治这位先生的腿伤。\n{莱德曼：}哟，这位小伙不是我们村的人，伊娜酱你不错嘛，上哪去傍来这么帅的小伙？\n{伊娜：}大爷别拿人家开心啦，他一个人驾船遇难了，在海边被我发现的。因为腿受了伤，所以找大爷您来了。\n{莱德曼：}来，到这边床上躺着，让我看看你的腿。哟，伤得好重，而且伤口已经感染了。还好来得及时，再晚几个时辰来恐怕就只能截肢了。——不过，伤得还是太重了，我现在只能简单处理下，保住他这条腿，如果要很快让他恢复行动能力，还需要有{绿心草}才行。要不然，他至少得在床上躺三个月。\n{伊娜：}绿心草是什么？嗯，赶紧拿出伊娜酱万能笔记本来记。\n{莱德曼：}这是一种生长在{艾拉尔山}的草药，治疗外伤相当有效。可惜我年纪大了，上不动山了。以前年轻时我经常去山上采的。\n{伊娜：}那么这件事交给我吧，我去山上给您采来绿心草。\n{莱德曼：}虽然不好意思麻烦伊娜酱，不过现在事不宜迟，还是只好麻烦你跑一趟了。真是对不住。\n{伊娜：}大爷说哪里话，是我麻烦大爷您呢。我这就去了。——嗯，凡事都要勤记录，这样才不会丢三落四，把要做的任务记录到伊娜酱万能笔记本的《{冒险日志}》一章里好了，以后就可以随时查看自己需要做什么了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is the \"Red Sea Fleet\" the so many warships that have just passed by? It's spectacular...\n{Rael:} This guy Solo is amazing, there is actually a fleet of this size.\n{Freeman:} But, it's a bit strange. Why do the styles of those boats look familiar?\n{Ina:} Jack has seen the fleet of the demon world before?\n{Freeman:} How could it be possible, I'm here for the first time like you.\n{Rael:} So is the style of the ship the same?\n{Freeman:} Yes, this style is very similar to a flying shear sailboat. The prototype hull developed by our Royal Navy in Kartia in recent years should not have been mass-produced, let alone equipped with a large number of fleets. Since all aspects of the flying scissor sailing boats are much better than the Galenian sailing boats that are popular nowadays, we have always regarded it as Kartia's top secret and strictly blocked the news.\n{Rael:} No wonder the Red Sea Fleet has the ability to completely control this sea area. It turns out that the performance of the ships has an overwhelming advantage...\n{Freeman:} This area seems to be the area of influence of the Red Sea Fleet. Let us be careful. Action, try not to reveal whereabouts. Our goal is to find Spien Rodri to obtain the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\", not to go to war with his large fleet.","{伊娜：}刚才经过的那么多战舰，就是“赤海舰队”吗？好壮观……\n{雷尔：}索罗这家伙了不得，居然还有这样规模的舰队。\n{弗里曼：}可是，有点奇怪。 为什么那些船的式样，看起来很眼熟呢。\n{伊娜：}杰克以前也看过魔界的舰队？\n{弗里曼：}怎么可能啊，我跟你一样是第一次来。\n{雷尔：}那么就是船只的式样相同？\n{弗里曼：}是的，这个式样，很像是飞剪式帆船。我们卡尔提亚的皇家海军近年开发出来的试作型船体，应该还没有量产过，更不可能大批装备到舰队。由于飞剪式帆船的各方面性能尤其是速度比现在普遍流行的盖伦式帆船好得多，所以我们一直当作卡尔提亚的最高机密，严格封锁消息的。\n{雷尔：}难怪赤海舰队可以有能力完全控制这片海域，原来是船只性能占据了压倒性优势……\n{弗里曼：}这一带看起来都是赤海舰队的势力范围，我们小心行动，尽量不要暴露行踪。我们的目的是找到斯拜恩罗德里取得“龙牙项链”，而不是跟他的大型舰队开战。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is the tomb below this cave?\n{Rael:} Ina, don't you think it's weird? How could there be a passage in the mausoleum?\n{Ina:} Yes, the tomb should be closed.\n{Rael:} This passage looks like it was dug by a tomb robber.\n{Ina:} What is tomb robbery?\n{Rael:} is the act of stealing treasures or cultural relics from the mausoleum.\n{Ina:} Ah, this is dangerous. Will the Eternal Orb have been stolen?\n{Rael:} Anyway, let's go down and have a look before talking.","{伊娜：}这个地洞下面就是墓室了吗？\n{雷尔：}伊娜，你不觉得奇怪吗？陵墓怎么可能会留有通道呢？\n{伊娜：}是哦，陵墓应该是封闭的。\n{雷尔：}这个通道看起来像是盗墓的人挖的。\n{伊娜：}什么是盗墓？\n{雷尔：}就是偷窃陵墓中的财宝或文物的行为。\n{伊娜：}啊，这可危险了，永恒之球会不会已经被偷走了？\n{雷尔：}不管怎么说，我们先下去看看再说吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is there a light on top, is there an exit?\n{Freeman:} It's not like an exit, it's too small, maybe it's a vent.\n{Ina:} Anyway, we can go out to get our breath.","{伊娜：}上边有光亮，出口吗？\n{弗里曼：}不像是出口，太小了，也许是个通风孔。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，我们可以出去透下气也好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is there any way to find the deep entrance of the altar? Why don't we find them separately?\n{Rael:} It's too dangerous to separate. None of us knows what organs or traps are in this huge altar.\n{Radia:} I have something that I might use. I let out an \"observing eye\" and let it find a way. However, the inconvenience is that it has no positioning function. If it is found, we don’t know how to notify us. We can’t sit here and wait for it to report back...\n{Freeman:} If it is in your \"eye of observation\" \"How about a probe and a transmitter on it?\" So that we can receive the information it sends back at any time. I will make these devices.\n{Ina:} Great. Sure enough, as long as everyone works together, there will always be a way.","{伊娜：}有什么办法找到祭坛深处的入口吗？要不大家分头去找？\n{雷尔：}分开太危险了，我们谁都不知道这个巨大的祭坛里有些什么机关或陷阱。\n{拉迪亚：}我有个东西也许可以用一下。我放出一个“观察之眼”，让它去寻找通路。不过，不方便的是，它没有定位功能，如果找到了，不知该如何通知我们，我们也不可能一直坐在这里等它回来汇报……\n{弗里曼：}要是在你的“观察之眼”上面装上探头和发信器怎么样？这样我们就能随时收到它传回的情报了。我会制作这些装置。\n{伊娜：}太好了。果然，只要大家齐心协力，总会有办法的呢。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this Mag Udia? Really barren land.\n{Rael:} It looks like a place like this {no magic well} is not good for Ina, right?\n{Freeman:} It's not just here. If you want to go to other places in the future, you must make reasonable arrangements for the use of mana, because it is difficult to expect to be supplemented in unknown places.","{伊娜：}这里就是玛格乌迪亚吗？真是不毛之地。\n{雷尔：}看起来这样的地方恐怕{不会有魔井}，对伊娜不太有利吧。\n{弗里曼：}不止是这里呢，以后如果要去其他地方远征，魔法值的使用都要作好合理的安排才好，因为未知的地方很难指望能得到补充。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this ancient building just the temple of mirrors? The back part looks very solemn, but the door is a bit weird.","{伊娜：}这个古老的大建筑，是不是就是镜之神殿啊？后面的部分看上去挺庄严的，就是门有点儿古怪。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this place the \"Qingyunling\" that Radia calls it? Although it is said that the \"Blue Thunder Ring\" is probably in this area, how should we find it, and it is not like the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" that can use the detector...\n{Raier:} Is your intuition not working now?\n{Ina:} My instinct... OK, just follow me.\n{Rael:} Do you really have to rely on intuition?\n{Freeman:} I think it's right to go here. You see there is an empty ship over there. It seems to be the same ship that Vidor took when he set off from the port of Eldria. It should be evidence that Vidor passed by here. So we are right here too.\n{Rael:} Phew... You two are working together again...","{伊娜：}这个地方，莫非就是拉迪亚所说的“青云岭”吗？虽然说“青雷环”很可能就是在这一带，不过我们该怎么找呢，又不像“龙王神力”那样可以使用探测仪……\n{雷尔：}你的直觉，现在不灵了吗？\n{伊娜：}我的直觉啊……那好，你们就跟我来吧。\n{雷尔：}还真的要凭直觉啊？\n{弗里曼：}我觉得往这里走没错呢。你们看那边还有一只空船，跟维多从埃尔德里亚的港口出发时乘的船好像是同一只，应该是维多经过这里的证据。所以我们走这边也是没错的。\n{雷尔：}呼……你们两个又配合起来了……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this place the Akasabara? Sure enough, it's like this name...","{伊娜：}这个地方就是赤砂原吗？果然就像这名字一样……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this the entrance to the \"Pool of All Souls\"? Hmm...how it feels so strange, like someone's magic enchantment. The surrounding scenery is different, I can’t tell if it's the real scenery or the illusion...","{伊娜：}这边就是“万灵池”的入口吗？唔……怎么感觉好奇怪，像是谁的魔法结界一般。周围的景色也不一样了，分不清是真景还是幻景……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this the garden of truth that those stinky guards say? Well, it's opening hours now, let's go in and have a look.","{伊娜：}这就是那些臭门卫说的真理之园吗？嗯，现在正是开放时间，我们进去看看吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this the so-called Windward Mountain?\n{Freeman:} The wind is heading, and the waterway is narrow, there is no room for the boat to turn, and there is no way to use the adjustable sail to advance to the broken line.\n{Ina:} So it's called Windward Mountain? Let me take a look at the mountain in front... Hey, that, take a look, take a look!\n{Rael:} What a big building...\n{Freeman:} The white building in the shape of an altar should be what they call the Altar of Wind. It's a pity that we can't get closer to see.\n{Rael:} Is that guy named Spindler in there now?\n{Ina:} I don't know, I hope we are not late yet.","{伊娜：}所谓的迎风山，就是这里吗？\n{弗里曼：}正顶风啊，而且水道狭窄，船只根本没有旋回的空间，没有办法利用调节帆向折线前进。\n{伊娜：}所以就叫迎风山吗？我看看前面的山上……咦，那个，快看快看！\n{雷尔：}好大一个建筑……\n{弗里曼：}那个祭坛形状的白色建筑，应该就是他们所说的风神坛吧。可惜我们没法靠得更近一些去看。\n{雷尔：}那个叫斯拜恩罗德里的家伙，现在正在里面吗？\n{伊娜：}不知道耶，希望我们还没有来晚。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Is this the village chief's house? Is the village head here?\n{Village Chief:} I am the village head. Who is the guest?\n{Ina:} I am a friend of Axue's from outside, and I want to see her again.\n{Village Chief:} Alright, Axue is in the room inside. Ina walked into the room and saw a young girl sitting by the bed crying.\n{Ina:} Are you, Axue?\n{Axue:} Are you? ...\n{Ina:} I am Ina. I heard that they are going to offer you as a tribute to the Sea Dragon King, is that right?\n{Axue:} Hmm... {Ina:} What do you think? Just let them throw you into the sea?\n{Axue:} I'm afraid... but I can't help it. And it was my father who sent me here.\n{Ina:} So it is. I have seen your father, and he seems to be eager to exchange you for money.\n{Axue:} Mom can't bear me. However, this is the rule of the whole village, and my mother can't help it. I can only blame myself for being a girl.\n{Ina:} How can I say that, I am a girl too. I can still become a very powerful magician... well, it's the future tense. In short, I basically understand. Then, I will go to the Sea Dragon King instead of you, and I will talk to the village chief.\n{Axue:} Huh? How can this work, no matter how useless I am, I can't let you die for me...\n{Ina:} Don't worry, I won't die. I'm great. I'm going to talk to the Sea Dragon King and tell him not to do such damaging things in the future. If he doesn't listen, I will knock him down, so that he won't cause you any more trouble in the future.","{伊娜：}请问村长家是这里吗？村长在吗？\n{村长：}我是村长。请问客人是？\n{伊娜：}我是阿雪的一个外地朋友，想再见一下她。\n{村长：}也好，阿雪在里面房间里。\n\n伊娜走进房间，看到一个坐在床边哭泣的少女。\n\n{伊娜：}你是，阿雪？\n{阿雪：}你是？……\n{伊娜：}我是伊娜。我听说了他们要把你作为贡礼献给海龙王，是这样吗？\n{阿雪：}嗯……\n{伊娜：}你怎么想？就这样让他们把你扔进海里？\n{阿雪：}我怕……可是我没有办法。而且是爸爸把我送来的。\n{伊娜：}也是啊。我见过你父亲了，他看上去巴不得把你换钱呢。\n{阿雪：}妈妈舍不得我。可是，这是全村的规定，妈妈也没有办法。要怪只能怪自己是个女孩。\n{伊娜：}怎么能这么说呢，我也是女孩呀。我还是可以成为很厉害的魔法师……嗯，是将来时啦。总之，我基本上明白了，那么，我代替你去见海龙王吧，我去跟村长说说。\n{阿雪：}啊？这怎么行，我再怎么没用，也不能让你替我去死啊……\n{伊娜：}放心啦，我不会死的。我很厉害的哦。我要去找海龙王说说，让他以后不要干这种伤天害理的事了。要是他不听，我就打倒他，总之让他以后不会再给你们添麻烦。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Isn't Thunder Mountain right here? Look, the huge circle hanging there...\n{Voice:} Don't think about the idea of \"Blue Thunder Ring\"!\n{Ina:} Who are you?\n{Voice:} We are the patron saint of ancient artifacts. If this \"blue thunder ring\" falls into the hands of ambitious people, it will bring huge disasters to the world. Our duty is to defend it and obliterate all those who try to take it away.\n{Ina:} So there is a patron saint, then I can rest assured, with you, Solo won't get it so easily. I don't have to fight for this thing anymore. Let's go, goodbye...\n{Voice:} Don't want to run away! watch out!\n{Ina:} Hello! I have said that I don't want the \"Blue Thunder Ring\", why are you still attacking me...\n{Voice:} Anyone who has seen the \"Blue Thunder Ring\" must be wiped out!\n{Ina:} You are unreasonable!\n{Voice:} We have been given such a mission from the time we were created. We only know that we will carry it out firmly, and there is no room for accommodation.\n{Ina:} There is no way, in this case, I have to knock you down for my own life. Of course, I can only take the \"Blue Thunder Ring\", because after you are defeated by me, it will lose its protection, and it will be easily taken away by Solo's men.","{伊娜：}雷神峰是不是就是这里啊。看，挂在那里的巨大的圈圈……\n{声音：}休想打“青雷环”的主意！\n{伊娜：}你们是谁？\n{声音：}我们是上古神器的守护神。这件“青雷环”如果落入野心者的手中会给世界带来巨大的灾难，我们的职责就是保卫它，抹杀一切企图夺走它的人。\n{伊娜：}原来有守护神啊，那我就放心了，有你们在，索罗不会那么容易得到它了吧。我也没有必要来争抢这件东西了。我们走啦，再见……\n{声音：}休想逃走！看招！\n{伊娜：}喂！我都说了我不想要“青雷环”了，你们怎么还攻击我……\n{声音：}凡是见过“青雷环”的人，都必须抹杀！\n{伊娜：}你们不讲理啊！\n{声音：}我们从被创造出来之时起就被赋予了这样的使命，我们只知道坚定地执行，没有半点通融的余地。\n{伊娜：}没办法了，既然这样，我为了自己活命，只有把你们打倒了。当然“青雷环”我也只能拿走了，因为你们被我打倒后，它就失去保护了，会很容易被索罗的部下拿走吧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Isn't that general good?\n{Freeman:} It was originally a position that was bought with money, and it was not a general that was based on real talents and learning. Moreover, his IQ is not very good, and he always leaks things that his boss told him not to leak.\n{Ina:} Yes, and he also said, which general was not promoted by money. No wonder the combat effectiveness of Solandria's army is so poor, it turns out that these characters are acting as the command of the army.\n{Freeman:} Alas, a huge greed ruined a country.\n{Ina:} Did Jack think of Kartia again?\n{Freeman:} Well, I will definitely prevent such people from appearing in the ruling and the opposition in the future.\n{Ina:} As expected of Jack.\n{Freeman:} But that is still a long time away. The Demon Race has already figured out how to calculate us. The matter is not simple. I don't know what Archbishop Yingluck is planning now. ?a?aAnyway, now that I have broken into the royal city, go to Holiya first.\n{Ina:} Hmm.","{伊娜：}那个将军不厉害嘛。\n{弗里曼：}本来就是花钱买来的职位，不是凭真才实学当上将军的。而且他的智商也不怎么样，连上司嘱咐他不能泄漏的东西都老说漏嘴。\n{伊娜：}是哦，而且他还说，哪个将军不是靠塞钱晋升的。难怪索兰德里亚的军队战斗力都那么差，原来都是些这样的人物充当军队的指挥。\n{弗里曼：}唉，一个巨贪毁了一个国家啊。\n{伊娜：}杰克是不是又想到卡尔提亚了？\n{弗里曼：}嗯，以后我一定会杜绝这样的人出现在朝野之中。\n{伊娜：}不愧是杰克。\n{弗里曼：}不过那还是很久远的事情，魔族已经在想办法算计我们了，事情并不简单，还不知道英拉大主教现在在谋划什么。——不管怎么说，现在已经闯入了王城，先去找霍利亚吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Isn't this, your Majesty? It just so happens that we have something to tell you...\n{Freeman:} Wait, this posture does not seem to be here to welcome us.\n{Queen:} Several hard work, unfortunately Gals does not seem to be your opponent, it seems that I need to take action.\n{Rael:} What, Your Majesty, what is going on?\n{Freeman:} Is Her Majesty the real master behind the scenes? But why does Her Majesty be against us?\n{Queen:} No, no, I am not the mastermind. However, who is the mastermind is not important to you anymore, because you are going to Huangquan soon.","{伊娜：}这不是，女王陛下吗？正好我们有事想告诉你呢……\n{弗里曼：}等等，这架势，好像不是来迎接我们的。\n{女王：}几位辛苦了，遗憾的是加尔斯似乎并不是你们的对手，看来需要我出手了。\n{雷尔：}什么，女王陛下，这是怎么回事？\n{弗里曼：}难道女王陛下才是真正的幕后主使？可是女王陛下为什么要与我们为敌呢？\n{女王：}不不不，我并不是主谋。不过，谁是主谋对你们来说已经不重要了，因为你们马上就要去黄泉了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It looks like it's land here. It's not clear at all, the following are bones...\n{Rael:} We can't tell whether the bones are under water or land, and there may be a dark river. You can tell if you try to step on it carefully.","{伊娜：}这里，貌似是陆地了吧。完全分不清楚啊，下面都是尸骨……\n{雷尔：}我们看不清尸骨的下面是水还是陆地，也可能会有暗河。先小心地试踩一下，就能分辨出来。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It looks really bad now.\n{Freeman:} Judging from the information provided by Chinu just now, the situation is very serious. The demons are brewing a very dangerous plan. And there is a treasure that can destroy something.\n{Ina:} It's a pity that Chinu died too quickly to ask more.\n{Raier:} In addition, he also said that his most elite troops are garrisoned in the front, and we can't be careless.\n{Ina:} I know, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}现在看起来情况真的很糟糕。\n{弗里曼：}从齐努刚才提供的情报看，形势很严峻。魔族正在酝酿很危险的计划。而且还有一个能毁灭什么什么的宝物。\n{伊娜：}可惜那个齐努死得太快，没能问到更多的东西。\n{雷尔：}另外，他还说了他最精锐的部队驻守在前面，我们不能大意。\n{伊娜：}我知道了，我会努力的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It really came out. I don't know how much damage Solo has done, so I hurried to stop him.","{伊娜：}果然通出来了。不知道索罗已经进行了多少破坏了，赶紧去阻止他。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It really is a tyrant who buried the construction workers alive in the mausoleum.\n{Rael:} He must be afraid that his tomb would be known to others after he died, so he killed all the workers.\n{Ina:} But his tomb was still stolen like this, I don't know if it deserves it.","{伊娜：}果然是暴君啊，竟然把建筑工人活埋在陵墓里。\n{雷尔：}他一定是害怕死后自己的墓被别人知道后扒坟吧，所以把工人都灭口。\n{伊娜：}可是他的墓还是被盗成这样，不知是不是该说活该呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It really is here, Radia.\n{Radia:} How come? Why are you here? Go away, it's dangerous here, someone is chasing me.\n{Ina:} Don't worry, the two guys who chased you have been killed by us. I'm here to return this thing from you. Listen to those two guys saying that this is the Thor's helmet, is it an important treasure?\n{Radia:} In this case, it is convenient. Let's take out the \"Dragon Wing Robe\" buried here now. This Thor's helmet is necessary to take out the \"Dragon Wing Robe\", so I stole it out.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much, Ladia, you help us so...\n{Ladia:} I am not trying to help you, but I don't want \"Dragon King Divine Power\" to fall into Solo's hands. I don't have the power to fight against Solo alone, so I want to use you, just use it!\n{Ina:} Well, that's it, but thank you very much.","{伊娜：}果然在这里呢，拉迪亚。\n{拉迪亚：}怎么会？你们怎么来了？快走，这里很危险，有人在追杀我。\n{伊娜：}放心吧，追杀你的那两个家伙已经被我们干掉啦。我是来找你还这件东西的。听那两个家伙说这叫雷神盔，是什么重要的宝物吗？\n{拉迪亚：}既然这样，那就方便了。我们现在就把埋藏在这里的“龙翼袍”取出来吧。这个雷神盔是取出“龙翼袍”的必要物件，所以我才把它偷出来的。\n{伊娜：}太谢谢你了，拉迪亚，你这么帮助我们……\n{拉迪亚：}我可不是为了帮助你们哦，只是我不想让“龙王神力”落入索罗手中而已。我自己一个人没有力量对抗索罗，所以才想利用你们而已，仅仅是利用而已！\n{伊娜：}好吧，那就算是这样吧，不过还是很感谢你。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It seems that the deepest part of the hole is almost reached. Is Radia here? Anyway, the things she gave me must be returned to her in good condition.","{伊娜：}似乎快到了洞的最深处了吧。拉迪亚是不是在这里呢。不管怎么说，必须把她交给我的东西完好地送还给她才是。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It turned out to be an island, and the female devil must have flown away.","{伊娜：}结果是个岛，那个女恶魔肯定飞走了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It turned out to be no help...Are we going to find Hailong? Where does Hailong live? Jack, do you know?\n{Freeman:} Uh, it should be living in the sea...\n{Ina:} What? Jack has always been very knowledgeable, and he didn't expect to give such an answer.\n{Freeman:} But after all, the sea dragon is just a creature in the rumors. Whether anyone has seen the real thing, I really can’t be sure. In fact, many times, when the fisherman encountered big storms and the boat was overturned, he claimed to have encountered a sea dragon, and then spread it ten by ten, and everyone believed it. In fact, no one saw it at first.\n{Ina:} Huh? If you say that, it will appear in places with strong winds and waves?\n{Rael:} Do you really believe it?\n{Ina:} The sea near here is quite strong, or let's find a {pier} and take a boat to take a look.","{伊娜：}结果还是没什么帮助嘛……难道，我们要去找海龙？海龙生活在什么样的地方呢？杰克你知道吗？\n{弗里曼：}呃，应该是生活在海里吧……\n{伊娜：}什么嘛，杰克一向学识渊博，没想到也给出这样的答案。\n{弗里曼：}但是海龙毕竟只是传言中存在的生物，有没有人见过实物，还真不能确信。其实很多时候，渔民遇到了大风浪，船被打翻了，他就声称遇到了海龙，然后一传十十传百，大家就相信了，实际上最初就没有人看见。\n{伊娜：}唉？这么说的话，就是在大风浪的地方就会出现啦？\n{雷尔：}你还真的相信了？\n{伊娜：}这边附近的海上风浪就挺厉害的，要不我们找个{码头}坐船去看看吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It turned out to be so, and sure enough, the legend is true. I got into trouble.\n{Freeman:} Could it be said that the original purpose of the Mozu was to liberate the Phoenix, and then took advantage of us...\n{Ina:} It's all my fault. It would be nice if you didn't see Rael patiently waiting.\n{Elder:} I know that you didn't deliberately destroy the barrier, just don't know the truth. By now, self-blame is no longer useful.\n{Ina:} Yes, we should find a way to solve the problem now. If we go find the Phoenix and knock him down again, it should be fine, right?\n{Elder:}... {Ina:} What's wrong, did I say something wrong?\n{Elder:} Really a newborn calf is not afraid of tigers. Cherry Flander, a legendary warrior who was invincible on the entire continent, was only able to barely defeat the Phoenix after wearing the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\". I don't know how capable you girl is, but just wanting to fight Warcraft like this is too self-conscious.\n{Ina:} How powerful is the so-called Warcraft?\n{Elder:} The Phoenix and the Black Dragon King, the Golden Dragon, the Nine-Headed Dragon, the Holy Kylin, and the Galou, also known as the Six Great Monsters, are the strongest creatures in the world.\n{Ina:} It may be true, but the destruction of the barrier was caused by my mistake, and I should take responsibility anyway. I will work hard! Even if I lose my life, I should try it.\n{Freeman:} Actually, I think we may not have no chance of winning. Although the Phoenix is unusually strong, it has just broken out of the enchantment, and its vitality has not yet recovered, perhaps it is still very weak. Maybe now is the best time to beat him.\n{Ina:} Yes, yes, when we came in just now, we had knocked down several little birds, and those little birds had just emerged from the ice and they were very weak.\n{Elder:} Well, if you insist on trying, we will also walk together.\n{Ina:} Elder, grandpa, don't go, it's dangerous. If I make trouble, I can just go by myself.\n{Elder:} What silly thing to say. As the guardian of the Phoenix, how can I give up my duties and run away at this time. Besides, I am more familiar with this enchantment than you are, and it is better for someone to lead the way than you blindly touch it yourself. Go, go to {the depths of the enchantment}, Phoenix and \"Dragon Tooth Crown\". They should all be there.\n{Ina:} Grandpa elder...Thank you, I will work hard!","{伊娜：}原来是这样，果然那个传说是真的。我闯大祸了。\n{弗里曼：}难道说，魔族的本来目的就是想要解放不死鸟，然后利用了我们……\n{伊娜：}都是我不好。如果当时没看到雷尔耐心等待下就好了。\n{长老：}我知道你们也不是故意破坏结界的，只是不知道真相而已。事到如今，自责已经没有用了。\n{伊娜：}对，现在应该想办法解决问题。我们去找到那个不死鸟，再次把他打倒的话，应该就可以了吧？\n{长老：}……\n{伊娜：}怎么了，我又说错什么了吗？\n{长老：}真是初生牛犊不怕虎。当年整个大陆上几无敌手的传奇勇士切里弗兰德也是在穿上了“龙王神力”之后才能勉强战胜不死鸟。你这个丫头有多大的本事我是不知道，不过就想这样去对抗魔兽，未免太自不量力。\n{伊娜：}所谓魔兽，有多厉害呢？\n{长老：}不死鸟与黑龙王，金神龙，九头龙，圣麒麟，伽楼罗，并称为六大魔兽，是天底下最强的生物。\n{伊娜：}也许是这样没错，但是结界的破坏是我的错误造成的，不管怎么说我也应该去承担责任。我会努力的！即使会赔上性命，我也应该去试试。\n{弗里曼：}其实，我倒觉得，我们未必没有胜算。虽然不死鸟异常的强大，但是刚刚从结界中破冰而出，元气尚未恢复，也许还很虚弱。可能现在才是击败他的最好时机。\n{伊娜：}对啊对啊，刚才我们进来的时候已经打倒了好几只小鸟了，那些小鸟都是刚刚从冰封中出来，虚弱得很呢。\n{长老：}好吧，如果你执意要去试试，我们也一起同行。\n{伊娜：}长老爷爷，您还是不要去了吧，那么危险。我闯的祸，我自己去就行了。\n{长老：}说什么傻话。作为不死鸟的看守者，我怎么能在这种时候放弃自己的职责而逃跑。再说，这结界里面我比你熟悉，有人带路总比你自己瞎摸的好。走吧，向{结界的深处}去，不死鸟和“龙牙冠”。应该都在那一带。\n{伊娜：}长老爷爷……多谢了，我会努力的！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It turns out that this is the \"Tongtian Monument\". There are so many records on it. Although it is impossible to copy them all, it is better to make the main records as much as possible.","{伊娜：}原来这就是“通天碑”啊，上面的记载还真多呢，虽然全部抄下来不可能，不过还是尽可能地作好主要的记录吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It was not easy to finally defeat the general named Seresia.\n{Rael:} At this time, the manticore may have already flown to Cheman Island. We have to hurry up and race against time.","{伊娜：}终于打败了那个叫赛雷西亚的将军，真不容易。\n{雷尔：}这时蝎狮王估计已经飞到奇曼岛了吧。我们要赶快了，争分夺秒。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It would be great if there was a way to cool the magma. By the way, the freezing magic... It's a pity that I haven't learned it yet. There is no time now, and Roland is still in the hands of the enemy, so let's use the magic element given to me by Senior Feng Xing to cast the freezing magic and cool the magma.","{伊娜：}如果有办法让岩浆冷却一下就好了，对了，冰冻魔法……可惜我还没有学会。现在没有时间了，罗兰还在敌人手里，那么就用风行前辈给我这个魔法元素来施展冰冻魔法，把岩浆冷却吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's almost here, the sky is quite open, let's send a signal. But how does this thing work?\n{Rael:} There is no switch and no trigger...\n{Ina:} There is a thread here. Is it the fuse? Need to be ignited?\n{Freeman:} No, the material of this thread is not for igniting.\n{Ina:} Jack, you know more about engineering, how do you use this thing?\n{Freeman:} Is it possible to... pull this thread?\n{Ina:} Isn't it, cracker? Bang~~~~~~~~! A flash ball hit the ground.\n{Ina:} Hey, that's it.\n{Freeman:} Are you pulling right now? Fighting on the ground is useless. Fighting from the sky can attract the attention of the enemy, right?\n{Ina:} I just wanted to give it a try, but I didn't expect...\n{Rael:} There is only one serve, and it's gone after the pull.\n{Ina:} It doesn't matter, I have seen the effect, and I can imitate it myself. Look at the trick, Ina-chan's special flash bomb~!","{伊娜：}这里差不多了吧，上空挺开阔的，我们来发信号。不过，这东西怎么用的呢？\n{雷尔：}没有开关也没有扳机……\n{伊娜：}这里有根线呢。是不是导火索？需要点燃的？\n{弗里曼：}不是，这线的材质并非是引火用的。\n{伊娜：}杰克，你对工程学比较了解，你看看这东西怎么使用？\n{弗里曼：}有可能是……拉这根线？\n{伊娜：}不是吧，拉炮？\n\n砰~~~~~~~~！一个闪光球打在地上。\n\n{伊娜：}咦，就是这样啊。\n{弗里曼：}你这就拉了？朝地上打没用啊，朝天上打才能吸引敌人的注意吧？\n{伊娜：}我只是想试一下，没想到……\n{雷尔：}只有一发，拉完就没了。\n{伊娜：}没关系，我已经看到那个效果了，我自己也可以模仿出来。看招，伊娜酱特制闪光弹~！\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's calm. Jack, it's time to tell us about Kartia.\n{Freeman:} Okay. I will speak slowly. However, there are some behind-the-scenes things that I am not clear about. I can only talk about what I know.","{伊娜：}好一片风平浪静。杰克，下面该给我们讲讲卡尔提亚的事了吧。\n{弗里曼：}好吧。我慢慢说来。不过，有些幕后的事情我也并不清楚，我只能说说我所知道的事情。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's finally out, everyone is okay. The inside of this temple is really dizzying, there are mirrors everywhere... oh, how come there are so many people outside?\n{Militia:} Is the priest okay? We are planning to go in and rescue...\n{Zola:} The villagers are worried, we are all right. Thanks to Ina and their help, the invading demons were finally killed.\n{Zade:} However, it is really surprising that there will be demons coming to our Snow Mountain Island. How did they come...\n{Zola:} Have any suspicious ships docked?\n{Militia:} No, we have been on duty all the time. How could it be possible to let the demons ashore...\n{Zade:} That's weird... Did they use a portal?\n{Zola:} Impossible. There is a huge difference in temperature and air pressure between Snow Mountain Island and other places in the outside world. This is equivalent to a physical barrier. Spells such as portals cannot break through the barrier and invade from the outside. If they forcibly pass through the portal connecting the inside and outside of the enchantment, they will be crushed by the huge magic pressure difference-unless they have a crimson crystal.\n{Ina:} Ah, Crimson Crystal? Could it be this? What I got from that demons just now. Ina took out the crimson crystals she had picked up from the demons who had been defeated earlier.\n{Zola:} Huh? They actually have Crimson Crystal...\n{Freeman:} It turns out that this is Crimson Crystal. I have read about it in books before, but I didn't expect the real thing to look like this...\n{Ina:} This, what is Crimson Crystal? what? Is it something extraordinary?\n{Zola:} Crimson crystal is a very rare mineral, which only grows in the demon world and is very rare. It is a powerful magic accessory, often used to offset the huge magic pressure difference to create magical effects that are usually impossible to achieve. If there is this thing, it will be possible to pass through the portal from the outside world to Snow Mountain Island...\n{Rael:} So, the demons really came here through a portal...\n{Zola:} Someone from this Snow Mountain Island There must still be the portal that they opened when they came here, and we must find it out.\n{Zade:} Who was the first to see the demons? From what direction did they enter the temple?\n{Women:} The first thing the sister saw was from the dense forest in the south.\n{Zola:} Okay, let's go to the jungle, find the portal, and close it! Never let the demons bring danger to Snow Mountain Island again.\n{Ina:} Let's go too.\n{Zola:} Well, please, to close the portal, our mana may not be enough. You are a magician, and you may need your help again.\n{Zade:} But please be careful on the way, follow us and don't get lost. It is dangerous in the dense forest.","{伊娜：}总算是出来了，大家都没事吧。这神殿里面可真是让人头晕，到处都是镜子一样……哟，外面怎么好多人？\n{民兵队：}司祭大人没事吧？我们正打算进去营救……\n{佐拉：}害乡亲们担心了，我们没事。多亏伊娜他们的帮助，总算是干掉了入侵的魔族。\n{扎德：}不过，居然会有魔族闯到我们雪山岛来，真是太意外了，他们是怎么过来的……\n{佐拉：}有发现可疑的船只靠岸吗？\n{民兵队：}没有，我们一直有人值勤的，怎么可能放魔族的人上岸呢……\n{扎德：}那就怪了……难道他们使用了传送门？\n{佐拉：}不可能，雪山岛与外界其他地方存在巨大的温差和气压差，这相当于一个物理结界，传送门之类的法术，是不能突破结界由外部侵入的。如果强行穿越连结结界内外的传送门，他们会被巨大的魔法压差辗得形神俱灭——除非，他们拥有赤水晶。\n{伊娜：}啊，赤水晶？难道是这个？刚才从那个魔族身上拿到的东西。\n\n伊娜取出从之前打倒的魔族身上捡到的深红色的水晶体。\n\n{佐拉：}啊？他们居然真的有赤水晶……\n{弗里曼：}原来这就是赤水晶啊，以前在书本上读到过，没想到实物是这个样子的……\n{伊娜：}这个，赤水晶到底是什么东西？很了不得的东西吗？\n{佐拉：}赤水晶是一种非常稀有的矿物，只在魔界生长，非常罕见。是一种强大的魔法辅料，常用来抵消巨大的魔法压差来创造平时无法实现的魔法效果。如果有这个东西，从外界穿越传送门来到雪山岛就成为可能了……\n{雷尔：}这么说，魔族真是用传送门来到这里的……\n{佐拉：}这个雪山岛的某处一定还留着他们过来时开的传送门，我们必须去找出来。\n{扎德：}谁是最先看到魔族的人？他们从什么方向进入神殿的？\n{妇女：}姐最先看到的，就是从南边的密林里出来的。\n{佐拉：}好，我们去密林里，把传送门找出来，然后关闭它！绝对不能让魔族再给雪山岛带来危险。\n{伊娜：}我们也去。\n{佐拉：}嗯，拜托了，要关闭传送门，光靠我们的法力可能还不够，你是魔法师，也许需要你再次帮忙。\n{扎德：}不过路上请一定小心，跟好我们，不要走散。密林里很危险。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's so hot under the cave, and magma can be seen. It's no wonder that the trees outside are all being smoked and withered.","{伊娜：}这洞底下好热啊，还看得到岩浆，难怪外面的树都要被熏得枯了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's so hot. In such a desolate place, you can't even see a half-person figure. Can this kind of place really recover?\n{Freeman:} Not for humans, but not necessarily for other creatures. Some creatures just like high-heat environments.\n{Ina:} That's it, write it down.","{伊娜：}好热啊。这么荒凉的地方，连半个人影都看不到。这种地方真的能恢复能力？\n{弗里曼：}对人类来说不能，对其他生物就不一定的。有的生物就是喜欢高热的环境。\n{伊娜：}原来如此，记下来记下来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's strange how there is a piece of ice and snow inside.\n{Freeman:} This ice and snow does not appear to have formed naturally. Although it has been formed for a long time.\n{Ina:} Is it magic?\n{Freeman:} I don’t know, I’m not familiar with magic. I can only judge it physically. In short, we have to be careful. How did the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" detector respond?\n{Ina:} There is a reaction, it should be correct. Let's {look inside} to find it.","{伊娜：}这里面，怎么会是一片冰雪，好奇怪啊。\n{弗里曼：}这冰雪不像是自然形成的。虽然已经形成了好长时间。\n{伊娜：}难道是魔法？\n{弗里曼：}我也不清楚，我对魔法并不熟悉。我只能从物理上来判断。总之我们要小心了。“龙王神力”探测仪的反应如何？\n{伊娜：}有反应的，应该没错。我们{往里}找找吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's strange. I have a feeling. From the Queen's intelligence, the enemy should not be strong. Why am I always a little uneasy?\n{Freeman:} If it wasn't because the enemy had reinforcements, we should indeed sit down and plan well. However, time does not allow it now. Even if there is some discrepancy in the information, we must do it as soon as possible.\n{Ina:} But, since one of their squadrons can already make this country powerless, why should they request reinforcements? What is the purpose of the reinforcements?\n{Freeman:} I don’t understand this...\n{Rael:} They obviously stopped their operations and asked for reinforcements after they got the \"Dragon Eye Rings\". I think the reinforcements must be related to the \"Dragon Eye Rings\". .\n{Ina:} It makes sense to say so, let me write down the doubts first. The next thing is to find Gals and the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" first, and maybe the truth will become clear after finding them.","{伊娜：}很奇怪，我有一种感觉，明明从女王的情报来看，敌人应该不强，为什么我总是有点不安呢？\n{弗里曼：}如果不是因为敌人有援军，我们的确应该先坐下来好好地计划一下。不过，现在时间上不允许了。即使情报有点出入，我们也要尽快才好。\n{伊娜：}可是，既然他们一个中队就已经能让这个国家无力抵抗了，为什么还要请求援军呢？援军来的目的是什么？\n{弗里曼：}这个，我也想不明白……\n{雷尔：}他们很明显是在得到了“龙眼指环”之后才停止行动并且请求援军的，我觉得援军一定与“龙眼指环”有关。\n{伊娜：}这么说也有道理，我先把疑点记下来吧。接下来先找到加尔斯和“龙眼指环”才是当务之急，也许找到之后一切就真相大白了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's too cold here, do you want to go here?","{伊娜：}这边太冷了啦，要往这里走吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} It's very hot here. Is it really here?","{伊娜：}这里很热耶。真的是这里吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Jack, ah no, your prince, do you really want to go back with that uncle?\n{Freeman:} No way, since I was hit by General Bruno, I can't even think about going back. General Bruno is a close friend of Archbishop Yingluck. The archbishop has always had opinions on me, although it is only a religious leader in name. Shang holds many real powers and important figures in the kingdom, so I'd better not mess with him.\n{Rael:} I didn't expect the prince to have a fearful figure.","{伊娜：}杰克，啊不，王子殿下，你真的要跟那个大叔回去吗？\n{弗里曼：}没办法，既然被布里诺将军撞到了，想不回去也不成了，布里诺将军是英拉大主教的亲信，大主教一向对我有意见，虽然名义上只是宗教领袖，实际上掌握着王国很多实权和重要人物，我还是不要惹他比较好。\n{雷尔：}没想到王子也有惧怕的人物。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Jack, don't you think it's getting more and more weird? What are they talking about? Frozen for 99 years?\n{Freeman:} Having said that, I suddenly thought of a legend. 99 years ago, the warrior Cherry Flander defeated the World of Warcraft {Phoenix Phoenix}, which endangered the mainland of Mirronia, and frozen it somewhere on the mainland. Legend has it that as long as the ice is sealed for 100 years, the phoenix The magic power will be completely wiped out, and he can no longer harm humanity.\n{Ina:} Wait, so, is this place where we are now...\n{Freeman:} It seems to be related to that legend.\n{Ina:} Sorry, I think I got into trouble...","{伊娜：}杰克，你不觉得越来越奇怪了吗？他们在说些什么？冰封99年？\n{弗里曼：}这么说起来，我突然想到一个传说。99年前，勇士切里弗兰德击败了当时危害米尔罗尼亚大陆的魔兽{不死鸟菲尼克斯}，并将其冰封在了大陆的某处，传说只要冰封满100年，不死鸟的魔力就会完全消灭，他就不能再危害人类了。\n{伊娜：}等等，这么说，难道我们现在所在的这个地方是……\n{弗里曼：}看起来像是和那个传说有关。\n{伊娜：}糟了，我觉得我闯祸了……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Jack, what kind of character is your brother?\n{Freeman:} My brother, he is a bit strange to speak of. I seldom talk, seldom interact with people, and often be alone by myself. I never played with me when I was young.\n{Rael:} As a leader of the country, it's no good not to listen to other people's opinions. Not being good at communication may be a weakness.\n{Freeman:} However, in the Royal Academy, his academic performance has always been the first, which I am ashamed of. I have worked very hard, but my academic performance is always far behind my brother.\n{Ina:} Is it a pedantic student?\n{Freeman:} But it's not like this. Anyway, it's a strange one. Even so, after all, he is a brother of more than ten years and a child of the same father. If he is in danger, I always miss him.\n{Ina:} The same father, not the same mother?\n{Freeman:} Well, my brother's mother is Queen Bellandia, and my mother is Princess Issa.","{伊娜：}杰克，你哥哥是个什么样的人物呢？\n{弗里曼：}我哥哥啊，他这人，说起来也是有点奇怪的。平时很少说话，很少跟人交往，常常自己一个人独处。小时候也从来不跟我玩。\n{雷尔：}作为国家的领导者，不多听别人的意见可不行啊，不擅交际可能是个弱点呢。\n{弗里曼：}不过，皇家学院里，他的学习成绩却从来都是第一，这一点我是自愧不如。我已经很努力了，但是学习成绩上却总是远远比不上哥哥。\n{伊娜：}难道是个闷头读书的学究？\n{弗里曼：}但是又不像是这样。总之很奇怪一个人。虽然如此，但毕竟是十几年的兄弟，又是同一个父亲的孩子，如果他会有危险，我总是挂念的。\n{伊娜：}同一个父亲， 不是同一个母亲？\n{弗里曼：}嗯，哥哥的母亲是王后贝兰迪娅，我的母亲是王妃伊莎。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Jack, what shall we do now? We must find the \"Fire Spirit Orb\", but this guy hid in the city and dared not come out.\n{Freeman:} Can only attack the city. Anyway, this prime minister is not a good thing. He doesn't recognize anything except money, and he also raises a lot of waste bureaucrats. Seeing a country become so corrupt, even though it is not my own country, I still feel very uncomfortable.\n{Ina:} Yes, he tried to harm us several times anyway, and it's not too much for us to retaliate. Then it was so decided, attacked the Intasia King City, and seized the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".","{伊娜：}杰克，现在我们怎么办呢？我们必须找到“火灵珠”才行，可是这家伙躲进城里不敢出来了。\n{弗里曼：}只能攻城了。反正这个宰相也不是个好东西，除了钱什么都不认，还养了一大堆废物官僚。看着一个国家变成这么腐败的样子，虽然不是自己的国家，也还是觉得很不是滋味。\n{伊娜：}对，反正他想害我们也好几次了，我们以牙还牙也并不过分。那么就这样决定了，攻打因塔西亚王城，强夺“火灵珠”。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Judging from the response of the detector, there is a \"Dragon King Divine Power\" component that should be near here, and we are already very close.","{伊娜：}从探测仪的反应来看，有一个“龙王神力”的部件应该就在这里附近，我们已经离得很近了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Killed the elder brother, and then the younger brother.\n{Rael:} But that younger brother doesn't know where he flew.\n{Ina:} Yes, how can I find him out. It will be difficult for him to find Radia if it is too late.\n{Freeman:} There is a way, look at this.\n{Rael:} It was found from him, which is? ...\n{Freeman:} It looks a bit like a firework, maybe a device that sends a signal flare.\n{Ina:} Ah yes, this is it! Jack, you are so smart.\n{Raier:} It turns out that this is used to attract my younger brother, so that we don't need to bother to find it. It really is a good way.\n{Freeman:} However, here is too narrow and there are many barriers, and the effect may not be good. It is better to find a more open place and send the signal.\n{Ina:} Then let's move to a place closer to the sea. Near the sea should be relatively open.","{伊娜：}干掉了哥哥，接下来是弟弟了。\n{雷尔：}不过那个弟弟不知道飞哪去了。\n{伊娜：}是哦，该怎么把他找出来呢。拖晚了让他先找到拉迪亚就不好办了。\n{弗里曼：}有办法，看这个。\n{雷尔：}从他身上搜出来的，这是？……\n{弗里曼：}看起来有点像焰火，可能是个发信号弹的装置。\n{伊娜：}啊对了，就是这个！杰克你真聪明。\n{雷尔：}原来是用这个把弟弟吸引过来，这样就不需要我们费力去找了。果然是好办法。\n{弗里曼：}不过，这里太狭窄，屏障多，发出来可能效果不太好，我们还是找一处更开阔一些的地方再放信号比较好。\n{伊娜：}那么我们向靠海边一些的地方移动吧。海这附近应该会比较开阔的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Killed...\n{Rael:} But the commander behind the scenes was not found.\n{Freeman:} Anyway, be careful, there may be ambushes below. If there is any way to attract the conductor behind the scenes, it would be great.\n{Ina:} This, I think about it, there will be a way.","{伊娜：}干掉了……\n{雷尔：}可是没有发现幕后指挥者。\n{弗里曼：}总之大家小心，下面说不定还会有埋伏。如果，有什么办法能吸引幕后指挥者现身的话就好了。\n{伊娜：}这个，我想想吧，会有办法的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Let's continue. First, Archbishop Yingluck wants to harm you, who cares about the country everywhere; second, Archbishop Yingluck doesn't care about the country himself, and doesn't want to resist the aggression first when Kartia is invaded; third, Archbishop Yingluck does not care about the country. , Archbishop Yingluck does not care about the people and does not pay attention to monster attacks. Fourth, Archbishop Yingluck transferred all the army of the local lords. Therefore, Archbishop Yingluck is an ambitious and selfish person, and he is now in his hands. With power and soldiers, Rael said before that he is likely to engage in a coup, which is very credible. If let him succeed, Kartia will fall into dire straits.\n{Freeman:} So you still know this. I think why Archbishop Yingluck did this. It looks like a conspinacy. However, if he really wants a coup, my brother is in danger. Perhaps, Archbishop Yingluck would want to get rid of him, and then he could become king himself.","{伊娜：}\n下面继续，\n第一，英拉大主教想要加害对国家处处关心的你；\n第二，英拉大主教自己不关心国家，在卡尔提亚被侵略时不想办法先抵抗侵略；\n第三，英拉大主教不关心国民，对怪物袭击事件不闻不问；\n第四，英拉大主教把地方领主的军队都调走；\n因此，英拉大主教是一个有野心而自私的人，而且现在手里又有权又有兵，雷尔之前说他很可能会搞政变，就非常可信了。如果让他得手，卡尔提亚将陷入水深火热。\n\n{弗里曼：}原来你们还知道这些，我想英拉大主教为什么会这么做呢，看起来真有阴谋。不过，要是他真想政变，我哥哥可就危险了。说不定，英拉大主教也会想除掉他，然后就可以自己做国王了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Let's do it, I protect you from here.\n{Ghost:} You? Really can?\n{Ina:} I can also magic, I think I will have a way to deal with that King Jaya.\n{Ghost:} There are seven of our brothers, can you guarantee the safety of all of us, {no accidents}?\n{Ina:} I will work hard.\n{Ghost:} Well, you don't look like a bad person either, we believe you once. We follow you. If you can let us all escape the control of King Jaya safely, we will thank you. But if one of our brothers is missing, then you are dead.","{伊娜：}这样吧，我保护你们通过这里。\n{鬼魂：}你？真的可以吗？\n{伊娜：}我也会魔法，我想我会有办法对付那个查亚大王的。\n{鬼魂：}我们兄弟七个呢，你能保证我们全员安全，{一个都不能出意外}吗？\n{伊娜：}我会努力的。\n{鬼魂：}好吧，你看上去也不像是坏人，我们相信你一回。我们跟着你。如果你能让我们全部安全逃离查亚大王的控制范围，我们会酬谢你的。但是如果我们兄弟少了一个，那你就死定了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Let's go to raid Herald first, and don't take this route for the time being.","{伊娜：}现在先去突袭海拉尔德，暂时不走这条路。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Let's go to {Cheman Island} quickly. Don't let the demons come first.","{伊娜：}还是赶紧去{奇曼岛}吧。别让魔族先到。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Let's put it away.","{伊娜：}还是把它收起来吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, look at it, is there something tall next to it?\n{Rael:} I see, there are three tall pillars on the east side.\n{Ina:} Isn't this the \"Spirit Gathering Pagoda\" that Ladia called?\n{Freeman:} I don't know, let's take a look around.","{伊娜：}你们看你们看，这旁边是不是有什么高大的东西？\n{雷尔：}看到了，东边，有三根高大的台柱一样的东西。\n{伊娜：}这个是不是就是拉迪亚所说的“聚灵塔”？\n{弗里曼：}不知道，我们再观察一下周围看看。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, something is flying around.\n{Rael:} It looks like a dragoon, we will hide, don't be found.\n{Freeman:} Fortunately, the distance is relatively long, we are not conspicuous in the mud, and we are not found. But if you march forward, you will definitely fall into their field of vision. This is in trouble...\n{Ina:} There is such a unit in the Barland army?\n{Freeman:} As far as I know, the Barland army should have no such troops as dragoons. Taming dragons is not something ordinary people can do.\n{Rael:} Maybe it was the demons again...\n{Freeman:} It's probably like this, I miscalculated. Sorry everyone...\n{Ina:} Why does Jack apologize?\n{Freeman:} Now there are interceptions and chasing soldiers. Our situation is very dangerous. I didn't consider all of you to drag everyone down...\n{Ina:} You can't blame you for this. Before we set off, I don't know what the Balanda Kingdom has to do with the demons.\n{Rael:} Yeah, it's useless to blame ourselves now, let's think about how to solve the problem.\n{Freeman:} That...that's true...\n{Ina:} If we rushed over at the fastest speed, would it work?\n{Freeman:} No matter how fast we are, we can't run on the ground as fast as we fly in the sky. As long as we are discovered, we will be exposed to their surveillance all the way afterwards, and we will no longer be able to carry out any concealed actions. Without concealment, we have no advantage at all.\n{Ina:} Hmm... It seems that we have to kill the dragoons... As long as we kill them, our original plan is still feasible, right?\n{Freeman:} If it can be done, our threat will indeed be lifted. However, the opponent is driving a dragon, which is not easy to deal with.\n{Rael:} Ina must have thought of something?\n{Ina:} We've had the experience of fighting dragons several times before, right? For example, in Horn Valley, in Blackwind Valley, we can all defeat dragons. Although the dragon is very powerful, it is huge and depressing in a narrow place. I think there should be a way to deal with them if they can be led to cramped places.\n{Freeman:} There are no tall rocks in this swamp. The obstacles that can be used to restrict the opponent's movement are...\n{Ina:} You can use trees. You see, some tall trees are much taller and thicker than dragons.\n{Freeman:} That is the Frankie arbor, the tallest plant in Milronia. It is mostly in the damp and damp areas. It is now in the deciduous period...\n{Ina:} Yes, the tallest trees are all It's bald. Why don't those short trees go bald?\n{Freeman:} Those short plants are mostly ferns, not deciduous trees...\n{Raier:} Wait, stop here, aren't we here to study plants?\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm sorry. So my solution is to lead them to a place {a place surrounded by deciduous trees on all sides} and fight them there. There is very little space there. As long as we choose our position well, the opponent's dragon wants to hit us, but is afraid that the dragon's breath will spray on our own people, and we will look forward to throwing rats. In this way we have ample opportunity to eliminate them one by one.\n{Freeman:} It sounds good, but I still don't understand how to do it. Anyway, we trust Ina's way and try it.","{伊娜：}看，前面有什么东西在飞来飞去。\n{雷尔：}好像是龙骑兵，我们快隐蔽，别被发现了。\n{弗里曼：}好在距离比较远，我们在泥沼地中不显眼，没被发现。不过如果再向前行军，肯定要落入他们的视野。这下麻烦了……\n{伊娜：}巴兰德军居然还有这样的部队？\n{弗里曼：}据我所知，巴兰德军应该没有龙骑兵这样的部队。驯服龙可不是一般人能做得了的。\n{雷尔：}搞不好又是魔族弄来的……\n{弗里曼：}很有可能是这样，我失算了。对不起大家……\n{伊娜：}杰克为什么要道歉呀？\n{弗里曼：}现在前有堵截后有追兵，我们的境况非常危险了，把大家拖累都是我没考虑周全……\n{伊娜：}这事不能怪你啊，在我们出发前，并不知道巴兰德王国跟魔族有什么关系。\n{雷尔：}是啊，现在自责可没有用，我们还是想想怎么解决问题吧。\n{弗里曼：}这……说得也是……\n{伊娜：}如果我们用最快的速度一口气冲过去，行不行呢？\n{弗里曼：}我们再怎么快，在地上跑的也比不过在天上飞的吧。只要我们被发现，之后就等于是全程暴露在他们的监视之下，之后就没法再进行任何隐蔽的行动了。丧失了隐藏性，我们就没有任何优势可言。\n{伊娜：}唔……看来，得把那些龙骑兵干掉才行了……只要干掉了他们，我们原来的计划依然可行，对不对？\n{弗里曼：}如果能干掉，确实我们的威胁就解除了。不过，对方驾驭的可是龙啊，这可不是好对付的。\n{雷尔：}伊娜一定是想到什么主意了吧？\n{伊娜：}以前，我们也有过数次跟龙交手的经历的吧？比如在霍恩山谷，在黑风谷，我们都能把龙打败。虽然龙很厉害，但是身躯庞大，在狭窄的地方会很郁闷。我想，如果能把他们引到狭窄的地方，应该有办法对付的。\n{弗里曼：}这沼泽地带里并没有高大的山石，可以用来限制对方行动的障碍是……\n{伊娜：}可以用树啊。你们看，有一些高大的树木比龙还要高大粗壮得多呢。\n{弗里曼：}那是福兰克乔木，米尔罗尼亚最高大的植物，多生于阴湿地带，现在正值落叶期……\n{伊娜：}是哦，那些最高的树都是秃的呢。为什么那些矮的树却不会秃掉？\n{弗里曼：}那些矮的植物多为蕨类，并不是落叶乔木……\n{雷尔：}等等，就此打住，我们不是来研究植物的吧？\n{伊娜：}啊，对不起。那么我的办法就是，把他们引到一处{四面都被落叶树包围的地方}，在那里与他们交手。那里空间很小，只要我们自己位置选得好，对手的龙既想要打我们，又怕龙息喷到自己人，又怕被自己人喷了，就会瞻前顾后投鼠忌器了。这样我们就有充足的机会来把他们逐一消灭。\n{弗里曼：}听起来不错，不过我还不怎么理解具体操作办法。不管怎么说，我们信任伊娜的办法，去试试吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, the bricks on the wall here seem to be somewhat similar to the mechanism that Sam opened before.\n{Freeman:} It may be the same agency.\n{Ina:} Then let's try, maybe we can find a way out here. I saw how Sam did it before...\n{Freeman:} Be careful of electric shock, and don't touch the metal part!\n{Ina:} What should I do?\n{Freeman:} Holding the wooden handle part, pull it down.\n{Ina:} Is that true? ... the wall moved and the door opened.","{伊娜：}看，这里的墙上的砖，好像跟之前萨姆打开的机关有些相似。\n{弗里曼：}可能是同样的机关。\n{伊娜：}那么我们试试吧，也许这里能找到出去的通路。之前看萨姆是怎么做的……\n{弗里曼：}小心触电，千万不要碰到金属的部分！\n{伊娜：}要怎么做才好？\n{弗里曼：}握住木制的把柄部分，往下拉。\n{伊娜：}是这样吗？……墙动了耶，门开了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, the detector is responding!\n{Rael:} So the \"Dragonbone Greaves\" is really nearby.","{伊娜：}快看，探测仪有反应了！\n{雷尔：}这么说“龙骨胫甲”真的就在附近了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, there is a person floating on the sea.\n{Freeman:} Are you a victim of pinates again?\n{Raier:} It seems to be a living person, we rescue him. Everyone rescued the floating people on the boat. This person looked quite old, with white eyebrows and long beard, his robe was ragged and drenched, and his face was extremely haggard.","{伊娜：}看，海上漂着一个人啊。\n{弗里曼：}又是海盗的受害者吗？\n{雷尔：}好像是活人，我们把他救上来。\n\n大家把海上漂着的人救到船上。此人看上去年纪挺大了，白眉长髯，身上的长袍又破烂又湿透，面容极其憔悴。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Look, this pit...\n{Rael:} This is a sinking well. Did someone touch the organ?\n{Freeman:} Yes, look, there are infrared sensors on both sides of the pit.\n{Ina:} Then I will turn it off first. Well, then it should be fine. Look inside the pit...\n{Rael:} A bear, it seems to be dead...\n{Ina:} It turned out to be just a bear. Fortunately, I am worried about Ladia.\n{Rael:} Radia can fly and should not fall into a sinkhole.\n{Ina:} So too. But we can't fly, how should we get there? Hey, yes, the shade of the well cover that I got just now seems to be the right size, just cover it, and it can pass now.","{伊娜：}你们看，这个坑……\n{雷尔：}这是坠井吧。是不是有人触到了机关？\n{弗里曼：}没错，看，坑的两侧果然有红外线感应器。\n{伊娜：}那我去先把它关掉。嗯，这样就该没事了。看看坑里面……\n{雷尔：}一只熊，好像已经死了……\n{伊娜：}原来只是只熊，还好，我很担心拉迪亚呢。\n{雷尔：}拉迪亚会飞，应该不会落入坠井。\n{伊娜：}也是哦。不过我们不会飞耶，我们该怎么过去呢？哎，有了，刚才拿到的那个阴井盖，似乎大小合适，盖上去就好了呢，这下可以通过了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Looks like there is a town ahead? What is the town of the demons like? Go check it out. I hope I won't be hunted down.","{伊娜：}前面看起来有个城镇？魔族的城镇是什么样子的呢？去看看吧。希望不会被追杀。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Lord Kurug, can I ask you something about Fendinia?\n{Kurug:} Miss just ask. After serving in Fendinia for many years, he has a basic knowledge of the situation here.\n{Ina:} That's great. Just now those centaur said that we are outsiders, and also said that since outsiders came, Fendinia changed and the peaceful life disappeared. I don't know what this means?\n{Kurug:} Alas, this is exactly what we bother about. Fendinia has always been a quiet, peaceful, peaceful country in the past. But a few days ago, some people from the Demon Race came here...\n{Rael:} Demon Race! ?\n{Kulug:} Yes, those guys are rude and rude. Not only do they bully our people, but the worst thing is that the Queen’s treasure {\"Dragon Eye Ring\"} was also stolen by them.\n{Rael:} (Sure enough, here!)\n{Ina:} (However, the demons have already taken the lead, what should we do?)\n{Freeman:} But, you can’t deal with those demons, regain the treasures, and Did they drive out Fendinia?\n{Kulug:} Alas, we also think about it, but due to too long a period of peace and tranquility, our army has degraded to a low level of combat effectiveness. Many soldiers have never experienced any actual combat since they were born. The Mozu fights are retreating steadily.\n{Ina:} Never let the demons be so rampant. If there is anything we can do to help, Lord Kurug, just say, let's do our best to take the treasure back and drive away the demons.\n{Kulug:} To be honest, Her Majesty did have this intention, so she sent me down to greet a few of them back to the palace. How embarrassed I was to ask the guests for help. I didn’t expect several of them to be chivalrous, Her Majesty. Sure enough, I didn't read the wrong person. When you arrive at the palace, I will treat you all.","{伊娜：}库鲁格大人，能不能向你打听点关于芬迪尼亚的事情？\n{库鲁格：}小姐只管问。在下在芬迪尼亚任职多年，对这里的情况基本了如指掌。\n{伊娜：}那太好了。刚才那些半人马说我们是外来人，还说自从外来人来了之后，芬迪尼亚就变了，宁静的生活消失了。不知这话是什么意思呢？\n{库鲁格：}唉，这也正是我们烦恼的事情。芬迪尼亚从前一直是一个偏安一隅，与世无争，宁静安详的国度。可是前些日子，有一些魔族的人闯到了这里……\n{雷尔：}魔族！？\n{库鲁格：}是啊，那些家伙蛮横无礼，不但欺负我们的百姓，而且最糟糕的是，女王陛下的宝物{“龙眼指环”}也被他们偷走了。\n{雷尔：}（果然在这里！）\n{伊娜：}（可是，魔族已经抢先了，怎么办哪？）\n{弗里曼：}可是，你们没有办法对付那些魔族，夺回宝物，把他们赶出芬迪尼亚吗？\n{库鲁格：}唉，我们也想啊，可是由于经历了太长时期的和平与安宁，我们的军队已经退化得战斗力低下了，很多士兵从出生到现在就从没经历过任何实战，跟魔族交手是节节败退。\n{伊娜：}决不能让魔族这样猖狂。如果我们能帮上什么忙的话，库鲁格大人尽管说，我们出点力，去把宝物夺回来，赶走魔族。\n{库鲁格：}说实在的，女王陛下本来确有此意，所以派在下来迎接几位回宫，在下正愁怎么好意思开口向客人请求帮忙，没想到几位果然是侠义非凡，女王陛下果然没看错人。到了王宫，在下一定好好款待各位。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Mr. Guard, it's open time. Why haven't you opened the door yet?\n{Guard:} The time is not up. The sun has not yet risen to the top.\n{Ina:} Hey, it's cloudy today, the sun won't be out at all, don't you just leave it for a day?\n{Guard:} No way, we have no way to know the exact time except looking at the sun.\n{Ina:} Alas, let's give you an hourglass, so that you can count the time regardless of sunny or cloudy days.\n{Guard:} Ah, this is what we need most, thank you so much.\n{Ina:} Then, open the door for us now.\n{Guard:} Yes, no problem, here is the door.","{伊娜：}守卫先生，开放时间到啦。怎么还不开门？\n{守卫：}时间没到呢。太阳还没升到顶。\n{伊娜：}喂，今天阴天耶，根本不会出太阳了，难道你就一天不开了？\n{守卫：}没办法，我们除了看太阳之外，没有办法知道准确时间。\n{伊娜：}唉，这样吧，送你个沙漏，这样以后你不管晴天阴天都能计时了。\n{守卫：}啊，这正是我们最需要的，太感谢了。\n{伊娜：}然后，现在给我们开门啦。\n{守卫：}是是，没问题，这就开门。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Mr. Orans, I heard that there is a priest here who can treat hydrophobia, is that right?\n{Olens:} Yes, I can indeed help you overcome your fear of water. There is a magic tower in my \"Star Viewing House\", where you can teach {\"Water Walk\"} magic. With that, people can fly like water, and naturally they won't be afraid of water anymore. Unfortunately, it is now occupied by the demons. Did you come here for this? If you take back the stargazing house, I will teach you the \"Water Walk\".\n{Ina:} Uh, it's not that we want to learn, but our angel friend wants to treat hydrophobia and is planning to come to you. But I didn't expect something happened halfway, and the weird person would be caught. But can we also learn? If there is a magic that can walk on water, it would be very convenient.\n{Olens:} Of course you can learn.\n{Ina:} Great. When we drive away the demons and save Roland, we will learn from you together.","{伊娜：}奥兰斯先生，听说这里有一位能治疗恐水症的神官，是这样吗？\n{奥兰斯：}没错，我的确可以有办法帮你们克服对水的恐惧。我的“观星居”里有魔法塔，可以教授{“水行”}魔法，有了那个，人就能步水如飞，自然就不会再怕水了。不过可惜现在被魔族占领了。你们来这里原来是为了这个吗，那正好如果夺回了观星居，我就把“水行”教给你们。\n{伊娜：}呃，其实不是我们想学，是我们那位天使朋友想治疗恐水症所以打算来找您的。不过没想到半路出事，让怪人给抓了。不过，我们也可以学吗？如果有能在水上行走的魔法，倒是很方便耶。\n{奥兰斯：}当然可以学。\n{伊娜：}太好了，等我们赶走魔族，救下罗兰，就一起跟您学。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Mr. Orans, what is the \"source of stars\" you just mentioned?\n{Olens:} That is the relic left by my master, which was refined by the master using the essence of the four elements of air, fire, water, and soil. In fact, I don't know what it looks like, or even where it is. I only know that it must be on the Taslinna Mountains. My master is a highly accomplished priest named Renner. He is particularly good at using magic techniques to treat people's diseases. He is called...\n{Freeman:} Holy Doctor Renner!\n{Olens:} Yes, that's the Holy Doctor Reina. So you guys know it too.\n{Freeman:} The fame of Saint Doctor Reina was still very famous ten years ago. We all know his name there. It's a pity that he passed away too early...\n{Olens:} Master has been busy running around to treat others, overworked, and finally found that he could be cured but he could not be cured. Alas, if I worked hard before and got to the next level in my art studies, I might be able to save Master. It's useless to say these now. Before his death, Master told me that he had buried his research result \"Star Source\" somewhere in the Taslinna Mountains. Master said that \"Star Source\" can bring power to people and must be handed over to just and kind people. Must not fall into the hands of evil. Those guys from the Mozu obviously also heard the news, and wanted me to take them to find it. Then I met you on the road.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be like this, but since you don't know it, why do they want you to find it?\n{Olens:} I don't know what I said, but if they don't believe it, I can't help it. They had no choice but to bite the bullet and leash them out to go around, but they were saved. You seem to be righteous and kind-hearted people. If you can find the \"source of the star\", you may be able to fulfill Master's last wish.","{伊娜：}奥兰斯先生，刚才你所说的“星之源”又是什么呢？\n{奥兰斯：}那是我师父留下来的遗物，师父用气火水土四元之精华提炼而成。其实我并不清楚具体是什么样子的，甚至也不知道在哪里，只知道一定在这塔斯林纳山上。我师父是一个造诣很深的神官，名叫雷纳，他特别擅长用法术为人们治疗疾病，在米尔罗尼亚被称作……\n{弗里曼：}圣医雷纳！\n{奥兰斯：}对对，就是圣医雷纳。原来你们也知道啊。\n{弗里曼：}圣医雷纳的名气在十年前还是很响的。我们那里都知道他的大名。只可惜他过世太早了……\n{奥兰斯：}师父一直忙于东奔西走替人治疗，操劳过度，最后发现治得了别人却治不好自己。唉，我要是以前多多努力，学艺更上一台阶的话，也许还能挽救师父。现在说这些也没有用了。师父临终前，告诉我，他把自己的研究成果“星之源”埋在了塔斯林纳山的某处，师父说，“星之源”可以给人带来力量，要交给正义善良的人，绝不能落入邪恶之手。魔族那些家伙显然也打听到了这个消息，就想让我带他们去找。然后就在路上遇到你们了。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样啊，不过你既然自己也不知道，他们怎么还要你去找？\n{奥兰斯：}我说了我也不知道，可是他们死活不信，我也没办法。只好硬着头皮带他们出来兜圈，还好得救了。你们看起来是正义善良之人，如果你们能找出“星之源”，也许就能了却师父的遗愿呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Mr. Philosopher, look, do these two things work for you?\n{Scholar:} These two are...\n{Ina:} This is the \"character of life\" and the \"character of death\". After wearing it, you can feel the feeling of death and rebirth.\n{Scholar:} Oh, that would be great. I was still wondering if I could only comprehend it after I died, but at that time, even if I realized it, I couldn't publish a paper. I will try it now.\n{Scholar:} Haha, thanks to you, the question that has troubled me for two years has finally been answered. I can go to publish a paper.\n{Ina:} No, there really is an answer? What kind of answer?\n{Scholar:} People live for death, and die for life.\n{Ina:} What kind of answer is this? It feels like I'm playing a word game.\n{Scholar:} It's just that you haven't realized that level yet. Okay, I'm going to open the box the teacher left for me.\n{Ina:} Okay, whatever you want. Anyway, I'm not happy to think about it so complicated. I just think that if I live to be a useful person to others, it's all right.\n{scholar:}?-?-!\n{Ina:} What's wrong?\n{Scholar:} The letter the teacher left me in the box is almost the same as what you just said...How is it possible that I have been studying philosophy for so many years as a scholar, how can I get the answer worse than a layman?\n{Ina:} I just told the truth about my real thoughts, not as complicated as your thinking.\n{Scholar:} But the two pendants you just gave me have clearly made me realize the premise of understanding life and death...\n{Ina:} Those two are just ordinary pendants, I just want you to simulate them, no Thinking of you taking it seriously, you really got the answer...\n{Scholar:} So my answer is also false? What's the problem... By the way, look at the teacher's letter, since you can answer the teacher's question correctly, maybe it can inspire me.\n{Ina:} I may not understand it... Well, philosophy is the knowledge that makes people smart, not the knowledge that shows one's own smartness. Philosophy is the knowledge of serving people, not the knowledge of self-promotion. If you can't keep your feet on the ground and let learning become a useful tool for people, but pursue a theory that seems to be beautiful but illusory, you are going astray. Philosophy that only has a world view without methodology is meaningless. All the roads that a person can walk start from under his own feet. ?a?aVery simple, I thought it would be difficult to understand.\n{Scholar:} Sure enough, I'm still far from the teacher. Anyone can read the articles he wrote, but I can't do it... I decided, I want to learn the teacher's paper from scratch. Thank you for your help. Although it is not direct, it gave me an opportunity to understand the teacher's intentions. This statue \"down to earth\" was left to me by the teacher. I will give you a copy of it as a gift for me.","{伊娜：}哲学家先生，你看，这两件东西，对你有用不？\n{学者：}这两件是……\n{伊娜：}这是“生命之符”与“死亡之符”。戴上之后，能体会到死亡和重生的感觉哦。\n{学者：}哦，那就太好了，我本来还在想，是不是我死了之后才能领悟到，可是那时即使领悟到了我也不能发表论文了。我这就试试。\n\n{学者：}哈哈，托你的福，困扰我两年的问题终于有答案了。我可以去发表论文了。\n{伊娜：}不是吧，真的有答案了？什么样的答案？\n{学者：}人们是为了死而生，为了生而死。\n{伊娜：}这算是什么答案啊，感觉好像是在玩文字游戏嘛。\n{学者：}那只是你还没有领悟到那一层而已。好了，我要打开老师留给我的箱子了。\n{伊娜：}好吧，随你怎么说。反正我可不高兴去想那么复杂。我只是觉得，我活着能成为一个对别人有用的人，就可以了。\n{学者：}……！\n{伊娜：}怎么了？\n{学者：}老师在箱子里留给我的书信，竟然跟你刚才说的差不多……怎么可能，我作为一个学者，研究哲学已经那么多年，怎么可能得到的答案还不如一个外行人？\n{伊娜：}我只是把自己的真实想法照实说出来而已，没像你思考那么复杂。\n{学者：}可是你刚刚给我的两个挂件，明明已经让我体会到了领悟生死的前提……\n{伊娜：}那两个只是普通的挂件啦，我只是想让你模拟一下而已，没想到你直接当真了，还真得到答案了……\n{学者：}所以我的答案也是假的吗？问题到底出在哪里……对了，你看看老师的书信，既然你能答对老师的问题，说不定能给我启发。\n{伊娜：}我可能看不太懂的吧……唔，哲学是使人聪明的学问，而不是显示自己聪明的学问。哲学是为人服务的学问，而不是自我标榜的学问。如果不能脚踏实地，让学问成为对人们有用的工具，而是追求看似美妙实则虚幻的理论，就是走入了歧途。只有世界观没有方法论的哲学是没有意义的。人能走的一切道路，都从自己脚下开始。——很朴实的话耶，我还以为会有多难懂呢。\n{学者：}果然，我离老师还差得很远，他写出来的文章，谁都能读懂，我就做不到……我决定了，我要把老师的论文从头学起。谢谢你给我的帮助，虽然不是直接的，却让我得到了了解老师意图的契机。这座雕像“脚踏实地”是老师留给我的，我将一件复制品送你给好了，当作是我的谢礼。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Next, first, General Bruno wants, or at least wants to help whoever puts you to death; second, General Bruno is a close friend of Archbishop Yingluck; third, Archbishop Yingluck I have always had opinions on you. Fourth, Archbishop Yingluck accused you of treason; therefore, Archbishop Yingluck and General Bruno are also associates, and Archbishop Yingluck wants to put you to death.\n{Freeman:} It's probably because they didn't find my body after the cabin was burned, and they knew that I had escaped. The original attempt to obliterate me through an \"accident\" was not realized, so I took the next move. However, the move to frame me as treason is not as good as the previous move, because many people dare not say, but in their hearts they do not believe that I will treason.","{伊娜：}\n接下来，\n第一，布里诺将军想要，或者至少是想要协助谁置你于死地；\n第二，布里诺将军是英拉大主教的亲信；\n第三，英拉大主教一直对你有意见；\n第四，英拉大主教诬陷你叛国；\n因此，英拉大主教跟布里诺将军也是同伙，英拉大主教想置你于死地。\n{弗里曼：}很可能是当小木屋烧完后，他们没发现我的尸首，才知道我已经逃跑了。原本想通过一起“事故”来抹杀我的企图没有实现，才走了下一步棋。不过诬陷我叛国这一步棋并不如上一步好，因为很多国民虽然嘴上不敢说，但心里并不相信我会叛国。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Next, it's time to start the {Bait Battle}. But first, we must ensure that we will not be trapped, {must have enough feet} {return strength} Oh.","{伊娜：}接下来，就是要启动{诱饵大作战}了。不过首先要保证我们自己不会被困住，{要有足够的脚}\n{力回来}哦。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Next, we are going to stop Solo. Never let him resurrect the \"Sword of Destruction\". Radia, where is Solo, right?\n{Radia:} It must be in his altar now, waiting for the last moment of the resurrection of the \"Sword of Destruction\". The altar is not far to the north. Have you seen that tall building?\n{Ina:} That's right there, well, let's go over. Rael, the \"Dragon King supernatural power\" has been gathered, and your dream can be realized. Will you help us defeat Solo again?\n{Rael:} Isn't that of course. Without your help, I would not be able to obtain the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". Now that the entire continent of Mirronia is in crisis, how could I just ignore it.","{伊娜：}接下来，我们就是要去阻止索罗了。千万不能让他复活“毁灭之剑”。拉迪亚，索罗在什么地方，你知道的吧？\n{拉迪亚：}现在肯定是在他的祭坛里，等着“毁灭之剑”复活的最后时刻了。祭坛就在北边不远，看到那个高大的建筑了吗？\n{伊娜：}就是那里啊，好，我们过去吧。雷尔，“龙王神力”已经凑齐了，你的梦想也可以实现了，你会再帮我们一起打败索罗吗？\n{雷尔：}那不是当然的嘛。如果没有你们的帮助，我不可能得到“龙王神力”，现在米尔罗尼亚整个大陆都遇到了危机，我又怎么可能坐视不理呢。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No more creatures can be involved in the battle. There will be no more conscription here. Let's take a holiday and rest.\n{Subordinate:} But how do you write the weekly conscription report?\n{Ina:} Can't you write it?\n{Subordinate:} No, the system stipulates that you have to write...\n{Ina:} It's really hard to write, so just write some numbers casually.","{伊娜：}已经无法再带更多部队参战了。这里暂停征兵，大家放个假，休息一下吧。\n{部下：}那每周的征兵报告怎么写呢？\n{伊娜：}不能由你来写吗？\n{部下：}不行，制度规定必须由您来写……\n{伊娜：}真麻烦，那就随便填几个数字好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No way, since you can't get through, you have to put you away. Who told you not to appear as a kitten?","{伊娜：}没办法，既然你通不过，就只有把你收起来了。谁叫你不以小猫的形态出现的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, Rael, I seem to have a chill, as if someone is looking at me...\n{Rael:} Danger! Rael hugged Ina and drew aside, an arc of lightning fell from the sky, breaking through a large pit where Ina was standing.\n{Ina:} Phew, it's dangerous. Ah, Rael, where are you hugging...\n{Rael:} Ah, I'm sorry, but I didn't think about the situation too much...\n{Voice:} The action is quite clever, I actually avoided it.\n{Rael:} Who are you?\n{Ina:} Ah, I see it, on it... It's another flying demons, I really hate...\n{Voice:} I'm Demon General Baltz. Although I don't know who you are, but you are actually quite capable, and came here through the portal I opened.\n{Ina:} How about, we came through the portal, what do you want?\n{Bartz:} Of course it is to destroy you, otherwise our secret base here will be exposed.\n{Ina:} It turns out it's just like this. It's great. It seems that you don't know that the \"Longan Ring\" is in our hands. Don't worry.\n{Bartz:} What? \"Longan Ring\" in your hands? Ah ha ha ha, I really don't know, I didn't expect you to be so stupid, just tell it yourself. It's easier to do now, and you can kill two birds with one stone!\n{Ina:} Oops, I accidentally said it... Will I let you succeed so easily? Come if you want to try it.\n{Bartz:} Don't run!","{伊娜：}不好，雷尔，我似乎有一阵寒意，好像有谁在瞄着我……\n{雷尔：}危险！\n\n雷尔一把抱住伊娜往旁边闪开，一弧闪电从天而降，在伊娜原来站立的地方击穿出一个大坑。\n\n{伊娜：}呼，好险。呀，雷尔，你抱住哪里啦……\n{雷尔：}啊，对不起，情况紧急没考虑太多……\n{声音：}动作挺机敏的嘛，居然躲开了。\n{雷尔：}你是谁？\n{伊娜：}啊，看到了，在上面……又是会飞的魔族啊，真讨厌……\n{声音：}我是魔将军巴尔茨。虽然不知道你们是什么人，不过，居然本事挺大的，通过我所开通的传送门追到这儿来了。\n{伊娜：}怎么样啊，我们是通过传送门过来了，你想怎么样？\n{巴尔茨：}当然是消灭你们了，要不然我们设在这里的秘密基地也会暴露。\n{伊娜：}原来只是这样啊，太好了，看来你还不知道“龙眼戒”在我们手上，这下放心了。\n{巴尔茨：}什么？“龙眼戒”在你们手上？啊哈哈哈，我还真是不知道，没想到你居然那么傻，自己说出来。这下好办了，一举两得！\n{伊娜：}糟糕，不小心说出来了耶……我会那么容易让你得手吗？想试试的话就来吧。\n{巴尔茨：}别跑！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, can you really get diamonds? You must have cheated, right? Cheating is a bad boy.","{伊娜：}不是吧，你真的能搞到钻石？你一定作弊了是不是？作弊是坏孩子。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, if you don't kill the captain who will put some explosive bombs, all of our lives will be held in his hands. It's too dangerous to continue walking inside.","{伊娜：}不行，如果不把那个会放什么爆弹的队长干掉，我们所有人的命都被他握在手里，太危险了，不能继续往里走。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, the dragoons who have not eliminated the enemy cannot move forward in a hurry.","{伊娜：}不行，还没有消灭敌人的龙骑兵，不能急着向前走。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, there is absolutely no way to break this barrier. \"Dragon Armor\" should be inside, what should I do.","{伊娜：}不行啊，完全没有办法打破这个结界。“龙甲”应该就在里面吧，该怎么办才好呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} No, there must be a problem here, I have to see what happened. Maybe there are really demons and monsters...\n{Voice:} Someone? Who is there? ......\n{Ina:} Has it been discovered? Hurry and hide...\n{Voice:} Who is there, come out!\n{Ina:} The current situation is unknown, and the opponent doesn't know who it is. What is the strength. It's best not to start the fight. It's good to be able to confuse the past...\n{Voice:} If you don't come out, I'm not welcome!\n{Ina:} Yes, use this! Ina combined the five parts of the \"Warrior Simmons Statue\" to form a warrior statue of equal height. Then he placed it next to the dead tree, deliberately making a noise, and at the same time flashed behind another dead tree.\n{Voice:} So over there, I found you. A green guy with the appearance of a goblin approached and found the statue.\n{Fairy:} So you came here. No one told you that entry is forbidden here?\n{Statue:}... (Of course, the statue can't speak)\n{Fairy:} Why don't you speak?\n{Statue:}... {Fairy:} Is it frightened?\n{Statue:}... {Fairy:} Forget it, you look quite honest, so I'll leave you alive. However, because you have already seen what I look like, you can't let you tell other people, so I will take you to deal with it and delete this memory of you. ——Fortunately, you just rushed to the door. If you go deeper and enter the \"Illusory Realm\", I'm afraid you will die without me.\n{Statue:}... {Fairy:} Don't be afraid, just delete this memory of you, and then you seem to have never been here. Your body will not be harmed. Okay, let's go. The fairy-like guy took the statue away.\n{Ina:} Huh... It seems that there is an article in it... If you go deeper, you will enter a very dangerous place called the \"All Souls Fantasy Realm\"? I'll just be careful...","{伊娜：}不行，这里面一定有问题，我得去看个究竟。搞不好真的有妖魔鬼怪……\n{声音：}有人？谁在那里？……\n{伊娜：}被发现了？快躲起来……\n{声音：}是谁在那里，出来！\n{伊娜：}现在状况不明，对手也不知道是什么人，实力如何，最好不要开打，能瞒混过去就好了……\n{声音：}再不出来，我就不客气了！\n{伊娜：}有了，用这个！\n\n伊娜把“战士西蒙斯像”的五个部件相组合，拼成了一个等高的战士雕像。然后摆放在一边的枯树旁，故意弄出点响声，同时自己闪到另一棵枯树后。\n\n\n{声音：}原来在那边，我找到你了。\n\n一个妖精模样的绿色的家伙走近来，发现了雕像。\n\n{妖精：}原来就是你闯到这里来了。没人告诉过你这里是禁止进入的吗？\n{雕像：}……（当然，雕像是不会说话的）\n{妖精：}怎么不说话？\n{雕像：}……\n{妖精：}难道是吓坏了？\n{雕像：}……\n{妖精：}算了，看你样子挺老实的，就放你一条生路了。不过，因为你已经看到了我的样子，不能让你再去告诉其他人，所以我要把你带去处理一下，删除你的这一段记忆。——幸好你还只是闯到门口而已，如果走深一点，进入“万灵幻境”，只怕不用我出手你早就挂了。\n{雕像：}……\n{妖精：}不用害怕，只是删除你这一段记忆而已，之后你就像是没有来过这里一样。你的身体不会受到伤害的。好了，走吧。\n\n妖精模样的家伙把雕像带走了。\n\n{伊娜：}呼……看起来其中果然有文章……再深入会进入叫做“万灵幻境”的很危险的地方？我小心一点就是了……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now Holia's men will fight when they see us, no matter what. Jack, you say, why is this happening?\n{Freeman:} It feels like a complete declaration of war on us. Could it be because the previous plan to kill two birds with one stone failed, that made you become so embarrassed and angry? It may be possible, but it still feels strange.\n{Ina:} If it doesn't work, we can only kill him all the way.","{伊娜：}现在霍利亚的手下见到我们就打，什么都不管啊。杰克，你说，为什么会这样呢？\n{弗里曼：}感觉上就是完全向我们宣战了的样子。莫非是因为之前一箭双雕的计划失败了，才变得如此恼羞成怒？可能是有这样的可能，不过还是觉得奇怪。\n{伊娜：}真要不行，我们只能一路杀到他那里去了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now I'm all ready. With a sable fur coat, you can go to Snow Mountain Island.\n{Freeman:} According to the information provided by Roddy, if you want to go to Snow Mountain Island, you must pass Zhushan Island first.\n{Ina:} Well, this is the tunnel leading to Zhushan Island. Although it is unfinished, according to Roddy, at least the part leading to Zhushan Island has been completed. Let's go from here now.","{伊娜：}这下准备万全了。有了黑貂皮衣，就可以去雪山岛了。\n{弗里曼：}根据罗迪提供的情报，要去雪山岛的话，必须先经过竹山岛。\n{伊娜：}嗯，这里就是通向竹山岛的隧道没错了。虽然说未完工，不过根据罗迪的说法，至少通向竹山岛的部分已经建成了，我们现在先从这里走啦吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now come back and think about it, Kalidan was disguised by Gals, so some doubts can be eliminated. But there are still no answers to some questions.\n{Freeman:} Why Gals wanted to kill us, and it seemed that his target was only us, which is very strange. In fact, he was lurking by the Queen's side, and he wanted to attack the Queen, and it would be easy to capture this country directly. But he did not do so. He seemed to be just looking at us.\n{Ina:} Anyway, when we go back, we have to tell the queen that Kalidan is Gals.","{伊娜：}现在回过来想想，卡里丹就是加尔斯伪装的，那么可以消除一部分疑点了。但是还是有些问题得不到答案。\n{弗里曼：}加尔斯为什么要杀我们，而且似乎他的目标只是我们而已，这很奇怪。其实他潜伏在女王身边，想对女王下手，直接夺取这个国家简直是轻而易举。可是他却没有这样做。他好像只是瞄着我们来的一样。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，等下我们回去要把卡里丹就是加尔斯的事情告诉女王才好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now that I have arrived at Snow Mountain Island, the next step is to go to the Temple of Mirror to find the Salman father and son who bought the \"Dragon Eye Ring\". Ugh? Why is the eldest sister in front so panicked? A woman rushed towards her, her expression anxious and flustered. When she saw Ina, she had no time to react and ran into each other at once.\n{Ina:} Ouch! pain!\n{Women:} Sorry, sorry! Isn't it hurt?\n{Ina:} I'm all right. Why is the eldest sister running so fast, slipping on the snow, it is easy to wrestle.\n{Women:} Sister is a skier, which is a piece of cake.\n{Ina:} Why is the eldest sister so anxious?\n{Women:} Oh, sister almost forgot, such an important thing. Just now, my sister saw a demon guy sneaking into the Temple of Mirror with a murder weapon.\n{Ina:} Ah, Demon!\n{Rael:} They move so fast...\n{Freeman:} This is bad...\n{Women:} Yes, this is bad. The priest and son are still in the temple, I'm afraid there will be danger. We hurried to inform everyone and let the militia assemble to save the priests and fathers.\n{Ina:} Let's go quickly.\n{Rael:} Hmm. {Women:} Don't go by yourself, it's too daring, the demons are very dangerous...\n{Ina:} Sister is practicing magic, this level is a piece of cake-don't be careful about copying the lines of the eldest sister . In short, it's still a hurry, we'll go first.\n{Women:} Okay, then sister will go to inform others. You have to be very careful and come back alive...","{伊娜：}既然到了雪山岛，下面就是要到镜之神殿去找到购买了“龙眼戒”的萨尔曼父子了。唉？前面的大姐怎么这么慌张？\n\n迎面奔来一个妇女，神情焦急慌乱，看到伊娜时来不及反应，一下子撞在了一起。\n\n{伊娜：}哎哟！痛！\n{妇女：}对不起对不起！没受伤吧？\n{伊娜：}我还好啦。大姐干嘛跑这么快，雪地上滑，很容易摔跤的耶。\n{妇女：}姐是练滑雪的，这点程度小菜一碟啦。\n{伊娜：}大姐为什么这么着急呢。\n{妇女：}唉呀，姐差点忘了，这么重要的事情。刚才姐看到一个魔族的家伙带着凶器偷偷潜入了镜之神殿了。\n{伊娜：}啊，魔族！\n{雷尔：}他们动作真快……\n{弗里曼：}这下糟了……\n{妇女：}是呀，这下糟了。司祭父子还在神殿里面呢，只怕会有危险。我们赶紧去通知大家，让民兵队集合，去救司祭父子。\n{伊娜：}我们赶紧去吧。\n{雷尔：}嗯。\n{妇女：}你们不要自己去啊，太冒失了，魔族很危险的啊……\n{伊娜：}姐是练魔法的，这点程度小菜一碟啦——不当心山寨了一下大姐的台词。总之现在还是赶时间要紧，我们先去了。\n{妇女：}好吧，那么姐再去通知其他人。你们可要千万小心，要活着回来呀……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now we are far away from the base of the Red Sea Fleet. Can they change the uniforms of their soldiers? Take advantage of the good weather now, let it dry, maybe it will be useful in the future.","{伊娜：}现在已经远离了赤海舰队的基地。可以把他们士兵的制服换下来了吧。趁着现在天气好，晾一晾，说不定以后还会有用。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Now we must eliminate the pinates first, and we can't just leave.","{伊娜：}现在我们要先把海盗消灭掉，不能一走了之。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Oh, I forgot to ask what the green heart grass looks like and it came out. What can I do now? But time is very tight, it would be too delay to go back to ask, I still find a way to find it by myself.","{伊娜：}糟了，我忘了问绿心草长什么样子的就出来了，这下可怎么办呢。不过时间很紧张的样子，再回去问就太耽搁了，我还是自己想办法找吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Oh, Roland forgot his sword here.\n{Freeman:} I think he must be too excited, someone can cure the hydrophobia that has plagued him for years. So I made an error while busy.\n{Ina:} What should we do, or else, let's go find him and bring him the sword. The place he is going to is called {Taslinna Mountain}, but where is that place? It is better for us to find someone to ask.","{伊娜：}哎呀，罗兰把他的剑忘在这里了。\n{弗里曼：}我想他一定是太兴奋，有人能治好困扰他多年的恐水症。所以忙中出错。\n{伊娜：}怎么办呢，要不，我们去找他，把剑带给他吧。他要去的地方叫{塔斯林纳山}，不过，那个地方在哪呢？我们找人问问比较好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Oh, no, the magic is lost, I can't use magic anymore...\n{Bruno:} How about? What can you do to challenge me?\n{Raier:} Don't get too proud of yourself, I have one last resort. Rael drew his sword.\n{Bruno:} You? Do you want someone to challenge my army without any magical assistance?\n{Rael:} No, it's up to Ina to deal with you, but...\n{Ina:} Rael, what are you doing? Why use a sword to cut your own hand? Rael opened his arm with a sword, and blood splashed out. Then Rael waved his injured hand, and a burst of blood sprayed around Ina.\n{Rael:} How about Ina, have you recovered?\n{Ina:} Ah, the magic seems to have come back a bit, what's going on?\n{Bruno:} Could it be...\n{Rael:} Radiant Blood. The power possessed by the descendants of Augustine. In my blood mist, the effect of your magic circle is weakened.\n{Bruno:} I didn't expect that there would be people from the glorious saints among you... But what about this? The magic circle is only weakened, and you can't fully restore the mana.\n{Ina:} This is enough, I won't let Rael's blood flow in vain. I'll knock you down just now.","{伊娜：}呜，不行，魔力都流失了，我要使不出魔法了……\n{布里诺：}怎么样？你还有什么本事跟我叫板啊？\n{雷尔：}你别得意得太早，我还有最后一招。\n\n雷尔抽出佩剑。\n\n{布里诺：}你？你想要一个人在没有任何魔法援护的情况下挑战我的军队？\n{雷尔：}不，还是由伊娜来对付你，不过……\n{伊娜：}雷尔，你干什么？为什么用剑割自己的手？\n\n雷尔用剑划开自己的手臂，血飞溅了出来。然后雷尔把受伤的手一挥，一阵血雾洒在伊娜的周围。\n\n{雷尔：}怎么样伊娜，恢复些了吗？\n{伊娜：}啊，魔力好像回来了点，这是怎么回事？\n{布里诺：}难道是……\n{雷尔：}光辉之血。奥古斯丁的后裔所拥有的力量。在我的血雾之间，你的魔法阵的效果就削弱了。\n{布里诺：}没想到你们之中竟然有光辉圣族的人……不过，这又如何？魔法阵只是削弱了而已，你们还不能完全恢复法力。\n{伊娜：}这点足够了，我不会让雷尔的血白流的。就趁现在我就打倒你。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Oh, that small boat, it drove so fast, it disappeared in one shot, how can we keep up...\n{Rael:} But the waterway here is single, and walking along the road should be able to catch him . Anyway, he said that the place he was going to was {Yangfengshanfengjin altar}. At worst, we go there to find him.","{伊娜：}哎呀，那个小艇，飙得真快，一下就没影了，我们怎么可能跟得上嘛……\n{雷尔：}不过这里的水道单一，沿着路走应该能追上他。反正他说过他要去的地方是{迎风山风神坛}。最坏的可能，我们去那里找他。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Oh, what are these guys, grinning, people didn't find them, but they ran into these things.\n{Devil:} Anyone else dare to break here? Kill them!\n{Ina:} Hey, what is going on?","{伊娜：}哎呀，这群家伙是什么，呲牙咧嘴的，人没有找到，却撞上了这些东西。\n{魔鬼：}还有人类敢闯到这里来？杀了他们！\n{伊娜：}喂，这到底是怎么回事？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, I put the book on the magic of water movement here, and the rest is {let Archbishop Yingluck get it} it. It's free, I'm really tireless in teaching people.","{伊娜：}好了，我把写着水行魔法的书放在这里，剩下就是{让英拉大主教拿到}它了。免费的哦，我真是诲人不倦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, Jack, you don't have to send that far. Sister Mengying has returned to Horn Valley, and you should also go back to Kartia to inherit the throne. A brand new country is waiting for you to rebuild. You can't be lazy.\n{Freeman:} Well, then I will go back. Ina, Rael, good luck to you all. My country is about to recover, Rael keep on going.\n{Rael:} Thank you, Jack. Without your help, I wouldn't be here so smoothly. I won't forget you, Jack.\n{Freeman:} What are you talking about, it's not a goodbye. After you have defeated the demons and rebuilt your homeland, you will come to Kartia as a guest. That's a deal.\n{Rael:} Okay, it's settled.\n{Freeman:} Then I'm going back, Rael, Ina, goodbye~~~!\n{Ina:} Goodbye, Jack~~! Be a good king~~!","{伊娜：}好了，杰克，你不用送这么远啦。梦影姐姐已经回到霍恩山谷去了，你也该回去卡尔提亚继承王位了。一个崭新的国家等着你去重建呢，你可不能偷懒了哦。\n{弗里曼：}嗯，那么我就回去了。伊娜，雷尔，祝你们好运。我的国家就要恢复了，雷尔继续加油吧。\n{雷尔：}谢谢了，杰克，没有你的帮助，我也不会那么顺利地来到这里。我不会忘记你的，杰克。\n{弗里曼：}说什么呢，又不是永别。等你打败了魔族，重建了自己的家园之后，还要来卡尔提亚作客哦。说定了。\n{雷尔：}好，说定了。\n{弗里曼：}那么我回去了，雷尔，伊娜，再见~~~！\n{伊娜：}再见，杰克~~！当个好国王~~！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, finally, 8 pieces of \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" have been collected, and only the last piece of \"Dragon Armor\" is left.\n{Freeman:} The \"Dragon Armor\" is already in Solo's hands, which seems to be certain.\n{Ina:} Although I am sure it is in Solo's hands, from the content of the previous conversation between Widow and Spindler: First, none of them mentioned \"Dragon Armor\" at all; second, There is indeed only one \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" in Spin Rodri's hand; thirdly, Spin Rodri laughed at not having one at Vidor, and Widow did not refute it, indicating that the \"Dragon Armor\" would not be in Vidor. In hand. So \"Dragon Armor\" should be somewhere else we don't know.\n{Freeman:} Although the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" has no new clues for the time being, yet another \"green thunder ring\" emerged. It seems that the \"Green Thunder Ring\" has not yet fallen into Solo's hands, we better find it first than Widow.\n{Ina:} Well, we still have a clue about the \"Green Thunder Ring\". Because Victor left from here, although it is only Spien Rodri's personal speculation, Victor should be looking for the \"Blue Thunder Ring\". So it must be right for us to go from here.\n{Rael:} But Widow has already taken a step first, and he probably already knows the location. We are slower than him and know nothing about the location. It is too difficult to find before him.\n{Ina:} I believe there will be a way, and I will work hard.","{伊娜：}好啦，终于，“龙王神力”已经凑齐了8件，只差最后一件“龙甲”了。\n{弗里曼：}“龙甲”已经在索罗的手里，这一点看来是确信无疑。\n{伊娜：}虽然确信在索罗手里，不过，从之前维多与斯拜恩罗德里的谈话内容看：\n第一，他们都一丁点儿也没提到“龙甲”；\n第二，斯拜恩罗德里手里确实只有一件“龙牙项链”；\n第三，斯拜恩罗德里嘲笑维多一件也没有，维多并无反驳，说明“龙甲”也不会在维多手里。\n所以“龙甲”应该是在别的我们未知的地方才是。\n{弗里曼：}虽然“龙王神力”暂时没有新线索，却又冒出来一个“青雷环”。看起来“青雷环”目前还没有落入索罗的手中，我们最好比维多抢先找到。\n{伊娜：}嗯，关于“青雷环”，我们还是有一点线索的。因为维多是从这里走的，虽然只是斯拜恩罗德里的个人推测，不过维多应该是去找“青雷环”了。所以我们从这里走肯定没错。\n{雷尔：}不过维多已经先走一步，而且他很可能已经知道了地点，我们既比他慢，又对地点一无所知，想要比他先找到，难度太大了吧。\n{伊娜：}我相信会有办法，我会努力的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, give it back to you. Thanks to your help this time.\n{Da Wu:} Haha, if you want to thank my lord, why don't you come with something practical, such as cash?\n{Ina:} Cut, still want to blackmail me?\n{Da Wu:} It doesn't matter, this time, forget it, thank you for keeping it until next time this lord will help you again, it will not be too late. Then this lord will leave.","{伊娜：}好了，还给你。这次多亏你帮忙了。\n{达伍：}哈哈，要谢本大人的话，不如来点实际些的，比如现金？\n{伊娜：}切，还想敲诈我？\n{达伍：}也罢也罢，这次就算了，谢礼留着等下次本大人再帮你们忙时再给也不迟。那么本大人就告辞了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, let's follow up for the time being.","{伊娜：}好吧，暂且跟进去看看吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, let's get rid of it.\n{Rael:} But it looks like we have been discovered by them. If we don't want to think of a way, our whereabouts will soon be grasped by them.\n{Ina:} In other words, we will always encounter these monsters in the future?\n{Rael:} Not only these, but also much stronger monsters. I advised you long ago, don't act with me.\n{Ina:} But no matter what, I must help Rael and revive Rael's own country. No matter how difficult it is, I won't shrink back.\n{Rael:} So what can you do next?\n{Ina:} Next time you meet the little monster, defeat him just like just now.\n{Rael:} What if you run into a big monster? You must not be able to beat it.\n{Ina:} Can't you really beat it? Woo, let me think about it again...\n{Rael:} Can you magic?\n{Ina:} No. {Rael:} If you want to fight monsters, it is necessary to learn some magic. Otherwise, you will have no chance of winning when you meet a stronger monster. If you have a chance, you might as well learn a little magic.\n{Ina:} I'm stupid, can I learn it?\n{Rael:} I think Ina is very smart, she knows how to use her strengths to deal with the enemy, she is not stupid at all.\n{Ina:} Ah, it's the first time someone praised me for being smart when I grew up. Then I will work hard, try to learn magic, become a magician, and I will never be afraid of those monsters anymore.\n{Rael:} But at the moment, we still have to find a way to avoid being tracked by the demons.\n{Ina:} Yeah, what should I do?\n{Rael:} Let's dress up in disguise, so maybe they won't recognize it.\n{Ina:} It turns out that you can use a disguise to dress up this way, um, remember it in Ina's omnipotent notebook.","{伊娜：}好了，干掉了。\n{雷尔：}但是看起来我们已经被他们发现了。如果不想想办法的话，我们的行踪很快就会被他们掌握。\n{伊娜：}就是说，以后我们一直会碰到这些怪物了？\n{雷尔：}不止是这些，还会碰到强得多的怪物。我早就劝告过你的，不要跟我一起行动。\n{伊娜：}但是不管怎么样，我一定要帮雷尔，复兴雷尔自己的国家。不管多困难我也不会退缩的。\n{雷尔：}那么你下面有什么办法了吗？\n{伊娜：}下次再碰到小怪物，就像刚才那样打倒他。\n{雷尔：}要是碰到大怪物呢？你肯定打不过的。\n{伊娜：}真的打不过吗？呜，我再想想……\n{雷尔：}你会魔法吗？\n{伊娜：}不会。\n{雷尔：}如果想跟怪物战斗，学一些魔法很有必要。要不然遇到强一些的怪物你就根本没有胜算了。如果有机会，你不如学一点魔法吧。\n{伊娜：}我很笨的，能学吗？\n{雷尔：}我觉得伊娜很聪明哦，懂得用自己的长处去对付敌人，一点都不笨呢。\n{伊娜：}啊，长这么大第一次有人夸我聪明呢。那么我一定会努力的，努力学会魔法，成为一个魔法师，就再也不怕那些怪物了。\n{雷尔：}但是眼下，我们还是得想办法躲避魔族的追踪。\n{伊娜：}是啊，那该怎么办呢？\n{雷尔：}我们乔装改扮吧，这样也许他们就认不出来了。\n{伊娜：}原来可以用乔装改扮这个办法，嗯，记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, let's get rid of their leader, and leave here as soon as we are not found.\n{Jack:} This seems to be a {pass} used by their army.\n{Ina:} Great, take this pass, let's move quickly.\n{Rael:} Where are you going next?\n{Ina:} Of course, to save\n{Nanling Pass}. {Jack:} This idea coincides with me. Now the command of their backing force is paralyzed, and the enemy troops at Nanling Pass hadn't expected it before they got the news. They probably didn't know what was going on when they were going to make surprise attacks at this time.","{伊娜：}好了，干倒了他们的头儿，趁着我们没被发现时赶紧离开这里。\n{杰克：}这个好像是他们军里使用的{通行证}。\n{伊娜：}好极了，这个通行证带上，我们赶紧移动。\n{雷尔：}下一步你要去哪？\n{伊娜：}当然是要去救{南岭关}。\n{杰克：}这个想法跟我不谋而合。现在他们这支绕到背后的接应部队指挥瘫痪，南岭关的敌军还没有得到消息时根本料想不到，这个时候去奇袭，他们恐怕还不知道是怎么回事呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, now disguised as soldiers of the Barland army, go find their headquarters.","{伊娜：}好了，现在化装成巴兰德军的士兵，去寻找他们的指挥部。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, now the 7 parts have also been taken back. Who are you, the counterfeit, quickly confess! Ah, it's revealed!\n{Radia:} Vidor! How can it be! Didn’t you obviously have been killed by me...\n{Vido:} Hmph, it’s all because of your sneak attack that made me spend too much time recovering my life. I used the fake death method. You didn’t expect it...\n{ Radia:} This time I won’t let you feign death again.\n{Vido:} It's no use killing me. The \"Red Star Sword\" that was deceived before was handed over to Lord Solo long ago, and now Lord Solo has gathered all the parts of the \"Sword of Destruction\". Although there is no such powerful sacrifice as the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", it is impossible to complete the release of the seal immediately, but it is only a delay. Lord Solo’s altar is still absorbing energy, and it will be a matter of time before the seal is lifted and the \"Sword of Destruction\" is lifted... However, if you want to kill me, don't you ask if the real Yumekage is still alive?\n{Ina:} Ah, what do you mean?\n{Radia:} Widow has the ability to copy the appearance of others, but the prerequisite for this ability is that he must contact the copied person and the opponent must be in a coma.\n{Rael:} So, the real Mengying seniors are in their hands!\n{Vido:} Hey, do you realize it now... Mengying was locked on this island by me, but I set up a mechanism, and only I can open it. If you kill me, I’m afraid you won’t be able to save her...\n{Radia:} You are still as despicable as you always used to take hostages...\n{Vido:} Alas, I didn’t want to use it. , Who let you beat me. Originally, I only wanted to seize the other 8 parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" from your hands.\n{Ina:} Anyway, there is no way now. We won't kill you. You quickly take us to the place where Mengying sister was imprisoned.\n{Vido:} Of course, don't be so fierce. I will take you there.","{伊娜：}好啦，这下7件部件也夺回来了，你这个冒牌货到底是谁，快坦白！啊，现形了！\n{拉迪亚：}维多！怎么可能！你不是明明已经被我杀死了吗……\n{维多：}哼，都是因为你的偷袭害我多花费了太多时间恢复生命，我用了假死大法，你没料到吧……\n{拉迪亚：}这一次可不会再让你假死了。\n{维多：}你们杀了我也没有用。之前骗到手的“赤星剑”早就交给索罗大人了，现在索罗大人已经凑齐了“毁灭之剑”的全部部件。虽然没有“龙王神力”这样强力的祭品，不能立即完成解除封印，不过也只是推迟一点时间而已。索罗大人的祭坛还在继续吸收能量，解除封印复活“毁灭之剑”是迟早的事情……不过，你们想要杀我，不问问真正的梦影是否健在吗？\n{伊娜：}啊，什么意思？\n{拉迪亚：}维多有复制他人外形的能力，但发挥这个能力的前提是，他必须要接触到被复制的人，并且对方要处于昏迷状态。\n{雷尔：}这么说，真正的梦影前辈在他们手上！\n{维多：}嘿嘿，现在才意识到么……梦影就被我关在这座岛上，不过我设置了机关，只有我能打开。如果你们杀了我的话，恐怕你们就救不了她了……\n{拉迪亚：}你还是一如既往地卑鄙，采用挟持人质这种手段……\n{维多：}唉呀，我本来也不想用的，谁让你们打败了我呢。本来只想从你们手上夺取“龙王神力”的另外8个部件而已。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，现在也没办法了，我们不杀你，你赶紧带我们去梦影姐姐被关押的地方。\n{维多：}当然，不用这么凶嘛。我会带你们去的。\n\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, now we should also look for that {city west direction} change.","{伊娜：}好了，下面我们也该去寻找那个{城西方向}的异动了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, okay, 15,000 gold coins are 15,000 gold coins. I just give it.\n{Reception room guard:} My lord is really refreshing. In the future, adults will surely be able to make progress, and after the adults have developed, they still hope to give more care to the younger ones. Adults, please wait here, and the younger ones will go in and report.","{伊娜：}好吧好吧，15000金币就15000金币。我给就是了。\n{接待室门卫：}大人真是爽快。今后大人一定能平步青云，大人发达了之后还望给小的多点照顾啊。大人请在这里稍等，小的这就进去通报。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Okay, then the goal is clear. Go to {Bataan City} to find {Spain Rodri}. This time we can find the parts of the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" that fell into Solo's hands without the help of Radia. Then go to the seaside {south side} first, and take a boat again>_<","{伊娜：}好，那么接下来目标明确了。去{巴塔安城}找{斯拜恩罗德里}。这次我们不靠拉迪亚帮忙也能自己找到落入索罗手中的“龙王神力”的部件了。那么先去{南边}的海边吧，又要坐船了>_<\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Or, I will share my blood with you?\n{Mondo:} No, then you will die. If you dare to do this, I will kill myself immediately!","{伊娜：}要不，我把自己的血分给你吧？\n{蒙多：}不行，这样你会死的。你要是敢这么做我马上自尽！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Our top priority is to find Kairon first, not to let the \"Dragon Shield\" fall into the hands of the demons.","{伊娜：}我们的当务之急还是先去找到凯隆，不能让“龙盾”落入魔族手中。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Passed through the \"death triangle\" safely. Sure enough, he did not encounter sea monsters and aliens. So it seems that this is the devil world, right?\n{Freeman:} Presumably this should be the case. But I have never been to the Demon World, and I have never seen a description in the book, so I can't tell.\n{Rael:} I have heard a little legend. Because my ancestors had fought with the demons and invaded the demons in the continent of Aryania. It is said that the sky in the Demon World is red, and the ground is mostly rocky and barren, with a lot of magma and very little soil.\n{Ina:} The sky is really red. It seems to be correct. However, according to Rael, the environment is terrible, how can the demons survive? You can't even grow food.\n{Rael:} I don't know this anymore.\n{Freeman:} Let's find a place to log in first. Then investigate the surrounding environment and what we are looking for.","{伊娜：}平安地穿过了“死亡三角”了。果然没有遇到海怪和异星人。那么看来这里就是魔界了吧？\n{弗里曼：}推测应该是如此了。不过我从没到过魔界，也没在书上看到过描述，所以无法断定。\n{雷尔：}我倒是听过一点传说。因为我的先祖在亚利安尼亚大陆曾经与魔族交战并攻入过魔界。据说魔界的天空是红色的，地面多为岩石的不毛之地，多岩浆，土壤极少。\n{伊娜：}天空真的是红色的耶。看来是没错了。不过，如果照雷尔所说，那么这个环境很糟糕耶，魔族们怎么生存呢？连粮食都种不了。\n{雷尔：}这我就不知道了。\n{弗里曼：}我们先找到地方登陆吧。然后再调查周围的环境，以及我们要找的东西。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, I finally got my wallet back. However, how could there be a war suddenly? No wonder Auntie Anne's famous clothing store has fewer customers. What's going on.\n{Rael:} If you don't know, I, someone from afar, doesn't even know.\n{Ina:} Anyway, let's go to {Kartia City} and ask.\n{Rael:} But the trouble is, we may often encounter Barland's army below.\n{Ina:} If you meet, beat them. Looking at that Qiu Ba just now, he knew that he was not a good person, and he actually plundered civilians. Barland's soldiers are badass! Our soldiers in Kartia treat the common people kindly, so they won't be as virtuous as him.","{伊娜：}呼，总算把钱包给夺回来了。不过，怎么会突然就发生战争了。难怪安妮大婶小有名气的服装店顾客少了许多。这到底是怎么回事啊？\n{雷尔：}如果你都不知道，我这个从远方来的人就更不知道了。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，我们还是先去{卡尔提亚城}问问吧。\n{雷尔：}但是麻烦的是，下面我们可能会经常跟巴兰德的军队遇上。\n{伊娜：}如果遇上了，就揍他们。看刚才那个丘八就知道他不是好人，居然掠夺平民。巴兰德的军人是坏蛋！我们卡尔提亚的军人待老百姓可亲切了，才不会像他那样的德性呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, I finally rushed out of the woods. Woo, my hair burned a lot...\n{Freeman:} It's not bad to be able to come out alive. This wood is really a good place for fire attacks.\n{Ina:} Fire attack? You mean, this fire was deliberately set?\n{Freeman:} The rainy season has just passed, and now the weather is not dry at all, and it is impossible to catch a fire naturally.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be so, quickly remember it in the little Ina universal notebook. But who was it that set the fire?\n{Freeman:} I always feel that this matter is a bit similar to the last time I was attempted to burn to death.\n{Ina:} Is it Archbishop Yingluck? No, he shouldn't care about Solandria's side...\n{Freeman:} What I said was similar, not that the mastermind was the same person, but that the course of the incident was more similar. First, falsely and beautifully lured back to Wangcheng, and then started halfway.\n{Ina:} Ah, so to speak, is it Holia?\n{Freeman:} Judging from the current situation, he is probably right. Perhaps it was found that we could not be destroyed by force, so I came up with this strategy again. Holia, this person is really very mindful.\n{Ina:} Too bad, he really lied to us! Go find him to settle the account.\n{Freeman:} Wait, we are now rushing over with a big fanfare, I'm afraid we will be chased and killed again. Besides, whether Holia wants to harm us, there is not enough evidence, it is just my speculation. I have an idea. Since we have escaped from the woods and no one else has seen it, we simply pretend to be burned to death, and then sneak into Intasia quietly, and then see what Horia reacted. If it was his hand, he would definitely reveal it.\n{Ina:} Good idea, Jack, you are really good.","{伊娜：}呼，总算冲出树林了。呜，我的头发都烧糊了好多根……\n{弗里曼：}能活着出来就算不错啦。这片树林真是火攻的好场所啊。\n{伊娜：}火攻？你是说，这火是有人故意放的？\n{弗里曼：}雨季才过了不久，现在天气一点都不干燥，自然起火根本不可能。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样，赶紧记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上。不过，放火的又是谁呢？\n{弗里曼：}我总觉得，这个事情，跟我上一次被人企图放火烧死有点相像。\n{伊娜：}难道是英拉大主教？不对，他应该管不到索兰德里亚这边吧……\n{弗里曼：}我说的相像，不是说主谋是同一人，只是说这个事件的经过比较像。先是假意美言引诱回王城，然后半路下手。\n{伊娜：}啊，这么说，是霍利亚？\n{弗里曼：}从目前的情况来看，多半是他没错了。也许是发现用武力剿灭不了我们，所以又想出了这个计谋。霍利亚这个人，还真是很有心眼。\n{伊娜：}太坏了，他果然是骗我们的！去找他算帐去。\n{弗里曼：}等等，我们现在大张旗鼓地冲过去，只怕又要引来追杀了。何况现在是不是霍利亚想害我们，还没有足够的证据，仅仅是我的推测而已。我有一个想法，既然现在我们逃出树林也没有其他人看见，我们干脆就假装是被烧死了，然后悄悄地潜入因塔西亚，然后看看霍利亚是什么反应。如果是他下的手，他一定会露馅的。\n{伊娜：}好主意，杰克你真厉害。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, finally broke through the ambush...\n{Freeman:} Are you all right?\n{Rael:} I'm okay, where's Lord Kalidan?\n{Freeman:} Huh? Where is Lord Kalidan?\n{Ina:} I didn't notice it either. I don't know when it disappeared...\n{Freeman:} This is bad, what should we do, should we move on or go back to find him?\n{Ina:} Of course it is {forward}. If he is behind us, at least the place we walked is safe. I'm afraid that he will walk faster than us, and that would be in danger.","{伊娜：}呼，终于突破了埋伏了……\n{弗里曼：}大家没事吧？\n{雷尔：}我没事，卡里丹大人呢？\n{弗里曼：}唉？卡里丹大人在哪？\n{伊娜：}我也没注意到，不知什么时候不见了的……\n{弗里曼：}这下糟了，我们怎么办，是继续向前还是回去找他？\n{伊娜：}当然是{向前}了，如果他在我们后面，至少我们走过的地方也是安全的。就怕他比我们走快了，那就有危险了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, finally rushed over. It turns out that the dragon is so powerful that even the magic is useless.\n{Rael:} Do you want to keep going forward?\n{Ina:} Of course, never do or stop.","{伊娜：}呼，终于冲过来了，原来龙那么厉害，连魔法都没效。\n{雷尔：}还要继续向前闯吗？\n{伊娜：}当然了，一不做二不休。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, it's finally out. But what is this place?\n{Freeman:} I don't know this place...\n{Ina:} But anyway, after leaving the cursed place, you can use the magic of returning to the city. Let's go back to the city of Kozia. Oh, wait!\n{Raier:} The \"Dragon King Divine Power\" detector reacted.\n{Ina:} It seems that there should be parts of \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" nearby. Sorry Jack, Rael and I are going to find the parts of \"Dragon King Divine Power\". I will use magic to send you back first.\n{Freeman:} No, I'll go together too. Now Archbishop Yingluck must be looking for us everywhere, and I am afraid that he will be in his arms when returning to Kozia City, so it is better to go to other places to avoid the limelight.","{伊娜：}呼，终于出来了。不过这里是什么地方啊？\n{弗里曼：}我不认识这个地方……\n{伊娜：}不过不管怎么说，离开了诅咒之地，就可以使用回城魔法了。我们回到科齐亚城去吧。唉，等等！\n{雷尔：}“龙王神力”的探测仪有反应了。\n{伊娜：}看来这里附近应该有“龙王神力”的部件。对不住杰克，我跟雷尔要去找“龙王神力”的部件了。我用魔法先送你回去吧。\n{弗里曼：}不用，我也一起去好了。现在英拉大主教一定在四处找我们，回科齐亚城恐怕会正中他的下怀，不如就去其他地方避避风头好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, knock down this demons, it's not amazing at all. Are you all right?\n{Yuni:} No...It's okay...\n{Brother Uni:} Thank you for your help, I thought I was going to die...\n{Ina:} Hey, the performance is all messed up, what should I do now? I don't know how to apologize...\n{Brother Youni:} It's not your fault. It was your bravery that prevented us from being hurt.\n{Ina:} That... I am embarrassed to ask, can you sign me? ...\n{Unidi:} No problem.\n{Rael:} Well, excuse me, Ina, should we leave for the Li Qide family?\n{Ina:} Well, sign and leave.\n{Brother Youni:} Huh? Are you looking for a pig head family?\n{Ina:} Huh? Even you call them the pig head family? How did they offend everyone?\n{Brother Youni:} We did not give the name of the pig head family, but they themselves hung on the plaque at the house. If you see it, you will know.\n{Rael:} Someone else would put such a name on their door? It's incredible.\n{Freeman:} Was it someone's prank? It can be seen that the people here are very dissatisfied with the Li Qide family. There should be some reasons, right?\n{Brother Uni:} You are from a different place. There is indeed a reason for it, so I will tell you about it. The pig head family, ah no, the Li Qide family is a stingy family of iron roosters. Obviously doing business has made a fortune, but he has no ethics at all. This starts with the tsunami that occurred in our area two years ago. Many places in Belentania East were submerged in that tsunami, tens of thousands of people were affected, so many people died, and so many people were left homeless.\n{Rael:} Is it the place we just passed by? The houses there are very simple.\n{Unidie:} If you enter Belentania from the east, you are right there.\n{Brother Uni:} After the tsunami, the people of Solandria had money and made great efforts. Everyone enthusiastically donated money to help the reconstruction of the disaster area. But as Solandria's richest person, he may also be one of the top richest people in all of Mirronia, and he didn't even donate a copper plate. Fortunately, an anonymous person later donated 1 million gold coins to help the disaster-stricken area tide over the difficulties.\n{Unidie:} In the face of everyone's doubts, the head of the house, Rod Richide, actually publicly stated that his land was not affected by the disaster, so why should he donate?\n{Ina:} This is really shameful...\n{Brother Uni:} Yes, so from then on, the people of Berentania looked down on their family.\n{Rael:} It turns out that there is such a thing, then the people will be so disgusted with them, it is understandable.\n{Brother Uni:} But, what are you going to find them?\n{Ina:} We are just here to discuss a business.\n{Brother Uni:} Did you make an appointment last month?\n{Ina:} Nothing. Still need an appointment?\n{Unidi:} You can't see them without making an appointment, you will be closed doors.\n{Ina:} No, we are buyers, do we have to make an appointment?\n{Brother Uni:} No way, their jewelry is indeed very popular. It can be said to be the best in Mirronia. There are many rare treasures except their family, you can't find it anywhere else.\n{Ina:} That's not easy. Why don't we make an appointment now?\n{Brother Youni:} Now you have to wait at least ten days and a half for an appointment before you can see it. Why don't I take you in through the side door? Our brothers walked past their house to perform, knowing that they have a side door, and the doorman over there is also our brother's dance fan. He will not embarrass us. If you go in with us, there should be no problem. After you go in, you can directly see their young master Roddy Richide-this young man has just recently taken over the family business from the old man.\n{Ina:} I'm sorry to trouble you like this...\n{Unidi:} It's okay, just treat it as our gratitude for saving our lives.\n{Brother Uni:} Yes, let's set off when we are ready. Their home is {northwest of here}, from here {to the west}, then {crossing a river in the north}, and they are there. The side door we are going to walk through is at the {east side of the river} position.","{伊娜：}呼，把这个魔族打倒了，一点都不厉害嘛。你们没事吧？\n{尤尼弟：}没……没事……\n{尤尼兄：}谢谢你们相救，还以为要送命了……\n{伊娜：}哎，演出全给搞砸啦，这下怎么办哪。我都不知道该怎么道歉好了……\n{尤尼兄：}这不是你们的错啊。倒是你们见义勇为才阻止了我们受到伤害。\n{伊娜：}那个……很不好意思地问，能不能给我签个名啊？……\n{尤尼弟：}没问题啊。\n{雷尔：}那个，打扰一下，伊娜，我们该动身去找李奇德家族了吧？\n{伊娜：}嗯，签好名就走。\n{尤尼兄：}嗯？你们要找猪头世家？\n{伊娜：}咦？连你们都叫他们猪头世家？他们到底怎么得罪大家了？\n{尤尼兄：}猪头世家这名号可不是我们起的，是他们自己挂在家门牌匾上的哦。你要是看到了就会知道了。\n{雷尔：}还有人会在自己家门上挂这样的名称？太不可思议了吧。\n{弗里曼：}是不是谁的恶作剧呢。看得出来，这里的民众对李奇德家族很不满意，应该是有什么原因的吧？\n{尤尼兄：}你们是外地来的啊，说起来确实是有原因的，我就给你们讲讲吧。猪头世家，啊不，李奇德家族，是个吝啬得要死的一毛不拔的铁公鸡家族。明明做生意发了大财，却一点都没公德心。这要从前两年我们这一带发生的大海啸说起。贝伦塔尼亚东这好多地方在那次海啸中被淹没了，数万人受灾，那么多人死去，那么多人无家可归。\n{雷尔：}是不是就是我们刚才经过的地方呢，那里的房屋都非常简陋。\n{尤尼弟：}如果你们是从东边进入贝伦塔尼亚的话，就是那里没错了。\n{尤尼兄：}那次大海啸过后，全索兰德里亚的民众，有钱出钱有力出力，大家都踊跃捐款帮助灾区重建。可是作为索兰德里亚最富有，在全米尔罗尼亚可能也是名列前茅的大富豪，竟然一个铜板都没捐。幸好后来有一位匿名人士捐了100万金币，才让灾区渡过了难关。\n{尤尼弟：}面对大家的质疑，当家的罗德·李奇德居然公开表示，他家的地没有受灾，凭什么要捐款。\n{伊娜：}这，真是太不像话啦……\n{尤尼兄：}是啊，所以打从那时起，贝伦塔尼亚的民众就看不起他们家族了。\n{雷尔：}原来有这样的事情，那么民众会如此反感他们，也就可以理解了。\n{尤尼兄：}不过，你们要去找他们，是有什么事呢？\n{伊娜：}我们只是来谈一桩生意的。\n{尤尼兄：}上个月你们有预约过吗？\n{伊娜：}没有耶。还需要预约的？\n{尤尼弟：}不预约的话是没法见到他们的，你们会吃闭门羹。\n{伊娜：}不是吧，我们是买家耶，这也要预约？\n{尤尼兄：}没办法，他们的珠宝确实很吃香，可以说是米尔罗尼亚最上乘的，有不少奇珍异宝除了他们家族，别处你根本找不到。\n{伊娜：}那不好办啊，要不现在我们去预约？\n{尤尼兄：}现在预约也要至少再等个十天半个月才能见得到。不如我带你们从旁门进去吧。我们兄弟以前进过他们府第演出的，知道他们有个旁门，那边的看门的人也是我们兄弟的舞迷，他不会为难我们。如果你们跟我们一起进去，应该没问题。等进去之后，你们就可以直接见到他们当家的少主罗迪·李奇德了——这个年轻人最近刚刚从老头子手里接过家业。\n{伊娜：}这样麻烦你们，真是不好意思呢……\n{尤尼弟：}没关系，就当作是我们对救命之恩的谢礼好了。\n{尤尼兄：}对，准备好了我们就出发吧。他们家在{这里的西北边}，从这里{向西}，然后{渡过北边一条河}，就到了。我们要走的旁门在{河的东边}位置。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Phew, thanks to the use of magic, I finally won. But why did I only use magic once? I would also like to give them a flash of lightning for each of them, and it can be easily solved.\n{Rael:} Because your {magic value} is exhausted. You have just started to learn magic, and the magic power is still very weak. After you gradually become stronger after training, the magic value will be more.\n{Ina:} So what should I do now, if I run into 2 more swordsmen, I will lose if I can't use magic.\n{Rael:} It's okay, if you can find {Magic Well} and drink a water from the Magic Well, you can regain full magic power. If there is nothing to replenish the mana, it will naturally restore 1 point of mana every day.\n{Ina:} It takes only 1 point to recover in a day, which is too slow. I'll look for the magic well. By the way, write down the knowledge of magic.","{伊娜：}呼，幸亏使用了魔法，总算赢了。但是为什么刚才我只能用一次魔法呢？我还想给他们2个人一人一下闪电，就可以轻松解决呢。\n{雷尔：}因为你的{魔法值}消耗完了。你刚刚开始学魔法，魔力还很弱，以后经过锻炼慢慢变强了之后，魔法值会更多的。\n{伊娜：}那么我现在该怎么办，如果再碰到2个剑士，我用不了魔法的话就输了啦。\n{雷尔：}没关系，如果能找到{魔井}，喝一口魔井的水，就可以恢复满魔力。如果没有东西可以补充魔力的话，每天也会自然恢复1点魔力的。\n{伊娜：}1天才恢复1点，太慢啦。我还是找找魔井吧。顺便把魔力的知识记下来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Quickly check the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" again.","{伊娜：}快把“龙王神力”再确认一下啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Rael is still waiting, let's go to Holia and ask for {\"Fire Spirit Orb\"}.","{伊娜：}雷尔还在等着，我们赶紧去找霍利亚要{“火灵珠”}吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Rael, I've been thinking all the way, that Archbishop Yingluck, what kind of medicine is sold in the gourd, and why he did so many strange things. For a while, he slandered Jack for treason, and for a while, the army was transferred away regardless of the ordinary people, so that even the robbers dared to dominate in broad daylight. He didn't say anything when he was beaten by the Barland army before, but after we helped him drive the Barland army away, he became angry.\n{Rael:} I don't know more than you at the moment. I only know that he is a man with a lot of power. Even Jack was afraid of him before. Such a powerful person, when the country is in turmoil, if they want a coup, it is also a possibility.\n{Ina:} What is the coup?\n{Rael:} A coup is the seizure of state power through means other than the law. Of course, this is just a guess, the specific situation, when we find Jack, we may be able to ask more information.\n{Ina:} Take notes. In short, now I think that Archbishop Yingluck does not look like a good person.","{伊娜：}雷尔，我一路上一直在想，那个英拉大主教，到底葫芦里卖的什么药，为什么会做出那么多奇怪的事情来。一会儿诬蔑杰克叛国，一会儿又不管老百姓死活地把军队都调走，弄得连强盗都敢在光天化日之下横行霸道。之前被巴兰德军打的时候他怎么一点都不作声，我们帮他把巴兰德军赶走之后，他却神气起来了。\n{雷尔：}我目前了解的情况并不比你多，只知道他是一个重权在握的人，之前连杰克都惧怕他。这样手握重权的人，在国家动荡的时候，如果想要政变，也是一种可能性。\n{伊娜：}政变是什么？\n{雷尔：}政变，就是通过法律以外的手段夺取国家政权。当然这只是一种猜测了，具体的情况，等我们找到了杰克，也许能问到更多的消息。\n{伊娜：}笔记笔记。总之，现在我觉得，那个英拉大主教，看上去不像个好人。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Rael, Jack, you are here too.\n{Rael:} Although we found the pier, these guards wouldn't let us pass.\n{Freeman:} No one is allowed to go to sea on the tribute day.\n{Ina:} Hey, look at me.\n{Guard:} I said you can't go to sea.\n{Ina:} The village chief asked me to bring you this souvenir.\n{Guard:} Huh? It turned out to be so. Then please pass.\n{Rael:} Wow, that's great, Ina is getting more and more capable. How did you do it?\n{Ina:} I'll talk to you slowly later. Let's go first.","{伊娜：}雷尔，杰克，你们也在这儿呀。\n{雷尔：}虽然找到了码头，可是这些守卫怎么也不让我们通过。\n{弗里曼：}说什么贡礼日的，什么人都不许出海。\n{伊娜：}嘿嘿，看我的。\n{守卫：}我说过了不能出海的。\n{伊娜：}村长让我把这个手信带给你们。\n{守卫：}啊？原来是这样。那么请通过吧。\n{雷尔：}哇，好厉害，伊娜越来越能干了。怎么做到的？\n{伊娜：}这个等下慢慢跟你们说。我们先走。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Rael, Rael, are you okay?\n{Rael:} I'm fine. It's just that Lingbi's magic power is too strong and consumes too much physical energy, so just take a rest.\n{Freeman:} The wound has been simply bandaged, and the blood has stopped. They are all traumas and there is no danger.\n{Rael:} As a soldier, I have experienced many life-to-death struggles, and now this injury is really nothing. I remembered that when General Gelong took me out of the demon ambush, I was covered with sword wounds...\n{Ina:} But, why did you suffer such injuries deliberately? I deliberately asked me to use them. Stronger magic?\n{Freeman:} Because, blood is needed, right?\n{Rael:} Well, the spiritual wall that protects the tower is maintained by the energy of countless dead spirits absorbed by it, so it has a very strong evil spirit. And \"brilliant blood\" is an effective means to crack it. The reason why you want to use a stronger magic again is because the moment when it shows its visible appearance after rebounding the magic attack, it is also when it is at its weakest, and I just want to seize this time to break it.\n{Ina:} \"Glory Blood\"...Ah, I remembered that during the battle with Bruno, Rael also used his blood to weaken the evil mist so that I could use magic. That's why you refused to tell me the method before, it turned out to be the case!\n{Rael:} If I told you in advance, you won't be able to do it, right?\n{Ina:} Well, people don't want Rael to be injured...\n{Freeman:} But this time it's different. This time Rael's eyes have a light that they haven't seen before. What is that?\n{Rael:} I don't know this either. But it seems that in this situation, my \"Sky Sword\" will be stronger than usual.\n{Ina:} Heavenly Sword, is it the name of your sword? I have never heard of it.\n{Rael:} No, this is the name of the sword move, the sword technique passed down by our family, the ultimate meaning of the Augustine family. If you want to learn, I can teach you later. However, it takes a considerable degree of swordsmanship to practice well. I have been practicing since I was five years old.\n{Ina:} Uh, forget it, I'm not a martial artist at all, although watching Rael's move I think it's very handsome-after all, Rael, you don't want to hurt yourself like this in the future.\n{Rael:} There is no one who is stumbling and tumbling on the battlefield without being injured. Don't care so much-ah, there is a figure in front of him, catch up with him.","{伊娜：}雷尔，雷尔，你不要紧吧？\n{雷尔：}我，没事。只是灵壁的魔力太强，消耗了太多体力，休息一下就好了。\n{弗里曼：}伤口已经简单包扎过了，血止住了，都是外伤，不会有什么危险。\n{雷尔：}作为一个战士，经历过多少出生入死的搏斗，现在这点伤真的不算什么了。想起格隆将军带着我从魔族的伏击中杀出重围的那时，浑身都是刀剑伤呢……\n{伊娜：}可是，你为什么要故意受这样的伤呢，故意要我使出更强的魔法？\n{弗里曼：}因为，需要血吧？\n{雷尔：}嗯，保护那个塔柱的灵壁是靠它吸收的无数死灵的能量维持的，所以有着很浓重的邪气。而“光辉之血”是破解它的有效手段。之所以要你再用一次更强的魔法，是因为它在反弹魔法攻击后，显出可视外形的那个瞬间，也是它最薄弱的时候，而我就是要抓住这个时间来打破它。\n{伊娜：}“光辉之血”……啊，我想起来了，跟布里诺交战时，雷尔也用自己的血削弱了邪雾让我可以使用魔法。所以你之前才不肯告诉我方法，原来是这样！\n{雷尔：}如果我事先告诉了你，你会下不了手吧？\n{伊娜：}唔，人家也不想雷尔受伤嘛……\n{弗里曼：}不过这次又不一样，这次雷尔的眼睛里有出现了之前没见过的光芒，那是什么？\n{雷尔：}这个我也不清楚。但是好像在这种情形下，我的“天霄剑”会比平时更强。\n{伊娜：}天霄剑，是你这把剑的名字吗？我还从没听过呢。\n{雷尔：}不，这是剑招的名字，是我们家传的剑法，奥古斯丁家族的最终奥义。如果你们想学，以后我可以教你们。不过想练好需要相当程度的剑术功底，我是从五岁就开始练习了。\n{伊娜：}呃，算了算了，我可完全不是习武的料，虽然看雷尔出招觉得很帅——话说回来，雷尔，你以后可不要再这样随便弄伤自己了。\n{雷尔：}战场上跌爬滚打的，哪有不受伤的。别那么在意了——啊，前面有个人影，快追上他。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Rael, do you find it a little strange?\n{Rael:} Yes, this should be the territory of the Trifia Kingdom, but it is in a mess, and it looks like a land without jurisdiction.\n{Ina:} There are ruins everywhere, and no residents can be seen. I hope Jack is okay.","{伊娜：}雷尔，你觉不觉得有点奇怪？\n{雷尔：}是啊，这里应该是特里菲亚王国的领土，可是却一片狼藉，看上去根本像是无人管辖之地。\n{伊娜：}到处是一片废墟，也看不到有居民。希望杰克没事才好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Said it was east-south, but I don't know how far. Let's ask someone to ask. ?a?aHello this aunt, how far is Black Wind Valley?\n{Passerby:} There is still a long way to go. Are you going to Black Wind Valley? I don't want to live, I will be eaten by the black dragon.","{伊娜：}说是东偏南方向，但是却不知道多远。我们找个人问问吧。——这位大妈您好，请问黑风谷还有多远？\n{路人：}还有好一段路呢。你们要去黑风谷？不想活啦，会被黑龙吃掉的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Seeing another one, what is this guy looking for?\n{Demon Scout:} Huh, human? I was found...\n{Ina:} Do you want to escape again?\n{Mozu Scout:} Escape? Don't think Lao Tzu is so useless! Since it was discovered, I will kill you!","{伊娜：}又看到一个，这家伙在找什么？\n{魔族侦察员：}啊，人类？被发现了……\n{伊娜：}难道又想逃跑？\n{魔族侦察员：}逃跑？别把老子想得这么窝囊！既然被发现了，就杀了你们！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Since the guards of this cave are the minions of Archbishop Yingluck, it is certain that everything here is related to Archbishop Yingluck. What I want to know now is what important things are hidden in this hole so deep.\n{Freeman:} The most powerful elites in the \"Black Tiger Agent Team\" are also gathered here, and they even carry secret weapons...\n{Rael:} So that's really important, but...\n{Ina:} But? {Rael:} Ina, think about it, if it were you, would you entrust your most important things to someone else?\n{Ina:} Well, no, of course I watched it closely...Ah! Rael meant that Archbishop Yingluck himself would be here?\n{Rael:} I think this is very possible.\n{Ina:} Then, let's take this opportunity to defeat him in one fell swoop! I am much better than when I met him last time.\n{Freeman:} You can be much stronger, and so can Archbishop Yingluck, and he has frequent contact with the demons, and the skills he can master far surpass ours. I think it is better for us not to be too confident.\n{Rael:} And this is the other side's territory, maybe there will be some institutions, the other side knows everything here, but we don't know anything.\n{Ina:} Huh? Neither of you believe that I can beat him. Even if he is very powerful, if we use our brains, we still have a chance. Many of the opponents we have encountered before seemed to be very powerful, but we also defeated them in the end. Could it be that we got here so easily, can't we go back now?\n{Freeman:} Let's vote, for those who are in favor of moving forward, and those who are opposed to moving forward. one two Three!\n{Ina:}... {Rael:}...\n{Freeman:} All three are palms, so let's move on.\n{Ina:} Well, thank you for your trust in me.","{伊娜：}既然守卫这个地洞的是英拉大主教的爪牙，那么这里的事情都与英拉大主教有关是确信无疑了。现在我想要知道的是，这个地洞这么深，里面到底藏着什么重要的东西。\n{弗里曼：}“黑虎特工队”中最强悍的精英也云集于此了，甚至还携带了秘密武器……\n{雷尔：}这么说来，真是非常重要的东西了，不过……\n{伊娜：}不过？\n{雷尔：}伊娜，你想想，如果是你，你会把自己最重要的东西托付给别人代管吗？\n{伊娜：}唔，不会，当然是自己紧紧地看着了……啊！雷尔的意思是说，英拉大主教本人也会在这里面？\n{雷尔：}我觉得这是非常有可能的。\n{伊娜：}那么，我们趁这个机会一举打倒他！现在的我可比上一次遇到他时强多了。\n{弗里曼：}你可以强多了，英拉大主教同样也可以，而且他跟魔族频繁接触，能掌握的技术远胜过我们。我觉得我们还是不要太过自信比较好。\n{雷尔：}而且这里是对方的地盘，说不定会有什么机关，对方对这里的一切都了如指掌，我们却一无所知。\n{伊娜：}唉？你们两个都不相信我能打败他啊。就算他很厉害，如果我们动动脑筋，还是有机会的啊，以前我们遇到过的很多对手不都是看似很强大，最后也被我们战胜了嘛。难道，我们好容易走到了这里，现在就打退堂鼓回去不成？\n{弗里曼：}我们表决吧，赞成继续向前走的出手心，反对继续向前走的出手背。一，二，三！\n{伊娜：}……\n{雷尔：}……\n{弗里曼：}三个都是手心，那么我们继续向前吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯，谢谢你们对我的信任啦。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Since this place is called \"Longya Mountain\", does it have anything to do with \"Dragon King Divine Power\"?\n{Rael:} There are many places in the name of dragon. We also have many in Aryania. It doesn't necessarily matter.\n{Ina:} Yes, the detector doesn't respond at all, it's because I'm too sensitive.","{伊娜：}这个地方既然叫“龙牙山”，那么跟“龙王神力”会不会有什么关系？\n{雷尔：}以龙为名的地名多着呢。我们亚利安尼亚也有不少。不见得是有什么关系。\n{伊娜：}也是，探测仪一点都没有反应，是我太敏感了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying is so powerful, the guard put it in without even asking...Well, Melia is the name of Sister Mengying?\n{Mengying:} That is my real name. Mengying is just my name. Except for the people in Tianchi Mountain, I am afraid that no one knows my real name anymore, I really miss it...","{伊娜：}梦影姐姐好厉害，门卫连问都不问就放进了……那个，梅丽亚是梦影姐姐的名字？\n{梦影：}那才是我的本名。梦影只是我的法号而已。除了天池山的人之外，恐怕已经没有人知道我的本名了吧，真是怀念……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying is such a good person. If she comes later, maybe we will be killed by the assassin in a dream someday.\n{Rael:} But how did she know that we got the \"Red Star Sword\", and how did she know that we were here, and actually came to us in person...\n{Freeman:} We never told anyone, Knowing that we got the \"Red Star Sword\", apart from Solo and his subordinates, there shouldn't be anyone else, right?\n{Rael:} The last time we told us the news was also from Toroland, what kind of wind was blowing this time for her to come in person, and she came to the Demon Realm?\n{Ina:} What are you thinking, do you suspect that Mengying's sister is Solo's subordinate? Isn't this possible? If so, why did she help us make the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" detector? Can't you just do it for Solo?\n{Rael:} It really doesn't make sense. But just now, she always felt a bit weird, and after taking the sword, it flashed in a hurry, always feeling something was wrong.\n{Ina:} So, I really feel a little strange. When I gave the sword to her just now, I somehow hesitated, maybe it was instinct.\n{Rael:} Here comes again, still intuition...\n{Ina:} Believe me, the girl's intuition is very good. At that time, suddenly there was a feeling that should not be given to her, so he hesitated.\n{Freeman:} I gave it all now, and there is nothing to do. Next time you see her again, ask a few more questions. If there is really a ghost in it, you will lose more words.\n{Ina:} Well, Jack is right. We should still have a chance to see her again, and ask to understand next time.","{伊娜：}梦影姐姐真是好人哪。如果她再晚点来，也许我们真的哪天被刺客杀死在梦里了。\n{雷尔：}不过，她是怎么知道我们得到了“赤星剑”的，又是怎么知道我们在这里的，居然亲自来找我们……\n{弗里曼：}我们从没告诉过任何人，知道我们得到“赤星剑”的，除了索罗及其部下之外，应该不会有其他人了吧？\n{雷尔：}上一次告诉我们消息也是托罗兰来传达的，这次吹什么风了让她亲自来，而且是来到魔界？\n{伊娜：}你们在想什么呢，难道你们怀疑梦影姐姐是索罗的部下？这个没可能吧？如果是的话，她为什么要帮我们制作“龙王神力”的探测仪呢？直接帮索罗做不就行了吗？\n{雷尔：}确实解释不通。可是刚才看她总觉得有点蹊跷，而且拿了剑后匆匆忙忙就闪了，总觉得有点不对劲。\n{伊娜：}这么说来，我也确实觉得有点奇怪，刚才把剑给她时，不知怎么的犹豫了一下，可能就是直觉吧。\n{雷尔：}又来了，还是直觉……\n{伊娜：}相信我，女孩子的直觉很灵的啦。那个时候，突然一瞬间有一种感觉，不应该交给她，所以犹豫了一下。\n{弗里曼：}现在给都给了，也没办法了，下次再见到她时，多问几句吧。如果这里面真的有鬼，言多必失。\n{伊娜：}嗯，杰克说的对。我们应该还有机会再见到她的，下次问个明白。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} So I really can't learn fire magic? I still want to be a magician, but I didn't expect such a rule.\n{Rael:} The rules of the Magic Academy are very strict, and there is no alternative. However, if you really want to learn fire magic, there is not no way out.\n{Ina:} Is there a way?\n{Rael:} There are some witches living in high huts in the wild. They sometimes teach people skills, and they don't know the rules of the Magic Academy, so no matter whether you can learn them by profession, they are willing to teach you.\n{Ina:} Great, then as long as I find the witch's house that teaches {fire magic}, I can learn it. Well, this should be noted down. I will work hard, I must become a full-scale magician.\n{Rael:} However, there is one thing you should pay attention to, because a hero can only learn 8 skills. If you want to become a full-scale magician, the 5 skills {Four Elements Magic and Wisdom} are all indispensable, plus the pathfinding skills that you have learned, post-relearning, and intelligence. 8 skills are full.\n{Ina:} In other words, I can't learn skills other than these 8 skills?\n{Rael:} Well, if you learn other skills, you will definitely not be able to learn all four magic skills. Although some skills may seem tempting.\n{Ina:} I understand, take notes. In order to become a full-scale magician, I need to {abandon other possible skills}{skills}. Thank you Rael.","{伊娜：}于是我就真的没办法学习火系魔法了吗？我还想当一个魔法师呢，没想到有这样的规定。\n{雷尔：}魔法学院的规矩很严格，这也是没有办法的事情。不过，如果你真想学火系魔法，倒也不是没有门路。\n{伊娜：}有办法吗？\n{雷尔：}野外有些女巫住在高处的小屋里，她们有时也会教人技能，而且她们是不知道魔法学院的规矩的，所以不管你职业能不能学，都肯教给你。\n{伊娜：}太好了，那么只要找到教{火系魔法的女巫小屋}，我就可以学了。嗯，这一点要记下来。我会努力的，我一定要成为一个全面的魔法师。\n{雷尔：}不过，还是有一件事你要注意一下，因为一个英雄只能学8个技能。如果你想成为全面的魔法师，{四系魔法和智慧术}这5个技能都是不可少的，再加上已经学了的寻路术，后勒学，智力。8个技能就满了。\n{伊娜：}也就是说，我不能学这8个技能以外的技能了？\n{雷尔：}嗯，如果你又学了其他别的技能，就必然没法学齐四系魔法技能了。虽然有些技能看起来可能也很诱人。\n{伊娜：}我明白了，笔记下来。为了成为全面的魔法师，我需要{放弃其他有可能学得到的}{技能}。谢谢你，雷尔。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} So it's inside...\n{Rael:} (Shh~~~~!)\n{Ina:} (Ah, that demons!)\n{Rael:} (Not far in front, he What are you doing?)\n{Freeman:} (It doesn't look like there is a trap.)\n{Raier:} (Then let's get rid of him quickly?)\n{Ina:} (No, {Don't do it yet} ?-)\n{Rael:} (Why?) {Ina:} (Look at the surroundings...)\n{Freeman:} (They are all crystal mirrors, so I can't tell where to pass. What's wrong?)\n{Ina:} (It seems that finding Salman and his son is not as easy as imagined.)\n{Rael:} (It does seem to be difficult to find. It seems that this demons is also trying to find a way.)\n{ Ina:} (Should we find it easier after we kill him, or is it easier to let him clear the way for us and then kill him?)\n{Freeman:} (Yeah! How come I didn't expect it, the feeling of the demons More sensitive than humans, humans rely excessively on vision and make other senses dull. In this environment surrounded by mirrors, it is precisely that vision is the most chaotic, so we are at a loss. And demons can rely on other sensitive senses. It's much easier to find a way than us. So {Don't kill him}, {Wait for him to clear the way for us} is a smarter way. Ina even thought of this.)\n{Ina:} (Uh , I didn't think so much...)\n{Rael:} (But, wouldn't it be dangerous? If he were to find Salman and his son first, maybe he would kill them...)\n{Free Man:} (So we have to kill him before he gets in touch with Salman and his son. As long as you keep a proper distance, this shouldn't be difficult for Ina.)\n{Ina:} (Well, that's it.)","{伊娜：}原来这里面……\n{雷尔：}（嘘~~~~！）\n{伊娜：}（啊，那个魔族！）\n{雷尔：}（就在前面不远处，他在干什么呢？）\n{弗里曼：}（看上去并不像有什么陷阱。）\n{雷尔：}（那么赶紧出手把他干掉吧？）\n{伊娜：}（不，{先不要出手}……）\n{雷尔：}（为什么？）\n{伊娜：}（你们看周围啊……）\n{弗里曼：}（都是水晶的镜面，完全分不清哪里可以通过。怎么了？）\n{伊娜：}（看起来，找到萨尔曼父子并不像想像中的那么容易啊。）\n{雷尔：}（的确看起来很难找，看起来这个魔族也在想办法。）\n{伊娜：}（我们是干掉他之后自己找容易呢，还是让他帮我们开路之后再干掉他更容易呢？）\n{弗里曼：}（是啊！我怎么没想到呢，魔族的感觉比人类灵敏，人类过度地依赖视觉而使其他感觉变得迟钝，在这个四周都是镜子的环境里，恰恰视觉是最混乱的，所以我们才会束手无策。而魔族则可以依赖灵敏的其他感官来寻找通路，比我们要容易得多。所以{不要杀他}，{先等他为我们开路}才是更聪明的手段。伊娜连这点都想到了。）\n{伊娜：}（呃，我并没有考虑到这么多啦……）\n{雷尔：}（但是，这样不会有危险吗？如果让他先找到了萨尔曼父子，也许他会杀了他们……）\n{弗里曼：}（所以我们要在他接触萨尔曼父子之前将他干掉。只要保持合适的距离，这个对伊娜来说应该不是难事。）\n{伊娜：}（嗯，就这么办了。）\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} So our plan changed, go to {Black Wind Valley} to meet the demons?\n{Freeman:} It seems that the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is already in Horia's hands, and it seems that he doesn't know the relationship between the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" and the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", just as a treasure. It's just greedy.\n{Ina:} That's right. In this way, according to the previous clues, the Demon Race wanted to find the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\". After finding it, we killed Holia. Then we should stop the Demon Race as soon as possible. The \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is safe. That's true--but, to be honest, how do I think it's not necessarily a bad thing to let the Mozu kill that insatiable prime minister...\n{Rael:} Although he is a corrupt official, it seems that he is still willing to be with us For the sake of dealing with the demons, it shouldn't be so bad. What's more, if the Demon Race really kills him, it means that the Demon Race has found the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", and the situation will be very unfavorable for us.\n{Ina:} That's right. It's my cranky thinking.","{伊娜：}于是我们的计划就改变了，去{黑风谷}迎击魔族？\n{弗里曼：}看起来“火灵珠”已经在霍利亚手上了，而且似乎他并不知道“火灵珠”与“龙牙冠”的关系，只是当作一件珍宝而想贪入怀中而已。\n{伊娜：}对对，这样一来，根据之前的线索，魔族想找“龙牙冠”，找到之后就杀了霍利亚，那么我们尽快阻止魔族，“火灵珠”就是安全的了——不过，说实话，我怎么觉得，让魔族杀了那个贪得无厌的宰相不见得是坏事呢……\n{雷尔：}虽然说他是个大贪官，不过看在他还是愿意与我们一同对付魔族的份上，不应该那么使坏的。何况如果真的让魔族杀了他，就意味着魔族已经找到了“龙牙冠”，那么局面就对我们很不利了。\n{伊娜：}也对。是我胡思乱想了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} So, what is the thing you are looking for, and where is it?\n{Rael:} That thing is called {\"Dragon King Divine Power\"}. I don't know where it is. I just heard rumors that it is in Mirronia.\n{Ina:} Ah, you don't even know where you are. How do you find it now...\n{Rael:} So you should leave me alone, Ina. I just need to find it myself.\n{Ina:} Well, this is not good. It is so difficult to find. It will be even more difficult for you to find it alone. If I help you find it together, it might be easier. This thing has never been recorded in the Ina-chan universal notebook, which means I have never heard of it in the village. Maybe no one in the village knows it. If it doesn't work, we can go to the city to find clues. In any case, the top priority now is to get Uncle Lederman to help you treat your legs.","{伊娜：}那么，你要找的那件东西是什么，它又在哪里呢？\n{雷尔：}那件东西叫做{“龙王神力”}，到底在哪里我也不知道，只是听到传闻说它在米尔罗尼亚。\n{伊娜：}啊，连你自己都不知道在哪里，这下该怎么找呢……\n{雷尔：}所以你还是别管我了，伊娜。我自己去找就行了。\n{伊娜：}嗯，这不行，这么难找，让你一个人找就更加困难了，如果我帮你一起找，也许还能容易一些。这东西在伊娜酱万能笔记本上从没有记载过，说明我在村里从没听过，可能全村都没人知道，实在不行我们可以到城市里去打听线索。不管怎么说，眼下当务之急是先找莱德曼大爷帮你医腿。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Someone who is blind will definitely eat, it's the rusty dragon.\n{The Secretary will:} Very good. Then please hold this mascot \"Star Wish Bird\" and use it to answer the following questions. Listen to the question. How many of the following statements are {correct}?\n1. The spearmen actually have special effects.\n2. If there is a wizard or archmage among the creatures the hero brings, if you don't consider the influence of the enemy Pegasus, the MP required for any magic he casts will be reduced by 2 points.\n3. In addition to sailing boats, there are row boats in the H3 world.\n4. During the Week of Creatures, it is possible for cities that have upgraded high-level nest buildings and cities that have only low-level creature nests without upgrading to increase their output at the same time.\n5. Two godsends can increase the output of level 2 soldiers in a city by\n10.\n6. Dragon-slaying magic is also effective against bone dragons, but it is not effective against phoenixes.\n7. Regardless of the low-level arms, once they are promoted to high-level, they cannot be relegated to low-level.\n8. Without the Orb of Destruction, any attempt to click and cast any magic in the magic book on the black dragon is futile.\n9. I once spent an hour playing a single-player scene map and scored 415 points. Do you think a few of them are {correct}, just go to the corresponding prize-receiving office and hand over the mascot \"Wish Star Bird\" to the person in charge.","{伊娜：}肯定会吃失明的，是锈龙啦。\n{司会：}很好。那么这个吉祥物“星愿鸟”请您拿着，用来答下面的问题。听好问题。\n\n以下叙述中，有几条是{正确}的？\n1，枪兵其实是有特技的。\n2，英雄所带的生物中如果有法师或大法师，如果不考虑遇到敌方飞马的影响，他施放的任何魔法所需要的MP都会降低2点。\n3，除了帆船之外，H3世界中还有排桨船。\n4，生物之周的时候，已经升级了高级巢穴建筑的城与没有升级只有低级生物巢穴的城是有可能同时额外增加产量的。\n5，两个天赐神足能让一个城内的2级兵产量加10。\n6，屠龙魔法对付骨龙也有效，但对付凤凰无效。\n7，不管是什么低级兵种，一旦升为高级，就无法再降回低级了。\n8，在没有毁灭之球的情况下，魔法书中的任何魔法试图点击在黑龙身上施放都是徒劳的。\n9，我曾经花了1小时打了一张单人场景地图得了415分。\n\n你认为其中有几条是{正确}的，就到对应的领奖处去把吉祥物“星愿鸟”交给负责人就好。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Still failed to catch up, let the guy run away. How to do?\n{Rael:} And they blocked the access door.\n{Ina:} We still want to go to Bataan to find Spinrodri's...\n{Mondo:} I'm really sorry, I was actually fooled, and I got you involved.\n{Ina:} We were originally going to Bataan, not for you.\n{Mondo:} If I want to go to Bataan, I actually know a secret trail.\n{Ina:} Really? That's great. When he arrived in the city, he continued to find that Drake for payment.\n{Mondo:} Just south of {the place you saved me}, there is a narrow waterway through which you can reach the city of Bataan. I will take you there. Although I was deceived, I hope that I can help you accomplish the task, which can be regarded as a life-saving grace in return.","{伊娜：}还是没能追上，让那家伙跑掉了。怎么办？\n{雷尔：}而且他们把通路的门给堵死了。\n{伊娜：}我们还想去巴塔安城找斯拜恩罗德里的……\n{蒙多：}真是不好意思，我居然上了当，还把你们牵连进来。\n{伊娜：}我们本来就是要去巴塔安城的，不是为了你也要去的。\n{蒙多：}如果要去巴塔安城，其实我知道一条秘密小道。\n{伊娜：}是吗？那太好了。到了城里继续找那个德兰克讨报酬。\n{蒙多：}就在{你们救我的地方向南}，有一条狭窄的水道，通过那里，也能到达巴塔安城。我带你们去吧。虽然我被骗了，不过我希望能帮你们达成任务，也算是回报救命之恩。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Strange, even the demons appeared in Terracia. However, that guy just didn't seem to be strong.\n{Freeman:} Terracia's national defense strength is relatively strong, and perhaps the demons still dare not act blatantly, so they only send people to spy on secretly.\n{Ina:} But, what target are they scouting?","{伊娜：}奇怪了，连泰拉西亚也出现了魔族。不过，刚才那个家伙好像并不强。\n{弗里曼：}泰拉西亚的国防实力比较强，也许魔族还不敢明目张胆行动，所以只派人偷偷侦察。\n{伊娜：}不过，他们到底在侦察什么目标呢？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Sure enough, the strength of the SWAT team here is weaker than before. Jack is really good and knows everything about Terracia.\n{Freeman:} It's not enough to know everything, but the geography class of Mirronia I learned before has the basic overview of each country, so the basic situation is still clear.","{伊娜：}果然，往这边的特警队的力量就比之前弱了。杰克真厉害，对泰拉西亚的情况了如指掌。\n{弗里曼：}了如指掌还不至于，只是以前学过的米尔罗尼亚的地理课上有各国基本概况，所以对于基本地况还是清楚的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Sure enough, there is still a mechanism...\n{Roland:} At this level, it's not a big deal, is it embarrassing to lie that only he can open it? joke.","{伊娜：}果然还是有机关吗……\n{罗兰：}这点程度，不算什么吧，这也好意思谎称只有他自己可以打开？笑话。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Sure enough, there was no army to stop us.\n{Freeman:} However, the attitude of that messenger is still a bit strange to me.\n{Ina:} I also feel that something is wrong. Moreover, they chased us so embarrassedly, how could we just apologize. Anyway, let's talk about it after seeing Holia first, and then ask him more clearly.","{伊娜：}果然之后就都没有军队阻拦我们了。\n{弗里曼：}可是，那个使者的态度，我还是觉得有点奇怪。\n{伊娜：}我也觉得好像有哪里不对劲。而且，他们把我们追杀得这么狼狈，怎么能就一句道歉就了事呢。不管怎么说，我们先见到霍利亚再说吧，然后再向他问个清楚。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Take a closer look at this prison-like city. Where are the guards? I'd better call them out.\n{Rael:} Call them out? What do you want to do?\n{Freeman:} If you attack, you are afraid of hurting the civilians inside.\n{Ina:} Yes, and one more thing, if they take hostages, it will be very detrimental to us. I have to find a way to set a trap for them, and when they find that they can't beat us, they can no longer take hostages. Now everyone should be concealed first, and I will tease them alone.\n{Rael:} Are you going alone? Be careful...\n{Ina:} You wait for my signal, you will be dispatched as soon as I signal.","{伊娜：}靠近看看这座监狱一样的城，守卫们在哪里呢，最好能喊他们出来。\n{雷尔：}喊他们出来？你想干什么？\n{弗里曼：}如果强攻的话，怕伤及里面关着的平民吧。\n{伊娜：}是呀，而且还有一点，万一他们要是挟持人质的话，对我们就很不利了。我得想个办法给他们设个圈套，等他们发现打不过我们的时候已经没法挟持人质了。现在大家先隐蔽好，我独自去逗逗他们。\n{雷尔：}你一个人去？当心啊……\n{伊娜：}你们等我的信号哦，我一发信号你们就出动。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} That bad guy is real, he slipped so fast. Leading the way will not lead to the end. Huh, who is in front? ...\n{base guard:} Intruder found! Hurry up and report to Lord Baltz!\n{Ina:} Well, this, what should I do, your Lord Baltz has gone on vacation and can't come back temporarily. Should I trouble you to act as my opponent temporarily?\n{Base guard:} I...I just don't do it...I still have the important items that Master Baltz asked me to take care of. How can I be tempted by you...\n{Ina:} You are so unconfident, are you? Think you will lose if you hit me?\n{Base Guard:} Don't try to use radical tactics, I won't be fooled. Because this thing in my hand is too important, I must not take any risk.\n{Ina:} So you still have something like this in your hand. A surprise, could it be a part of the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\"? ...\n{base guard:} No, this one in my hand is the \"Red Star Sword\", which is the core component for Master Solo to complete the \"Sword of Destruction\". This thing is very important to Lord Solo's plan and must not fall into the hands of others. So I won't be fooled, don't try to lie to me and beat you.\n{Ina:} Uh, so detailed, let me take notes first. It's okay, I don't need to seduce you. Because I can take the initiative to beat you, and I don't need to wait for your consent.\n{Base guard:} Hey, how can you be like this, you can hit me, why don't you tell me...\n{Ina:} Who do you think I am, and I'm not playing chess with you or playing chess. I am an intruder, your enemy. Well, then I will do it, you have the right to remain silent and give up resistance.","{伊娜：}那个坏人先生真是的，溜得真快。带个路也不带到头。咦，前面这位是？……\n{基地守卫：}发现入侵者！赶快去报告巴尔茨大人！\n{伊娜：}嗯，这个，怎么办呢，你们的巴尔茨大人去度假了，暂时回不来了耶。要不就麻烦你临时充当一下我的对手吧？\n{基地守卫：}我……我才不干……我手里还有巴尔茨大人拜托我照顾的重要物品，怎么能随便受你引诱……\n{伊娜：}这么没自信啊，你是不是觉得跟我打你一定会输啊？\n{基地守卫：}你不要试图用激将法，我不会上当的。因为我手里这件东西太重要了，所以绝不能冒一点风险。\n{伊娜：}原来你手上还有这样的东西啊，意外收获耶，莫非是“龙王神力”的部件？……\n{基地守卫：}才不是，我手上的这个是“赤星剑”，是索罗大人完成“毁灭之剑”的最核心的部件。这东西对索罗大人的计划至关重要，绝对不能落入别人手里。所以我不会上当的，别想骗我打你。\n{伊娜：}呃，这么详细啊，我先笔记下来。没关系，我不需要引诱你。因为本来我就主动可以打你，不需要等你同意。\n{基地守卫：}喂，你怎么能这样，你居然可以打我，怎么不告诉我……\n{伊娜：}你以为我是谁啊，又不是跟你下棋还讲规矩。我是入侵者耶，是你的敌人。嗯，那么我动手啦，你有权保持沉默放弃抵抗。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The Fire Spirit Orb is not on the old man who is greedy for money, is it hidden.\n{Freeman:} Go inside and look for it. I don't think he will take this thing outside.","{伊娜：}火灵珠并不在那个贪财老头身上，难道是被藏起来了。\n{弗里曼：}进里面找找吧。我觉得他不会把这东西带到外面去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The beach doesn't look like a human being, so don't go there yet.","{伊娜：}海边看上去不像有人的样子，先不要去那里吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The classmate who is flying over there, wait a minute.\n{Mozu:} Who are you? How could humans come here?\n{Ina:} Listen to the voice, are you the older brother of the two?\n{Mozu:} What, you actually know that we are brothers... But I don't have the time to break with you now, I still have important things. Don't follow me if you don't want to die.\n{Ina:} I know what you call the important thing, is it looking for Thor's helmet, because of your negligence was stolen by Ladia...\n{Mozu:} How do you know this!\n{Ina:} I heard the conversation between you and your brother just now.\n{Mozu:} You eavesdropped! Despicable humans!\n{Ina:} I didn't overhear it. You said it yourself, and it was so loud that I didn't want to hear it all.\n{Mozu:} Anyway, it's useless to beg for mercy now. You must be killed, otherwise we will be finished if the news reaches Lord Solo.\n{Ina:} I won't tell Solo, but you are still going to die.","{伊娜：}那边在飞的那位同学，等一下。\n{魔族：}你是谁？怎么会有人类到这里来的？\n{伊娜：}听声音，你是刚才两人中的哥哥吧？\n{魔族：}什么，你居然知道我们是兄弟……不过我现在可没工夫跟你瞎掰，我还有重要的事。你要是不想死的话别跟着我。\n{伊娜：}我知道你所谓的重要的事，是在找雷神盔吗，因为你的疏忽大意被拉迪亚偷走……\n{魔族：}你怎么会知道这些！\n{伊娜：}刚才你和你弟弟的谈话我都听见了啊。\n{魔族：}你居然偷听！卑鄙的人类！\n{伊娜：}我才没偷听呢，是你们自己说出来的，而且声音那么大，我不想听都听见了。\n{魔族：}不管怎么说，现在你求饶也没用了，一定要把你灭口，不然这消息要是传到索罗大人那里我们就完蛋了。\n{伊娜：}我不会去告诉索罗的，不过，你还是一样要完蛋。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The detector's response has become stronger. So it seems that the target we are looking for should be {opposite bank}. But there is no ship and no dock here, how can I get there. Mr. Roland can fly, can you take us over one by one?\n{Roland:} I'm really sorry, I don't dare to fly over.\n{Ina:} Ah, why is this?\n{Roland:} Tell me, don't make a joke. I have a hydrophobia. If I see water underneath, I will feel dizzy and my wings will become soft...\n{Ina:} Then what should I do... Well, I will think about it. Let's do it.","{伊娜：}探测仪的反应变强了。这么看起来，我们要找的目标应该在{对岸}。可是这边又没船又没码头，该怎么过去呢。罗兰先生倒是会飞，能不能把我们一个个带过去？\n{罗兰：}真的很不好意思，我自己都不敢飞过去。\n{伊娜：}啊，这是为什么？\n{罗兰：}说出来你们不要笑话，我有恐水症，如果看到下面是水，就会头发晕，翅膀发软……\n{伊娜：}那怎么办啊……唔，我再另想办法吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The eldest sister, do you know where the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" is?\n{Resident A:} \"Dragon King Divine Power\"? Is that a dish? There may be something you want in the lobster restaurant on South Street.\n{Ina:} Uh, it seems to be a misunderstanding. I will ask others again. ?a?aThe uncle, do you know where the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" is?\n{Resident B:} What? The old man's ears are not good, can you say it again?\n{Ina:} Does the uncle know where the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" is?\n{Resident B:} Oh, \"braised chestnuts\", you can buy them in many stores here.\n{Ina:} Hey, it seems that the uncle's ears are really not working well. Ask someone else again-this uncle, do you know where the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" is?\n{Resident C:} What? Call me uncle? Am I so old? Oh my god-I don't live anymore-I was called the uncle...\n{Ina:} I'm sorry, sorry...","{伊娜：}这位大姐，请问您知道“龙王神力”在哪里吗？\n{居民A：}“龙王神力”？那是一道菜吗？南街的龙虾馆里可能会有你想要的东西。\n{伊娜：}呃，看来是误会了，我再问问别人。——这位大爷，您知道“龙王神力”在哪里吗？\n{居民B：}什么？老夫耳朵不好，你再说一遍？\n{伊娜：}大爷知道“龙王神力”在哪里吗？\n{居民B：}哦，“红烧生栗”啊，这里好多店里都能买到啊。\n{伊娜：}唉，看来大爷的耳朵确实不太好使，再问问别人——这位大叔，您知道“龙王神力”在哪里吗？\n{居民C：}什么？管我叫大叔？我有这么老吗？天哪——我不活啦——竟然被人叫大叔了……\n{伊娜：}对不起对不起……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The female devil seems to have gone {inside} with the \"Fire Spirit Orb\". We went in all the way to find her, don't let her escape.","{伊娜：}那个女恶魔似乎是带着“火灵珠”往{里面}去了，我们一路进去找她，别让她逃走了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The flaming creatures in other places have been wiped out, so here is what will be left in the end.","{伊娜：}其他地方的火炎生物都消灭了，最后就剩下这里了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The front is what Radia said is the only way to reach Huangyan Island.","{伊娜：}前面就是拉迪亚所说的到达黄岩岛的必经之地了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The front is {Port Salen}. There happens to be a boat. \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" is ready, but don't forget it here.","{伊娜：}前面就是{塞伦港}了。正好有船呢。“龙王神力”带好了吧，可别忘在这里哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The guard changed his attitude as soon as he saw the money. He was really a snob. This virtue must have been learned from his master.\n{Rael:} Shh~~~~~~! Ina, you can't do this, it will be troublesome for people to hear.\n{Ina:} But I think they are very upset, what should I do?\n{Freeman:} Well, let me negotiate with him later. ?a?aSomeone is coming, very fast.\n{Holia:} I'm sorry to keep everyone waiting. I'm the Prime Minister, Horia.\n{Ina:} This is Ina, and these two are my friends Rael and Jack.\n{Holia:} Fortunately to meet you. I wonder if you have any requirements for finding the truth? There are not too many vacancies in Solandria.\n{Freeman:} Lord Prime Minister, in fact, we are not here to ask for an official. We heard that the Prime Minister got a treasure \"Fire Spirit Orb\" from the hands of the Demon Race. We inquired that the Demon Clan seemed to have any plans and wanted to use the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" in exchange for what conditions, fearing that they would endanger the Prime Minister and the country. After we wiped out a team of the Demon Race, we tracked them so far. We want to remind the Prime Minister, and don't trust those guys of the Demon Race.\n{Holia:} So that's how it is. Thank you for your kind advice. However, don't worry, everyone, how can the truth be so easily fooled. He pretends to agree to them, but in fact he will do his best, get the \"Fire Spirit Orb\", and deceive them to {Black Wind Valley}, preparing to send an army to encircle and wipe it out. In this way, the demons can be eliminated to defend this country, and this rare and famous pearl can become more dazzling in my hands. Isn't it the best of both worlds?\n{Freeman:} The Prime Minister is better to be careful, the demons are sinister and vicious.\n{Holia:} Well, what you said makes sense. Since you have also fought against the demons, then we are also on the same front, how about you also participate in the original plan of eliminating demons? The demons should now move around the Black Wind Valley, which is relatively narrow and easy to attack. Zhenxiang was thinking about taking advantage of this good time to hit them off guard. Unfortunately, the army's mobilization was not ideal. It might take some time for the main force to rush over, and I was afraid that the opportunity would be missed. If you can rush forward at this time, you will definitely be able to fight a beautiful battle, and my main force will come to take it afterwards. I don't know how you like it?\n{Freeman:} Let's think about it. Ina, Rael, what do you think?\n{Ina:} I don't know if I should agree.\n{Rael:} I think I agree. Don't let the demons get ahead. If they can cooperate with them to eliminate the demons who came to Solandria in one fell swoop, it would be very advantageous.\n{Freeman:} Well, I think so too. Where's Ina?\n{Ina:} Then agree.\n{Freeman:} Okay, Lord Prime Minister, we agreed.\n{Holia:} Great, Black Wind Valley is located in the {East by South} direction. Looking forward to your triumph.","{伊娜：}那个门卫，一看到钱，态度马上变了，真是个势利小人。这德性肯定跟他主子学的。\n{雷尔：}嘘~~~~~~！伊娜你这样可不行啊，让人家听到就麻烦了。\n{伊娜：}可是我看他们很不爽耶，怎么办。\n{弗里曼：}这样吧，等下由我来跟他交涉好了。——有人来了，挺快的啊。\n\n{霍利亚：}很抱歉让各位久等了。我是宰相霍利亚。\n{伊娜：}我是伊娜，这两位是我的朋友雷尔和杰克。\n{霍利亚：}幸会幸会。不知各位找本相有什么要求呢？现在索兰德里亚朝中空缺的岗位并不太多。\n{弗里曼：}宰相大人，其实我们并不是来求官的。我们听说宰相大人从魔族手里得到一件宝物“火灵珠”。我们打听到魔族似乎有什么计划，想借“火灵珠”换取什么条件，担心他们会危及宰相大人以及这个国家。我们消灭了魔族的一支队伍后，追踪他们至此，想给宰相大人提个醒，千万不要轻信魔族的那些家伙。\n{霍利亚：}原来是这样啊。多谢好心相告。不过，各位不用担心，本相哪会这么轻易上当。本相假装答应他们，实则将计就计，又把“火灵珠”弄到手，又把他们骗至{黑风谷}，准备出动军队围歼之。这样一来，又可以消灭魔族保卫这个国家，又能让这件稀世名珠在我的手里变得更加光辉夺目，岂不是两全其美？\n{弗里曼：}宰相大人还是小心为好，魔族手段阴险毒辣。\n{霍利亚：}嗯，你们说的也有道理。既然你们也是跟魔族交过手的，那么我们也算是同一阵线，要不你们也参加本相的除魔计划如何？现在魔族的人应该在黑风谷附近活动，那个地方比较狭窄，易攻难逃。本相正想着趁着这个好时机去打他们个措手不及，遗憾的是军队的调动不理想，主力军赶过去恐怕还需要点时间，只怕坐失良机。各位如果能在这个时候先行赶去，一定能打个漂亮仗，我的主力军随后就来接应。不知各位意下如何？\n{弗里曼：}我们考虑一下。伊娜，雷尔，你们觉得如何？\n{伊娜：}我不知道该不该答应。\n{雷尔：}我看答应了吧。不能让魔族抢了先。如果能配合他们把来索兰德里亚的魔族一举消灭，也是很有利的。\n{弗里曼：}嗯，我也是这么想的。伊娜呢？\n{伊娜：}那就答应了吧。\n{弗里曼：}好，宰相大人，我们答应了。\n{霍利亚：}太好了，黑风谷位于{东偏南}方向。期待各位凯旋。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The guy you picked up just now is just right. Just smash these rocks away and you can pass.\n{Rael:} Let me do the job.\n{Ina:} Don't don't, I'll do it. It's not long since your injury has healed. Don't exercise vigorously, the wound might open. Hey~yo~ ???a?a!\n{Rael:} Not bad, it broke, but the shackle is also broken.\n{Ina:} Aha, I really don't know how to use such a strange tool, I'm so stupid.","{伊娜：}刚才捡的家伙正好用得上，把这些石头砸开，就能通过了吧。\n{雷尔：}这活儿还是我来吧。\n{伊娜：}不要不要，我来就行了。你伤才好没多久，别剧烈运动，伤口搞不好会迸开的。哎~哟~咚——！\n{雷尔：}不错嘛，砸开了，不过链枷也坏了。\n{伊娜：}啊哈，我果然不太会用这种陌生的工具，我好笨。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The huge stove... is it here?\n{Mondo:} Well, let me try the handover signal.\n{Ina:} Is there a secret code?\n{Mondo:} Of course, what if someone pretends to claim it?\n{Ina:} So how do you use the code?\n{Mondo:} The Red River of Magic Castle is as blazing as blood.\n{Mozu:} The ghost town is dark and cloudless.\n{Mondo:} Ah, are you the consignee? What is your name?\n{Mozu:} I've been waiting for you for a long time, I'm Drake.\n{Mondo:} Well, it is the same as the name that the shipper told me, it seems to be correct.\n{Dranke:} Then show me the goods.\n{Mondo:} This is the \"Purple Spirit Shield\".\n{Dranke:} That's right. Very good, I accepted it. You have worked hard.\n{Mondo:} Then, please pay me.\n{Dranke:} Remuneration? Hasn't the consignor already paid?\n{Mondo:} No, I said it was cash on delivery. Because the items are very expensive, no deposit is required.\n{Derlank:} But the instructions I got were that the consignor had already paid, so I didn't prepare the money. I just came to receive the goods.\n{Mondo:} How can this be, you can't lie to me. I almost lost my life in order to give this thing.\n{Delanke:} I can't control this, I'm just responsible for receiving the goods. Lord Solo is still anxious to ask for this \"Purple Spirit Shield\", so I can't pester you here. I have to send it to Lord Solo quickly. Goodbye.\n{Mondo:} Hey, don't go...\n{Ina:} Ah, he just ran away like that. It's really annoying, the king's meal...\n{Rael:} And, he said that this thing is actually a claim What Luo wants...\n{Freeman:} It looks like we have to keep track of it.\n{Ina:} Let's go, we will catch up, it should be too late, and ask him to ask for payment from Brother Mondo, or at least take the \"Purple Spirit Shield\" back.","{伊娜：}巨大的火炉……就是这里了吧？\n{蒙多：}嗯，我来试试交接暗号。\n{伊娜：}还有暗号呀？\n{蒙多：}当然，要不然有人冒领怎么办？\n{伊娜：}那么暗号怎么用呢？\n{蒙多：}魔堡红河炽如血。\n{魔族：}鬼城黑天暗无云。\n{蒙多：}啊，您就是收货人？您的名字是？\n{魔族：}等你很久了，我是德兰克。\n{蒙多：}嗯，跟发货人告诉我的名字一致，看来是没错了。\n{德兰克：}那么把货给我看看吧。\n\n{蒙多：}这就是“紫灵盾”了。\n{德兰克：}没错。很好，我收下了。你辛苦了。\n{蒙多：}那么，请付给我报酬吧。\n{德兰克：}报酬？发货人不是已经付过了吗？\n{蒙多：}没有啊，当初说好是货到付款。因为物品非常贵重，所以不付定金了。\n{德兰克：}可是我得到的指示是发货人已经付过钱了，所以我没有准备钱来。我只是来收货而已。\n{蒙多：}怎么能这样，你们不能骗我吧。我为了送这件东西，差点命都赔了。\n{德兰克：}这个我就管不着了，我只是负责收货而已。索罗大人还急着催要这件“紫灵盾”呢，不能在这里跟你纠缠了。我得赶紧给索罗大人送去。告辞。\n{蒙多：}喂，别走啊……\n{伊娜：}啊，他就这么跑掉了，真可气，霸王餐啊……\n{雷尔：}而且，他说是这东西居然是索罗要的……\n{弗里曼：}看起来我们得追查下去才好。\n{伊娜：}走，我们追上去，应该还来得及，问他讨蒙多大哥的报酬，或者至少把“紫灵盾”夺回来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The light on the detector is already bright, and it seems that Kairon should be nearby.","{伊娜：}探测仪的灯已经很亮了，看来凯隆应该就在附近了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The light on the detector is brighter than before.","{伊娜：}探测仪上的灯比之前更亮了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The light on the detector is very bright, and the \"Dragon Bone Greaves\" is nearby.","{伊娜：}探测仪上的灯很亮了，“龙骨胫甲”就在附近了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The pinates were finally eliminated, and now we can move on.\n{Freeman:} And we need to tell everyone about the eradication of pinates, so that fishing, trade, and travel can return to normal.","{伊娜：}终于消灭了海盗，这下可以继续前行了。\n{弗里曼：}而且我们要把海盗被消灭的事情告诉大家，让打渔通商旅行都恢复正常。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The previous discomfort of seasickness is finally over, now it's much better.","{伊娜：}之前晕船的不舒服总算是过去了，现在好多了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The queen is back, so let's continue to look for the \"Dragon Eye Ring\". Alas, Jack, what are you thinking about?\n{Freeman:} Have you found a problem, Archbishop Yingluck, seems to have a certain relationship with the demons?\n{Rael:} Gals and the others seem to be in a group with Archbishop Yingluck.\n{Ina:} And they knew we were looking for \"Dragon Eye Ring\", how would they know it?\n{Freeman:} If it were Archbishop Yingluck, it would not be difficult to know this. The Black Tiger operatives under him would easily detect such a bit of intelligence.\n{Ina:} So the relationship between Archbishop Yingluck and the demons is more clear. I have to write it down first. But why does Archbishop Yingluck have to do with the demons?\n{Freeman:} I don't know why, but things are worse than expected. Archbishop Yingluck seems to be more than just a coup.","{伊娜：}女王回去了，那么我们就继续去寻找“龙眼指环”吧。唉，杰克，你在想什么呢？\n{弗里曼：}你们有没有发现一个问题，英拉大主教，好像跟魔族有一定的关系？\n{雷尔：}加尔斯他们好像跟英拉大主教是一伙的。\n{伊娜：}而且他们知道我们要找“龙眼指环”，他们怎么会知道的呢？\n{弗里曼：}如果是英拉大主教的话，想知道这件事就不难了，他手下的黑虎特工队侦察这么点情报是轻而易举的。\n{伊娜：}所以英拉大主教跟魔族的关系就更加明确了。我得先记下来。不过英拉大主教为什么要跟魔族扯上关系呢？\n{弗里曼：}我不清楚为什么，但是事情比想像的更糟糕了。英拉大主教看起来不仅仅是一个政变者那么简单。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The road here is so detour, and it's not easy to walk.","{伊娜：}这里面的路好绕啊，而且很不好走耶。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The road in the dense forest is so hard to walk, it's dark and cold...\n{Zade:} It's not a big deal, there may be beasts, everyone must be careful.\n{Zola:} So the Mozu opened the portal here, really thoughtful.\n{Ina:} Ah, yes, the \"Longan Ring\" is still here, give it back to you. 2 exactly the same.\n{Zola:} We have used it up and don't need to return it to us. Since you saved us before, it's better to give it to you. Didn't you come to Snow Mountain Island just to find it?\n{Ina:} Hey, run out of it? By the way, why do you want to buy \"longan ring\"?\n{Zola:} Why, do you still have to ask? We are priests here. Of course, it is for sacrifice. With the aid of artifacts, the effect of sacrifice can be increased dozens of times. Don't you do it for sacrifice?\n{Ina:} We, no, we just want to find the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" to fight against the demons. The demons seem to have some conspinacy, they are also looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\".\n{Zade:} No wonder we will be targeted by the demons.\n{Zola:} Since this is the case, then the \"Longan Ring\" should be given to you. Will you distinguish between true and false? In order to confuse the demons, we made a fake one. The fake one doesn't actually have any effect except for the exact appearance.\n{Ina:} Well, it looks exactly the same. But I can tell, just use the detector made by Mengying sister.\n{Zola:} That's good, you can take this fake too, maybe it will be useful in the future.","{伊娜：}密林里的路好难走，又黑又冷……\n{扎德：}这还不算什么，还有可能会出现野兽，大家千万要当心。\n{佐拉：}所以魔族把传送门开在这里面，还真是想得周到。\n{伊娜：}啊，对了，“龙眼戒”还在这，还给你们。完全一样的2枚呢。\n{佐拉：}我们已经用完了，不用再还给我们了。之前既然是你救了我们，不如就送给你吧。你们不也是为了找它才来到雪山岛的吗？\n{伊娜：}咦，用完了？话说你们为什么要买“龙眼戒”呢？\n{佐拉：}为什么，这个还用问吗，我们是这里的司祭，当然是为了祭祀了，有神器的辅助，祭祀的效果可以提升数十倍啊。难道你们不是为了祭祀吗？\n{伊娜：}我们，不是啦，我们只是想找“龙王神力”来对抗魔族啦。魔族似乎有什么阴谋，他们也在找“龙王神力”。\n{扎德：}难怪我们会被魔族盯上。\n{佐拉：}既然是这样，那么更应该把“龙眼戒”交给你们了。你们会区分真假吗？之前我们为了迷惑魔族，制作了一个假的。假的除了外观一模一样之外，其实并没有任何作用。\n{伊娜：}嗯，看上去确实是完全一样。不过我可以区分啊，用梦影姐姐做的探测仪就行了。\n{佐拉：}那就好，这个假的你们也拿着吧，也许以后会有用处的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The road to the sea is long and long.","{伊娜：}通向海边的路又长又远。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The secret base of the demons... the door seems to be locked. But it doesn't matter, the guard has the key just now. With this base, we can send troops over, and then go to {kill the Baltz}, {then go to the Demon World}. The timetable is confirmed, let's go!","{伊娜：}魔族的秘密基地……门好像锁住了。不过不要紧，刚才那个守卫的身上有钥匙。有了这个基地，我们就可以传兵过来了，然后去{干掉那个巴尔茨}，{接着就去魔界}。时间表确定，出发！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The secret base of the demons... the door seems to be locked. No key?","{伊娜：}魔族的秘密基地……门好像锁住了。没有钥匙？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The square is very lively, there is a group of people around there, what are they doing?\n{Lin Yu:} Ah, that is a life-and-death lecture for beginners, and it looks like the lecturer is giving a topic. Is Miss Ina interested in answering questions? The first one to get the correct answer will get a prize.\n{Ina:} I'm not a college student, can I participate?\n{Lin Yu:} It's okay. As I said just now, the square is a place where all students and visitors can communicate. However, something to make you laugh is that due to the limitations of chess and the large number of visitors, many people can only set the game on the ground, using stones to represent white chess and pits to represent black chess.","{伊娜：}广场上挺热闹的，有一群人围在那里，是在做什么呢？\n{林羽：}啊，那是面向初学者的死活形讲授课，貌似讲师在出题呢。伊娜小姐有没有兴趣去答题？第一个答对的能得到奖品哦。\n{伊娜：}我不是院生，也可以参加吗？\n{林羽：}没关系啦。刚才我就说了，广场上是不论高手低手院生来客都可以交流的场所。不过，有些让您见笑的是，由于棋具有限而来客众多，很多人只能在地上摆棋局，用石代表白棋，用坑代表黑棋。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The storm ahead is so big, do you want to move forward.\n{Rael:} It seems too dangerous...\n{Freeman:} Look, there is a small fishing boat not far away. Let's ask them about it.\n{Ina:} That's right. Hello~~~~~~! Is there anyone on the opposite fishing boat?\n{Man:} Someone! Almost drifted into the Death Triangle, it would really become a ghost ship!\n{Ina:} Hey, the triangle of death? Are you saying that there is a triangle of death ahead?\n{Man:} What? Don't you know? Don't move forward quickly. There is the \"death triangle\" known as the \"tombs on the sea\". I don't know how many ships disappeared there, and there are even empty ships floating back, but the people on board are gone.\n{Ina:} Ah, what is going on?\n{Man:} Who knows what's going on, there are all kinds of legends anyway. Some said it was eaten by a huge sea monster; some said it was inhaled by the mysterious force field on the seabed; some said it was a base for aliens, and those people were captured by aliens for dissection and study; there was also said there It's the passage of the Demon Realm. Those people have gone to the Demon Realm. It's also said that there is an entrance to a distorted space, and people have been sucked into a different space... Anyway, there are many different legends, but one thing is certain, if you If I go, I won't be able to come back in most cases.\n{Ina:} So there are so many sayings? But why didn't Jack tell me?\n{Freeman:} I'm afraid that you will be frightened by speaking out...\n{Ina:} How could it be? This is very interesting. Let's see what happens.\n{Man:} Hey, I warned you. If you didn't listen to advice, you were eaten. Don't come to me to claim your life after you die. I drove off first.","{伊娜：}前面的风浪好大，还要不要前进啊。\n{雷尔：}好像太危险了……\n{弗里曼：}看，旁边不远有只小渔船，我们向他们打听一下吧。\n{伊娜：}也对呢。喂~~~~~~！对面的渔船，有人吗？\n{男子：}有人！差一点就漂进了死亡三角区，那就真要成了鬼船了！\n{伊娜：}咦，死亡三角？你是说，前面就是死亡三角吗？\n{男子：}什么？你们不知道吗？你们赶紧别前进了。那里就是被称为“海上的坟墓”的“死亡三角”，不知有多少船只在那里消失不见，甚至还有的船只只剩空船漂回来，船上的人却都不见了。\n{伊娜：}啊，那是怎么回事呢？\n{男子：}谁知道是怎么回事啊，反正有各种各样的传说啦。有说是被巨大的海怪给吃了；有说是被海底的神秘力场吸入了；还有说那里是异星人的基地，那些人是被异星人抓去解剖研究了；还有说那里是魔界的通道，那些人去了魔界了；还有说那里是歪曲空间的入口，人都被吸到异空间去了……反正五花八门的传说很多了，但是有一点可以肯定的是，如果你去了，多半就再也回不来了。\n{伊娜：}原来有这么多说法啊？可是当初杰克怎么没告诉我呢？\n{弗里曼：}我怕说出来把你吓坏……\n{伊娜：}怎么会呢，这很有意思啊。我们去看个究竟吧。\n{男子：}喂，我可警告过你们了，不听劝告被吃了什么的，死后别来找我索命啊。我先开溜了。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The trees here are so dense.\n{Freeman:} No, what's the smell...\n{Ina:} Smoke smell, ah, it's on fire?\n{Freeman:} Not good, it has spread, there is still wind, and the fire has expanded too fiercely. If we don't find a way to escape quickly, we will all be burned here.\n{Ina:} How could this happen. I will try my best, I will try my best.","{伊娜：}这边的树木长得好茂密。\n{弗里曼：}不对，有股什么味……\n{伊娜：}烟味，啊，着火了？\n{弗里曼：}不好，蔓延开来了，现在还有风，火势扩张得太凶。不赶快想办法逃出去的话，我们都要被烧死在这里了。\n{伊娜：}怎么会这样嘛。我尽力吧，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The war is cruel, so many people have died...\n{Rael:} Don't be sad, the dead can't be resurrected. It's better to overtake them for a while. Otherwise, it would be really pitiful to live here as a lonely ghost.","{伊娜：}战争真残酷，死了那么多人……\n{雷尔：}别难过了，死者不能复活。不如替他们超渡一下吧。否则作为孤魂野鬼流落在此地才真的可怜。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} The weather is really good today. It was stormy yesterday. I didn't expect it would clear up so soon. Well, let me go to {church} first, and then go to {east beach} to catch some crabs.","{伊娜：}今天天气真好啊，昨天还风雨大作，没想到这么快就放晴了。嗯，我先去趟{教堂}吧，然后上{东边的海滩}去看看捉点螃蟹去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then Jack, are there any legends about the \"death triangle\"? Tell me more. What a funny look.\n{Freeman:} Do you still want to hear? Of course there is. So, let me talk about two more.\n{Ina:} Hmm. I take notes while listening.\n{Freeman:} One is about \"distorting space\". It is said that when passing through the vortex of the death triangle, there is a certain chance to enter a distorted space full of black mist. And that {somewhere in the distorted space, there is a treasure handed down from ancient times}\n{thing}. {Ina:} Really? Let's find that treasure.\n{Freeman:} Who knows whether it's true or not. However, it is said that there is a misty black mist everywhere in the distortion space. It is very difficult for you to find a solid ground that your feet can step on. Don't talk about finding any treasures. What's more, no one said that the distortion space will definitely be reached.\n{Ina:} If it arrives, I want to give it a try.\n{Freeman:} Okay, let me move on to the next one. We know that when crossing the passage, if equipped with \"Aris' Helmet\" can prevent death. Without this, it is likely that someone in the team will die.\n{Ina:} Well, we already have \"Aris' Helmet\" now, so don't worry about this.\n{Freeman:} But if not, do you know what will happen? There is a legend about this.\n{Ina:} What will happen?\n{Freeman:} No matter how many teams or creatures you bring, you pass through the vortex once, {always the number of the team with the smallest total value is reduced by half}. In layman's terms, the weakest team is reduced by half, and Other teams will not be affected. Of course, if there is only one weakest team, then this team disappears altogether.\n{Ina:} So if there is only one team in total, what about this team?\n{Freeman:} There won't be any reduction.\n{Ina:} So, if you don't have \"Aris' Helmet\" who wants to travel through the vortex without loss, you can bring only one creature. And if you bring a large force, you can also reduce the loss to the greatest extent by separating a team of the weakest creatures. This rule is also very useful, I also remembered it in Ina-chan's universal notebook.","{伊娜：}那么杰克，关于“死亡三角”，还有些什么传说啊？再讲点给我听听。好有趣的样子。\n{弗里曼：}你还想听啊？当然有了。那么，我再讲两个吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯。我一边听一边记笔记。\n{弗里曼：}一个是关于“歪曲空间”的。据说在穿过死亡三角的通道漩涡时，会有一定机率进到一个满是黑雾的歪曲空间。而那个{歪曲空间里的某处，埋藏着一件上古流传下来的宝}\n{物}。\n{伊娜：}真的吗？我们去找那件宝物。\n{弗里曼：}谁知道真的假的呢。可是据说歪曲空间里到处都是虚无飘渺的黑雾，你想找到一块脚能踩上的实地都很困难呢。不要说找什么宝物了。何况，谁也没说一定会到得了那个歪曲空间。\n{伊娜：}如果到了，我想试试看。\n{弗里曼：}好吧，我接着讲下一个。我们知道穿越通道时，如果装备有“亚里斯的头盔”可以防止死亡。如果没有这个，很可能队中会有人死亡。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我们现在已经有“亚里斯的头盔”了，不用担心这个了。\n{弗里曼：}但是如果没有的话，你知道会发生什么吗？有一个传说就是关于这个的。\n{伊娜：}会怎么样呢？\n{弗里曼：}不管你带了多少队什么生物，穿过一次漩涡，{总是总价值最小的那一队数目减少一半}，通俗地讲也就是最弱的那一队减少一半，而其他队伍则不会受到影响。当然，如果最弱一队只有一个，那么这一队就整个消失了。\n{伊娜：}那么如果总共只有一队，这队只有一个呢？\n{弗里曼：}那倒是不会有任何减少的。\n{伊娜：}那么说来，如果没有“亚里斯的头盔”想要穿越漩涡而无损失，可以只带一个生物。而如果带了大部队，也可以通过分出一队单个的最弱的生物，就可以最大程度地降低损失啦。这个规律也很有用呢，我也记到伊娜酱万能笔记本上了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then Mr. Roland, what's the matter with you coming to me.\n{Roland:} Mengying let me tell you that the demons are also looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\" now, and it is likely that they have already obtained some parts. You must be careful.\n{Ina:} Ah, indeed, before in Trifia, I also encountered the demons who wanted to find the \"Dragonbone Greaves\", but fortunately it didn't fall into their hands. But what are they looking for \"Dragon King Divine Power\" for?\n{Roland:} I don't know this anymore. The news has arrived, so I will leave now and wish you all the best.\n{Ina:} Wait, you ran so far away, ah no, flew, just to tell me this?\n{Roland:} Originally, I went to Mengying to ask about the whereabouts of an enemy. She told me that I had seen him in Terracia recently. In exchange, she asked me to help convey the news to you.\n{Ina:} So the enemy you are looking for is also in this area...what kind of enemy is it?\n{Roland:} Although we don't know each other, since it is the person Mengying wants to spread, he must not be a bad person, so I'll tell you. That enemy is {Demon Kairon}. Two years ago, in the village where I lived, he killed 15 people, including my mother, while I was out, just to steal the village's treasure {\"Dragon Shield\"}.\n{Ina:} \"Dragon Shield\"! Isn't this one of the parts of \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\"? Now the \"Dragon Shield\" is still in his hand?\n{Roland:} I think it should be in his hands. When I go to kill this enemy and retrieve the \"Dragon Shield\", I will come to you again. When I learned that you were looking for the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", I planned to hand over the \"Dragon Shield\" to you, and I would only be saddened by my memories with it myself.\n{Ina:} Then let's go find Demon Kairon together. Since Mr. Roland helped us, we should also do our best for Mr. Roland. I know some magic, although it is not very strong, but it can be somewhat useful. I will work hard.\n{Roland:} Okay, thank you so much. I will go with you {temporarily}, {until I kill Kairon}.","{伊娜：}那么罗兰先生，你来找我又是什么事呢。\n{罗兰：}梦影让我告诉你，魔族现在也在四处寻找“龙王神力”，并且很可能已经得到了一些部件，你必须要小心了。\n{伊娜：}啊，确实呢，之前在特里菲亚，也遇到魔族想要找“龙骨胫甲”，好在没落入他们手中。不过他们要找“龙王神力”做什么呢？\n{罗兰：}这个我就不知道了。消息我已经传到，下面我就告辞啦，祝各位顺利。\n{伊娜：}等等，你这么大老远跑来，啊不，飞来，就为了告诉我这个吗？\n{罗兰：}本来我是去找梦影询问一个仇人的下落，她告诉我最近在泰拉西亚见过他的踪影。作为交换，她要我帮忙给你传达消息。\n{伊娜：}这么说你要找的仇人也就在这一带了……是个什么样的仇人？\n{罗兰：}虽然我们素不相识，不过既然是梦影想要传话的人，想必不是坏人，我就说给你们听好了。那个仇人是{恶魔凯隆}。两年前，他在我居住的村子里，趁我外出时杀害了包括我母亲在内的15口人，就为了抢走村里的宝物{“龙盾”}。\n{伊娜：}“龙盾”！这不是“龙王神力”的部件之一吗？现在“龙盾”还在他的手上？\n{罗兰：}我想应该在他手里。等我去杀了这个仇人，取回“龙盾”，再来找你们。得知你们在寻找“龙王神力”的时候，我就打算把“龙盾”交给你们了，我自己带着它只会因为回忆而更悲伤。\n{伊娜：}那么我们也一起去找恶魔凯隆吧。既然罗兰先生帮了我们的忙，我们也应该为罗兰先生尽点力。我会些魔法，虽然还不算很强，不过多少能有点用处。我会努力的。\n{罗兰：}好吧，那么多谢了。我就跟你们{暂时同行}吧，{直到杀了凯隆}为止。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then there are these 8 pieces, \"Red Dragon Sword\", \"Dragon Tooth Crest\", \"Dragon Shield\", \"Dragon Wing Robe\", \"Dragon Sword\", \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\", \"Dragon Eye Ring\" \",\"Longan Ring\".\n{Mengying:} Okay, with these, I'm going to get the \"Dragon Armor\" out.","{伊娜：}那么就是这8件了，“赤龙剑”，“龙牙冠”，“龙盾”，“龙翼袍”，“龙骨胫甲”，“龙牙项链”，“龙眼戒”，“龙眼指环”。\n{梦影：}好，有了这些，我这就去把“龙甲”弄出来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then you can show us the things first.\n{Owner:} Okay, wait a minute...Look, this is the \"Dragon Armor\".\n{Ina:} Why doesn't the detector respond at all? Could it be fake?\n{Owner:} How could it be fake? The merchants are based on honesty. Besides, I am a well-known treasure appraisal expert in this village. I also got the \"Treasure Appraisal Professional Eighth Certificate\" issued by the king. No doubt, 30,000 gold coins are already at a discount. You can take it away if you like it.","{伊娜：}那么你先把东西拿出来给我们看看吧。\n{店主：}好，稍等……请看，这就是“龙甲”。\n{伊娜：}怎么探测仪一点反应都没有的？该不会是假的吧？\n{店主：}怎么可能是假的呢，商人以诚信为本，再说了我可是这个村有名的宝物鉴定专家，我还拿过国王颁发的“宝物鉴定专业八级证书”呢。不用怀疑啦，30000金币，已经是打折价了，您喜欢就给您拿走。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then, according to the information provided by Ladia, we went to the deepest part of the cave to destroy the \"Spirit Gathering Tower\"!\n{Rael:} Oh, really want to do it, it really is Ina's style.\n{Freeman:} Ina has never been afraid of danger, and has always been able to overcome danger, so she is trustworthy.\n{Ina:} Ah, Jack, you don't need to follow it. You can go back. After all, you are the future king. If there is a case, what should Kartia do in the future.\n{Freeman:} Why, does Ina think I'm a burden?\n{Ina:} No, no, no, Jack has a wealth of knowledge and clever strategies, how can I get here without Jack's help. However, Ladia also said that it is dangerous inside, and he has to meet with Archbishop Yingluck...\n{Freeman:} Do you have no confidence this time to take the risk?\n{Ina:} Yes, of course!\n{Freeman:} That's it, let's go!","{伊娜：}那么，根据拉迪亚提供的情报，我们去洞的最深处破坏那个“聚灵塔”！\n{雷尔：}呵，真的要干，果然是伊娜的作风。\n{弗里曼：}伊娜从来都不怕危险，而且向来都有办法化险为夷，所以才值得信赖。\n{伊娜：}啊，杰克你不用跟着去啦，你回去好了，毕竟你是未来的国王呢，真要是有个万一，以后卡尔提亚该怎么办呀。\n{弗里曼：}怎么，伊娜觉得我是累赘吗？\n{伊娜：}不不不不不，杰克有丰富的知识和高明的计谋，没有杰克的帮助我哪能走到这里。但是，拉迪亚也说了，里面很危险，而且要跟英拉大主教打照面……\n{弗里曼：}你这回没有信心化险为夷了吗？\n{伊娜：}有啊，当然有！\n{弗里曼：}那就行了，走吧！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then, we set off for {Solandria}. It's going to be a long time by boat now.","{伊娜：}那么，我们就向{索兰德里亚}出发了。这下又要坐船好久啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Then, your opponent is now me. I'm on it.\n{Clio:} Hehe. {Rael:} Ina, be careful behind! There is a sneak attack!\n{Ina:} Huh? Are you deceiving?\n{Clio:} When did I promise you not to cheat? Don't think of me as stupid as Radia.","{伊娜：}那么，你的对手现在是我了。我上了哦。\n{克里奥：}嘿嘿。\n{雷尔：}伊娜，小心背后！有偷袭！\n{伊娜：}啊？你居然使诈？\n{克里奥：}我几时答应过你不使诈的？别把我想像得跟拉迪亚一样傻。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are also spherical things, no matter what, just take them all back.","{伊娜：}还有球形的东西，不管了，干脆全部带回去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are so many people here, what kind of performance seems to be happening here?\n{Raier:} But such a popular open-air venue, the rich Li Qide we are looking for shouldn't be here, right?\n{Scalper:} The performance of the popular idol group Youni Brothers is about to begin. Tickets for VIP seats only cost 5000 gold coins! There are the last three!\n{Ina:} I want three tickets!\n{Rael:} Isn't it? Ina, are you serious?\n{Ina:} Rael, you are from another continent, maybe you don't know it. Youni brothers are famous in Mirronia, they are the best street dancers in the whole continent, and they are handsome guys-don't be jealous, they are indeed handsomer than you-since they met their performance, and there is just the last How can I miss the ticket? Come on, there are exactly three tickets, and you two will also go together.","{伊娜：}这里好多人，好像有什么公演？\n{雷尔：}不过这样庶民化的露天会场，我们要找的富豪李奇德应该不会在这里的吧。\n{黄牛：}人气偶像组合尤尼兄弟的公演马上就要开始啦。贵宾席的票只要5000金币！还有最后三张！\n{伊娜：}三张票我要了！\n{雷尔：}不是吧？伊娜你是认真的？\n{伊娜：}雷尔你是从别的大陆来的，可能不知道吧。尤尼兄弟在米尔罗尼亚可有名了，是全大陆最好的街舞演员，而且是帅哥——你别嫉妒啊，确实比你还帅——既然碰到了他们的公演，而且正好还有最后的票，怎么能错过呢。来吧，正好三张票，你们两个也一起去啦。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are so many thieves here. I can't stand it anymore. I think it is necessary to find out their nest. According to Ina-chan's Universal Notebook, the robber's nest is usually on the mountain.\n{Rael:} There is a mountain in the {southeast direction}. I don't know if it's what they call {\"Longya Mountain\"}.\n{Ina:} I think I can't be wrong. Go, let's go directly to their lair.","{伊娜：}这边的盗贼真是多，看不下去了，我觉得有必要去把他们的老巢找出来了。根据伊娜酱万能笔记本记载，盗贼的老巢一般在山上。\n{雷尔：}在{东南方向}有坐高山，不知是不是他们所称的{“龙牙山”}。\n{伊娜：}我看多半不会错。走，我们直接去他们老巢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are steep mountain roads after landing. Is this the Taslinna Mountain? It would be nice if I could ask someone to ask.","{伊娜：}靠岸之后都是陡峭的山路，这里就是塔斯林纳山吗？要是能找个人问问就好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are still demons remnants? I thought it was all gone.\n{Devil:} I am the most elite demon force of the Demon Clan, so I don't run away like those cowards. Even if I am the only one, I will fight to the end.","{伊娜：}还有魔族残党？我还以为都跑光了呢。\n{恶魔：}我是魔族最精锐的恶魔部队，才不像那些胆小鬼那样逃跑。就算只剩我一个也要战斗到底。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There are still many pits here, and they have all been dug. There must be people inside.","{伊娜：}这边还有不少坑，果然都被人挖过了。里面肯定还有人。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a dark river to the south, maybe you can use it...\n{Rael:} Have you thought of a good idea?\n{Ina:} I haven't fully thought about it yet, but I think if I can lure Archbishop Yingluck to the opposite side of the dark river...\n{Rael:} Since he can pass, he can naturally come back.\n{Ina:} Grandpa told me a story called \"Crossing the River and Demolition of the Bridge\". Although there is no bridge here, if we find a way to destroy the key link necessary for crossing the river, it is equivalent to dismantling the bridge.\n{Freeman:} A key part of crossing the river, do you mean the boat?\n{Ina:} There is something more crucial than a boat, that is\n{shore}. {Rael:} Ina, what the hell did you come up with?\n{Ina:} Hmm...you will understand what I do.\n{Freeman:} However, one thing is very important. We must not only be able to live by ourselves, but also allow Archbishop Yingluck to live well even after we have passed, so that Ina's crossing the river and bridge can be established. Calling a boat can only call one boat. How can we let the boat we have used be used by Archbishop Yingluck on the opposite side?\n{Ina:} Yes, this is very troublesome. However, as long as there is {appropriate river bank line}, there is still a way to achieve it.","{伊娜：}这里的南边是一条暗河，也许可以利用了一下……\n{雷尔：}你已经想到好主意了吗？\n{伊娜：}还没有完全想好，只是，我想如果能引诱英拉大主教到暗河的对面的话……\n{雷尔：}既然他能过去，自然也能回得来。\n{伊娜：}爷爷以前跟我讲过一个叫“过河拆桥”的故事。这里虽然是没有桥啦，但是如果我们想办法把过河必须的关键一环破坏掉，也就相当于拆桥了啊。\n{弗里曼：}过河必须的关键一环，你是指船？\n{伊娜：}还有比船更关键的东西哦，那就是{岸}。\n{雷尔：}伊娜你到底想出什么鬼主意了？\n{伊娜：}嗯……你们看我怎么做就会明白了。\n{弗里曼：}不过，有一点很重要，我们不但要自己能过得去，还要让英拉大主教在我们过去之后仍然过得去，伊娜的过河拆桥才能成立啊。召船术只能召一只船，怎么样才能让我们用过的船给对面的英拉大主教使用呢？\n{伊娜：}是啊，这一点很伤脑筋呢。不过，只要有{合适的河岸线}，还是有办法实现的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a hole here, we should have found the right place.","{伊娜：}这里有地洞，我们应该是找对地方了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a hole on the top of the mountain, which seems to be hot. Go in and have a look.","{伊娜：}山顶上居然有一个地洞，里面好像直冒热气啊。进去看看吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a house in front. It seems someone lives here? If you ask them, maybe you can get any clues. After knocking on the door, an old man with a white beard opened the door. He still has a copy of \"The Sea of Poetry\" in his hand.\n{Old man:} Hearing the knocking sound in the distance, a guest came to the door.\n{Ina:} Hello, grandpa, may I ask...\n{Old man:} Next sentence! What's the next sentence!\n{Ina:} Uh...\n{Freeman:} Peeking into the exquisite seam, you can still see Yu Lian Ren.\n{Old man:} Good! finally someone who understands poetry.\n{Ina:} Jack, this is? ...\n{Freeman:} The famous work \"Wang\" by the poet Li Jian.\n{Old man:} Young man, promising! Some time ago, a ghostly guy knocked on the door and wanted to ask me what treasures he wanted, but he asked him three famous poems, but he couldn't answer a word, and was kicked away by the old man.\n{Ina:} That shouldn't be Vidor...\n{Rael:} Maybe it's a ghost, this characteristic fits well.\n{Old man:} What is it for you to come to see the old man? Since that young man can answer Li Jian's poem, the old man can show you the way.\n{Ina:} We would like to inquire, grandpa, do you know where the \"green thunder ring\" is...\n{Old man:} Hmm... If you want the old man to tell you this, you must answer one of the old man's Poem title.\n{Freeman:} Although I dare not say that I am sure, I will give it a try.\n{Old man:} Recite a poem that best shows the surrounding scenery to the old man.\n{Freeman:} I think about it... there is it! Wu De \"Climb to the Top\": Walk alone in the cold mountains and worship the breeze, looking down at the mountains and surroundings. The blue sky, clouds and sea are covered with snow, and the Qingling ice cliff breaks the sky.\n{Old man:} Good! That's right, this poem is a masterpiece that best fits my Qingyunling landscape, especially the last two sentences, which are hailed as divine sentences.\n{Ina:} Jack is really amazing...\n{Freeman:} I just memorized other people's poems, it's nothing, the masters of morality who can write this poem are really amazing.\n{Old man:} Then, according to the agreement, the old man will tell you where the \"Blue Thunder Ring\" is. From here {to the west}, after reaching {Thunder God Peak}, you can find the \"Blue Thunder Ring\". However, whether you are qualified to take it, I am afraid there is still another test.","{伊娜：}前面有房子耶。看来有人居住在这里？如果向他们打听一下的话，说不定能得到什么线索。\n\n敲门之后，一个须发飒白的老人打开了门。他手里还揣着一本《诗海》。\n{老人：}遥闻叩声响，有客来登门。\n{伊娜：}老爷爷您好，请问……\n{老人：}下句！下句是什么！\n{伊娜：}呃……\n{弗里曼：}轻窥玲珑缝，犹见玉怜人。\n{老人：}好！终于有懂诗的人了。\n{伊娜：}杰克，这是？……\n{弗里曼：}诗人李简的名作《望》。\n{老人：}年轻人，有出息！前些时候有个鬼头鬼脑的家伙来敲门，还想问我打听什么宝物，结果问了他三句名诗，他一句都答不上来，当即被老夫踢走了。\n{伊娜：}那个该不会是维多吧……\n{雷尔：}没准就是，鬼头鬼脑，这个特征很符合。\n{老人：}你们来找老夫是什么事呢？既然那个年轻人能答出来李简的诗，老夫可以给你们指路。\n{伊娜：}我们想打听一下，老爷爷您知不知道“青雷环”的所在之处……\n{老人：}嗯……如果想要老夫告诉你们这个，你们必须再回答出来老夫的一个诗题。\n{弗里曼：}虽然不敢说一定有把握，不过我试试看吧。\n{老人：}给老夫吟一首最能展现这周围景色的名诗。\n{弗里曼：}我想想……有了！舞德《登顶》：\n独步寒山拜清风，\n俯望群峦围纵横。\n碧空云海遍地雪，\n青岭冰崖破天峰。\n{老人：}好！没错，这首诗是最符合我青云岭的景观的绝世佳作，尤其是末两句，被誉为神句。\n{伊娜：}杰克真厉害……\n{弗里曼：}我只是背别人的诗，不算什么啦，能写出这诗的舞德大师才是真正的厉害呢。\n{老人：}那么，就依照约定，老夫告诉你们“青雷环”的所在。从这里{向西}，到达{雷神峰}之后，你们就能找到“青雷环”了。不过，你们是不是有资格取走它，恐怕还要经受一个考验。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a new summoning technique available.","{伊娜：}又有新的召唤术可以用了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a pub here, there are a lot of people, let's inquire for information. Ask the prime minister, where is Holia.\n{Ina:} This eldest brother, may I ask how I want to find Prime Minister Holia?\n{Guest A:} Don't ask me, I don't know.\n{Ina:} This uncle, where can I see Prime Minister Holia?\n{Guest B:} Do you want to find him? I won't tell you even if I know it.\n{Ina:} Hello, eldest sister, can you please inquire about Prime Minister Holia...\n{Guest C:}... (Run back)\n{Ina:} Hey, what's the matter? It seems that everyone is not very welcome. topic.","{伊娜：}这边有个酒馆耶，人挺多的，我们打听打听情报吧。问问宰相霍利亚在哪里。\n\n{伊娜：}这位大哥，请问我想找宰相霍利亚大人该怎么走？\n{客人A：}别问我，我不知道。\n{伊娜：}这位大叔，去哪里能见到宰相霍利亚大人？\n{客人B：}你想找他？我就算知道也不告诉你。\n{伊娜：}大姐您好，能不能打听一下宰相霍利亚大人……\n{客人C：}……（回头就跑）\n{伊娜：}咦，这是怎么了，好像大家不太欢迎这个话题。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a question I don’t understand. Why did Archbishop Yingluck open the back door to this place?\n{Freeman:} I don't know this either. It seems that this place has nothing to do with Archbishop Yingluck, it is another country.\n{Ina:} Also, this Lord Kurug has a very different attitude from the group of centaurs before. It's really weird. Besides, how did they know we were here? The news is really well-informed.\n{Rael:} Anyway, we might as well meet their queen first. After all, we are here to find the parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". If the queen is more accommodating, we may be able to save a lot of trouble.\n{Ina:} That's true. But I still care more about what the Centaur said just now, so I can ask the Lord Kurug.","{伊娜：}话说有一个问题我想不明白，英拉大主教为什么会把后门开到这个地方来呢？\n{弗里曼：}这个我也不知道。好像这里跟英拉大主教完全没有关系，是另一个国度了。\n{伊娜：}还有还有，这个库鲁格大人，跟之前那群半人马，态度真是天壤之别啊。真是太奇怪了。另外他们怎么知道我们到这里来的？消息真灵通。\n{雷尔：}不管怎么说，我们不如先见到他们的女王再说吧。毕竟我们来这里是为了找“龙王神力”的部件，如果女王比较通融，我们也许可以省去不少麻烦。\n{伊娜：}说得也是。不过我还是对刚才半人马说的话比较在意，我问问那个库鲁格大人好了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a sea of fire everywhere outside...Did Solo do it all?\n{Mengying:} To be precise, it should be the \"Sword of Destruction\".\n{Freeman:} Solo wanted to conquer the mainland, and there was no reason to razing everything he went to.\n{Ina:} Could it be that...\n{Freeman:} In the worst case, as Archbishop Yingluck said, Solo can no longer control the \"Sword of Destruction\"...\n{Rael:} This way If it goes down, this continent...\n{Mengying:} may be completely destroyed. The entire continent was burned to ashes by the \"Sword of Destruction\".\n{Ina:} It's terrible...\n{Mengying:} Anyway, you can only find Solo first and destroy him, although this may not necessarily save the continent...","{伊娜：}外面到处是一片火海……这都是索罗干的吗？\n{梦影：}准确地说，应该是“毁灭之剑”干的吧。\n{弗里曼：}索罗想要征服大陆，没理由把所到之处全部夷为平地的。\n{伊娜：}难道说……\n{弗里曼：}最坏的结果，也许就像英拉大主教所说的那样，索罗已经无法控制“毁灭之剑”了……\n{雷尔：}这样下去的话，这个大陆……\n{梦影：}也许就会完全灭亡。整个大陆，都被“毁灭之剑”烧成灰烬。\n{伊娜：}太可怕了……\n{梦影：}不管怎么说，只有先找到索罗，把他消灭，虽然这样也不一定有办法救得了这个大陆……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a way, you come.\n{Rael:} What solution did you think of?\n{Ina:} It is written in Ina-chan's universal notebook. Rael told me that I can fool the enemy's eyes by disguising myself. Let's put on the clothes of the Barland army just now, and there will be no trouble when we encounter the enemy.","{伊娜：}有办法了，你们来。\n{雷尔：}想到什么办法了？\n{伊娜：}伊娜酱万能笔记本上有写哦，雷尔告诉我可以通过乔装改扮来骗过敌人的眼睛。我们把刚才那些巴兰德军的衣服穿上，遇到敌人就不会有麻烦了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a way, you come.\n{Rael:} What solution did you think of?\n{Ina:} It is written in Ina-chan's universal notebook. Rael told me that I can fool the enemy's eyes by disguising. Let's put on the clothes of the Barland army just now, and there will be no trouble when we encounter the enemy.","{伊娜：}有办法了，你们来。\n{雷尔：}想到什么办法了？\n{伊娜：}伊娜酱万能笔记本上有写哦，雷尔告诉我可以通过乔装改办来骗过敌人的眼睛。我们把刚才那些巴兰德军的衣服穿上，遇到敌人就不会有麻烦了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is a {watchtower} below. It should be easier to walk to see the panoramic view of the lake.","{伊娜：}下面有个{了望塔}，去看一下湖面全景应该会比较容易行走。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is no time to detour elsewhere, so hurry up and find Gals.","{伊娜：}现在没有时间去别的地方绕路了，赶紧去找到加尔斯吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is no time to hang out elsewhere.","{伊娜：}现在没有工夫去别处闲逛。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is no way, weird...\n{Rael:} There is no other passable place in this area.\n{Freeman:} Wait, look at the rocks here.\n{Rael:} Is there anything special about these volcanic rocks?\n{Freeman:} Do you think volcanic rocks have such cuts?\n{Ina:} So, I have never seen volcanic rocks like this.\n{Freeman:} Naturally formed volcanic rock should be a whole large piece of lava formed by cooling, and there should be no edges and corners. These are obviously artificially cut.\n{Rael:} So, someone should have chopped up and manipulated these rocks for some purpose...\n{Ina:} So that's it!\n{Rael:} Come on, everyone remove these rocks.\n{Freeman:} Sure enough...\n{Ina:} There is a hole.\n{Rael:} The rock that was moved to hide the hole...\n{Ina:} Let's go, let's go in.","{伊娜：}没有路了，奇怪……\n{雷尔：}这一带也没有其他可以通行的地方了。\n{弗里曼：}等等，你们看，这边的岩石。\n{雷尔：}这些火山岩，有什么特别吗？\n{弗里曼：}你们觉得火山岩会有这样的切块吗？\n{伊娜：}这么说来，我确实没见过这种样子的火山岩耶。\n{弗里曼：}自然形成的火山岩应该是熔岩冷却形成的整体的大块而且不会有棱角，这些明显是人为切割成的。\n{雷尔：}这么说来，应该是有人为了什么目的切碎并搬弄了这些岩石……\n{伊娜：}原来是这样！\n{雷尔：}来，大家把这些岩石搬开。\n{弗里曼：}果然……\n{伊娜：}有洞口呢。\n{雷尔：}为了隐藏这个洞口才搬的岩石……\n{伊娜：}走吧，我们进去。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There is such a deep waterway under this cave that most people can't make it through...\n{Freeman:} Therefore, none of the people who were taken to the deepest place to do hard work could escape.\n{Ina:} Yes, it's so pathetic.\n{Rael:} Wait, how do we get out?\n{Ina:} I haven't thought about this yet, but there is always a way. I will work hard.","{伊娜：}这洞底下居然还有这么深的水道，一般人还过不去呢……\n{弗里曼：}所以被押到最深处做苦工的人一个也逃不出来。\n{伊娜：}是哦，真可怜。\n{雷尔：}等下我们怎么出去呢？\n{伊娜：}这个我还没想好呢，不过，总会有办法的。我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There really is a black dragon. It's not your meal time, right? Don't come at me, I don't want to hurt wild animals. Don't force me to do it...","{伊娜：}真的有黑龙耶。现在不是你们的吃饭时间吧？你们别冲我来啊，我不想伤害野生动物呢。不要逼我动手啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There seems to be a river in front, and there will also be a river under this cave.\n{Freeman:} Isn't it strange that there is a river in the cave, as long as there is a water source, there can be a river. I have traveled to the Galadias cave before, and there is a lake in the cave. That is a major attraction in Kartia.\n{Ina:} Hey, that must be interesting, I really want to see it. I'm not as knowledgeable as Jack. Anyway, take notes first. ?a?aThe problem right now is that it looks like we still have to cross this river. It's too narrow and can't even call boats. It seems that we can only find a way to use water.","{伊娜：}前面好像有河啊，这洞穴下面也会有河呢。\n{弗里曼：}洞里面有河不奇怪吧，只要有水源就可以有河了。我以前去过加拉迪亚斯溶洞旅游过，那洞里面还有个湖呢。那可是卡尔提亚的一大名胜景点哦。\n{伊娜：}咦，那一定很有意思吧，好想去看看。我可没有杰克这么见多识广啦。不管怎么说，先笔记下来吧。——眼下的问题是，看起来我们还必须要渡过这条河，这里面太窄了，根本连召船都召不了，看来还是只能想办法使用水行啊。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There seems to be a tunnel here, go down and take a look.","{伊娜：}这里好像有一个地道，下去看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There seems to be some magic spells carved on the wall here. Could it be used to ward off evil spirits? Let me write it down first.","{伊娜：}这边墙上好像刻着些魔法咒文。莫非是辟邪用的？我先记下来吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There seems to be someone on the reef over there, and there seems to be a lot of blood. Could it be the one who was attacked by the sea monster? Let's go over and take a look.\n{Rael:} Does this person seem to have seen us?\n{Ina:} Ah, it's Brother Mondo! How will you be here?\n{Mondo:} Hey...It's really shameful. I didn't expect me to tell you half-jokingly that I might die, and I'm really going to die here now, and my death is so ugly...\n{Ina:} Don't That said, I will use healing magic.\n{Freeman:} Too much blood loss. If the blood transfusion is not possible, the healing magic may not be able to save it.\n{Ina:} I need a blood transfusion, what should I do? Where is the blood source...","{伊娜：}看那边的礁石上好像有个人，好像还有不少血迹。该不会是被海怪袭击了的人吧。我们过去看看。\n{雷尔：}这个人好像我们见过？\n{伊娜：}啊，是蒙多大哥！你怎么会在这里？\n{蒙多：}哎……真是丢人，想不到我半开玩笑地跟你说我说不定就会挂掉，这会儿就真的要死在这里了，而且死相这么难看……\n{伊娜：}别这么说，我来用治疗魔法。\n{弗里曼：}失血太多了。如果不能输血的话治疗魔法可能也救不过来。\n{伊娜：}要输血啊，这该怎么办呢？哪里有血源……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} There was a boat ahead, so fast, it rushed towards us.\n{Freeman:} Could this be the pinate whirlwind?\n{PInate:} Stop the ship ahead!\n{Ina:} It really is a pinate.\n{PInate:} You are quite courageous, I should have heard that this is my site, and dare to send it to the door. Could it be that he made a special trip to honor my uncle?\n{Ina:} Go to death! I heard that you not only rob but also murder, even those who don't have money are spared. You are a real villain.\n{PInate:} Sir, I just like killing people, it's fun. money? Do i need money? What do I want, just grab it, do I need to buy it? Doing a pinate is just a picture of a cool character. Seeing the blood splashing, I am happy, uncle!\n{Ina:} Scum! Originally I wanted to persuade you to turn around, but it seems unnecessary.\n{PInate:} The tone is not small, it has a personality, I like it, uncle, it is more interesting to kill the lamb that can resist. I know you can do magic, but you can try it. Does magic have any effect on this uncle? When you look at your desperate eyes, your hands will rise and fall, and that feeling will be wonderful. Wow ha ha ha~~~~~~~","{伊娜：}前面有船，好快的速度，就朝我们冲来了。\n{弗里曼：}莫非这个就是海盗飞旋风？\n\n{海盗：}前面的船给我停下！\n{伊娜：}果然是海盗。\n{海盗：}你们挺有胆子啊，应该听说过这里是我的地盘吧，还敢送上门来。莫非是专程来孝敬大爷我的？\n{伊娜：}去死！听说你不但抢劫还杀人，连没钱的人都不放过，真是十足的恶棍。\n{海盗：}大爷我就是喜欢杀人，过瘾。钱？我需要钱吗？我想要什么东西，直接抢就是，还用得着买？干海盗就是图个爽字，看那鲜血飞溅的样子，大爷我就是痛快！\n{伊娜：}人渣！本来还想劝你回头是岸的，看来没有必要了。\n{海盗：}口气不小嘛，有个性，大爷我喜欢，就是要会抵抗的羔羊杀起来才更有意思。我知道你会魔法，不过，你可以试试，魔法对本大爷有没有作用。到时候看着你绝望的眼神手起刀落，那个感觉才叫美妙。哇哈哈哈~~~~~~~\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} These two guys are wearing so thick armor, they look much more difficult to deal with than the Qiu Ba just now.\n{Rael:} This is a heavily armed Crusader swordsman. We can't fight it hard. If there is magic, it might be possible to deal with it.","{伊娜：}这两个家伙穿着好厚的盔甲，看上去比刚才的丘八难对付多了。\n{雷尔：}这是全副武装的十字军剑士，硬拼我们根本打不过的，如果有魔法的话倒是还有可能可以对付。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Things are getting more and more wrong. There are no people here, but monsters are emerging.\n{Rael:} Those guys belong to the demons, are they chasing me here?\n{Ina:} No, they don't recognize you. They directly call us humans, indicating that their goal is only to attack humans.\n{Rael:} It seems that this area has become such a barren land, which is related to these demons.","{伊娜：}越来越不对劲了，这里人都没有，却冒出怪物来。\n{雷尔：}那些家伙是魔族的，难道是追杀我到这里的？\n{伊娜：}不像，他们并不认识你的样子。他们直接管我们叫人类，说明他们的目标只是袭击人类。\n{雷尔：}看起来，这一带变成这样的一片荒土，跟这些魔族有关。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This big guy is too conspicuous, so put him away.","{伊娜：}这个大家伙太显眼了，还是把他收起来吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This book is for Bishop Yingdala, I can't take it away myself.","{伊娜：}这书是要给英大拉主教的，我自己可不能拿走。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This building should be the \"Spirit Tower\". I can feel the magic inside this tower.\n{Rael:} There is a strong evil in it.\n{Ina:} Can Rael feel it too?\n{Rael:} As a glorious saint, I have a special sensitivity to evil and dark magic. From the inside of this tower, the evil spirit radiated is as similar as the feeling I felt when I fought against the scarlet witch Kryana, who is good at manipulating evil spirits...\n{Ina:} But anyway, what is in front of me. This thing is just piled up with stones, even if it has magical power, it will be nothing if you blow it up. We are here to destroy it. See tricks...\n{Freeman:} Wait, Ina!\n{Ina:} Well, Jack, what did you find again?\n{Freeman:} Don't use magic that is too destructive, otherwise the vibration will cause the cave to collapse.\n{Ina:} Oh, too, this is really troublesome. If you use a magic with low power, I'm afraid it won't be blown up. Well, I will try it first. Look at the trick, little Ina mini-blasting mine~~~~~ Ina throws a fireball at the tower pillar, and the fireball explodes in front of the tower pillar and spreads into flames in all directions. However, a green light suddenly enveloped the entire body of the tower pillar, covering the entire body of the tower pillar like a shield. The moment the flame touched the green wall, it bounced away.\n{Rael:} Danger! Ina was still in shock, Rael flew to the front and caught the fire with his sword. But the shallow flames still scorched several cracks in Rael's armor.\n{Rael:} Good risk, are you all right?\n{Ina:} Here, what is going on... Rael, are you injured?\n{Rael:} It doesn't matter, it's just a little injury.\n{Freeman:} It seems that your magic has been bounced back.\n{Ina:} Oh, fortunately, I just heard what Jack said, otherwise if you use powerful magic, you will be finished... But what should I do now, if I can't use magic to hit it, how can I destroy him? Don't tell me I can only use a hammer and a shovel.","{伊娜：}这个建筑，该就是“聚灵塔”了吧。我可以感觉到这个塔柱的内部蕴含着的魔力。\n{雷尔：}里面有一股很强的邪气。\n{伊娜：}雷尔也能感觉到吗？\n{雷尔：}我作为光辉圣族，对邪暗魔力是有特殊的感应的。从这个塔的里面，散发出来的那阵邪气，就如同我以前跟擅长操纵恶灵的赤色魔女克里亚娜交手时的感觉那般相似……\n{伊娜：}但是不管怎么说，眼前的这个东西只是用石头堆成的而已，即使有魔力又怎么样，把它炸掉就什么都没有了。我们不就是为了破坏掉它而来的嘛。看招……\n{弗里曼：}等等，伊娜！\n{伊娜：}嗯，杰克，你又发现什么了？\n{弗里曼：}不要使用破坏力太强的魔法，否则震动会使洞穴塌方。\n{伊娜：}也是哦，这可真麻烦，如果使用威力小的魔法，只怕炸不动它。好吧，我试一试先。看招，伊娜酱微型爆破雷~~~~~\n\n伊娜把一个火球丢向塔柱，火球在塔柱跟前炸开，散成四射的火焰。然而塔柱的周身突然笼起一围绿光，像护罩一般包住了塔柱全身。火焰在触到绿光壁的一刹那，都被反弹开。\n\n{雷尔：}危险！\n\n伊娜还在惊呆中，雷尔飞身挡到前面，用剑接住了射来的火焰。但是浅射开来的火焰还是在雷尔的衣甲上灼开了好几个裂口。\n\n{雷尔：}好险，你们没事吧？\n{伊娜：}这，这是怎么回事呀……雷尔，你受伤了？\n{雷尔：}不要紧，一点小伤而已。\n{弗里曼：}似乎是你的魔法被反弹回来了。\n{伊娜：}呜，幸亏刚才听了杰克的话，要不然如果使用了强劲的魔法，就完蛋了……不过这下怎么办哪，如果不能用魔法去打它的话，怎么才能破坏他呢，别告诉我只能用锤子铁锹什么的啊。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This clumsy basilisk is too slow in the mountains.","{伊娜：}这个笨拙的蛇鸡怪在山地里行动太慢了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is Black Wind Valley. It is said that there is a black dragon...\n{Freeman:} Although this is the only way, Ina, you should think about how to deal with the black dragon.\n{Ina:} Hit them with magic.\n{Rael:} The black dragon is immune to all magic, and your magic is completely useless to hit them.\n{Ina:} Really? It's so powerful, so quickly take notes. Well, you can't use magic to fight, what should I do now, I have to think about it, I will work hard.","{伊娜：}这里就是黑风谷了吧。据说有黑龙的地方……\n{弗里曼：}虽然说这是唯一的通路，不过，伊娜，你还是考虑一下如何对付黑龙比较好。\n{伊娜：}用魔法打它们。\n{雷尔：}黑龙免疫所有魔法，你的魔法打它们是完全没用的。\n{伊娜：}真的吗？这么厉害，赶紧笔记下来。嗯，不能用魔法打，这下该怎么办呢，我得想想，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is Silan Village, right? However, the villagers here are so strange, all silent, no one to welcome foreign visitors? There are a lot of people gathered in front of me, so let's go over and ask.\n{Rael:} You still like watching the show, Ina.\n{Ina:} But, I always feel that those people are not normal.\n{Freeman:} We have to find the pier and try to get out to sea.\n{Raier:} Come on, let's go, let's go find someone to ask, Ina, I'll beg you here.\n{Ina:} Well, I will ask them.","{伊娜：}这里就是史兰村了吧？可是，这里的村民怎么都好奇怪，一个个默不作声的，没一个人来欢迎外地来客？前面有好多人聚集在一起，过去问问看呢。\n{雷尔：}你还那么喜欢看热闹啊，伊娜。\n{伊娜：}可是，我总觉得那些人不太正常耶。\n{弗里曼：}我们得先找到码头设法出海才是。\n{雷尔：}得了，这样吧，我们分头去找人问，伊娜，这边就拜托你了。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我会问他们的。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is it, this place is quite suitable, attract them to discover us.\n{Rael:} Attracting them means...\n{Ina:} Here is a string of fireworks~~~~ Ina hit a string of fireballs into the air.\n{Dragon Cavalry A:} Huh? Dude, what do you think it is?\n{Dragon Cavalry B:} A string of sparks rises from the ground, it looks so beautiful, it seems to be lined up in a line of words...\n{Drakon A:} What word?\n{Dragon Cavalry B:} \"You are pigs\"... asshole, who dares to provoke us so?\n{Dragon Cavalry A:} It seems to be in the bushes below.\n{Dragon Cavalry B:} Go, guys, go and teach them!","{伊娜：}就是这里了，这个地方挺合适，吸引他们发现我们吧。\n{雷尔：}吸引他们是指……\n{伊娜：}来一串礼花~~~~\n\n伊娜向空中打了一串火球。\n\n{龙骑兵A：}嗯？伙计，你看那是什么？\n{龙骑兵B：}一串火花从地面升上来，真好看，好像还排成了一行文字……\n{龙骑兵A：}什么字啊？\n{龙骑兵B：}“你们是猪”……混帐，什么人，敢这么挑衅我们？\n{龙骑兵A：}好像就在下面的树丛当中。\n{龙骑兵B：}走，伙计们，去教训他们！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is it? Exit?\n{Rael:} is where we come in. It used to require spells to pass through the enchantment, but now that the enchantment is destroyed, it seems that anyone can go in and out freely.\n{Ina:} So, have we searched it all? Still not found?\n{Elder:} Do you feel anything strange?\n{Freeman:} Calories!\n{Elder:} That's right. That guy is {not far from the hole}. He wanted to run away, so he hurried to catch up.\n{Ina:} Understood. I will work hard.","{伊娜：}这里是？出口？\n{雷尔：}就是我们进来的地方。本来需要法术才能穿过结界，现在结界破坏了之后似乎谁都可以自由出入了。\n{伊娜：}这么说，我们已经全部找遍了吗？还是没有找到？\n{长老：}你们有没有感觉到什么异样？\n{弗里曼：}热量！\n{长老：}没错。那家伙就在{洞外不远处}。他想逃走，赶快追上去。\n{伊娜：}明白了。我会努力的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is not the place we should go now.","{伊娜：}这里不是我们目前应该去的地方吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is terrible. Their navy will drive us away.\n{Freeman:} Maybe there is a connection between things. I guess, Holia may have already got the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".\n{Ina:} Why do you say that?\n{Freeman:} From the words of the boy in the port before, it can be seen that he had been to Solandria not long ago, so the sea ban has only been implemented recently. And Radia also went to Solandria at this time. At this time, it was a little too coincidental.\n{Rael:} Maybe this is the instruction of the Demon Race.\n{Ina:} Makes sense. I will record it first. It seems we have to hurry up.\n{Rael:} Then, if you encounter the Solandria Navy again, do you want to...\n{Ina:} Well, there is no way, only to offend them.","{伊娜：}这下可糟糕了。他们的海军都要驱赶我们。\n{弗里曼：}也许事情之间是有联系的。我猜想，霍利亚可能已经得到了“火灵珠”。\n{伊娜：}为什么这么说呢？\n{弗里曼：}从之前港口那个少年的话，可以看出不久之前他还去过索兰德里亚，所以海禁是最近刚刚才开始实行的。而拉迪亚也是在这个时间去了索兰德里亚，这时间上，也太巧了一点吧。\n{雷尔：}也许这正是魔族的授意也说不定。\n{伊娜：}有道理。我先记录下来。看来我们得抓紧了。\n{雷尔：}那么，下面如果再碰到索兰德里亚海军的话，你是不是又要……\n{伊娜：}嗯，没办法了，只有得罪他们了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the baby helmet that the Sea Dragon King said...\n{Freeman:} Ah, isn't this {Aris' helmet}?\n{Ina:} Huh? No...\n{Freeman:} It can't be wrong.\n{Ina:} But, didn't you say Jack, haven't you seen the real thing?\n{Freeman:} But I have seen a portrait, exactly like this one.\n{Ina:} So, the rumor that the bad guy said is still true. I tried desperately to find it before and couldn't find it. I didn't think about it at all now, but it appeared before my eyes.\n{Rael:} This means that if you deliberately plant flowers without blooming, unintentionally plant willows and willow trees.\n{Ina:} Sure enough, my instincts are not wrong at all.\n{Rael:} You were hitting by mistake...\n{Ina:} No...\n{Freeman:} Anyway, this matter is settled satisfactorily. Can I go to the Demon Realm? There is hope now. Let's go back to {Kozia City} for a break, and then consider the next step.\n{Ina:} Well, go back.","{伊娜：}这个就是海龙王所说的宝贝头盔……\n{弗里曼：}啊，这不是{亚里斯的头盔}吗？\n{伊娜：}咦？不是吧……\n{弗里曼：}不会错的。\n{伊娜：}可是，杰克你不是说过，你没见过实物吗？\n{弗里曼：}可是我见过画像啊，就跟这个一模一样。\n{伊娜：}这么说，坏人先生所说的那个传言，还是真的咧。之前拼命想找它找不到，这会儿根本没想它，它却自己出现在眼前了。\n{雷尔：}这就叫有心栽花花不开，无心插柳柳成荫吧。\n{伊娜：}果然，我的直觉一点都没错。\n{雷尔：}你那是误打误撞……\n{伊娜：}才不是呢……\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，这事情算是圆满解决了。能不能去魔界，现在也有希望了。大家先回{科齐亚城}休整一下，再考虑一下下一步行动吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯，回去吧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the island where the entrance to Magudia is located.\n{Rael:} It's not clear how strong the enemy is, but based on the posture of Chinu, the strength must not be weak, everyone must be careful.\n{Ina:} Well, thanks to Jack this time, I can raise an army, and I'm so courageous with more people.\n{Freeman:} Since taking the city of Kozia, more and more people have come to defect. I believe it won't be long before we can build a mighty teacher, with the help of magicians like Ina, Don't be afraid of Mozu and Archbishop Yingluck anymore. Maybe it's just training soldiers now, and the evil battle is still to come.\n{Ina:} Jack trusts me so much, I will work hard!","{伊娜：}这里就是通向玛格乌迪亚的入口所在的小岛了吧。\n{雷尔：}敌人有多强现在还不明确，不过光就那个齐努的架势来看，实力一定不弱，大家要小心。\n{伊娜：}嗯，这次多亏了杰克，能募集到一支军队，人多就壮胆了。\n{弗里曼：}自从拿下科齐亚城之后，前来投奔的人越来越多了，我相信用不了多久，我们能够建成一支威武之师，再加上伊娜这样的魔法师相助，不用再怕魔族和英拉大主教了。现在也许只是练兵，恶仗还在后头。\n{伊娜：}杰克这么信任我，我会努力的！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the land where Bataan City is located.","{伊娜：}这边就是巴塔安城所在的陆地了吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the pass.\n{Barland Guards:} Now that you have a pass, go over.","{伊娜：}这个就是通行证吧。\n{巴兰德军守卫：}既然有通行证，那么你们过去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the royal city. I wonder if the Prime Minister will come out to greet us, or hide in there to avoid seeing us? Or just come and say \"what's the crime of trespassing in the royal city\"?\n{Freeman:} Say that Cao Cao arrived.\n{Holia:} Ah, you are...\n{Ina:} Your Majesty, we are back.\n{Holia:} Ghost... God of Wealth, save me...\n{Ina:} I said, did you make a mistake? In this broad daylight, the sunny birds sang, where are the ghosts.\n{Holia:} But, my subordinates have obviously lured you to the dense forest and set them on fire...\n{Freeman:} There is only one mistake in your words. Just remove the word \"death\" from \"burn to death\". No problem. Burning is burning, but we escaped.\n{Holia:} Ah, this group of useless wastes can't be put on the fire well, and they can't do anything except count the money.\n{Ina:} Isn't this taught by the Prime Minister? When we came back, we wanted to ask, why did the Prime Minister repeatedly want to kill us?\n{Holia:} This is a misunderstanding. Actually, I didn't intend to harm you, but my subordinate made a mistake and originally asked him to cultivate farmland...\n{Freeman:} But the general who guarded the gate told us that the demons promised a huge reward for you to get rid of we?\n{Holia:} That wine bag and rice bag actually leaked again! Ah, no, no, that guy is talking nonsense all day long, don't listen to him...\n{Freeman:} Let me tell you this, Prime Minister, we know everything, you deliberately sent an army to chase us, and The matter of setting fire to the forest. But the goal of the Mozu is the \"Fire Orb\" in your hand. If they use your hand to get rid of us, they will definitely not let you go. It is better not to do business with them.\n{Holia:} You guys, do you want to threaten the truth? ...Or else, the demon clan offered me 2 million gold coins. If you pay more than them, I will help you, how about? For example, how about\n2.5 million gold coins?\n{Ina:} I actually want to blackmail us. We don't have that much money, even if we have it, we won't give it to you.\n{Holia:} Then there is nothing to say. He is the master of a country, how can he be threatened by you?\n{Ina:} Shouldn't the lord of a country be the king?\n{Holia:} His Majesty the King is in poor health and has entrusted me with full power to act for the affairs of the state.\n{Freeman:} How about let us see the king?\n{Holia:} No way. His Majesty the King must rest assured, if there are two shortcomings, can you bear the responsibility? This matter is not negotiable, even if you give money, you can't see it. Also, you, if there is nothing else to do, hurry out, this is the royal city, otherwise I will be called the Imperial Guard. Come, kick them out, huh? Come here? How about the Janissaries?\n{Ina:} Your Imperial Guard seems to be a bit weak, and we have already beaten to the ground.\n{Holia:} What, you...well, I'll withdraw...\n{Ina:} Ah, don't slip away.\n{Freeman:} Retracted into the city.","{伊娜：}这里面就是王城了，不知道宰相大人是会出来迎接我们呢，还是躲在里面避而不见？或者义正辞严地来个“擅闯王城，该当何罪”？\n{弗里曼：}说曹操曹操到。\n{霍利亚：}啊，你们是……\n{伊娜：}宰相大人，我们回来了。\n{霍利亚：}鬼啊……财神爷救救我……\n{伊娜：}我说，你有没有搞错啊，这光天化日之下，阳光明媚小鸟欢唱，哪来的鬼啊。\n{霍利亚：}可是，我的属下明明已经把你们引诱到了密林并且放火烧死了……\n{弗里曼：}您的话只有一点错误，把“烧死”的“死”字去掉就没问题了。烧是烧了，但是我们逃出来了。\n{霍利亚：}啊，这群没用的废物，放把火都放不好，除了会数钱之外啥都不会。\n{伊娜：}这不是宰相大人教出来的吗。我们回来就是想问问，为什么宰相大人屡次想置我们于死地？\n{霍利亚：}这个是误会啦。本相没有想加害于你们，只是我属下弄错了，本来让他去开垦农田……\n{弗里曼：}可是守门的那个将军跟我们说，魔族许诺了巨额赏金要你除掉我们？\n{霍利亚：}那个酒囊饭袋居然又说漏嘴！啊不不，是那个家伙成天胡说八道，你们不要听他的……\n{弗里曼：}这么跟您说吧，宰相大人，事情我们都清楚了，您故意出动军队追杀我们的事，以及放火烧林的事。但是魔族的目标就是您手里的“火灵珠”，如果他们借您的手除掉我们之后，一定不会放过您的。您还是不要跟他们做交易比较好。\n{霍利亚：}你们，难道想威胁本相？……要不这样吧，魔族给我开的价钱是200万金币，如果你们出得比他们多，我就帮你们，怎么样？比如250万金币如何？\n{伊娜：}居然还想敲诈我们哦。我们才没那么多钱呢，就算有也不会给你。\n{霍利亚：}那就没什么好说的了，本相是一国之主，岂能被你们威胁？\n{伊娜：}一国之主不是应该是国王吗？\n{霍利亚：}国王陛下身体欠佳，已经委托我全权代理国事。\n{弗里曼：}让我们见见国王如何？\n{霍利亚：}没门。国王陛下必须要安心休养，要是有个三长两短，你们负得起责吗？这事情不容商议，就算给钱也不能见。还有，你们，要是没有其他事情，赶快出去，这里是王城，要不然我要叫禁卫军了。来人，把他们赶出去，嗯？来人啊？禁卫军呢？\n{伊娜：}你的禁卫军，好像实力有点逊，已经被我们打趴下啦。\n{霍利亚：}什么，你们……好吧，我撤……\n{伊娜：}啊，别溜啊。\n{弗里曼：}缩进城里去了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the territory of the Kingdom of Barland, so no one should have discovered it.","{伊娜：}这边就是巴兰德王国的境内了，应该没有被什么人发现吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the time to completely get rid of Archbishop Yingluck. At least he should not be able to catch us for a while. Next, continue to search for the \"Spirit Gathering Tower\" in the depths.","{伊娜：}这下算是彻底甩掉英拉大主教了吧。至少他应该有一阵子没法来抓我们了。下面就继续向深处去寻找“聚灵塔”吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the town of the demons. Although the architectural style is very different from ours, it is not as cold as expected.\n{Rael:} What do you imagine?\n{Ina:} It looks like a haunted house...\n{Freeman:} The devil and the underworld are not the same thing, but whether the underworld really exists is also controversial. The current popular materialism is negative. of. The Demon World is just another place where the environment is strange to us.\n{Rael:} However, we didn't seem to attract much attention here, and the demons around us didn't seem to want to attack us...\n{Ina:} Yes, I thought they would fight when they saw us. .\n{Freeman:} Although I don't understand the reason very well, this is the best way. Let's see if there is any hotel or something. Let's take a break and check the information.","{伊娜：}这里就是魔族的城镇啊。虽然建筑风格和我们的差别很大，不过并没有想像中的那么阴冷嘛。\n{雷尔：}你想像中的是什么样的？\n{伊娜：}大概是鬼屋那种样子的……\n{弗里曼：}魔界和冥界不是一回事啦，不过冥界是不是真的存在也是有争议的，现在流行的唯物学说是持否定态度的。魔界只是一个环境对我们而言比较异样的另一个地方而已。\n{雷尔：}不过，我们在这里似乎并没有引起什么注意，周围过往的魔族也没有想要袭击我们的样子……\n{伊娜：}是呀，我还以为他们会见到我们就打呢。\n{弗里曼：}虽然不是很明白原因，不过这样最好了，前面看看有没有酒店什么的，去歇个脚打探一下情报吧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is the volcanic island no one said. You have to find a place to dock first.","{伊娜：}这就是没有人大姐所说的火山岛吧。得先找地方靠岸才好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This is where the uncle said that many explorers have gone and never returned? Although the beginning of the cave was quite gloomy, it didn't look dangerous to see the scenery as it went deep.","{伊娜：}这里就是那位大伯所说的许多探险家有去无回的地方？虽然进洞开始那一段挺阴森的，不过进到深处，看景色不像是很凶险的样子啊。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This lake is really inconvenient to walk on, it feels like crossing the river by feeling the stones...","{伊娜：}这个湖面上还真不方便行走，简直就像是摸着石头过河的感觉……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This library is huge and complicated.\n{Rael:} (Shhh~~~~~ Be quiet. We sneaked in)\n{Ina:} (I see. Let's find someone quickly.)","{伊娜：}这书库好大好复杂。\n{雷尔：}（嘘~~~~~轻声点。我们可是偷偷进来的）\n{伊娜：}（知道了。我们赶紧找人吧。）"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This looks like a lumber yard. You should be able to find wood.","{伊娜：}这里看上去像是一个伐木场耶，应该能找到木材吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This most prominent building seems to be that their headquarters is correct.\n{Rael:} There are still people talking in it. It should be the meeting that the soldier said just now.\n{Ina:} Go, let's go to the door.\n{Rael:} Go in? {Ina:} No, no, go and stand guard. Didn't those soldiers sneak out while standing guard just now? Then we can go back to their posts, and at the same time, we can clearly hear what is said inside at the door.\n{Freeman:} Yes, it is more important to collect information first. We still don't know which is Spindrift or how many enemy soldiers there are in this base. It is very dangerous to start rashly. Only when you find the target first, and then try to find him when you place an order, will it be safer. Sure enough, Ina is getting better and better, even thinking about this...\n{Ina:} Uh, this, I didn't think about it so much...Anyway, let's go to the door to stand guard and listen to what's said inside.","{伊娜：}这幢最显目的楼，看起来是他们的指挥部没错了。\n{雷尔：}里面还有人在讲话，应该就是刚才的士兵说的正在开会吧。\n{伊娜：}走，我们到门口去。\n{雷尔：}杀进去？\n{伊娜：}不不，去站岗啊。刚才那几个士兵不是站岗中偷偷溜出去的嘛。那么我们回到他们岗位上去就可以了，而且同时还能在门口很清楚地听到里面说什么。\n{弗里曼：}对啊，现在先收集情报更重要，我们现在还不知道哪个是斯拜恩罗德里，也不知道这个基地里有多少敌兵，贸然下手很危险。只有先找准目标，然后尽可能找他落单的时候下手，才会比较稳妥。伊娜果然越来越厉害了，连这些都想到了……\n{伊娜：}呃，这个，我没考虑那么多啦……总之我们先到门口去站岗，听听里面说些什么。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This mountain is so high, why do I feel a little uncomfortable...\n{Freeman:} Could it be altitude sickness?\n{Ina:} What is altitude sickness?\n{Freeman:} People who usually live in low-altitude areas may not adapt to the body due to factors such as lower air pressure when they climb a mountain for the first time. Such as dizziness, vertigo, fatigue, severe nausea, vomiting, chest tightness, etc. If it is really uncomfortable, let's go down the mountain first. Otherwise it will do great harm to your body.\n{Ina:} No, we must find the \"Blue Thunder Ring\" as soon as possible. Don't delay time casually. Jack, is there any cure for altitude sickness?\n{Freeman:} If it's not too serious, staying at the original altitude for a few days should get better. If it is serious, it is best to go down the mountain.\n{Ina:} It's okay for me. Let's continue on our way. Ouch~!\n{Rael:} Don't force yourself, you can't even walk.\n{Ina:} But, how can you not delay important things because of me... Oh, I'm really useless, I'm seasick, and altitude sickness...\n{Rael:} Come on, I'll carry you go.\n{Ina:} Rael? {Raier:} You have to persist on the road and have no strength. What else can you do besides carrying you...\n{Ina:} I am not a child, so why do I have to carry it...\n{Raier:} So you want the princess to hug?\n{Ina:} Forget it, let's recite...","{伊娜：}这山好高啊，为什么我感觉有点不舒服呢……\n{弗里曼：}莫非是高原反应？\n{伊娜：}高原反应是什么？\n{弗里曼：}平时生活在低海拔地区的人，初次登高山的时候，可能会因为气压变低等因素导致身体不适应。比如头晕，眼花，乏力，严重的甚至会恶心，呕吐，胸闷等。 如果实在不舒服，我们还是先下山吧。否则对你的身体伤害很大的。\n{伊娜：}不行啊，我们必须尽快找到“青雷环”才行。不能随便耽搁时间。杰克，高原反应有什么办法治疗吗？\n{弗里曼：}如果不太严重的话，在原高度停留几天，应该可以好转。如果严重的话最好下山。\n{伊娜：}我还不要紧啦。我们还是继续赶路吧。哎哟~！\n{雷尔：}不要勉强自己，你连路都走不动了。\n{伊娜：}可是，怎么也不能因为我而耽误了重要的事情呀……呜，我真没用，又是晕船的，又是高原反应的……\n{雷尔：}来，我背你走。\n{伊娜：}雷尔？\n{雷尔：}你又要坚持赶路，又没有力气，除了背你走之外还有什么办法……\n{伊娜：}人家不是小孩子啦，怎么还要人背……\n{雷尔：}那么你想要公主抱？\n{伊娜：}算了，还是背吧……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This pendant, obtained from a member of the Black Tiger Commando, seems to fit the keyhole very well. Sure enough, is this cabinet something they use? The things of the Black Tiger Agents were placed directly in the underground library, and it turned out to be a close friend of Archbishop Yingluck. ?a?aYo, insert it with this pendant, the lock can be opened.","{伊娜：}这个从黑虎特攻队的人身上取得的挂件，看起来似乎与钥匙孔很吻合呢。果然这个柜子是他们用的东西吗？黑虎特工队的东西就直接放在地下书库里，果然是英拉大主教的亲信啊。——哟，用这个挂件插进去，锁可以开了呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This place is full of rotting swamps. Will the guy named Kairon be here?\n{Freeman:} Because of this, it is difficult for Terracia's army to come to clean up this place. This is a good place for him to hide, and he can even occupy the mountain as the king.\n{Ina:} Yes, take notes.\n{Roland:} However, his good days are coming to an end, no matter how difficult the road here is, I must get him out!","{伊娜：}这个地方到处都是腐烂的沼泽，那个叫凯隆的家伙会在这里吗？\n{弗里曼：}正因为如此，这个地方泰拉西亚的军队也难以前来清剿，这才是他藏身的好去处，甚至可以占山为王。\n{伊娜：}是这样啊，笔记笔记。\n{罗兰：}不过，他的好日子就要到头了，不管这里的路多难走，我也一定要把他揪出来！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This place is so big...\n{Ladia:} I haven't been here either. It seems that this is only the periphery, I don't know if Solo is here.\n{Mengying:} I hope it’s still too late. Let’s start looking for it here.","{伊娜：}这个地方好大啊……\n{拉迪亚：}我也没有来过。这里似乎还只是外围，不知道索罗在不在这里。\n{梦影：}希望还来得及，我们先从这里开始找找看吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This sword should be the \"Red Star Sword\". It looks really amazing. The core component of \"Sword of Destruction\", what is \"Sword of Destruction\"? Jack, do you know?\n{Freeman:} I don't know, I have never heard of it, whether it is \"Sword of Destruction\" or \"Scarlet Star Sword\".\n{Rael:} We only knew that the Demon Race was also looking for the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", but now there is another \"Sword of Destruction\"? New clues?\n{Ina:} No, it is not a new clue. Although \"Sword of Destruction\" is the first time I have heard it, the same information can be sorted out in Ina-chan's omnipotent notebook. Chinu said before that Solo is going to wake up a treasure that has been in the dust for many years, and for this, a large number of top-quality living sacrifices are required. The power of that treasure was enough to destroy something, and then I didn't finish it later. Have you seen any keywords?\n{Rael:} \"Destroy\"!\n{Freeman:} So, the \"Sword of Destruction\" is probably the treasure he was talking about. And the \"Red Star Sword\" we have now is also part of Solo's plan.\n{Rael:} Is it possible that \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" is also part of his plan?\n{Freeman:} This is very possible. According to the information provided by Ladia before, the remaining two parts of the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" have been obtained by Solow, and the situation is very serious.\n{Ina:} But fortunately, we unexpectedly got the \"Red Star Sword\" he needed. The \"Dragon King Divine Power\" is also our 7-2 lead. I think the initiative is still in our hands.\n{Rael:} But if you don't try to get the last two parts quickly, no one can predict what will happen.\n{Ina:} Radia has already managed to inquire about those two components, I believe she will give us news.\n{Rael:} We can't wait any longer, Radya will come and go without a trace, who knows when it will appear. Besides, we have no reason to let her fight alone. Now that we have the conditions to enter the Demon Realm, why don't we go to the Demon Realm as well.\n{Ina:} Rael is right. Let's go to the demon world. The entrance to the devil... I look at the notes... Jack said before that the entrance to the devil is in a place called the \"death triangle\"...\n{Freeman:} But I also said that I don't know where this place is... ?-\n{Ina:} Do you really know nothing?\n{Freeman:} I only know that somewhere on the sea, you must travel by boat to get there.\n{Ina:} Okay, right at sea. I believe we can always find it.","{伊娜：}得到的这把剑应该就是“赤星剑”了吧。看上去果然很厉害。“毁灭之剑”的最核心部件，“毁灭之剑”又是什么？杰克，你知道吗？\n{弗里曼：}不知道，不论是“毁灭之剑”还是“赤星剑”，我都没有听说过。\n{雷尔：}我们原先只是知道魔族也在找“龙王神力”，这会儿又冒出个“毁灭之剑”？新的线索？\n{伊娜：}不，不能算新的线索，虽然“毁灭之剑”是第一次听到，不过，伊娜酱万能笔记本上可以整理到相吻合的信息。之前齐努说过，索罗准备唤醒一件尘封多年的宝物，为此需要祭上大量极品的活祭。那件宝物的力量足以毁灭什么什么，然后后面没说完。你们看到什么关键词没有？\n{雷尔：}“毁灭”！\n{弗里曼：}这么说来，“毁灭之剑”就很可能是他所说的那件宝物了。而我们现在得到的这把“赤星剑”，也是索罗计划的一部分。\n{雷尔：}难不成“龙王神力”也是他计划的一部分？\n{弗里曼：}很有这个可能。根据之前拉迪亚提供的情报，剩下2个“龙王神力”的部件已经被索罗得到了，形势非常严峻。\n{伊娜：}不过好在我们意外地得到了他必需的“赤星剑”，“龙王神力”也是我们7比2领先，我看主动权还是在我们手里吧。\n{雷尔：}但是如果不赶紧设法取得最后2个部件的话，谁都不能预料会出什么事。\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚已经设法去打探那两个部件了，相信她会给我们消息的。\n{雷尔：}我们不能干等下去，拉迪亚来无影去无踪，谁知道什么时候出现。何况我们也没理由让她一个人孤军奋战。既然现在我们已经具备了进入魔界的条件，不如我们也向魔界进发吧。\n{伊娜：}雷尔说得不错。我们去魔界吧。魔界的入口……我看看笔记……之前杰克说，魔界的入口在一个叫做“死亡三角”的地方的……\n{弗里曼：}可是我也说过我并不知道这个地方在哪里……\n{伊娜：}真的一点都不知道吗？\n{弗里曼：}只知道在某处海上，必须要行船才能到达。\n{伊娜：}行，在海上是吧。我相信我们总能找到的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This thing dug on the road just now seems to be able to reach in.\n{Raier:} Could it be that this pendant is the key to unlock.\n{Ina:} It's on. Let's go in.","{伊娜：}刚才路上挖到的这个东西，好像伸得进去耶。\n{雷尔：}莫非这个挂件就是开锁的钥匙。\n{伊娜：}开了开了。我们进去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This time it can fly...\n{Rael:} But it doesn't seem to be strong enough. Elite will not be so weak.","{伊娜：}这次的是会飞的了……\n{雷尔：}但是好像不够强吧。精锐不会这么弱的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This tunnel looks like it was dug by hand. Maybe someone will take refuge in it.","{伊娜：}这个地道看起来像是人工挖掘的。说不定会有人躲在里面避难呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} This uncle, may I ask, do you know where Aris’ helmet is?\n{Old man:} What is this?\n{Ina:} Uh, I don’t seem to know, I’m sorry to disturb you.","{伊娜：}这位大爷，请问，您知道亚里斯的头盔在哪里吗？\n{老人：}这是什么东西？\n{伊娜：}呃，看来是不知道，对不起打扰了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Thursday arrived, but Uncle John did not return to the village, and there was no news. It seems that the matter of moving the goods has to be put aside for now.","{伊娜：}星期四到了，可是约翰大叔并没有回村，也没有任何消息。看来搬货物的事情要先搁一搁了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Two more Barland troops?\n{Soldiers:} Yes, we are the Barland Army. Stop and search for us!\n{Ina:} Don't even think about it!","{伊娜：}又是2个巴兰德军？\n{士兵：}没错，我们是巴兰德军。停下来给我们搜查！\n{伊娜：}想都别想！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Uncle Robert, what's the matter, why the village entrance is so messy, the road is blocked.\n{Robert:} Alas, the gale at night knocked my stable down and blocked the road. Now I want to put up the stable shed again, only to find that it is just a little bit short of {wood}. Can't stand up without a leg, what should I do now?\n{Ina:} I'll also help figure out how to do this.","{伊娜：}罗伯特大叔，这是怎么啦，怎么村门口这么乱七八糟的，路都堵住了。\n{罗伯特：}唉，晚上的大风把我马厩吹塌了，还堵在了路中间。现在我想重新把马厩的棚子支起来，却发现就是差了那么一点点{木头}。缺一脚就立不起来，这下怎么办呢？\n{伊娜：}这事我也来帮忙想想办法吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Uncle, do you know where the Richid family lives?\n{Passerby A:} Li Qide? Humph, never heard of it!\n{Ina:} This eldest sister, may I ask, where does the Li Qide family live?\n{Passerby B:} We don't have the Li Qide family here, but there is a pig-headed family. I wonder if it is what you are looking for?\n{Ina:} Uh, maybe it's a mistake. This aunt, may I ask, where does the Li Qide family live?\n{Passerby C:} That pig head family, I'm sorry I don't know, even if I do, I won't tell you.\n{Ina:} Everyone, what's the matter, why do you say it is from the pig head family? Is the Li Qide family's reputation so bad? It seems that no one likes them?\n{Freeman:} I really don't know this. Although the Kartia Palace bought their things, it was only a business deal. As for how they are, it is really unclear. Since the reviews in Belentania are so bad, there must be a reason.\n{Ina:} However, everyone refused to say, what shall we do now? You don't have to spend any more money to find the bad guy.\n{Freeman:} But anyway, if we go further west, this area is relatively barren, and it doesn't look like there will be wealthy businessmen.\n{Raier:} Yes, how can I say, it is impossible for a famous jeweler across the continent to live in such a simple place with houses all around.","{伊娜：}大叔，请问，李奇德家族住在哪里，您知道吗？\n{路人A：}李奇德？哼，没听说过！\n{伊娜：}这位大姐，请问，李奇德家族住在哪里？\n{路人B：}我们这里没有李奇德家族，倒是有一个猪头世家，不知是不是你想找的啊？\n{伊娜：}呃，可能弄错了吧。这位大婶，请问，李奇德家族住在哪里呢？\n{路人C：}那个猪头世家啊，很抱歉我不知道，就算知道也不会告诉你。\n\n{伊娜：}大家这是怎么了，为什么说是猪头世家啊？李奇德家族名声这么差吗？好像大家都不喜欢他们？\n{弗里曼：}这个我还真不清楚了。虽然卡尔提亚王宫买过他们的东西，但是只是生意上的打交道，至于他们为人如何，还真不清楚。既然在贝伦塔尼亚都风评这么差，肯定是有原因的吧。\n{伊娜：}不过，大家都不肯说，这下我们怎么办呢？总不见得再花钱去找坏人先生吧。\n{弗里曼：}不过不管怎么说，我们再往西走走看，这一带比较贫瘠，不像是会有富商的样子。\n{雷尔：}没错，怎么说，全大陆有名的珠宝商，也不可能住在这种四周房屋都这么简陋的地方。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Unexpectedly, there are so many thieves in Barland.\n{Freeman:} Their army has time to attack us, but they don't clean up the robbers and bandits in their own country.\n{Ina:} That's right, it's really shameful to rob the poor and help the rich.\n{Rael:} Who is helping this \"robbing the poor and helping the rich\"?\n{Ina:} Hey, I haven't thought about this. I just wanted to catch a job and ask.\n{Freeman:} Could it be that someone instructed them to do this...\n{Rael:} I have this suspicion, too.","{伊娜：}没想到巴兰德境内也这么多盗贼。\n{弗里曼：}他们的军队有空攻打我们，却不收拾自己国内的强盗土匪。\n{伊娜：}就是啊，还什么劫贫济富，真不像话。\n{雷尔：}这个“劫贫济富”，济的是谁呢？\n{伊娜：}咦，这个我倒没有想过耶，刚才要是抓个活的问一下就好了。\n{弗里曼：}该不会是有人指使他们这么做的吧……\n{雷尔：}我也有这个怀疑。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Village chief, I have decided. I replaced Axue as a tribute. May I?\n{Village Chief:} Huh? real or fake?\n{Ina:} Of course it is true, I volunteered. Axue is too pitiful. If she is allowed to go, the mother and younger brother in the family will be sad.\n{Village Chief:} Do you know what you are doing? Still so happy?\n{Ina:} I know, isn't it just going to eat the Sea Dragon King.\n{Village Chief:} Hmm...\n{Ina:} How about it?\n{Village Chief:} Okay, let me write a hand letter. You take this to {pier}, the guard will let you pass, and then you can get on the boat.","{伊娜：}村长，我决定了。我代替阿雪去作为贡礼。可以吗？\n{村长：}啊？真的假的？\n{伊娜：}当然是真的，我自愿的。阿雪太可怜了，如果让她去了，家里的母亲和弟弟会伤心的。\n{村长：}你知道你在做什么吗？还这么兴高采烈？\n{伊娜：}我知道啊，不就是去给海龙王吃掉嘛。\n{村长：}唔……\n{伊娜：}怎么样怎么样？\n{村长：}好，我写个手信，你拿着这个到{码头}去，守卫就会放你通过，然后你就上船吧。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wait a minute!\n{Rael:} What's wrong?\n{Ina:} I have a hunch.\n{Rael:} Is it intuition again?\n{Ina:} Yes, very strong intuition. It seems that who is telling me, {Don't go any further}...\n{Rael:} What happens if you take a step forward?\n{Ina:} I don't know. But there is a feeling that you can never turn over once you try.","{伊娜：}等一下！\n{雷尔：}怎么了？\n{伊娜：}我有一种预感。\n{雷尔：}又是直觉吗？\n{伊娜：}没错，很强烈的直觉哦。好像是谁在告诉我，{千万不能再前进一步}……\n{雷尔：}如果前进了一步，会怎么样呢？\n{伊娜：}不知道。但是有一种一旦尝试就永远无法翻身的感觉。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wait a minute, I won't let you run away this time.\n{Radia:} Huh? you guys? Didn't you expect you to chase here? Silando didn't kill you guys?\n{Ina:} I regret to tell you that Silando was killed by us.\n{Radia:} This useless guy... In this case, I can't let you escape.\n{Ina:} Hey, this is my line.\n{Radia:} Don't think I'm so bullied because I'm few people. I'm full of magic right now, and it's different from the first time I met.","{伊娜：}等一下，这回我可不会让你再跑掉了。\n{拉迪亚：}嗯？你们？没想到你们居然追到这里来了？西兰多没干掉你们？\n{伊娜：}很遗憾地告诉你，西兰多被我们干掉了。\n{拉迪亚：}这个没用的家伙……既然这样，我可不能放你们逃掉。\n{伊娜：}喂，这是我的台词吧。\n{拉迪亚：}别以为我人少就好欺负，我现在可是魔力满满，跟第一次相遇时情况不同了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wandering around, finally came to this place. It should be closer to {Eldria}. We continue to search.","{伊娜：}绕来绕去，总算是来到了这个地方。这里应该离{埃尔德里亚}更近了吧。我们继续寻找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} We are back. There are so many spherical objects in the tomb of the tyrant. I really don't know which \"Eternal Sphere\" is, and I brought them all.\n{Mengying:} Yes, one of them is the \"Eternal Orb\". I will make an instrument for you to detect the power of the Dragon King. You will wait outside for a while. Mengying got into the small room and closed the door. Strange noises were heard in the small room from time to time, sometimes accompanied by explosions or roars. The door opened, and Mengying gave Ina something that looked like a watch and a ring.\n{Mengying:} Okay, this is the finished product. There are 9 indicator lights on it, corresponding to the 9 parts of Dragon King's supernatural power. If it gets close to a component, the corresponding light will light up. The closer the distance, the greater the brightness. But once you have collected a component, remember to turn off the corresponding light, otherwise it will keep on and consume electricity. That's all I can help you. I wish you success.\n{Ina:} Thank you sister Mengying. By the way, there is one more thing to ask. When we entered the valley before, we saw a checkpoint outside. Where did that lead?\n{Meng Ying:} That is a shortcut to {Rod Anna Mountain}, where is the territory of the Trifiya Kingdom. Most people don't know this road. You can go this way if you need it later. But at the moment, the level may not allow you to pass.\n{Ina:} I will write this down first.","{伊娜：}我们回来了，那个暴君的陵墓里球形的东西有好多，我真不知道哪个是“永恒之球”，索性全带来了。\n{梦影：}没错，其中就有一个是“永恒之球”，我这就给你们制作探测龙王神力的仪器。你们在外面等一会儿。\n梦影钻进小房间，关上门。小房间里不时传出奇怪的响声，时而伴随着爆炸或轰鸣。\n门开了，梦影拿给伊娜一个又像手表又像戒指的东西。\n{梦影：}好了，这是完成品。这上面有9个指示灯，分别对应龙王神力的9个部件。如果它靠近了某个部件，对应的灯就会亮起来。距离越近亮度越大。不过一旦你们收集到一个部件，记得把相应的灯关掉，不然一直亮着很费电的。我能帮你们的就这么多了，祝你们成功。\n{伊娜：}谢谢梦影姐姐。对了，还有一件事问一下，之前我们进入山谷时，看到外面有一个关卡，那是通向哪里的？\n{梦影：}那是一条可以通向{罗德安那山}的捷径，那里是特里菲亚王国的地盘。这条路一般人都不知道的。如果你们以后用得着的话可以走这条路。不过目前可能那个关卡不会让你们通行。\n{伊娜：}这个我先记下来。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} We have passes.\n{Guard:} Well, that's right, there is the signature of General Spane Rodri on it, okay, you can go over.","{伊娜：}我们有通行证的啦。\n{守卫：}嗯，没错，这上面有斯拜恩罗德里将军的签名，好的，你们过去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} We must hurry to save Nanling Pass, now is not the time to go to other places.","{伊娜：}我们必须赶紧去救南岭关，现在不是去其他地方的时候。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Well, I just give it. It was my fault anyway.","{伊娜：}好吧，我给就是了。反正本来也是我的错。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Well, since Auntie Anne said so, I'm ashamed to refuse. Thanks aunty.\n{Auntie Anne:} What are you polite, I should say thank you.","{伊娜：}好吧，既然安妮大婶这么说，我哪好意思拒绝的。谢谢大婶了。\n{安妮大婶：}客气什么，该说谢谢的是我才对。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Well, since sister Mengying said so, it should be fine. Then \"Red Star Sword\" please. Mengying took the sword and disappeared in a flash.","{伊娜：}好吧，既然梦影姐姐这么说，应该没问题的。那么“赤星剑”就拜托了。\n\n梦影接过剑，一闪就不见了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Well, since you ask someone for help, you should pay. At this time, I miss the bad guy, he only costs 2000...","{伊娜：}好吧，既然请人帮忙，给钱也是应该的。这时候反倒怀念坏人先生了，他只要价2000……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Well, you guys go home safely, and I should say goodbye.\n{Ghost:} Wait a minute, if you say I want to thank you, please feel welcome.","{伊娜：}好啦，你们平安回家，我也该告辞了。\n{鬼魂：}等一下，说好要酬谢你的，请不要客气。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What a huge stove...","{伊娜：}好一个巨大的火炉……\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What a narrow hole...\n{Mondo:} That's why it's called a \"secret passage\".\n{Ina:} It's almost here. There is light from the exit ahead.\n{Mondo:} Someone seems to be saying something outside.\n{Ina:} Huh? I didn't hear anything.\n{Mondo:} I have a part of the demon blood, and my hearing is better than you. But I can't hear it clearly here. Go, let's go a little further and go to listen to it near the entrance of the cave. It seems to be something related to Solo.","{伊娜：}好窄的洞啊……\n{蒙多：}正因为如此才叫“秘密通道”嘛。\n{伊娜：}快到了吧。前面有出口的亮光了。\n{蒙多：}外面好像有人在说什么。\n{伊娜：}啊？我什么都没听到耶。\n{蒙多：}我有一部分魔族血统，听力比你们好一点。不过这里听也听不大清楚。走，我们再向前一点，到洞口附近去听听看。好像是跟索罗有关的什么消息。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What a poor explorer, just like this was killed by the pinates.\n{Freeman:} So we have to get rid of the pinate as soon as possible, so as not to let him harm more innocent people.\n{Ina:} But where is the map left by this explorer? Why can't I understand?\n{Freeman:} I don't know the terrain either, it seems it's not a place in Kartia. Mr. Rael came from another place, do you know this place?\n{Rael:} I'm from another continent, let alone know each other.\n{Ina:} Oh, look, there are still words written on the back of this map.\n{Freeman:} \"Although I don't know who will pick up this drift bottle, but when you read this letter, I am no longer alive. I will sleep forever in the sea with the death certificate.\" There is a painting beside it. A skeleton. It seems to be a suicide note? But what is this \"proof of death\"?\n{Rael:} Maybe it is something important.\n{Ina:} Let's find out this thing, we should be able to figure it out. Maybe it has something to do with Baotu. The explorer should have fallen into the sea near here, and the thing called the \"Proof of Death\" is not too far away, probably {right in this sea area}.\n{Raier:} This sea area is still very large, not to mention the shape and size of that thing. It's really a needle in a haystack. However, if you use the \"{1?ìì}\" magic, it will be easier to find the treasure.\n{Ina:} It turns out that this is the case, let me take notes first. But our first task is not this. After all, we are here to eliminate pinates, not to hunt for treasures. The places on this map, maybe we will recognize them when we get there in the future.","{伊娜：}好可怜的探险家，就这样被海盗杀害了。\n{弗里曼：}所以我们更要赶快去除掉海盗，以免让他残害更多无辜的人。\n{伊娜：}不过这个探险家留下的地图，是哪里呢？我怎么看不懂？\n{弗里曼：}这地形我也不认识，好像不是卡尔提亚境内的地方。雷尔先生是从别处来的，是不是认识这地方呢？\n{雷尔：}我是从其他大陆来的，更不会认识了。\n{伊娜：}啊，你们看，这地图的背面还写着字。\n{弗里曼：}“虽然不知道谁会捡到这个漂流瓶，不过，当你读到这封信时，我已经不在人世了。我与死神之证一起在大海中永眠。”旁边还画了一个骷髅。好像是遗书？不过，这个“死神之证”又是什么？\n{雷尔：}也许是什么重要物品吧。\n{伊娜：}我们把这个东西找出来，应该能弄明白吧。也许和宝图有关也说不定。那个探险家应该是在这附近坠海的，那个叫“死神之证”的东西也不会太远，估计{就在这一片海域}。\n{雷尔：}这一片海域还是很大，何况我们不知道那个东西的外形和大小。真的是大海捞针了。不过，如果使用“{观天}”魔法会比较容易找到宝物。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样，我先笔记下来。不过我们首要的任务并不是这个，毕竟我们是来消灭海盗的，不是来寻宝的。这地图上的地方，也许以后我们到了当地，自然会认出来。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What a powerful monster, I finally didn't die...\n{Freeman:} Someone must have been attacked all the way.\n{Rael:} And the opponent can drive monsters like bone dragons, the ability must be no small thing.\n{Ina:} Anyway, land is in front of us, let's get on the shore. It's important to find Roland quickly.","{伊娜：}好厉害的怪物，总算没挂掉……\n{弗里曼：}一路上一直被袭击，一定是有人刻意所为了。\n{雷尔：}而且对方能驱使骨龙这样的怪物，能力必定非同小可。\n{伊娜：}不管怎么说，陆地就在眼前了，我们靠岸吧。赶紧找到罗兰要紧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What are these guys with their teeth and claws, why are they having trouble with us?\n{Radia:} These are Solo's men. Because \"Dragon Armor\" is nearby, of course he will send troops to defend it.\n{Ina:} Well, it seems that fighting is inevitable.","{伊娜：}这些张牙舞爪的家伙们是什么呀，为什么要跟我们过不去？\n{拉迪亚：}这些是索罗的部下。因为“龙甲”就在这附近，他当然会派出军力来保卫。\n{伊娜：}好吧，看来打架是在所难免了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What did senior think of?\n{Popular:} Uh, sorry, wait a minute.","{伊娜：}前辈想到什么了？\n{风行：}呃，不好意思，你再等等。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What do you think about this armor? I bought it from a treasure dealer at a big price. Although it is not a artifact, it is still a very useful treasure.\n{Mozu mercenary:} It looks good, this can be used as a reward. If you can trust us, give it to us first, and we will follow you. After all, Solo said that he would be paid after the fact.","{伊娜：}你们看这件铠甲怎么样，这是我花大价钱从宝物商人那里买来的。虽然不是什么神器，不过还是件相当有用的宝物。\n{魔族雇佣兵：}看起来不错，这个可以作为报酬。你要是信得过我们，先给我们，我们就跟你了，毕竟索罗说要事后才给报酬。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What is this place, industrial waste water, medical waste, the pollution is too serious, it smells bad.","{伊娜：}这里是什么嘛，工业废水，医疗垃圾，污染太严重啦，难闻死了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What is written on the wall in front. What a strange font.\n{Raier:} This type of font, I seem to have seen it a long time ago...\n{Freeman:} It's the magic round body, the font that the demons like to use, and other races generally don't use it.\n{Rael:} Ah, yes, I saw it in the letters seized during the battle between Aryania and the demons.\n{Ina:} Jack is so knowledgeable, I quickly write it down. Alas, if you say that, could it be the person who left these words...\n{Rael:} The Ladia we met when we came in just now?\n{Ina:} In this case, maybe what is the code word that is helpful to us? Let's take a look first.","{伊娜：}前面的墙上写着什么字呢。好奇怪的字体。\n{雷尔：}这种字体，我好像很久以前在哪见到过……\n{弗里曼：}是魔圆体吧，恶魔族喜欢用的字体，其他种族一般不使用。\n{雷尔：}啊，对，以前在亚利安尼亚跟魔族交战时缴获的书信上看到的。\n{伊娜：}杰克真是渊博，我赶紧记下来。唉，这么说的话，留下这些字的人莫非是……\n{雷尔：}我们刚才进来时遇到的拉迪亚？\n{伊娜：}这样的话，说不定是什么对我们有帮助的暗语呢？先看一下好了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What kind of explosive weapon, it sounds very powerful, what if we were attacked here?\n{Freeman:} It should be mortal.\n{Ina:} Hmm... I have to think of a way...\n{Rael:} In the face of such weapons of mass destruction, can you also find a way to deal with it?\n{Ina:} I'm thinking, if there is a way to {make him unable to release} that explosive bomb, we are not without a chance, are we? I am a little eye-catching...","{伊娜：}那个什么爆弹的武器，听起来很厉害的样子，如果在这里我们被攻击了，会怎么样？\n{弗里曼：}应该是必死无疑。\n{伊娜：}唔……我得想想办法……\n{雷尔：}面对这样的大规模杀伤性武器，你也能想办法对付吗？\n{伊娜：}我在想，如果能有个什么办法，{让他施放不出}那个什么爆弹的话，我们也不是没有机会，是吧？我有点眉目了……\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What kind of truth?\n{Prophet:} You will see when you look behind.","{伊娜：}什么样的真相？\n{预言家：}你往后面看就知道了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What magic do you want to teach me?\n{Fengfei:} This magic is called \"violence\", or it is sometimes translated as \"crazy\". Do you understand?\n{Ina:} Ah, this magic, I heard it is very powerful.\n{Feng Fei:} Let me explain it in detail. The function of this magic is to turn troops within a certain range into a violent state. The troops in the violent state will not be controlled by the hero, and will attack the nearest troops regardless of the enemy or the enemy. Of course, regardless of whether the troops he is attacking are enemies or friends, as long as they can counterattack, they will still be counterattacked.\n{Ina:} There is no distinction between friends and foes, which means that it may not be beneficial to us.\n{Feng Fei:} Yes, if you don't use it well, you might lift a rock and hit yourself in the foot. However, if used cleverly, it will have a decisive effect.\n{Ina:} I'll write it down first, it seems I have to study the usage carefully.\n{Fengfei:} That's the function of magic, but there are two more points that need to be added.\n{Ina:} Is it something to pay attention to?\n{Fengfei:} Let's say so. The first point is that this magic {also works for us}. So pay attention when using it, especially when the enemy and our troops are close, you need to pay attention to the range of the spell.\n{Ina:} There is also auxiliary magic that can be effective against both the enemy and us at the same time. This requires careful notes.\n{Fengfei:} The second point is more important. It is this magic that has a hidden feature, or a skill to use. Under normal circumstances, violent troops will attack the target closest to him, and the violent state will be released immediately after the attack. But if he cannot attack the nearest target due to obstacles and other reasons, what do you think will happen?\n{Ina:} Is it the second closest target?\n{Flying Wind:} Haha, creatures in a violent state are not that smart. If there is a situation where the nearest target cannot be attacked, he will only {stand still}, and the violent state will {continue to maintain}. If this is still the case in the next round, just continue to stand still. Of course, only flying soldiers will have this situation, because flying soldiers choose the closest target according to the straight-line distance, while infantry choose the closest target according to the route of travel. In addition, if the target is a double grid soldier, the tail position shall prevail, and the head will be regarded as an obstacle, so sometimes there will be situations where it is clearly next to each other but cannot be attacked.\n{Ina:} This is very interesting. If you try to create such a situation deliberately, it may have surprising effects.\n{Feng Fei:} Yeah. So I think {you will definitely use this method in the future}.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much for your advice.","{伊娜：}前辈想教我的魔法是？\n{风飞：}这个魔法叫做“狂暴”，或者也有的地方把它翻译为“丧心病狂”。你有了解吗？\n{伊娜：}啊，这个魔法，我听说它很厉害呢。\n{风飞：}我来详细讲解一下吧。这个魔法的作用，是让一定范围内的部队变为狂暴状态。狂暴状态下的部队，会不受英雄控制，不分敌我地攻击离他最近的部队。当然，不论他攻击的部队是敌是友，只要还能反击，仍然会遭到反击。\n{伊娜：}不分敌友，也就是说还不一定能对我方有利啊。\n{风飞：}是的，如果用得不好的话会搬起石头砸自己的脚也说不定。不过，如果用得巧妙，会起到决定性的效果。\n{伊娜：}我先记下来，看来得好好研究一下用法才好。\n{风飞：}魔法的功能就是这样了，不过，还有两点内容需要补充一下。\n{伊娜：}是注意点吗？\n{风飞：}可以这么说吧。第一点，这个魔法{对我方也是有效}的。所以使用时要注意，特别是敌我双方的部队靠得近时，需要注意施法的范围。\n{伊娜：}还有能同时对敌我双方都有效的辅助魔法啊，这个需要好好地笔记呢。\n{风飞：}第二点更重要。就是这个魔法还有一个隐藏的特性，或者说是使用的技巧。普通情况下，狂暴的部队会攻击离他最近的目标，攻击完后就立即解除了狂暴状态。但是如果因为障碍物等原因，使他无法攻击到最近的目标时，你猜会怎么样？\n{伊娜：}是攻击第二近的目标吗？\n{风飞：}哈哈，狂暴状态下的生物是没有那么聪明的。如果发生最近的目标无法攻击到的情况，他就只会{傻站着不动}了，而且狂暴状态会{继续保持}着。如果到了下一轮仍然还是这样的局面，就继续傻站着不动。当然，只有飞兵会有这样的情况，因为飞兵是按直线距离选择最近目标，而步兵是按行进路线选择最近的目标。另外，如果目标是双格兵，以尾部位置为准，而头部将会视为一个障碍物，所以有时会有明明就是紧挨着，却无法攻击到的局面。\n{伊娜：}这样子很有趣耶，如果设法故意创造这样的局面，也许能有惊异的效果哦。\n{风飞：}是啊。所以我想{你以后一定会用得到这个方法}的。\n{伊娜：}太感谢前辈的指点了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What the hell are those guys just now, saying that we broke the barrier?\n{Freeman:} Enchantment is something related to magic. I only heard of this when I was in school, but I didn't know what was going on. Ina, you learn magic, and if you don't know, I don't even know.","{伊娜：}刚才那些家伙到底是什么，说我们破坏了结界？\n{弗里曼：}结界是跟魔法有关的东西，我只是在上学时听说过这个，但完全不知道具体是怎么回事。伊娜你是学魔法的，如果你不知道，我就更不知道了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What the hell is that \"doomsday blaster\"?\n{Freeman:} I'm not very clear, but I've heard that it seems to be a new type of thermal weapon developed by the Black Tiger Agents. Attack is like encountering the end of the world, hence the name.\n{Ina:} This Archbishop Yingluck actually develops such a terrifying thing, what exactly does he want to do...","{伊娜：}那个“末日爆炎弹”到底是什么东西啊？\n{弗里曼：}我也不是很清楚，但是听说过一点，好像是黑虎特工队研制的一种新型热兵器，其攻击范围广阔，而且威力之大能瞬间熔化钢铁，所以一旦被其攻击，就如同遇到世界末日一般，因此得名。\n{伊娜：}这个英拉大主教居然还研制这么恐怖的东西，他到底想干什么呢……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's going on? How is Prince Freeman convicted of treason...\n{Rael:} Shhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh! Be quiet.\n{Ina:} (Obviously, when he was with us before, he was so anxious about the dangers of the country. He wanted to repel the Baland army. How could he become a collaborator and treason? How could I not believe that he would do this Things.)\n{Rael:} (It's hard to say about political struggles. Sometimes in order to bring down political enemies, they often use false accusations. That's why I told you that court struggles are complicated and you can't intervene. This announcement is released. The person is Archbishop Yingluck. Prince Freeman also mentioned to us last time that this person may have regarded Prince Freeman as an enemy.)\n{Ina:} (That guy will not lead his troops to retreat, Fah Prince Rieman and us helped him repel the Barland army. He actually made false claims on the other hand, which is too shameless. I went to the person who read the notice and asked him to understand.)\n{Rael:} Wait, Inaq Na!","{伊娜：}怎么回事怎么回事，弗里曼王子怎么成叛国罪啦……\n{雷尔：}嘘——！小声点。\n{伊娜：}（明明之前他跟我们在一起时还对国家的危难那么焦急，一心想击退巴兰德军，怎么会成了通敌叛国呢？我怎么也不相信他会做出这种事。）\n{雷尔：}（政治斗争的事情不好说，有时为了打倒政敌，常常会用诬谄的手段，所以我才跟你说宫廷斗争很复杂，你没法插手的。这个布告的发布者是英拉大主教，上次弗里曼王子也跟我们提到过，这个人可能本来就视弗里曼王子为敌人。）\n{伊娜：}（那个家伙自己不会带兵退敌，弗里曼王子和我们一起帮他击退了巴兰德军，他居然反过来诬谄，太不像话了。我去找那个读布告的人问个明白。）\n{雷尔：}等等，伊娜！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's in this box?\n{Rael:} There seems to be something sealed inside.\n{Ina:} I thought of the story of Aladdin's magic lamp. Is it true that when I open the box, an elf will come out to satisfy my wish?","{伊娜：}这个箱子里是什么呢？\n{雷尔：}似乎有什么东西封印在里面。\n{伊娜：}我想到了阿拉丁神灯的故事了耶。是不是我打开箱子，会出来个精灵满足我的愿望？\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's the matter, little brother?\n{Boy:} Sister Sorcerer, you are very good, aren't you? Can you save my sister?\n{Ina:} Save? What happened?\n{Boy:} My sister has been chosen as this year's tribute. She is going to be sunk into the bottom of the sea and become the sea dragon king’s meal. Oh, I don’t want her sister to be eaten...\n{Ina:} Huh? Gongli is actually a living person?\n{Boy:} Sister Mage, can you save my sister?\n{Man:} Ajian, you run around again, come home quickly and be honest.\n{Ajian:} Dad, this magician sister from outside may be able to save my sister...\n{Ajian’s father:} Stop messing around! go home. It is an honor for Axue to be selected, what do you kid know!\n{Ina:} Wait a minute, uncle, what the hell is going on, can you tell me more about it?\n{Ajian's father:} Sorry, please don't mind my child making trouble for you unreasonably. Is such that. Every year in our village, we will present a girl as a tribute to the Sea Dragon King to pray for a smooth climate in the coming year. This year my daughter Axue was selected. But my son is ignorant, always crying to prevent us from sending Axue away. Alas, this kid doesn't know how to make a living for the whole village.\n{Ina:} But, do you have the heart to let your daughter eat it for the Sea Dragon King?\n{Ajian’s father:} Families who give out their daughters as tributes can get a subsidy of 20,000 gold coins from the village committee. You know, if you marry your daughter, even if you marry a wealthy family, you won’t get more than 10,000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} How can you... how can you use gold coins to measure your daughter? unacceptable!\n{Ajian’s father:} Wasn’t that the way it was? Give birth to a boy to inherit the family business, and give birth to a girl in exchange for money.\n{Ina:} No way. Where is Axue now? I'm going to see her.\n{Ajian’s father:} It has been delivered to {village chief’s house}, and when everyone has prepared everything for the ceremony, they will go out to the sea to make offerings.\n{Ina:} Okay, I'll go to the village chief.","{伊娜：}什么事呀，小弟弟？\n{男孩：}魔法师姐姐，你很厉害是不是？你能不能救救我的姐姐啊？\n{伊娜：}救？发生什么事了？\n{男孩：}我的姐姐被选为今年的贡礼了，要被沉入海底成为海龙王的美餐，呜，我不要姐姐被吃掉……\n{伊娜：}啊？贡礼居然是活人？\n{男孩：}魔法师姐姐，你能不能救我姐姐啊？\n{男子：}阿健，你又乱跑，快给我回家老老实实待着去。\n{阿健：}爸爸，这个外地来的魔法师姐姐说不定能救我姐姐……\n{阿健的父亲：}别胡闹了！回家去。阿雪能被选中是她的荣幸，你个小孩子懂什么！\n{伊娜：}等一下，大叔，这到底是怎么一回事，能不能跟我详细说一说？\n{阿健的父亲：}不好意思，请不要介意我孩子无理取闹给您添麻烦。是这样的。我们村每年要向海龙王进献一名少女作为贡礼，以祈求来年风调雨顺。今年我的女儿阿雪被选中了。可是我儿子不懂事，老是哭着闹着不让我们把阿雪送走，唉，这孩子一点都不晓得为全村的生计着想。\n{伊娜：}可是，你就这么忍心让你的女儿去给海龙王吃掉？\n{阿健的父亲：}送出女儿作贡礼的家庭，能得到村委会20000金币的补助。要知道，把女儿嫁出去，就算嫁个有钱人家，拿到的聘礼也不会超过10000金币。\n{伊娜：}你……怎么能把自己的女儿用金币来衡量？太过分了！\n{阿健的父亲：}本来不就是这样吗？生男孩为继承家业，生女孩为换钱财。\n{伊娜：}不行。阿雪现在在哪？我要去见她。\n{阿健的父亲：}已经送到{村长家}了，等会儿大家把仪式的东西都准备好之后就要出海进献了。\n{伊娜：}好，我去找村长。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's the matter, there is a black mist here, and the surrounding trees are withered.\n{Rael:} Be careful! This is the magic circle. It will suck away your magic.\n{Freeman:} So, does anyone know that we will come, so we put a magic circle here?\n{Voice:} His Royal Highness Prince Freeman is really smart. The subordinates have been waiting here for a long time.\n{Freeman:} You are... General Bruno!\n{Bruno:} Will the prince go back with me and apologize to Archbishop Yingluck?\n{Freeman:} What's the joke, why am I guilty?\n{Bruno:} Whether you are guilty or not, it's not that you have the final say, this is up to Archbishop Yingluck to decide. Now all the power of the country is in the hands of Archbishop Yingluck. He wants to condemn you without any reason.\n{Freeman:} Even if I'm not here, my brother should inherit the throne. What qualifications does Archbishop Yingluck have to take over the power?\n{Bruno:} You can't control this.\n{Freeman:} Since Archbishop Yingluck came to power, Kartia's situation has gotten worse and worse. He arrested the opposition violently, but ignored the suffering of the people and allowed thieves and demons to persecute people. General BBruno, as a heavy court minister, you should at least persuade him...\n{Bruno:} Your Royal Highness, you are so naive. I was inserted into the court by Archbishop Yingluck. From the very beginning, I only dealt with him. One person is loyal. Archbishop Yingluck expected you to come here, so he sent me to receive you. I will only execute the orders of Archbishop Yingluck. Either you go back with me obediently, or, Archbishop Yingluck said, you can take your corpse back.\n{Ina:} Don't want to move His Royal Highness with your fingers, there is still me here.\n{Bruno:} Oh, who are you? The prince's bodyguard? Hahaha...Although I don't know how good you are, how much can you do in my magic circle?","{伊娜：}怎么回事，这边一片黑雾，周围的树都枯萎了。\n{雷尔：}小心！这是魔法阵。它会吸走你的魔力。\n{弗里曼：}这么说，难道是有谁知道我们会来，所以在这里布下魔法阵？\n\n{声音：}弗里曼王子殿下果然聪明。属下在此恭候多时了。\n{弗里曼：}你是……布里诺将军！\n{布里诺：}王子殿下是不是跟我回去向英拉大主教谢罪呢？\n{弗里曼：}开什么玩笑，我何罪之有？\n{布里诺：}你有没有罪，不是你说了算了，这个由英拉大主教决定。现在一切国家大权都在英拉大主教手里，他想定你的罪，并不需要什么理由哦。\n{弗里曼：}就算我不在，王位也应该由我哥哥继承，英拉大主教有什么资格独揽大权？\n{布里诺：}这个你就管不着了。\n{弗里曼：}英拉大主教当权以来，卡尔提亚的情况越来越糟，他大肆抓捕反对派，却对百姓的疾苦不闻不问，任由盗贼和魔族到处害人。布里诺将军，你作为朝廷重臣，至少也应该劝他……\n{布里诺：}王子殿下，你真是天真，我是英拉大主教一手安插进朝廷的，从一开始我就只对他一个人效忠。英拉大主教料到你会到这里来，所以派我来接待你，我只管执行英拉大主教的命令。你要么乖乖跟我回去，要不然，英拉大主教说，带你的尸首回去也可以。\n{伊娜：}休想动王子殿下一跟手指头，这里还有我呢。\n{布里诺：}哦，你是谁？王子的保镖？哈哈哈……虽然不知道你有多厉害，不过，在我的魔法阵里，你又能使得出多少本事？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's the matter, what is this monster?\n{Rael:} This is jumping! It's the scout of the demons! It's over, I didn't expect to be spotted by them so quickly.\n{Ina:} Jump? {Rael:} His official name is Little Monster, and Tiao Tiao is a common name.\n{Ina:} This guy doesn't look strong, right. I try to knock him down.","{伊娜：}怎么回事，这个怪物是什么？\n{雷尔：}这是跳跳！是魔族的侦察兵！完了，没想到这么快就被他们盯上了。\n{伊娜：}跳跳？\n{雷尔：}他的正式名称叫小怪物，跳跳是俗称而已。\n{伊娜：}这家伙看起来不强吧。我试试看打倒他。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's the matter, why did the firebird appear in this place full of ice and snow just now, and why did it attack us?\n{Freeman:} Completely unclear. Fortunately, its power has been weakened a lot in such a cold environment.\n{Ina:} Does this have anything to do with the enchantment mentioned earlier? Let's continue to go deep and find out the answer.","{伊娜：}怎么回事，刚才那火鸟为什么会出现在这满是冰雪的地方，而且为什么要攻击我们？\n{弗里曼：}完全不清楚。好在它的力量在这么冷的环境下被削弱了许多。\n{伊娜：}这个会不会跟之前说的结界什么的事情有关联呢？我们继续向深处走，把答案找出来吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} What's the matter? Where is Solo? It was clear that he was about to be defeated just now...\n{Mengying:} It seems that he can use teleportation freely within this altar. It should have been transferred to another place.\n{Ina:} Let's go chasing him... But where should we go. I don't know how to get to the depths of the altar at all.","{伊娜：}怎么回事？索罗呢？刚刚明明就快要打倒他了……\n{梦影：}看起来在这个祭坛之内他可以自由地使用传送。应该是转移到别的地方去了。\n{伊娜：}我们快去追他……不过，该往哪里去追呢。完全不知道怎么通向祭坛深处。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Why another spherical thing, which one is the \"Eternal Sphere\"...","{伊娜：}怎么又一个球形的东西，到底哪个才是“永恒之球”啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Why does this piece of clothing obtained from the pinate have a half black and half white circular pattern on it?\n{Raier:} This seems to be a Tai Chi diagram, and I am not sure, it seems to be related to a Taoist technique in a very distant place.\n{Ina:} Hey, did this pinate come from a far away place? And also know Dao Shu? But I didn't see him use any novel magic just now.\n{Freeman:} Maybe he snatched it from someone. No wonder he can be so arrogant, it turns out that he has this set of treasure protection.\n{Ina:} If the owner is still alive, we have to return the things to others.","{伊娜：}从海盗手里得到的这身衣服，上面怎么都有一个一半黑一半白的圆形图案？\n{雷尔：}这个好像是太极图，我也不太清楚，似乎与一种很遥远的地方的道术相关。\n{伊娜：}咦，这个海盗是从很遥远的地方来的吗？而且还会道术？可是刚才没见他使出什么新奇的魔法来啊。\n{弗里曼：}可能是他从谁的手里抢来的吧。难怪他能这么嚣张，原来是有这套宝物护身。\n{伊娜：}要是物主还活着的话，我们得去把东西还给人家。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Why doesn't it respond when knocking on the door...\n{Freeman:} Large families usually have doorbells and the like. Because the house is too big, no one can hear you knocking on the door.\n{Ina:} So that's it. I need to take notes on this...\n{Steward:} Who are you dangling in front of our door? Customer? Or a thief?\n{Ina:} Hey, it's rude to say that. We want to talk about a business.\n{Steward:} Really? But you can't even use the doorbell, and you don't seem to be a customer with an identity. If it's not just passing by, I don't know when you are going to knock. No matter, this question will not be held accountable. When did you make an appointment, please report your name and report to the young master.\n{Ina:} Uh, we didn't actually make an appointment, we came here suddenly...\n{Steward:} Without an appointment, according to our rules, we will not be able to meet.\n{Ina:} Can't you just get along?\n{Voice:} It's okay, just let me meet. I'm not busy now anyway.\n{Steward:} Ah, why did you come here in person, Master Young? You can just tell the trivial things...\n{Rody Lichide:} It's okay, I was thinking about going for a walk, and I just ran into it. Good guys, I'm Roddy Richter, the current head of the Richter family. Just call me Roddy. Please advise.\n{Ina:} I'm Ina, and here are my friends Rael and Jack. Please advise.\n{Rody:} So, I wonder if some of you are interested in having a cup of tea in the garden of this courtyard. Let's drink and talk. The room is too boring, and I am just thinking of it.\n{Ina:} Ah, that's so grateful.\n{Rody:} Uncle Kroder, go get ready. We talked in the garden in front of this door. I want a good purple fairy tea.\n{Steward:} Let's do it now. Please wait for a while and have tea soon.\n{Ina:} (Rail, Jack, look, what do you think of this person? Doesn't it feel as bad as the rumored person?)\n{Rail:} (Looks very humble, it is indeed a little bit different from the rumored impression. )\n{Freeman:} (As the saying goes, people can't look at their faces, so let's observe and observe before drawing conclusions.)","{伊娜：}为什么敲门没反应呢……\n{弗里曼：}大户人家，一般都会有门铃之类的吧。因为房子太大，你敲门根本没人听见的。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样啊，这个要笔记下来……\n{管家：}你们是谁，在我们的门前晃来晃去的？客户吗？还是贼？\n{伊娜：}喂，这么说太失礼了吧。我们是想来谈一桩生意的。\n{管家：}是吗？可是你连门铃都不会用，不太像是有身份的客户。如果不是在下正好经过，还不知道你们要敲到什么时候。也罢，这个问题不追究了，你们什么时候预约的，报上名来，在下去向少当家禀报。\n{伊娜：}呃，我们其实没有预约，是突然有急事才来的……\n{管家：}没有预约的话，按我们的规矩是不能接见的。\n{伊娜：}不能通融一下吗？\n{声音：}没关系，就让我接见吧。反正我现在也不忙。\n{管家：}啊，少主大人您怎么亲自来了，这等小事在下来传达就可以了……\n{罗迪·李奇德：}没关系，我也正想出来散散步，正好撞见了。几位好，我是李奇德家族的现任当家罗迪·李奇德，叫我罗迪就可以了。请多指教。\n{伊娜：}我是伊娜，这边是我的朋友雷尔和杰克，请多指教。\n{罗迪：}那么，不知几位有没有兴趣在这庭院的花园里品上一杯茶呢，我们边喝边谈好了。屋子里太闷，我也是正想出来透透气的。\n{伊娜：}啊，那真是太感谢了。\n{罗迪：}克罗德叔叔，你去准备一下。我们就在这门前的花园里商谈了。要上好的紫仙茶哦。\n{管家：}在下这就去办。请各位客人稍候片刻，很快就上茶。\n{伊娜：}（雷尔，杰克，你们看，觉得这个人怎么样，感觉不像传闻的那么坏吧？）\n{雷尔：}（看上去挺谦逊的，确实和传闻的印象有点差距。）\n{弗里曼：}（俗话说人不可貌相，还是再观察观察再作结论吧。）\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Why is there something missing? I'll look for it again.","{伊娜：}怎么好像还少了什么呢，我再找找。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Why, this dialogue machine rang, does Archbishop Yingluck have anything else to say, do you want to listen...\n{Yingluck:} Hey, little girl, tell me how to leave this ghost place!\n{Ina:} Hey, does the wise and martial Archbishop Yingluck also have any problems?\n{Yingla:} This place can neither recruit boats nor sail through the water, and it can't move at all when stuck here!\n{Ina:} That's right, so I will let you go there for a good vacation.\n{Yingla:} If you don't let me out, you will all be finished! Solo couldn't control the \"Sword of Destruction\" with his ability. Without my help, the \"Sword of Destruction\" would definitely get out of control in his hands and the entire continent would be destroyed.\n{Ina:} How do I know if what you said is true or false? You might lie to me.\n{Yingla:} Hmph, do you think my far-sighted calculations are for fun with you? Do you know why I knew Solo wanted to dominate the continent and helped him get the \"Sword of Destruction\"? It is because his ability is below me! I am the only person on the continent who has enough mana to manipulate the \"Sword of Destruction\"! Solo is just a pawn of mine. With the help of his power, after the seal of \"Sword of Destruction\" is lifted, everything will be under my control, and it will be easy to get rid of him at that time! In the end, it is impossible for him to dominate the mainland, but me!\n{Ina:} What happens if you hang up first?\n{Yingla:} Hahahaha! Good question! Without me, the \"Sword of Destruction\" would be completely out of control in Solo's hands, and the entire continent would be reduced to ashes! What I can't get, don't even think about getting it, let's be wiped out together! Hahahaha!\n{Ina:} No way, can't stand it, go crazy all by yourself. I hung up.\n{Intercom:} Beep~~Beep~~~\n{Freeman:} But what he said seems to be true. If the \"Sword of Destruction\" really gets out of control...\n{Ina:} We must have a way to stop Solo. Hasn't the \"Sword of Destruction\" been unsealed yet? Jack, now that Archbishop Yingluck has been dealt with, you should be able to return to Kartia and regain your throne, right? You are confident to revive the Kingdom of Kartia, right?\n{Freeman:} I said so, but now the most important thing is to stop Solo first, otherwise, whether it is the Kingdom of Kartia or other kingdoms on the mainland, it will be destroyed. The situation has fallen to the point where it is today. It should be said that I am also responsible. If I noticed the conspinacy of Archbishop Yingluck earlier... All I can do now is to work with you to put an end to Solo's ambitions. Return to Kartia with confidence.\n{Ina:} Okay, then let's work hard together. What about Radia, you will also act with us, right?\n{Radia:} Hmph, I don't want to be friends with you or something, don't make a mistake, it's just that our enemies are the same for the time being.\n{Ina:} But, I think Radia is already my friend.\n{Radia:} Come and win me! I will not be so easily overwhelmed by you. Don't forget, I am a demon, and you humans have been hostile to each other for a long time...\n{Ina:} I don't hate you at all.\n{Radia:} Indeed, you have saved me several times. I am very principled, since you saved me, I will definitely return you. But this is completely different from the boundary between us.\n{Ina:} Don't be so scary. No matter how many times, if Radia is in danger, I will definitely help, because we are friends.","{伊娜：}怎么，这个对话机响了，英拉大主教还有什么想说的吗，要不要听听呢……\n{英拉：}喂，小丫头，快告诉我怎么离开这个鬼地方！\n{伊娜：}咦，英明神武的英拉大主教也有搞不定的问题吗？\n{英拉：}这个地方又不能招船又不能水行，卡在这里根本没法动！\n{伊娜：}这就对了啦，所以我才会让你去那里好好度假啊。\n{英拉：}你要是不把我放出来的话，你们统统会完蛋的！索罗以他的能力是控制不住“毁灭之剑”的，如果没有我的帮助，最后“毁灭之剑”在他手里肯定会失控，整个大陆都会被摧毁。\n{伊娜：}我怎么知道你说的是真的还是假的，你说不定骗我的呢。\n{英拉：}哼，你以为我深谋远虑的计算是拿来跟你说着玩的？你知道我为什么明知道索罗想称霸大陆还帮助他得到“毁灭之剑”？就是因为他的能力在我之下！我是当今大陆唯一有足够法力操纵“毁灭之剑”的人！索罗只不过是我的一个棋子而已。借助他的力量，解除“毁灭之剑”的封印之后，一切都将在我的掌控之中，到时再将他除掉轻而易举！最后称霸大陆的根本不可能是他，而应该是我！\n{伊娜：}那如果你先挂了，会怎么样啊？\n{英拉：}哈哈哈哈！问得好！如果没有我，“毁灭之剑”在索罗的手中一定会完全失控，到时整个大陆都会化为灰烬！我得不到的，谁也别想得到，大家一起被抹消吧！哈哈哈哈！\n{伊娜：}不行了，受不了，你一个人尽情地疯去吧。我挂断了。\n{对讲机：}嘟~~嘟~~~\n{弗里曼：}不过他说的，好像是真的啊。如果“毁灭之剑”真的会失控的话……\n{伊娜：}我们一定会有办法阻止索罗的。现在“毁灭之剑”不是还没有解除封印吗？杰克，现在英拉大主教解决掉了，你应该可以回到卡尔提亚，夺回你的王位了吧？你有信心复兴卡尔提亚王国是吧？\n{弗里曼：}说是这样说，不过，现在最要紧的还是先阻止索罗才好，要不然，不管是卡尔提亚王国也好，大陆上的其他王国也好，都会被摧毁的。局面落到今天这个地步，应该说我也有责任，如果我早一点察觉到英拉大主教的阴谋就好了……现在我能做的只有跟你们一起，去把索罗的野心终结掉，我才能放心地回到卡尔提亚。\n{伊娜：}好啊，那么我们一起努力。拉迪亚呢，你也会跟我们一起行动了吧？\n{拉迪亚：}哼，我可不是想跟你们成为朋友什么的哦，不要搞错了，只是我们暂时敌人一致罢了。\n{伊娜：}不过，我觉得拉迪亚已经是我的朋友了呢。\n{拉迪亚：}少来拉拢我！我不会那么轻易被你笼络的。不要忘了，我是魔族，跟你们人类长期以来都是相互仇视……\n{伊娜：}我一点都没有仇视你哦。\n{拉迪亚：}的确，你救过我几次。我很讲原则，你既然救过我，我肯定会回报你。不过这跟我们之间的界线完全是两码事。\n{伊娜：}不要说得这么吓人啦。不管多少次，如果拉迪亚遇到危险，我一定还会出手相助的，因为我们是朋友嘛。\n\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Widow dropped his wallet during a meeting here before, and the general asked us to send it to him quickly.\n{Guard:} Really? I guess you guys are looking for excuses to go out to catch eels to eat.\n{Ina:} Hey...Let's do it, I will share an eel when you come back.\n{Guard:} (looking around) Okay, take advantage of no one to find out, you go and come back quickly. If the officer caught him, I wouldn't admit that it was your accomplice.","{伊娜：}之前维多在这里开会的时候把钱包掉了，将军叫我们给他赶紧送过去。\n{卫兵：}真的假的？我猜，你们该不会是找借口出去抓鳗鱼吃吧。\n{伊娜：}嘿嘿……这样吧，等下回来也分你一条鳗鱼。\n{卫兵：}（东张西望）好，趁着没人发现，你们快去快回。要是让长官逮到了，我可不承认是你们的同伙啊。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} With four heart-shaped leaves, this grass looks very curious. I will take it back.","{伊娜：}四片心形的叶子，这株草的样子好奇特。我就把它带回去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wow! What is this, such a big...","{伊娜：}哇！这是什么，这么大个……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wow, the scenery here is so beautiful. Is this Tianchi Mountain?\n{Freeman:} It's like a paradise on earth.\n{Mengying:} This is almost a fairyland, not the world.\n{Ina:} Hey~~~~~~? Really?\n{Mengying:} Be quiet, quiet, loud noises are forbidden here.\n{Ina:} I'm sorry...\n{Guardian:} How many of you? who?\n{Mengying:} It's me.\n{Guardian:} Ah, it turned out to be Lord Melia. I haven't seen you for many years. I heard that you retired. Are you free to visit us now?\n{Mengying:} I am looking for the guards of the Creation Altar for something important, but now is not the time for greetings, sorry. Can you let us pass?\n{Guardian:} No problem, no problem, please.","{伊娜：}哇，这儿的景色好漂亮。这就是天池山吗？\n{弗里曼：}简直就像是人间仙境。\n{梦影：}这里几乎可以算是仙境了，不是人间。\n{伊娜：}哎~~~~~~？真的？\n{梦影：}小声点，安静，这里禁止大声喧哗的。\n{伊娜：}对不起……\n{门卫：}你们几个？什么人？\n{梦影：}是我。\n{门卫：}啊，原来是梅丽亚大人啊，多年不见，听说您隐退了，这会儿又有空来看我们了？\n{梦影：}我找创世坛守卫有点要紧事情，现在不是寒暄的时候，抱歉。能不能让我们通过？\n{门卫：}没问题没问题，请。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Wow, what a big city. This is the royal city of Kartia. If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes, I could hardly imagine such a magnificent building. Ugh? Rael, you don't seem surprised at all.\n{Rael:} Ha ha, I have seen many cities of this size, and even larger cities.\n{Ina:} It turns out that Rael is a person who has seen the world. I am too soiled. I have been in the country for the rest of my life and I don't know what the city is like. Will I be laughed at when I am so excited?\n{Rael:} No, I don't think the residents here seem to be very arrogant. You see we are wearing such earthy robes, they still greet us casually.\n{Ina:} That's good. So let's start asking someone to ask.","{伊娜：}哇，好大一座城。这就是王都卡尔提亚城吧。如果不是亲眼所见，我简直想像不出这么宏伟的建筑。唉？雷尔，你好像一点也不吃惊嘛。\n{雷尔：}呵呵，这样规模的城市我见过不少啦，甚至还见过更大的城市。\n{伊娜：}原来雷尔是见过世面的人，是我自己太土了，一辈子窝在乡下，都不知道城里是什么样。我这样激动是不是会被人笑话啊。\n{雷尔：}不会的吧，我看这里的居民并不像是很傲慢的样子。你看我们穿着这么土的袍子，他们还是很随便地跟我们问好。\n{伊娜：}这就好。那么我们开始找人问吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Yes, if we bring a dog, we can help us find the way others have walked. Although we can't leave footprints, the smell left behind can be found by the dog.","{伊娜：}有了，如果带上一只狗，就可以帮我们找出别人走过的路了，虽然留不下脚印，但是留下的气味能被狗找出来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} Yes, this blood bottle obtained from Solo's subordinates can provide blood.\n{Freeman:} It's easy now, let's use this bottle for blood transfusion.\n{Mondo:} Thank you for taking a life back.\n{Ina:} It's nothing, Brother Mondo helped us a lot before. Helping each other is supposed to be, not to mention how can you die without saving. But how come you come here, it's so dangerous...\n{Mondo:} I said, I'm a transport merchant. No matter how dangerous the business is, you have to do it. I received an order two days ago and asked me to send this \"Purple Spirit Shield\" to Bataan City. Although it was dangerous, the reward was quite generous. The other party promised to give 300,000 gold coins. So I can't help but send it to others as soon as possible.\n{Ina:} Such a high reward... It just so happens that we also want to go to Bataan City. Then it's better to go together.\n{Mondo:} To the west is the land where Bataan City is located. The client told me that the grounding point was by a huge stove.\n{Ina:} Okay, let's go over.","{伊娜：}有了，这个从索罗的部下那里得到的血瓶可以提供血哦。\n{弗里曼：}这下好办了，用这个瓶来输血吧。\n{蒙多：}捡回一条命，真是谢谢你们了。\n{伊娜：}没什么啦，蒙多大哥之前也帮了我们不少。互相帮忙本来就是应该的，何况哪能见死不救。不过，你怎么会跑到这儿来呢，这么危险……\n{蒙多：}我说过了嘛，我是个运输商人。接了生意，不管多危险，都得去干。前两天接了一个单，要我把这面“紫灵盾”送到巴塔安城，虽然挺危险，不过报酬相当丰厚，对方许诺给30万金币。所以不能不尽快给人家送过去。\n{伊娜：}这么高的报酬呀……正巧，我们也要去巴塔安城。那么不如一起去吧。\n{蒙多：}西边就是巴塔安城所在的陆地了。委托人告诉我的交接地点是在一个巨大的火炉旁。\n{伊娜：}好，我们这就过去。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} You should be able to see the other side of the lake from here. But the distance may be a bit long...\n{Freeman:} If the distance is too long, even if you can see it, you can't make it through \"water travel\" alone?\n{Ina:} Yes, \"Shui Xing\" must get to the other side in one breath...\n{Freeman:} If there is no relay station, the distance is too long to reach the other side. Although I haven't learned magic, I also know this.\n{Ina:} Hey, relay station? Hmm... can we think of a way to {create a relay station}?","{伊娜：}从这里应该能看到湖的另一边岸了吧。不过距离可能有点长……\n{弗里曼：}距离太长的话，就算能看得到，单靠“水行”也过不去吧？\n{伊娜：}是啊，“水行”必须一口气到对岸……\n{弗里曼：}没有中继站的话，距离太长就到不了对岸，虽然没学过魔法，不过这个我也知道。\n{伊娜：}唉，中继站？嗯……我们是不是可以想个办法{创造一个中继站}呢？\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} You shouldn't go wandering around somewhere you don't know, and do business now.","{伊娜：}现在不该去不认识的地方乱逛，赶紧办正事。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} caught up.\n{Phoenix:} Huh, human? I should have killed you all, but I need to rest now and don't bother my god bird.\n{Ina:} Hey, this is the Phoenix? How do I feel different from the impression?\n{Freeman:} Seen Ina before?\n{Ina:} Wait for me to look through the little Ina universal notebook. Grandpa painted me a picture of a phoenix before. It should be a very beautiful bird. How ugly this one is in front of me. I found it, look at it.\n{Phoenix:} How dare you say that this sacred bird is ugly, you are really impatient to live. One thing must be made clear before you die, don't confuse this sacred bird with the bird called the phoenix in Eastern mythology. The orthodox name of the god bird is Phoenix, written as phoenix. The so-called phoenix you call fenghuang, or chinese phoenix, is now written in the encyclopedia. It can be seen that calling the sacred bird the phoenix reverses dignity and inferiority, and the phoenix should be called the Chinese phoenix.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be so, write it down. However, that phoenix is indeed much more beautiful than you. I like that image.\n{Phoenix:} Cut, you stupid human beings don't know how to appreciate the beauty of this sacred bird. Originally, the sacred bird did not want your life, but the sacred bird absolutely cannot tolerate your insulting the heroic posture of the sacred bird. Go to the hell of flames to repent.","{伊娜：}赶上了。\n{菲尼克斯：}嗯，人类？本来应该把你们杀尽的，不过我现在需要休息，别来烦本神鸟。\n{伊娜：}咦，这就是凤凰？我怎么觉得跟印象中的不一样呢？\n{弗里曼：}伊娜以前见过？\n{伊娜：}等我翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本。爷爷以前给我画过一张凤凰的图像的，应该是很漂亮的一只鸟啊。眼前这只多丑。找到了，你们看。\n{菲尼克斯：}竟敢说本神鸟丑，你们真是活得不耐烦了。有一点必须在你们死前说清楚，别把本神鸟跟东方神话中那只叫凤凰的鸟搞混了。本神鸟正统的名字是不死鸟菲尼克斯，写作phoenix。而你们所谓的凤凰，现在的百科全书上已经写作fenghuang了，或者叫chinese phoenix。可见把本神鸟叫成凤凰是颠倒了尊卑，凤凰才应该叫做中国不死鸟。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样，记下来。不过，那个凤凰确实比你漂亮多了，我喜欢那个形象。\n{菲尼克斯：}切，你们这些愚蠢的人类根本不懂得欣赏本神鸟的美。本来本神鸟还不想要你们的命，不过本神鸟绝对不能容忍你们侮辱本神鸟的英姿。到火焰的地狱中去忏悔吧。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally broke through. I saw the prison in front.\n{Roland:} Haha, what? He also said that only he can crack the mechanism, aren't we here...\n{Rael:} Roland, you are injured, too desperate.\n{Roland:} I'm fine, such a small injury is nothing, so hurry up and move on, it's important to save people.\n{Ina:} Roland, why are you so desperate...\n{Roland:} Is that still necessary? It’s because I killed Vidor. If Mengying can’t be rescued for this reason, it’s my responsibility...\n{Ina:} We won’t blame you, you don’t know in advance. Situation...\n{Roland:} This is my responsibility. I don't want to feel guilty about Mengying. That's it.","{伊娜：}终于闯过来了。看到前面的监狱了。\n{罗兰：}哈哈，什么嘛，还说什么只有他能破解的机关，我们这不是过来了吗……\n{雷尔：}罗兰，你受伤了吧，太拼命了。\n{罗兰：}我没事，这么点小伤算什么，赶紧继续前进，救人要紧。\n{伊娜：}罗兰，为什么你要这么拼命……\n{罗兰：}那还用说吗？是因为我杀了维多，如果真的由于这个原因致使梦影没法被救出的话，就都是我的责任了……\n{伊娜：}我们不会怪你的啦，你事先又不知道情况……\n{罗兰：}这是我的责任，我不希望对梦影有愧疚感。仅此而已。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally caught up again!\n{Dranke:} Stop them! I withdrew first, so I had to quickly hand over the \"Purple Spirit Shield\" to Lord Solo.\n{Subordinate:} Yes!\n{Ina:} Here comes again, cut, anyway, you are also Solo's subordinates, right, then I won't be merciful with my hands.","{伊娜：}终于又追上了！\n{德兰克：}拦住他们！我先撤了，得赶紧把“紫灵盾”交给索罗大人。\n{部下：}遵命！\n{伊娜：}又来了，切，反正你们也是索罗的部下是吧，那么我就不用手下留情了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally cleaned up...not only guard against Archbishop Yingluck and his minions, but also guard against these nasty creatures...\n{Raier:} Anyway, we have to act as carefully as possible, and The light in front is getting darker and darker, and God knows what will come out. Otherwise, I'll take the lead, and I'll send a signal when something happens.\n{Ina:} No, it's too dangerous.\n{Rael:} Don't underestimate me, a warrior who has gone through hundreds of battles from birth to death. I have experience in dealing with various emergencies. In such a dangerous place, if there is not a capable person to fight the outpost, the moment I encounter Everyone in the enemy will be in a hurry.\n{Ina:} Well, well, I believe Rael.\n{Rael:} We have agreed on the signal. Three clapping sounds indicate safety and you can continue to move forward; two clapping sounds indicate suspiciousness, please pause for a while; clapping one hands indicates that you encounter enemy situations and prepare for battle immediately; continuous clapping indicates that it is very dangerous. Run away and leave me alone.\n{Ina:} No, no matter how dangerous it is, we can't leave you alone...\n{Rael:} Generally, the last signal is not used, don't worry, just in case.\n{Ina:} Does it really matter?\n{Rael:} Don't worry, I'll set off first. Just listen to my signal.","{伊娜：}终于清理掉了……不但要防着英拉大主教和他的爪牙们，还要防着这些讨厌的生物……\n{雷尔：}不管怎么说，我们得尽量小心行动，而且前面光线越来越暗了，天知道会冒出什么来。要不，我打头阵吧，遇到情况我就发信号。\n{伊娜：}不要啦，这样太危险了。\n{雷尔：}不要小看我这个出生入死经历过数百场战斗的战士，我有着对付各种紧急情况的经验，在这种危险的地方，如果没有一个有本事的人打前哨，一遇到敌人大家都要手忙脚乱。\n{伊娜：}唔，好吧，我相信雷尔。\n{雷尔：}我们约定好信号，拍手三声表示安全，可以继续前进；拍手两声表示可疑，请稍作停顿；拍手一声表示遇到敌情，立即准备战斗；连续不停拍手表示非常危险，你们快逃，不要管我。\n{伊娜：}不行的啦，不管多危险，我们都不可能丢下你不管的……\n{雷尔：}一般不会使用最后一种信号的，放心吧，只是以防万一而已。\n{伊娜：}真的不要紧吗？\n{雷尔：}别担心啦，我先出发了，你们注意听好我的信号就是了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally down the mountain. Now you don't need to encounter thieves again.\n{Ghost:} We live in {the dead wood to the east}.\n{Ina:} In this case, a good person will do it to the end and send the Buddha to the west.\n{Ghost:} Not to the west, but to the east.\n{Ina:} Uh, this is a colloquialism, a colloquialism. By the way, now that I have reached the bottom of the mountain, let me call a pet kitten out to play. --Ugh? What's wrong, this guy is? Forget it, it looks like a cat.","{伊娜：}终于下山了。这下可以不用再碰到盗贼了吧。\n{鬼魂：}我们就住在{东边的枯木林}里。\n{伊娜：}既然这样，好人做到底，送佛送到西。\n{鬼魂：}不是西边，是东边。\n{伊娜：}呃，这个，是俗语啦，俗语。对了，既然已经到了山下，我召个宠物小猫出来玩玩吧。——唉？怎么不对，这个家伙是？算了，看上去还算是猫科动物。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally got here. Successfully sneaked in.\n{Rael:} Is this the Kingdom of Barland already?\n{Ina:} Not yet, just to cross another river.","{伊娜：}终于渡过来了。成功潜入。\n{雷尔：}这里已经是巴兰德王国了吗？\n{伊娜：}还没有，再要过一条河就是。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally got rid of it. That sister is really awkward.\n{Rael:} Isn't it a bit impolite to push us like this? Since people don't welcome us...\n{Ina:} But what else can we do if we don't break in? Just go back like this? So easy to find such a clue, just give up like this? How about we apologize when we meet Senior Mengying.","{伊娜：}总算摆脱了。那位姐姐真是犟。\n{雷尔：}我们这样硬闯，是不是有点不礼貌？既然人家并不欢迎我们的样子……\n{伊娜：}可是不闯还能怎么办？就这么回去吗？好容易找到这么点线索，就这样放弃吗？要不等下我们见到了梦影前辈好好道个歉吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally got rid of the troublemaker...Is everyone alright.\n{Rody:} We're all right. It seems that his goal is not us.\n{Raier:} His goal is \"Dragon Eye Ring\". Now that I know that \"Dragon Eye Ring\" is no longer in your hands, there is no need to do it to you. But what's bad is that he released the letter bird before he died. I'm afraid that the people of the Demon Race will soon attack the Snow Mountain Island...\n{Rody:} I heard that this treasure is an ancient artifact, the devil The clan actually wanted to get it. I knew it was so, so I won't sell it...\n{Freeman:} This way the demons will make trouble for you, and you will be very dangerous...\n{Rody:} Although so Say, but if you pass the danger to others for your own safety, isn't it very wicked? Moreover, the two people who came to buy the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" looked very loyal. I really don't want them to be chased by the demons.\n{Rael:} We will stop the demons, and you don't have to worry too much. If we go directly to Xueshan Island now, we should be able to catch up.\n{Ina:} Well, it's decided, let's go to {Snow Mountain Island}. But how should I go?\n{Rody:} Snow Mountain Island is located in {East of Solandria}, it is a big island. However, if you want to go to Snow Mountain Island, you must first pass {Zhushan Island}, which is located in {the sea west of Helald}. It is difficult to land on Zhushan Island, but there is a {tunnel} under construction that can lead to it. In addition, the buyer is a pair of father and son, whose surname is Salman, and his father is Zola, who is about 50 years old; his son is Zade, who is in his 20s, and they are both burly and strong. Please be sure to find them when you get there.\n{Ina:} It's so detailed, great, thank you Roddy. I wrote it all down.\n{Rody:} I just hope to help you as much as possible to make up for the harm that my fault has caused to others. There is one more thing that must be reminded of you, you come here with me.","{伊娜：}终于把那个捣乱的干掉了……大家都没事吧。\n{罗迪：}我们没事。看起来他的目标并不是我们。\n{雷尔：}他的目标是“龙眼戒”，既然得知“龙眼戒”已经不在你们手上，就没有必要对你们动手了。不过糟糕的是，被他临死前放出了信鸟，只怕魔族的人很快就会向雪山岛出手……\n{罗迪：}我听说这件宝物是上古神器的一件，魔族居然想要得到它，早知如此，我就不把它卖掉了……\n{弗里曼：}这样魔族一定会找你麻烦的，你会很危险……\n{罗迪：}虽然这么说，可是如果为了自己安全就把危险转嫁给别人不是很缺德吗？而且，来买“龙眼戒”的那两个人，看上去很忠厚，我真不想他们被魔族追杀。\n{雷尔：}我们会去阻止魔族的，你也不必太担心。如果现在我们直接赶去雪山岛的话，应该赶得上。\n{伊娜：}嗯，决定了，我们去{雪山岛}。不过，该怎么去呢？\n{罗迪：}雪山岛位于{索兰德里亚的东方}，是个大岛。不过如果要去雪山岛，还必须先经过{竹山岛}，它位于{海拉尔德西面的海上}。竹山岛很难登陆，不过有一条正在建设中的{隧道}可以通向那里。另外再说一下买主，是一对父子，姓萨尔曼，父亲叫佐拉，大约50岁上下；儿子叫扎德，20多岁，两人身材魁梧，都很健壮。你们到了那里请一定找到他们。\n{伊娜：}这么详细，太好了，谢谢你罗迪。我都记下来了。\n{罗迪：}我只是希望尽可能地帮助你们，以弥补自己的过失给别人带来的危害。还有一件事必须提醒你们，你们跟我到这边来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally landed. Sure enough, the land is reassuring.\n{Rael:} The demons must arrive before us, so be careful.\n{Freeman:} Well, look, there is a small army of Demon in front. It's better to say hello before they want to clean up us.","{伊娜：}终于登陆了。果然还是陆地让人安心。\n{雷尔：}魔族的人肯定比我们先到，要小心才好。\n{弗里曼：}嗯，看，前面就有魔族的小部队了。不如在他们想要收拾我们之前，我们先去打个招呼吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ina:} finally the group of dark things were sent away. Why do they trouble us?\n{Freeman:} The group of guys were clearly directed at us just now, and it looked like someone was deliberately attacking us.\n{Ina:} Could it be that Archbishop Yingluck sent it again? Isn't it?\n{Freeman:} I don't know now, but we have to be careful next, maybe there will be attacks.","{伊娜：}总算把那群黑乎乎的东西打发走了。他们为什么要找我们麻烦啊？\n{弗里曼：}刚才那群家伙分明就是冲着我们来的，看起来像是有人故意要袭击我们的样子。\n{伊娜：}难道又是英拉大主教派来的？该不会吧？\n{弗里曼：}现在我也不知道，但是下面我们得小心了，搞不好还会有袭击。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Jack:} Ina really has a way, she really got the information out.\n{Ina:} This is all the credit of Ina-chan's Universal Notebook, which uses the previously recorded information to obtain new information. Grandpa taught me since I was a child that a good memory is not as good as a bad pen. ?a?aAfter finding the {Captain Rudd} and knocking him down unexpectedly, this Baland army lost its command.\n{Rael:} However, Captain Rudd should not be as easy to deal with as the pawns. Ina, don't be too optimistic.","{杰克：}伊娜真有办法，还真把情报给套出来了。\n{伊娜：}这都是伊娜酱万能笔记本的功劳，利用之前记录的情报去套取新的情报。爷爷从小教导我，好记性不如烂笔头。——等下找到了那个{鲁德大队长}，出其不意地打倒他，这支巴兰德军就失去指挥了。\n{雷尔：}不过，那个鲁德大队长应该不会像小卒们那么好对付了。伊娜可不要太过于乐观。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Janitor:} Hey, who are you, you can't enter here without permission.\n{Brother Uni:} Hello, Jimmy.\n{Jimmy, the janitor:} Ah, it turned out to be Brother Yuni, it was rude, please come in. Are you coming to the show again this time?\n{Brother Uni:} No, this time I just came to help a few friends to introduce them. They are in a hurry to seek a talk with the boss, but they missed the appointment time, so...\n{Jimmy the janitor:} Ah, no problem, a few Please come in.","{看门人：}喂，你们是什么人，这里不能擅自进入。\n{尤尼兄：}吉米，你好啊。\n{看门人吉米：}啊，原来是尤尼兄弟，失礼了，请进请进。这次又要来演出吗？\n{尤尼兄：}不，这次只是来帮几个朋友引见一下的，他们有急事要找当家的商谈，但是错过了预约时间，所以……\n{看门人吉米：}啊，没问题，几位请进。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Kalidan:} Alright, bypassing the palace, you can walk north from here to a cave, and you can pass through there to Black Rock Island.","{卡里丹：}好了，绕过了王宫，从这里向北就能走到一处地洞，穿过那里就能到黑岩岛了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Karon:} Who? Dare to break into my private house?\n{Roland:} Hmph, Kairon, you beast won't forget me, right?\n{Karon:} Ahahaha, it turned out to be Roland. I thought who it was. I don't know what you are doing here?\n{Roland:} Bah! You killed 15 people in my village, including my mother. Today I am here to take your head and avenge them. I have been looking for you for two years.\n{Karon:} Hey, it's not my fault. I only wanted to take away the \"Dragon Shield\", and had no intention of killing people, but those guys refused to give the \"Dragon Shield\" to me when they died. In the end, I really had no choice but to deal with them as a last resort.\n{Roland:} Beast! Today, I want your item and \"Dragon Shield\".\n{Karon:} It seems that you are not going to be reasonable, well, it doesn't matter. The \"Dragon Shield\" is right here, but if you can get it, you have to ask whether the sickle in my hand agrees or not.","{凯隆：}什么人？胆敢闯进我的私宅？\n{罗兰：}哼，凯隆，你这畜生该不会忘记我了吧？\n{凯隆：}啊哈哈哈，原来是罗兰。我还以为是谁呢。不知你来我这里有何贵干啊？\n{罗兰：}呸！你杀了我村里15口人，包括我的母亲，我今天就是来取你首级，为他们报仇的。我找你找了两年了。\n{凯隆：}哎，这可不是我的错啊。我本来只想取走“龙盾”，并无杀人之心，可是，那些家伙死也不肯把“龙盾”交给我，最后我实在没有办法，迫不得已，才只好把他们解决掉。\n{罗兰：}畜生！今天，你的项上魔头和“龙盾”我都要了。\n{凯隆：}看来你是不打算讲理了，嘛，也没关系。“龙盾”是在我这里没错，不过，你能不能取得走，还得先问问我手里的镰刀答应不答应。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{King Zaya:} What? How dare someone bully my brothers?\n{Rogue:} Great King, you have to be the master for the little one. We were beaten so badly by a little girl...\n{King Zaya:} Hmph, I'm so bold. Take me to find her, I'm going to peel off this ignorant girl and make soup!\n{Rogue:} Ah, here it is, she is the one who came over there...\n{Ina:} Oh, who are you? No, it seems to have been discovered...\n{Ghost:} The leader is King Jaya, you have to be careful.\n{Ina:} There is no way. I wanted to avoid it, but now I can only bite the bullet.","{查亚大王：}什么？居然有人敢欺负我的兄弟们？\n{盗贼：}大王，您可要替小的作主啊。之前我们被一个小丫头打得好惨……\n{查亚大王：}哼，真是胆大包天了。带我去找她，老子要把这不知天高地厚的丫头剥了皮熬汤喝！\n{盗贼：}啊，来了，那边过来的人就是她……\n\n{伊娜：}哎呀，你们是？不好，看起来被发现了……\n{鬼魂：}那个带头的就是查亚大王，你可要小心。\n{伊娜：}没办法了，本来还想避着点的，现在只能硬着头皮上了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Knight:} Want to go to the arena? Let's compete with us first.","{骑士：}想去竞技场？先跟我们比试比试。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Kurug:} This is our palace, please come in. The three followed Kurug into the palace. Ina looked around, amazed at the magnificence that she had never seen in the palace. In the center of the main hall, the queen is dressed in luxurious clothes and wears a crystal crown. Sitting in the middle, two maids stand on the left and right.\n{Kurug:} Your Majesty, the guest is here.\n{Queen:} It's hard work, Kurug, you can withdraw.\n{Kurug:} The minister retired.\n{Rael & Freeman:} See Her Majesty the Queen.\n{Ina:} Huh? This, do you want to salute?\n{Rael:} Ina, be solemn to the head of state.\n{Ina:} Ah, I'm sorry, Your Majesty, I have never experienced such a scene...\n{Queen:} It doesn't matter. Welcome to Fendinia as guests. I am Lucia, Queen of Fendinia. A few people who came from afar must have been exhausted from the journey. I asked someone to prepare a room for you in the palace. Let's rest for a few days.\n{Freeman:} Your Majesty, in fact, we have heard Lord Kurug talk about the matter just now. Fendinia is now being harassed by the Demon Race, and your Majesty’s treasure has also fallen into the hands of the Demon Race. We also hope that we can help a little bit. I'm afraid it's not good to rest at this time. Her Majesty the Queen might as well tell us the enemy's situation, and we should also make countermeasures early.\n{Queen:} I am really touched by how many people are so righteous. Okay, let me talk about the situation.","{库鲁格：}这里就是我们的王宫了，请进。\n\n三人跟随库鲁格走进王宫。伊娜四下张望，对王宫中从没见过的金碧辉煌惊奇万分。\n\n正殿中央，女王衣着华贵，头戴水晶冠，坐在正中，两名侍男立于左右。\n\n{库鲁格：}陛下，客人来了。\n{女王：}辛苦了，库鲁格，你退下吧。\n{库鲁格：}臣告退。\n{雷尔&弗里曼：}参见女王陛下。\n{伊娜：}咦？这个，要行礼？\n{雷尔：}伊娜，对国家元首礼仪要庄重。\n{伊娜：}啊，对不起，女王陛下，我从没经历过这样的场面……\n{女王：}没关系。欢迎各位来到芬迪尼亚作客。我是芬迪尼亚的女王露西亚。几位远道而来想必旅途劳累，我叫人在宫中给你们准备房间，先休息几日吧。\n{弗里曼：}女王陛下，其实刚才事情我们已经听库鲁格大人说过了。芬迪尼亚现在正受着魔族的侵扰，陛下的宝物也落入了魔族手中，我们也希望能帮上点忙，这个时候恐怕不好再休息了。女王陛下不如这就把敌情告诉我们，我们也好早作对策。\n{女王：}几位如此仗义，实在令我感动。好吧，我把情况说一说。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ladia:} It turned out to be you, why are you here, I thought it was Archbishop Yingluck's men again, and almost killed Rael.\n{Rael:} It was almost killed by me, how could I lose to you.\n{Ladia:} Humph! You are too confident.\n{Ina:} Radia, why are you here?\n{Radia:} Let me ask you first.\n{Ina:} Uh...we are here to investigate this cave to find clues related to Archbishop Yingluck...\n{Ladia:} Have you found anything?\n{Ina:} Not yet... I just know what's important in this cave...\n{Radia:} Well, I tell you, you can go back, and if you keep going inside, I'm afraid you won't be able to live. gone back.\n{Ina:} Huh? {Ladia:} I have already investigated. The deepest part of this hole is the \"Spirit Tower\" built by Archbishop Yingluck and the evil prince Solo. This tower will absorb the energy of the souls of the killed creatures. Supply the altar set by Solo in the Demon World. Archbishop Yingluck confiscated the civilians of Baland as laborers, built the tower, and then killed those civilians to sacrifice. The depths of the cave are already covered with bones.\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be like this, it's too cruel... Then what's the purpose of that altar?\n{Radia:} I don't know either. However, judging from the fact that the altar has so far absorbed so many sacrifices, including Warcraft Phoenix, that it has not been full, there must be something earth-shattering in it, which may be a treasure of the artifact level.\n{Ina:} Then I should destroy the tower as soon as possible...\n{Radia:} Don't dream, if it could be easily destroyed, I would have done it a long time ago. Archbishop Yingluck himself is in the cave now. His strength is much stronger than that of Solo. You can't win it, and there is {cursed land} full of bones. You can't cast advanced magic at all. You can use magic. What else can the mage who is a weapon do in such a terrain? I originally wanted to dive into the deepest place, but I encountered Archbishop Yingluck on the way and could only escape. If I hadn't pretended to make him mistakenly believe that he was just a bat and didn't care about it, he would have become a sacrifice.\n{Ina:} But, you can't leave the tower wherever you want, or else you don't know how many people they are going to kill, and if the altar you mentioned receives enough energy, isn't it too late? I have to find a way to destroy that tower.\n{Radia:} I have already advised you. If you don't listen, I can't do anything about it. You can do it yourself, I'll go out first.\n{Ina:} But, I didn't expect Radia to be on the same side with us.\n{Radia:} Cut, I'm not here to help you. I just don't want my brothers to be used as tools for careerists. That guy Solo was completely bewildered by Archbishop Yingluck now. He had a hot head and wanted to dominate the mainland, but he didn't know that Archbishop Yingluck was far more treacherous than him, and he didn't know who would kill him.\n{Ina:} Hey, you know so much, so I quickly take notes...\n{Radia:} I have been investigating secretly these days, and I have this information. I have provided it to you, but you have to come out alive. Hope we will have a period later.","{拉迪亚：}原来是你们，你们怎么会在这里，害我还以为又是英拉大主教的手下，差点杀了雷尔。\n{雷尔：}是差点被我杀了吧，我怎么可能输给你呢。\n{拉迪亚：}哼！你太过自信了吧。\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚，你怎么会来这里啊？\n{拉迪亚：}是我先问你们的吧。\n{伊娜：}呃……我们是来调查这个地洞，查找跟英拉大主教有关的线索……\n{拉迪亚：}你们查到什么了吗？\n{伊娜：}还没有……只知道这洞里有什么重要的东西……\n{拉迪亚：}好吧，我告诉你们，你们可以回去了，继续往里面走的话，恐怕就没法活着回去了。\n{伊娜：}啊？\n{拉迪亚：}我已经调查好了，这个洞的最深处，是英拉大主教与邪亲王索罗共同建造的“聚灵塔”，这个塔会吸取被杀死的生物的灵魂的能量，供给索罗在魔界设置的祭坛。英拉大主教征用了巴兰德的平民作为劳工，建造了这个塔，随后又把那些平民杀掉了祭献，洞的深处已经是遍地尸骨。\n{伊娜：}啊，竟然是这样，太残忍了……那么那个祭坛，又是干什么用的？\n{拉迪亚：}我也不知道。但是从祭坛迄今为止吸取了包括魔兽菲尼克斯在内的那么多祭品还未饱满来看，一定是有什么惊天动地的东西在其中，可能是神器级别的宝物。\n{伊娜：}那我更应该尽快去破坏那个什么塔才是……\n{拉迪亚：}你别做梦了，如果能轻易破坏的话，我早就下手了。英拉大主教本人现在正在洞中，他的实力比索罗还要强大得多，你不可能赢得了的，而且里面是遍地尸骨的{诅咒之地}，你根本施放不了高级魔法，你这个以魔法为武器的法师，在那样的地形中，还能做得了什么？我本来也想潜入最深处，但途中遭遇了英拉大主教，只能逃了出来，若不是我伪装了一下让他误以为只是蝙蝠而没放在心上，就已经成为祭品的一份子了。\n{伊娜：}可是，总不能放着那个塔不管哪，要不然还不知他们要杀多少人，而且你说的那个祭坛如果收到了足够的能量那不就来不及了吗？我一定要想办法去破坏那个塔才行啊。\n{拉迪亚：}我已经忠告过你了，如果你不听的话我也没办法，你好自为之吧，我先出去了。\n{伊娜：}不过，真没想到拉迪亚能跟我们站在同一边呢。\n{拉迪亚：}切，我可不是为了帮你们。我只是不希望自己的弟兄们被利用，成为野心家的工具而已。索罗那个家伙现在完全被英拉大主教迷惑住了，头脑发热，一心就想着称霸大陆，却不知道英拉大主教远远比他老奸巨滑，到时还不知道鹿死谁手呢。\n{伊娜：}咦，原来你了解那么多啊，我赶紧记笔记……\n{拉迪亚：}我这些天一直在暗中调查，才有了这些情报。我都提供给你们了，你们可要活着出来。希望我们后会有期。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Ladia:} You actually defeated Clio...\n{Ina:} That guy wants to kill you, how can this be.\n{Ladia:} It's ironic, I was saved by you again.\n{Ina:} It's okay. But you are injured. Treat yourself first, and then fight with me. Otherwise, it would become my advantage, which would be unfair. Radia was silent, and slowly drew out his sword.\n{Ina:} Isn't it, you are in such a hurry to do it? Does your injury matter?\n{Radia:} I don't know why, I think it's nice to meet you, Ina. I hope we will not become enemies in the next life... Radia suddenly swung the sword at herself, and Ina grasped the blade. Ina's hand was full of blood, running down the sword and onto Radia's hand.\n{Radia:} Don't stop me. I have nowhere to go. You don't hesitate to get hurt to stop me, who is desperate anyway, why bother?\n{Ina:} It hurts...but, my grandpa taught me that there is only one life, so I must cherish it. We will die for a long time in the future, so we must cherish it when we are alive. Even if we encounter difficulties and setbacks, there is nothing better than being alive. Didn't you just say that you still have subordinates? If you leave them behind, what will they do?\n{Radia:} I don't know, don't ask me, I don't know...","{拉迪亚：}你竟然打倒了克里奥……\n{伊娜：}那家伙想杀你耶，这怎么可以。\n{拉迪亚：}真是讽刺，我又一次被你救了。\n{伊娜：}没关系啦。不过你受伤了，先治疗一下吧，然后再跟我决斗。不然变成我占便宜，不公平了。\n\n拉迪亚默不作声，缓缓抽出佩剑。\n\n{伊娜：}不是吧，这么急着动手吗？你的伤不要紧？\n{拉迪亚：}不知道为什么，我现在觉得，能认识你真好，伊娜。希望来世我们不要成为敌人……\n\n拉迪亚突然把剑挥向自己，被伊娜一把握住剑刃。伊娜的手上满是鲜血，顺着剑，淌到拉迪亚的手上。\n\n{拉迪亚：}不要阻止我了。我已经无处可去了。你自己不惜受伤来阻止我这个反正已经走投无路的人，何必呢？\n{伊娜：}很痛啊……可是，爷爷教过我，生命只有一次，要爱惜它。以后我们会死很久，所以活着的时候要好好珍惜，即使遇到困难和挫折，也没有什么比活着更好的了。你刚才不是说过，你还有部下吗，如果你抛下他们，他们怎么办呢？\n{拉迪亚：}我不知道，不要问我，我不知道……\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Leader of the thief:} Who broke into our camp? Is it the government army? Not to be notified.\n{Ina:} We are not the same government army as you, we are here to fight against you.\n{Leader of thieves:} Crusade? You are so courageous. We Longyashan heroes, and even the government troops have said that they will not violate the waters of our wells. Who are you who dare to speak wildly about crusades? Don't think we are just ordinary heroes, we still have a strong backing.\n{Ina:} Isn't it the Demon Race? You bad guys who rob your compatriots to sell their lives for the Demon Race, you are actually embarrassed to say that you are a good guy. It's not ashamed. You can tell if you are guilty or not.","{盗贼头目：}什么人，闯到我们的营地来？难道是政府军？也不通报一声。\n{伊娜：}我们不是那个跟你们一丘之貉的政府军，我们是来讨伐你们的。\n{盗贼头目：}讨伐？你胆子真不小。我们龙牙山好汉，连政府军都说好了跟我们井水不犯河水，你们是什么人物，也敢口出狂言说讨伐？别以为我们只是普通的好汉，我们还有强大的后盾呢。\n{伊娜：}不就是魔族吗，你们这群坏蛋，打劫自己的同胞为魔族卖命，居然还好意思说自己是好汉，真不害臊。是不是口出狂言，打打看就知道了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Lederman:} As expected of little Ina, I fetched the green heart grass so soon.\n{Rael:} Ina, thank you. If it weren't for your help, if I really lay in bed for a few months, I would be dead.\n{Lederman:} Ina is so helpful. Okay, I'm going to grind the medicine. With this medicine, you can get out of bed tomorrow, boy.\n{Rael:} Thank you, uncle.\n{Lederman:} But, just to be on the safe side, you still hold this wood. You can use it as a cane. You don't need it when it's completely cured.\n{Rael:} Isn't this crutches too long? It's actually taller than a person.\n{Lederman:} You are a young man, of course you have to be this high if you stand up straight, and you are not a hunched grandfather. You only need a walking stick to the waist.","{莱德曼：}不愧是伊娜酱，这么快就把绿心草取来了。\n{雷尔：}伊娜，谢谢你。要不是你帮忙，我要是真在床上躺上几个月，那就真完蛋了。\n{莱德曼：}伊娜酱就是这样乐于助人啊。好了，我去磨药，上了这药，小伙子你明天就能下床了。\n{雷尔：}谢谢大爷。\n{莱德曼：}不过，保险起见，这木头你还是拿着，当拐杖用，等完全好了之后就不需要了。\n{雷尔：}这拐杖，是不是太长了一点啊，居然有一人高。\n{莱德曼：}你是个小伙子，站直了当然要这么高，又不是驼背老爷爷只要到腰的拐杖就够了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Lin Yu:} Our Sifang Chess Court is located in the southern part of Solandria, surrounded by mountains and water, which is a quiet and elegant place.\n{Ina:} Indeed, the environment here is very good.\n{Lin Yu:} The row of courtyards on the north side of the chess academy is where professional chess players play and study. The row of huts to the west is the main place for apprentices and amateur chess players to study. The square in the middle is a place where both masters and inferior players, college students and visitors can learn and exchange ideas. On the sea to the east, there are three stone tablets erected to commemorate the three most outstanding chess players in the history of our chess academy: Long Xiangtian 9th Dan, Carrifeld 9th Dan, and Shuxia Chengliang 9th Dan.","{林羽：}我们四方棋院地处索兰德里亚南部，依山旁水，正是宁静风雅之地。\n{伊娜：}确实这里的环境很好呢。\n{林羽：}棋院北边那排庭楼就是职业棋士们对弈和研究的地方了。西边的一排小屋是学徒和业余棋手们学习的主要场所。而中间的广场则是不论高手低手，不论院生还是来客，都能切磋和交流的地方。东边的海上则竖立着三块石碑，分别用以纪念我们棋院历史上最杰出的三位棋士：龙翔天九段，卡里费尔德九段，树下成良九段。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Little Hei:} This is the GInard Church. The well-known fortune teller Ferro lives here. He is the most accurate fortune teller in Terracia. Would you like to go for a divination? Today happens to be during the travel Golden Week promotion discount period, and each person only needs 12,000 gold coins. It usually costs 15,000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} Forget it, we can't afford it.","{小黑：}这里是吉拉德教堂。远近闻名的占卜师费罗就住在这里哦，他是泰拉西亚最准确的占卜师了，各位要不要去占个卜？今天正好是旅游黄金周促销打折期间，每位只要12000金币。平时要15000金币呢。\n{伊娜：}算了，我们占不起。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Little Hei:} This is the most famous attraction in GInard Village. Have you seen the tallest Yashi? There are poems written by the famous ancient poet Wu De. According to legend, Wu De was an old man who lived all his life and wrote poetry while traveling. Being in a foreign country for a long time will inevitably have homesickness. One day when he arrived in our village of GInard, he happened to see this huge rock on the seashore. He climbed up and looked far and vaguely saw his hometown of Solandria in the southwest. The old man was full of emotion, so he wrote a poem on the Yashi, which has since been named \"Wangxiangshi\".\n{Little Hei:} Can you see the words on this clearly? Let me read it to everyone. The wind is blowing, listening to the rhyme of the piano, and the tide is falling. The red leaves fly in four seasons, and the clear water is calm. Chariots in other township roads, my hometown in the southwest. After the tree was a thousand years old, Lin Yushang is now.\n{Little Hei:} How about? Well written. But what is strange is that these eight lines of poems are divided into two paragraphs. The old man wrote the first four lines on the left and the last four lines on the right. It is generally not written like this. Of course people who understand poetry know the order at a glance. There is also a legend that Wu De did not leave a collection of poems after his death, only some of his works have been circulated orally among the people, but in fact he still has a large number of excellent poems that have not been published publicly, and no one knows how many poems he wrote in total. . Wu De never found a successor to his satisfaction, so he hid his collection of poems and said that whoever could {decipher the mystery of his poems}, he would give the collection of poems to someone. So if you can find anything in this poem, maybe you can become the heir of the great poet.\n{Ina:} So legendary, well, I will write down this poem first.","{小黑：}这里可是吉拉德村最有名的景点了。看到那块最高大的涯石了吗？上面有古代著名的大诗人舞德的题诗哦。相传舞德他老人家一生四海为家，一边游历一边创作诗歌。长期身在他乡难免有思乡情怀。有一日他到了我们吉拉德村，正好看到这块海边巨大的涯石，登高远望，隐约看到了西南方向的家乡索兰德里亚。老人家感慨万分，于是挥笔题诗于涯石之上，这块涯石自此得名“望乡石”。\n\n{小黑：}这上面的字能看清吗？我给大家念一念吧。\n风拂听琴韵，\n潮涌落弦音。\n红叶飞四季，\n碧水静一心。\n车马他乡路，\n西南故里亲。\n树老千年后，\n林郁尚如今。\n\n{小黑：}怎么样？写得不错吧。不过很奇怪的是，这八句诗分作了两段，老人家把前四句写在了左边，后四句写在了右边呢。一般不会这么写的。当然懂诗的人一看就知道顺序。另外还有一个传说呢，舞德死后没有留下诗集，只有民间口头流传了一些他的作品，但是实际上他还有大量优秀的诗作没有公开发表过，没人知道他一共写了多少诗。舞德生前一直没有找到令自己满意的传人，因此把自己的诗集藏了起来，说谁能{破解他诗中的奥妙}，他就把诗集赠与谁。所以如果你能够从这诗中发现什么，也许你就能成为大诗人的传人哦。\n\n{伊娜：}这么富有传奇色彩啊，好吧，我先把这诗记下来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Little Hei:} This is the water world built last year in our GInard Village. A paradise for swimming and all kinds of water games in the hot summer. Tickets are only 2,000 gold coins, and each play item is charged separately. In addition, we also sell all kinds of swimwear with a complete range of styles and good prices.\n{Ina:} Well, forget it, it's still cold now.","{小黑：}这里是我们吉拉德村去年才兴建好的水上世界。炎炎夏日里游泳和各类水上游戏的天堂哦。门票只要2000金币，各个游玩项目另算费用。另外我们还附带销售各类泳装，款式齐全，价廉物美。\n{伊娜：}这个，算了，现在天气还冷呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Little Hei:} Well, here, the tour of the whole village is over. Are you satisfied with Little Hei's commentary? If you have any comments or suggestions, please send them to the Guillard Village Guide Center. Check out below, 7000 gold coins. Welcome everyone to come again later.","{小黑：}好了，到这里，全村就游览完毕了。各位对小黑的解说是否满意？如果有什么意见或建议，欢迎向吉拉德村导游中心提出。下面结帐啦，7000金币。欢迎各位以后再来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Locals:} Welcome to GInard Village. Some of you look like outsiders. I don't know if it's for travel or shopping?\n{Freeman:} It turned out to be Gillard Village. This village is very famous.\n{Ina:} So, I think where I have heard this name.\n{Locals:} Haha, of course, the people in our village are famous for being good at doing business. There are merchants from our village going out everywhere on the mainland of Mirronia.\n{Freeman:} There is also the city of Kartia. I have encountered.\n{Ina:} I look at the Ina-chan universal notebook... Ah, I found it, Gillard Village. Grandpa said that the people in this village are profiteers. He was cheated of money.\n{Locals:} Uh, this, I'm sorry, it's only a very rare case. It is possible for a village with hundreds of people to have a scum, but most people in our village do business in their own right. Oh.\n{Ina:} Well, I believe you, even if my grandfather is out of luck. Well, change the content of the previous record.\n{Locals:} So, where do you want to go? I can accompany and explain the whole process in this village, so that you will feel at home.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much for having such a kind person. Then I beg you.\n{Locals:} It's nothing, I am very enthusiastic about people from other places. This is my job. Just call me Little Hei.\n{Ina:} But I don't think you are black at all, you are quite white.\n{Little Hei:} This is just a name, not a nickname.\n{Ina:} So little black, let's go.\n{Little Hei:} Can some guests pay a deposit first? The tour guide fee is 10,000 gold coins, the deposit is 5,000, and another 5,000 will be paid at checkout.\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be for money!\n{Rael:} Do you think? From the very beginning, I felt that he was playing your wallet idea. You promised it with one bite.\n{Ina:} So expensive, you are really dark as expected. I took back what I said before you were not black.\n{Little Hei:} Hey, how can I say that? I am the best tour guide in this village. It's definitely worth the price. Seeing you don't believe it yet, let's just lower the deposit, 3000 is fine, how about it?\n{Ina:} Have you saved 2000?\n{Little Hei:} There is also 2000 changed to pay at checkout, that is to say, pay 7000 at checkout.\n{Freeman:} I don't know anything about it, I'm really shrewd. Sure enough, they are all business people.\n{Ina:} All right, all right, I just give it.","{当地人：}欢迎各位来到吉拉德村。几位看上去像是外地人吧。不知是来旅游，还是购物？\n{弗里曼：}原来是吉拉德村啊，这个村子很有名呢。\n{伊娜：}这么说来，我也觉得这名称在哪听到过。\n{当地人：}哈哈，当然，我们村的人以擅长做生意而闻名，米尔罗尼亚大陆上到处都有我们村走出去的商人。\n{弗里曼：}卡尔提亚城也有。我遇到过。\n{伊娜：}我看看伊娜酱万能笔记本……啊，找到了，吉拉德村，爷爷说这个村里的人是奸商耶，他曾经被骗过钱。\n{当地人：}呃，这个，很抱歉啦，那只是极个别，一个村几百口人，出个把败类也是有可能的，不过我们村绝大部分人都是很本份地做生意的哦。\n{伊娜：}好吧，我就相信你了，就算我爷爷运气不好。嗯，把以前记录的内容改改。\n{当地人：}那么，几位是想去哪里呢，这个村里我可以全程陪同和解说，包你们宾至如归。\n{伊娜：}有这么好心的人啊，真是太感谢你了。那么就拜托你了。\n{当地人：}没什么啦，我对外地来的人都很热情的，这是我的工作呢。你们就叫我小黑就可以了。\n{伊娜：}可是我看你一点都不黑呀，挺白的呢。\n{小黑：}这个只是名字啦，又不是外号。\n{伊娜：}那么小黑，我们走吧。\n{小黑：}几位客人能不能先付点定金啊？导游费10000金币，定金5000，结帐时再付另外5000。\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是要钱的啊！\n{雷尔：}你以为？从刚开始我就觉得他打的是你钱包的主意了。你还一口就答应下来。\n{伊娜：}好贵啊，你果然很黑。我收回我之前说你不黑的话。\n{小黑：}唉，怎么能这样说呢，我是这个村最好的导游了，绝对值这个价。看您还不太相信的样子，这样吧，我降低些定金，3000就好，如何？\n{伊娜：}省了2000啊？\n{小黑：}还有2000改到结帐时付，也就是说结帐时付7000。\n{弗里曼：}一点都没省，真是精明呢。果然都是做生意的人。\n{伊娜：}好吧好吧，我给就是了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Man A:} Next, how do we rescue our family?\n{Ina:} Then just leave it to us. You should hide first, and don't get hurt by getting involved in the battle.","{男子A：}接下去，要怎么救出我们的家人呢？\n{伊娜：}下面就只管交给我们好了。你们先躲起来吧，不要被卷入战斗伤到了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Man A:} Thank you for your help.\n{Ina:} Can you tell me now, what is going on? Who are you, why do you want to run, where do you want to go?\n{Man A:} We were originally residents on the outskirts of {Bilesberg}, but recently a group of troops came and for unknown reasons, we were all arrested suddenly.\n{Man B:} Then we men were gathered and locked up together, while the elderly women and children were locked away elsewhere. Alas, my parents, wife and children still don't know how...\n{Man C:} Some of us were called out one after another, and then the one who went out never came back. I don't know where the news came from, saying that those people had been taken to the Demon Realm to do hard labor, and they would never come back until they died.\n{Man A:} So the rest of us discussed to escape. finally, there was a chance, while the guard was dozing off, we made an appointment to do it together, broke out of the prison, and escaped.\n{Man B:} Soon those who catch us will come and kill us. We don't know where we are going to flee, and we have been separated from a group of companions...\n{Freeman:} I'm sorry, those companions you lost may have been killed. We saw theirs when we came along. Dead body.\n{Man A:} Ah, then what shall we do?\n{Man C:} No matter where you flee, you will still be killed...\n{Man B:} And I'm also worried about my parents, wife and children...\n{Ina:} Let's go with us and return to { Bielesberger, go, knock down all those who arrested you, and rescue all your families. If there is any accident along the way, I will protect you.\n{Man A:} Although we also want to save our family, is it too dangerous to go back? Is it really okay for us to follow you?\n{Ina:} Don't worry, I must {ensure the safety of each of you}. We were about to rush to Bilesberg.","{男子A：}多谢救命之恩。\n{伊娜：}现在能不能告诉我，到底是怎么回事？你们是什么人，为什么要跑，想跑到哪里去？\n{男子A：}我们本来是{比勒斯勃格}城郊的居民，可是最近突然来了一批军队，也不知是什么原因，突然就把我们都抓了起来。\n{男子B：}然后我们男人就被集中起来，关在一起，老人妇女和孩子被关在了别处。唉，我的父母妻小还不知道怎么样……\n{男子C：}我们中的人被一批一批地叫出去，然后出去的人再也没有回来。不知道从哪里传来的消息，说那些人都是被押去魔界做苦工了，干到死为止，再也回不来了。\n{男子A：}所以我们剩下的人就商量逃跑。终于有一次机会，趁着看守在打瞌睡，我们约好了一齐动手，破牢而出，逃了出来。\n{男子B：}很快那些抓我们的人就来追杀我们。我们也不知道要逃到哪里去，而且还跟一批同伴们失散了……\n{弗里曼：}很抱歉，你们失散的那些同伴，可能已经被杀害了，我们一路过来时看到了他们的尸体。\n{男子A：}啊，那么我们怎么办？\n{男子C：}不管逃到哪里，还是会被杀的啊……\n{男子B：}而且我还担心我的父母妻小……\n{伊娜：}这样吧，你跟着我们一起，回到{比勒斯勃格}去，去把抓你们的那些人统统打倒，把你们的家人都救出来。在这一路上，如果发生什么意外，我会保护你们。\n{男子A：}虽然我们也想救出家人，不过，再要回去，是不是太危险了，我们跟着你们，真的没问题吗？\n{伊娜：}放心吧，我一定{确保你们每一个人的安全}。我们本来也正要赶着去比勒斯勃格呢。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Man A:} Then let's go one step ahead, and the heroes must also triumph.","{男子A：}那么我们先走一步，英雄们也一定要凯旋啊。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Man in white:} Welcome to the Mana Foundation.\n{Ina:} Mana Foundation? what is this?\n{Man in white:} If you have extra mana, you can donate it to us, and we will use it for charity to help people in difficulties. Of course, this is entirely voluntary, and it doesn't matter if you don't want to donate.\n{Ina:} This sounds good, let me think about it...","{白衣人：}欢迎光临法力基金会。\n{伊娜：}法力基金会？这是什么？\n{白衣人：}如果您有多余的法力，可以捐助给我们，我们将会把它用于慈善事业，去帮助生活困难的人们。当然，这完全出于自愿，如果您不愿意捐助也没关系。\n{伊娜：}这个，听上去不错，我考虑一下……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Manticore King:} I found the entrance, but I couldn't get in. Sure enough, the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is still needed. Why isn't General Ceresia coming? According to the plan, we should kill Holia and retrieve the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".\n{Ina:} Your general Seresia will not come again, and I will not let you get the \"Fire Spirit Orb\".\n{Manticore:} What, can't it be said...\n{Ina:} Fortunately, I caught up. Since you still stay here and haven't left, then don't leave forever.","{蝎狮王：}入口倒是找到了，可是进不去。果然还是需要“火灵珠”。赛雷西亚将军怎么还不来，按照计划，我们应该去杀掉霍利亚取回“火灵珠”了。\n{伊娜：}你们的赛雷西亚将军不会再来了，而且我也不会让你们去拿“火灵珠”的。\n{蝎狮王：}什么，难道说……\n{伊娜：}还好赶上了。既然你们还留在这里没走，那么就永远别走了吧。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Men in black:} Where are you going? I'm a traveler, I wonder if I can travel with me?\n{Freeman:} How come this man in black's clothes are so familiar... Ah, come to think of it, this is how the man in black who set fire to my house that night!\n{Man in black:} Oh, I didn't expect Prince Freeman to have seen our costumes and he has such a good memory. That's right. I am a member of the \"Black Tiger Agent Team\" under the command of Archbishop Yingluck. Archbishop Yingluck made a brilliant calculation. It is estimated that you will pass Calterra before letting us search. Sure enough, I found you.\n{Freeman:} Found me, what do you want?\n{Men in black:} I wanted to pretend to be with you and wait for an opportunity to get rid of you on the road. But now that I have been spotted, I can only do it directly...\n{Ina:} I want to harm Prince Freeman, I won't let you succeed!","{黑衣人：}几位上哪里去？我是个旅行者，不知能不能同行啊？\n{弗里曼：}这黑衣人的服装怎么这么熟悉……啊，想起来了，那天晚上放火烧我屋子的黑衣人就是这个样子的！\n{黑衣人：}哎呀，没想到弗里曼王子看过我们的服装，还记性这么好。没错。我就是英拉大主教麾下的“黑虎特工队”的一员。英拉大主教神机妙算，估计到你会经过卡尔泰拉，才让我们来搜寻。果然找到你了。\n{弗里曼：}找到了我，你想怎么样呢？\n{黑衣人：}本想假装跟你们同行，路上伺机下手除掉你。不过现在既然被察觉了，那么就只有直接动手了……\n{伊娜：}竟然想加害弗里曼王子，我不会让你得逞的！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} Coming soon, this is it.\n{Ina:} Is this Tianchi Mountain?\n{Mengying:} No, to be precise, this is the secret entrance of Tianchi Mountain. Normally I don't bring other people here, but now the situation is urgent and there is no other way.\n{Ina:} What kind of place is Tianchi Mountain?\n{Mengying:} Ha ha, I can't elaborate on this. When I get there, I will go to the creation altar and ask the guards for the \"sword of creation\". Then you will just follow me. Don't talk too much. The most important thing is, don't tell them that we want to use the \"Creation Sword\". \"Sword of Destruction\" to destroy the \"Sword of Destruction\".\n{Ina:} Hey, why can't you tell them?\n{Mengying:} Anyway, just listen to me.\n{Ina:} Uh...well.","{梦影：}快到了，就是这里。\n{伊娜：}这里就是天池山吗？\n{梦影：}不，准确地说，这里是天池山的秘密入口。一般我不会带其他人到这里来，不过现在事态紧急，也没有办法了。\n{伊娜：}天池山到底是一个什么样的地方呢？\n{梦影：}呵呵，这个我可不能说得更详细了。等下到了那里，我会到创世坛去跟守卫要“创世之剑”，那时你们跟着我就好，不要多嘴，最重要的是，千万不要告诉他们我们是想用“创世之剑”来破坏“毁灭之剑”。\n{伊娜：}咦，为什么不能告诉他们呢？\n{梦影：}总之你听我的就好了。\n{伊娜：}呃……好吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} Hahahaha! It's so simple to get all the \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\"! I just said that the guy from Spien Rodri wasn't good, and the one who finally got all the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" must be me! Go take the \"Dragon Armor\", synthesize the complete \"Dragon King Divine Power\" and give it to Lord Solo, Lord Solo can succeed in his hegemony, hahahaha!\n{Ina:} You really are not Mengying sister.\n{Mengying:} You find it's too late now! \"Dragon King Divine Power\" I have all got it.\n{Ina:} You can't get the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\". Because the \"longan ring\" I gave you is fake. If you don't believe me, try it. The real \"longan ring\" is here.\n{Mengying:} What! how so! You actually kept a hand! Have you noticed it before?\n{Ina:} There are heavy defenses from Solo's troops here, and it is too unnatural for Sister Mengying to appear here safely. And the previous time you defrauded the \"Red Star Sword\" from me, it was too unnatural. However, the most important and decisive evidence is that the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" you painted is too realistic! Sister Mengying's painting is really terrible!\n{Mengying:} I didn't expect to show off here, I admit that you are really very scheming. However, now there are 7 pieces of \"Dragon King Divine Power\" in my hands and you only have one. The advantage is still on my side. Even if you see through me, it's useless, I can still snatch the last \"Dragon Eye Ring\".\n{Ina:} I think so too. Anyway, if you give these 7 pieces to you, you can't form the \"Dragon King Divine Power\". I can still take it back. As long as I am sure that you are not sister Mengying, then I will be relieved.","{梦影：}哈哈哈哈！这样简单就把“龙王神力”全部弄到手了！我就说斯拜恩罗德里那家伙不行，最后取得全部“龙王神力”的人一定是我！去拿了“龙甲”，合成完整的“龙王神力”交给索罗大人，索罗大人的霸业就可以成功了，啊哈哈哈哈！\n{伊娜：}你果然不是梦影姐姐。\n{梦影：}你现在发现已经晚了！“龙王神力”我已经全部到手了哦。\n{伊娜：}你合不出“龙王神力”的啦。因为我给你的“龙眼戒”是假的哦。不信你去试试。真的“龙眼戒”在这儿呢。\n{梦影：}什么！怎么会这样！你居然留了一手！难道之前你已经察觉了？\n{伊娜：}这里有索罗的部队的重重布防，梦影姐姐能安然出现在这里太不自然了。而且前一次你从我手中骗取“赤星剑”时也太不自然。不过，最重要的，决定性的证据是，你画的“龙牙项链”太逼真了！真的梦影姐姐画画超级烂的！\n{梦影：}没想到居然在这上面露了马脚，我承认你确实很有心计。不过，现在“龙王神力”有7件在我手中而你只有一件。优势还是在我这边。即使你识破了我也没用，我照样能把最后一件“龙眼戒”夺过来。\n{伊娜：}我也是这么想的，反正这7件给你，你也组不了“龙王神力”，我还是能夺回来的呢。只要确信了你不是梦影姐姐，那么我就放心地出手了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} It seems that this is the core part of the altar.\n{Ina:} What a horrible building... I feel more and more disturbed... I feel a little uncomfortable... Solo, where is that guy...\n{Ladia:} Be careful, it's a magic gun!\n{Ina:} Huh? ! The scorching cannon flame that shot at Ina was blocked by Radia with his body. On the high platform ahead, Solo was standing next to a cannon, laughing out loud.\n{Solo:} Hahaha! What an idiot, actually acting as a shield for others, see, the fate of betraying me...\n{Ina:} Radia! Radia!\n{Radia:} Ina, I can finally save you once...I hope that in the afterlife, I can really become...friends with you...\n{Ina:} Radia! ! !\n{Solo:} Is this the last word? It's so unambiguous...\n{Ina:} Asshole, unforgivable, Solo...\n{Reel:} Ina's eyes, what's going on...\n{Freeman:} The eyes turned bright red...\n{Mengying:} Could it be...\"Dark Blood\"?\n{Ina:} Solo, I won't forgive you! Ina pointed at Solo with a single hand, releasing a fierce fireball. Solo jumped away, and the Magic Cannon was blown to pieces.\n{Solo:} Hahaha, what a surprise. It surprised me too much! Unexpectedly, it was you, Eluda II, who came back by himself!\n{Ina:} What are you talking about...\n{Solo:} You are my masterpiece of success. Seventeen years ago, in order to create a biological weapon capable of conquering the mainland, I created you!\n{Mengying:} Could it be said that it was really \"dark blood\" just now?\n{Solo:} Yes, as opposed to the \"brilliant blood\" possessed by the descendants of Augustine, the descendants of Kaos also possess the same powerful ability \"dark blood\". Unfortunately, there are no descendants of Kaos on the mainland of Mirronia. However, I was lucky enough to get a formula. After years of experimentation, I finally synthesized the \"Dark Blood\"! In order to be able to use \"Dark Blood\" to create powerful biological weapons, I secretly carried out a \"Blood Demon Project\" 17 years ago! I first created the experimental body Eluda One with \"Dark Blood\", but it was a pity that although it had powerful destructive power, it could not control the \"Dark Blood\" in the body, and finally ran away to death. After learning the lessons of No. 1, I made a significant adjustment and improvement in control, and finally created a successful experimental body Eluda No. 2, which is you!\n{Ina:} What are you talking about... I was born in the village of Ainar, and it has nothing to do with you...\n{Solo:} I could have done the hegemony 17 years ago because of the emergence of a human , Let this plan be postponed until now! That man is Coron Alsace! He stole Eluda II, who was still adjusting the pupal state at the time, and burned all my recipe materials! The \"Blood Demon Project\" that I had been planning for many years was completely shattered!\n{Ina:} Coron Alsace... That's Grandpa's name... How would you know...\n{Solow:} You actually call him grandpa! He is just a thief who stole you, and I am your real master!\n{Ina:} You are not allowed to insult my grandpa! For so many years, Grandpa has always been the only relative who loves me most...How could I believe this set of lies you made up!\n{Solo:} It seems that you have been instilled too many wrong understandings by humans... But it doesn’t matter, you see, from Radia’s death, the altar received the last bit of energy needed, my \"Sword of Destruction.\" Has been unblocked! With the help of this \"Sword of Destruction\", I can completely awaken your \"Dark Blood\" and let you see the truth!\n{Rael:} Sorry, \"Sword of Destruction\"...\n{Dream Shadow:} Is it too late...\n{Solo:} Don't worry, my goal now is not you, I just want to wake up my blood demon, Ai Luda II, wake up!","{梦影：}看起来这里就是祭坛的核心部分了。\n{伊娜：}好恐怖的建筑……越来越感到不安了……身体有些难受……索罗，那家伙在哪里……\n{拉迪亚：}小心，是魔动炮！\n{伊娜：}啊？！\n\n射向伊娜的一柱一人高的灼热的炮焰，被拉迪亚用身体挡住了。前方高台上，索罗站在一尊大炮旁边，失声大笑。\n\n{索罗：}哈哈哈！真是笨蛋，居然为别人作盾，看到了吧，背叛我的下场……\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚！拉迪亚！\n{拉迪亚：}伊娜，我终于可以救你一次了呢……希望来世，真的能和你成为……朋友……\n{伊娜：}拉迪亚！！！\n{索罗：}这就是遗言？真是太没志气了……\n{伊娜：}混蛋，不可饶恕，索罗……\n{雷尔：}伊娜的眼睛，怎么回事……\n{弗里曼：}眼珠变成了鲜红色……\n{梦影：}难道是……“暗黑之血”？\n{伊娜：}索罗，我不会原谅你！\n\n伊娜单手指向索罗，放出猛烈的火弹。索罗一跃闪开，魔动炮被炸得粉碎。\n\n{索罗：}哈哈哈，真是意外之喜啊。太让我吃惊了！没想到是你，艾露达二号，竟然自己回来了！\n{伊娜：}你在说些什么……\n{索罗：}你是我的成功的杰作啊。十七年前，为了创造出能够征服大陆的生物兵器，我创造了你！\n{梦影：}难道说，刚才真的是“暗黑之血”？\n{索罗：}没错，与奥古斯丁后裔拥有的“光辉之血”相对，卡奥斯的后裔也拥有同样强大的能力“暗黑之血”。可惜米尔罗尼亚大陆上并没有卡奥斯的后裔。不过，我幸运地得到了一个配方，经过多年的试验，终于人工合成了“暗黑之血”！为了能应用“暗黑之血”制造出强大的生物兵器，我在十七年前秘密进行了一项“血魔计划”！我先造出了拥有“暗黑之血”的实验体艾露达一号，可惜它虽然拥有强大的破坏力，却无法制御体内的“暗黑之血”，最后暴走而死。吸取了一号的教训之后，我在控制力上大幅调整改良，终于造出了成功的实验体艾露达二号，也就是你！\n{伊娜：}你说什么疯话……我出生在艾拉尔村，跟你扯不上一点关系……\n{索罗：}本来我十七年前就可以完成霸业，就是因为一个人类的出现，让这个计划延迟到了现在！那个人叫科伦·阿尔萨斯！他偷走了当时还在蛹状态的调整中的艾露达二号，还把我的配方资料都烧了！让我运筹多年的“血魔计划”完全破灭！\n{伊娜：}科伦·阿尔萨斯……那是爷爷的名字……你怎么会知道……\n{索罗：}你居然还叫他爷爷！他只是偷走你的窃贼，我才是你真正的主人！\n{伊娜：}不许你侮辱我的爷爷！这么多年来，爷爷一直是最疼爱我的唯一的亲人……我怎么可能相信你编出来的这套谎言！\n{索罗：}看来你被人类灌输了太多错误的认识了……不过不要紧，你看，从拉迪亚的死，祭坛获得了最后一点所需的能量，我的“毁灭之剑”已经解封了！有了这把“毁灭之剑”的帮助，我就可以彻底唤醒你的“暗黑之血”，让你看看事实的真相吧！\n{雷尔：}糟了，“毁灭之剑”……\n{梦影：}已经来不及了吗……\n{索罗：}放心，我现在的目标不是你们，我只想唤醒我的血魔，艾露达二号，觉醒吧！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} It's useless to apologize on your lips.","{梦影：}光嘴上道歉没用哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} The coast is ahead. We took a boat {to the west}, {around Snow Mountain Island}, to the west of Snow Mountain Island.","{梦影：}前面就是海岸了。我们坐船{向西}，{绕过雪山岛}，往雪山岛的西面去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} Then let me explain what I know about the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\". \"Dragon King Supernatural Power\" is a combined treasure. There are 9 components in total, namely {\"Dragon Tooth Crown\", \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\", \"Red Dragon Sword\", \"Dragon Shield\", \"Dragon}{Armor\", \"Dragon Wing Robe\", and \"Dragon Bone Sword\" , \"Longan Ring\", \"Longan Ring\"}. And these 9 parts have now been scattered to all corners of Mirronia. You must collect them separately.\n{Ina:} So where are these 9 parts?\n{Mengying:} It's a pity that I don't know where they are. However, if you can obtain {\"Eternal Sphere\"}, I can use it to make a magical instrument that can detect the position of the corresponding component when it approaches.\n{Ina:} Okay, thank you sister Mengying! Then we go to find that \"eternal ball\".\n{Rael:} But where is the \"Eternal Sphere\"?\n{Dream Shadow:} The first king of the Kingdom of Barland, Kurid VII, once received an \"Eternal Orb\".\n{Ina:} Culled VII, the name is so familiar, I flipped through my notes... Ah, I found it. Grandpa told me before that Culled VII is a tyrant who likes to search for money and rare treasures. , Grandpa's father originally lived in the Kingdom of Barland, but he escaped to Kartia because he couldn't stand the tyranny of Kurid VII...\n{Mengying:} Yes, as you said, he is an insatiable villain.\n{Ina:} But, this tyrant has been dead for decades, where are we going to find the \"eternal ball\" that was in his hands?\n{Dream Shadow:} The funeral of Culled VII was extremely luxurious when he died. A lot of treasures were used as funeral objects, so I think the \"Eternal Ball\" is probably one of the funeral objects. You can go to his {mausoleum} looking around. Let me open a {portal} channel for you.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much. In addition, I would like to ask by the way, sister Mengying must be very powerful in magic, can you teach me a little bit?\n{Mengying:} I don't really study magic very much. There is a little information in my {bookstore}, if you can read it down.\n{Ina:} Also, I want to learn fire magic, I wonder if sister Mengying has a way?\n{Mengying:} Fire magic, I also have it in my bookstore.\n{Ina:} Thank you so much. Then let me check it out.","{梦影：}那么我说明一下我所知道的关于“龙王神力”的情报。“龙王神力”是一件组合宝物。共有9个部件组成，分别是{“龙牙冠”，“龙牙项链”，“赤龙剑”，“龙盾”，“龙}{甲”，“龙翼袍”，“龙骨胫甲”，“龙眼戒”，“龙眼指环”}。而这9个部件如今已经散落到米尔罗尼亚的各个角落。你们必须分别去收集它们。\n{伊娜：}那么这9个部件分别在哪里呢？\n{梦影：}很遗憾的是我也不知道它们在哪里。不过，如果你们能取得{“永恒之球”}的话，我倒是可以利用它做出一个魔法仪器来，可以在靠近的时候探测到相应部件的位置。\n{伊娜：}好啊，谢谢梦影姐姐！那么我们去找那个“永恒之球”。\n{雷尔：}不过，“永恒之球”又在哪里呢？\n{梦影：}巴兰德王国的先王库里德七世曾经得到过一个“永恒之球”。\n{伊娜：}库里德七世，这个名字好熟悉，我翻翻笔记……啊，找到了，爷爷以前跟我讲过，库里德七世是个暴君，喜欢搜刮钱财和奇珍异宝，爷爷的父亲本来居住在巴兰德王国，就是因为无法忍受库里德七世的暴政才逃到了卡尔提亚……\n{梦影：}对，正如你所说，他是个贪得无厌的恶棍。\n{伊娜：}可是，这个暴君已经死了好几十年了，我们上哪去找曾经在他手里的“永恒之球”呢？\n{梦影：}库里德七世死时葬礼极尽奢华，大量珍宝都作为陪葬品了，所以我想“永恒之球”很可能也是陪葬品之一，你们可以到他的{陵墓}去找找看。我帮你们开一个{传送门}通道吧。\n{伊娜：}太感谢了。另外我顺便想问问，梦影姐姐魔法一定很厉害吧，能不能教我一点？\n{梦影：}我对魔法其实并不是很有研究。我的{书屋}里有一点资料，如果你能读下来的话。\n{伊娜：}还有，我想学火系魔法，不知梦影姐姐是不是有办法？\n{梦影：}火系魔法，我的书屋里也有。\n{伊娜：}太感谢了。那就让我去看看吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} This is my workplace. You have found {Eternal Sphere} and get it here.","{梦影：}这里是我的工作间。你们找到了{永恒之球}就拿到这里来好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} This is the bookstore. However, if you want to go in, you have to pay 5000 gold coins first.\n{Ina:} Do you still have to collect money?\n{Mengying:} This is a punishment for your improperly called me before.\n{Ina:} Uh... I was wrong.","{梦影：}这里就是书屋了。不过，如果你要进去的话，得先付5000金币。\n{伊娜：}还要收钱啊？\n{梦影：}这是对你之前对我称呼不当的惩罚。\n{伊娜：}呜……我错了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mengying:} This place is very nice. Even if a violent shock wave erupts, it will not have a big impact on the surroundings.\n{Ina:} So, are we destroying the \"Sword of Destruction\" right here?\n{Mengying:} Have you thought about it? Once the \"Sword of Destruction\" is destroyed, the \"Sword of Creation\" will also be shattered. We will no longer be able to create the world, and mankind can only continue on its own strength.\n{Rael:} Human beings should survive on their own strength. We don't need a god of creation.\n{Freeman:} Yes, we will follow our own path so that we will not repeat the same mistakes as the extinction of prehistoric humans.\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying said, a person can become very strong if he has aspinations, as long as he has hope. I hope that people can live happily, happily, and safely, and can understand the hard-won of this ordinary life, and cherish it, so that mankind will no longer need to create the world. This is my wish.","{梦影：}这个地方很不错。即使爆发出猛烈的冲击波，也不会对周围造成很大的影响。\n{伊娜：}那么，我们就在这里破坏“毁灭之剑”了吗？\n{梦影：}你们想好了吗？一旦破坏了“毁灭之剑”，“创世之剑”也会粉碎，我们将不再能创世，人类只能靠自己的力量去延续了。\n{雷尔：}人类，本来就应该靠自己的力量生存下去，我们才不需要什么创世神。\n{弗里曼：}没错，我们会沿着自己的路走下去，才不会重蹈史前人类灭绝的覆辙。\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐说了，一个人有心愿可以变得很强大，只要拥有希望。我希望，人们能够快乐，幸福，平安地生活，并且，能够理解这份平凡生活的来之不易，珍惜它，那么人类就不会再需要创世。这就是我的心愿。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Military:} Stop the ship! We are...\n{Ina:} You are the Solandria Navy, I know, I borrowed it...","{军人：}停船！我们是……\n{伊娜：}你们是索兰德里亚海军，我知道的啦，借过借过……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Military:} Stop the ship, we are the Solandria Navy...\n{Ina:} I'm sorry, I know your maritime prohibition, but we have to pass, the navy adults offended.","{军人：}停船，我们是索兰德里亚海军……\n{伊娜：}不好意思，我知道你们海禁，不过我们还得必须要过去，海军大人们得罪了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Military:} The ship ahead, stop! Don't move forward anymore.\n{Ina:} Ah, is it a pinate?\n{Military:} Unbridled! What a pinate! We are the Solandria Navy.\n{Ina:} We are just civilians, and we didn't break any law. What did the navy guys ask us for?\n{Military:} According to Master Holia's latest instructions, Solandria has implemented a sea ban. Foreign ships are not allowed to enter the territorial waters of Solandria. Please go back.\n{Ina:} But, we must go to Solandria if we are in a hurry.\n{Military:} This is an order from Lord Holia. If you do not obey, we can only use coercive means to get you back.\n{Ina:} What is a coercive method?\n{Soldier:} I paid your ship and sent you back.\n{Ina:} Stop it, I don't want to fight with you...","{军人：}前面的船只，停船！不要再向前了。\n{伊娜：}啊，难道是海盗？\n{军人：}放肆！什么海盗！我们是索兰德里亚海军。\n{伊娜：}我们只是平民，没犯什么法，海军大人们找我们做什么呢？\n{军人：}根据霍利亚大人最新的指示，索兰德里亚已经全面实行海禁。外国船只不得再进入索兰德里亚领海，请你们回去吧。\n{伊娜：}可是，我们有急事一定要去索兰德里亚耶。\n{军人：}这是霍利亚大人的命令。如果你们不服从，我们只能用强制手段让你们回去了。\n{伊娜：}怎么个强制手段？\n{军人：}缴了你们的船，把你们遣送回去。\n{伊娜：}住手啊，我可不想跟你们打……\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Military:} This is the Solandria Army Training Camp. You guys want to train too? Then you have to try first if you can win us.","{军人：}这里是索兰德里亚陆军训练营。你们也想来训练？那得先试试你们能不能赢得过我们。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Militia:} Our militia will also go together. The dense forest is very dangerous. Let us protect the safety of the priest, father and son.\n{Zola:} Thank you all. But everyone should be careful {no casualties} on the way.\n{Militia:} Don't worry, all of our militia are the best guys on Snow Mountain Island.","{民兵队：}我们民兵队也一起去，密林里很危险，让我们来保护司祭父子的安全。\n{佐拉：}谢谢大家了。不过大家路上千万注意{不要有伤亡}。\n{民兵队：}放心啦，我们民兵队个个都是雪山岛上最好的汉子。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Minotaur:} Intruder! kill!\n{Ina:} Ah, how come there are monsters here?\n{Rael:} Sure enough, there is a problem, my hunch is correct.\n{Freeman:} Brother, where is your brother?\n{Minotaur:} Kill! kill!\n{Ina:} It seems that these guys don't know where your brother is. Before they can cut off our heads, they must be dealt with first.","{牛头怪：}闯入者！杀！\n{伊娜：}啊，这里怎么会有怪物？\n{雷尔：}果然有问题，我的预感没错。\n{弗里曼：}哥哥，哥哥到底在哪里？\n{牛头怪：}杀！杀！\n{伊娜：}看来这些家伙是不知道你哥哥在哪里了，在他们砍下我们的脑袋之前，得先把他们解决掉。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mondo:} It turns out that the guy Solo has been violating human beings. If it weren't for you, I really didn't know he had such ambitions. That being said, I helped them transport the \"Purple Spirit Shield\", which may have done something bad.\n{Ina:} Brother Mondo is not responsible. You didn't know it originally.\n{Mondo:} Alas, if I knew earlier that Solo wanted this thing, I wouldn't take this business. I had a bad impression of him at first. It's okay now, it actually helped him and caused you trouble.\n{Ina:} Don't blame yourself, Brother Mondo. We will try to stop Solo.","{蒙多：}原来，索罗那个家伙一直在侵犯人类啊，要不是你说，我还真不知道他有这样的野心。这么说来，我帮他们运送了“紫灵盾”，可能是做了坏事了。\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥没有责任的啦。本来你就不知道嘛。\n{蒙多：}唉，我要是早点知道是索罗要这东西，我也不会接这桩生意。本来就对他印象不好。现在倒好，居然帮了他的忙，还给你们添了麻烦。\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥别自责了。我们会尽量阻止索罗的。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mondo:} Stop.\n{Ina:} Huh? Reached?\n{Mondo:} From this cave, you can directly reach the city of Bataan.\n{Ina:} That's great. We will try our best to help you get your reward back.\n{Mondo:} I don't think it's a play, don't take it too seriously. You should take care of your own tasks first.","{蒙多：}停。\n{伊娜：}嗯？到了吗？\n{蒙多：}从这个洞穴上去，就能直接到达巴塔安城的城下了。\n{伊娜：}那真是太好了。我们一定尽量帮你把报酬讨回来。\n{蒙多：}那个我看是没戏了，不必太认真。你们还是先管你们自己的任务吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mondo:} That's it.\n{Ina:} This waterway is so narrow. This is the secret passage to Bataan City?\n{Mondo:} Exactly.\n{Ina:} How did Brother Mondo know this way?\n{Mondo:} This is the professional skills of our transportation merchants. We often travel to and from various places, and we need to know all the traffic to ensure the speed of delivery. For a variety of different goods, different roads must be selected according to the situation. For example, some goods are easy to damage, so you must choose a stable road; some goods need to be transported secretly, you must choose a hidden road; some goods are not resistant to high temperatures, so you must choose a cold road; some goods are dangerous goods that are easily affected. To seize, one must choose a way that can avoid the guard posts of the various tribes. Only when you are familiar with all the roads can you choose the most reasonable route in all situations.\n{Ina:} Being a transport merchant is not easy.","{蒙多：}就是这里了。\n{伊娜：}这条水道好窄啊。这就是通向巴塔安城的秘密通道？\n{蒙多：}没错。\n{伊娜：}蒙多大哥怎么会知道这条道的呢？\n{蒙多：}这就是我们运输商人的职业技巧了，经常往来于各地，对所有的交通都要了如指掌才能保证送货的速度。对各种不同的货物，必须要根据情况选择不同的道路。比如有的货物易损坏，就要选择平稳的路；有的货物需要秘密运送，就要选择隐蔽的路；有的货物不耐高温，就要选择阴冷的路；有的货物是危险品容易被扣押，就要选择能避开各部落岗哨的路。只有熟悉了所有的路，才能在各种情况下都能选出最合理的路线。\n{伊娜：}当个运输商人也不简单呢。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monitor:} This is the marine environment monitoring station. Recently, large swaths of blue algae have erupted in the southern waters. In order to prevent their spread, the gate of this station was closed. The boat, please detour.","{监测员：}这里是海洋环境监测站。近期由于南方海域爆发了大片蓝藻，为了防止其扩散，本站的闸门关闭。船只请绕行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monitor:} This is the marine environment monitoring station. Recently, large swaths of blue algae have erupted in the southern waters. In order to prevent their spread, the gate of this station was closed. The boat, please detour.\n{Ina:} Has this gate been closed all the time?\n{Monitor:} It is not always closed. If the cyanobacteria can be controlled, they can open up. {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} Ah, cyanobacteria! I like to eat! Leave me here.\n{Monitor:} Ah, isn't this... Golden Crown Jellyfish? Golden Crown Jellyfish is the best way to suppress blue algae. Unexpectedly, you made a special trip to bring us this. Thank you so much.\n{Ina:} Uh, actually...it's not a special trip... {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} Let me stay here.\n{Ina:} Well, this seems to be the best of both worlds.\n{Monitor:} With the golden crown jellyfish, there is no need to worry about cyanobacteria. We will reopen the floodgates.","{监测员：}这里是海洋环境监测站。近期由于南方海域爆发了大片蓝藻，为了防止其扩散，本站的闸门关闭。船只请绕行。\n{伊娜：}这个闸门就一直关闭了吗？\n{监测员：}也不是一直关闭。如果蓝藻能够被控制住的话，就可以开放了。\n{金冠水母：}啊，蓝藻！我喜欢吃！把我留在这里吧。\n{监测员：}啊，这不是……金冠水母吗？金冠水母是抑制蓝藻的最好方法了。没想到你们专程为我们带来这个。真是太感谢了。\n{伊娜：}呃，其实……也不是专程……\n{金冠水母：}让我留在这里吧。\n{伊娜：}好吧，这看起来是个两全其美的方案。\n{监测员：}有了金冠水母，蓝藻的问题就不用担心了。我们这就重新开放闸门。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monster:} Found unknown armed, not from Solandria, kill!\n{Ina:} Who are you, obviously you are the unknown armed, right?","{怪物：}发现不明武装，不是索兰德里亚的人，杀！\n{伊娜：}你们是谁啊，明明你们才是不明武装吧？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monster:} Human! Don't come near here, kill them!\n{Ina:} Hey, who are you? Why are you stopping me here?","{怪物：}人类！不许靠近这里，杀了他们！\n{伊娜：}咦，你们是谁？为什么要在这里拦我？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monster:} There are humans approaching, kill!\n{Ina:} Should a monster be killed here, right? This is our human country.","{怪物：}有人类靠近，杀！\n{伊娜：}有怪物在这里才该杀吧？这里是我们人类的国家唉。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Monster:}...\n{Ina:} These guys are even more straightforward, and they rushed forward without speaking...No, they can't speak at all.","{怪物：}……\n{伊娜：}这些家伙更干脆，不说话就扑上来了……不对，是他们根本就不会说话。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mozu Mercenary:} If you can't get a proper remuneration, then I am sorry that we can only accept Solo's offer.","{魔族雇佣兵：}如果你拿不出合适的报酬的话，那就抱歉我们只能接受索罗的报价了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mozu:} I'm here, brother! did you find it?\n{Ina:} Unfortunately, we are not your brother, but we did call you.\n{Mozu:} Why are you looking for me?\n{Ina:} Of course I killed you.","{魔族：}我来了，老哥！找到了吗？\n{伊娜：}很遗憾，我们不是你老哥，不过确实是我们把你叫来的。\n{魔族：}你们找我干嘛？\n{伊娜：}当然是干掉你了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Mozu:} You guys, stop them for me. If you can't stop them, you will have to wait for a while!\n{Subordinate:} Yes, Captain!\n{Ina:} Do you guys want to stop me?","{魔族：}你们几个，给我拦住他们，拦不住也要拖点时间！\n{部下：}是，队长！\n{伊娜：}就凭你们几个小喽罗也想拦住我吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Naga:} Strangers, kill!\n{Ina:} Is this the elite unit that Chinu said?\n{Freeman:} It doesn't feel like it. Since it was called Xiaolong Force, it felt like it was something like a dragon, at least it should be able to fly.","{那迦：}陌生人，杀！\n{伊娜：}这就是齐努所说的精锐部队吗？\n{弗里曼：}感觉不像。既然叫枭龙部队，感觉是不是龙之类的东西，至少也该是会飞的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Officer of the Ministry of Infrastructure:} In order to speed up the construction of urban infrastructure and protect the lives of the people, we need more labor, but the existing manpower is not enough...\n{Officer:} I understand what you mean, I will transfer a group of idle volunteers to help you Right. {Official of the Ministry of Infrastructure:} Thank you so much.\n{Officer:} This is a list of {32 spearmen and 14 shooters}. {Official of the Ministry of Infrastructure:} Why is the number reported below a bit weird? More than 60,000 people?\n{Officer:} That's just a fake, don't bother about it. That was when I asked the adjutant to make a publicity and asked him to make some momentum so that more people could join us. As a result, he wrote such large numbers indiscriminately, which was too fake at first glance. So these propaganda papers can no longer be used. In order not to waste paper, I take them back for miscellaneous use.","{基建部官员：}为了加快建设城市基础设施，保障民众生活，我们需要更多劳动力，但现有人手不够……\n{军官：}我明白你的意思，我调一批闲置的志愿兵去帮助你吧。\n{基建部官员：}真是太感谢了。\n{军官：}这是名单，共抽调了{枪兵32人，射手14人}。\n{基建部官员：}怎么下面的报告数字有点怪？六万多人？\n{军官：}那只是假的，不用理会。那是之前我叫副官去作宣传，让他搞点声势好让更多人来加入我们，结果他就乱写些这么大的数字，一看就太假了。于是这些宣传纸就不能用了，为了不浪费纸张，我收回来作为杂用。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Old man:} Lend me some, I'll count it, and I will definitely pay it back.\n{Ina:} If you can't, you can't.","{老人：}借我些吧，我说话算话，一定会还的。\n{伊娜：}说不行就是不行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Old man:} Lend me some, I'll count it, and I will definitely pay it back.\n{Ina:} If you can't, you can't.\n{Old man:} Alas, young people nowadays are really stingy...\n{Ina:} This is not the problem. You are to blame for losing money in gambling. Gambling is a cancer of society and the root of crime. I will lend you money to gamble or continue to harm you. If you don't gamble, don't even talk about borrowing, I would be happy to send money for relief.\n{Old man:} Really? Well, I will never participate in gambling anymore.\n{Ina:} How does this sound so false?\n{Old man:} Don't belittle my personality, I never count. You can go to the Kingdom Archives to see where I have broken my promise before.\n{Ina:} The Kingdom Archives will not be seen by ordinary people, as you said earlier yourself.\n{Old man:} I can swear by my personality.\n{Ina:} Forget it, this is all empty. I believe you will do it once, and be fooled at most once. Here are 99999 gold coins. Go and buy something for home. Don't sleep on the stool anymore. It's not good for your health.\n{Old man:} I was moved...I was wrong, I shouldn't have said you were stingy.\n{Ina:} It's okay, if there is nothing else, I will leave. Goodbye, grandpa. I will check if you have fulfilled your promise later.\n{Old man:} Please wait, little sister.\n{Ina:} What else is there?\n{Old man:} As a generation of heroes, how can you earn money in vain? I teach you the moves I used to fight in the Quartet, which counts as a reward for you.","{老人：}借我些吧，我说话算话，一定会还的。\n{伊娜：}说不行就是不行。\n{老人：}唉，现在的年轻人，真是小气……\n{伊娜：}不是这个问题。您赌博输掉钱是咎由自取。赌博是社会的毒瘤，是犯罪的根源，我借钱给您赌博还是继续害您。您要是不赌博的话，别说借了，就是送钱救济我也乐意。\n{老人：}真的吗？好，我以后再也不参加博彩了。\n{伊娜：}这话怎么听起来好假。\n{老人：}别把我的人格看扁了，我说话从来算数。你可以去翻王国档案，看看我以前哪次有食言过。\n{伊娜：}王国档案是不会让一般人看的，您刚才自己说过。\n{老人：}我可以发誓，以我的人格担保。\n{伊娜：}算了算了，这都是空的啦。我就相信您一次好了，上当最多一次。给您99999金币，去买回家当什么的吧，不要再睡凳子啦，对身体不好的。\n{老人：}感动……我错了，刚才不该说你小气的。\n{伊娜：}没关系啦，要是没什么别的事，我就走了哦。老爷爷再见。过些时候我会来检查您有没有兑现诺言的哦。\n{老人：}小妹妹请等一下。\n{伊娜：}还有什么事？\n{老人：}作为一代英雄，岂能白白收人钱财。我把我当年征战四方所用的招式教给你，算作是对你的酬谢。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Old man:} Sure enough, you haven't reached LV40, so you can't be allowed in.","{老汉：}果然，你没有达到LV40，那么不能让你进去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Old man:} Well, since you have LV40, then I will let you in. But there is something to be said. If you can't come back, the next explorer's standard I agree to put in will be LV41.","{老汉：}好，既然你有LV40，那么我就让你进去。不过有话说在前头，如果你回不来的话，下一个我同意放进去的探险家的标准就要提到LV41了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Old man:} What is the planet closest to the sun, and how many days is its revolution period? Haven't thought about it yet?\n{Ina:} This, please give me some more time...\n{Old man:} It's okay, anyway, I have been studying here. When will you think about it and when will you answer me?","{老者：}离太阳最近的行星是什么，它的公转周期是多少天？还没想好吗？\n{伊娜：}这个，再给我点时间好不好……\n{老者：}没关系，反正我一直在这里读书，你什么时候想好了，什么时候回答我。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{One-eyed man:} Stop! Rob!\n{Ina:} Go to death, you robbers!","{独眼人：}站住！打劫！\n{伊娜：}去死啦，你们这些强盗！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{One-eyed man:} Stop! Rob!\n{Ina:} Isn't it? Do you want to say that the little brother and the little brother and the little brother are in front of you again?\n{One-eyed man:} You actually know all about it! ?\n{Ina:} Your generations are too complicated, it's very dizzying!","{独眼人：}站住！打劫！\n{伊娜：}不是吧？难道你想说前面的又是小弟和小小弟和小小小弟？\n{独眼人：}你居然全知道了！？\n{伊娜：}你们辈份太复杂了啦，这样很让人头晕的耶！\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{One-eyed man:} Stop! Rob!\n{Ina:} My team has been killed by me, now what?\n{One-eyed man:} What kind of team, we are the team, the younger brother and younger brother in front.\n{Ina:} Well, I will let you go to meet your little brother and little brother right away.","{独眼人：}站住！打劫！\n{伊娜：}本队都已经被我干掉啦，这会儿的是？\n{独眼人：}什么本队，我们才是本队，前面的是小弟和小小弟。\n{伊娜：}好吧，我马上让你们去见你们的小弟和小小弟。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{One-eyed man:} Stop, robbery!\n{Ina:} How come there are more?\n{One-eyed man:} The previous batch of little brothers who were just probing, we are our team!\n{Ina:} I care about you! All the robbers anyway.","{独眼人：}站住，打劫！\n{伊娜：}怎么还有啊？\n{独眼人：}前面一批只是试探的小弟，我们才是本队！\n{伊娜：}我管你！反正都是强盗。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Organization Magic Dragon:} The intruder found! The intruder found! Start the automatic defense system! Eliminate intruders!","{机关魔幻龙：}侵入者发现！侵入者发现！启动自动防卫系统！排除侵入者！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} Don't you need my help to upgrade the little monster? You can come to me whenever you need it.","{店主：}不需要我帮忙升级小怪物吗？等你需要的时候随时可以来找我。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} If you are a guest, just order it and let's make a deal at a price. I will give you one more stone as a bonus. I will give you 6 more. How about?","{店主：}客人您要是干脆点，一口价，咱们就成交了。我再多送你一份石材算是添头，给您6份，如何？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} If you can't afford it, there is no way. I said I will not lower the price.","{店主：}买不起的话那也没办法啦。我说过了我不会降价的哦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} Welcome to Low Mountain Fortress.\n{Ina:} Why are you called Low Mountain Fortress here?\n{Shop owner:} This is my shop name. In fact, what I wanted to open a mountain fortress was the facility that could upgrade creatures. It's a pity that my level is not enough and I can't upgrade all creatures. Until now, only little monsters will be upgraded. So I am embarrassed to call it a high mountain fort, but a low mountain fort. If you need to upgrade a little monster, you can find me, I can help you upgrade\n5.\n{Ina:} Why can there be only 5?\n{Owner:} Because when I upgrade them, I need to hold their tails with 2 fingers, lift them upside down and put them on the upgrade furnace to smoke them red. I only have 10 fingers, so I can only upgrade 5 of course.","{店主：}欢迎光临低山堡垒。\n{伊娜：}你这里为什么叫低山堡垒？\n{店主：}这是我的店名。其实我本来想开个高山堡垒的，就是那个能升级生物的设施。可惜我水平不太够，没法升级所有生物。到现在为止只会升级小怪物。所以不好意思叫高山堡垒，只能叫低山堡垒了。如果你需要升级小怪物，可以找我，我能帮你升级5个。\n{伊娜：}为什么只能5个呢？\n{店主：}因为我给它们升级的时候我需要用2只手指头夹住它们的尾巴倒提起来放到升级炉上去熏到发红。我只有10个手指头，当然就只能升级5个了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} Welcome, this is Bisheng Treasure Store. Is there anything I need?\n{Ina:} What treasures are sold here?\n{Owner:} We have all kinds of treasures here. Just talk about what you want.\n{Ina:} Do you have any \"Dragon King Divine Power\" components?\n{Owner:} Hey, you really have come to the right place. I have a \"Dragon Armor\" part of \"Dragon King Power\".\n{Ina:} Really? How much do you sell?\n{Owner:} \"Dragon King Divine Power\" is an ancient artifact, one of its parts, I said, selling 50,000 gold coins, is not too much.\n{Ina:} What a high price, we can't afford it.\n{Owner:} Although the ancient artifacts are indeed worth the money, this lady is so young and beautiful. Visiting our shop really makes the shop splendid. Looking at this, I will give you a 40% discount. Okay, just 30,000 gold coins, how about it?\n{Ina:} The words are pretty good, but they are still quite high. Can you just cut the price?\n{Owner:} Alas, it's not easy for us businessmen to eat a meal together. Besides, this is also a magical tool anyway. If you drop the price, you will lose your identity. It can't be lower.","{店主：}欢迎光临，这里是必胜宝物店。请问有什么需要的吗？\n{伊娜：}这里都卖些什么宝物？\n{店主：}我们这里的宝物种类齐全应有尽有，您要什么只管说。\n{伊娜：}你们有没有“龙王神力”的部件呢？\n{店主：}嘿，这您还真是来对地方了，我这里就有一个“龙王神力”的部件“龙甲”。\n{伊娜：}真的吗？你卖多少钱？\n{店主：}“龙王神力”可是上古神器啊，它的一个部件，我说，卖50000金币，不算过份吧。\n{伊娜：}好高的价钱啊，我们买不起耶。\n{店主：}虽然说上古神器确实是物有所值，不过，这位小姐如此年轻美貌，造访我店真是让小店蓬璧生辉啊，看在这份上，我给您打个6折吧，就30000金币，怎么样？\n{伊娜：}话是挺中听的，不过还是挺高，能不能再杀点价？\n{店主：}唉，我们生意人混口饭吃也不容易，再说这好歹也是神器，再掉价就有失身份了。不能再低啦。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Owner:} Welcome, this is the Brinell building materials store, selling building stone.\n{Ina:} How much does the stone cost?\n{Owner:} Starting at 5 copies, each with 5 copies of 60,000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} This is too expensive. Can I exchange gems for your stone?\n{Owner:} Yes, you can give 30 gems for every 5 pieces of stone.\n{Ina:} Oh my God, how can a stone be more expensive than a gem.\n{Owner:} Guests, when doing business, I'll just talk about consensualism. If you think it's not cost-effective, you just don't buy it. I think I won't sell it if it's not cost-effective, so I won't cut the price.","{店主：}欢迎光临，这里是布氏建材商店，出售建筑石材。\n{伊娜：}石材卖多少钱？\n{店主：}5份起卖，每5份60000金币。\n{伊娜：}这也太贵了吧。那么我用宝石换你的石材可以吗？\n{店主：}也行，每5份石材您给30个宝石就成。\n{伊娜：}天哪，哪有石头比宝石还贵的。\n{店主：}客人啊，做生意这事，就讲个两厢情愿。您要是觉得不划算，您不买就行了。我觉得不划算的话我也不会卖，所以我也不会降价。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{PInate:} Stop the ship, we are...\n{Ina:} I see, you are the Solandria Navy...\n{PInate:} No, we are pinates! Rob!\n{Ina:} Ah, so you are not the navy? I'm too habitual thinking. PInates are even less polite.","{海盗：}停船，我们是……\n{伊娜：}知道了啦，你们是索兰德里亚海军……\n{海盗：}不，我们是海盗！打劫！\n{伊娜：}啊，原来你们不是海军啊？我太惯性思维了。海盗就更没什么好客气的啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{People in white:} If you are willing to donate, please click OK. We will charge you 5 mana.","{白衣人：}如果您愿意捐助，请点击确定。我们将收取您5点法力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Person in charge:} Haven't you got the mascot \"Star Wish Bird\" yet? Then please come back later.","{负责人：}你还没有拿到吉祥物“星愿鸟”吗？那么请稍后再来。"},
