 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Phantom Guardian:} You are so powerful, you can actually find the hidden treasure in this distorted space. However, if this pair of \"Warrior Simmons Arm Statues\" can be handed over to you, you have to try your abilities.","{幻灵守卫：}你很厉害嘛，居然能找到这歪曲空间里的宝物埋藏地点。不过，这对“战士西蒙斯手臂像”能不能交给你，还要试试你的能耐才行。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Phoenix:} How is it possible...The sacred bird can't even solve humans...\n{Elder:} Didn't you lose to humans 99 years ago? What's more, you have just escaped from the ice, and your strength is far from restored. Now that you have nowhere to escape, go back to the enchantment and go to bed obediently.\n{Phoenix:} Certainly, if it hadn't been for the sacred bird to rest, it would have already fluttered its wings and rushed towards the night. I didn't expect to be caught by you despicable humans...\n{Elder:} How about it, are you going back obediently, or do you want us to do it?\n{Phoenix:} It is a shame that this sacred bird is so threatened by humans...\n{Voice:} Master Phoenix, I will help you escape.\n{Elder:} Who? After a strong flash, a man with long head and double horns appeared beside Phoenix.\n{Ina:} Ah, the demon?\n{Devil:} Demon General Clio joins.\n{Ina:} I don't care what general you are, don't make trouble.\n{Clio:} Master Phoenix, please follow my teleportation magic and escape to {Red Sand Plain} immediately. There will be a great place for you to recover. When your body is fully recovered, it will not be too late to come to them for revenge.\n{Phoenix:} Ah, this...\n{Clio:} Let's go. Clio couldn't help but said, dragging Phoenix who was hesitating and disappearing in the light of teleportation magic.\n{Ina:} It's over. I ran away. I didn't expect the demons to make trouble. What on earth did they want to do? This time I have a bad deal...\n{Elder:} The Demon Race has planned for this matter, and you are not responsible. It's a pity that I only understand it now. This incident may have been their plan from beginning to end.\n{Ina:} What should I do now? Where is the Akasahara that the guy is talking about?\n{Freeman:} is {North Kozia} a desert that can be reached through a {ground hole}. To chase it?\n{Ina:} Of course I want to go. However, for now it is better to {clear the fire in the enchantment first} so that the elders and their homes will not be overwhelmed.","{菲尼克斯：}怎么可能……本神鸟居然连人类都解决不了……\n{长老：}99年前，你不是也输给过人类吗？更何况你现在刚刚从冰封中逃出，实力远未恢复。现在你已经无处可逃了，还是乖乖地回到结界中去睡觉吧。\n{菲尼克斯：}切，要不是本神鸟休息尚未充分，早已振翅直冲云宵。没想到被你们这些卑鄙的人类抓住了破绽……\n{长老：}怎么样，是你自己乖乖回去呢，还是要我们动手？\n{菲尼克斯：}本神鸟竟然被人类如此威胁，真是奇耻大辱……\n{声音：}菲尼克斯大人，我来助您逃脱。\n{长老：}谁？\n\n一阵强烈的闪光之后，一个头长双角的男子出现在菲尼克斯的旁边。\n{伊娜：}啊，魔族？\n{魔族：}魔将军克里奥参上。\n{伊娜：}我管你是什么将军，别来捣乱啊。\n{克里奥：}菲尼克斯大人，请立即随我的传送魔法逃至{赤砂原}。那里将会很适合您恢复。等您身体完全复元，再来找他们报仇不迟。\n{菲尼克斯：}啊，这……\n{克里奥：}走吧。\n\n克里奥不由分说，拖上正在犹豫中的菲尼克斯，消失在传送魔法的光芒中。\n\n{伊娜：}完了，逃走了，没想到还会有魔族来捣乱，他们到底想干什么？这下我坏大事了……\n{长老：}魔族对此事早有计划，责任不在你。可惜我现在才看明白。这件事从头到尾也许都是他们的策划。\n{伊娜：}这下怎么办？那家伙所说的赤砂原是哪里？\n{弗里曼：}是{科齐亚北方}通过一处{地洞}可以到达的一片沙漠。去追吗？\n{伊娜：}当然要去。不过，眼下还是{先把结界里的火清除掉}吧，免得长老他们的家被淹没。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Popular:} It turned out to be so, thank you very much. The anti-magic chain is my treasure. Just give this to me. In addition, if you do not dislike it, I will give you a thank you gift in return.","{风行：}原来是这样，多谢你们了。抗魔链是我的宝物。你们把这个给我就行了。另外，如果你不嫌弃的话，我给你一件谢礼作为报答。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Popularity:} This thing is called magic element, it is made of the essence of magic, not only has the ability of {ring strike}, but also {not affected by any magic} {sound}. In addition, he can use magic that you have not mastered once for you, but only once, and it will disappear after you use it. Hope it will be useful to you.\n{Ina:} I am so grateful to seniors.\n{Popular:} Where, I should say thank you.","{风行：}这东西叫做魔法元素，是集魔法的精华而成，不但有{环击}的本领，而且还{不受任何魔法影}\n{响}。另外，他还能替你使用一次你自己尚未掌握的魔法，不过只有一次，使用完后它就会消失。希望它会对你有用。\n{伊娜：}实在太感谢前辈啦。\n{风行：}哪里哪里，该说感谢的是我才对啊。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Priest:} Although your heart is simple, you still seem to lack discipline. After you reach a certain level, you can naturally realize the true reverence for the gods.","{神官：}虽然你内心纯朴，不过看起来还缺少磨练。等你达到一定境界之后，自然能领悟到对神明真正的崇敬。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Priest:} Do you want to visit the \"Tongtian Monument\"?\n{Ina:} Yes. {Priest:} Please pay the maintenance fee of 30,000 gold coins in advance.\n{Ina:} Huh? You have to pay.\n{Priest:} Of course. The \"Tongtian Monument\" can stand for more than three thousand years without falling, thanks to the meticulous maintenance of our St. Cridrans clan over the years. Since the Amishulan dynasty, my ancestors have been appointed as the guardian of this monument. From then on, it has been passed on from generation to generation. Regardless of how the dynasties change, the kings of each dynasty have maintained the \"Tongtian Monument\" to the St. Cridrans clan. Appreciation of the work has increased strong support. However, because we are not subject to the independent existence of the governments of each dynasty, we cannot use state funds. Although sometimes enthusiastic nobles, rich people and even kings will provide a little sponsorship in private, the payment of tourists is the main part of our maintenance funds. source.\n{Ina:} But, your charges are so expensive that ordinary people can't afford it, right?\n{Priest:} If every ordinary citizen can step on their feet, can this monument stand still to this day?\n{Ina:} Uh... so to speak...\n{Priest:} You may not know how difficult it is to maintain this ancient and majestic building. We have to inspect, repair, clean, and take care of every day. All these tasks are done by our family. We also specially bred a few Varian volcanic eagles imported from Ariania. They are dexterous and docile, suitable as mounts to maintain the outer wall of the \"Tongtian Monument\"-unlike the flying dragons, which are too large and rude, they are not careful. Crashing it will cause damage instead. But these guys are not ordinary and delicate, they are very picky for food, and the feed money for a lunch alone will cost thousands of gold coins. If it weren't for these inputs, how could this three thousand-year-old ancient building remain so stable today?\n{Ina:} It's really hard work, so that means paying for it.","{神官：}你们要参观“通天碑”吗？\n{伊娜：}是的。\n{神官：}请先付维护费用30000金币。\n{伊娜：}啊？还要付钱的啊。\n{神官：}当然。“通天碑”能够屹立三千多年不倒，全靠着我们圣克里德兰斯一族长年以来的精心维护。从阿米舒兰王朝起，我的祖先就被任命为此碑的守护者，从此以后代代相传，不论朝代如何更替，各朝君王都对我们圣克里德兰斯一族维护“通天碑”的工作赞赏有加大力支持。不过，由于我们是不受制于各朝政府的独立存在，因此也无法使用国家经费，虽然有时热心的贵族和富豪甚至国王以私人名义会提供一点赞助，但游客支付费用才是我们维护经费的主要来源。\n{伊娜：}可是，你的收费这么贵，普通百姓负担不起吧？\n{神官：}如果每个普通百姓都能上去踩两脚，这碑还能屹立到今天吗？\n{伊娜：}呃……说得也是……\n{神官：}你也许不知道维护这个古老而巍峨的建筑有多少困难吧。我们每天都要检查，维修，清洗，护理，细致入微，这些工作全部是由我们家族完成的。我们还专门饲养了几只从亚利安尼亚引进的瓦里安火山鹫，它们灵巧而温驯，适合作为坐骑来维护“通天碑”的外壁——不像飞龙什么的过于庞大和粗鲁，不小心撞到了反而会带来损伤。可是这些家伙们可不是一般的娇贵，吃东西挑得很，光是一顿午餐的饲料钱，就要花上上千金币了。如果不是因为有这些投入，这座三千多年的古建筑怎么可能至今还如此稳固？\n{伊娜：}确实很辛苦啊，这么说来，付钱确实是应该的呢。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Priest:} Now that you understand our hard work, please pay if you want to visit.","{神官：}既然你明白了我们的辛苦，那么想参观就请付钱吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Priest:} Very good, you fully meet the requirements of being accepted by the gods. Then come and pray with me.\n{Ina:} Well, thank you Lord Priest. May the God of Glory bless this continent and people all over the world, peace, tranquility, happiness...\n{Official:} Ah, your state of mind is higher than mine. I only want to be the kingdom of Baland, but you do. For the whole continent, the whole world! very impressive. This is the prayer book of this church. Please accept it and continue praying for the whole world.","{神官：}很好，你完全符合被神明接受的条件。那么你也来和我一起祷告吧。\n{伊娜：}嗯，谢谢神官大人。愿光辉之神保佑这片大陆，保佑全世界的人们，和平，安宁，幸福……\n{神官：}啊，你的心境比我更高，我只想着为巴兰德王国，你却想着为全大陆，全世界！真了不起。这是本教堂的祈祷书，请你收下，为全世界继续祈福吧。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Promoter:} Are you interested in participating? There are mysterious gifts.\n{Ina:} What is the mysterious gift?\n{Promoter:} Of course, this cannot be revealed in advance. Of course this is just a small game, if you have something to be busy with, we won't force it.\n{Ina:} Let me think about it.","{宣传员：}几位有兴趣参加吗？有神秘礼物赠送哦。\n{伊娜：}神秘礼物是什么？\n{宣传员：}这个当然不能提前透露的啦。当然这只是个小游戏，如果各位有要事要忙的话我们也不会强求。\n{伊娜：}我考虑一下。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Promoter:} Welcome to participate in the award-winning interactive activities of Corberos Kindergarten. The participation fee is 2000 gold coins.","{宣传员：}欢迎参加科尔伯洛斯幼儿园的有奖互动活动。参加费用为2000金币。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Prophet:} You give me 2012 gold coins and I will tell you the truth.","{预言家：}你给我2012金币，我告诉你一个真相。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Queen:} About one squadron of the Demon Race is entrenched in {Black Rock Island}, under the command of a Demon General named {Galths}. My treasure \"Dragon Eye Ring\" was also taken away by them. I sent someone to reconnaissance and learned that they have stayed on Black Rock Island and haven't moved since they got the \"Dragon Eye Ring\".\n{Ina:} A squadron, not too much. When we fought against the demons in Trifia before, the opponent was far more than that.\n{Queen:} What is ashamed is that our military is too weak. Even a squadron is much better at fighting than us. We have been defeated repeatedly, and they have robbed a lot of resources. Wherever they go, the people's food and materials will become the target of their looting.\n{Ina:} It's really disgusting. We must teach them well.\n{Freeman:} But why did they stop moving after they got the \"Dragon Eye Ring\"?\n{Queen:} I don't know the reason, but the reconnaissance heard them say that they are planning to request more reinforcements from the Demon Clan headquarters.\n{Rael:} If they let their reinforcements arrive, it will be broken, so we can act quickly.\n{Freeman:} If it is just a squadron strength, it is really not to be afraid, but I just don't know the strength of that Gals.\n{Queen:} Judging from the situation we played against him, it seems that he does not use magic.\n{Ina:} That's easy. If I can't use magic, I will definitely have a way to deal with him.\n{Freeman:} So why don't we leave here, go to Black Rock Island to find Gals and his troops, rush to destroy them before the arrival of reinforcements, and regain the \"Dragon Eye Ring\".\n{Queen:} Go now? Don't you rest for a while?\n{Freeman:} It should not be too late, the longer it is, the more dangerous it will be. Her Majesty will show us the way to Black Rock Island, right?\n{Queen:} I will let the right envoy Kalidan go with you, he will know the way. Carridan, come in.\n{Karidan:} The minister is here. What is the order of Her Majesty the Queen?\n{Queen:} These warriors are going to Black Rock Island to destroy the demons. You can show them a way.\n{Karidan:} The minister takes the command. A few, please come with me, {from the back of the palace facing the north, go through a hole in the ground}, you can get there. I will go with you all the way.\n{Freeman:} Thank you, Lord Carridan.","{女王：}魔族大约有一个中队的兵力盘踞在{黑岩岛}，受到一个叫{加尔斯}的魔族将领的指挥。我的宝物“龙眼指环”也是被他们夺走的。我派人侦察得知，他们得到了“龙眼指环”之后，一直停留在黑岩岛上没有移动过。\n{伊娜：}一个中队，不算多吧。我们以前在特里菲亚跟魔族交手的时候，对方远不止这个数呢。\n{女王：}惭愧的是我国军力太过衰弱，即便只是一个中队也比我们善战得多，我们屡战屡败，还被他们抢走了很多资源。他们所到之处，老百姓的粮食和物资都会成为他们洗劫的目标。\n{伊娜：}真是太可恶了。我们一定要好好教训教训他们。\n{弗里曼：}不过，为什么他们得到“龙眼指环”之后，就不动了呢？\n{女王：}原因我也不清楚，不过侦察有听到他们说，正在计划向魔族本部请求更多的援军。\n{雷尔：}如果让他们的援军赶到就坏了，我们抓紧行动才好。\n{弗里曼：}如果仅仅是一个中队的兵力，倒确实是不足为惧，不过就是不知道那个加尔斯实力如何。\n{女王：}从我们跟他交手的情况来看，似乎他并不会使用魔法。\n{伊娜：}那就简单了，如果不会魔法，我肯定会有办法对付他的。\n{弗里曼：}那么不如我们这就动身，去黑岩岛寻找加尔斯和他的部队，赶在援军到来之前消灭他们，夺回“龙眼指环”。\n{女王：}现在就去吗？你们不休息一会儿？\n{弗里曼：}事不宜迟，越拖得久就多一分危险。女王陛下把去黑岩岛的路给我们指明一下吧？\n{女王：}我让殿前右使卡里丹和你们一同去吧，他会认识路的。卡里丹，你进来一下。\n{卡里丹：}臣在。女王陛下有何吩咐？\n{女王：}这几位勇士现在就要去黑岩岛消灭魔族，你给他们带个路吧。\n{卡里丹：}臣领命。几位请随我来，{从王宫后面向北边绕，经过一个地洞}之后，就可以到达那里。我跟你们一路同去。\n{弗里曼：}多谢卡里丹大人了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Radia:} Ina, don't come, don't come!\n{Ina:} What's wrong?\n{Ladia:} Archbishop Yingluck is not far to the west of you, don't come here, it's dangerous!\n{Ina:} But, Radya, are you there too? Are you okay?\n{Radia:} I will find a way to deal with him, you leave me alone.\n{Ina:} No, Radia is in danger, and I can't leave it alone.\n{Radia:} Don't come here!","{拉迪亚：}伊娜，不要过来了，别过来！\n{伊娜：}怎么了？\n{拉迪亚：}英拉大主教就在你的西面不远处，不要过来，危险！\n{伊娜：}可是，拉迪亚你也在那里吧？你不要紧吗？\n{拉迪亚：}我会想办法对付他的，你别管我。\n{伊娜：}不行啊，拉迪亚有危险我更不能不管了。\n{拉迪亚：}不要过来啊！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Radia:} Not much gossip, let's find a way to open the mechanism on this slate. \"Dragon Wing Robe\" is hidden behind the slate.\n{Ina:} How to open it, what are some strange patterns on this slate? Are they secret signs?\n{Radia:} I don't understand either. Only learned from Solo's men that Thor's helmet must be used to open this.\n{Ina:} But on this helmet, there is no clue at all.\n{Rael:} What exactly is painted on this slate? Some lines and dots. I don't understand what it means at all. Wait, you see, these lines seem to be inlaid with metal. Probably copper.\n{Freeman:} Ah, so to speak, isn't this a circuit board?\n{Ina:} What is a circuit board?\n{Freeman:} This is a common component in engineering. A series of circuits are engraved on a board, and the instrument can be operated after the power is turned on.\n{Ina:} It turned out to be engineering stuff. Fortunately, there is an expert Jack...\n{Freeman:} I can't call it an expert, but I learned a little while in school, and then I read some books by myself to understand a little bit about it. That's it.\n{Rael:} Then this circuit board, can the problem be solved by trying to make it work?\n{Freeman:} Well, now this circuit board is not fully completed, and there are still several open circuits that have not been connected. However, if you don't understand the internal structure of this mechanism, you can't judge how to wire it.\n{Ina:} Wait, wait, we still have one item that we haven't used yet. Since this Thor's helmet is necessary to open the mechanism, it must be used to complete the wiring, right?\n{Freeman:} But nothing can be seen on this helmet.\n{Ina:} Do you want to wear it? Come on, Jack, put on this.\n{Freeman:} Ouch, I'll do it myself, don't give me a trick, ah... it's reversed.\n{Ina:} Uh, I reversed the front and back, I'm sorry.\n{Rael:} Now I completely cover my face.\n{Freeman:} But, I saw something, the inner wall of this helmet seems to have some stripes.\n{Ina:} Huh? Isn't it?\n{Radia:} Take it down, I'll break it open.\n{Ina:} Ah, I tore off the helmet in one fell swoop...\n{Radia:} Okay, what's on the inner wall now, can you see clearly?\n{Freeman:} It seems to be a circuit diagram. Maybe it's the circuit on this slate.\n{Ina:} But how do I look at the shape completely different?\n{Freeman:} The circuit diagram does not need to be the same shape, as long as the topology is the same, it is the same circuit. Let me see... It's basically the same, but the circuit diagram on the helmet has a few more connections... Well, it seems that these are the parts we need to add.\n{Ina:} Jack is amazing...\n{Freeman:} This, this, um... almost... this, it's done.\n{Rael:} The slate moved. It looks like Ina is slapped again this time.\n{Ina:} What kind of crooked beating is right? People's sixth sense is very spiritual.\n{Rael:} Okay, okay, let's just make the sixth sense... the slate opened.\n{Radia:} You stand back and watch out for the organs!\n{Ina:} As a result, there are no hidden weapons or traps.\n{Radia:} We don't know, what if it happens. If you don't be careful all the time, you can easily die. I went in and out of Solo's territory, and if I were not always vigilant, a few lives would not be enough to pay.\n{Ina:} Yes, this should be written down, Radia's experience is also very helpful to us. ?a?aAh, this green robe...\n{Ladia:} This is the \"Dragon Wing Robe\". You take it away.","{拉迪亚：}闲话不多说了，我们来想办法把这个石板上的机关打开吧。“龙翼袍”就藏在石板的后面。\n{伊娜：}怎么打开呢，这石板上面一些奇怪的图纹又是什么，是暗号吗？\n{拉迪亚：}我也不懂。只是从索罗的手下那里得知，打开这个必须要用到雷神盔。\n{伊娜：}可是这个头盔上面，也完全看不出头绪耶。\n{雷尔：}这个石板上面画着的到底是什么呢？一些线和圆点。完全不明白是什么含义。等等，你们看，这些线，好像镶着金属。大概是铜吧。\n{弗里曼：}啊，这么说，这不是电路板吗？\n{伊娜：}电路板是什么东西啊？\n{弗里曼：}这是工程学里的常用部件。将一系列电路刻在一块板上，接通电源以后就能让仪器工作。\n{伊娜：}原来是工程学的东西啊，幸好有专家杰克在……\n{弗里曼：}专家称不上，只是在学校时学过一些，后来又自己读了些书，了解点皮毛而已。\n{雷尔：}那么这个电路板，是不是设法让其工作起来，问题就能解决了？\n{弗里曼：}嗯，现在这块电路板还没有完全完成，还有几处断路没有接上，但是，不了解这个机关的内部构造的话，无法判断应该怎么接线。\n{伊娜：}等等等等，我们还有一个道具没有使用呢。既然这个雷神盔是打开机关的必要之物，那么肯定要用得到这个才能完成接线吧？\n{弗里曼：}不过这个头盔上完全看不出什么啊。\n{伊娜：}莫非是要戴上？来，杰克你戴上这个。\n{弗里曼：}哎哟，我自己来，你别给我套，啊……反了。\n{伊娜：}呃，我把前后搞反了啊，对不起。\n{雷尔：}这下把脸完全遮住了。\n{弗里曼：}可是，我看到了一些东西，这个头盔的内壁，好像有什么条纹。\n{伊娜：}咦？不是吧。\n{拉迪亚：}拿下来，我来把它破开。\n{伊娜：}啊，一下就把头盔撕开了……\n{拉迪亚：}好了，这下内壁上有些什么，可以看清楚了吧？\n{弗里曼：}好像是个电路图呢。说不定就是这个石板上的电路。\n{伊娜：}可是我看着怎么形状完全不一样啊？\n{弗里曼：}电路图并不需要形状一样，只要拓扑一样就是一样的电路了。我看看……基本是一样的呢，只是头盔上的电路图多了几处接线……嗯，看来这几处就是我们要补接上的部分了。\n{伊娜：}杰克好厉害……\n{弗里曼：}这样，这样，嗯……差不多了……这样，完成。\n{雷尔：}石板动了。看起来这次伊娜又是歪打正着。\n{伊娜：}什么歪打正着啦，人家的第六感很灵的哦。\n{雷尔：}好吧好吧，姑且就算是第六感好了……石板打开来了。\n{拉迪亚：}你们退后，小心机关！\n\n{伊娜：}结果没有什么暗器或陷阱嘛。\n{拉迪亚：}我们又不知道，万一有怎么办呢。如果不时刻小心提防，很容易就送命了。我从索罗的地盘里进进出出，如果不是时刻保持警惕，几条命都不够赔的。\n{伊娜：}也是啊，这个要记下来，拉迪亚的经验对我们也很有帮助。——啊，这件绿袍……\n{拉迪亚：}这就是“龙翼袍”了。你们把它带走吧。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Radia:} The information returned from the \"Observing Eye\" should be able to reach the deep level of the altar from here.\n{Ina:} Although the road looks a bit difficult to walk, but there is no other way, let's go in.","{拉迪亚：}从“观察之眼”传回的情报，从这边进入应该可以到达祭坛的深层。\n{伊娜：}虽然路看上去有点不太好走，不过也没有别的办法了，我们进去吧。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Radia:} {Huangyan Island} is not far west here. \"Dragon Armor\" was placed in an enchantment on the island.\n{Ina:} Great, Rael, we will be able to gather the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" soon, and you can rejuvenate your country.\n{Rael:} Thank you, Ina.\n{Radia:} Don't be too happy first. I also said before that the barrier is very strong, and I don't think you have the ability to easily destroy it. Perhaps, in the end, it will be a lament that clearly sees the \"Dragon Armor\" close in front of him but can't get it.\n{Ina:} I haven't tried, how can I know that there is no way. Anyway, I will not give up hope. I will work hard.\n{Rael:} Ina is right. Our ability to get here is the result of everyone's perseverance all the time. No matter how difficult it is, I will never give up. From the time when I came to Mirronia alone, I have held this belief, and Ina made me firmer. General Gron and they must still be waiting for me, I will hold on to the last moment of defeating Solo.","{拉迪亚：}{黄岩岛}就在这边向西不远了。“龙甲”就被放在岛上的一个结界里。\n{伊娜：}太好了，雷尔，我们很快就可以凑齐“龙王神力”了，你就可以复兴你的国家了。\n{雷尔：}谢谢你，伊娜。\n{拉迪亚：}先别高兴得太早。之前我也说过了，那个结界很强，我并不认为你们有本事轻易地破坏它。也许，最后会是明明看到“龙甲”近在眼前却得不到的悲叹。\n{伊娜：}试都没试，怎么知道没有办法呢。不管怎么说，我不会放弃希望。我会努力的。\n{雷尔：}伊娜说得对。我们能够走到这里，都是大家一直以来坚持不懈的结果。不管多大的困难，我都不会放弃。从当初一个人来到米尔罗尼亚开始，我就抱着这样的信念，而伊娜让我更加坚定。格隆将军他们一定还在等着我，我会坚持到打败索罗的最后一刻。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} \"Dragon King Divine Power\" has a fierce reaction... Does it mean that we are already very close to the center of the altar?\n{Mengying:} That's right. \"Dragon King Divine Power\" can feel a huge magical power. The altar is pouring the last energy for the \"Sword of Destruction\".\n{Ina:} Why, I seem to feel a little uneasy...\n{Rael:} Are you seasick again?\n{Ina:} It doesn't seem to be, I can't tell you what it feels like, I have never felt...\n{Raier:} Don't be nervous, no matter what kind of danger you encounter, I will guard you.\n{Ina:} Thank you, Rael.","{雷尔：}“龙王神力”有激烈的反应……是不是说我们已经很接近祭坛的中心了？\n{梦影：}没错。“龙王神力”可以感觉到巨大的魔动力。祭坛在为“毁灭之剑”浇灌最后的能量。\n{伊娜：}为什么，我好像觉得有点不安……\n{雷尔：}你又晕船了吗？\n{伊娜：}好像不是，说不上来是什么感觉，从来没有过的……\n{雷尔：}别紧张，不管遇到什么样的危险，我会守护你的。\n{伊娜：}谢谢你，雷尔。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} After a day's rest, I can walk around freely, as if I had never been injured. That herb is amazing.\n{Ina:} Great. So is it possible to set off to find \"Dragon King Divine Power\"? To be honest, I haven't traveled far since I grew up, and I get excited when I think about it.\n{Rael:} Don't blame me for pouring you cold water. This is not a fun thing. There may be various dangers on the road. You still have time to retreat. I can already move around, so I can go alone.\n{Ina:} How does this work. Rael worked so hard and wanted to rejuvenate his country, even if I could help a little. We went to find the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" together, and it was so decided. Now go to the city to inquire about information.","{雷尔：}休息了一天，我已经完全可以自如走动了，就像没受过伤一样。那个草药真神奇。\n{伊娜：}太好了。那么是不是可以动身去找“龙王神力”了？说实话，我长这么大还没出过远门呢，一想到这事就兴奋。\n{雷尔：}可别怪我泼你冷水，这可不是件好玩的事情，路上也许会碰到各种各样的危险。你现在打退堂鼓还来得及。我已经能走动了，一个人去就可以了。\n{伊娜：}这怎么行。雷尔那么努力，一心想要复兴自己的国家，我就算是能帮上一点小忙也好。一起去找“龙王神力”，就这么决定了。现在就先去城市里打听打听情报吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Although Nanling Pass has been recovered, it has not yet completely lifted the threat from the Barland army. What are you going to do next, Ina?\n{Ina:} I delayed Rael's important business. I'm sorry, ooh... Then I should find a way to continue searching for clues to the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\". However, isn't this just the garden of truth where you can look up all kinds of knowledge, let me ask and have a look. ?a?aThat, Mr. Director, do you know where the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" is, or is there any relevant information here?\n{Director:} Sorry, I don't know what you are asking.\n{Ina:} Ah, even Mr. Director doesn't know...\n{Director:} But I know that a mysterious person might be able to help you answer this question. In {Horn Valley} lived a hermit named {Mengying} with vast magical powers, who knew everything from the past to the present. If you can find him, maybe you can get the answer.\n{Ina:} Take this note down. Okay, let's try to find him, thanks to the principal.","{雷尔：}虽然南岭关收复了，不过还没有完全解除巴兰德军的威胁。接下来你打算怎么办，伊娜？\n{伊娜：}我把雷尔的重要事情耽搁了，对不起，呜……接下来该想办法继续寻找“龙王神力”的线索。不过，这里不就是能查阅各种知识的真理之园嘛，我问一下看看。——那个，园长先生，请问您知道“龙王神力”在哪里吗，或者这里有没有相关的资料？\n{园长：}抱歉，我完全不清楚你问的东西是什么。\n{伊娜：}啊，连园长先生都不知道……\n{园长：}不过，我知道有个神秘的人也许能帮你解答这个问题。在{霍恩山谷}里居住着一位叫做{梦影}的神通广大的隐士，对古往今来的很多事情都了如指掌。如果你能找到他，也许能得到答案。\n{伊娜：}这个笔记下来。好吧，我们试试去找他，多谢园长。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Anyway, you are now embarrassed, so you have to be careful, if you encounter any enemy...\n{Ina:} I'll be careful.","{雷尔：}不管怎么说，你现在这副狼狈样，下面可得小心了，要是碰到什么敌人的话……\n{伊娜：}我会当心的啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Be careful, there are vampires!\n{Ina:} How could there be a vampire here, and who summoned it?\n{Rael:} Isn't it normal that vampires live in the tomb?\n{Ina:} Hey, is that right? Notes...\n{Rael:} Let's fight first, or you will be sucked up before you finish memorizing it.","{雷尔：}小心，有吸血鬼！\n{伊娜：}这里怎么会有吸血鬼，难道又是谁召唤出来的？\n{雷尔：}陵墓里住着吸血鬼不是很正常的事情吗？\n{伊娜：}咦，是这样啊？笔记笔记……\n{雷尔：}还是先应战吧，要不然没等你记完就要被吸干了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} By the way, Ina, have you ever fought a naval battle?\n{Ina:} No, is sea war different from land war?\n{Rael:} Wait for a fight against the pinates, it is likely to be a naval battle. Naval battles must be carried out by connecting the ship, {only boarding between ships can be done} {passing}. In addition, if one party fails, his {boat will sink}.\n{Ina:} So, let me take notes first. Only a plank can pass, which means that there is no land to open it, so maybe it can be used.","{雷尔：}对了，伊娜，你打过海战吗？\n{伊娜：}没有耶，海战与陆地战不一样吗？\n{雷尔：}等下跟海盗交手，很可能是海战。海战要通过接舷的方式进行，{船与船之间只有搭板可以}\n{通行}。另外，如果一方失败了，他所乘的{船会沉没}。\n{伊娜：}这样啊，我先笔记下来。只有搭板可以通行，就是说远没有陆地来得开阔了，这样也许可以利用一下呢。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Here again, be careful everyone!\n{Ina:} More this time...","{雷尔：}又来了，大家小心！\n{伊娜：}这次的更多啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} How about using this piece of wood? My leg is completely healed and I don't need it anymore.\n{Robert:} This length is just right, thanks a lot.\n{Ina:} Great, now the road can be smooth again.","{雷尔：}用这根木头如何？我腿已经完全好了，不需要它了。\n{罗伯特：}这个长度正合适，多谢了。\n{伊娜：}太好了，这下道路又可以畅通啦。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} How did things happen like this... Solo escaped, and Ina is now like this... Ina, you don't really want to kill me, do you?\n{Ina:} Glory saints, obliterate... Ina shot waves of attack magic on Rael, Rael tried his best to evade, but was still wiped occasionally.\n{Rael:} I believe it is definitely not your true intention, Ina, wake up...\n{Mengying:} Rael, if you don't fight back, she will kill you!\n{Rael:} How could it be possible for me to fight back and shoot to Ina...\n{Mengying:} If you are killed, everything will be over, and the previous efforts to gather the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" will be all in vain. Although Solo has unblocked the \"Sword of Destruction\", you who possess the \"Glory Blood\" and the power of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" may still have a glimmer of hope against Solo...\n{Rael:} You want Persuade me to kill Ina?\n{Mengying:} Otherwise, what else can you do? Let her kill you? What's more, you can't beat her at all in your current state, you must use \"Glory Blood\".\n{Rael:} But, the current Ina was only manipulated for a while, she couldn't really want to kill me...\n{Mengying:} Indeed, she is in a violent state now, but she was made by Solo Gorefiend, this is undeniable, right? Even if she returns to her normal state, can she still be your companion as before?\n{Rael:} I believe Ina, I want to save her.\n{Freeman:} I also believe in Ina. We should try every means to save her. Since it is a violent state, can it be relieved by healing or dispelling it?\n{Mengying:} I tried it a long time ago, but it doesn't work. There seems to be something in her body that can keep the frenzy, but I tried to use the sky-viewing magic and still couldn't see it.\n{Freeman:} Can’t you even see the sky...\n{Mengying:} It may be that the thing is too small, so it is difficult to find it. If the effect of watching the sky can be enlarged, it would be great...\n{Freeman:} Then Can this be used? Refractor telescope.\n{Mengying:} Through physical equipment, why didn't I expect it, give it to me, let me try.\n{Freeman:} Where's Rael? How are you?\n{Rael:} I will delay as much as possible, and you will find the method quickly...\n{Mengying:} It turned out to be the \"Seal of Destruction\"! What Solo used to hit Ina with the \"Sword of Destruction\" just now... \"The Seal of Destruction\" can manipulate the \"Dark Blood\" to get it out of control and become a violent state. Point the telescope at Ina, I shine it up with magic, Rael, you can see it too, on Ina's chest.\n{Rael:} I see, if you destroy that, Ina can recover...\n{Dream Shadow:} But it is not easy to destroy the \"Seal of Destruction\". The current Ina has both magical power and speed. Unusually strong, there is simply no flaw... If you want to hit such a precise target, unless you can let her reveal the flaw...\n{Rael:} Now that I know the method, I'll give it to me now, Radiant Blood, Awaken! Rael's eyes turned bright blue. He raised his sword and set his posture. But Ina's magic came over.\n{Freeman:} Rael be careful!\n{Mengying:} Do you want to take Ina's magic deliberately if you stay still and do not hide?\n{Rael:} If you want Ina to show her flaws, the best time is when she makes a move. I want to see her moves to find the flaws in that moment, and then meet her moves with a sword. As long as there is a slight deviation, Ina and I will die. But I will not allow this deviation to happen. I still have a mission to complete. General Gron is still waiting for me to go back. How can I die here?\n{Mengying:} In order to see the flaws clearly, I don’t hesitate to suffer so much damage...\n{Rael:} Here comes! Holy Light Heaven Sword!","{雷尔：}事情怎么会弄成这样……索罗逃掉了，伊娜现在成了这样……伊娜，你不会真的想杀我吧？\n{伊娜：}光辉圣族，抹杀……\n\n伊娜向雷尔打出一波接一波的攻击魔法，雷尔极力闪避，但还是间或被擦到。\n\n{雷尔：}我相信现在绝不是你的真实意愿，伊娜，醒来啊……\n{梦影：}雷尔，你再不还手的话，她会杀了你！\n{雷尔：}要我还手，向伊娜出手，怎么可能……\n{梦影：}如果你被杀了，什么都完了，之前集齐“龙王神力”的努力，也就全部白费了。虽然索罗已经解封了“毁灭之剑”，但是拥有“光辉之血”的你，加上“龙王神力”的力量，对抗索罗也许还有一线希望……\n{雷尔：}你是想劝我杀了伊娜吗？\n{梦影：}否则你还能怎么办？让她杀了你吗？何况，你现在的状态根本赢不了她，你必须使用“光辉之血”。\n{雷尔：}可是，现在的伊娜只是一时被操控了而已，她不可能真的想杀我的……\n{梦影：}的确，现在她处于狂暴状态，但是她是索罗所制造出来的血魔，这一点已经无可否认了吧？就算是恢复到普通状态，她还能像以前一样成为你的同伴吗？\n{雷尔：}我相信伊娜，我要救她。\n{弗里曼：}我也相信伊娜。我们应该想一切办法救她。既然是狂暴状态，是不是能用治疗或驱散来解除呢？\n{梦影：}我早就试过了，不行。她身上好像有什么东西能使狂暴一直维持着，可是我尝试了使用观天魔法仍然看不见。\n{弗里曼：}连观天都看不见吗……\n{梦影：}可能是那个东西太细小了，所以难以发现，如果观天效果能放大就好了……\n{弗里曼：}那么这个能不能用？折射式望远镜。\n{梦影：}透过物理仪器吗，我怎么没想到呢，给我，我试试。\n{弗里曼：}雷尔呢？你怎么样？\n{雷尔：}我尽可能地拖延，你们快把方法找出来……\n{梦影：}原来是“毁灭之印”！刚才索罗用“毁灭之剑”打向伊娜的东西……“毁灭之印”能操纵“暗黑之血”使之失控而成为狂暴状态。把望远镜对着伊娜，我用魔法照射上去，雷尔，你也能也看到了吧，在伊娜的胸口。\n{雷尔：}看到了，把那个破坏掉的话，伊娜就能恢复了吧……\n{梦影：}但是想破坏“毁灭之印”也并非容易，现在的伊娜不论是魔力还是速度都异常的强，简直是没有破绽……想要击中那么精确的目标，除非能让她露出破绽……\n{雷尔：}既然知道了方法，下面就交给我了，光辉之血，觉醒！\n\n雷尔的眼睛变成亮蓝色。他举起剑，摆好了架势。但是伊娜的魔法打了过来。\n\n{弗里曼：}雷尔小心！\n{梦影：}原地不动也不躲，难道是故意要承受伊娜的魔法吗？\n{雷尔：}如果想要伊娜露出破绽，最好的时机只有她出招的时候。我要看清她的出招来寻找那一瞬间的破绽，然后迎着她的招式出剑。只要有一点偏差，我和伊娜都会丧命。不过我不会允许这种偏差发生。我还有任务没完成，格隆将军还在等着我回去，我怎么能死在这里呢。\n{梦影：}为了看清破绽，不惜承受那么大的伤害……\n{雷尔：}来了！圣光天霄剑！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} How is Ina's situation now?\n{Ina:} I don't know, it's still uncomfortable. Haven't found the Sea Dragon King in so long?\n{Rael:} We are just about to ask you.\n{Ina:} Hey, I don't know where it is.\n{Rael:} I came out looking for it if I didn't know?\n{Freeman:} I asked the villagers in Silan Village, and it seems that they don’t know where the Sea Dragon King lives. I thought Ina had already asked.\n{Ina:} I just guess it should not be too far away. Look for it again, there will be a way.","{雷尔：}伊娜现在情况怎么样？\n{伊娜：}不知道，还是不太舒服。这么久还没找到海龙王在哪吗？\n{雷尔：}我们正要问你呢。\n{伊娜：}咦，我不知道在哪里啊。\n{雷尔：}不知道就出来找了？\n{弗里曼：}我问过史兰村的村民，似乎他们也不知道海龙王的居所。我还以为伊娜已经问到了呢。\n{伊娜：}我只是估计应该不会太远的。再找找吧，会有办法的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I actually won, and Ina is still smart.\n{Ina:} Ahahaha, I'm a little embarrassed to say...\n{Freeman:} finally, their own facilities tripped their hands and feet, and they were completely manipulated by Ina. Not only that, but the calculation of the distance is also quite good. Accurate...\n{Ina:} Hey, running is my best project.","{雷尔：}居然赢了，果然还是伊娜聪明啊。\n{伊娜：}啊哈哈哈，被说得有点不好意思……\n{弗里曼：}最后他们自己造的设施绊了自己的手脚，完全被伊娜玩弄了，不仅如此，路程的计算也相当精确……\n{伊娜：}嘿嘿，跑路是我最擅长的项目嘛。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I didn't expect to get news of the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" here...\n{Ina:} So I'm going to beat him even more. Can't let his conspinacy succeed.","{雷尔：}没想到在这里还能得到“龙牙冠”的消息……\n{伊娜：}所以更要打倒他了。不能让他的阴谋得逞。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I said Ina, why did you accidentally tell him that we have a \"longan ring\"? You've always been very smart, so why are you confused now...\n{Ina:} Hey, I leaked it to him on purpose.\n{Rael:} deliberately? You just said that you were not careful...\n{Ina:} Pretend to be careless so that he can believe it.\n{Rael:} Do you have any other bad ideas?\n{Ina:} He accidentally said that he has a secret base. Now his magic is much faster than mine. I have no chance of winning at all, but if we can {occupy his base}, we can {transport forces through the return to the city magic} and we won't be afraid of him.\n{Rael:} You already know the location of their base?\n{Ina:} I don't know.\n{Freeman:} Understood, now there is no chance of winning a head-on confrontation with that Baltz, and it will be even more difficult to get him back to his base. Therefore, Ina intends to use her strengths of running fast, first lead the Baltz to a farther place, and then be able to smoothly implement the plan.\n{Ina:} Hey, Jack is so good, he has already thought so well. Actually, I didn't think so far. I will think about it later, taking a step and looking at it. I didn't expect that Jack had already considered it all...\n{Raier:} Phew... You two really cooperated well.\n{Ina:} Then it's decided. Let's start implementing the first step of the plan. Let the demons named Bartz {race} {run} with us.","{雷尔：}我说伊娜，你怎么不小心把我们有“龙眼戒”说给他听啦？你一向很聪明的，这时怎么犯糊涂了……\n{伊娜：}嘿嘿，我是故意漏给他的啦。\n{雷尔：}故意？你刚才明明是说不小心……\n{伊娜：}要装得像是不小心，好让他相信嘛。\n{雷尔：}你莫非又有什么鬼主意了？\n{伊娜：}是他先不小心说出来他有个秘密基地的啊。现在这边他的魔法比我快多了，我根本没胜算，但是如果能{把他的基地占到手}，我们就可以{通过回城魔法输送兵力}过来，就不怕他了啊。\n{雷尔：}你已经知道他们的基地的位置了？\n{伊娜：}不知道。\n{弗里曼：}明白了，现在跟那个巴尔茨正面交锋没有胜算，而如果让他回到自己的基地就更难了。所以，伊娜打算用自己跑得快的长处，先引开那个巴尔茨到远一点的地方，然后就能顺利地实施计划了。\n{伊娜：}咦，杰克好厉害，已经想得这么周全了。其实我没想那么远啦，后面的打算后面再想，走一步看一步，没想到杰克已经全盘考虑好了……\n{雷尔：}呼……你们两个还真是配合得好。\n{伊娜：}那么决定了，下面就开始实施计划的第一步，先让那个叫巴尔茨的魔族跟我们{赛}\n{跑}吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I said, there will be no results for your questioning, right?\n{Ina:} Also, alas, I'm so stupid.\n{Freeman:} There is a tavern in front, so it's better to take a rest and sort out the information.\n{Ina:} Good too. Hey, that's not... (+_+ eyes gleaming) Mr. Bad Guy!\n{Dawu:} Huh? Stupid girl, are you here too? What kind of business is there for this lord to do this time?\n{Ina:} Mirronia is the first person to be informed, eyes, ears, omniscience, omniscience, omniscience, I know you will ask the right person. 3000 gold coins are given to you first.\n{Dawu:} It's getting more and more refreshing. So what do you want to ask this time, just say it.\n{Ina:} I want to ask, where is Aris' helmet.\n{Dawu:} This, I don't know.\n{Ina:} Hello! How can you do this, I gave all the money, come back!\n{Da Wu:} But this lord is not omnipotent, and there is nothing he can do if he doesn't know.\n{Ina:} You at least pay me back. Why are you embarrassed to take the money without providing me with information?\n{Da Wu:} You gave it first this time, and it wasn't what this lord asked for.\n{Ina:} Badass! I won't believe you anymore!\n{Da Wu:} Alright, alright, for the sake of these 3,000 gold coins, although I don't know where the thing is, but I can give you some clues. It's somewhat worthwhile. Listen carefully.","{雷尔：}我说，你这种问法，不会有结果吧？\n{伊娜：}也是，唉，我好笨。\n{弗里曼：}前面有个酒馆，不如先去休息下，整理整理情报。\n{伊娜：}也好。咦，那位不是……（+_+ 两眼放光状）坏人先生！\n{达伍：}咦？笨小丫头，你也上这儿来啦？这次又有什么生意让本大人做啊？\n{伊娜：}米尔罗尼亚第一消息灵通眼明耳快无所不知无所不晓的达伍大人，我知道问你就问对人了。3000金币先给你。\n{达伍：}越来越爽快了。那么这次你想问什么，就说吧。\n{伊娜：}我想问，亚里斯的头盔，在什么地方。\n{达伍：}这个啊，本大人不知道。\n{伊娜：}喂！你怎么能这样，我钱都给了耶，还来！\n{达伍：}可是本大人也不是万能的，不知道也没办法。\n{伊娜：}你至少把钱还我啊，没向我提供信息你怎么好意思拿钱？\n{达伍：}这次是你先给的，又不是本大人讨的。\n{伊娜：}坏蛋！以后再不相信你了！\n{达伍：}好啦好啦，念在这3000金币的份上，虽然本大人不知道那东西在哪里，不过，却能给你提供一些线索。多少还是有点价值的。你听好了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I see it! Is that Solo?\n{Freeman:} It has become so huge...\n{Ina:} Solo! Stop it, what are you doing? Burning the surroundings to ashes...\n{Solo:} Aw~~~~~~~~~~~~~!\n{Ina:} Did you hear what I said?\n{Freeman:} Don't you want to achieve hegemony? Where can the hegemony come from if everything is burned out?\n{Solo:} Aw~~~~~~~~~~~~~!\n{Rael:} He seems to be totally incapable of hearing, and he has become a lunatic...\n{Mengying:} It seems that he has been demonized...\n{Ina:} Demonized? What does this mean?\n{Mengying:} Because he was unable to control the \"Sword of Destruction\", after a long time of use, the devilish energy of the sword had eroded all of him, causing him to lose control. He has completely lost himself, only knows about destruction, and knows nothing else.\n{Ina:} The \"Sword of Destruction\" is terrible...\n{Rael:} It's a sword as its name suggests.\n{Ina:} Now {even at all costs}, we have to stop him. Whether it's the original Solo or the demonized Solo, in short, he is what we want to defeat, I'm here to guitar.","{雷尔：}看到了！那个是索罗？\n{弗里曼：}变得好巨大……\n{伊娜：}索罗！你住手啊，你在干什么？把周围都烧成灰了……\n{索罗：}嗷~~~~~~~~~~~~~！\n{伊娜：}你有没有听到我说的啊？\n{弗里曼：}你不是要成就霸业吗？把一切都烧光了还哪来的霸业？\n{索罗：}嗷~~~~~~~~~~~~~！\n{雷尔：}他好像完全听不到，整个成了一疯子……\n{梦影：}看起来，他已经被魔化了……\n{伊娜：}魔化了？这是指？\n{梦影：}由于他没有能力驾驭“毁灭之剑”，过长时间使用之后，剑的魔气已经侵蚀了他的全部，使他变得失控。他已经完全丧失了自我，只知道破坏，其他什么都不知道。\n{伊娜：}“毁灭之剑”真可怕……\n{雷尔：}真是剑如其名。\n{伊娜：}现在{就算不惜一切代价}，我们也要阻止他。不管是原来的索罗也好，魔化的索罗也好，总之他是我们要打倒的，我来了结他。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I'm afraid it's not very good for us to break like this. In this way, the people of Terracia might really think that we are bad guys.\n{Ina:} So, do you want to be arrested for interrogation for a month?\n{Rael:} Of course I don't want this...\n{Freeman:} I don't think Mr. Rael needs to worry either. This area is the center of Terracia. Naturally, the search is stricter. It doesn't matter if you go to a slightly remote place. We can avoid {west} first.","{雷尔：}我们这样闯，恐怕也不太好吧。这样泰拉西亚的人可能真会以为我们是坏人了。\n{伊娜：}那么，你想被抓起来去审讯个把月吗？\n{雷尔：}这个当然不想……\n{弗里曼：}我觉得雷尔先生也不必担心，这一带是泰拉西亚的中心地带，自然搜查比较严格，到了稍偏远一些的地方就不要紧了。我们可以先向{西面}避一避。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} I'm afraid we will meet with Archbishop Yingluck soon. What do you want to do with him, Ina?\n{Ina:} I wanted to defeat him, but now it seems impossible.\n{Freeman:} Since she knew that it was impossible to defeat him, she continued to insist on going in and destroying the \"Spirit Gathering Pagoda\". In other words, Ina had already thought of other ways to deal with Archbishop Yingluck?\n{Ina:} Is it okay to rush over with my fastest feet?\n{Rael:} I don't see this trick. We are totally unfamiliar with the terrain here, but Archbishop Yingluck must know everything well. He can take shortcuts where we want to go around. We are too passive.\n{Ina:} In fact, I have a little idea. For example, if there is any way to {seduce and trap him} and let him {there is no way to attack me}, we can sneak in smoothly. However, if you want to do this, you have to {use your brain}.","{雷尔：}恐怕我们很快就要跟英拉大主教碰面了，你想怎么对付他，伊娜？\n{伊娜：}本来想打倒他的，不过现在看起来似乎不可能耶。\n{弗里曼：}既然明知不可能打倒他，还继续坚持要进去破坏“聚灵塔”，就是说，伊娜已经想到了其他办法对付英拉大主教了？\n{伊娜：}用我最快的脚力一口气冲过去行不行？\n{雷尔：}我看这招没戏，这里的地形我们完全不熟悉，但英拉大主教一定了如指掌，我们要兜圈的地方他能抄近道，我们太被动了。\n{伊娜：}其实我是有一点想法，比如说，如果有什么办法能够{引诱并且困住他}，让他{没有办法攻击到我}的话，我们就可以顺利地潜入了。不过，要想做到这一点，还得{好好动动脑筋}才行。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Ina, are you really planning to go to the continent of Ariania with me? It's not fun at all there. There is a fierce demon waiting for me.\n{Ina:} People are not going to play. The so-called help to the end is to send the Buddha to the west. Since I promised to help Rael rejuvenate the country, of course I must help until I defeat the demon. After so many battles, I have become very strong, and I will never pull Rael's hind legs.","{雷尔：}伊娜，你真的打算跟我一起去亚利安尼亚大陆吗？那里可一点都不好玩哦。有个凶恶的魔头在等着我呢。\n{伊娜：}人家才不是去玩的呢。所谓帮忙帮到底，送佛送到西嘛。既然我答应了要帮雷尔复兴国家，当然要帮到打败那个魔头为止。经过了这么多战斗的磨练，我已经变得很强了哦，绝不会扯雷尔的后腿的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Ina, are you sure you are heading in this direction?\n{Ina:} Not sure, but I have a feeling that I should go this way.\n{Rael:} Another feeling, is this reliable?\n{Freeman:} I also think I should go this way.\n{Ina:} Jack, do you feel the same as me? But the girl's intuition, shouldn't you?\n{Freeman:} There are footprints on the snow. This should be left by the demons who sneaked into Snow Mountain Island.\n{Ina:} So that's it!\n{Rael:} As a result, you hit and hit by mistake again.\n{Ina:} This is intuition, intuition, anyway, is it right? Let's go, let's go.","{雷尔：}伊娜，你确定是往这个方向吗？\n{伊娜：}不确定，不过我有一种感觉，该往这边走。\n{雷尔：}又是感觉，这个靠得住吗？\n{弗里曼：}我也觉得该往这边走。\n{伊娜：}杰克，你也有跟我一样的感觉吗？可是女孩子的直觉，你应该没有吧？\n{弗里曼：}雪地上有脚印啊。这应该是潜入到雪山岛的那个魔族所留下的。\n{伊娜：}原来是这样！\n{雷尔：}结果你又是误打误撞撞对了。\n{伊娜：}这是直觉啦直觉，反正是对了不是，走，我们出发啦。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Ina, your face has become so ugly.\n{Ina:} The waves are so big, I'm seasick again. (>?×<)\n{Rael:} How do you deal with the Sea Dragon King now?\n{Ina:} It's not here yet, let me get used to it, it might be better if I get used to it for a while...","{雷尔：}伊娜，你脸色变得那么难看。\n{伊娜：}浪好大，我又晕船了啦。(>∽<)\n{雷尔：}这下你还怎么去对付海龙王？\n{伊娜：}还没到呢，让我适应一下，再适应一段时间可能就会好点了……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Is this the \"Longan Ring\"?\n{Ina:} It seems not...","{雷尔：}这个就是“龙眼指环”吗？\n{伊娜：}好像不是啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} It looks like Ina has already inquired about the intelligence?\n{Ina:} Not exactly. But at least there is a direction. In addition, we can be sure that our activities around here will not be too dangerous. Next is going to {west} to find {Chief Security Officer}, it is said that he will know some information we need. Let's go, let's go now.","{雷尔：}看起来伊娜已经打听到情报了？\n{伊娜：}准确地说还没有。不过至少有方向了。另外也可以确信我们在这里附近活动不会有什么太大的危险。下面就是要去{西边}找{安防长}了，据说他会知道一些我们需要的情报。走吧，我们这就出发。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} It looks like the storm is getting stronger ahead, everyone, be careful.","{雷尔：}看起来前面风浪大起来了，大家小心。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} It's finally balanced, and it looks like the storm has passed.\n{Ina:} Well, I'm seasick...(>_<)\n{Rael:} You are still seasick, why didn't you say it earlier.\n{Ina:} I don't know. This is the first time in my life on a boat. It didn't matter before, but the shaking was too strong just now, and the body became uncomfortable.","{雷尔：}总算平衡一点了，看起来风浪过去了。\n{伊娜：}唔，我晕船啦……(>_<)\n{雷尔：}你还晕船啊，你怎么不早说。\n{伊娜：}我不知道嘛，这是我这辈子第一次坐船呢。之前还不要紧，可是刚才一阵晃动太厉害了，身体就不舒服了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} It's time to enter the stormy zone, everyone be careful.","{雷尔：}要进入风浪区了，大家小心。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Jack, since you are an officer, why didn't you bring an army?\n{Jack:} If I had an army, I wouldn't have to worry so much. I have no military power at all. Maybe I shouldn't have slipped out alone, but I heard that the frontline war was tight, and I always wanted to do something.\n{Rael:} Aha? How does this tone resemble Ina. It's enough to have a bold daredevil Ina, now there is another bold daredevil Jack...\n{Ina:} Hey! Rael, I don't want to speak ill of others like that.\n{Jack:} I came here prepared. Although there are no soldiers, I have brought a book about summoning, and I intend to use it to defend myself. This book records a lot of powerful summoning magic, which can summon various creatures to help fight.\n{Rael:} Then why were you caught by the Barland army just now?\n{Jack:} Actually, when I met them, I wanted to use summoning to deal with them, but when I opened the book, I found out that I had never learned magic before, so the above summoning technique could not be used. ?a?aBy the way, Ina seems to know magic.\n{Ina:} My goal is to be a great magician-but I haven't learned it for a long time now...\n{Jack:} It's better to give this book to you, I hope it can help you a little bit.\n{Ina:} Huh? Really can? Thank you so much. (Flips the book) But it seems that there are a lot of things deep in it...\n{Rael:} It didn't take long for you to learn magic, so don't think of eating fat in one go. Take your time, you can start with simple practice. In this way, you don't have to fight alone in the future, just let the summoned creatures fight, and you can just put magic behind it, which is much safer.","{雷尔：}杰克，你既然是军官，为什么没有带军队呢？\n{杰克：}我要是有军队，就不用这么愁了。我是一点兵权都没有。本来也许我不该独自溜出来，不过听闻前线战事吃紧，总想能做点什么才好。\n{雷尔：}啊哈？这口气怎么跟伊娜挺像。有一个大胆冒失鬼伊娜已经够呛了，现在又来一个大胆冒失鬼杰克……\n{伊娜：}喂！雷尔，不兴这样说人家坏话的。\n{杰克：}我可是有备而来的。虽然没有兵，不过我带了一本召唤术的书，打算用这东西来防身的。这书记载了很多强大的召唤魔法，可以召唤各种生物来帮忙作战。\n{雷尔：}那么刚才你怎么又被巴兰德军抓了呢？\n{杰克：}其实，我遇到他们时是想用召唤来对付他们，但翻开书我才发现，我从来没学过魔法，那上面的召唤术用不出来。——对了，伊娜好像会魔法吧。\n{伊娜：}我的目标是当一个了不起的魔法师——不过现在我也是才学了没多久……\n{杰克：}这本书不如就送给你吧，希望能对你有点帮助。\n{伊娜：}啊？真的可以吗？太感谢了。（翻书）不过好像其中有很多东西很深啊……\n{雷尔：}你也才学魔法没多久，别想一口气吃成胖子啦。慢慢来，可以先从简单的练起。这样以后你就可以不用单打独斗了，让召唤出来的生物去战斗就可以了，你只管在后面放魔法，这样安全得多。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Leave it to me here, first put these cards everywhere in this area. Ina, go to the beach.\n{Ina:} Good. Rael, be careful.\n{Rael:} My task is much easier than you. You have to face the enemy's leader alone, so you have to be more careful.\n{Ina:} I will work hard.","{雷尔：}这边就交给我了，先把这些卡片在这一带到处贴上。伊娜你就往海边去吧。\n{伊娜：}好。雷尔你小心。\n{雷尔：}我的任务比你轻松多了，你要单独面对敌人的首领，你才是要加倍小心才是。\n{伊娜：}我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Let me add, if Archbishop Yingluck wants to be his own king, will the people approve it?\n{Freeman:} Of course not. But maybe he will come up with some conspinacy to make his coup seem reasonable.\n{Rael:} If by law, now you are wanted and run away, should your brother succeed him?\n{Freeman:} Yes, so the prince is the only candidate left, and my brother should inherit the throne. If his elder brother succeeds safely, he should find a way to prevent Archbishop Yingluck from messing up the country. However, now I am more worried about my brother's safety. I'm afraid that Archbishop Yingluck hit his brother's idea.","{雷尔：}我插一句，如果英拉大主教想自己做国王，国民会赞成吗？\n{弗里曼：}当然不会了。但是也许他又会想出什么阴谋来让自己的政变看上去合情合理呢。\n{雷尔：}如果按法律，现在你被通缉了又逃走了，那么是不是应该你哥哥继位？\n{弗里曼：}是啊，这样王子只剩唯一的人选，哥哥应该继承王位。如果哥哥平安继位倒也好了，他应该想办法阻止英拉大主教把国家搞得这么乱。不过，现在我更担心哥哥的安危。就怕英拉大主教打哥哥的主意。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Let me talk about it. This place was where the Warriors Cherry Flander defeated Phoenix Phoenix and sealed it 99 years ago. The ice barrier around here is used to seal the phoenix. As long as it is frozen for 100 years, the Phoenix will lose its magic power. The elder and his people, their ancestors were entrusted by Cherry Flander to guard this place, in order to keep this enchantment undamaged for 100 years. When Cherry Flanders fought against the Phoenix, it was the \"dragon king supernatural power\" that was worn. While the final blow knocked down the Phoenix, Cherry Flander was also hit on the head by the magic of the Phoenix. The protection of \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" did not suffer much damage. But this blow knocked down the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\". Cherry Flander ignored the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" and was anxious to seal the Phoenix with the barrier, so the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" was also sealed in the barrier. That’s why we found it here. \"Fire Spirit Orb\" is the only way to destroy the enchantment. That's why the Demon Race intends to use the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" to open the barrier. But if the barrier is opened now, the phoenix will be resurrected, and it will endanger the world. We didn't know this before. We simply thought that the \"Fire Spirit Orb\" was just a tool to open the mechanism, but we didn't expect the Demon Race to have other intentions. While I was waiting for you here, I met the elder and his people, and they told me this. They learned that I wanted to find the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" and were willing to help. The \"Dragon Tooth Crown\" was only sealed together in the enchantment. Although the specific location is unknown, it is still possible to take it out without breaking the enchantment. The elders have the magic to shuttle through the enchantment. Because I was anxious to see the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\", I came in with them, but left a member of the clan to inform you at the door. Unexpectedly, he was conspired. Soon after we came in, we found that the barrier was broken, so we hurried to the entrance and met you here.","{雷尔：}还是我来说吧。\n\n这个地方，是99年前勇士切里弗兰德打败不死鸟菲尼克斯并将其封印的地方。这里四周的寒冰结界就是用来封住不死鸟的。只要将其冰封满100年，不死鸟就会丧失魔力。这位长老和他的族人，他们的先祖受到切里弗兰德的委托看守这里，为了让这结界100年不受破坏。\n\n当年切里弗兰德与不死鸟交战时，正是穿的“龙王神力”，最后一击将不死鸟击倒的同时，切里弗兰德也被不死鸟的魔法击中头部，由于“龙王神力”的保护，才没有受到很大的伤害。但是这一击把“龙牙冠”击落了。切里弗兰德顾不得“龙牙冠”，急着用结界将不死鸟封印，因此“龙牙冠”也就一起被封在了结界中。所以我们才会找到这里。\n\n“火灵珠”是破坏结界的唯一方法。所以魔族才打算用“火灵珠”来打开结界。但是如果现在打开结界，不死鸟就会复活，又会危害人间。我们原先并不知道这些，单纯地以为“火灵珠”只是打开机关的工具，却没有想到魔族还有别的意图。\n\n我在这里等你们的时候，碰到了长老和他的族人们，他们告诉了我这些。他们得知我想要寻找“龙牙冠”，愿意提供帮助。“龙牙冠”仅仅是被一起封在了结界中而已，虽然不知道具体方位，但还是有可能在不打破结界的前提下将其取出的。长老有穿梭结界的法术，我由于急着想见到“龙牙冠”，就跟他们一起进来了，只是留了一个族人在门口通知你们。没有想到的是，他遭到了暗算。\n\n我们进来之后不久，就发现结界被打破了，赶紧向入口这边赶来，然后就在这里遇到了你们。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Look, there is a group of people running towards us...\n{Ina:} Ah, those people are...\n{Man A:} No, there is an army ahead, we are dead...\n{ Man B:} I can only fight, it's all dead anyway...\n{Man C:} Wait, look, their banners and clothes are different from those chasing us, maybe not in the same group.\n{Man A:} There is no way, although I don't know who they are, try to ask for help.\n{Ina:} What are you guys? ...\n{Man A:} Someone wants to kill us, and they have already chased us. Can you save us?\n{Ina:} Who is going to kill you?\n{Man A:} It's already here!\n{Chasing soldiers:} Kill! Don't let them go, leave them alone!\n{Ina:} Hey, who are you, why are you killing them, they don't have weapons...\n{Chaser:} Who are you? If you get in the way, even kill you!\n{Ina:} You slaughter people without weapons, how can I not care. Come on if you want to do it. I will ask more details later. All I know now is to help the weaker.","{雷尔：}看，前面有一群人在向我们跑来……\n{伊娜：}啊，那些人是……\n\n{男子A：}不好了，前面也有军队，我们死定了……\n{男子B：}只能拼了吗，反正都是死……\n{男子C：}等等，你们看，他们的旗号和衣服，跟追我们的那些家伙不一样，也许不是一伙的。\n{男子A：}没办法了，虽然不知道他们是谁，试试求救吧。\n\n{伊娜：}请问你们是？……\n{男子A：}有人要杀我们，已经追来了，能救救我们吗？\n{伊娜：}是谁要杀你们？\n{男子A：}已经来了！\n{追兵：}杀！不要放过他们，一个不留！\n{伊娜：}喂，你们是谁，为什么要杀他们啊，他们又没武器……\n{追兵：}你又是谁？你管不着，碍事的话连你也杀！\n{伊娜：}你们屠杀没有武器的人，我怎么管不着。要动手就来吧，详细的事情我等会再问，现在我所知道的就是帮助弱的一方。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Look, this is {Magic House}. A place where you can learn magic.\n{Ina:} It turns out that you have to learn magic in such a place.\n{Rael:} It's not just such a place. If {Magic Guild} is open in the city, you can also learn it. In addition, in addition to the magic itself, there are 4 types of {magic auxiliary skills} of wind, fire, water and soil, which also greatly help the effect of magic.\n{Ina:} Quickly take the little Ina universal notebook and copy it down. Now I can learn magic, so I don't have to worry about monsters or Balandian troops.\n{Rael:} Not enough, only one magic \"lightning\" can be learned here, and there are dozens of various other magics.\n{Ina:} One kind is better than none at all. I'll write down this magic first. But having said that, I think that our village chief seems to be a little interested in magic. He said before that he wanted to build a magic guild, but because we need a lot of {building materials}, we can't afford it in such a small village. Give up. If we could create a magic guild in our village, maybe I would have been a magician long ago.","{雷尔：}看，这是{魔法屋}。可以学习魔法的地方。\n{伊娜：}原来要在这样的地方才能学习魔法啊。\n{雷尔：}也不止是这样的地方，如果城市里面开放了{魔法行会}的话，也可以去学的。另外，除了魔法本身之外，还有风火水土4种{魔法辅助技能}，对魔法的效果也有相当大的帮助。\n{伊娜：}赶紧拿伊娜酱万能笔记本抄下来。这下我就可以学到魔法，就不用担心怪物或者巴兰德军了吧。\n{雷尔：}还不够，这里只能学到一个魔法“闪电”，还有好几十种各式各样的其他魔法呢。\n{伊娜：}一种也比完全不会的好。这个魔法我就先记下来了。不过话说回来，我想起来我们村长好像对魔法也有点兴趣呢，以前他说过想造一个魔法行会来着的，但是因为需要大量{建筑材料}，我们这么个小村负担不起，只好作罢。如果我们村里能造出魔法行会，也许我早就是个魔法师了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} No problem. I came here for it, how could such an important thing be forgotten.\n{Ina:} Then, let's go. The goal is Rael's hometown, Ariana, and set sail.","{雷尔：}没问题了。我来到这里就是为了它，这么重要的东西怎么会忘掉呢。\n{伊娜：}那么，我们出发吧。目标是雷尔的故乡亚利安尼亚，启航了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Okay, let me do it.\n{Dream Shadow:} Rael puts on the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", holds the \"Creation Sword\", uses the Radiant Blood, and then does his best to attack the \"Destruction Sword\". Ina and Jack came to my side, hiding behind my protective magic.\n{Ina:} Got it.\n{Freeman:} Okay.\n{Rael:} Glory blood, awaken!\n{Freeman:} With such a strong momentum, Rael's eyes changed color.\n{Ina:} Come on Rael!\n{Rael:} Holy Light Heaven Sword~~!\n{Mengying:} Get down and avoid the impact! Boom~~~~~~~~~~!\n{Freeman:} What a great power, this is the Heavenly Sword from the \"Sword of Creation\", it's too strong...\n{Ina:} How about it? Did you make it?\n{Rael:} \"The Sword of Creation\" is intact...The \"Sword of Destruction\" is also intact. It seems to be a failure...\n{Mengying:} Is the impact still not enough? If it is said that neither \"Blood of Radiance\" plus \"Sword of Creation\" can destroy \"Sword of Destruction\", then there may really be no way...\n{Ina:} Sister Mengying didn't say that this can destroy \"destroy\" \"Sword of\"?\n{Mengying:} I didn't say that it must be okay, only that there is hope. In theory, if two swords are used to hedge with the same strongest force, they can destroy each other, but theoretically there is such a little hope...\n{Ina:} If there is a little hope, we shouldn't give up, right?\n{Rael:} Yes, I will try again.\n{Freeman:} Ina, what are you going to do, don't stay away from the master of dream shadow, this is very dangerous.\n{Mengying:} Ina, you want to take the \"Sword of Destruction\"... Ah, is it possible...\n{Ina:} Dark blood, awaken!\n{Freeman:} Ina's form has changed again, becoming the same as before...\n{Mengying:} It's too crazy...Do you really want to oppose Rael's Heavenly Sword? Although you with dark blood can indeed control the \"Sword of Destruction\", if your sword cannot reach the power of Rael, you will be blown away!\n{Ina:} I may not learn well, although I have only read it a few times... Rael, would you like to try it with me?\n{Freeman:} This posture is exactly the same as Rael's...\n{Rael:} Well, Ina, I believe you. You have to withstand it.\n{Ina:} Well, I will work hard.\n{Freeman:} What is this strange noise...\n{Mengying:} Does it resonate? \"The Sword of Creation\" and the \"Sword of Destruction\" are at the same time in the resonance of the battle state...because these two swords are the wishes left by Augustine, the god of brilliance, and Kaos, the god of darkness, respectively... {Reel: }It turned out to be so, no wonder, I saw a new spell on the sword.\n{Ina:} I saw it too. let's start.\n{Rael:} Good. {Ina:} The dark magic sword shrouded the shadow that never faded under the sun, and the power of Kaos was with the earth.\n{Raier:} The glorious holy sword ignites the indelible stars in the night, and Augustine's power and the sky will last forever.\n{Ina:} Magic Light Heaven Sword~~!\n{Rael:} Holy Light Heaven Sword~~!","{雷尔：}好吧，就由我来动手。\n{梦影：}雷尔穿上“龙王神力”，手持“创世之剑”，使用光辉之血，然后尽全力对“毁灭之剑”进行攻击。伊娜和杰克到我这边来，躲在我的防护魔法之后。\n{伊娜：}知道了。\n{弗里曼：}好的。\n{雷尔：}光辉之血，觉醒！\n{弗里曼：}好强的气势，雷尔的眼睛变色了。\n{伊娜：}雷尔加油！\n{雷尔：}圣光天霄剑~~！\n{梦影：}趴下，躲避冲击！\n\n轰~~~~~~~~~~！\n\n{弗里曼：}好大的威力，这就是“创世之剑”打出来的天霄剑啊，太强了……\n{伊娜：}怎么样？成功了吗？\n{雷尔：}“创世之剑”完好……“毁灭之剑”也完好。看来是失败了……\n{梦影：}冲击力依然不够吗？如果说“光辉之血”加上“创世之剑”都无法破坏“毁灭之剑”的话，那可能真的是没有办法了……\n{伊娜：}梦影姐姐不是说这样可以破坏“毁灭之剑”的吗？\n{梦影：}我也没说一定可以啊，只是说有希望可以而已。理论上来说，如果两剑以同样最强的力量对冲，是可以相互破坏的，只是理论上有这样一点希望而已……\n{伊娜：}如果有一点希望，我们就不该放弃是吧。\n{雷尔：}对，我再尝试一次。\n{弗里曼：}伊娜，你要做什么，不要远离梦影大师，这样很危险。\n{梦影：}伊娜，你拿“毁灭之剑”是想……啊，难不成……\n{伊娜：}暗黑之血，觉醒！\n{弗里曼：}伊娜的形态又变化了，变得跟之前那次一样……\n{梦影：}太胡来了……难道你真的想跟雷尔的天霄剑对冲？虽然拥有暗黑之血的你确实能够驾驭“毁灭之剑”，不过如果你的剑招达不到雷尔同等的威力，你会被吹飞的！\n{伊娜：}我，可能学得不是太好呢，虽然只是看过几遍……雷尔，你愿意跟我一起尝试一下吗？\n{弗里曼：}这个架势，跟雷尔的一模一样啊……\n{雷尔：}好吧，伊娜，我相信你。你要顶住啊。\n{伊娜：}嗯，我会努力的。\n{弗里曼：}这奇怪的响声，是什么……\n{梦影：}共鸣吗？“创世之剑”与“毁灭之剑”同时处于临战状态的共鸣……因为，这两把剑，就是光辉之神奥古斯丁与暗黑之神卡奥斯各自留下的心愿……\n{雷尔：}原来是这样，难怪，我看到了剑上有新的咒语了呢。\n{伊娜：}我也看到了。开始吧。\n{雷尔：}好。\n{伊娜：}暗黑的魔剑笼罩着阳光下永不消逝的阴影，卡奥斯的力量与大地同在。\n{雷尔：}光辉的圣剑点燃着黑夜中永不磨灭的星辰，奥古斯丁的力量与天空永存。\n{伊娜：}魔光天霄剑~~！\n{雷尔：}圣光天霄剑~~！\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Pop!\n{Ina:} Also, it's really troublesome...","{雷尔：}啪！\n{伊娜：}还有，真麻烦……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Pop!\n{Ina:} With a cry, ready to fight! Ah, another nasty vampire...","{雷尔：}啪！\n{伊娜：}一声，准备迎战！啊，又是讨厌的吸血鬼……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Put this robe on, it should not be easily recognized.\n{Ina:} It's ugly, but now I almost cover my face.\n{Rael:} That's why it is safe.\n{Ina:} Okay, okay.","{雷尔：}把这长袍穿上，应该不会轻易被认出来。\n{伊娜：}真丑，不过这下几乎连脸都遮住了。\n{雷尔：}所以这样才安全。\n{伊娜：}好吧好吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Since there are organs, it is even more clear that there are people. The mechanism is used to prevent outsiders from entering.","{雷尔：}既然有机关，就更加说明有人了。机关是用来防止外人进入的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} So you really plan to deal with that pinate?\n{Freeman:} I have two considerations. One is that we have no other way to go, we can only pass through here. The second is what Archbishop Yingluck is not willing to do. If we can do it, the people will support us. This is exactly what we need. Only if you are willing to consider the people of this country, can you gain the support of the people and govern a country well. Therefore, I can't refuse this kind of thing.\n{Ina:} Wow, that's amazing. I didn't think about it so much just now. I just thought that pinate was too bad, so I must get rid of him. Jack will definitely become a good king.\n{Freeman:} The current king is my brother. I just want to prevent Archbishop Yingluck from manipulating this country, not to be a king. If the elder brother is safe and sound, the king will be done by the elder brother. I hope that Archbishop Yingluck will not start with my brother.","{雷尔：}于是你们就真的打算去对付那个海盗？\n{弗里曼：}我出于两个方面考虑。一是我们也没别的路可走，只能从这里通过。二是英拉大主教不肯做的事情，我们能做，民众就会支持我们，这正是我们所需要的东西。只有肯为这个国家的民众着想，才能获得民众的支持，才能治理好一个国家。所以这种事情，我更不能推辞。\n{伊娜：}哇，好厉害，我刚才都没想那么多耶，只觉得那个海盗太坏了，所以一定要收拾掉他。杰克一定会成为一个好国王的。\n{弗里曼：}现在的国王是我哥哥，我只想阻止英拉大主教操纵这个国家，并不是想当国王。如果哥哥安然无恙的话，国王还是由哥哥来做好了。希望英拉大主教不会对我哥哥下手才好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} The big wave is coming again, everyone be careful.","{雷尔：}大浪又来了，大家小心。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} The front is upstream.\n{Freeman:} It looks like we are about to enter the whirlpool area. Fanli seems to have difficulty controlling the ship's progress. If there is no strong ship handling equipment, the ship may not know where it will be pushed.","{雷尔：}前面是逆流。\n{弗里曼：}看来要进入漩涡区了。帆力似乎难以控制船的行进了。如果没有强力的操船设备，船可能不知会被推向何方。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} The road here looks quite complicated, which is very unfavorable to us.\n{Ina:} Yes, I'm dizzy... the border guards here are those we can and we can't, and there are those that Archbishop Yingluck can and he can't, and everyone can't open them. of. We must make our own line open, but also not allow Archbishop Yingluck to catch us. You have to {look carefully} the road here, {don't drive the wrong} guards.\n{Ladia:} This is impossible! Archbishop Yingluck has been active in this area for a long time. He must be fully familiar with the surrounding geographical environment. How could he lose to you in the competition to find a route? In addition, many people in black were lying in wait among his men. Although those people may not be able to beat you, they will delay your time for Archbishop Yingluck to catch you.\n{Ina:} Then it seems that I can only find a way to trap the Archbishop Yingluck...\n{Rael:} To put it simply, how can you trap him? You can't put him in a desolation alone. Go to the island.\n{Ina:} Huh? Good idea? {Containing him on a desert island} is also a way.\n{Rael:} What horrible idea did you think of again?\n{Freeman:} We have no ability to catch him, we just have to find a way to lead him to the desert island, right. I think Ina's idea is not unfeasible, but Archbishop Yingluck knows how to do it? If it doesn't, it won't lead to it, right?\n{Ina:} If he can't, I {teach him} that's it. I just write the magic spell on the book and put it in {where he can get} {place}, and it's all there is to it. Well, give the book a name, it's called {Water Magic Book}.\n{Rael:} Do you really want to do this?\n{Ina:} Let's give it a try... Otherwise, is there any other good way for Rael?\n{Rael:} No more.\n{Ina:} Then let's follow my plan.","{雷尔：}这边的道路看上去相当地复杂，对我们很不利啊。\n{伊娜：}是哦，看得晕晕的……这里的边境守卫有我们能开的和我们不能开的，又有英拉大主教能开的和他不能开的，还有大家都不能打开的。我们既要让自己的路线打通，又不能让英拉大主教能抓到我们。得{好好看清楚}这里的路，{不要开错}了守卫才行。\n{拉迪亚：}这根本不可能！英拉大主教已经在这一带活动了很久了，他一定对这周围的地理环境完全熟知，怎么可能在寻找路线的竞争中输给你？另外他的手下还有不少黑衣人四处埋伏着。那些人虽然可能打不过你，但是会拖延你的时间让英拉大主教抓住你的。\n{伊娜：}那么看来只能想办法把英拉大主教困住才好啦……\n{雷尔：}说得简单啊，怎么才能困住他，你又不可能把他一个人关到荒岛上去。\n{伊娜：}咦？好主意耶？{把他关到荒岛上去}，也是一个办法。\n{雷尔：}你又想到什么鬼主意了？\n{弗里曼：}我们没有能力抓住他，就是要想办法把他引到荒岛上对吧。伊娜的想法我是觉得也未尝不可行，只是英拉大主教他会水行吗？要是不会的话，也引不过去吧？\n{伊娜：}如果他不会，我{教他}就是了。我只要把魔法的咒语写在书上，放在{他拿得到的}\n{地方}，就可以了。嗯，给书起个名字，就叫{水系魔法书}好了。\n{雷尔：}你真的要这么干？\n{伊娜：}试一试好了……要不然，雷尔有什么别的好办法吗？\n{雷尔：}没有了。\n{伊娜：}那么还是按我的计划来吧。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} The situation does not seem to be easy. They seem to have a lot of people. They stay here, it is difficult for us to pass. It's definitely not a good way to go hard.\n{Ina:} Then how about we distract them. At least disperse them and defeat them individually.\n{Freeman:} This is the only way to go. But you have to be careful of this Srael, her nickname is {\"Freelander\"}, and she is extremely fast. If you fight with her, I am afraid that she will kill her before she has the time to act. On this plain, she has no obstacles to display her skills.\n{Ina:} So what should I do? Would it be better if there was any way to lead her to a place with many obstacles, such as a city?\n{Rael:} I'm afraid it will still be difficult. Will the other party be easily fooled?\n{Ina:} If there is a fat enough bait, it should still be able to attract it.\n{Rael:} Could it be that you want to {lead her to the city}?\n{Ina:} Maybe, if {there are walls and rivers}, would it be more advantageous to us?\n{Rael:} But if you defend the city, the opponent won't be stupid to attack, right?\n{Ina:} But think about it in another direction, what if {let the other party advance to the city}? I come to think of a way, I will work hard.","{雷尔：}情况好像不太好办哪。他们看起来人不少，守在这里，我们很难通过去。硬闯绝对不是好办法。\n{伊娜：}那么我们把他们引开如何。至少分散开他们，各个击破。\n{弗里曼：}也只有这样了。不过你们要小心这个斯蕾尔，她的外号叫{“神行者”}，速度极快，跟她交战的话，恐怕还没有来得及行动，就被她先手干掉了。在这平原上，她施展身手更是毫无阻碍。\n{伊娜：}那怎么办哪？如果有什么办法把她引到障碍多的地方会不会好一点呢，比如城里？\n{雷尔：}恐怕还是会很难，对方会轻易上当吗？\n{伊娜：}如果有足够肥的诱饵的话，应该还是能引到的吧。\n{雷尔：}难道说，你想把她{引到城里}？\n{伊娜：}也许吧，如果{有墙有河}的话，会不会对我们比较有利呢。\n{雷尔：}但是如果你守城的话，对方不会傻到来强攻吧？\n{伊娜：}但是换个方向考虑，如果{让对方先进城}呢？我来想办法，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} The situation is so grim. Jack, what do you think?\n{Freeman:} I have to think about it. For now, let's find Kairon first, it will be troublesome to be preempted by the demons.\n{Ina:} But we can't go to the other side right now.\n{Dawu:} Hahaha. My lord knows that you are going to the other side and are trapped here. Don't worry, Master Darwood, who has a noble moral character and a pure heart, is kind and helpful to others, and will definitely help you solve problems.\n{Ina:} Where did you know, you just clearly asked me why I was here. But then, do you really have a way to let us pass?\n{Da Wu:} This lord has a treasure called {\"Water God Boots\"}. After wearing it, you can walk like flying in the water, like stepping on a flat ground. As long as you are willing to pay the rent of 5000 gold coins, I will lend it to you. ?a?aHowever, {you have to return it to this lord} when you use it up.\n{Ina:} Really, that's great, I will definitely return it when I use it up.\n{Dawu:} Then come to the hut in front, and I will bring it to you.","{雷尔：}局势真严峻啊。杰克，你觉得该怎么办？\n{弗里曼：}我得想想。眼下我们还是先把凯隆找到吧，被魔族抢先就麻烦了。\n{伊娜：}可是我们眼下没法去对岸耶。\n{达伍：}哈哈哈。本大人就知道你们要去对岸，在这里困住了。放心，有品德高尚心灵纯洁好善乐施助人为乐的达伍大人在，一定帮你们排忧解难。\n{伊娜：}你哪里知道了，你刚刚明明还问我怎么会在这里。不过话说，你真有办法让我们过去？\n{达伍：}本大人有一件宝贝，叫做{“水神靴”}，穿上它之后就可以步水如飞，像踩在平地上一样。只要你们肯出5000金币的租金，我就借给你们用一下。——不过，{用完了可要还给本大人}的哦。\n{伊娜：}是吗，那太好了，我用完一定会归还的。\n{达伍：}那么到前面的小屋来吧，本大人拿给你们。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Then, let's do it again. Ina, this time is more powerful than last time, okay?\n{Ina:} Rael, what are you going to do? I've hurt you just now, if the power increases...\n{Freeman:} Is there any way Rael can do it?\n{Rael:} There is indeed a way. Ina, you can just do as I said.\n{Ina:} I don't understand, you have to tell me how to do it before I am willing to do it. Otherwise I don't worry.\n{Rael:} Don't worry about that much, just do as I say, we can't spend it here. You don't want all our efforts so far to be wasted, do you? Don't want to wait for Archbishop Yingluck to stop us?\n{Ina:} But... {Rael:} Stop it, do it, trust me.\n{Ina:} Well, Rael has always been dependable. So, I started.\n{Rael:} Well, I'm ready too.\n{Ina:} little Ina medium blasting mine~~~~~ Go! Ina threw a fireball larger than before to the tower post. But the situation is no different from just now. The fireball hit the light wall of the tower and was scattered and bounced back.\n{Ina:} Ah, it still doesn't work, Rael, what are you doing...\n{Rael:} Leave it to me, you guys get out of the way! Rael stood in front alone, raised his sword at the direction of the tower column, standing still. Pillars of flame cut through Rael, splashing wisps of blood. Rael's eyes glared at the tower pillar, his eyes glowing bright blue. His own blood was spilled on the sword, and the sword also glowed.\n{Rael:} Holy Light Heaven Sword! Before Ina and Freeman could see Rael's movements clearly in the future, the green light wall around the tower pillar shattered. Countless resentful spirits poured out from the tower pillar. Rael fell to the ground.\n{Ina:} Rael!\n{Freeman:} Leave Rael to me, Ina, deal with those ghosts first.","{雷尔：}那么，我们再来一次吧。伊娜，这次比上一回威力再加强一点，可以吗？\n{伊娜：}雷尔，你这是打算干什么？刚才已经把你弄伤了，威力要是再增大的话……\n{弗里曼：}雷尔是不是有什么办法？\n{雷尔：}办法确实是有，伊娜你就照我说的做就行了。\n{伊娜：}我不明白，你要先把办法告诉我，我才肯照着做。要不然我不放心。\n{雷尔：}别管那么多了，就照我说的做吧，我们可不能在这里耗下去了。你也不想让我们至今为止的努力全部白费吧？不想等英拉大主教来阻止我们吧？\n{伊娜：}可是……\n{雷尔：}别可是了，动手吧，相信我。\n{伊娜：}好吧，雷尔一直是值得依赖的。那么，我开始了。\n{雷尔：}嗯，我也准备好了。\n{伊娜：}伊娜酱中型爆破雷~~~~~去吧！\n\n伊娜把一个比刚才更大一些的火球丢向塔柱。但是情形却跟刚才没有区别。火球碰到塔柱的光壁即被四散弹回。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，还是不行啊，雷尔，你干什么……\n{雷尔：}下面交给我了，你们闪开！\n\n雷尔一人站到前面，举剑对准了塔柱方向，巍然不动。火焰一柱一柱地从雷尔身上割过，溅起一缕缕血花。雷尔的眼睛怒视着塔柱，眼珠发出了亮蓝色光芒。自己的血洒在剑上，剑也泛起了辉光。\n\n{雷尔：}圣光天霄剑！\n\n伊娜和弗里曼还未来得及看清雷尔的动作，塔柱周身的绿色光壁就粉碎了。无数怨灵从塔柱之中泻放而出。雷尔则一头栽倒在地上。\n\n{伊娜：}雷尔！\n{弗里曼：}雷尔交给我，伊娜你先对付那些鬼魂。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} There are many demons in this area, and it feels more and more dangerous.\n{Ina:} I'm sorry to involve you too, but I want to save Roland too much...\n{Rael:} No, I didn't mean that, I just want to say that we have to be careful every step of the way. Although there are a lot of demons, we can't lose a lot when fighting against those young men, otherwise it will be difficult to deal with Chinu.\n{Ina:} I will work hard.","{雷尔：}这一带有很多魔族在活动，感觉越来越危险了。\n{伊娜：}对不起把你们也卷进来了，只是我太想救罗兰了……\n{雷尔：}不，我并没有这个意思，只是想说，下面我们每一步都得小心才好。虽然有很多魔族，但是我们不能在跟那些小喽罗交战时就损失巨大，否则遇到齐努就不好办了。\n{伊娜：}我会努力的。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} There are traces of excavation everywhere, and there is obviously a tomb robbery.\n{Ina:} Ah, there is someone in front! Is this the tomb thief?\n{Grave Robber:} Two of you! who?\n{Ina:} Let’s find something...\n{Grave Rogue:} Go away, the treasures here are all mys, don't think about it!\n{Rael:} \"We\"? So you still have accomplices?\n{Ina:} Then we can't wait anymore, we have to hurry up.\n{Grave Robber:} Damn, disobedient, right? Kill you!","{雷尔：}里面到处是挖掘的痕迹，显然有人盗墓。\n{伊娜：}啊，前面有个人！这就是盗墓贼吗？\n{盗墓贼：}你们2个！什么人？\n{伊娜：}我们来找一件东西……\n{盗墓贼：}滚，这里的财宝都是俺们的，你们别想了！\n{雷尔：}“俺们”？这么说你还有同伙？\n{伊娜：}那就更不能等了，我们要赶快。\n{盗墓贼：}靠，不听话是吧，宰了你们！\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} There is another waterway ahead.\n{Ina:} Is there another dark river?\n{Rael:} This can't be regarded as a dark river, it's a bright river.\n{Ina:} Do you still have to get there by boat...\n{Freeman:} No, look at the other side, the boat seems inconvenient to land. It seems that there is no way to reach the opposite shore by boat alone.\n{Ina:} This shore is a cursed land, and there is no way to use \"Water Walk\". You can't take a boat, nor can you travel on the water. How can I get to the other side...\n{Rael:} After finally getting here, shouldn't you have to give up all your efforts?\n{Ina:} Is there any other way to get to the other side besides taking a boat and a water trip?\n{Freeman:} As far as our current conditions are concerned, there is no other way.\n{Ina:} So, it seems that you can only dig inside in these two methods...\n{Raier:} Excavate inside?\n{Ina:} These two methods cannot be used alone, so only {combining these two methods} is used.","{雷尔：}前面又是水路了。\n{伊娜：}又有暗河了吗？\n{雷尔：}这个不能算暗河，是明河了。\n{伊娜：}还是要靠船渡过了吗……\n{弗里曼：}不行啊，你看对岸，船只似乎不方便登陆。看起来没有办法光靠坐船到达对岸。\n{伊娜：}这岸上是诅咒之地，也没有办法使用“水行”。坐船也不行，水行也不行，怎么样才能到达对岸呢……\n{雷尔：}好不容易到了这里，该不会要前功尽弃吧？\n{伊娜：}除了坐船和水行，还有其他办法能到达对岸吗？\n{弗里曼：}就我们目前的条件，是没有别的办法了。\n{伊娜：}这样啊，那看来只能在这两个办法里面内部挖掘了……\n{雷尔：}内部挖掘？\n{伊娜：}这两个办法单独使用都不行，那么只有{把这两个办法结合起来}用了。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} There is movement, be careful!\n{Ina:} Ah, this is...\n{Freeman:} Bat, ah no, vampire...\n{Ina:} How come you meet these guys every time you go into the cave.\n{Rael:} It's as if you encounter fish every time you go to the sea.","{雷尔：}有动静，小心！\n{伊娜：}啊，这是……\n{弗里曼：}蝙蝠，啊不，吸血鬼……\n{伊娜：}怎么每次下洞穴都会碰到这些家伙们啊。\n{雷尔：}这就如同你每次去海里都会碰到鱼一样。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} There is no way here, where are you going to escape!\n{Ina:} Just now Roddy has told me that the west side of the courtyard is unreachable, and it is a dead end for you to run here.\n{Mozu:} Hey, it seems I can't escape...\n{Ina:} What's the matter, I can't escape, what are you still writing? Is it also Ina's omnipotent notebook?\n{Mozu:} Go ahead, bring it to Lord Solo! The Mozu handed the note he had just written to a black falcon that suddenly descended from the sky, and the black falcon took the note and flew into the sky.\n{Rael:} Oh, let him spread the letter...\n{Ina:} That bird flies so fast, I can't hit it with magic...\n{Mozu:} Hey, now you guys It's no use killing me. Why don't you just let me go. For the sake of the fans of Brother Youni, I'll give you first-class VIP tickets next time, how about it?\n{Ina:} Still want to buy me? No doors! It's all because of your destruction that I can't see my performance. Today you can't escape anywhere, I want to avenge my three tickets!","{雷尔：}这里没有路了，你还往哪逃！\n{伊娜：}刚才罗迪已经告诉我庭院的西边是不通的啦，你往这儿跑是死路一条。\n{魔族：}嘿嘿，看来是逃不掉了……\n{伊娜：}怎么了，逃不掉了你还在写什么，难道也是伊娜酱万能笔记本？\n{魔族：}去吧，带给索罗大人！\n\n魔族把刚刚写的纸条交给一只突然从上空降下的黑隼，黑隼接过纸条一飞冲天不见了。\n\n{雷尔：}糟了，这下让他把信传出去了……\n{伊娜：}那个鸟飞得好快，我用魔法也打不到了……\n{魔族：}嘿嘿，这下你们杀了我也没有用了，不如干脆放我走吧，看在同是尤尼兄弟的粉丝的份上，下次我送你们头等贵宾票啊，怎么样？\n{伊娜：}还想收买我？门都没有！都是因为你们的破坏，才害我演出都看不成。今天你哪也逃不走，我要为我的三张票报仇！\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} This is a big trouble, it seems that the demons here also want to conquer humans. And they were looking for the \"Dragon Bone Greaves\", a component of \"Dragon King Divine Power\".\n{Ina:} The Trifia Kingdom has actually been occupied, so the residents here were killed by them... It's too cruel...\n{Rael:} Why did they look for the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\" What about the parts...\n{Ina:} Although I don't know why they were looking for it, it looks like they haven't found the \"Dragon Bone Greaves\". And since they are looking in this area, it seems that they have already got some information, maybe that part is nearby.\n{Rael:} So what about the detector Mengying gave us, is there any response?\n{Ina:} There is no reaction at all. Am I wrong?\n{Rael:} If you can meet survivors, you may be able to get some information.\n{Ina:} Yes, just do it. Let's search for the survivors of the residents here. If you can't see a city far away, maybe you can find someone, so go there first.","{雷尔：}这下麻烦大了，看起来这里的魔族也想要征服人类。而且他们竟然在找“龙王神力”的部件“龙骨胫甲”。\n{伊娜：}特里菲亚王国竟然已经被占领了，那么这里的居民呢，难道都被他们杀了……太残忍了……\n{雷尔：}他们为什么也要找“龙王神力”的部件呢……\n{伊娜：}虽然我不知道他们为什么要找，但现在看起来他们还没有找到“龙骨胫甲”。而且既然他们在这一带找，看起来他们已经得到了一些情报，那个部件说不定就在这附近。\n{雷尔：}那么梦影给我们的探测仪呢，有反应吗？\n{伊娜：}一点反应都没有。难道我判断错了？\n{雷尔：}如果能遇到幸存者的话，也许还能得到些情报。\n{伊娜：}对，就这么办。我们去搜寻这里的居民的幸存者吧。看不远处有座城，或许能找到人，先去那里看看。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} This is {one-way door}, you have to consider how to return after entering. If the magic points are used up, it will be a waste of time to return.","{雷尔：}这里是{单向门}，你得考虑好进去之后如何返回。如果魔法点用光了的话，返回就要浪费点时间了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} Wait a minute, everyone stop for a while.\n{Ina:} Huh? {Rael:} Do you feel that someone is following us?\n{Ina:} So, there are indeed some strange noises along the way. I thought it was a small animal...\n{Freeman:} It seems that I have to find a way to draw that guy out.\n{Ina:} (loudly) Ah, \"Longan Ring\"! found it!\n{Rael:} Found it?\n{Voice:} Good job, I just wait for this moment.\n{Freeman:} Appeared, you are... Kurug! Is it you who followed us along the way?\n{Kurug:} Yes, although the plan to use the queen to kill you has failed, if you can follow you to obtain the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", it will be a success. Okay, please hand over the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" obediently, or do you want me to take it?\n{Ina:} I lied to you. I just called it to get you out, but I didn't find it at all.\n{Kurug:} You! Little girl, it's really mean to fool me!\n{Ina:} Is there any mistake? You lied to us first, okay, the thief shouted to catch the thief.\n{Kurug:} Hmph, since you have discovered it, even if you can't get the \"Dragon Eye Ring\", you can kill you! Kurug began to chant magic. A huge magic cloud gathered on Kurug's head, and the sky turned dark.\n{Rael:} No, this is \"swallowing\" magic, which is powerful enough to destroy a city. Run away, I will hold him.\n{Ina:} Rael has seen this magic?\n{Rael:} When we were at war with Pallas, he used this magic to almost annihilate our thousands of armies...Hurry up, you two run away... Ina was hesitating, suddenly in the air. The sharp sword flew down, hitting Kurug. Kurug was pierced in his chest and fell to the ground. The magic cloud disappeared, and the sky was bright again. An angel slowly descended from the air.\n{Ina:} Ah, it turned out to be... Roland!\n{Roland:} It's a few benefactors. It's a coincidence that we met again. I passed by here and saw that something was wrong. It turned out that there was a demon who was using mass destruction magic, so I hurried to kill him first, so as not to suffocate the creatures. Fortunately, he was completely defenseless against me and succeeded in the sneak attack. He didn't expect that his target was you.\n{Ina:} I'm saved, I really have to thank you this time, or we might be dead. What is Roland doing here?\n{Roland:} I'm just passing by. I'm going to a place called {Taslinna Mountain}, where it is said that there is a god who healed my waterphobia.\n{Ina:} Really, that's great.\n{Roland:} Well, I should continue on my way, goodbye everyone. After Roland finished speaking, he hurriedly flew away.","{雷尔：}等一下，大家停一停。\n{伊娜：}嗯？\n{雷尔：}你们有没有感觉到，好像有人在跟踪我们？\n{伊娜：}这么说来，确实一路上经常有一些奇怪的声响，我以为是小动物呢……\n{弗里曼：}看来，得想办法把那个家伙引出来才好。\n{伊娜：}（大声）啊，“龙眼指环”！找到了！\n{雷尔：}找到了？\n{声音：}干得好，我就是等着这一刻。\n{弗里曼：}出现了，你是……库鲁格！一路上跟踪我们的，就是你吗？\n{库鲁格：}没错，虽然利用女王捕杀你们的计划失败了，但是如果能跟踪你们取得“龙眼指环”，也是一功。好了，乖乖地把“龙眼指环”交出来吧，或者，是要让我出手强夺呢？\n{伊娜：}骗你的啦。我只是为了把你引出来才这么叫的，其实根本没有找到。\n{库鲁格：}你！小丫头，居然耍我，真是卑鄙！\n{伊娜：}有没有搞错，是你先骗我们的好不好，居然贼喊捉贼。\n{库鲁格：}哼，既然被你们发现了，就算得不到“龙眼指环”，把你们杀了也行！\n\n库鲁格开始咏唱魔法。巨大的魔法云在库鲁格头上聚集，天色变得暗了起来。\n{雷尔：}不好，这是“吞噬”魔法，杀伤力足以毁灭一个城市。你们快逃吧，我拖住他。\n{伊娜：}雷尔见过这个魔法？\n{雷尔：}当年我们与帕拉斯交战的时候，他用这个魔法一下就让我们几千大军几乎全灭啊……快，你们2个快逃……\n\n伊娜正在犹豫间，突然空中一把利剑飞贯而下，正中库鲁格。库鲁格胸被刺穿，一头倒地。魔法云消失了，天又恢复了明亮。一个天使从空中徐徐降下。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，原来是……罗兰！\n{罗兰：}是几位恩人啊，又见面了，真是巧啊。我途经这里，看到情况不对劲，原来是有魔族在使用大杀伤性魔法，赶紧出手先把他杀了，免得生灵涂炭。好在他对我全无防备，偷袭得手了，没想到他的目标竟然是你们。\n{伊娜：}得救了，这次真要好好谢谢你了，要不然我们恐怕就要挂了。话说罗兰来这里做什么呢？\n{罗兰：}我只是路过而已，我要去一个叫做{塔斯林纳山}的地方，据说那里有一位神官能治好我的恐水症。\n{伊娜：}是吗，那真是太好了。\n{罗兰：}好了我该继续赶路了，各位再见。\n\n罗兰说完急匆匆地飞走了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} What are you going to do, Ina?\n{Ina:} No, we must find a way to stop the Balandian army, otherwise the city of Kartia will be in danger. Even if I can only help a little, I have to do something.\n{Rael:} But how do you want to stop them? If the other party has a lot of people.\n{Ina:} There will always be a way, I have to work hard.","{雷尔：}你打算怎么办，伊娜？\n{伊娜：}不行，一定得想办法阻止巴兰德军，否则卡尔提亚王城就危险了。即使只能帮上一点忙也好，我得去做点什么。\n{雷尔：}不过，你想怎么阻止他们呢？如果对方人数很多的话。\n{伊娜：}总会有办法的，我要努力。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} What building is there on the east side? It's so tall, I can see it from far, far away.\n{Ina:} That? Really, what the hell is that... Jack is so knowledgeable, he should know?\n{Freeman:} There is a very famous building near here called \"Tongtian Monument\".\n{Ina:} Ah, speaking of this name, Grandpa mentioned it to me. I'm going to look through the universal notebook of little Ina... I found it. The \"Tongtian Monument\" of the Kingdom of Barland is one of the most magnificent buildings in Mirronia. Because it is located in the center of the mainland of Mirronia, The dynasties and generations that have ruled here for thousands of years have regarded it as...I don't understand the following words, but when I listened to my grandfather, I didn't understand...\n{Freeman:} See it as a symbol of divine power. . Since the original Amishulan dynasty built this monument, it has been passed down for more than three thousand years. Since then, every generation of kings will add a layer on top of it and record themselves in the long river of history. Even after the war and the change of dynasties, the \"Tongtian Monument\" was still regarded by the new emperor as a symbol of his orthodox power and continued to rise to the sky.\n{Rael:} No wonder it is so tall. It is not easy to be preserved intact for more than three thousand years.\n{Freeman:} Because the emperors of the past have attached great importance to it. I have always been looking forward to when I can pay homage to the \"Tongtian Monument\". How many ups and downs are recorded on this, it is the mirror of governing the country-but now we don't have time to care about this, and come back if we have time. .","{雷尔：}东边方向上有一个什么建筑？这么高大，很远很远就看到了。\n{伊娜：}那个吗？真的耶，那到底是什么啊……杰克见多识广，应该知道吧？\n{弗里曼：}这里附近有一座非常有名的建筑，叫做“通天碑”。\n{伊娜：}啊，说到这个名字，爷爷跟我提到过呢。我来翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本……找到了找到了，巴兰德王国的“通天碑”，是米尔罗尼亚最宏伟的建筑之一，由于地处米尔罗尼亚大陆的中心地带，几千年来统治这里的各朝各代都视其为……下面几个词我不懂唉，当时听爷爷说的时候没明白……\n{弗里曼：}视其为天赐神权的象征吧。从最初的阿米舒兰王朝建造此碑开始，已经传承了三千多年了，此后每一代君王都会在此之上加盖一层，把自己记录在历史的长河之中。即使经历战乱和朝代更替，“通天碑”依然被新帝王视为自己正统权力的象征，继续升向云霄。\n{雷尔：}难怪会这么高大。能够三千多年保存完好真是不容易。\n{弗里曼：}因为历代帝王都对其非常重视的原因吧。一直以来我都非常期待着什么时候能去瞻仰一下“通天碑”呢，这上面记录了多少盛衰兴亡，是治国的明镜啊——不过现在我们可没时间关心这个了，以后如果有空再来吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} What's the matter, Ina, such a depressed look is not like you usually look like.\n{Ina:} I'm all to blame. If it wasn't for saving us, Roland would not forget the weapon, and wouldn't be able to defeat that weird man...\n{Freeman:} You can't be blamed for this. But it doesn't make sense to think about whose fault it was now. You should find a way to find that weird person and rescue Roland. Roland will not be rescued because you blame yourself. On the contrary, only if you cheer up can you give full play to your skills and rescue Roland.\n{Ina:} Well, that's right... Anyway, it was Roland who rescued us before, but now we must rescue him.","{雷尔：}怎么了，伊娜，这么沮丧的样子，不像你平时的样子啊。\n{伊娜：}都怪我不好，如果不是为了救我们，罗兰就不会把武器忘掉，也就不会打不过那个怪人了……\n{弗里曼：}这个不能怪你吧。不过现在考虑是谁的过失都没有意义，应该想办法找到那个怪人，救出罗兰才好。罗兰并不会因为你自责而获救，相反，只有你打起精神来，才能充分发挥你的本领，把罗兰救出来。\n{伊娜：}唔，说得也对……不管怎么说，之前是罗兰救了我们，现在我们一定要把他救出来。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} What? That said, you were allowed to go to sea only after agreeing to the tribute of becoming the Sea Dragon King?\n{Ina:} Correct answer!\n{Rael:} But, this is too foolish. Are you afraid of being eaten?\n{Ina:} There is a record in the little Ina universal notebook. The six major monsters are the Phoenix, the Black Dragon King, the Golden Dragon, the Nine-Headed Dragon, the Holy Kylin, and the Garuda. This is what the elders of Cheman Island told us.\n{Freeman:} What does this show?\n{Ina:} There is no Sea Dragon King in the Warcraft. Then he must be better than Phoenix.\n{Freeman:} But what you defeated before was not a 100% phoenix.\n{Ina:} It's okay. I will work hard. Next, let's go to the Sea Dragon King and ask him for an explanation.","{雷尔：}什么？这么说，你是答应了成为海龙王的贡礼才被允许出海的？\n{伊娜：}正解！\n{雷尔：}可是，这也太胡闹了吧。你不怕真的被吃了？\n{伊娜：}伊娜酱万能笔记本上有记载哦，六大魔兽是不死鸟，黑龙王，金神龙，九头龙，圣麒麟，伽楼罗。这是奇曼岛的长老告诉我们的。\n{弗里曼：}这又说明了什么？\n{伊娜：}魔兽之中并没有海龙王的名号啊。那么他一定不如不死鸟强。\n{弗里曼：}但是之前你战胜的并不是百分百实力的不死鸟。\n{伊娜：}没关系的啦。我会努力的。下面我们就去找海龙王吧，向他讨个说法。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rael:} actually broke through. Ina is really smart.\n{Ina:} Really? Ahahaha, those big guys are just stupid...","{雷尔：}居然闯过来了。伊娜果然是聪明过人啊。\n{伊娜：}是吗？啊哈哈哈，那些大家伙比较笨而已……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Reception room doorman:} Can't afford that much money? Go go, go home.","{接待室门卫：}拿不出那么多钱？去去去，回家去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Reception room doorman:} Who are you?\n{Ina:} We want to see the Prime Minister Holia.\n{Reception room guard:} The reservation fee is 15,000 gold coins.\n{Ina:} Huh? Isn't it 10,000 gold coins? {Reception room doorman:} There is also a part of my tip. If you don't give it, it's fine if I don't inform you.","{接待室门卫：}你们是什么人？\n{伊娜：}我们想见宰相霍利亚大人。\n{接待室门卫：}预约费15000金币。\n{伊娜：}啊？不是10000金币吗？\n{接待室门卫：}还有一部分是我的小费。你要是不给也行，我不帮你通报就是了。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rescued:} Thank you for your rescue, I thought I was going to die on this sea.\n{Ina:} How could this grandpa float on the sea alone?\n{Rescued:} Don't bark, what \"grandfather\", I'm only 180 years old this year, so young, you naughty girl, don't call me so old.\n{Ina:} (One hundred and eighty years old! How do I feel that my name is still small, my grandfather's grandfather is not as big as you.)\n{Rescued:} My name is Fengyou, I am a wandering Taoist priest, and two The younger brother traveled together, but he did not expect to encounter pinates on this sea. The pinates took away our magic weapon and wanted to kill us. At the moment of the crisis, we used the teleportation method that had not yet been fully practiced, and luckily escaped from the pinate ship. But because our magic weapon was taken, the mana was weakened, and the teleportation Dafa was not practiced well, we couldn't control the landing point of the teleportation. As a result, it was teleported to the sea in mid-air. We just fell into the water. The two juniors were washed away by the waves and disappeared. I grabbed a driftwood entangled in seaweed and floated here.\n{Freeman:} So, the life and death of the two juniors of the predecessor is still unknown?\n{Fengyou:} If you don't get caught by the pinates again, you can't die. We have practiced together for more than a hundred years, and we still won't die because of a storm.\n{Ina:} The pinates have been killed by us, please don't worry, senior.\n{Fengyou:} Really, that's great. So have you seen the 3 treasures that we lost, the anti-magic boots, the anti-magic cloak, and the anti-magic chain?\n{Ina:} It turns out that these three things belong to you, which is really great. We are worried that we can't find the owner. This is back to you.\n{Fengyou:} The anti-magic boots are mine, and the other two are from the younger brother. I have to find 2 of them...Ouch! Fengyou tried to stand up, but fell down due to exhaustion.\n{Ina:} Senior, don't force it, let's go to your 2 junior brothers.\n{Rael:} Yes, seniors will rest on the boat.\n{Fengyou:} I am very grateful for a few people who helped me up, and I really don't want to trouble a few more. Or, give me the anti-magic boots first. With this, I can gradually restore my mana.","{获救者：}感谢几位搭救，还以为要死在这海上了。\n{伊娜：}这位爷爷怎么会一个人漂在海上呢？\n{获救者：}什么“爷爷”，不要乱叫，我今年才一百八十岁，年轻着呢，你这顽皮丫头不要把我叫得那么老。\n{伊娜：}（一百八十岁！我怎么感觉我还是叫得小了，我爷爷的爷爷都没你大。）\n{获救者：}我名叫风游，是个云游道士，与两位师弟结伴出行，没想到在这海上遇到了海盗。海盗抢走了我们的法宝，还要杀我们。就在危机关头，我们使用了还没有修练完全的传送大法，幸运地从海盗船上逃了出来。但是由于我们法宝被夺，法力削弱了，加上传送大法本来就没修练好，我们没法控制传送的落点，结果传送到了海上的半空中。我们就这样落入水中，两位师弟被海浪越冲越远不知去向，而我抓住一根被海草缠住的浮木漂在这里。\n{弗里曼：}这么说来，前辈的两位师弟现在还生死不明？\n{风游：}如果没有被海盗再抓住的话，死是死不掉的。我们一起修练了一百多年，还不会因为点风浪就死掉。\n{伊娜：}海盗已经被我们干掉啦，前辈您放心。\n{风游：}是吗，那太好了。那么你们有没有看到我们丢失的3件宝物抗魔靴，抗魔披风，抗魔链？\n{伊娜：}原来这3件东西就是您的，真是太好啦，我们正愁找不到失主呢。这就还给您。\n{风游：}抗魔靴是我的，另2件是师弟的。我还得去找他们2个……哎哟！\n\n风游试图站起来，但是体力不支摔倒了。\n\n{伊娜：}前辈别勉强啦，我们去找你的2位师弟好了。\n{雷尔：}是啊，前辈就在船上休息休息吧。\n{风游：}几位搭救我上来，我已经很感激了，实在不想再麻烦几位。要不，你们先把抗魔靴给我吧，有了这个，我就可以渐渐恢复法力了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Resentful Spirit:} I was overtaken, overtaken...\n{Ina:} Hey, what are you talking about?\n{Resentful Spirit:} I was overtaken, overtaken...\n{Ina:} Who was overtaken by you?\n{Resentful Spirit:} I was overtaken, overtaken...\n{Ina:} Hey, it has nothing to do with us, don't attack us...","{怨灵：}被追上了，被追上了……\n{伊娜：}咦，你们在说什么？\n{怨灵：}被追上了，被追上了……\n{伊娜：}你们被谁追上了？\n{怨灵：}被追上了，被追上了……\n{伊娜：}喂，跟我们无关啦，别攻击我们啊……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Resentful Spirit:} Run, run...\n{Ina:} What are you talking about again?\n{Resentment:} Run, run...\n{Ina:} Okay, run, don't come to me.\n{Resentment:} Run, run...\n{Ina:} I said don't come to me...","{怨灵：}快跑，快跑……\n{伊娜：}这又是在说什么？\n{怨灵：}快跑，快跑……\n{伊娜：}好吧，你们快跑，别来找我。\n{怨灵：}快跑，快跑……\n{伊娜：}我说了别来找我啦……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Resentful Spirit:} The chase is here, it's over...\n{Ina:} Wait, what is the chase?\n{Resentful spirit:} The chase is here, it's over...\n{Ina:} I'm not chasing a soldier...\n{Resentment:} The chasing is here, it's over...\n{Ina:} I finally got a clue...","{怨灵：}追兵来了，完了……\n{伊娜：}等等，追兵是？\n{怨灵：}追兵来了，完了……\n{伊娜：}我不是追兵啦……\n{怨灵：}追兵来了，完了……\n{伊娜：}好不容易有点头绪了……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Resentful Spirit:} Where to go...\n{Ina:} I don't know.\n{Resentful Spirit:} Where to go...\n{Ina:} Don't ask me.\n{Resentful Spirit:} Where to go...\n{Ina:} It's useless to chase after me...","{怨灵：}要跑到哪里……\n{伊娜：}我不知道。\n{怨灵：}要跑到哪里……\n{伊娜：}不要问我。\n{怨灵：}要跑到哪里……\n{伊娜：}追着我又没用的啦……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Resentful spirit:} Run...run...\n{Ina:} Why is another batch...\n{Resentful spirit:} Run...run...\n{Ina:} You run yours, I run mine.\n{Resentful Spirit:} Run...Run...\n{Ina:} Hey, I'm none of your business...","{怨灵：}跑……跑……\n{伊娜：}怎么又是一批……\n{怨灵：}跑……跑……\n{伊娜：}你们跑你们的，我跑我的。\n{怨灵：}跑……跑……\n{伊娜：}喂，我不关你们的事啦……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Robert:} It's a small thing when my stables fall down, and it's a big trouble to block the road. How can this be good?","{罗伯特：}我的马厩倒了倒是事小，把路堵了麻烦大，这可如何是好。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rody:} Snow Mountain Island has a unique climate and is extremely cold. Ordinary cotton warm clothing can not withstand the cold wind there. Therefore, you must make adequate preparations for the cold to go there, otherwise it would not be sensational to freeze to death there. I have some sable fur coats here, which can be provided for you to use. This fur is very warm and can hold three or five quilted jackets.\n{Freeman:} Sable, this is very expensive. Rumors say \"one inch of sable and one inch of gold\". Is it really appropriate for us to accept this?\n{Rody:} I have nothing else to help. I am really ashamed, so I hope you will accept these leather jackets.\n{Ina:} Well, since Roddy said so, let's accept it, thank you Roddy, we will prevent the demons from taking the \"Dragon Eye Ring\" and protect the safety of Salman and his son.","{罗迪：}雪山岛气候独特，异常寒冷，普通的棉制御寒衣物都无法抵挡那里的寒风，所以要去那里必须为御寒作好充分的准备，否则冻死在那里绝非耸人听闻。我这里有一些黑貂皮衣，可以提供给你们使用，这毛皮的保暖性非常好，一件皮衣就能顶三五件棉袄了。\n{弗里曼：}黑貂皮，这个很名贵的啊，传言都说“一寸黑貂一寸金”呢。我们收下这个真的合适吗？\n{罗迪：}我没有什么其他的可以帮上忙的地方，真的很惭愧，所以这些皮衣希望你们一定要收下。\n{伊娜：}好吧，既然罗迪这么说了，我们就收下吧，谢谢你罗迪，我们会阻止魔族夺取“龙眼戒”，保护萨尔曼父子的安全的。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Another fat sheep is here, let's do it!","{盗贼：}又有肥羊送上门来了，动手！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Find the target and kill!","{盗贼：}发现目标，杀！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Found the prey, come brothers!\n{Ina:} A few more thieves came here, it's okay, this kind of little girl is not my opponent.","{盗贼：}发现猎物，弟兄们上！\n{伊娜：}又来了几个盗贼，没事，这样的小喽罗不是我的对手。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Huh? Brother, why are you caught? This is too useless.\n{Ina:} Who are you?\n{Thief:} He is the one who instigated me to steal!\n{Rogue:} What? I think you might have some future, and I will show you a clear way. Unexpectedly, you are so useless, you will be arrested for stealing something. Lao Tzu will teach you, Lao Tzu doesn't need to steal it at all, use it to steal it.\n{Ina:} So you are more hateful. However, this time you hit the gun yourself. Just put you away together.","{无赖：}哈？小兄弟，你怎么被抓啦？这也太没用了吧。\n{伊娜：}你是谁？\n{窃贼：}他就是教唆我偷东西的人！\n{无赖：}什么话嘛，老子是看你可能会有点前途，给你指一条明路。没想到你这么没用，偷个东西都要被抓。老子来教教你，老子根本不用偷的，用明抢的。\n{伊娜：}原来你更可恶。不过，这回你自己撞到枪口上了。正好把你一起收拾掉。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Oh, it hurts~~~~~~~\n{Ina:} Just you two, want to grab me too, this skill is too bad.\n{Rogue:} Hmph, although we can't beat you, our boss {King Jaya} is in this area. This mountain is the site of King Jaya. Don't think you can pass through safely... {Ina: }What is the king? Is it great? Write it down anyway.","{盗贼：}哎哟，痛~~~~~~~\n{伊娜：}就你们两个，也想抢我，这身手太差了啦。\n{盗贼：}哼，虽然我们打不过你，不过我们老大{查亚大王}就在这一带，这座山就是我们查亚大王的地盘，你别以为你能安然无恙地通过……\n{伊娜：}什么什么大王？很厉害吗？不管怎么说先记下来。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Rogue:} Stop, we are Dragon Yashan heroes...\n{Ina:} Let's not talk about you anymore, just do it.","{盗贼：}站住，我们是龙牙山好汉……\n{伊娜：}不跟你们罗嗦了，直接动手。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Roland:} Thanks to your help this time, otherwise I must be dead. I don't know how to thank you all.\n{Ina:} You saved us last time in front of Kurug.\n{Roland:} I have to avenge the guy who caught me. I lost to him last time because I didn't have a weapon. This time I took my sword back. He must not be my opponent...\n{Ina:} That Qi Nu, we have defeated it.\n{Roland:} Was he killed by you?\n{Ina:} We defeated him. We wanted to get some intelligence from him, but unfortunately he was killed by his accomplices. Now I only know what sacrifices the demons want to do, there is a very powerful treasure, and what is the name of their leader, the evil prince Solo.\n{Roland:} That Solo seems to have a certain connection with {Barland Kingdom}.\n{Ina:} Ah, Kingdom of Barland?\n{Roland:} I heard it from the Chinu. I asked him why he arrested me. He said he would never tell me, and then said, what Solo provided support to the kingdom of Baland and let them attack The Kingdom of Kartia, what sent troops to occupy the Kingdom of Trifia, what looked for parts of the \"Dragon King's supernatural power\", and so on.ìyμ??ò??ê?3??a￡??-à′?§×?μ?ò°D??a?′′ó?￡ {òá?è￡o}°?￡??-à′1yè￥μ????′?àê??é??ê????úμ·1í￡? {?Tà?￡o}±?à′?ò?1???à?êμ?￡??é?§???y?μ×?￡?±?ò????Dà-μ???μ???μ??D×?á?￡?è?oó?ò?íò??±±?ò???è?1??ú?a?ù￡??±μ?????à′?￡????????′ò?????′°ì??￡? {?￥à??ü￡o}?ò???±è?°íà?μ?í?1úè￥?°?òμ????÷?￡ {à×??￡o}?°ê§1í?ü??ó?òa′óμ¨DD?ˉà2￡? {òá?è￡o}?òμ1??μ??aò2ê???2?′íμ??÷òa???￡?????÷?Tò2?ú?ò?°áúí?é?á|?±￡????ò?D?????aμàμ?±è?ò???à￡??μ2??¨?ò??′ó????à??üμ?μ??ü?à???÷?￡ {à×??￡o}o?°éo?°é￡??????èè????a?′??￡??òò2??àíóé·′??￡???ê??§íòòaD?D??￡ {?￥à??ü￡o}μ±è?￡?°íà?μ????úê??¨??ìá??μ?μD??1ú￡??ò??μ???°ì·¨′ó???§μ?μ?·?íμíμ?±è?￡????¨2??ü×???á?1???±?μ?1ú?3??á??￡ {òá?è￡o}?a?′?μà′￡?′ó?ò??{°?à-??′??ò???é1yò???ot}?í?üμ?°íà?μ??3?ú??￡????ò??±???ê2?′è?1ü￡??òòˉòˉμ????×?íê?′ó??à?ìóμ??¨??ìá??μ??￡?ò????°ì·¨′ó??à?1yè￥°é?￡???′?Tà???￡? {?Tà?￡o}?ò?1ê?μ??èè￥?t?1á??éé?￡??ò???í′?·?±e°é?￡??è??òò??¨?á±¨′e?????è?ü???÷?￡","{罗兰：}这次多亏你们相救，要不然我肯定没命了。真不知怎么感谢你们才好。\n{伊娜：}上次库鲁格面前你也救了我们呀。\n{罗兰：}我得去找那个捉我的家伙报仇，上次我输给他是因为没有武器，这次我拿回了自己的剑，他一定不是我的对手……\n{伊娜：}那个齐努，已经被我们打败啦。\n{罗兰：}他被你们杀了吗？\n{伊娜：}我们打败了他，本想从他嘴里套点情报出来，可惜他被他的同伙给杀了。现在只知道魔族要搞什么祭祀，有一件很厉害的宝物，还有还有，他们的头儿叫什么邪亲王索罗。\n{罗兰：}那个索罗，好像跟{巴兰德王国}有一定的联系。\n{伊娜：}啊，巴兰德王国？\n{罗兰：}我是从那个齐努嘴里听到的，我问他为什么抓我，他说他绝不会告诉我，然后说了一通，什么索罗向巴兰德王国提供支援让他们去进攻卡尔提亚王国，什么派军队占领特里菲亚王国，什么到处寻找“龙王神力”的部件，等等。听得我真是吃惊，原来魔族的野心这么大。\n{伊娜：}啊，原来过去的那么多事情都是他在捣鬼！\n{罗兰：}本来我还想多问点，可惜他正说着，被一个叫拉迪亚的女的叫走了，然后我就一直被一个人关在这儿，直到你们来。你们下面打算怎么办呢？\n{弗里曼：}我想潜入巴兰德王国去寻找点线索。\n{雷尔：}冒失鬼杰克又要大胆行动啦？\n{伊娜：}我倒觉得这也是个不错的主意呢。那个索罗也在找“龙王神力”，而且感觉他知道得比我们多，说不定我们从他那里能得到更多线索。\n{雷尔：}好吧好吧，你们既然都这么想，我也没理由反对，只是千万要小心。\n{弗里曼：}当然，巴兰德现在是卡尔提亚的敌对国，我们得想办法从偏僻的地方偷偷潜入，肯定不能走南岭关那边的国境线了。\n{伊娜：}这么说来，从我们{艾拉尔村向南渡过一个湖}就能到巴兰德境内呢，而且那边没什么人管，我爷爷的父亲就是从那里逃到卡尔提亚的。我们想办法从那里过去吧。那么罗兰呢？\n{罗兰：}我还是得先去塔斯林纳山，我们就此分别吧。改日我一定会报答你们救命之恩。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Roland:} The residence of the guy Kairon is right in front of him. Leave it to me now. Get out of the way, I can clean him up. You {do not} {can have any loss}.","{罗兰：}凯隆那家伙的居所就在眼前了。下面交给我吧。你们让开一点，我能收拾他。你们{千万不}\n{能有任何损失}。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Roland:} Then, I should go, thank you for helping me get revenge. The \"Dragon Shield\" will be handed over to you. There will be a period later.","{罗兰：}那么，我该走了，感谢你们帮助我报仇雪恨。“龙盾”就交给你们了。后会有期。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Sam:} Stop it.\n{Ina:} What's wrong?\n{Sam:} There is a secret path in this place. I saw they used them when the people in black brought us in. I think about it, there seems to be a switch here.\n{Ina:} It turns out that a brick here can be removed, but there is something inside...\n{Sam:} This is their hidden switch. Pull the gate down and the wall can be opened.\n{Freeman:} Be careful, don't...\n{Sam:} Ah~~~~~~~! As Sam pulled the brakes down, there was a burst of electric sparks on his body. The wall was opened with a passage. But Sam fell to the ground, unconscious.\n{Ina:} What's the matter, what's the matter with you?\n{Freeman:} Tell him to be careful, but his hand is still too fast. This device is a live body and should be operated by holding the insulated part, but his hand touched the metal part and was electrocuted.\n{Ina:} What does it mean to get an electric shock?\n{Freeman:} It's like being struck by a falling thunder. Of course, this thing is much less powerful than thunder, but it's still deadly.\n{Rael:} It seems that there is still a breath, not dead, there should be salvation.\n{Freeman:} Fortunately, it just loosened when it touched a little bit, and it didn't stick to it.\n{Ina:} Then it can be rescued, right, anyway, he helped us open this passage, we have to carry him out to the hospital.","{萨姆：}停一下。\n{伊娜：}怎么了？\n{萨姆：}这个地方有一个密道的。黑衣人带我们进来的时候我看他们使用过。我想想，好像是在这里有个开关。\n{伊娜：}原来这里的一块砖头可以移开，里面还有什么东西……\n{萨姆：}这就是他们隐藏的开关啦，把这个闸往下一拉，这面墙就能打开了。\n{弗里曼：}小心一点，别……\n{萨姆：}啊~~~~~~~！\n\n萨姆把闸拉下来的同时，身上冒出一阵阵电火花。墙被打开了一条通路。但是萨姆倒地不起，不省人事。\n\n{伊娜：}怎么回事，你怎么了？\n{弗里曼：}叫他小心，可是他手还是太快了。这个装置是个带电体，应该握着绝缘的部分操作的，可是他的手碰到了金属的部分，触电了。\n{伊娜：}触电是什么意思啊？\n{弗里曼：}就像是被落雷击中那样的情况，当然这个东西的威力比雷小得多，不过仍然足以致命。\n{雷尔：}看来还有气息，没死，应该有救。\n{弗里曼：}还好只是碰到了一点点就松开了，没被粘上去。\n{伊娜：}那就是还可以救回来是吧，不管怎么说他帮我们开了这条通路，我们抬也要把他抬出去送到医院。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Scholar:} Oh, you came right in time.\n{Ina:} Me? What can this gentleman need for help?\n{Scholar:} Actually I am a philosopher.\n{Ina:} That's amazing. I heard my grandfather say that people who study philosophy are very smart. So what does Mr. Philosopher need me to do.\n{Scholar:} Listen to me slowly. Actually, I have been thinking about a problem. I have been thinking about it for two years, but there is still nothing that satisfies me. My teacher gave me this question before his death two years ago, and left a box for me to open it after I got the answer, but I haven't got the answer yet.\n{Ina:} A question that Mr. Philosopher has been unable to think of for two years, I think I should not be able to help, right?\n{Scholar:} Sometimes, there is only one inspination and one opportunity for success. So no matter who it is, it is possible to accidentally touch the key to the truth.\n{Ina:} So, what is the question that Mr. Philosopher has been thinking about in the past two years?\n{Scholar:} The question is, why do people live...\n{Ina:} What a big question...\n{Scholar:} No matter how you live, the final outcome must be death. Everyone knows this ending. So why are we still alive, and what are we living for?\n{Ina:} I definitely can't answer such a profound question. But I think about it, is there any way to help Mr. Philosopher.","{学者：}哦，你来得正好。\n{伊娜：}我吗？这位先生有什么需要帮忙的？\n{学者：}其实我是一个哲学家。\n{伊娜：}好厉害。我听爷爷说，研究哲学的人都很聪明。那么哲学家先生需要我做什么呢。\n{学者：}你听我慢慢说来。其实啊，我一直在思考一个问题，想了两年了，还是没有什么能令我满意的结果。两年前我的老师临终之前给了我这个问题，并且留下了一个箱子，让我得到答案之后再开启，可是我到现在也没有得到答案。\n{伊娜：}哲学家先生两年都想不出来的问题，我觉得，我应该帮不上忙吧？\n{学者：}有的时候，成功只差一个启发，一个契机。所以不论是什么人，都有可能无意中触及到通向真理的钥匙。\n{伊娜：}那么，哲学家先生两年来思考的问题是什么呢？\n{学者：}问题就是，人们为什么而活着呢……\n{伊娜：}好大的问题啊……\n{学者：}不管你怎么活着，最后的结局肯定是死亡，谁都知道这个结局。那么为什么我们还活着，又是为了什么而活着？\n{伊娜：}这么深奥的问题，我肯定是答不上来啦。不过我想想，有没有什么办法能帮上哲学家先生。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Scholar:} Thank you for helping me out. I am Alchemist Nahn. Although I have no abilities, at least I can refine mercury. If you need mercury, just ask me.","{学者：}多谢你们帮我解围，我是炼金术士拿恩。虽然我没有什么本事，不过至少会提炼水银，如果你们需要水银，只管找我好了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Scholar:} Why are we still alive, and for what?","{学者：}为什么我们还活着，又是为了什么而活着？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Scout:} His Royal Highness Prince Freeman, it's not good, big... big event!\n{Freeman:} What's the matter? Archbishop Yingluck came to attack?\n{Scout:} No. But it may be worse than this. Archbishop Yingluck suddenly announced that he had formed a military alliance with the Kingdom of Barland, and he also served as the Generalissimo of the two countries at the same time!\n{Freeman:} This... is really bad. Thank you for your information. I think of a way.\n{Ina:} Grand Marshal, what position is this?\n{Freeman:} The Generalissimo is the commander-in-chief of a country and the head of all the armed forces in the country.\n{Ina:} Take notes...Ah, so, that Archbishop Yingluck can use all the forces of the two countries to attack us?\n{Freeman:} So the situation is really bad now. The Kingdom of Barland is a militarist system, with a high proportion of its soldiers, and its strength is far higher than that of Kartia. If the troops of the two countries are united and a small city of Kozia, even if it is easy to defend and difficult to attack, it will not be able to defend it at all. This is nothing. What I worry most is that many people who have migrated from other places and expect to live a stable life here will suffer again.\n{Ina:} Then, without waiting for him to hit us, shall we take the initiative?\n{Freeman:} What do you mean by taking the initiative?\n{Ina:} Attack {Balland Kingdom} to see what happened there. Isn't it weird that they would let a person who was once a hostile country be the general marshal?\n{Freeman:} This is a good idea. Our strength is not strong, but our specialty is flexibility. If you defend in place, it is equivalent to giving up your strengths. Entering the territory of the Baland Kingdom, we can gain more space for activities. Even if the Archbishop Yingluck has thousands of troops, he does not necessarily catch us, but instead gives us all the opportunities to break through. At the same time, it burned the flames of war on the enemy's territory, avoiding large-scale battles here that would inflict civilians. Thank you Ina, you gave me a good idea.\n{Ina:} Huh? I didn't expect that much. I just thought it was weird and wanted to go to the Kingdom of Barand to see what happened.\n{Freeman:} Anyway, our goal is set, to cross {Nanling Pass} and head towards the Kingdom of Barland. Everyone is ready to go.","{侦察兵：}弗里曼王子殿下，不好了，大……大事件！\n{弗里曼：}什么事？英拉大主教来进攻了？\n{侦察兵：}不是。不过可能比这更糟。英拉大主教突然宣布，与巴兰德王国结成军事同盟，并且自己同时兼任两国的大元帅！\n{弗里曼：}这……的确很糟糕。多谢你的情报。我想想办法。\n{伊娜：}大元帅，这是什么职务？\n{弗里曼：}大元帅是一个国家的军事总指挥，是全国所有军队的首脑。\n{伊娜：}笔记下来……啊，这么说，那个英拉大主教，就可以使用两国全部的兵力来攻打我们了？\n{弗里曼：}所以说现在的局面确实很糟糕。巴兰德王国是军国主义体制，其军人比例很高，兵力远在卡尔提亚之上。如果合两国之兵，区区一个科齐亚城，即使仗着易守难攻的地利，也根本守不住。这倒还不算什么，我最担心的是，很多从其他地方迁移而来，指望在这里过安稳的生活的人们又要遭殃了。\n{伊娜：}那么，不等他来打我们，我们先主动出击吧？\n{弗里曼：}主动出击是指？\n{伊娜：}攻向{巴兰德王国}，去看看那里究竟发生了什么。他们居然会让一个曾经是敌对国的人担任大元帅，这不是很奇怪吗？\n{弗里曼：}这是个好主意。我们的兵力不强，但是特长是灵活机动。如果原地防守，反而是等于放弃了自己的长处。进入巴兰德王国的领地，我们可以获得更多的活动空间，英拉大主教纵使有千军万马，也不见得逮得着我们，反而给了我们各个击破的机会。同时又把战火烧到了敌人的地盘上，避免了在这里进行大规模战斗而连累平民。谢谢你伊娜，你给我出了个好点子。\n{伊娜：}咦？我没有想到那么多耶。我只是觉得很奇怪，想去巴兰德王国看个究竟。\n{弗里曼：}不管怎么说，我们的目标确定了，越过{南岭关}向巴兰德王国进发。大家作好准备就出发吧。\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Sea Dragon King:} I am afraid that the following king will have to trouble some of you for a favor, can you go to Silan Village to help this king clarify the facts? Tell them not to misunderstand this king again.\n{Ina:} But if we go to say it, I'm afraid they won't believe it. The villagers would definitely think that I was afraid of being eaten and fled back and made up such a lie. Is it better for Sea Dragon King to go there in person? Then they will believe it.\n{Sea Dragon King:} So it is. Then the king will clarify it himself. If it weren't for you to come today, I don't know how many years I will be kept in the dark, and I don't know how long I'm going to be in the dark. Anyway, I still want to thank you. Let me give you a thank you gift.\n{Ina:} Hey, I don't dare to be this one.\n{Sea Dragon King:} You are welcome. Twenty years ago, the king picked up a helmet that sank to the bottom of the sea. He knew it was a treasure at first glance, and he kept it in his possession. It's a pity that this helmet is made according to the size of a human head. This king's head is too big to be worn at all, so it's useless. It happens to be the first time a human visits this king's cave, this helmet will be given to you.\n{Ina:} Well, thank you so much, Sir Sea Dragon King.","{海龙王：}下面本王恐怕要麻烦几位帮个忙，你们能不能去史兰村帮本王澄清一下事实呢？叫他们不要再误会本王了。\n{伊娜：}不过，如果我们去说，恐怕他们不会相信吧。村民肯定会以为我是怕被吃掉逃回去又自编了这么个谎言。海龙王大人是不是亲自去一趟比较好？这样他们一定会相信的。\n{海龙王：}也是啊。那么等下本王就亲自去澄清好了。今天要不是你们来，本王还不知道多少年要被蒙在鼓里，还不知要背多久的黑锅，不管怎么说，还是要感谢你们。本王送你们一个谢礼吧。\n{伊娜：}咦，这个不敢当啦。\n{海龙王：}不必客气。二十年前，本王捡到了一个沉入海底的头盔，一看就知道是个宝贝，一直收藏着。可惜这头盔是按人类的脑袋大小制作的，本王脑袋太大，根本戴不上，所以也没什么用。正好，第一次有人类拜访本王的洞府，这头盔就送给你们好了。\n{伊娜：}这个，太感谢海龙王大人啦。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Sea Dragon King:} Ouch, it hurts! The king lost. Your little girl is so heavy, she doesn't know how to respect the elderly.\n{Ina:} I'm sorry. But otherwise, it seems that you won't listen to me.\n{Sea Dragon King:} Then if you have anything to say to this king, just say it.\n{Ina:} I'm here to ask about Silan Village. Why do you ask them to give you a girl to eat every year?\n{Sea Dragon King:} What is this and what?\n{Ina:} Still loading garlic. They told me that in order to pray for good weather, a young girl is presented to you as a tribute every year.\n{Sea Dragon King:} Go...what a joke. When did this king say such a request? Besides, how can this king have the ability to control the weather, when this king is a god? Those human beings are too superstitious, they pretend to worship blindly, and they put their hats on the king's head...\n{Ina:} Huh? How could this be? Is it a misunderstanding? ...\n{Sea Dragon King:} This is simply slander of this king!\n{Ina:} Oh, what should I do now, I originally prepared a lot of words to educate you not to do such injurious things...\n{Sea Dragon King:} Come here! ?a?aAh no, come to dragon! Call me the Director of Scouting.\n{Subordinate:} Yes! {Reconnaissance Minister:} Majesty, what's the order for the subordinate?\n{Sea Dragon King:} You can investigate for me, whether this little girl is talking about Shilan Village is true or not. {Ministry of Reconnaissance:} Back to the king, it's true.\n{Sea Dragon King:} Did you know before you go? {Captain of Reconnaissance:} In fact, his subordinates knew it a few years ago...\n{Sea Dragon King:} Then why didn't you tell this king? ! {Ministry of Reconnaissance:} The subordinates think that this is just the superstition of those human beings themselves, they are self-inflicted, and have nothing to do with us, so why bother with them. So these trivial things, the subordinates feel that they don't need to disturb the king...\n{Sea Dragon King:} Didn't you expect that this would make this king a scapegoat? As a result, the king was accused of notoriety out of nothing, and these people fiercely came to ask for explanations. If this rumor spreads, how will this king be in the rivers and lakes in the future? {Reconnaissance Minister:} Subordinates know their mistakes.\n{Sea Dragon King:} If you conceal something like this in the future, be careful of this king scratching your scales. {Reconnaissance Minister:} The subordinates dare not.\n{Sea Dragon King:} Okay, go down.","{海龙王：}哎哟，好痛！本王输了。你个小丫头居然下手那么重，一点都不懂得尊老。\n{伊娜：}对不起。可是不这样的话似乎你也不会听我说话。\n{海龙王：}那么你有什么话要跟本王说，你就说吧。\n{伊娜：}我是来问关于史兰村的事的。你为什么要求他们每年送一名少女给你吃啊？\n{海龙王：}这是什么跟什么？\n{伊娜：}还装蒜。他们告诉我，为了祈求风调雨顺，每年都要把一名少女作为贡礼献给你。\n{海龙王：}开……开什么玩笑。本王什么时候说过这种要求的。再说了，本王哪有本事控制天气，当本王是神啊？那些人类太迷信了，自作主张盲目崇拜，还把帽子扣到本王的头上……\n{伊娜：}唉？怎么会这样？难道是误会？……\n{海龙王：}这简直就是对本王的诬蔑！\n{伊娜：}哎呀呀，这下怎么办，我本来还准备了一大堆说词想教育你不要干这样伤天害理的事情的……\n{海龙王：}来人！——啊不，来龙！给我去叫侦察部长来。\n{部下：}是！\n{侦察部长：}大王，叫属下来有何吩咐？\n{海龙王：}你给我去调查一下，这个小丫头所说的史兰村的事情，是真是假。\n{侦察部长：}回大王，千真万确。\n{海龙王：}你还没去就知道了？\n{侦察队长：}其实属下几年前就知道了……\n{海龙王：}那怎么不告诉本王？！\n{侦察部长：}属下以为，这只是那些人类自己乱迷信罢了，他们自作自受，跟我们又不相干，何必去搭理他们。所以这等鸡毛蒜皮的小事，属下觉得不用打扰大王了……\n{海龙王：}你没想到这会让本王背黑锅吗？害得本王被扣上无中生有的恶名，被这些人气势汹汹地来讨说法。这谣言要是传开去，以后本王在江湖上怎么混啊？\n{侦察部长：}属下知错。\n{海龙王：}以后再碰到这类事情瞒而不报的话，小心本王刮你鳞片。\n{侦察部长：}属下不敢了。\n{海龙王：}好了，你下去吧。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Sea Dragon King:} Who? Break into the king's cave without permission? What a shame!\n{Ina:} Hey, are you the Sea Dragon King? I have something to tell you.\n{Sea Dragon King:} This king has no time to break with you, little girl! You are rude to enter this king's cave without permission. Let me teach you a lesson first!\n{Ina:} It's a virtue if you don't ask anything indiscriminately. I wanted to give a courtesy first and then soldiers, but it seems there is no way.","{海龙王：}什么人？擅自闯本王洞府？太不像话了！\n{伊娜：}咦，你就是海龙王？我有话要跟你说。\n{海龙王：}本王没空跟你这小丫头瞎掰！你未经许可随便闯本王洞府，太失礼了，先给你点教训！\n{伊娜：}什么也不问就不分青红皂白动手，怎么都一个德性。本想先礼后兵的，看来没办法啦。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Shaun:} This is Sean's private magic academy, which provides elementary magic learning.","{肖恩：}这里是肖恩私立魔法书院，提供初级魔法学习。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Shawn:} If you want to come in and study, please pay 1,000 gold coins.","{肖恩：}如果要进来学习，请付1000金币。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Shopping Department:} The price is already very low, and there is no more discount. There are still a lot of customers waiting in line. If you don't want to buy, please let us go first?","{小卖部：}已经是很低价了，不能再打折啦。后面排队的顾客还很多，您要是不买就先让一让好吗？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Skeleton:} You ask what is the relationship between skeleton and spirit? What is the name of the top piece of the skull? By the way, Tianling!","{骷髅：}你问骷髅跟灵有什么关系？骷髅最上面一块叫啥？对了，天灵！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Slander:} Little girl, I heard that the \"Dragonbone Greaves\" is in your hands, I'll confirm it specially.\n{Ina:} Are you Slander?\n{Slander:} So you know my name, so you should also know how good I am, and why don't you hand over the treasures obediently?\n{Ina:} I'm afraid you still don't know that you have been hit?\n{Slander:} What? Could it be that the thing is not in your hands? If you play tricks on me, you will even kill you!\n{Ina:} irritated and irritated. Ina-chan's omnipotent notebook has grandpa's famous saying that when a person is irritated, his strength will increase and his IQ will decrease. Then the opportunity is now.","{斯兰德：}小丫头，听说“龙骨胫甲”在你手里，我特地来确认一下。\n{伊娜：}你就是斯兰德吧？\n{斯兰德：}原来你知道我的大名啊，那么你也应该知道我有多厉害，还不乖乖交出宝物？\n{伊娜：}恐怕你还不知道你已经中计了吧？\n{斯兰德：}什么？难道说东西不在你手上？你要是耍我，更要杀了你！\n{伊娜：}激怒了激怒了。伊娜酱万能笔记本上有爷爷的名言，人在被激怒的时候，力量会上升，智商会下降。那么机会就是现在了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Soldiers:} Report, I am back from scouting.\n{Freeman:} How about? Did you find the hospital?\n{Soldiers:} I'm very sorry, there are no hospitals in this area, and some of them were destroyed and turned into ruins. They couldn't be used at all, and no doctor could be found.\n{Ina:} What should I do now, Sam is still awake, and there is no hospital to treat...\n{Freeman:} At least there is no life-threatening, there is no other way, but to take him first. . We will settle in him until when we return to our city.\n{Ina:} This can only be done, so let's move on...what's the matter, in this lake, I can't use the call boat, the boat soon sank into the water. There is a lake with no floating wood on the water...\n{Freeman:} This is the \"sand lake\". I have learned in geography class before. This is the first time I have visited such a lake where boats cannot float. Its environment.\n{Ina:} How can I get there now, can I only use water...","{士兵：}报告，我侦察回来了。\n{弗里曼：}怎么样？找到医院在哪里了吗？\n{士兵：}非常抱歉，这一带根本没有任何医院了，原来有的也都被破坏成了废墟，根本没法使用，也找不到医生。\n{伊娜：}这下怎么办哪，萨姆还昏睡不醒，居然没有医院可以治疗……\n{弗里曼：}至少没有生命危险，眼下没有别的办法，只能先把他带着了。直到什么时候我们回到自己的城市里再安顿他吧。\n{伊娜：}也只能这样了，那么我们继续前进吧……怎么回事，这个湖里，我使用召船都不行呢，船很快就沉到水里去了。竟然有水上不能浮木头的湖……\n{弗里曼：}这就是“沉沙湖”吧，以前我在地理课上学到过，有这么一个船只无法浮起的湖，还是第一次身临其境。\n{伊娜：}这下怎么渡过去呢，只能用水行了吗……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Soldiers:} We are the Terracia Special Police Force. Please show Terracia ID card or foreign passport.\n{Rael:} I don't have such a certificate.\n{Ina:} I don't have any. Our village just has so few people, so I don't need to issue any certificates.\n{Freeman:} I do have a passport, but if you take it out, I'm afraid it will cause trouble.\n{Soldiers:} None of you can show your credentials, so you can only take all of you off.\n{Ina:} Hey, this is too strict, right?\n{Soldiers:} Don't blame us, there are demons moving around in Terracia recently, and we must strengthen our defenses. If you are really not spies of the demons, you will naturally be released after interrogation.\n{Freeman:} Terracia's legal procedures are very cumbersome. A case often lasts for a month at the first trial. We are afraid we can't afford this time.\n{Ina:} This is not enough.\n{Rael:} What do you plan to do, is it...\n{Ina:} Of course, sir, sorry, we are in a hurry, if you don't let it go, then you can only force it.","{士兵：}我们是泰拉西亚特警队，请出示泰拉西亚身份证或者外国护照。\n{雷尔：}我没有这样的证件啊。\n{伊娜：}我也没有耶，我们村就那么点人，哪还用发什么证件。\n{弗里曼：}护照我倒是有，只是，如果拿出来看，恐怕会造成麻烦。\n{士兵：}你们一个都不能出示证件，那么只能把你们全部拿下了。\n{伊娜：}喂，这个，也太严格了吧？\n{士兵：}不要怪我们，最近有魔族在泰拉西亚四处活动，我们必须加强防范。如果你们真不是魔族的间谍，经过审讯自然会释放你们。\n{弗里曼：}泰拉西亚的法律程序很繁琐，一个案子常常一审就是个把月的，我们怕是拖不起这个时间啊。\n{伊娜：}这样可不行啊。\n{雷尔：}你打算怎么办，莫非又是……\n{伊娜：}当然了，各位长官，对不住，我们有急事，你们不放行，那就只能硬闯啦。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Soldiers:} We are the Terracia Special Police Team...\n{Ina:} Sorry, I borrowed, I borrowed...","{士兵：}我们是泰拉西亚特警队……\n{伊娜：}抱歉，借过，借过……"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Soldiers:} We are the Terracia Special Police Team...\n{Ina:} There is no need to explain anything, so I just rushed over.","{士兵：}我们是泰拉西亚特警队……\n{伊娜：}不用解释什么了，干脆利落地冲过去。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Soldiers:} Your Royal Highness Prince Freeman, we are unwilling to be slaves to Archbishop Yingluck. We have fled here. Please let us join.","{士兵：}弗里曼王子殿下，我们不愿意做英拉大主教的奴仆，逃到了这里，请让我们加入吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Sorry:}... I repeat it again below. As a result of illicit liaison with the enemy, Prince Freeman betrayed the important intelligence of the Kingdom of Kartia to attract the enemy's army into the country and caused heavy casualties to our army and civilians. His actions have constituted treason. Therefore, the Chinese government has issued a national arrest warrant for Prince Freeman who is currently at large. Anyone who can capture Prince Freeman will be rewarded with 100,000 gold coins. If effective clues can be provided, 20,000 gold coins will be awarded. If there is a shelter, it will be punished as treason.","{差人：}……下面再重复一遍。弗里曼王子由于私通敌国，出卖我卡尔提亚王国重要情报引敌国军队入境，并让我国军队和平民遭受重大伤亡，其行为已构成叛国罪。因此我国政府对于目前在逃的弗里曼王子发出全国通缉令，任何人如能捉拿弗里曼王子归案的，奖励100000金币。如能提供有效线索的，奖励20000金币。如有包庇者，一并以叛国罪论处。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Steward:} The tea is ready, everyone, please use it slowly.\n{Freeman:} It really is Zixian tea, it is known as the best of the fairy in tea...\n{Ina:} Jack is so knowledgeable, I know everything, I don't understand this...\n{Steward:} I'm afraid this It's not a question of understanding or not. This is a treasure that ordinary people have never had a chance to taste in a lifetime. If you don't know, it can only show that your status is humble.\n{Rody:} Hey, Uncle Crowder, don't be rude to your guests.\n{Housekeeper:} Sorry. It's just that this guest didn't even know how to use the doorbell, so I feel...\n{Ina:} Aha, that, I've never seen such a big mansion before, especially when I just entered Belentania. The place where there are are some simple houses, the contrast is so big that you can't adapt to it...\n{Rody:} Ha ha, I don't know if I should be proud or ashamed...\n{Ina:} Just this gate alone It's too high to see the top... Hey, there is a plaque on the door with words...\n{Steward:} That plaque is the proudest thing of our Li Qide family. This is the poem given to us by the great poet Wu De when he came to our family as a guest. You see, hanging in the middle of this courtyard, you can see clearly outside the courtyard.\n{Ina:} So there is a background...\n{Steward:} I will read to you: Zhu Yuan, a hundred feet in the sky, and a half-step golden jade brick, the world's precious gems gather in all directions in my home\n{Ina:} Uh, it turns out that the poem was read vertically, I thought it was read horizontally...\n{Freeman:} Indeed, according to Milronia's writing habits, it is generally written horizontally, and it's really rare to write it vertically... ?-\n{Raier:} The poems of Wu De I saw on the \"Wangxiang Stone\" before were also written horizontally...\n{Steward:} Wu De, when he wrote the poem, wrote it vertically, of course. Read it. Besides, how could it be possible to read horizontally, reading horizontally is...\n{Ina:} The pig-headed family.\n{Steward:} You! Hugh is rude!\n{Ina:} I just read a sentence horizontally. But now I finally understand how the people's term came from.\n{Freeman:} Of course the people don't know how to read it vertically, it must be read horizontally. Maybe the original intention of Wu De when he wrote this poem was satire...\n{Steward:} Hugh is nonsense! No, no! I have to go and take this plaque down...\n{Rody:} No, no, let it hang.\n{Steward:} Young Master! This...\n{Rody:} The people have a lot of criticism of our family, and I know this. This is a debt left to me by my grandparents. Since I have inherited this family business, of course I have to inherit this debt and work hard to repay it. This plaque reflects the opinions of the people on us and should be kept as a warning to ourselves.\n{Freeman:} Debt? This refers to...\n{Rody:} People lost in order to gather money. I don't approve of my father doing that, but before I took charge of the family, I didn't have the ability to change the situation. My father is very stubborn. If I disagree with his will, I will even be punished physically. Take the tsunami two years ago as an example. Why did my father refuse to donate. Later, I secretly ran and donated 1 million gold coins...\n{Ina:} Ah, it turns out that the anonymous person is you?\n{Rody:} If you are not anonymous, let my father know and I don't know how to kill me...\n{Ina:} If everyone knows that it is you, maybe the view of your family can be slightly changed.\n{Rody:} Take this slowly. After all, now I have ushered in my own era, and I have the obligation to reshape the image of the family. Therefore, I decided to keep this plaque to motivate myself.\n{Ina:} As ambitious as Jack, I support you!\n{Freeman:} I can't compare, but what's more important now, Ina, our purpose is to...\n{Ina:} Oh, I almost forgot the most important thing. We want to buy a treasure called \"Longan Ring\". I heard that it is now in the hands of your family.\n{Rody:} \"Longan Ring\", indeed it was in our hands...\n{Rael:} \"Once\", that is, no longer?\n{Rody:} Well, I was bought by two people from {Snow Mountain Island} a few days ago.\n{Ina:} Ah, one step too late!\n{Voice:} So it's really troublesome on Snow Mountain Island...\n{Rael:} Who! ? {Voice:} What a mess! I accidentally said it...\n{Ina:} Someone is eavesdropping over there! You are... the demons who escaped at the performance venue before!\n{Mozu:} I was...recognized...\n{Ina:} So you have been eavesdropping on us...\n{Rael:} I won't let you run away again this time!\n{Steward:} Master Young Master, run away, there is something underneath... Ouch!\n{Ina:} Leave it to us, we will ensure Roddy's safety. Uncle housekeeper, you are not young anymore, and your hands and feet are not dexterous, so don't be aggressive.\n{Rael:} This guy still wants to run, and went to {west}. Ina, let's catch him!","{管家：}茶好了，各位请慢用。\n{弗里曼：}果然是紫仙茶呢，号称茶中仙子的极品啊……\n{伊娜：}杰克真渊博啊，什么都知道，我是不懂这些啦……\n{管家：}恐怕这不是懂不懂的问题，这是一般庶民一辈子都没机会品尝到的珍品，你不知道只能说明你的身份低微。\n{罗迪：}哎，克罗德叔叔，对客人不得无礼。\n{管家：}对不起。只是这位客人之前连门铃都不懂得使用，所以在下觉得……\n{伊娜：}啊哈，那个，我从没见过这么大的豪宅啦，特别是之前刚刚进入贝伦塔尼亚时经过的地方都是些简陋的房子，反差大得一下子有点适应不了……\n{罗迪：}呵呵，不知道我是该自豪呢，还是该羞愧呢……\n{伊娜：}光是这个大门就高得见不着顶了……咦，门上有个牌匾上面有字呢……\n{管家：}那块牌匾可是我们李奇德家族最自豪的东西了。这是当年大诗人舞德来我们家族作客时，赠给我们的诗啊。你看，挂在这门庭正中，在庭园之外都能看得清清楚楚。\n{伊娜：}原来这么有来头啊……\n{管家：}在下来给你们念念：\n\n朱垣百尺云霄汉\n投足半步金玉砖\n世间珍瑰八方聚\n家中琦璃四海全\n\n{伊娜：}呃，原来这诗是竖着念的啊，我还以为是横着念的……\n{弗里曼：}确实，按米尔罗尼亚的书写习惯，一般是横写，竖写的还真少见……\n{雷尔：}之前在“望乡石”上看到的舞德的诗也是横写的……\n{管家：}舞德他老人家在题诗的时候就是竖着写的，当然是竖着念了。再说横着念怎么可能读得通，横着念是……\n{伊娜：}猪头世家。\n{管家：}你！休得无礼！\n{伊娜：}我只是横着念了一句而已。不过这下总算明白民众使用的这个称呼是怎么来的了。\n{弗里曼：}民众当然不会知道竖着念，肯定是横着念的啦。说不定舞德老人家写这首诗的本意就是讽刺……\n{管家：}休得胡说！不行不行！得赶快去把这牌匾取下来……\n{罗迪：}不，不必了，还是让它挂着吧。\n{管家：}少主大人！这……\n{罗迪：}民众对我们家族颇有微词，这一点我是知道的。这是祖辈父辈给我留下的债务。既然我继承了这家业，当然也要继承下这笔债务，努力去偿还它。这块牌匾，反映了民众对我们的意见，应该留着，用以警示自己。\n{弗里曼：}债务？这是指……\n{罗迪：}为了敛聚钱财而失去的人心。我并不赞成父亲那样做，但是在我掌管家族之前，我并没有这个能力去改变状况。父亲十分顽固，如果我对他的意志有异议甚至会被体罚。就拿两年前的大海啸来说，父亲是怎么也不肯捐款，我后来只能偷偷自己跑去捐了100万金币……\n{伊娜：}啊，原来那个匿名人士就是你？\n{罗迪：}如果不匿名的话，让父亲知道了还不知道要怎么样打死我呢……\n{伊娜：}如果大家知道是你的话，也许对你们家族的看法能稍稍改观一些。\n{罗迪：}这个慢慢来吧。毕竟现在我迎来了自己的时代，我有这个义务重塑家族的形象。所以，这个牌匾，我决定留着，用以激励自己。\n{伊娜：}跟杰克一样的雄心壮志啊，我支持你！\n{弗里曼：}我是比不上啦，不过现在更重要的是，伊娜，我们来这里的目的是……\n{伊娜：}哎呀，差点把最重要的事情忘了呢。我们是想来买一件叫做“龙眼戒”的宝物的，听说它现在在你们家族的手里。\n{罗迪：}“龙眼戒”啊，的确它曾经是在我们手里……\n{雷尔：}“曾经”，就是说，现在不在了？\n{罗迪：}嗯，几天前被两个来自{雪山岛}的人买走了。\n{伊娜：}啊，来晚了一步！\n{声音：}原来在雪山岛啊，真是麻烦……\n{雷尔：}谁！？\n{声音：}糟了！不小心说出口了……\n{伊娜：}那边有人在偷听！你是……之前在公演会场逃走的那个魔族！\n{魔族：}被……被认出来了……\n{伊娜：}原来你一直在偷听我们……\n{雷尔：}这次不会再让你逃走了！\n{管家：}少主大人，您快逃，这里有在下顶着……哎哟！\n{伊娜：}还是交给我们吧，我们会确保罗迪的安全的。管家大叔您年纪也不小了，手脚也不灵便，还是别逞强了吧。\n{雷尔：}这家伙还想跑，往{西面}去了。伊娜，我们抓住他！\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Suspicious character:} Don't stare at me, there's nothing written on my face, right?\n{Ina:} Are you guilty?\n{Suspicious character:} I am not guilty, I definitely did not steal pigs, I did not steal!\n{Ina:} I haven't said that you stole the pig, so you won't confess yourself. I just think you look very similar to this painting, so I want to confirm if it's you. Since you have done all the tricks, just go back with us. Of course, if you want to fight first and have to be beaten to find teeth before you can honestly follow us back, I don't mind.\n{Suspicious character:} Don't hit me! I'll just go with you. Forgive me, I was forced to steal things too, I am not a habitual offender. It's just that I ran out of money, I was hungry for a day, and I couldn't help it, so I did this kind of thing...\n{Ina:} Seeing that you have healthy limbs and plenty of energy, why don't you work to earn money if you have no money? It's delicious and lazy, it's easy to work, it's time to fight!\n{Thief:} Don't hit me! I was wrong. I was wrong! After entering the prison, I will honestly work for compensation...\n{Ina:} What about the pig you stole? Also hand it over.\n{Thief:} That... the pig has been eaten by me.\n{Ina:} Huh? Already eaten?\n{Thief:} I'm really hungry.\n{Ina:} What about the family who was stolen by you? You ate the pig, how can you pay for it?\n{Thief:} I should be able to make it up after a month's work.\n{Ina:} People are very poor, how can I wait for you for a month... Forget it, I will think of a way to see if I can {get a pig and return it}.","{可疑人物：}你们不要盯着我看，我脸上没写着什么吧？\n{伊娜：}你心虚了？\n{可疑人物：}我才不心虚，我绝对没有偷猪，没有偷！\n{伊娜：}我还没说你偷猪呢，你就不打自招了。我只是觉得你长得跟这张画上很像而已，所以想确认一下是不是你。既然你招都招了，就跟我们回去吧。当然，如果你想先打一架，要被揍得满地找牙才肯老实跟我们回去的话，我也不介意。\n{可疑人物：}不要打我啊！我跟你们走就是了。原谅我，我也是迫不得已才偷东西的，我不是惯犯啊。只是钱花光了，饿了一天了，没办法，才做了这种事情……\n{伊娜：}看你四肢健全，体力充沛，没钱了为什么不工作挣钱呢？好吃懒做，好逸恶劳，该打！\n{窃贼：}不要打我啊！我错了我错了！进了大牢我会老老实实做工补偿……\n{伊娜：}那你偷的猪呢？也交出来啊。\n{窃贼：}那个……猪已经被我吃了。\n{伊娜：}啊？已经被吃了？\n{窃贼：}我实在是饿坏了嘛。\n{伊娜：}被你偷的那家人怎么办啊？你把猪吃了，怎么赔人家？\n{窃贼：}我作一个月工应该能补回来吧。\n{伊娜：}人家很穷的，哪里能等你一个月……算了，我再想想办法，看能不能{弄一只猪去还给他们}。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{The Secretary:} Are you here to participate in the knowledge contest? Then listen to the preparatory questions first. After answering the preparatory questions correctly, you will get the mascot \"Wish Star Bird\" of an academic conference, so you can continue to participate in the subsequent competition activities. Preliminary question: What kind of dragon will definitely eat blindness magic?","{司会：}您是来参加知识竞答的吗？那么首先听好预备题哦。答对了预备题之后，您将可以获得一个学术大会的吉祥物“星愿鸟”，从而继续参加后面的竞答活动。\n\n预备题：\n哪一种龙肯定会吃失明魔法？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{The Secretary:} If you can't answer, you can go directly to the real object and try it out.","{司会：}如果答不出来的话，你可以直接去找实物试验一下。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{The man in black:} So amazing, I didn't expect my dignified Black Tiger agent to lose to a little girl.\n{Ina:} Not convinced?\n{Man in black:} I failed but died. However, Calterra is already under the close monitoring of our Black Tiger agent team, and you have no chance to escape. I just went to Huangquan to wait for you for a while, wow hahaha~~~~! Long live Archbishop Yingluck! The man in black yelled slogans and killed himself.\n{Ina:} Hey, why did you die like this? I want to torture some information.\n{Freeman:} These people are secret agents trained by Archbishop Yingluck. They are very loyal to Archbishop Yingluck. Even if they are tortured, they will not confess any information. I've heard the name of \"Black Tiger Agents\" a long time ago, but I have never seen a real person. I didn't expect these guys to set fire to my death.\n{Ina:} So the conclusion that Archbishop Yingluck is your mastermind is correct at all.\n{Freeman:} But as he said just now, the Black Tigers have fully controlled Calterra, and now we think of going to the beach may not be so easy. However, now that there is no way out, Ina, can you help me? If you encounter someone from the Black Tiger Agents.\n{Ina:} No problem. Look at this guy just now, isn't it easy to get it done.\n{Freeman:} This is just a pawn. There are still a lot of capable people in the Black Tiger agent team, and they won't be so easy to deal with.\n{Ina:} Although they may be great, but I will work hard.","{黑衣人：}好厉害，没想到我堂堂黑虎特工队员竟然输给一个小丫头。\n{伊娜：}不服气吗？\n{黑衣人：}我失败了只是死而已。不过卡尔泰拉已经在我们黑虎特工队的密切监控之下，你们根本没有机会逃出去的。我只是先去黄泉等你们一阵而已，哇哈哈哈~~~~！英拉大主教万岁！\n\n黑衣人喊着口号切腹自尽了。\n\n{伊娜：}喂喂，怎么就这样死了，我还想拷问点情报呢。\n{弗里曼：}这些人是英拉大主教秘密训练的亲信特工，对英拉大主教忠诚得很，就算严刑拷打也不会招供任何情报的。“黑虎特工队”的名号我很早就听过了，只是从没见过真人，没想到放火想烧死我的人就是这些家伙。\n{伊娜：}所以英拉大主教就是谋害你的主谋的结论一点都没错。\n{弗里曼：}但是他刚才也说了，黑虎特工队已经全面控制了卡尔泰拉，这下我们想到海边去恐怕不会那么容易了。不过，既然到了这里，已经没有退路了，伊娜你能帮我吗？如果遇到黑虎特工队的人。\n{伊娜：}没问题。看刚才这家伙不就很容易搞定了嘛。\n{弗里曼：}这只是一个小卒而已。黑虎特工队里还是有不少能人的，不会这么好对付。\n{伊娜：}虽然他们也许很厉害，不过，我会努力的。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Thief:} Hey, the people who are coming, stop for me. Ask something, do you know where Ina is?\n{Ina:} I am Ina, what are you looking for?\n{Thief:} The Prime Minister is offering a reward of 100,000 gold coins for your head. Hey, if I kill you, not only will I be able to make a fortune, but I may also be able to work as an official and a half at the hands of the Prime Minister, and I won't have to be a mountain thief anymore.\n{Ina:} No, even the thieves are on my mind.\n{Freeman:} A very good move to mobilize the masses, the guy in Houlia has a difficult mind.\n{Ina:} However, these mobs are too big to defeat me.","{盗贼：}喂，正在过来的人马，给我站住。问个事情，你们知道伊娜在哪里吗？\n{伊娜：}我就是伊娜，你找我什么事？\n{盗贼：}宰相大人悬赏十万金币要你的人头，嘿嘿，如果我把你干掉了，不但能发财，而且说不定能到宰相手下混个一官半职，再也不用做山野盗贼了。\n{伊娜：}不是吧，连盗贼都打上我的主意了。\n{弗里曼：}很不错的一招发动群众，霍利亚那家伙的心眼不简单。\n{伊娜：}不过，这群乌合之众，想打倒我也未免太托大了。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Thief:} You guys, stop and hand over your property!\n{Ina:} Huh? who are you?\n{Rogue:} Unexpectedly, we don't know us, we are a powerful robbery from all directions {Longyashan heroes}.\n{Ina:} Cut, it's just a bunch of robbers after all.\n{Thief:} It is really an insult to us to compare us with ordinary robbers! Brothers, come on!","{盗贼：}你们，停下，把财物交出来！\n{伊娜：}啊？你们是谁？\n{盗贼：}居然不知道我们，我们是威震八方的劫贫济富{龙牙山好汉}。\n{伊娜：}切，说到底只是一帮强盗而已。\n{盗贼：}竟然把我们跟一般的强盗相提并论，这真是对我们莫大的侮辱！弟兄们，上！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Tree Fairy:} Prohibit indiscriminate logging and protect the ecological environment!","{树妖：}禁止滥采滥伐，保护生态环境！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Uncle Charlie:} \"God's boots\". You have been lying in the shoe cabinet for twelve years, and finally you can meet the master who appreciates you. Now you can follow your new master.","{查理大叔：}“神行靴”啊。你在鞋柜里躺了十二年，终于能遇到赏识你的主人了。现在你就跟着你的新主人去吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Uncle Charlie:} Guest, you really have a hand, you really got the \"mane of the beast\". I didn't see the wrong person. Then the shoes are here, please.","{查理大叔：}客人您果然有一手，真把“神兽之鬃”弄到了。我果然没看错人。那么鞋就在这边，请吧。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Uncle Charlie:} Welcome to Uncle Charlie's boutique shoe store.\n{Ina:} Uncle Charlie, where did I hear this name? I flipped through my notes... Ah, I found it. I saw your ad on an island.\n{Uncle Charlie:} It turns out that the guests came here based on my advertisement. It's a great honor. So what kind of shoes do customers want?\n{Ina:} What kind of shoes do you have?\n{Uncle Charlie:} I have everything I have for what kind of shoes, you just pick. If you have special needs, you can also ask them.\n{Ina:} I am not very interested in shoes, but if there are shoes that can make me run faster, I would be a little interested.\n{Uncle Charlie:} Your guest, you are really extraordinary, and you immediately put forward such a high-end demand. I really have a pair of shoes that can run faster.\n{Ina:} Really? How much does it cost?\n{Uncle Charlie:} It's not a question of money. There is only one pair of shoes. Twelve years ago, I also had a chance to save a wounded unicorn under a cliff. The unicorn gave me thanks to me. He gave me a mane, and with that mane I sew out the pair of shoes with magical power.\n{Ina:} In this case, I won't bother you to cut love.\n{Uncle Charlie:} Shoes exist to appreciate the people who make good use of them, not to lie in the shoe cabinet for a lifetime. I have opened this store for more than 20 years, and for the first time someone asked me about this demand. I think that maybe it's time to find the owner of that pair of shoes. Although I am still a little bit reluctant. Or else, if you can get me another {\"Shen Beast}{mane\"}, I will give you that pair of shoes, how about it?","{查理大叔：}欢迎光临查理大叔精品鞋店。\n{伊娜：}查里大叔，这名字好像在哪里听过，我翻翻笔记……啊，找到了，我在一个岛上见过你的广告。\n{查理大叔：}原来客人是根据我的广告找上门来的呀，真是荣幸。那么客人想要什么样的鞋呢？\n{伊娜：}你有什么样的鞋呢？\n{查理大叔：}我这里是什么样的鞋都应有尽有，您只管挑。如果有特别的需要，也可以提出来。\n{伊娜：}我本来对鞋也不是很感兴趣啦，不过，要是有能让我跑得更快的鞋的话，我倒是会有点兴趣。\n{查理大叔：}客人您果然不同凡响，一下就提出了这么高档的需求。要说能跑得更快的鞋，我倒还真有一双。\n{伊娜：}真有？要多少钱呢？\n{查理大叔：}倒不是钱的问题，那鞋只有一双，十二年前，我也是一次偶然的机会，在一个山崖下救了一只受伤的独角兽，独角兽为了感谢我，送给了我一条它的鬃毛，用那鬃毛我才缝出了那双带有神奇力量的鞋。\n{伊娜：}既然这样，我也就不麻烦你割爱啦。\n{查理大叔：}鞋是为了赏识它善用它的人而存在的，而不是为了一辈子躺在鞋柜里。我开这店也有二十多年了，第一次有人向我提出这个需求，我想，那双鞋也许真的到了找到它的主人的时候了。虽然我还是有点不舍。要不这样吧，如果客人您能再给我弄到一条{“神兽之}{鬃”}，我就把那双鞋给您，怎么样？"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Venue Receptionist:} Welcome to the \"Snow Love Cup\" academic conference venue at Star Wish Mountain University. If you are here to participate in the academic conference, please show your membership card or guest card. If you are only here to observe, please do not enter the venue area. There is a special audience area on the outside square that provides real-time video broadcast.","{会场接待员：}欢迎来到星愿山大学的“雪恋杯”学术大会会场。如果您是来参加学术大会的，请出示会员证或嘉宾证，如果您只是来观摩的，请不要进入会场区，外面广场上有专门的观客区，提供实时视频直播。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Venue receptionist:} This badge is indeed a membership card, please come in.","{会场接待员：}这个徽章的确是会员证，请进。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Vido:} This, can you make it easier for me?\n{Ina:} Do you want to take the opportunity to escape?\n{Vido:} I really want to make it easier, please, be convenient with others...\n{Ina:} If it is true, then I have to look at you to prevent you from escaping.\n{Vido:} You really look so disgusting...\n{Ina:} Hey! How can you say that...\n{Vido:} Want to see me conveniently, voyeuristic, perverted!\n{Ina:} Too much, you keep holding back for me!\n{Vido:} Sorry, I was wrong. I'm just behind the big tree over there, just for a while, it doesn't matter, I can't get away even if I want to run, right?\n{Ina:} Hmm... {Vido:} Alright, well, I'll go, I promise it will be fine in a little while... Widow ran to the back of the big tree in small steps, but after a while, he still didn't see it.\n{Ina:} Sorry, he didn't really run away, right? Ah, it's gone! How did he run away, could he fly...huh? Is there a noise in the tree? Could it be that he climbed up the tree? An angel got out of the branches of the tree and jumped to the ground.\n{Ina:} Huh, Roland? Why are you here...\n{Roland:} I heard that you have obtained the 8 parts of the \"Dragon King Divine Power\", can you show me?\n{Ina:} Cut, you are Vido changeable again, too fake... Suddenly disappeared from behind the tree, and then drilled out of the tree, you think I am stupid, you can't see it...\n{Roland :} Who is Widow?\n{Ina:} Stop pretending to be garlic!\n{Roland:} I don't understand what you are talking about, I am Roland... While the two were talking, a sharp sword fell from the sky and pierced Roland's chest. Roland vomited blood and fell to the ground, recovering Vidor's appearance.\n{Ina:} Sure enough, it's dimensional changeable, I guess I didn't guess it wrong. Hello, are you okay, won't you just die like this? Wouldn't you feign death? Ah, the one above is... Above the sky, an angel slowly descended.\n{Ina:} Roland! Is it true this time...\n{Roland:} I heard that a guy pretended to be me and deceived Mengying and captured her. I chased him all the way and finally let me find him. He didn't expect him to deceive you. My sword has the attribute of \"Rain of Holy Light\", which can break the suspended animation, and now he can't survive with great abilities.\n{Ina:} But we are asking him to take us to rescue sister Mengying who is locked on this island. He said that only he can unlock the mechanism there... If he hangs up, what should I do next...\n{ Roland:} This... he is deceiving... how could it be possible that only he can unlock it... Don't believe him, this island is not big, we should be able to easily find the detention location, and then I will break the mechanism.\n{Ina:} Well, that's all there is.","{维多：}这个，能不能让我去方便一下？\n{伊娜：}你是想趁机逃跑吧？\n{维多：}我真的是想方便一下，求求你啦，与人方便自己方便……\n{伊娜：}如果是真的，那也得看着你，防止你逃跑。\n{维多：}你真色，讨厌啦……\n{伊娜：}喂！你怎么可以这样说……\n{维多：}想看我方便，偷窥狂，变态！\n{伊娜：}太过份了，你给我一直憋着！\n{维多：}对不起，是我错了啦。我就在那边那棵大树后面，就一小会儿，不要紧吧，想跑也跑不掉，对不对？\n{伊娜：}唔……\n{维多：}好啦好啦，我去啦，保证一小会儿就好……\n\n维多小碎步跑到大树后面，可是过了好一会儿仍不见出来。\n\n{伊娜：}糟了，他不会是真的跑了吧？啊，不见了！怎么跑掉的啊，难道他会飞……嗯？树上有响动？莫非是爬到树上去了？\n\n一个天使从树上枝叶里钻了出来，跳到地上。\n\n{伊娜：}啊，罗兰？你怎么会在这儿……\n{罗兰：}我听说你们得到了“龙王神力”的8个部件了，能不能让我看看？\n{伊娜：}切，你又是维多变的吧，太假了……突然从树后消失，然后从树上钻出来，你以为我傻的啊，这都看不出来……\n{罗兰：}维多是谁？\n{伊娜：}少给我装蒜了！\n{罗兰：}我不明白你在说什么，我是罗兰啊……\n\n两人正在说话间，一柄利剑从天而降，一下子刺穿了罗兰的胸膛。罗兰吐血倒地，恢复了维多的外形。\n\n{伊娜：}果然是维多变的，看我没猜错吧。喂喂，你没事吧，不会就这么断气了吧？你不是会假死吗？啊，上面的是……\n\n上空，一个天使缓缓降下。\n\n{伊娜：}罗兰！这次是真的吧……\n{罗兰：}听说有个家伙冒充我欺骗了梦影抓走了她，我一路追来，终于让我找到他了，没想到他还想欺骗你们。我的剑带有“圣光之雨”的属性，能破除假死，这下他再有天大的本事也活不过来了。\n{伊娜：}可是我们正要他带我们去救关在这个岛上的梦影姐姐，他说那里的机关只有他能解开耶……他挂了的话，下面该怎么办呢……\n{罗兰：}这个……他骗人的吧……怎么可能会只有他能解开呢……不要相信他，这个岛不大，我们应该能很容易找到关押地点，然后我来把机关破除。\n{伊娜：}好吧，也只有这样了。\n\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice A:} Brother, do those traps you set really work?\n{Voice B:} Although I can be sure that Ladia is near this area, it is still a bit big here, and it is not easy to catch her, so I came up with such a clever way to cover this area. Various organs, so that once Radia appears and touches a certain organ, we can catch her.\n{Voice A:} But I just caught only one bear...\n{Voice B:} This is just a mistake! Accidental mistake! After that, I will write the words \"There is a trap here, don't go near\" next to the trap, so that those dumb bears won't touch it.\n{Voice A:} Can the bear understand? I think that if you write this way, Ladia will understand it before the bear...\n{Voice B:} Your brother, I have learned the bear language. I have no problem writing in bear language!\n{Voice A:} But, as far as I know, Xiongyu seems to have no words.\n{Voice B:} Well, this is a question, or else put a recording next to each trap? No, no, the cost is too high...\n{Voice A:} Actually, brother, I think the main problem is not here. Radia can fly just like us, will she encounter those organs? Will you fall into a trap?\n{Voice B:} Fuck me! Why didn't you say it earlier! Then the traps we set up before are all in vain!\n{Voice A:} I just saw that you are very motivated and you look confident, thinking that you have considered all kinds of issues...\n{Voice B:} If you consider it, Thor's helmet will still be stolen ?\n{Voice A:} That's right, my brother hid the Thor's helmet on the fifth floor and removed all the stairs. I thought it was safe. I didn't expect Radia would fly...\n{Voice B:} Okay. Okay, don't talk about it. Then there is no need to set up any traps now. Let's continue to look for it separately. We have searched the east to here, and then you go to the northwest to find it, I will go to the southwest. No matter who finds it first, send a flare immediately.\n{Voice A:} Got it, brother.\n{Rael:} Who was talking with that voice just now? So loud.\n{Freeman:} It's really loud, I can't see the figure, I just heard it from a long distance.\n{Ina:} These are the two guys chasing Radia. Their voices are very loud. The previous time, I heard them all in the air, and they were clear. ?a?aNo, they are catching Radia, we have to stop them as soon as possible.","{声音A：}老哥啊，你布置的那些陷阱，真的会管用么？\n{声音B：}虽然可以确信拉迪亚就在这一带附近，但是这里地方还是大了点，想要抓住她不容易，所以我才想出这么个巧妙的办法，在这一带都布上各种机关，这样一旦拉迪亚出现了，触到了某个机关，我们就可以把她抓到。\n{声音A：}可是刚刚明明只抓到一头熊……\n{声音B：}这只是失误！偶然的失误！之后我都会在陷阱旁边写上“此处有陷阱，勿靠近”的字样，这样那些笨熊就不会碰了。\n{声音A：}熊能看得懂吗？我倒觉得这么写的话拉迪亚会比熊先看懂……\n{声音B：}你老哥我学过熊语的，我用熊语写就没问题了！\n{声音A：}可是，据我所知，熊语好像没有文字啊。\n{声音B：}嗯，这是个问题，要不然每个陷阱旁边放个录音？不行不行，成本太高了……\n{声音A：}其实啊老哥，我觉得最主要的问题还不在这里。拉迪亚跟我们一样会飞啊，她会碰得到那些机关么？会掉入陷阱么？\n{声音B：}我靠！你怎么不早说！那我们之前布置的陷阱不都白忙活了么！\n{声音A：}我只是看到老哥你干劲十足，看上去又很有把握的样子，以为已经考虑到各种问题了……\n{声音B：}要是考虑到的话，雷神盔还会被偷吗？\n{声音A：}也是啊，老哥把雷神盔藏在五楼上，还把楼梯都拆了，觉得这样就很安全了，没想到拉迪亚也会飞……\n{声音B：}好了好了，别说了。那么现在也不用再布置什么陷阱了。我们两个继续分头找吧。东边到这里为止我们都搜过了，接下来你往西北方向去找吧，我就往西南方向。不管谁先找到，立即发信号弹。\n{声音A：}知道了，老哥。\n\n{雷尔：}刚才那声音是谁在说话？好响亮。\n{弗里曼：}真是响，看不到人影，只是从老远就听见了。\n{伊娜：}这就是追拉迪亚的那两个家伙。他们声音是很大的，之前一次就是，他们在老高老高的空中的说话，我都听到了，而且清清楚楚。——不好，他们在抓拉迪亚呢，我们得尽快去阻止他们。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice A:} General Drake, is this really good? Would you like your subordinate to run for you?\n{Voice B:} No, ignore him. That guy Spin Rodrie, play us like monkeys all the way to the west. When he was here a few days ago, he didn't say anything, he went back to {Eldria} after playing around. At this moment, I had to work hard and finally gave the \"Purple Spirit Shield\" to Solo. The adults sent it, and he actually asked me to send him the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" again. If he didn't deliberately trick us, why didn't he ask us to send it together when he was here.\n{Voice A:} General Spane Rodri also said that he didn't expect General Drake to get the \"Purple Spirit Shield\" so quickly, so it was just a momentary negligence.\n{Voice B:} It was his fault anyway, I don't care. Master Solo will not blame me if he is anxious. Why is he lazy to let us run errands for him? When Master Solo urges him, it will be up to him whether he will go or not.\n{Voice A:} So, what about this \"Navy Outpost Pass\" given by General Spane Rodri?\n{Voice B:} Let's keep it. Isn't it possible to return it to him specially?\n{Ina:} Oops, the \"Purple Spirit Shield\" has been delivered to Solo.\n{Rael:} And Spien Rodri is not here anymore.\n{Freeman:} Then is it useful for us to go to Bataan?\n{Ina:} It's useful. Since we already know that it is the stronghold of Solo's subordinates, of course we have to unplug him. And also to regain the loss of Brother Mondor who was cheated.\n{Mondo:} Don't think about my business anymore.\n{Ina:} Also, we'd better get the \"Navy Outpost Pass\" in their hands. It will be more convenient to find him if we go down {Eldrie} {Ya}. But where is Eldria?\n{Mondo:} In {north of the town where we first met}. But it is not easy to get there, and the road is quite difficult.\n{Ina:} Then the next goal is also determined. For now, let's take this out of {Derank down} who deceived Brother Mondo.\n{Rael:} But that Drake's teleportation magic is very strong. It can move so many troops at once. It's not so easy to deal with, right?\n{Ina:} This, let me think about it...\n{Mondo:} There are still ways...\n{Ina:} What are some good strategies?\n{Mondo:} No, it's nothing, I just said that there must be a way.","{声音A：}德兰克将军，这样真的好吗？要不属下替您去跑一趟？\n{声音B：}不用，别理他。斯拜恩罗德里那家伙，把我们当猴耍到东耍到西啊。前几天他在这里的时候啥都不说，玩了一圈就回到{埃尔德里亚}去了，这会儿我舟车劳顿费了好大劲终于把“紫灵盾”给索罗大人送去了，他居然又再叫我去帮他送“龙牙项链”。如果不是存心耍我们，怎么当初他在这儿的时候不叫我们一并送了。\n{声音A：}斯拜恩罗德里将军也说了，当初他没想到德兰克将军您能这么快得到“紫灵盾”，所以一时疏忽了而已嘛。\n{声音B：}反正是他的错，我不管。索罗大人急了也不会怪到我头上。凭什么他懒就要我们替他跑腿？等索罗大人催他，到时看他自己去不去送。\n{声音A：}那么，斯拜恩罗德里将军给的这张“海军前哨通行证”怎么办？\n{声音B：}咱们留着呗。难道还特地给他还回去不成。\n\n{伊娜：}糟糕了啦，“紫灵盾”已经被送到索罗手上了。\n{雷尔：}而且斯拜恩罗德里也不在这里了。\n{弗里曼：}那么我们到巴塔安城还有用吗？\n{伊娜：}有用啊，既然已经知道是索罗的部下的据点，我们当然要拔掉他。而且还要夺回蒙多大哥被骗的损失。\n{蒙多：}不用再考虑我的事了。\n{伊娜：}还有呢，我们最好能把他们手里那张“海军前哨通行证”弄来，这下去{埃尔德里}\n{亚}找他就会更方便些。不过，埃尔德里亚在哪呢？\n{蒙多：}在{我们第一次见面的那个城镇的北方}。不过要去那里并不容易，路相当地不好走。\n{伊娜：}那么下一个目标也确定了。目前就先把这个欺骗了蒙多大哥的{德兰克打倒}吧。\n{雷尔：}但是那个德兰克的传送魔法很强，能一次移来那么多支部队，没那么好对付吧？\n{伊娜：}这个，我想想……\n{蒙多：}办法还是有的……\n{伊娜：}有什么好计策？\n{蒙多：}不，没什么，我只是说办法一定会有的。\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice A:} Widow, is that all you want to say?\n{Voice B:} General Spane Rodri, are you not going to take the next suggestion?\n{Voice A:} A joke! You are just a good general, what right do you have to point your finger at me. I am the supreme commander of the Red Sea Fleet, possessing the most elite fleet in Mirronia. In the future, I am the only one who will be able to lay down the world and conquer mankind for Lord Solo.\n{Voice B:} Come on. Your fleet is not just because the Archbishop Yingluck gave you the design drawings of the flying shears. Wouldn't it be ridiculous to want to conquer mankind with the designs given to you by mankind? The archbishop Yingluck is not credible, I don't know yet. You rely on him so much now, in case he keeps a hand, and has some hidden door built-in, and turns his face in the future, your broken fleet is useless at all.\n{Voice A:} Lord Solo said that Archbishop Yingluck is a reliable ally, and you dare to doubt it. What can you do as a helper, to the commander-in-chief of the army so big, as if you are very capable.\n{Voice B:} Of course there is a way. Regardless of position, those who are able are good. Now Lord Solo needs the \"Sword of Destruction\" and the \"Supernatural Power of the Dragon King\". Look, you must help Lord Solo get it first.\n{Voice A:} Hahaha, do you get it first? How many have you got now? \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" was salvaged from the deep sea by my fleet. Do you have the ability to salvage it?\n{Voice B:} You just got one piece. It's not too late to boast after you get all the remaining 7 pieces.\n{Voice A:} I only have one, better than you have none at all. Hahaha, laughed to death, actually came to compare this to me...\n{Voice B:} General Spane Rodri, here is a piece of advice, don't underestimate those human opponents, the arrogant soldiers will lose. War is not only brave but also wisdom. If you can't use strategy, it will be difficult for you to gain the upper hand over cunning humans. Now Xia gives the general a chance, a chance to get the remaining 7 parts of \"Dragon King Divine Power\" before Xia, and take all the credit, it depends on whether you can grasp it. Because you have the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" in your hand, those humans who are collecting the \"Dragon King Divine Power\" will definitely find ways to find you, because they want to take your \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\". If you can take this opportunity to take care of the plan and put the other 7 parts in their hands, then the credit will be all yours and nothing will be done. But if you fail, then I will take the remaining 8 parts-including the \"Dragon Tooth Necklace\" they snatched from you, and return them to Lord Solo.\n{Voice A:} A joke, how could I fail. Just wait, without your intervention, I will definitely collect the 7 parts.\n{Voice B:} Then, waiting for the good news of the general, I will leave today.\n{Voice A:} The meeting is over! A group of people walked out of the conference room.\n{Ina:} (It turns out that that is Spin Rodrie. I met now, and the other one should be called Victor. I don't know the origin, but at least it's a powerful character...)\n{Rael:}( What do we do, do we want to do it?)\n{Freeman:} (Don't, they are crowded now, and that Victor looks more scheming, wait for him to leave and look for a chance.)\n{Ina:} (Yes , That Spaniel Rodri looks more stubborn. It should be a bit easier to deal with than that person, so we have to wait for them to separate.)","{声音A：}维多，你要说的就是这些吗？\n{声音B：}斯拜恩罗德里将军，你不准备采纳在下的建议吗？\n{声音A：}笑话！你区区一个裨将，有什么资格对我指手划脚。我可是赤海舰队的最高统帅，拥有整个米尔罗尼亚最精锐的舰队，将来有能力为索罗大人打下天下征服人类的，只有我而已。\n{声音B：}得了吧。你那舰队，还不是因为那个英拉大主教把飞剪船的设计图纸给你了，你才张罗起来的。想用人类送给你的设计品去征服人类，那不是很可笑吗？那个英拉大主教可不可信还不知道呢，你现在就这么依赖他，万一他留了一手，内置了什么暗门，以后翻了脸，你那破舰队一点用处都没有。\n{声音A：}索罗大人说了英拉大主教是可以依赖的盟友，你居然也敢怀疑。你一个裨将能有什么能耐，对一军统帅口气那么大，好像你就很有办法似的。\n{声音B：}在下当然有办法。不论职位高低，能者为善。现在索罗大人最需要的是“毁灭之剑”与“龙王神力”，你看着，一定是在下先帮索罗大人弄到手。\n{声音A：}哈哈哈，你先弄到手？你现在弄到几件了啊？“龙牙项链”可是我的舰队从深海里打捞上来的，你有这本事捞上来么？\n{声音B：}你才得了一件而已，等你把剩余7件都弄到手，再来向在下夸口也不迟。\n{声音A：}我只有一件，也好过你一件都没有。哈哈哈，笑死了，居然来跟我比这个……\n{声音B：}斯拜恩罗德里将军，在下忠告一句，不要太小看了那些人类对手，骄兵必败。战争不但是勇猛同时也是智慧，如果不会运用策略，你很难对狡猾的人类占上风。现在在下给将军一个机会，一个让你比在下先得到“龙王神力”其余7个部件，拿走全部功劳的机会，就看你能不能把握得住了。因为你手上有“龙牙项链”，那些正在收集“龙王神力”的人类一定会想方设法来找你的，因为他们想夺取你的“龙牙项链”。如果你能借此机会将计就计，把他们手中的另7个部件收入囊中，那么功劳就全归你，在下什么也不要。但是如果你失败了，那么我会把剩下8个部件——其中也包括他们从你手上夺走的“龙牙项链”，重新拿回来交给索罗大人。\n{声音A：}笑话，我怎么可能会失败。你就等着吧，不用你插手，我一定会把那7个部件收齐的。\n{声音B：}那么在下恭候将军的佳音，今天就告辞了。\n{声音A：}散会！\n\n一行人从会议室里走出来。\n\n{伊娜：}（原来那个就是斯拜恩罗德里，这下认识了，另外那一个应该是叫维多，还不知道是什么来历，不过至少是个厉害角色……）\n{雷尔：}（我们怎么办，要动手吗？）\n{弗里曼：}（别，现在他们人多，而且那个维多看起来比较有心计，等他离开再找机会吧。）\n{伊娜：}（是啊，那个斯拜恩罗德里看起来比较一根筋。应该会比那个人好对付一点，所以要等他们分开。）\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Are 10,000 gold coins ready? I can't do it without money.","{声音：}10000金币准备好了吗？没钱我可不白干。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Haha, the prey actually broke into my training room.\n{Freeman:} This voice is... Archbishop Yingluck!\n{Yingla:} I didn't expect that His Royal Highness would come to the door by himself. It's really nowhere to be found after breaking through the iron shoes, and it takes no effort at all.\n{Ina:} Are you Archbishop Yingluck? Didn't you go out?\n{Yingluck:} When I was practicing, I would pretend to be out. Do you really think I was out? In any case, you came just right. I'm worried about not catching Prince Freeman.\n{Rael:} Now that we have encountered it, let's just ask to understand. Archbishop Yingluck, you have taken the power of the country in your hands and suppressed resistance, but disregarded the livelihood of the people. What are you doing?\n{Yingluck:} This country is already mine. I can do whatever I want. Can you control it? People? They are just tools to collect taxes for me.\n{Ina:} No matter how you say this country is not yours, the current king is not you.\n{Yingluck:} King? Do you think this country has a king now? Ah ha ha ha...\n{Freeman:} What did you do to my brother? Where is he?\n{Yingla:} Your brother? Is there such a person?\n{Freeman:} You! Did you kill my brother?\n{Yingla:} Don't be silly, boy. Your brother has never existed before. Ahaha, laughed to death, do you really think you have an elder brother?\n{Freeman:} What do you mean? !\n{Yingla:} Well, since the matter is up to this point today, I will tell you the matter as it is, my prince.","{声音：}哈哈，猎物竟然闯到我的修炼室里来了。\n{弗里曼：}这声音是……英拉大主教！\n{英拉：}真没想到，王子殿下会自己送上门来。真是踏破铁鞋无觅处，得来全不费工夫啊。\n{伊娜：}你就是英拉大主教？你不是外出了吗？\n{英拉：}我修炼的时候都会假称外出，你们还真以为我外出了？不管怎么说，你们是来得正好。我正愁抓不到弗里曼王子呢。\n{雷尔：}既然碰到了，我们干脆问个明白吧。英拉大主教，你把国家大权独揽于手中，一心镇压反抗，却不顾百姓的生计，你这是想干什么？\n{英拉：}这个国家已经是我的了，我想怎么样就怎么样，你管得着吗？百姓？他们只是为我征税的工具而已。\n{伊娜：}再怎么说这个国家也不是你的吧，现在的国王又不是你。\n{英拉：}国王？你们认为这个国家现在有国王吗？啊哈哈哈……\n{弗里曼：}你把我哥哥怎么样了？他到底在哪里？\n{英拉：}你哥哥？有这么个人吗？\n{弗里曼：}你！难道你杀了我哥哥？\n{英拉：}别傻了，孩子。你哥哥这个人，从来就不曾存在过。啊哈哈，笑死了，你还真当你有个哥哥啊？\n{弗里曼：}你这是什么意思？！\n{英拉：}好吧，今天既然事情到这份上了，我就把事情原原本本告诉你好了，我的王子殿下哟。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Hearing reports that there is a human armour that has been hampering us everywhere, it's true.\n{Ina:} Who are you?\n{Voice:} I am the Demon General Seresia. Originally, I was ordered to assist Ladia to complete the task, but I didn't expect her to escape by herself. But that's okay. After you get rid of the troublemakers, I can take the credit for completing the task exclusively.\n{Ina:} What is the task you are talking about?\n{Seresia:} What you must know is the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\".\n{Ina:} I won't let you go to Chiman Island.\n{Seresia:} Ah, it turns out that the thing is on Chiman Island. Thank you for your information. I was worried that I didn't meet with Ladia and didn't ask about the location of the \"Dragon Tooth Crown\".\n{Ina:} Ah, you didn't know? I was wrong, I shouldn't have said it...\n{Ceresia:} Don't you know now. {Manticore}, you take your troops and fly to {Cheman Island} immediately, and I will come after I deal with these guys.\n{Manticore:} Yes, General.\n{Ina:} No, how can I let you pass...\n{Seresia:} Your opponent is me, I won't let you go after the Manticore.\n{Ina:} Well, even if I break in, I have to break through.","{声音：}听到报告说有一支人类的武装一直在到处妨碍我们，果然没错。\n{伊娜：}你是谁？\n{声音：}我是魔将军赛雷西亚。本来我是奉命来协助拉迪亚完成任务的，没想到她竟然自己逃跑了。不过没关系，把你们这些捣乱者清理掉之后，我就可以独享完成任务的功劳了。\n{伊娜：}你所说的任务，是什么？\n{赛雷西亚：}想必你们也知道的，就是“龙牙冠”了。\n{伊娜：}我才不会让你们去奇曼岛呢。\n{赛雷西亚：}啊，原来那东西在奇曼岛上，真是多谢你的情报了，我正愁没跟拉迪亚会面，没问到“龙牙冠”的位置所在呢。\n{伊娜：}啊，你原来不知道啊？我错了，不该说出来的……\n{赛雷西亚：}现在这不就知道了嘛。{蝎狮王}，你带着你的部队马上飞去{奇曼岛}，我处理完这些家伙后就来。\n{蝎狮王：}是，将军。\n{伊娜：}不行，怎么能让你们过去……\n{赛雷西亚：}你的对手是我，我可不会放你去追蝎狮王。\n{伊娜：}好吧，我就算闯也要闯过去。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Help me! They are going to eat me! Ina followed the voice and saw a large group of alligators surrounding a hat-shaped thing about to attack.\n{Ina:} It seems that a man in a hat was attacked by a crocodile in the water. Let's save him!","{声音：}救救我！他们要吃了我！\n\n伊娜循着声音望去，看到一大堆短吻鳄围着一只形似帽子的东西正要攻击。\n\n{伊娜：}好像有个戴帽子的人在水里被鳄鱼攻击了，我们去救他！"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Oh, there is no way. Is this man going to have a destiny at this point, and Life will do its best to sacrifice heroic justice...\n{Ina:} Hey? This isn't... Mr. Bad Guy?\n{Dawu:} Ah, it turns out to be a stupid girl! Great, saved!\n{Ina:} Why are you here?\n{Dav:} Hmph, this lord knows that you are about to encounter difficulties...\n{Ina:} You still want to blackmail me money, right? We did not encounter difficulties. Gone, goodbye.\n{Dav:} Ah, wait, no money this time, really no money...\n{Ina:} I didn't want to ask you for help. By the way, why did you come here?\n{Dawu:} My lord lost his way around here. It was nothing, but he broke into a demons' base by mistake. After the demons found out, they wanted to kill the lord, so they escaped in one fell swoop...\n{Ina:} We are looking for their base, so you've been there before...\n{Dav:} Hey, this lord knows that you need help, so I inquired about their base in advance...\n{Ina:} We don't need help, thank you. We can find it ourselves. Goodbye, Mr. Bad.\n{Davu:} Don't go, wait...\n{Ina:} What else is there?\n{Dawu:} My lord is now in danger, can't he raise his hands and others to facilitate the economy and the world to help all sentient beings? You take this lord out to escape the chase of the demons, and this lord also takes you to find their base. How about no extra money?\n{Ina:} This is what you are waiting for. If you said it earlier, you won't get it. Have to put on some airs. Go, I will protect you from here safely.","{声音：}糟了，没路了，难道本大人就要天命至此人寿将尽光荣牺牲英勇就义了么……\n{伊娜：}哎？这不是……坏人先生？\n{达伍：}啊，原来是笨小丫头！太好了，得救了！\n{伊娜：}你怎么会在这里啊？\n{达伍：}哼哼，本大人知道你们要遇到困难了……\n{伊娜：}还想敲诈我钱财是吧？我们没遇到困难。走了，再见。\n{达伍：}啊，等等，这次不要钱啦，真的不要钱……\n{伊娜：}我本来就没想求助于你啊。话说你怎么会跑到这儿来了呢？\n{达伍：}本大人在这附近迷了路，本来倒没啥，可是偏偏误闯进了一个魔族的基地。魔族的家伙们发现了之后，要杀本大人灭口，所以就一口气逃了出来……\n{伊娜：}我们正想找他们的基地呢，原来你去过啊……\n{达伍：}嘿嘿，本大人知道你们需要帮助，所以特地事先打探了他们的基地所在……\n{伊娜：}我们不需要帮助，谢谢。我们自己也能找到。再见，坏人先生。\n{达伍：}别走啊，等等……\n{伊娜：}还有什么事？\n{达伍：}本大人现在处境危险，就不能顺便高抬贵手与人方便经天济世普渡众生帮个忙吗？你们带本大人出去，躲过魔族的追杀，本大人也带你们去找他们的基地。不另收钱，怎么样？\n{伊娜：}等的就是你这句啦。早说不就得了嘛。非要摆什么架子。走吧，我会保护你安全离开这里。\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} Thank you for saving me.\n{Ina:} Okay, it's okay, all the crocodiles were driven away by us. You can come out of the water. You will be suffocated in the water. While talking, Ina pulled her hat up from the water, only to find that there was nothing under the hat.\n{Ina:} Huh? People? Is it already sinking?\n{Voice:} I am in your hands.\n{Ina:} I only have one hat in my hand.\n{Voice:} I am not a hat. I am a golden crown jellyfish. It's a kind of marine life.\n{Ina:} Ah, so you are not a human... {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} Wouldn't you be saved if you weren't a human?\n{Ina:} No, no, I'm just surprised. I always thought it was someone wearing a hat. {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} Indeed, we are called by this name because we look like hats.\n{Ina:} So, thinking of it, I seem to have heard the name before. I looked through the little Ina universal notebook to see... there is it! The golden crown jellyfish lives in shallow seas and feeds on various algae. It is a national first-class protected animal. The existing wild population is very scarce... This is what I wrote down when I visited the aquarium with my grandpa. {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} There is no way, because we have too many natural enemies, we are always preyed, and survival is getting harder and harder. This shoal was originally our paradise, but recently, due to the influence of human development, a large number of alligators have moved from other places and eat when they see us. We have nowhere to hide.\n{Ina:} Then what to do. It seems that if I put you back, you will still be in danger. {Golden Crown Jellyfish:} I beg you, good people do it to the end, take me away and take me to other places where I can survive.\n{Ina:} Well, that's all there is.","{声音：}谢谢你们救了我。\n{伊娜：}好啦，没事了，鳄鱼都被我们赶走了。你可以从水下出来啦，一直闷在水里要窒息的哦。\n\n伊娜一边说着一边把帽子从水面上拉起来，却发现帽子底下什么都没有。\n\n{伊娜：}咦？人呢？难道已经沉下去了？\n{声音：}我就在你手上呀。\n{伊娜：}我手上只有一个帽子啊。\n{声音：}我不是帽子啦。我是金冠水母。是一种海洋生物啦。\n{伊娜：}啊，原来你不是人类啊……\n{金冠水母：}不是人类你就不救了吗？\n{伊娜：}不不，我只是比较吃惊，本来一直以为是个戴帽子的人。\n{金冠水母：}确实我们就是因为长得像帽子，才被叫成这名字的。\n{伊娜：}这么说来，想起来这名字我好像有听到过，我翻翻伊娜酱万能笔记本看看……有了！金冠水母生活在浅海，以各种藻类为食，是国家一级保护动物，现存野生数量已经十分稀少……这是我以前跟爷爷去参观水族馆时记下的呢。\n{金冠水母：}没办法，因为我们天敌太多，老是被捕食，生存越来越艰难。这一片浅滩本来是我们的乐园，可是最近因为人类开发的影响，大批短吻鳄从别处迁来，见我们就吃，我们无处藏身。\n{伊娜：}那怎么办哪。看起来如果我把你放回，你还会遭遇危险。\n{金冠水母：}求求你们，好人做到底，把我带走吧，带到其他可以生存的地方去。\n{伊娜：}好吧，也只有这样了。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Voice:} What are you doing in my altar?\n{Radia:} What is this voice? Solo!\n{Solo:} Hey, Radia, you betrayed me, so you dare to come back and stay with the humans...\n{Ladia:} I have never surrendered to you, so talk about betrayal. I just do what is good for me.\n{Ina:} So you are Solo. We are looking for you.\n{Solo:} I am looking for you too. You are those who have been secretly hindering my hegemony, right? Also good. Since you have cast yourself into the snare, I will take care of it to avoid future troubles.\n{Mengying:} Solo, I advise you to give up unblocking the \"Sword of Destruction\". This is my last advice to you. It is too late for you to listen to me. The \"Sword of Destruction\" is an ancient artifact capable of destroying the entire continent. Do you know how to use it? Are you capable of controlling it? If you resurrect it, it will eventually surpass your control, and even yourself will be swallowed.\n{Solo:} A joke, will I believe your rhetoric? My dream of being domineering for decades is right in front of me, how could I give up! Decades of stinging, decades of waiting, and decades of anticipation have finally ushered in the great opportunity now. How could you understand this!\n{Radia:} The guy who was completely dazzled by ambition, because of you, how many people were involved in the war, how many tribes lost their homes and brothers like me...\n{Solow:} It doesn’t matter how many people sacrificed. Compared to my dominance, these are trivial! Haven't you heard of \"a great accomplishment and a dead end\"?\n{Ina:} It seems that this stubborn guy doesn't make sense. The only way to prevent the \"Sword of Destruction\" from resurrecting is to beat him to the ground before that.\n{Solo:} Hahaha, I really don't know the depth, in my altar, gathering my most elite confidant troops, actually wanting to defeat me! Come on then, I can't ask for it.","{声音：}你们在我的祭坛里乱闯干什么？\n{拉迪亚：}这声音是？索罗！\n{索罗：}嘿嘿，拉迪亚，你背叛了我，居然还敢回来，还与人类为伍……\n{拉迪亚：}我从来就没有臣服于你，谈何背叛。我只是做对我自己有利的事罢了。\n{伊娜：}原来你就是索罗啊。我们正要找你呢。\n{索罗：}我也正要找你们。你们就是那些一直在暗地里妨碍我的霸业的人吧？也好。既然你们自投罗网，我就一并收拾了以绝后患。\n{梦影：}索罗，我劝你还是放弃解封“毁灭之剑”，这是我给你的最后一次忠告，你现在听我的还来得及。“毁灭之剑”是足以毁灭整个大陆的上古神器，你知道如何使用吗？你有能力驾驭它吗？如果你复活了它，最后它会超越你的控制，连你自己也会被吞噬。\n{索罗：}笑话，我会信你的花言巧语吗？我几十年霸业的梦想就在眼前了，怎么可能会放弃！几十年的蜇伏，几十年的等待，几十年的期盼，终于迎来了现在的大好时机，这些你怎么可能会懂！\n{拉迪亚：}完全被野心冲昏了头脑的家伙，因为你，多少人被卷入战火，多少部族像我一样失去家园失去兄弟……\n{索罗：}多少人的牺牲都没有关系，比起我达成霸业，这些都微不足道！没听说过“一将功成万骨枯”吗？\n{伊娜：}看来这个顽固的家伙是说不通了，能阻止“毁灭之剑”复活的唯一办法，就是在那之前先把他揍到趴下。\n{索罗：}哈哈哈，真是不知深浅，在我的祭坛之内，聚集着我最精锐的亲信部队，居然还妄想打败我！那就来吧，我求之不得呢。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} 12 \"three\" head dogs. 3*12=36 The answer you choose is 36","{服务员：}\n“三”头犬12只。3*12=36\n你选择的答案是\n36"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} 2 \"Nine\"-headed snakes. 9*2=18 The answer you chose is 18","{服务员：}\n“九”头蛇2只。9*2=18\n你选择的答案是\n18"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} 48 \"half\" men and horses. (1/2)*48=24 The answer you choose is 24","{服务员：}\n“半”人马48个。(1/2)*48=24\n你选择的答案是\n24"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} Congratulations. Your answer is correct. This is a mysterious gift for you-\"Warrior Simmons Head\". Please take it. Although it may seem useless to you now, it will help you in the future. Below is an explanation of the answer. A is \"four\", B is \"six\", C is \"two\", D is \"ten\", E is \"eight\", and F is \"three\". Each letter represents a Chinese character. Two (or three) consecutive letters are neither multiplied nor two (three) digits, but to read the two (three) characters together. The kids don't know anything about algebra, it's just a game of algebra.","{服务员：}恭喜您。您的答案是正确的。这是赠送给您的神秘礼物——“战士西蒙斯头部像”。请收下。虽然现在看起来可能对您没什么用处，不过，以后会对您有帮助的。\n\n下面是对答案的解释。\nA是“四”，B是“六”，C是“二”，D是“十”，E是“八”，F是“三”。\n每个字母代表一个汉字，连续两个（或三个）字母既不是相乘也不是两（三）位数，而是把这两（三）个字连着念。小朋友们不懂什么代数的啦，仅仅是代字游戏而已。\n\n\n\n"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} If you think the answer behind me is correct, please pass the badge to me.","{服务员：}如果您认为我身后的这个答案是正确的，请把徽章交给我，您就可以通过了。"},
 {"ira-the-mage-3\n{Waiter:} There are 2 \"ten\" characters. 10*2=20 The answer you choose is 20","{服务员：}\n“十”字军2个。10*2=20\n你选择的答案是\n20"},
