 {"jedi-story-3\nLong ago, powerful wizards were able to create magical artifacts, but time has caused us to forget how to make new items.  I would like to learn these techniques myself, but I need one of these artifacts first to see how it was done.  If you could bring me, the Orb of the Firmament, Orb of Silt, Orb of Tempestuous Fire, Orb of Driving Rain and Orb of Inhibition, you would be well rewarded. ","很久以前 强大的巫师创造了魔法宝物但是时间让我们忘记了如何制作新项目。  我想自己学习这些技巧 但我需要其中之一宝物首先看看它是如何完成的。  如果你能带我走 苍穹之球, 淤泥之球, 烈焰之球, 豪雨之球 和 禁魔球你会得到很好的奖励 "},
