 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\n< MORDOR || Sea of Nurnen >","〈 魔多 || 努尔能海 〉"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nA good! The true sirens will be satisfied! Let them go with us and you may pass.","很好！真正的海妖会满意的。把她们交给我们，你就能通过。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nA very long time I wait this time, Faramir! \nI challenge you to race for glory. Let's be decided once and for all: Which ship is faster. \nBlack Jack","法拉米尔，我等这一刻已经很久了！\n我要与你竞速，争夺荣耀。就让我们一劳永逸地分出胜负：究竟谁的船更快！\n黑杰克"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nANDURIL, THE FLAME OF THE WEST, FORGED FROM THE SHARDS OF NARSIL! THE BLADE THAT WAS BROKEN SHALL RETURN TO MINAS TIRITH. ","安都瑞尔，西方之焰，由纳西尔圣剑的碎片重铸！断剑将重返米那斯提力斯。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAct quickly with Dark Lord. Maybe he was left the half army in his town. Use berserk and Orb of Vunerability for Sauron's Devils and Efreets.","迅速进攻黑暗魔君。他可能把一半军队留在城里了。对索隆的恶魔和火精灵，使用丧心病狂与毁灭之球。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAdmiral's Hat please.","请交出海军上将之帽。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAh! A secret passage! Maybe this is the way into Mordor. \nNote by the autor: \n{MAKE A NEW SAVE}\n{OF THE GAME}\nand sent Frodo ahead. His time has come.","啊！一条秘密通道！也许这就是进入魔多的道路。\n作者提示：请先另存一份新的游戏进度，再派弗罗多先行。他的时刻到了。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAh! Bilbo! Tell us about one of your adventures!","啊，比尔博！给我们讲一个你的冒险故事吧！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAh! This is good!","啊！这样就好了！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAh, exactly what I needed!  Now I can regain my former power and my possessions that belong to me by right. Take a small gift as a token of gratitude.","啊，正是我需要的！现在我能恢复昔日的力量，夺回本就属于我的领地。请收下这份小礼物，聊表谢意。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAh.. dear Frodo. I told you this story so many times..","啊……亲爱的弗罗多，这个故事我已经给你讲过许多次了……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAll rings must be recycled. The Quiet Eye of the Dragon, Still Eye of the Dragon, Diplomat's Ring, Ring of the Wayfarer, Ring of Conjuring, Ring of Vitality, Ring of Infinite Gems and Eversmoking Ring of Sulfur. All of them.","必须交出全部戒指：龙眼指环、静眼指环、外交官之戒、旅行者之戒、魔力指环、活力之戒、宝石戒指和硫磺指环，一个也不能少。"},
