 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAragorn","阿拉贡"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAragorn, son of Arathorn II, was a Chieftain of the Dunedain and a direct descendant of Isildur, the last High King of both Arnor and Gondor. Aragorn would become the greatest man of his time, leading the Men of the West against Sauron's forces, helping to destroy the One Ring, and reuniting the Kingdoms of Arnor and Gondor. \n\nAragorn was born on March 1, 2931, and just two years later he became the sixteenth Chieftain of the Dunedain when his father Arathorn II was killed by Orcs. Aragorn's mother Gilraen took him to live in Rivendell, home of Elrond. Elrond accepted the child as a foster-son and gave him the name Estel, meaning \"Hope.\" Aragorn was not told his true name and heritage until 2951, when he was twenty years old and Elrond perceived that he had grown to manhood. Elrond then gave Aragorn two of the heirlooms of the House of Isildur: the Ring of Barahir and the shards of Narsil.\n\nIn the woods of Rivendell, Aragorn met and fell in love with Arwen, daughter of Elrond, who had newly returned from Lorien.","阿拉贡是阿拉松二世之子，杜内丹人的首领，也是阿尔诺与刚铎最后一位至高王伊熙尔杜的直系后裔。他将成为那个时代最伟大的人，率领西方人类对抗索隆，协助摧毁至尊魔戒，并重新统一阿尔诺与刚铎。\n\n阿拉贡生于第三纪元2931年3月1日。两年后，他的父亲阿拉松二世被半兽人杀害，他便继任为杜内丹人的第十六位首领。他的母亲吉尔蕾恩带着他迁居瑞文戴尔。埃尔隆德收他为养子，取名埃斯泰尔，意为“希望”。直到2951年，阿拉贡二十岁时，埃尔隆德认为他已成年，才告诉他真实姓名与身世，并交给他伊熙尔杜家族的两件传家宝：巴拉希尔之戒与纳西尔圣剑的碎片。\n\n在瑞文戴尔的树林中，阿拉贡遇见刚从洛丝罗瑞恩归来的埃尔隆德之女阿尔温，并爱上了她。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAragorn: I am Isildur's heir, King of Gondor. This is my proof of my words!\n","阿拉贡：我是伊熙尔杜的继承人，刚铎之王。这就是我所言的证明！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAragorn: I summon you to fulfill your oath.\nThe Lich King: None but the king of Gondor may command me.","阿拉贡：我召唤你们履行誓言。\n巫妖王：除了刚铎国王，无人能命令我。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nAre you kidding? Angelic Alliance so for free? What's wrong with you?","你在开玩笑吗？想白拿天使联盟？你怎么会这样想？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nArgonath","阿刚那斯巨像"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nArnor.. beautiful country, but fell into the hands of evil. I have to act quickly!","阿尔诺……美丽的国度，却落入邪恶之手。我必须迅速行动！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nArnorUsurper","阿尔诺篡位者"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nArwen","阿尔温"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nArwen Undomiel, often called Arwen Evenstar, was the betrothed of Aragorn. She is the daughter of Elrond and Celebri'an (and therefore grand-daughter of Galadriel). She rejects her Elven immortality (which she had the ability to do, since she was a half-elf, thus having the choice to be counted as an elf or a man) to marry Aragorn and die with him. ","阿尔温·乌多米尔，常被称为“暮星阿尔温”，是阿拉贡的未婚妻。她是埃尔隆德与凯勒布莉安之女，因此也是凯兰崔尔的外孙女。作为半精灵，她可以选择精灵或人类的命运。为了嫁给阿拉贡、与他一同面对死亡，她放弃了精灵的不朽。"},
