 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBilbo Baggins was a Hobbit who lived in The Shire during the final years of the Third Age. His adventure with the dwarves Thorin and company earned him a fortune, and brought the One Ring of Sauron back into knowledge. Bilbo was noteworthy as the first ring-bearer in the history of Middle-earth to give up the One Ring voluntarily; he surrendered the ring to Frodo Baggins at Gandalf's request. ","比尔博·巴金斯是第三纪元末期居住在夏尔的霍比特人。他随矮人索林及同伴冒险，获得一笔财富，也使索隆的至尊魔戒重现于世。他是中洲历史上第一位自愿放弃至尊魔戒的持戒者：应甘道夫请求，他把戒指交给了弗罗多·巴金斯。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBilbo Bagins","比尔博·巴金斯"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBlack Jack","黑杰克"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBlack Market","黑市"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBlack market, hmm.. good! I must regain at least part of the losses of jewels! Nasty, thievish Orcs!","黑市，嗯……很好！我至少得把损失的珠宝夺回一部分！可恶的半兽人窃贼！"},
