 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nBut when the time came....when Gondor's need was dire...they fled vanishing into the darkness of the mountain. And so Isildur cursed them never to rest until they had fulfilled their pledge.\n","然而，当履行誓言的时刻到来，当刚铎危在旦夕时，他们却逃入群山的黑暗。因此伊熙尔杜诅咒他们：在履行誓言之前，永远不得安息。"},
