 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nCollect the parts for Angelic Aliance. \nArmor of Wonder - in the last pandora's box of chest boxes in Moria. Sandals of the Saint was in Saruman; Celestial Necklace of Bliss in Galadriel; Lion's Shield of Courage behind Lorien; Helm of Heavenly Enlightenment behind Hobbitton, keep by Green Dragons. In the path of dead use speculum and spyglasses. Take the boots of levitation when you leave the boat. There are four places where you can take a step when you walk around the castle of death. \nSummon boat when you pass the green guard. \nTAKE THE TWO HARPIES WITH YOU.","收集天使联盟的组件。\n神奇战甲在莫瑞亚最后一批宝箱中的潘多拉魔盒里；圣靴在萨鲁曼身上；天赐神项在凯兰崔尔身上；勇气狮盾位于洛丝罗瑞恩后方；神谕之冠在霍比屯后方，由绿龙守卫。\n经过亡者之路时使用窥镜和望远镜。离船时带上凌波微步靴；绕行死亡城堡时，有四处可以落脚。\n通过绿色守卫后施放召船术。\n务必带上两只鹰身女妖。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nDO NOT SACRIFICE THE ARTIFACTS WHICH YOU FOUND  except items for resources, ship drops, tresor items and similar.\nFrodo make free Bilbo, then get the boots of speed, eq. gloves, wait for new week on the stable, run to Bree, make free Aragorn. The boots of Levitation are in the bushes before the gulf with Bilbo's prison. \nBilbo kill Golum, take some spells, use the fire wall and kill Great Goblin.\nDon't Forget to use Pendant of Life against Death Ripple and Pendant of Total Recall against Golum.\nMAKE ARAGORN YOUR MAIN HERO if you want to do the game easy. Aragorn is the strongest hero.\nFor the guard who kept the path to the north: Cape of Velocity in Aragorn; Cape of Conjuring - in the Ring of the Magi; Recanter's Cloak in Arwen; About Pendant of Life - search around the griphin conservatory before the ship landed in Angmar.\nSend Legolas underground with Archangels, Gold Dragons, Sharpshuters and Enchanters only. First take the boots of Levitation behind the subterranean gate. Go with boat to spotlight the area, return to Mirkwood with Town Portal and go back underground. Use the boots of levitation and logistic speciality of Legolas to get the land down, where it stood Helm of the Alabaster Unicorn before. Kill Beorn and TAKE some spells by your eagle eye skill. For Orb of Vunerability: Garniture of Interference was in Thranduil, Surcoat of Counterpoise is in a seer hut, western land of Anduin. Use blind and the Orb of Vunerability to kill Smaug. Send Gimli to collect Azures. Conquer Dale. Behind the town is the light blue keymaster tent.","不要献祭沿途找到的宝物！用于换取资源的物件、海上漂流物和宝箱一类的普通战利品除外。\n弗罗多先救出比尔博，取得神行靴和骑士手套，在马厩等待新的一周开始，然后赶往布理救出阿拉贡。凌波微步靴藏在通往比尔博监狱的海湾前方灌木丛中。\n比尔博击败咕噜后，学习一些法术，使用烈火魔墙击败大哥布林。记得佩戴生命挂件抵御死亡波纹，佩戴回忆挂件对付咕噜。\n想降低冒险难度，请让阿拉贡担任主力英雄，他是最强的英雄。\n北方道路守卫要求的宝物：极速披风在阿拉贡身上；魔力披风是魔力源泉的组件；禁魔披风在阿尔温身上。生命挂件可在登陆安格玛之前、狮鹫宝屋附近找到。\n派莱戈拉斯前往地下，只带大天使、金龙、幻影射手和魔幻法师。先取得地下通道后方的凌波微步靴。乘船探明区域，施放时空之门返回幽暗密林，再回到地下。利用凌波微步靴和莱戈拉斯的后勤术特长，抵达此前放置独角神兽之盔的下方陆地。\n击败贝奥恩，利用鹰眼术学到他的法术。毁灭之球所需的抗魔装备中，抗魔链在瑟兰杜伊身上，抗魔披风位于安都因河西岸的一座先知小屋。用双目失明和毁灭之球对付史矛革。派金雳去收集圣龙，攻下河谷城，城后便是浅蓝色钥匙大师帐篷。"},
