 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFaramir was the second of Denethor's two sons. He was briefly the Ruling Steward after his father's death. Upon the arrival of the true king, King Aragorn Elessar, he laid down his office, but Elessar renewed the hereditary appointment of Steward as the advisor to the King. Faramir was also appointed Prince of Osgliath and whole Ithilien.","法拉米尔是德内梭尔的次子。父亲去世后，他短暂担任执政宰相。真正的国王阿拉贡·埃莱萨归来时，他交还了职权；但埃莱萨重新确认其家族世袭宰相的地位，让他担任国王顾问。法拉米尔还被封为奥斯吉力亚斯及整个伊希利恩的亲王。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFaramir, Tome of Earth and Tome of Water are around Osgiliath. Pendant of Second Sight is guarded by Hydras. Send Faramir to racing with Black Jack. Use all of your lighthouses. Take the Pendant of Death of the final of race. The blue keymasters tent is behind the dragon lair in Brown Lands","法拉米尔，土系魔法书与水系魔法书就在奥斯吉力亚斯附近。先知挂件由九头怪守卫。派法拉米尔与黑杰克竞速，利用你控制的所有灯塔。竞赛终点可以取得死神挂件。蓝色钥匙大师帐篷位于褐地龙穴后方。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFaramir? Where it may be.. he did not obey his father ..thrown is in a jail.","法拉米尔？他会在哪里呢……他违抗父亲，被关进了监狱。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFinally you found dragons, eh?  Here is your payment. ","你终于找到巨龙了？这是给你的报酬。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFinally!  It is you, Treebeard.  Saruman is strong. Very strong! Here is what I have for you.  Do you accept?","终于来了！原来是你，树胡。萨鲁曼很强，非常强！这是我为你准备的东西，你愿意接受吗？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFollow Balrog and go to the hell !!!","追随炎魔，去地狱吧！"},
