 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFornost","佛诺斯特"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFree Trebeard. send him to fight for first wave with Saruman. If he fails  finish Saruman youself. ","救出树胡，让他先对萨鲁曼发起第一波进攻。如果他没能消灭萨鲁曼，你再亲自收尾。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFrodo Baggins was a Hobbit of the Third Age, the most famous of all Hobbits in the histories for his leading role in the Quest of the Ring. During this epic quest, he bore the One Ring to Mount Doom and there destroyed it, giving him renown like no other Halfling throughout Middle-earth. He is also peculiar for being, as a Ring-bearer, one of the three Hobbits who sailed from Middle-earth to Aman, there to die in peace. \n\nFrodo was born to Drogo Baggins and Primula Brandybuck on September 22nd, Third Age 2968. He spent much of his youth at Brandy Hall in Buckland, the home of his mother's family. He was considered something of a rascal, particularly by Farmer Maggot from whom Frodo stole mushrooms. In 2980, when Frodo was only twelve years old, he lost both his parents who took a boat out onto the Brandywine River and drowned. With no siblings, Frodo was taken in by the Brandybucks to live at Brandy Hall until his cousin, Bilbo Baggins, adopted him and made Frodo his heir. ","弗罗多·巴金斯是第三纪元的霍比特人，因在魔戒远征中担当核心角色而闻名。他把至尊魔戒带到末日火山并将其摧毁，声名传遍中洲，无人能与这位半身人相比。他也是三位乘船离开中洲、前往阿门安度余生的霍比特持戒者之一。\n\n弗罗多生于第三纪元2968年9月22日，父亲是德罗戈·巴金斯，母亲是普莉姆拉·烈酒鹿。他童年大多住在母亲家族位于雄鹿地的烈酒厅，被认为是个小淘气，尤其是被他偷过蘑菇的马戈特农夫更这么想。2980年，他十二岁时，父母乘船外出，在烈酒河溺亡。没有兄弟姐妹的弗罗多被烈酒鹿家族收留，继续住在烈酒厅，直到亲戚比尔博·巴金斯收养他，并指定他为继承人。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFrodo Bagins","弗罗多·巴金斯"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nFrodo, your journey stops here for now. You will be required at the end of the adventure. Until then you can visit any city and defend it. This is your task for now.","弗罗多，你的旅程暂且停在这里。冒险的最后阶段还需要你。在此之前，你可以驻守任何一座城镇，保护它。这就是你目前的任务。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGaladriel","凯兰崔尔"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGaladriel was a one of the Great Elves Calaquendi, and arguably the most famous and powerful elf of the Third Age. She was one of the bearers of the Three Rings, of Nenya, and with it kept her realm of Lothlorien (Lorien) free of stain. During her reign Lothlorien was subjected to three successive attacks by armies coming out of Dol Guldur.","凯兰崔尔属于伟大的光明精灵族，也许是第三纪元最著名、最强大的精灵。她持有精灵三戒之一的水之戒南雅，并借其力量使领地洛丝罗瑞恩免受污秽。她统治期间，多尔古多的军队曾连续三次进攻洛丝罗瑞恩。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf","甘道夫"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf stopped for a moment and asked himself: \"All paths lead to Khazad-Dum. But some may be trapped by fallen rocks.. Who is last entered the mines of Moria?! Maybe his way is the most clear...\"","甘道夫停下片刻，问自己：“所有道路都通向凯萨督姆，但有些可能已被落石堵住……最后进入莫瑞亚矿坑的是谁？也许他走过的路最畅通……”"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf to rogues: Sorry, but I need some equipment!","甘道夫对盗贼说：抱歉，我需要一些装备！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf to you: Moria. You fear to go into those mines. The Dwarves delved too greedily and too deep. You know what they awoke in the darkness of Khazad-dum: Shadow and flame.","甘道夫对你说：莫瑞亚。你害怕进入那些矿坑。矮人挖得太贪婪，也太深。你知道他们在凯萨督姆的黑暗中唤醒了什么：阴影与烈焰。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf was one of the five Istari sent to Middle-earth by the Valar in the Third Age. In Valinor he was known as Olorin. Gandalf was instrumental in bringing about the demise of Sauron in 3019, chiefly by encouraging others and dispensing his wisdom at pivotal times. Gandalf was originally robed in grey, and second to Saruman in the Order of wizards. After his fall in Moria, Gandalf returned to Middle-earth as head of the Order, robed in white. He was unique among the Wise for his interest in Hobbits. It is not known when he first went to the Shire, but he appeared there from time to time and was famous among Hobbits especially for his fireworks. He was also held responsible for causing several Hobbit lads and lasses to embark on adventures. Gandalf came to the aid of the Hobbits during the Long Winter of 2758-59 and was impressed by their courage and pity for one another in the face of dreadful hardship. He also knew Hobbits to be stealthy, a quality he deemed useful for sneaking into a Dragon's lair. \n\nHe continued to visit Bilbo in the Shire and found it odd that the Hobbit did not appear to age as the years passed. That coupled with the discovery that Bilbo had lied about his encounter with Gollum made Gandalf wonder whether the magic Ring was more powerful than he had thought. \n\nHoping to learn how Gollum had acquired the Ring, Gandalf set a watch for the creature. Gollum emerged from the Misty Mountains, and his path eventually took him through Mirkwood to Lake-town and back again. The Wood-Elves tracked Gollum but lost his trail when he turned southward. Gandalf then decided to give up the hunt for Gollum, much to his regret when he later learned that the creature had been drawn to Mordor.\n\nGandalf, like the other Wizards, took the shape of an old man. He was robed in gray and went about as a wanderer and counselor. Unlike Saruman, Gandalf did not go east and did not take up a single permanent residence. Gandalf apparently restricted his activities to the North-west of Middle-earth, where the remnants of the Dunedain and the Eldar remained to oppose Sauron.","甘道夫是维拉在第三纪元派往中洲的五位伊斯塔尔巫师之一，在维林诺被称为欧罗林。他通过鼓舞他人、在关键时刻给予智慧，对3019年索隆的覆灭起了重要作用。他最初身着灰袍，在巫师中地位仅次于萨鲁曼。在莫瑞亚坠落之后，他重返中洲，成为身披白袍的巫师之首。\n\n他对霍比特人的兴趣，在智者中独树一帜。无人知道他何时第一次到访夏尔，但他常在那里现身，尤其以烟火闻名，也曾促使数位年轻霍比特人踏上冒险。2758至2759年的长冬中，甘道夫援助了霍比特人；他们面对苦难时的勇气与彼此怜悯令他印象深刻。他也知道霍比特人擅长隐匿，认为这有助于潜入龙穴。\n\n他不断到夏尔探望比尔博，发现这个霍比特人似乎不会随着岁月衰老。再加上比尔博对自己与咕噜相遇的经过撒过谎，甘道夫开始怀疑那枚魔戒比自己原先想象的更强大。\n\n为了弄清咕噜如何得到魔戒，他派人监视这个生物。咕噜离开迷雾山脉，最终穿过幽暗密林抵达长湖镇，又折返回去。木精灵一路追踪，却在他向南转进后失去踪迹。甘道夫决定放弃追捕；后来得知咕噜已被魔多吸引，他对此深感懊悔。\n\n与其他巫师一样，甘道夫外表是位老人。他穿着灰袍，四处漫游，担任顾问。与萨鲁曼不同，他不往东方，也没有固定居所。他的活动似乎限于中洲西北部，因为在那里，杜内丹人与埃尔达精灵的后裔仍在抵抗索隆。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf: Go back to the Shadow! You shall not pass!","甘道夫：退回阴影之中！你休想通过！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGandalf: I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. \nThe dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udun!\n","甘道夫：我是秘火的仆人，执掌阿诺尔之焰。\n黑暗之火救不了你，乌顿之焰！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGet out! I have no dragons here!","出去！我这里没有巨龙！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGet the secret passage to Mordor who is behind Near Harad. Use Frodo's scouting skill and scouts artifacts. Don't kill Shelob with Sam. Take the Admiral's hut in the northeast on the tunnels. Take the Armageddon blade behind Mordor Gate 1.","寻找近哈拉德后方通往魔多的秘密通道。利用弗罗多的侦察术与侦察宝物。不要让山姆杀死尸罗。到东北方隧道取得海军上将之帽，再取走魔多一号门后方的末日之刃。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGimli","金雳"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGimli was a dwarf of Durin's Folk, a direct descendant of Durin the Deathless , and younger son of Gloin. He was born in the Blue Mountains one hundred and nine years after the tragic destruction of Dale and the Sacking of Erebor by Smaug the Golden. Little is known about his early life (or the lives of young dwarves in general, as a matter of fact), but he was forbidden to join Thorin and Company because of his age.\n\nHe had become a fast friend of Legolas the Elf, a result of Galadriel’s kindness. This, too, made him famous among all the Dwarves of the Third Age. ","金雳是杜林一族的矮人，不死者杜林的直系后裔，也是葛罗音的幼子。在金色巨龙史矛革摧毁河谷城、洗劫孤山一百零九年后，他出生于蓝山。人们对他的童年了解很少，其实对年轻矮人的生活也大多如此。他曾因年纪太小，被禁止加入索林与同伴的远征。\n\n由于凯兰崔尔的善意，他与精灵莱戈拉斯成为挚友，这也让他在第三纪元的矮人中广为人知。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGladden Fields","格拉顿平原"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGo ahead!","前进！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGoblins again. ","又是哥布林。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGolum","咕噜"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGood move!","走得好！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGood!","好！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGorbag","戈巴格"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGothmog","戈斯莫格"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGreat Goblin","大哥布林"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGrey Havens","灰港"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGrima","格里马"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nGrishna'kh","格里什纳赫"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHa Ha !","哈哈！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHa ha.. it's not be easy!","哈哈……可没那么容易！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHa!","哈！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHa! I looking for red tent... not for dark blue.. ","哈！我要找的是红色帐篷，不是深蓝色的……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHa, ha! We Don't Like Undead! We will melt their stuff in the forge!","哈哈！我们不喜欢亡灵！要把他们的装备丢进熔炉！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHail, O master Aragorn! Lord Elrond was here recently, and leave a message for you. He needs some things to forge that which was broken.","向您致敬，阿拉贡大人！埃尔隆德大人最近来过，给您留下口信。他需要一些物品，才能重铸断剑。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHalt! The Great Mermaid does not want to be disturbed!","停下！伟大的美人鱼不愿受到打扰！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHalt! The market is closed! Access is only available to inhabitants of the tunnels","停下！市场已经关闭，仅限隧道居民进入。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHalt! The tunnels are orcs ownership. You pay some charge to pass without any troubles. In jewelry, please!","停下！这些隧道属于半兽人。想平安通过，先交些费用，用珠宝支付！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHaradrimKing","哈拉德国王"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHave you seen two harpies, posing as sirens?","你见过两只冒充海妖的鹰身女妖吗？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today':\nIsildur is dead! He fell into an ambush by the Orc's troop in the Gladden fields. Bad news.. Very bad news. \nAny hope has lost..","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n伊熙尔杜死了！他在格拉顿平原遭到半兽人部队伏击。坏消息……实在太糟了。\n所有希望都破灭了……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today':\nLorien also fell into the hands of evil. The latest information says: Queen Galadriel failed. The siege of Dol guldur was defeated. All hope she is alive, but even in the dark dungeon of the grim fortress. We pray for the Queen to withstand torture.","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n洛丝罗瑞恩也落入邪恶之手。最新消息称，凯兰崔尔女王战败，对多尔古多的围攻失败了。所有人都盼望她仍然活着，哪怕被关在那座阴森堡垒的黑暗地牢里。让我们祈祷女王能够熬过酷刑。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today':\nThe Prince of Dol Amroth has escaped from prison in Minas Tirith. He was spotted in the east, around the Sea of Rhun. He has the keys of the kingdom, and this is our last hope to save Gondor.","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n多尔安罗斯的王子从米那斯提力斯的监狱逃脱了！有人在东方的鲁恩海附近见过他。他掌握着王国的钥匙，是拯救刚铎最后的希望。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today':\nThe usurpers were already two: Witch KIng of Angmar sent a servant to conquer Arnor. \n\nThranduil, Lord of Mirkwood, concluded a secret treaty with Saruman. Outraged by deed of his father, Legolas tried to oppose him, and was imprisoned.\n\nStill no news about Isildur.","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n篡位者已经有两位了：安格玛巫王派出仆从征服阿尔诺。\n\n幽暗密林之主瑟兰杜伊与萨鲁曼签订秘密条约。莱戈拉斯对父亲的行为极为愤怒，试图反抗，却被囚禁。\n\n仍然没有伊熙尔杜的消息。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today': \nAfter the departure of Isildur, Minas Tirith is ruled by Regent Denethor. According to unconfirmed reports, he usurped the throne. Enraged by the death of his eldest son, Boromir, he exiled his other son, Faramir in Osgiliath. The doors for the Southern Kingdom are closed.\n\nStill no news about Isildur.","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n伊熙尔杜离开后，米那斯提力斯由摄政德内梭尔统治。据未经证实的消息，他篡夺了王位。长子博罗米尔的死令他狂怒，他将另一个儿子法拉米尔放逐到奥斯吉力亚斯。南方王国的大门已经关闭。\n\n仍然没有伊熙尔杜的消息。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeadlines from 'Shire Today': \nHelm's Deep, the last stronghold of men, fell under the power of evel. King Theoden has betrayed. Saruman's forces, Uruk-Hai's army invaded Rohan. According to recent reports the King is dead.\n\nIn Lorien, the Queen Galadriel gather strength to attack the dark fortress of Dol Guldur.\n","《夏尔今日报》头条：\n人类最后的据点圣盔谷落入邪恶之手。希奥顿国王背叛了，萨鲁曼的强兽人大军入侵洛汗。最新报告说，国王已经死亡。\n\n在洛丝罗瑞恩，凯兰崔尔女王正在集结力量，准备进攻黑暗堡垒多尔古多。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHeavenly arrogance!\nHere is what I have for you. ","天大的傲慢！\n这是我为你准备的东西。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHelm's Deep","圣盔谷"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHelm's Deep... the last stronghold which has not fallen by the evil...","圣盔谷……最后一处尚未被邪恶攻陷的据点……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHelp me! I lost what was mine! Plese Help me! \nSignature: \nThe Great Mermaid, ruler of the southern seas.","救救我！我失去了属于自己的东西！请帮帮我！\n署名：\n伟大的美人鱼，南海的统治者。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHelp?  Your rating will fall!","要帮助吗？你的评分会降低！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHenceforth to look for hidden objects!","今后要留意隐藏的物件！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHere lies Boromir.\nMay he rest in peace.","博罗米尔长眠于此。\n愿他安息。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHere they are! But I supposedly paid...","他们在这里！可我应该已经付过钱了……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHere you can collect the 7 dragons per week. Gimli, you can do this job.","这里每周能领取7条巨龙。金雳，这件事交给你了。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHey! You want a powerful artifact for free? No. It is costly!","嘿！你想白拿强大的宝物？不行，它可不便宜！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHi Frodo! Gandalf leave a message for you. You must leave the Shire. And leave quickly! Go to the town of Bree. He said he would be waiting for you at the inn of the Prancing Pony. If he is not there - look for a stranger named Aragorn.","你好，弗罗多！甘道夫给你留下口信：你必须离开夏尔，越快越好！去布理，他会在跃马客栈等你。如果他不在那里，就找一个名叫阿拉贡的陌生人。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHi Gimli! what's up?","你好，金雳！最近如何？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHi strangers, I'm Elrond, Lord of Rivemdell! Welcome to my hall! Now we can summon the council to discuss the situation about the One!","你们好，陌生人！我是瑞文戴尔之主埃尔隆德，欢迎来到我的大厅。现在可以召集会议，讨论至尊魔戒的问题了！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHi, We stay hidden here because .. because .. we keep gold and relics.. \nOur lady was chained in the dungeon of Dol Guldur. We..","你好。我们躲在这里，因为……因为……我们守护着金币和圣物……\n我们的女王被锁在多尔古多的地牢里。我们……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm, I remember a story in the newspaper of the Shire: \"The Prince of Dol Amroth has escaped from the prison in Minas Tirith. He was spotted the east, around the Sea of Rhun. He has the keys of the kingdom, and this is our last hope to save Gondor.\" But how I get the Island there..","嗯，我记得《夏尔今日报》上有一则消息：“多尔安罗斯的王子从米那斯提力斯监狱逃脱，有人在东方鲁恩海附近见过他。他掌握着王国的钥匙，是拯救刚铎最后的希望。”可我要怎么到达那座岛呢……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm, down there in the bushes has weird object...","嗯，下面灌木丛里有个奇怪的物件……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm.. There is very strange ship pier.. but perhaps the way goes somewhere else..","嗯……这座码头很奇怪，也许道路通向别的地方……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm.. the Golum's cave. ","嗯……咕噜的洞穴。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm.. the same ship pier over there..","嗯……那边也有一座相同的码头……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHmm... Gandalf was right..  weird smell ... and that thunder and roar. Something ancient still lurked in the shadows!","嗯……甘道夫说得对……奇怪的气味，还有那雷鸣般的咆哮。有某种古老之物仍潜伏在阴影中！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHobbitton","霍比屯"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHow far east can you go before you're heading west?","你能向东走多远，才算开始向西走？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nHumid, wet and gloomy place! And I'm alone here! I miss Sam ..","潮湿、阴冷、昏暗！这里只有我一个人！我想念山姆……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI am Gandalf the White.\nAnd I come back at the turn of the tide. \nOne stage of your journey is over.\nAnother begins.\n","我是白袍甘道夫。\n我在局势逆转的时刻归来。\n你旅程的一个阶段已经结束，\n另一个阶段即将开始。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI am the oldest, wisest in Middle Earth! La-la-la! If you want to make life easy - choose Aragorn as your main hero! La-la-la! He is most worthy! Hi hi! Gandalf's diplomacy is for begining only. O, yep! To North Island only! There is the last willing to join your army! Ha-ha! I'm Tom Bombadil! I know everything for everything! Tra-la-la-la-laa...","我是中洲最古老、最睿智的人！啦啦啦！想轻松些，就让阿拉贡当主力英雄！他最值得信赖！嘻嘻！甘道夫的外交术只在开局有用。对，只到北方的岛屿为止，那里有最后一批愿意加入你的部队！哈哈！我是汤姆·邦巴迪尔！世间万事，我无所不知！啦啦啦啦……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI can not see! Where are my glasses?","我看不见！我的眼镜呢？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI can't cope without Sam. I feel cold.. I feel fear.. I..","没有山姆，我应付不来。我觉得冷……觉得害怕……我……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI have to find Bilbo. He locked our home and as always he has forgotten me out! Lately, he's very forgetful..","我得找到比尔博。他把家门锁上，又像往常一样把我忘在外面！他最近越来越健忘了……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI know everything that has happened and what will happen in Middle-earth! I'm Tom Bombadil!","中洲发生过什么、将会发生什么，我全都知道！我是汤姆·邦巴迪尔！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI looking for Orb of Vulnerability. Being seen it around?","我在找毁灭之球。你在附近见过吗？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI managed to escape from Mordor, but here I found my death.","我成功逃离魔多，却在这里迎来死亡。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI managed to get away from Mordor !...","我终于逃出魔多了！……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI need my glasses!","我需要我的眼镜！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI returned by Path of the Death, but Gondor is still closed for me .. I need to find the Prince of Dol Amroth!","我从亡者之路归来，但刚铎的大门仍对我紧闭……必须找到多尔安罗斯的王子！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI returned to Gondor, but no one welcomed me.. I wonder where is Faramir..","我回到了刚铎，却无人迎接……法拉米尔会在哪里呢……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI see you!","我看见你了！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI want to sing in your embrace","我想在你的怀中歌唱。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI was afraid that you will not find it :) \nDo wish to pass?","我还担心你找不到它呢。\n想通过吗？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI will ask him to tell me about some of his adventures. Especially how he found his ring in the Golum's cave. This is my favorite story","我要请他讲些冒险经历，尤其是他在咕噜洞穴中找到戒指的故事。那是我最喜欢的！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI'm so close to the Shire, but I have more important work to do. Frodo can cope alone.","我离夏尔这么近，却还有更重要的事要做。弗罗多能独自应付。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nI'm watching you!","我正注视着你！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nIf Pendant of Death is there - you win the race! If not - back to previous SAVE","如果死神挂件还在那里，你就赢得了竞赛！如果不在，请读取之前的存档。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nIf you could bring me, the Armageddon's Blade and Titan's Thunder, we can recruit an army for you with our money.","如果你能带来末日之刃和泰坦之箭，我们就用自己的钱为你招募军队。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nIf you could bring me, the Orb of Vulnerability, Orb of Inhibition and Ring of the Magi, we can recruit an army for you with our money.","如果你能带来毁灭之球、禁魔球和魔力源泉，我们就用自己的钱为你招募军队。"},
