 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nIsildur","伊熙尔杜"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nIsildur was a Dunadan of Numenor, the elder son of Elendil, High King of the Realms in Exile. He was briefly the second king of Gondor and Arnor. \n\nIn S.A. 3430, the same year that Isildur's fourth son Valandil was born, Isildur's father Elendil and Gil-galad formed the Last Alliance of Elves and Men. The army of the Alliance marched to Imladris in 3431, where Isildur left his wife and Valandil before the host moved on. In 3434 the combined armies of Elves and Men crossed the Misty Mountains and marched on to the Dagorlad. There the forces of Sauron were defeated and he retreated into the Barad-du^r to withstand a siege.\n\nThe siege lasted seven years, but finally Elendil and Gil-Galad threw down Sauron, thus winning the battle though both were slain and Elendil's sword Narsil broke under him as he fell. \nIsildur took the hilt shard of his father's sword and cut the One Ring from Sauron's finger. Ignoring the advice of Elrond and Cirdan, lieutenant of Gil-galad, Isildur did not destroy the Ring; instead he claimed it as an heirloom for his House.\n\nWhen Isildur finally felt free to leave he committed the rule of Gondor to Meneldil and with his three sons departed on 5 Ivanneth, T.A. 2. Instead of heading west and then north they journeyed northwards along the Anduin in order to first come to Imladris. On the thirtieth day of the journey, 5 Narbeleth, the King, his sons, and his Guard of two hundred knights and soldiers reached the northern borders of the Gladden Fields. There they were ambushed by a band of Orcs said to be ten times their number. ","伊熙尔杜是努门诺尔的杜内丹人，流亡王国至高王埃兰迪尔的长子。他曾短暂担任刚铎与阿尔诺的第二任国王。\n\n第二纪元3430年，他的第四子瓦兰迪尔出生。同年，父亲埃兰迪尔与吉尔加拉德缔结精灵与人类的最后联盟。3431年，联盟军进抵伊姆拉缀斯；大军继续前进之前，伊熙尔杜把妻子与瓦兰迪尔留在那里。3434年，联军越过迷雾山脉，进军达戈拉德，击败索隆的军队。索隆退守巴拉多，承受围攻。\n\n围城持续七年。最终，埃兰迪尔与吉尔加拉德击倒索隆，赢得战斗，但两人也双双战死，纳西尔圣剑在埃兰迪尔倒下时折断。伊熙尔杜拾起父亲断剑的剑柄残片，从索隆手指上斩下至尊魔戒。他没有听从埃尔隆德与吉尔加拉德副将奇尔丹的劝告，毁掉戒指，而是将它据为家族传家宝。\n\n终于能够离开时，他把刚铎交给梅内尔迪尔统治，于第三纪元2年伊凡涅斯月5日带着三个儿子启程。他们没有先向西再向北，而是沿安都因河向北，打算先抵达伊姆拉缀斯。旅程第三十天，即纳尔贝莱斯月5日，国王、三个儿子与两百名骑士士兵组成的护卫队抵达格拉顿平原北缘，在那里遭遇半兽人伏击。据说敌人数量足足是他们的十倍。"},
