 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nLegolas","莱戈拉斯"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nLegolas was a Sindarin Elf of the Silvan realm of Mirkwood, the only recorded son of King Thranduil. He became famous because of his membership in the Fellowship of the Ring, in which he served as one of their most valuable assets because of his superior sight, hearing, lightness of foot, and unrivaled archery.\n\nLegolas grew fond of the Hobbits and he loved and supported Aragorn, but the strongest bond he formed was his unlikely friendship with Gimli the Dwarf. ","莱戈拉斯是幽暗密林西尔凡王国的辛达精灵，也是瑟兰杜伊国王唯一见于记载的儿子。他因加入护戒远征队而闻名；敏锐的视听、轻盈的脚步与无与伦比的箭术，使他成为队伍最重要的成员之一。\n\n他逐渐喜爱霍比特人，也热爱并支持阿拉贡。但他最深厚的友谊，竟是与矮人金雳结下的情谊。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nLegolas: Aragorn, keep your living army! Use the Undead! \nAuthor's Note to player: {MAKE A NEW SAVE OF THE GAME}. \nMaybe later you will have to come back right here!","莱戈拉斯：阿拉贡，保留你的活人部队，改用亡灵作战！\n作者提示：请另存一份新的游戏进度。以后你可能还需要回到这里！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nLife without magic .. ehh.. Do you accept?","没有魔法的生活……唉……你愿意接受吗？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nLight blue border gate.. Dwarfs.. They keep the entrance to Moria..  They must know how to get into the mines.. But where I find them? All the dwarfs have gone to war with Smaug.. ","浅蓝色边境大门……矮人……他们守着莫瑞亚的入口，肯定知道怎么进入矿坑。可我去哪里找他们？所有矮人都去与史矛革交战了……"},
