 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nNorthern Kingdom of Arnor is in ruins.\n\nStill no news about Isildur, who last month left Minas Tirith and returned to the north, to restore order and peace in the kingdom.","北方阿尔诺王国已成废墟。\n\n上个月，伊熙尔杜离开米那斯提力斯，返回北方恢复王国的秩序与和平。至今仍没有他的消息。"},
