 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nPssssst, Frodo! Be quiet!  Black Riders has come for you!  Get the Boots of Speed and Equestrians Gloves from Bilbo, stay here until the beginning of new week ..and then run and don't look back! And do not forget: Hide behind the green doors and spend the nights there! Good Luck!","嘘，弗罗多！安静！戒灵来找你了！从比尔博那里取得神行靴与骑士手套，留在这里等新的一周开始，然后快跑，别回头！还有，记得躲进绿色大门后面，在那里过夜！祝你好运！"},
