 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nSauron sees all. But we can give Frodo his chance if we keep Sauron's Eye fixed upon us. Keep him blind to all else that moves.\nWe need to find Pendant to second sight","索隆能看见一切。但只要让他的目光始终盯着我们，让他看不到其他动向，就能为弗罗多争取机会。\n我们需要找到先知挂件。"},
