 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe Anduin is a mighty river and has long neld the Mordor at day. Yet the Dark Lord does not yield up his desires so easily. In secret, a host hast come forth from the very gates of Minas Morgul. It camps along the Anduin's east bank. ","安都因河是一条大河，长期阻挡着魔多的势力。但黑暗魔君不会轻易放弃野心。一支军队已秘密从米那斯魔窟大门出发，在安都因河东岸扎营。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe Boots of Levitation and Pendant of Life. Thats all.","凌波微步靴与生命挂件，就这些。"},
