 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe Lich King: That line was broken.\nAragorn: It has been remade. Fight for us! And regain your honour! Fight, and I will release you from this living death!\nThe Lich King: Ha ha! The Dead do not suffer the living! You will suffer me!\n","巫妖王：王族血脉已经断绝。\n阿拉贡：它已经重续！为我们而战，夺回你们的荣耀！战斗吧，我就让你们摆脱这不生不死的命运！\n巫妖王：哈哈！亡者不容活人！你将承受我的怒火！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe Lich King: Who enters my domain?\nAragorn: One who will have your allegiance!","巫妖王：谁闯入我的领地？\n阿拉贡：你将要效忠的人！"},
