 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe story in the newspaper of the Shire:...\"Prince of Dol Amroth has escaped from the prison in Gondor. He was spotted the east, around the Sea of Rhun.\" Perhaps the keys are been for the red border guards?! Maybe I should go to the east..","《夏尔今日报》曾报道：“多尔安罗斯的王子从刚铎监狱逃脱，有人在东方鲁恩海附近见过他。”也许他掌握着通过红色边境守卫的钥匙？我该去东方看看……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe time has come!","时候到了！"},
