 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe way of King Dain Ironfoot","铁足戴因国王之路"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThe world is changed. I feel it in the water. I feel it in the earth. I smell it in the air. Much that once was... is lost. For none now live who remember it. \nIt began with the forging of the Great Rings.\nThree were given to the Elves. Immortal, wisest and fairest of all beings. Seven to the Dwarf-lords. Great miners and craftsmen of the mountain halls.\nAnd nine...nine rings were gifted to the race of Men who, above all else, desire power.\nFor within these rings was bound the strength and will to govern each race. \nBut they were all of them deceived. For another ring was made. In the land of Mordor, in the fires of Mount Doom the Dark Lord Sauron forged in secret a Master Ring to control all others.\nAnd into this Ring he poured his cruelty, his maliceand his will to dominate all life.\nOne Ring to rule them all.\nOne by one the Free Lands of Middle-earth fell to the power of the Ring.","世界变了。我能从水中感受到，从大地中感受到，也能从空气中嗅到。许多曾经存在的事物已经消逝，如今已无人记得。\n这一切始于力量之戒的铸造。\n三枚戒指赐予精灵——他们不朽，最睿智，也最美丽。七枚戒指赐予矮人领主——他们是山中殿堂里杰出的矿工与工匠。\n还有九枚……九枚戒指赐予人类，而他们最渴望的是权力。\n这些戒指蕴藏着统治各族的力量与意志。\n然而，所有人都受到了欺骗，因为还有另一枚戒指被铸造出来。在魔多的末日火山烈焰中，黑暗魔君索隆秘密铸造了至尊魔戒，以控制其余所有戒指。\n他将自己的残忍、恶意，以及支配一切生命的意志，全部注入这枚戒指。\n一戒统御众戒。\n中洲的自由国度一个接一个地屈服于魔戒的力量。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nTheoden was the seventeenth King of Rohan, ruling for 39 years, from T.A. 2980 until his death. He was the last of the Second Line.\n\nIn T.A. 3014 Theoden's health began to fail. This may have been due to natural causes (he was sixty-six) or it may have been induced or increase by subtle poisons administered by Grima. Grima (or Wormtongue as most others in the Mark called him), was secretly in the employ of Saruman the White\n\nHe then restored his nephew, took up his sword, and led the Riders of Rohan into battle at Helm's Deep.","希奥顿是洛汗第十七任国王，也是第二王系的末代国王，自第三纪元2980年起统治39年，直至去世。\n\n3014年，他的健康开始衰退。原因可能只是自然衰老——他当时六十六岁——也可能是格里马暗中使用的慢性毒药诱发或加重了病情。格里马被洛汗人称为“巧言”，秘密受雇于白袍萨鲁曼。\n\n后来，希奥顿恢复了侄子的地位，重新拿起宝剑，率领洛汗骑兵投入圣盔谷之战。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThere are way out of Mordor, but unfortunately not here!","确实有离开魔多的道路，可惜不在这里！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThere's nothing interesting here. You can go home :)","这里没什么有趣的，你可以回家了。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThere's nothing there! \nHA-HA! \nYou thought you could get in your hands this powerful artifact like that?\n\nHint by author: Don't go back to an earlier save of the game that will spoil the pleasure! Done is done. Don't regret the loss of artifact.","什么都没有！\n哈哈！\n你以为能就这样拿到如此强大的宝物？\n\n作者提示：不要为了这件事读取更早的存档，那会破坏游戏的乐趣。事已至此，不必为失去宝物后悔。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis can be useful!","这个也许有用！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis is a sea mirage! ","那是海上的幻象！"},
