 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis is elven ownership! Who are you, stranger?","这里属于精灵！陌生人，你是谁？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis is one of the most western point of Middle-earth. Gandalf was told me about the lands beyond.. \nThe ancient Numenor ..The evergreen Valinor.. \nAh.. Gandalf.. \nI wonder where is he now?!..","这里是中洲最西端的地点之一。甘道夫曾向我讲起海那边的土地……古老的努门诺尔，常青的维林诺……\n啊，甘道夫……\n他现在在哪里呢？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis is the end of the game! Do you need a help? Your rating will fall very very so much! Jump to collapse!:)","已经到游戏最后了！需要帮助吗？你的评分会下降很多很多！那就跳下去，迎接崩塌吧！"},
