 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nThis prison is empty for a long time. The last convict, which has escaped from here is the Prince of Dol Amroth. They saw him in the east they say, if you looking for him. Anything else?","这座监狱空置很久了。最后一位越狱者是多尔安罗斯的王子。如果你要找他，听说有人在东方见过。还需要别的消息吗？"},
