 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nTreebeard","树胡"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nTreebeard, also known as Fangorn, was the oldest of the Ents, a tree-like being who was a sort of \"shepherd of trees\". Very tall and stiff-limbed, with bark-like skin and leafy hair, he lived in Fangorn Forest, which was named after him (or he after it).\n\nLike most Ents, Treebeard took a long time to make up his mind. He repeatedly spoke of not \"being hasty\". Treebeard is described along with Tom Bombadil as the oldest being in Middle-earth. Treebeard however said that there were trees in Fangorn that were \"older than he\". ","树胡又名法贡，是最古老的树人。树人外形如树，可以说是“树木的牧者”。他身躯高大，四肢僵硬，有树皮般的皮肤和叶片般的头发，居住在法贡森林。森林以他的名字命名，也可能是他以森林为名。\n\n与大多数树人一样，树胡要花很久才能作出决定，总是提醒别人“不要急躁”。他与汤姆·邦巴迪尔都被描述为中洲最古老的生命。不过树胡自己说，法贡有些树木“比他还古老”。"},
