 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe are buried in forgetfulness here, forgotten by God. Looking Beorn? Forget it!","我们在这被神遗忘的地方，被遗忘与沉寂埋葬。你在找贝奥恩？别想了！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe are innocent! We serve of the King of Gondor, whoever he is!","我们无罪！我们效忠刚铎国王，不论他是谁！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe are vassals of Angmar. We collect fees for travelers who sail along the western sea. Pay..","我们是安格玛的附庸，向沿西海航行的旅人征收费用。交钱吧……"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe can create palantir, more powerful than any other. Just need the rest!","我们能打造一颗比其他真知晶球都强大的晶球，只是还需要其余的组件！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe didn't likes Thranduil. We ran from him and knew he will not persist for long as the ruler of Mirkwood","我们不喜欢瑟兰杜伊，所以逃离了他。早就知道他统治幽暗密林不会长久。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe don't like the magic. We prefer natural things. You?","我们不喜欢魔法，更喜欢自然的东西。你呢？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWe fight.","我们作战。"},
