 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWelcome to Middle Earth, Gandalf! Long years ago the Great Elves sail to west of that port, now you are back.","欢迎来到中洲，甘道夫！很久以前，高等精灵从这座港口向西航行，如今你回来了。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWelcome to Paradise of Valinor, Gandalf! Here you can learn different skills and prepare yourself before starting your quest in Middle Earth! You can choose only two more skills! Make wise choices!","欢迎来到维林诺乐土，甘道夫！在前往中洲冒险之前，你可以在这里学习技能、作好准备。你只能再选择两项技能，请慎重决定！"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWelcome to the Real World, Gandalf...","欢迎来到真实的世界，甘道夫……"},
