 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWho are you, sailor? How dare you enter my domain? You got my message, you say? Wel.. Lest you bring me a gift? I need only one thing. ","水手，你是谁？竟敢进入我的领地？你说收到了我的消息？好吧……带礼物来了吗？我只需要一样东西。"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWho dares to disturb the great master of the woods?","谁敢打扰伟大的森林之主？"},
 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWhy didn't you say so? Ah Boromir.. Maybe rest in peace. He fought to the death with Saruman's Uruk-Hai and proved that a good man and brave warrior. He left this for you.","你怎么不早说？啊，博罗米尔……愿他安息。他与萨鲁曼的强兽人战斗至死，证明了自己是善良的人、勇敢的战士。这是他留给你们的东西。"},
