 {"lord-of-the-rings-1\nWithout the Quiet Eye of the Dragon, Still Eye of the Dragon, Diplomat's Ring, Ring of the Wayfarer, Ring of Conjuring, Ring of Vitality, Ring of Infinite Gems and Eversmoking Ring of Sulfur, none will pass.","没有龙眼指环、静眼指环、外交官之戒、旅行者之戒、魔力指环、活力之戒、宝石戒指和硫磺指环，任何人都不得通过。"},
