 {"the-lone-knight-1\n\"Destroying the balance of the elements was my primary plan because only then I could utilize the energy hidden beneath the Elemental Plane to cause havoc and upset the weather and transform the land.  I had long studied the way each of the Elemental Lords worked and I was finally able to set up magical fields of the opposing element and locked them all up in their own chamber.  After gaining control of the Elemental Plane, my powers grew infinitely stronger each day and it became easier for me to manipulate Erdian's mind even deeper as well as putting curse on King Lerdes.  Anyhow, you have heard enough from me.  Make a decision now.  Join me and you shall rule the world along side me.  Fight me and you shall perish.\"","摧毁结余元素是我的首要计划 因为只有这样我才能利用隐藏在造成破坏的元素平面和心痛天气和变换土地。  我学了很久以成年勋爵工作和我终于建立起了神奇的田地反对要素和把他们都锁在自己的房间里  控制元素平板,我的力量 逐日变强和使我更容易操控埃尔迪安的心灵 甚至更深恶咒附身在勒德斯国王那里  无论如何,你已经听够我的话了  现在就做决定  加入我和你将统治与我同在的世界  与我战斗和你们必定灭亡。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\n\"One other thing that I almost forget to mention.  We can greatly improve our chance defeating Erdian if only we can find the last piece of the fabled Cloak of the Undead King:  The Dead Man's Boots.  We have already possessed the Amulet of the Undertaker and the Vampire's Cowl.  With the three items combined together, we will be able to raise Liches from the dead instead of mere skeletons!  The Boots must have been buried somewhere on the snowland after it got lost during the attack at the castle of Sashara.  Let's hurry and see if we can find the Dead Man's Boots.\" ","\"还有一件事,我差点忘了提  如果我们能找到 击败埃尔迪安的机会最后一个传说鬼王斗蓬:   死神靴.  我们已经拥有了 亡灵护身符 和 吸血鬼披风.  与将三个项目合并在一起,我们将能够提出尸巫调自而不是仅仅死去骷髅兵!  靴子一定埋在某处雪地在攻击时轰炸萨沙的城堡  快点和看看我们能不能找到 死神靴.\" "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\n\"So I see you're persistent.  Give it up now.  It will be too late to rescue the King from his eternal damnation anyhow.  The Elixir of Life will not bring him back to this world anymore.  You're gravely mistaken if you think I was the one responsible for causing the turbulent weather and wild terrain transformation.  The Elemental Lords were right.  I alone would not have the power to transform the landscapes nor alter the weather.  In fact, I alone would not have been able to overwhelm and imprison the Elemental Lords in their own chamber.  But you don't have to worry any further because your journey will end right here!  Go ahead and fight me.  In the event should you manage to defeat me, I shall grant you the Elixir of Life to release the King from his palace, if it's not already too late.\"","\"所以我看你坚持。  现在就放弃吧  营救为时已晚国王从他永恒的诅咒。   神圣血瓶他不会再回到这个世界了  如果你认为我错了一、对造成动荡的天气和野外地形变化。  成年勋爵是对的  我不会独自一人要转换的电源地貌不变化,也不变更天气。  事实上,只有我一个人是无法战胜的和监禁成年勋爵在他们自己的房间  但你不必再担心了 因为你的旅程会在这里结束!  继续和与我战斗  内如果你能打败我,我就答应你 神圣血瓶要释放国王的宫殿,如果还不算太迟的话。”"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\n30 Mighty Phoenixes are yours if you bring me the Ring of the Magi.","30 万能凤凰你带我来,就属于你 法师之戒."},
