 {"the-lone-knight-1\nA new month will be coming shortly; it will be wise to be well prepared for the plague and population boon. ","新月将很快即将到来;充分准备瘟疫和人口福利。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nA new week has arrived and your guardian comes to your tent to tell you about some important news.  First, it is confirmed that both the King and Queen are still alive.  Shortly after the King made a public appearance, he actually announced that he had put Queen Esuna in prison for all the bad deeds the Necromancer clan had supposedly done and for the curse befalling the royal family.  He even went on as far as offering rewards for whomever able to bring the Prince to the palace dead or alive.","新的一周到来和你的监护人来到你的帐篷 告诉你一些重要的消息  首先,可以确认:王王 国王和女王还活着  之后不久国王公开露面 他宣布他把王后艾苏娜关在监狱的所有人不良行为内骨术氏族应该已经做了以及  恶咒附身落落的,皇室家族  他为能带来给人的报酬,而加以报酬者,王子到亲王宫殿是死是活"},
