 {"the-lone-knight-1\nA week has passed and there's no sign of the Prime Minister Erdian's troops anywhere yet.  You've started to gain a lot of weak troops to support your army.  Fragile as they may look like, low-level monsters are very powerful in great numbers!  However, you feel that the preparation can be a lot easier if only your clan elders will just lend their armies instead of just giving you a poorly built castle and a handful of weak troops....","一周过去了和没有任何迹象埃尔迪安总理的部队还没到哪里  你开始获得很多弱小的军队 来支持你的军队  低级的怪兽在数量上非常强大!  但是,你觉得如果只有你的族长 才会借军队 而不是给你一个破城堡和少数弱小部队..."},
