 {"the-lone-knight-1\nActually, finding all four of the Elemental Lords is the only key to enter the Snowland where you can try to challenge Erdian and rescue the King and Queen from his evil grip.  Surely, the other clans will not let you pass easily and the only way around this is to try to find and defeat their leader.  Adela is the protector of the Elementalist clan, Xeron has control over the Heretics, and of course the hardest of all, Prince Jasca, who seems to have been poisoned by the evil Necromancer clan!  If the ancient legend is true, each of the clan's leader holds a piece of the fabled Armor of the Damned.  Damacon gave you the Rib Cage that he acquired from his ancestors a long time ago and he believed the breastplate's one of the four pieces to assemble the dreadful armor.  Finding the other three pieces will surely be a daunting task but if you want to succeed you'd better try to force the other clan's leaders to surrender their piece of the armor.  At this point, it's clear that war among the clans is inevitable and it will serve everyone well because the victor will prove to be worthy to challenge the evil Prime Minister himself and save the kingdom.","实际上,找到所有四个成年勋爵是仅输入密钥雪地,你可以在那里挑战厄尔登和营救王王 国王和女王从他的邪恶控制。  当然其它宗族不会让你轻易通过和绕着这圈子的唯一方法 就是试着找到和击败了他们的领袖  阿德拉是保护受人保护的元素主义家族塞尔伦控有控制异教徒和当然最难的,王子贾斯卡他似乎被毒死邪恶的神枪手家族!  如果古老的传说是真实的氏族首领手里拿着一块传说诅咒铠甲.  黛玛克给了您 骨质胸甲很久以前从祖先那里获得的和他相信胸罩是要组装的四块可怕的盔甲。  查找寻找寻寻寻找寻其它三个部分肯定将是一项艰巨的任务 但是如果你想成功其他宗族领导人投降装甲。  此时此刻,很明显氏族是不可避免的和它将很好地为每个人服务,因为胜利者将证明值得挑战邪恶总理本人和保存保存王国。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nActually, finding all four of the Elemental Lords is the only key to enter the Snowland where you can try to challenge Erdian and rescue the King and Queen from his evil grip.  Surely, the other clans will not let you pass their territory easily and the only way around this is to try to find and defeat their leader.  Adela is the protector of the Elementalist clan, Mutare is the reigning queen of the Warlocks, and of course the hardest of all, Prince Jasca, who seems to have been poisoned by the evil Necromancer clan!  If the ancient legend is true, each of the clan's leader holds a piece of the fabled Armor of the Damned.  Octavia gave you the Skull Helmet that she acquired from her ancestors a long time ago and she believed the helmet's one of the four pieces to assemble the dreadful armor.  Finding the other three pieces will surely be a daunting task but if you want to succeed you'd better try to force the other clan's leaders to surrender their piece of the armor.  At this point, it's clear that war among the clans is inevitable and it will serve everyone well because the victor will prove to be worthy to challenge the evil Prime Minister himself and save the kingdom.","实际上,找到所有四个成年勋爵是仅输入密钥雪地,你可以在那里挑战厄尔登和营救王王 国王和女王从他的邪恶控制。  当然其它宗族不会让你轻易通过他们的领土和绕着这圈子的唯一方法 就是试着找到和击败了他们的领袖  阿德拉是保护受人保护的元素主义家族摩莉尔是皇后时的国巫师们和当然最难的,王子贾斯卡他似乎被毒死邪恶的神枪手家族!  如果古老的传说是真实的氏族首领手里拿着一块传说诅咒铠甲.  奥格塔维亚给了您 骷髅冠她很久以前从祖先那里获得的和她相信头盔的头盔要组装的四块可怕的盔甲。  查找寻找寻寻寻找寻其它三个部分肯定将是一项艰巨的任务 但是如果你想成功其他宗族领导人投降装甲。  此时此刻,很明显氏族是不可避免的和它将很好地为每个人服务,因为胜利者将证明值得挑战邪恶总理本人和保存保存王国。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nActually, finding all four of the Elemental Lords is the only key to enter the Snowland where you can try to challenge Erdian and rescue the King and the Queen from his evil grip.  Surely, the other clans will not let you pass easily and the only way around this is to try to find and defeat their leader.  Mutare is the reigning queen of the Warlocks, Xeron has control over the Heretics, and of course the hardest of all, Prince Jasca, who seems to have been poisoned by the evil Necromancer clan!  If the ancient legend is true, each of the clan's leaders holds a piece of the fabled Armor of the Damned.  Gelare gave you the sword Blackshard of the Dead Knight that he acquired from his ancestors a long time ago and he believed the sword's one of the four pieces to assemble the dreadful armor.  Finding the other three pieces will surely be a daunting task but if you want to succeed you'd better try to force the other clan's leaders to surrender their piece of the armor.  At this point, it's clear that war among the clans is inevitable and it will serve everyone well because the victor will prove to be worthy to challenge the evil Prime Minister himself and save the kingdom.","实际上,找到所有四个成年勋爵是仅输入密钥雪地,你可以在那里挑战厄尔登和营救王王 国王和女王从他的邪恶控制。  当然其它宗族不会让你轻易通过和绕着这圈子的唯一方法 就是试着找到和击败了他们的领袖  摩莉尔是皇后时的国巫师们塞尔伦控有控制异教徒和当然最难的,王子贾斯卡他似乎被毒死邪恶的神枪手家族!  如果古老的传说是真实的氏族首领手里有一块传说诅咒铠甲.  格雷尔给了您剑黑魔剑很久以前从祖先那里获得的和他相信剑之剑要组装的四块可怕的盔甲。  查找寻找寻寻寻找寻其它三个部分肯定将是一项艰巨的任务 但是如果你想成功其他宗族领导人投降装甲。  此时此刻,很明显氏族是不可避免的和它将很好地为每个人服务,因为胜利者将证明值得挑战邪恶总理本人和保存保存王国。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nActually, finding all four of the Elemental Lords is the only key to enter the Snowland where you can try to challenge Erdian and rescue your father and mother from his evil grip.  Surely, the other clans will not let you pass easily and the only way around this is to try to find and defeat their leader.  Adela, the Cleric, has been chosen as the leader of the Elementalist clan, while Mutare is the reigning queen of the Warlock, and Xeron has control over the Heretic clan.  If the ancient legend is true, each of the clan's leader holds a piece of the fabled Armor of the Damned.  Nagash gave you the Shield of the Yawning Dead that he acquired from his ancestors a long time ago and he believed the shield's one of the four pieces to assemble the dreadful armor.  Finding the other three pieces will surely be a daunting task but if you want to succeed you'd better try to force the other clan's leaders to surrender their piece of the armor.  At this point, it's clear that war among the clans is inevitable and it will serve everyone well because the victor will prove to be worthy to challenge the evil Prime Minister himself and save the kingdom.","实际上,找到所有四个成年勋爵是仅输入密钥雪地,你可以在那里挑战厄尔登和营救你父亲和母亲从他的邪恶之手。  当然其它宗族不会让你轻易通过和绕着这圈子的唯一方法 就是试着找到和击败了他们的领袖  阿德拉, 被选为组织领导者元素主义氏族,而摩莉尔是皇后时的国华洛克和 塞尔伦控有控制异端氏族  如果古老的传说是真实的氏族首领手里拿着一块传说诅咒铠甲.  纳格斯给了您 亡灵盾很久以前从祖先那里获得的和他相信 护体神盾中要组装的四块可怕的盔甲。  查找寻找寻寻寻找寻其它三个部分肯定将是一项艰巨的任务 但是如果你想成功其他宗族领导人投降装甲。  此时此刻,很明显氏族是不可避免的和它将很好地为每个人服务,因为胜利者将证明值得挑战邪恶总理本人和保存保存王国。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAdela -- Armor of the Damned","阿德拉 -- 诅咒铠甲"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAdela -- Bless","阿德拉 -- 圣灵佑佐"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAdela -- Intro","阿德拉-- 内演"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAdela -- Lord of Water","阿德拉- 水之王"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAdela -- Rulers","阿德拉- 标尺"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter a day of practice and killing monsters, you actually feel good.  Fighting monsters that have been roaming too close to residential lately is actually fun for you.  You begin to understand and love the art of Necromancy to kill monsters and protect people.  You also realize that your skeletons grow stronger as you gain more experience.","实践一日后和杀死怪物,你真的感觉很好。  最近离住宅太近的战斗怪兽 对你来说确实很有趣  你开始明白和爱爱艺术艺术艺术招魂术杀死怪物和保护人民。  你也意识到骷髅兵随着经验的积累 变得更强大"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter a few days of practice killing the monsters roaming the area, you actually feel good about yourself. It's been a while since you're brought to D'dare to train with the Warlocks and Overlords. Your exceptional talent in commanding the Dragons is unsurpassed and you quickly advance ranks. After getting appointed as the head leader of the clan, you promise that you will devote all your life toward the glory of the Warlock clan. ","经过几天的杀戮后野兽漫游着区域中,你对自己感觉很好。 你好久没来戴戴尔训练了长锁和霸主们 你的卓越指挥才能龙是无过海的和你们应当先进,然后, 被任命为头头你承诺将毕生奉献给荣耀之光华洛克氏族 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter a few days of practice killing the monsters roaming the area, you actually feel good about yourself. It's been a while since you're brought to Ende to train with the Heretics and Demoniacs. Your exceptional talent in commanding the Devils is unsurpassed and you quickly advance ranks. After getting appointed as the head leader of the clan, you promise that you will devote all your life toward the glory of the Heretic clan. ","经过几天的杀戮后野兽漫游着区域中,你对自己感觉很好。 好久没带你们去爱地训练了异地和恶魔 你的卓越指挥才能 恶魔无人超过和你们应当先进,然后, 被任命为头头你承诺将毕生奉献给荣耀之光异端氏族 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter a few days of practice killing the monsters roaming the area, you actually feel good about yourself. It's been a while since you're brought to Phyrelle to train with the Elementalists. Your exceptional talent in chanting blessings on the troops has really made you advance ranks very quickly. After getting appointed as the head leader of the clan, you promise that you will devote all your life toward the glory of the Elementalist clan. ","经过几天的杀戮后野兽漫游着区域中,你对自己感觉很好。 好久没把你带到菲雷尔训练了元素主义者 你的非凡天赋 高呼祝福部队真的让你们的先锋队伍 很快地赶来了 被任命为头头你承诺将毕生奉献给荣耀之光元素主义家族 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter more than a month on your conquest, you finally witness something very unusual happening across the kingdom.  Strange weather pattern and restless wind over the high sea are of common occurrences.  Nagash advises you to be more careful because he's afraid that the weather changes have actually reshaped the whole kingdom.  The fertile grassland of Shi and Tara Island has been changed to various landscapes foreign to grassland.  Nagash has always had the suspicion this must be the work of the Prime Minister Erdian's sorcery powers!  Only a strong magician like Erdian can affect the weather pattern to such great extent.  You wonder how you will be able to defeat such powerful wizard whose sorcery can even alter the weather pattern.","在你征服了一个多月之后 你终于见证了 发生了一些不寻常的事情王国。  奇怪的天气模式和暴风吹来,公海经常发生。  纳格斯劝你小心点,因为他害怕天气变化实际上已经改变整个王国  肥沃的什叶派草原和塔拉岛已经改变为不同的景观 与草原不同  纳格斯一直以来必须是怀疑工作委员会的工作埃尔迪安总理魔力权力!  只有像埃尔迪安这样强壮的魔术师才能影响天气模式如此之大。  你想知道你如何能打败 如此强大的巫师魔力甚至可以更改天气模式。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter more than a month on your conquest, you finally witness something very unusual happening across the kingdom.  Strange weather pattern and restless wind over the high sea are of common occurrences.  Your guardian advises you to be more careful because it appears that the weather changes have actually reshaped the whole kingdom.  The fertile grassland of Shi and Tara Island has been changed to various landscapes foreign to grassland.  This must be the work of the Prime Minister Erdian's sorcery powers!  Only a strong magician like Erdian can affect the weather pattern to such great extent.  You wonder how you will be able to defeat such powerful wizard whose sorcery can even alter the weather pattern.","在你征服了一个多月之后 你终于见证了 发生了一些不寻常的事情王国。  奇怪的天气模式和暴风吹来,公海经常发生。  你的监护人建议你更加小心 因为看起来天气变化实际上已经改变整个王国  肥沃的什叶派草原和塔拉岛已经改变为不同的景观 与草原不同  这必须工作委员会的工作埃尔迪安总理魔力权力!  只有像埃尔迪安这样强壮的魔术师才能影响天气模式如此之大。  你想知道你如何能打败 如此强大的巫师魔力甚至可以更改天气模式。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter much effort, you've finally found the prison of Princess Frondy. The Princess is the descendant of Dracon, the Dragon Slayer. She's one of the few who strongly opposed the appointment of Erdian as the Prime Minister. She was banished after Erdian became the Prime Minister. She will certainly be a great help on your journey ahead. ","经过很多努力 你终于找到了佛朗迪公主的监狱 公主是公主出生的后代德肯, 龙龙屠戮成性. 她是其中之一少数反对者,任命埃尔迪安为总理。 厄尔登出生后被流放总理。 在你的旅途中,她无疑将是一个巨大的帮助。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter nearly sixteen years isolated in the land of the Necromancers, Prince Jasca must seek out the ones responsible for the falling of his kingdom of Sashara; as well as finding his father and mother, the King and Queen of Sashara.","经过近16年的孤立之后2008年1月1日至死亡骑士,王子贾斯卡必须寻找负责者应负责并且发现他的父亲,和妈妈,王王 国王和萨沙王后"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAfter the nasty fight with the Giants you're finally convinced that the fights ahead shall not be easier!  Solmyr's command over the Lightning spell is unsurpassed even by Erdian.  However, the mere thought on how Erdian could actually persuade such venerable Wizard to work for him is very suspicious. ","之后与 巨人你终于相信前面的战斗不会容易!  索姆拉命令闪电法术即使厄尔迪安也无法超越  然而仅仅想到厄尔迪安如何能说服 这种可敬的巫师为他工作 是非常可疑的 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAhead is the Heretic clan headquarters. The lava flowing on the ground looks very intimidating at first but after a while it's just mere tickle on the feet.  You can't wait to face off against Xeron.  His unsurpassed command over the devils will make him one worthy opponent -- if he's still alive, that is. ","前面是异端氏族总部 熔岩在滚动,地面一开始看起来很可怕 但过了一段时间 它只是有点痒脚。  你等不及要面对塞尔伦.  他无过天的指挥权 恶魔使他成为一位有价值的对手 如果他还活着,那就是说 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAkh the Magic Cloud!  The Magic Cloud will contain the enormous power of the Lord of Earth, Erdamon.  His prison must be up ahead! ","阿赫魔术云!  魔云将包含巨大的能量大地之王,埃德蒙.  他的监狱一定就在前面! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAll -- Queen","所有 - 女王"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAll 4 of magic orbs are essential. All combo artifacts will be available to assemble. All 3 of the Diplomacy artifacts can be traded for rewards.","所有4种灵丹妙药都很重要 全部组合宝物将可供组装。 全部 3 外交术 宝物可以用来换取回报。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAll right.","好吧。 不错。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAnxiety hits you upon entering the Beastmasters' and Witches' territory.  It's important to stay guard at all times and be on the look out for traces of Aryati and the whereabouts of wher she's imprisoned.  You just hope she's still alive and treated pretty well considering the Beastmaster clan's savage reputation.","进入时的焦虑感野兽大师'和女巫的领地  一定要时刻保持警惕和开始于寻找阿里亚提的痕迹和她被囚禁后的下落。  你只希望她还活着和被照顾的很好野兽首领家族的野蛮名声"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAnxiety hits you upon entering the Beastmasters' and Witches' territory.  It's important to stay on guard at all times and be on the look out for traces of Aryati and the whereabouts of where she's imprisoned.  You just hope she's still alive and treated well considering the Beastmaster clan's savage reputation.","进入时的焦虑感野兽大师'和女巫的领地  一定要时刻保持警惕和开始于寻找阿里亚提的痕迹和她被监禁在何处?  你只希望她还活着和得到良好考虑的野兽首领家族的野蛮名声"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nApproaching the shrilling sirens, you uncover a rare artifact.  This looks like to be the missing Tome of Air Magic!","A. 近近发出警笛,你发现少见的宝物.  这看起来像是缺少气系魔法书!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nArchangels are menacing the southeastern region of this land.  If you could be so bold as to defeat them, I would reward you with the Dimension Door spell. No, I cannot teach you Fly, but the Sirens will. ","大天使正在作恶,这片土地的东南部地区。  如果你敢胆敢打败他们 我会用 异次元之门 法术. 不,我不能教你飞行奇术,但警笛会的 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAren't you lucky to find another Wizard's Well! ","找到另一个你真幸运魔力源泉! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nArmor of Wonder","奇迹战甲"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nArmor of the Damned","诅咒铠甲"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAryati","阿里亚提"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAryati1","阿里亚提1颜色"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAryati2","阿里亚提2颜色"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs a loyal servant to King Lerdes and Queen Esuna, Aryati was the one who bravely saved Prince Jasca from the evil Prime Minister Erdian. She surrendered herself so that the Prince could escape.","忠于勒戴斯国王的仆人和王后艾苏娜阿亚提是一个勇敢的拯救王子的人贾斯卡调自邪恶的总理埃尔登。 她自首,所以王子可以逃脱。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs if the mysterious figure can sense what's inside your mind, she tries to talk to you with such high pitch, almost shrieking, voice:  \"Well, well, you have finally reached my forbidden, isolated island.  Let me introduce myself.  My name is Lea de'Vuz.  Do you know what and whom you're up against that you can be so annoyingly persistent?  Let me tell you something.  I had been watching Erdian since his first training to become a mage.  I knew that he had much potential inside him and I wanted him badly to become my disciple but he rejected my offer flatly.  I could have killed him on the spot for embarrassing me and letting me down but I badly needed to learn about his talent in Hypnotize spell so I spared his life.  For a while I almost gave up trying to recruit Erdian but then came just the ripe opportunity for me when the Necromancer's clan was waging war against the Beastmaster clan.  I wiped out Erdian's family, burned their home, and made it look like it's the Necromancer's doing.  As it turned out, Erdian had no choice but to seek my help so I took advantage of him unknowingly and worked on my own agenda to destroy the whole kingdom by tapping into his hidden powers to spread confusion and hatred among the royal family and the rulers of the land.\"","仿似神秘的图象能感知你心里的想法, 她想用高音和你说话, 几乎尖叫,声音: “好吧,你终于到达了 我被禁止的孤立岛。  让我自我介绍一下  我的名字莉亚德瓦兹。  你知道什么和你和谁作对 竟敢这么固执  让我告诉你一件事。  我从埃尔迪恩第一次训练成为法师.  我知道他体内有很大的潜力和我非常想让他成为我的徒弟 但他断然拒绝了我的提议  我本来可以杀了他的丢我丢脸的地和让我失望 但我非常需要了解他的才能蛊惑人心 法术所以我饶了他一命  有一阵子我差点放弃招募埃尔迪安 但后来又来了对我来说时机成熟的机会尼古鲁曼骑士的部族正在发动战争野兽首领家族  我消灭了埃尔迪恩的家人 烧毁了他们的家和让它看起来像它内脏术士在做  结果,厄尔迪安别无选择 只能寻求我的帮助 所以我不知情地利用他和在我自己的议程下 致力于摧毁利用他隐藏的力量 散布混乱和种族仇恨、仇恨和皇室家庭和标尺的陆地。\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs soon as you defeat the dragon warrior and step on the central island, you're taken aghast by the enemy you're about to face.  The real enemy who's been able to manipulate the Prime Minister like a puppet and who's been putting a curse on the royal family of Sashara is a woman!  Furthermore, it would have really never occurred to you that a woman would be capable of wielding such powerful magic that can affect weather and terrain like what you have recently witnessed yourself on the outer ring.  She looks serene, almost gleeful, but you're sure that behind such beauty, she's truly a sinister at heart and one that must be taken very seriously.  You decide to approach the castle cautiously.","一旦你失败神龙大侠和步进于中中岛,你被你即将面对的敌人  真正的敌人谁能够操纵首相像傀儡一样和是谁一直把恶咒附身日期 上莎夏皇室是女人!  而且,你从来没有想过 女人会运用如此强大的魔法 来影响天气和就像你最近亲眼目睹的地形一样外环。  她看起来很平静,几乎很愉快 但你肯定在如此美丽背后 她的内心深处是邪恶的和这一点必须非常认真对待。  你决定接近城堡要小心"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you approach the beautiful Mermaid, you are overwhelmed with new inspirations. ","随你行近美丽的美人鱼 你充满了新的灵感 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you approach the beautiful Mermaid, you are overwhelmed with new inspirations.  Come back anytime to learn the art of Navigation. ","随你行近美丽的美人鱼 你充满了新的灵感  随时回来学习艺术艺术艺术航海术. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you approach the prison, Erdamon, the Lord of Earth, faintly speaks to you: \"Thank you for coming to rescue me. There's a greater evil on the move besides the Prime Minister Erdian. He alone will not have enough power to cause the tumult that's affecting the weather and landscape changes. I am not sure who's capable of wielding such enormous powers. The only thing to do right now is for you to free all the other Elemental Lords because only then will you be able to enter the snowland and find out about everything. Please hurry. I will teach you the devastating Meteor Shower and Sorrow spells in exchange for my release.\"","随你行近监狱,埃德蒙, 大地之主,略微对你说: \"谢谢你来救我 还有更邪恶的另动移动总理埃尔登。 光靠他一个人,不足以造成影响天气和景观变化。 我不确定谁有能力 运用如此巨大的力量 现在唯一要做的就是让大家自由至尊的主,在那日你们才能进去。雪地和发现所有的一切 请快点 我会教你毁灭性流星火雨 和 悲痛欲绝 法术交换我被释放。\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you come closer to the prison, Brissa, the Lady of Air Magic, whispers to you:  \"Please accept my sincere gratitude for rescuing me.  I will have to tell you that the one who's responsible for the capture of all four of the Elemental Lords cannot be the Prime Minister.  He's not strong enough to control the elements.  We're not sure who's behind all of this, but we hope that you will be the one who can find out and bring peace back to the kingdom again.  Let me join and help you find all the other Elemental Lords for you will need all four of the keys we each hold in order to enter the snowland.  I shall also teach you the coveted Chain Lightning and Counterstrike spells as my token of gratitude.\"","当你靠近监狱,博丽斯, 夫人夫人气系魔法悄悄地对你说:\"请接受我对救我的真诚感谢\"  我必须告诉你负责全部 4成年勋爵不可能是总理。  他不够强壮,不能控制要素。  我们不确定是谁幕后幕后黑手 但是我们希望你以便他们发现,和恢复和平又回到了王国  让我加入和帮助您查找所有至尊的君主,你们需要四人中的所有四人。键,我们各自持有的键以输入雪地。  我也会教你计入连锁闪电 和 反戈一击 法术以示我的感激\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you prepare to attack the castle ahead, you just hope that your mother is still safe and that it will not be too late to find and rescue her.  You just feel that you should waste no time and capture the castle. ","当你准备进攻时你只要希望你母亲还安全和绝不迟到,和救救她  你只是觉得你不应该浪费时间和捕捉城堡。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you step inside the castle entrance, you can immediately hear Prime Minister Erdian's sinister voice:  \"You have finally come to face me.  It is amazing to know that you managed to defeat all of my allies and more remarkable still that you are able to enter the Snowland with the help from all four of the Elemental Lords.  You will not really understand the hatred that I have had against King Lerdes and Queen Esuna.  Before she married the King, the Queen was just a practicing Necromancer.  She obliterated my whole family when she was pursuing her dark art of Necromancy just to prove her worth to her clan.  I was at first elated when King Lerdes of Sashara was waging war against the Necromancers and immediately I offered my service.  However, I was quickly disappointed when the King chose to marry the murderer of my family to avoid unnecessary bloodshed among the clans.  You would never understand how I felt watching with my own eyes my dead parents, wife, and child. Queen Esuna had done the most horrible thing to my family and it's only fair that I did the same to her family. Could you imagine the horror she felt when I let her live to watch her husband turned into zombie and her son's beheaded?  It's too bad that the Prince could escape his fate or otherwise my revenge would have been complete.  Can you still blame me for what I have done?  Do you still want to challenge me?\"","当你踏进里面城堡入口,你可以立即听到埃尔迪安总理的阴险声音: “你终于来见我了。  知道你打败了我的所有盟友 真是令人惊讶和更显著的是,您可以进入雪地带全部从所有 4成年勋爵  你不会真正理解的我对勒德斯国王的仇恨和王后艾苏娜.  在她结婚之前国王奎恩只是个执业的神枪手  她在追求黑暗的艺术时 毁了我全家招魂术只是为了向家族证明她的价值  萨沙拉的勒德国王发动战争固骨术士和我立刻就提供了服务。  然而,我很快感到失望的是:国王选择结婚来避免不必要的流血氏族  你永远无法理解我亲眼看着 我死去的父母 妻子和孩子们。 王后艾苏娜已经完成对我家人最可怕的事和这不公平,我做了与她的家人一样。 你能想象我让她活着 看着她丈夫变成僵尸时 她感到恐怖和她儿子被砍头了?  太可惜了王子可以逃过他的命运 否则我的复仇就会完成  你还能怪我做了什么吗?  你还想挑战我吗?\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you step out of the teleporter you get all wet feelings creeping all over your body.  It must be because of the Lucid Pools that are covering the area. The Lucid Pools will certainly make any kind of Fire magic useless in their presence.  You highly suspect that the Lady of Fire magic, Ignissa, must be kept imprisoned on the lake ahead.  What a smart move, the Elemental Lady can't certainly escape without the Waterwalk spell from her prison on water like that.","当你走出传送器,你得到所有湿的感觉 爬遍全身。  一定是因为覆盖的卢西德游泳池区域。 卢西德游泳池肯定能制造出任何火系魔法他们在他们面前,是毫无裨益的。  你高度怀疑夫人夫人火系魔法, 依格尼萨必须关禁闭前面的湖边  多么聪明的举动,女元子一定逃不掉没有水行人法术她的监狱里有这样的水"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you walk toward the majestic Dragon Utopia, you unearth a curious artifact.","当你走近巨龙乌托邦,你发现了一个好奇的宝物."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you're about to open the prison, Kalt, the Lord of Water, tries to say something: \"I appreciate that you're here to release me. Please listen to me carefully. We, the Elemental Lords, have total command over the elements and it will not be so easy to match, let alone, defeat us. While I am not sure who's the one defeated me, I am very sure that it could not have been the Prime Minister Erdian. I knew him when he's still a young mage and he just doesn't have enough talent to wield such strong magic capable of calling forth fiery fields against me in the battle. You will have to find and rescue the other Elemental Lords for we are the only ones who possess the key to enter the snowland. Please be careful on your journey ahead. Release me and I shall join you and teach you the incomparable Clone and Mirth spells.\"","当你即将打开监狱,凯尔特, 水的主啊!求你说:我感谢你来释放我。 请仔细听我说 我们,元勋大人,全权指挥元素元素和更不要说击败我们了。 虽然我不确定是谁一击败了我,我确信这不可能总理埃尔登。 我认识他的时候他还年轻法师 和他只是没有足够的能力 运用如此强大的魔法 能够呼喊火田战斗。 你必须找到和营救因为我们是其他的成年领主惟有拥有输入键的密钥雪地。 前面的旅程要小心 放开我和我将加入你们和教书不可比较镜像大法 和 欢欣鼓舞 法术.\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs you're about to release your mother from her prison, you can see her glowing and hear her speaking faintly to you:  \"I am very relieved and proud to know that you have come to save me, my son.  You have grown up now and the Necromancers have really taught you well.  You certainly have made me and the kingdom of Sashara proud for what you have done to us all.  Your father has made the most horrible mistake of his life by trusting Erdian and now he's under Erdian's control.  We must hurry to save him before your father has completely lost his mind.  We must seize the Elixir of Life from Erdian's hands because only the Elixir is capable of bringing back your father to his old self.  It will be very difficult to defeat Erdian but we don't have much time nor a choice.  You must kill Erdian and save your father.  I have all the confidence in you, my son.  Please be strong and I shall help fight by your side from now on.\"","当你即将释放你母亲出狱时 你可以看到她发光和听见她对你微微地说:我确是宽慰的,和骄傲地知道你是来救我的 儿子  你长大了和内科医生真的教了你好东西  你确实使我和萨沙拉王国为你对我们所有人的所作所为而感到自豪  你父亲做了相信埃尔迪安 他一生中最可怕的错误和他现在在埃尔迪恩的控制之下  我们必须在你父亲完全失去理智之前 赶快救他  我们必须抓住 神圣血瓶厄尔迪安的手,因为肝素可以把你父亲带回他原来的自我  打败埃尔迪安将非常困难 但我们没有太多的时间和选择  你必须杀了厄尔登和救你父亲  我拥有所有儿子,对你有信心  请坚强一点和从今以后,我会帮助你与你并肩作战\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAs your boat approaches the prison, you hear a weak voice from the Lady of Fire, Ignissa:  \"I may look weak to you but it is because the one who defeated me had zapped all of my powers before I was put to prison here.  You'll need either the Boots of Levitation or the Town Portal spell before you even think of rescuing me.  I shall owe you my life and will join you.  Let me also teach you the forbidden spells of Armageddon and Berserk, the two will come really handy when fighting insurmountable armies.  Also I remind you that it's clear to me the Prime Minister Erdian could have not been the one who defeated me.  I hope we will be able to find more clues as we rescue all of the other Elemental Lords.  Let's waste no time.\"","随着你的船驶近监狱里,你听到一个弱的声音火之女,依格尼萨:\"我可能看起来软弱,但你觉得... ...在我被关进监狱之前,我所有的力量都被一个击败了我的人砍断了  你也会需要的 水神靴或 时空之门 法术在你想到救我之前  我欠你一条命和将加入你们。  也让我教你禁止法术联 联 年 月 日 月末日审判 和 丧心病狂, 在与不可逾越的军队作战时,两支将非常有用。  我还提醒你,我很清楚埃尔迪安总理不可能他曾击败了我。  我希望,在我们拯救所有其他成年勋爵。  让我们不要浪费时间。”"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nAt last, you defeated the Archangels, and the countryside is safe again!  Are you ready to accept the reward? Don't forget to visit the Sirens. ","终于,你输了 大天使, 和乡下又安全了  你愿意接受吗赏金? 别忘了来看我警报器 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nBe careful ahead. ","前面小心一点 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nBone Crusher","骨粉碎器"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nBonus Troops","奖金部队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nBonus building","建设利润"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nCan't find the Armor of Wonder yet?  Well, there you go!  By the way you can find the real Armor on the small island where all four of the magical fields collide. ","找不到 奇迹战甲还没?  好了,你来了!  由找到真正的盔甲小岛屿,这里所有四个魔力田相撞 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nChrysallis","克莱萨利斯"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClearly amused and disbelieved with all the mushrooms thriving to live on the frozen lake, you march on.  The Archangels must have fed on the mushrooms for they grow much bigger than Angels!  And the ones standing in the middle of the lake look really stuffed up; they may not even be able to fight!  Overcome by the humor, you taunt the Archangels:  \"Stuffed Mushrooms!\"","明显令人愉快和全体不信者蘑菇繁茂繁荣,可以生存冰冻湖,你继续前进。   大天使一定喂饱了蘑菇长大后天使!  和站立在中间湖看起来真的塞满了, 他们甚至可能无法战斗!  超过幽默,你这自以为是 大天使\"充满了蘑菇!\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClearly confused with what the Prime Minister's trying to tell you about another figure behind all the commotion, you decide to put the matter aside and focus on fighting and defeating the Prime Minister first.  After he's done for, it will be much easier to release the King from his palace to the south and perhaps you will get to know the one who's been helping Erdian accomplish his sinister plans to wreck havoc in the kingdom of Sashara.","与什么明显混淆首相想告诉你另一个背后人物骚乱,你决定把暂置事项和以战斗为重点和击败中总理第一。  等他完成后,就更容易释放了国王从王宫到南南和或许你们知道,他一直在帮助埃尔迪安 完成他的险恶计划萨沙的王国"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClone, Armageddon, Meteor Shower, and Chain Lightning are four of the most powerful spells of the elemental magic. I can teach you Armageddon if you just bring me the Talisman of Mana. ","镜像大法, 末日审判, 流星火雨, 和 连锁闪电是 4最强大的法术联 联 年 月 日 月元素魔法。 我可以教你末日审判如果你只是带我 魔法护符. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClone, Armageddon, Meteor Shower, and Chain Lightning are four of the most powerful spells of the elemental magic. I can teach you Chain Lightning if you just bring me the Talisman of Mana. ","镜像大法, 末日审判, 流星火雨, 和 连锁闪电是 4最强大的法术联 联 年 月 日 月元素魔法。 我可以教你连锁闪电如果你只是带我 魔法护符. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClone, Armageddon, Meteor Shower, and Chain Lightning are four of the most powerful spells of the elemental magic. I can teach you Clone if you just bring me the Talisman of Mana. ","镜像大法, 末日审判, 流星火雨, 和 连锁闪电是 4最强大的法术联 联 年 月 日 月元素魔法。 我可以教你镜像大法如果你只是带我 魔法护符. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nClone, Armageddon, Meteor Shower, and Chain Lightning are four of the most powerful spells of the elemental magic. I can teach you Meteor Shower if you just bring me the Talisman of Mana. ","镜像大法, 末日审判, 流星火雨, 和 连锁闪电是 4最强大的法术联 联 年 月 日 月元素魔法。 我可以教你流星火雨如果你只是带我 魔法护符. "},
