 {"the-lone-knight-1\nCongratulation for finding the Golden Gate!  Move along the shoreline.  A handsome reward is waiting for your hard work and diligence.","祝贺寻找金门!  向前移动海岸线  英俊的奖赏正等着你辛苦工作和勤奋"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nCould Solmyr be guarding inside the castle?  Where's Erdian?  Where's the King?  So many questions so little time. ","能够索姆拉里面守卫着城堡吗?  埃尔迪恩在哪?  在哪里国王?  这么多问题如此之少的时间。 "},
