 {"the-lone-knight-1\nErdamon has always been harsh in nature. The same harshness made him easily compete with his Earth elemental brethrens and claimed the title of Lord of Earth for himself. ","埃德蒙一直以来都是残酷的。 同样的严酷使他很容易与他竞争召唤土元素哥和索赔地主的称号 他自己。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nErdian","埃尔迪安"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nErdian -- Hyp","厄尔迪安 - Hyp 环环"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nErdian's family was accidentally killed by King Lerdes' army during the Barbarian's rebellion. Seeking revenge, Erdian tried to gain the King's trust and one day he succeeded in destroying the royal family.","埃尔迪安的家人意外被勒德斯国王军队杀害野蛮人的叛乱 厄尔迪安为了报仇 试图谋利国王的信任和有一天,他毁灭了众人,皇室家族"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEsuna","艾苏娜"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven the snowland didn't escape the terrain transformation.  Most of the snow has melted and covered with various landscapes foreign to the territory. Nevertheless, you still feel the cold weather chills you to the bone considering what dangers may still lie ahead.  Prime Minister Erdian has already gathered support from the Wizards of Nidogano.  Solmyr, one of the most powerful Wizards, can even match Erdian's powers in one-on-one duel. Clearly distraught by what you are up against soon, you march forward cautiously. ","偶连雪地没有逃离地形变化。  多数雪融化和地貌景观领土。 尽管如此,你仍然觉得寒冷的天气使你寒寒考虑未来可能还存在哪些危险。  埃尔迪安总理已经从尼多加诺的巫师  索姆拉,其中的一个最强大的巫师 甚至能以一对一的决斗 和埃尔迪安的力量相匹配 很明显,你对即将到来的遭遇感到非常不安,你谨慎地前进。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven though the Elixir didn't work to cure the King, at least it made the King wake up from his eternal slumber.  From a distance you can hear King Lerdes speaking to you:  \"You have done a great deal for your kingdom to come this far trying to rescue me.  I am afraid you have come too late.  Not only have I have lost the ability to use any cure or dispel magic to remove the curse, the Elixir of Life will no longer work because of these evil Shackles of War.  In fact, I doubt that anything or anyone can break the Shackles to free me.  Erdian was right, he was just a puppet and he was not the one who put the curse on me.  You will just have to find out yourself the person who's responsible for all the chaos that's been going on. Erdian was only a tool.  He could be exploited easily because of his hatred toward my wife, Queen Esuna.  The good news is that you will soon come to an end trying to restore peace to the kingdom again and I shall personally thank you for what you and your clan have done for the kingdom of Sashara.  The bad news is that you shall fight me in order to pass the border gate where you will find the real nemesis.  Please don't hesitate.  The royal family of Sashara may be doomed but you have saved the Queen and with your help, she should be able to restore the land to its former glory again.  Please give my final farewell to the Queen and put up your best fight because if you cannot kill and release me from this zombified body, you will stand a chance against what you will face next.  With my blessings, I hope you will continue to do what you always believe in your heart for yourself and the kingdom.\"","虽然埃利克斯没有工作到疗伤 国王,至少他做了国王从他永恒的睡梦中醒来  你从远处可以听到勒德国王对你说: \"你为你的王国做了很多事 来拯救我  恐怕你来得太迟了  我不仅输了使用疗伤或驱魔大法要删除的魔法 恶咒附身,  神圣血瓶由于这些邪恶,他们再也不能工作了战争枷锁.  事实上,我怀疑任何东西 或任何人能打破沙克勒斯让我自由  埃尔迪安是对的 他只是个傀儡和他没有以一个配, 恶咒附身对我。  你只要自己找出来个人责任人的责任一直以来的混乱 埃尔迪恩只是个工具  因为他憎恨我的妻子女王 他很容易被利用艾苏娜.  好消息是你们很快将结束 恢复和平的努力再一次王国和我将亲自感谢你所做的一切和你的宗族已经为萨沙的王国  坏消息是你们要跟我战斗 才能通过边关大门,您将在那里找到真正的仇敌。  请不要犹豫  萨沙拉的皇室,也许注定要灭亡 但你救了我一命王后和在你的帮助下,她应当能复原土地的旧荣耀再次降临。  请替我最后告别王后和拼尽全力战斗 因为如果你不能杀和把我从这个僵尸体中释放出来 你将有机会对抗接下来你将面对的  我祝福你,希望你继续做你一直相信的事情 为自己做你自己的事和王国。\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven though the Elixir didn't work to cure the King, at least it made the King wake up from his eternal slumber.  From a distance you can hear your father speaking to you:  \"I am proud that I can finally see you grown up and become such a great man and leader, my son.  You have made your mother and me very proud.  I am afraid you have come too late.  Not only that I have lost the ability to use any cure or dispel magic to remove the curse, the Elixir of Life will no longer work because of these evil Shackles of War.  In fact, I doubt that anything or anyone can break the Shackles to free me.  Erdian was right, he was just a puppet and he was not the one who put the curse on me.  You will just have to find out yourself the person who's responsible behind all the chaos that's been going on.  Erdian was only a tool.  He could be exploited easily because of his hatred toward your mother, Queen Esuna. The good news is that you will soon come to an end trying to restore peace to the kingdom again and to finally reclaim the throne for our family.  The bad news is that you shall fight me in order to pass the border gate where you will find the real nemesis.  Please don't hesitate.  I never had any regret in marrying your mother.  She might be a vile Necromancer to some but to me and to us all, she's proven herself to be a loyal wife and an outstanding person.  I know that your mother will help you restore our kingdom once more and that you will make a much better king than I ever was.  Please give my final farewell to your mother and put up your best fight because if you cannot kill and release me from this zombified body, you may not even stand a chance against what you will face next. With my blessings, I hope you will always do what you believe in your heart for yourself and the kingdom.\"","虽然埃利克斯没有工作到疗伤 国王,至少他做了国王从他永恒的睡梦中醒来  从远处你都能听到你父亲对你说: \"我为终于看到你长大而感到骄傲\"和成为一个伟大的人和领袖,我的儿子  你让妈妈成为你的母亲和我非常骄傲。  恐怕你来得太迟了  不仅我输了使用疗伤或驱魔大法要删除的魔法 恶咒附身,  神圣血瓶由于这些邪恶,他们再也不能工作了战争枷锁.  事实上,我怀疑任何东西 或任何人能打破沙克勒斯让我自由  埃尔迪安是对的 他只是个傀儡和他没有以一个配, 恶咒附身对我。  你只要自己找出来责任人背后的责任人一直以来的混乱  埃尔迪恩只是个工具  他可能很容易被利用 因为他憎恨你的母亲,女王艾苏娜. 好消息是你们很快将结束 恢复和平的努力再一次王国和最终恢复我们家族的王位  坏消息是你们要跟我战斗 才能通过边关大门,您将在那里找到真正的仇敌。  请不要犹豫  我从未后悔嫁给你母亲  她也许对有些人来说是个卑鄙的内脏术士,但对我和对我们所有人来说 她已经证明自己是忠诚的妻子和一名杰出人士。  我知道你妈妈会帮你 恢复我们的王国和以便你成为比我更优秀的国王  请你替我最后告别你母亲和拼尽全力战斗 因为如果你不能杀和把我从这僵尸的身体里放了出来 你可能连一个机会都打不过你接下来要面对的事 以我的祝福,我希望你将永远做 你对自己的内心所相信的事和王国。\""},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven though you don't exactly remember every detail of the story when the Prime Minister captured the King and Queen, you remember that the kingdom immediately fell into chaos and monsters started to roam free and spread terror everywhere.  Your guardian also told you about the story of Prince Jasca:  how he managed to escape the fateful battle and how he grew up and ended up ruling over the Necromancer clan, the clan where Queen Esuna came from originally.","即使你并不完全记得当被俘的总理王王 国王和女王,你记得王国立即陷入混乱和怪物开始自由漫游和到处散布恐怖。  你的监护人也告诉你王子的故事贾斯卡:他是如何逃脱的命运的战斗和他是如何成长的和终归统治者,死神氏族皇后的宗族艾苏娜原产于此。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven though you feel that the conquest is going smoothly, you can't help but notice a lot of skepticism and irritability running around the area you've landed on.  It must be because of the fact that they fear your undead armies more than they respect you as the heir to the throne of Sashara.  Perhaps all of your solitary years in the land of the Necromancers, toughened and focused by all the misfortune and cynicism from everyone, will make you remembered as the Lone Knight.","即使你觉得征服是顺利的, 你忍不住注意到 很多怀疑主义和周围运行的刺激性着陆区域。  一定是因为他们的确畏惧你,亡灵军队比他们更尊敬你们,继承人至萨沙拉的王位  也许你们这些孤独的岁月2008年1月1日至固硬的死神术士和以所有人为焦点 大难临头 和每个人的愤世嫉俗 将令你记住孤独的骑士."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nEven though you only have little memory and vague glimpse of what Queen Esuna looks like, there's no mistake that it is her who's being held in the prison ahead.  Her body's limp after having been kept in this vile underground with no sunlight.  However, you can still see the determined life in her eyes.  As you approach the prison, the Queen softly speaks to you:  \"Thank you, brave hero for coming to rescue me and, especially, for your undying loyalty to the kingdom of Sashara. It's a shame that the other rulers of the kingdom have taken advantage of the chaos for their own cause and it's very disheartening for me to know that my own lost son has also been possessed by the worst people of my own clan.  In the name of the kingdom of Sashara I shall give you my most sincere gratitude to endure such long and dangerous journey to fight for your kingdom.  Let's hurry now to save the King.  Prime Minister Erdian has brainwashed and made the King his puppet.  In order to save him, we must kill the Prime Minister and seize the Elixir of Life from his possession.  Only the Elixir will be able to reawaken and cleanse the King.  I shall help and join you in your journey ahead.\"","即使你记忆力微薄和模糊的一瞥女王是什么艾苏娜貌似,没有错,是她被关在前面的监狱  被困在这个肮脏的地下 没有阳光  然而,你仍然可以看到在她眼里决定了生命  随你行近监狱,女王温柔地对你说: \"谢谢你,勇敢的英雄来救我\"和尤其是为了你对萨沙的王国 真可惜其他统治者的其他其他统治者利用了...为自己事业制造混乱和令我非常沮丧的是,我知道 我自己的迷失的儿子 也被附身我本家族最坏的人  内 名字联 联 年 月 日 月萨沙拉国的国国萨夏拉... ...我将衷心感激你...和为你的王国而战的危险旅程  赶快去救人吧国王  埃尔迪安总理洗脑了和作出国王的傀儡  为了救他,我们必须杀人总理总理总理,总理和扣押 神圣血瓶他拥有的财产。  仅叶利西能重新唤醒和净 净国王  我会帮你的和与你们一起前行吧!」"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nExtra Troops","额外部队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nExtra troops","额外部队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFaerie... Faerie... Who's the foolest of them all? Y O U! ","仙灵... 仙灵... 谁最愚弄的吗? 尤欧乌! Y O U! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFew are able to train a dragon to become a loyal slave.  Draconia was still an infant when the witch Lea de'Vuz rescued her from the great fire engulfing the Ende underground.  Eversince, Draconia has served her master with undying loyalty.","很少有人能够训练龙成为忠诚的奴隶。  德拉诺尼亚还是个婴儿时女巫莉娅 德伍兹救出她大火将笼罩着,地下的内特。  从那时起,德拉科尼亚一直忠于她主人的忠诚"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFiery and feisty in nature, Ignissa was born when wild fire engulfed the entire Ende underground hundred of years ago. No one dared to challenge her when she claimed the highest rank among the Fire elementals to become the Lady of Fire magic. ","烈火和大自然的自大,依格尼萨当野火吞没时出生,整个Ende地下100年前。 当她声称,没有人敢挑战她最高级别 火元素成为夫人夫人火系魔法. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFinally!","终于!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFinally!  The gate to the underground prison!   It feels like it's been forever ever since you first tried to wage war against the Prime Minister.   With the rescue of the Queen, it will only be a matter of time to release the King from the Prime Minister's evil grip because only the Queen will know where the Prime Minister has put the King under his spell. ","终于!  向地下监狱!   这感觉就像它已经永远 从你第一次 试图发动战争总理。   与救援营救女王,现在释放时间已晚国王从首相的邪恶控制 因为皇后会知道在哪里总理提出国王在王下法术. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFirst you must prove your worth by defeating us!","首先,你必须证明你的价值 通过击败我们!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFollow the Golden Path to find the Statue of Legion.","后续要找到的黄金路径 天赐神兵."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nForgetfulness","失忆大法"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFrondy","曲调"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFrondy1","弗朗迪一号"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFrondy2","弗朗迪二号"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFurthermore, Nagash points out the harbor town farther to the south.  It appears that the silver border gate may be the one thing that has secured the area from the Prime Minister's savage armies.  However, upon closer investigation a strange monolith near your starting castle may foretell that the Prime Minister has actually successfully located your castle.  It will just be a matter of time before his army will come to attack.  Worse, the Prime Minister has managed to gather support from the underground Barbarians as well as the Beastmasters of the Swampland, the Clerics of the Tara island, the Druids of the Shi continent, and, the most dangerous of all, the Wizards of the Snowland.  You will never know which one of them will first come to attack, but it's clearly better to fully prepare for any ambushes ahead while keep working on gathering strong troops.","此外,纳格斯指出:更远至南边。  似乎:银色边境大门可能是有一件事情,它有保证区域从总理的野蛮军队  然而,经过更深入的调查 在你的起步城堡附近 一个奇怪的石碑 可能会预言首相实际上已经成功地找到了你的城堡  他的军队迟早要进攻了  更糟的是总理设法从以下各方争取到支持:地下野蛮人以及野兽船长沼泽教士塔拉岛德鲁德什叶大陆和, 最危险的是向导雪地岛  你永远也不会知道他们中谁先来攻击, 但显然最好做好充分准备, 以防今后发生任何伏击事件, 同时继续努力集结强大的部队。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nFurthermore, your guardian points out a grand castle near a subterranean gate.  It appears that the silver border gate protecting the subterranean gate may be the one thing that has secured the area from the Prime Minister's savage armies.  However, upon closer inspection, a strange monolith near your starting castle may foretell that the Prime Minister has actually successfully located your castle.  It will just be a matter of time before his armies come to attack.  Worse, the Prime Minister has managed to gather supports from the underground Barbarians as well as the Beastmasters of the Swampland, the Clerics of the Tara Island, the Druids of the Shi continent, and, the most dangerous of all, the Wizards of the Snowland.  You will never know which one of them will first come to attack, but it's clearly better to fully prepare for any ambushes ahead while keep working on gathering strong troops.","此外,你的监护人指出 附近有一个大城堡地下通道.  似乎:银边大门保护 地下通道可能有一件事情,它有保证区域从总理的野蛮军队  然而,经过仔细的检查 你起步城堡附近的一个奇怪的石碑 可能会预言首相实际上已经成功地找到了你的城堡  他的军队迟早要进攻了  更糟的是总理设法从地下野蛮人以及野兽船长沼泽教士塔拉岛德鲁德什叶大陆和, 最危险的是向导雪地岛  你永远也不会知道他们中谁先来攻击, 但显然最好做好充分准备, 以防今后发生任何伏击事件, 同时继续努力集结强大的部队。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGlad we can help!","很高兴我们能帮上忙"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGold -- Colors","金币--- 颜色"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGold for Colors","金币颜色"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGolden Path","金金路径"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGoldies","黄金"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGreetings hero.  We're the Sharpshooters under the command of Lady Aryati. Please rescue our master who's captured during the battle at Sashara palace.  She's being held captive by the loathsome Witches in the swampland to the east.  Please hurry! ","你好 英雄们  我们是 幻影射手下阿里亚蒂夫人的指挥权 请你救救我们的主人 谁被捕的主人萨哈拉宫殿战役  她被囚禁在令人憎恶的女巫沼地至东面  请快点! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nGreetings, my Prince.  We're here to bring you a message.  We used to be under Aryati's command when she's still working at the palace under Queen Esuna.  We've heard about her capture while trying to save you.  We're here to inform you that our lady is still alive and that she's being held captive in the Swampland to the north.  Please hurry and try to save our lady! ","你好,我的王子。  我们是来给你带口信的  我们以前在阿里亚提的指挥下 当她还在工作的时候女王统治下的宫殿艾苏娜.  我们听说她为了救你而抓捕你  我们是来通知你 我们的女士还活着和她被囚禁在沼泽地至北边  请快点和试着救我们的女人! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHave several of your secondary heroes cross the Whirlpool and explore the uncharted waters.   Just bring enough troops to withstand the whirlpools.","有几个二等英雄十字架支流和探索未知水域。   只要带足够的部队来抵抗龙卷风"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHave several of your secondary heroes cross the Whirlpool and explore the uncharted waters.  Just bring enough troops to withstand the whirlpools.","有几个二等英雄十字架支流和探索未知水域。  只要带足够的部队来抵抗龙卷风"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHave you rescued both Princess Frondy and Aryati?  You won't have a chance fighting Kilgor's Ancient Behemoths without their help. ","你救过弗朗蒂公主和阿里亚提?  你没有机会打架了科尔格数的远古比蒙没有他们的帮助。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHer uncanny ability to endure pain of all kind has made Lea de'Vuz able to learn high level magic with such ease.  Her control over all four magic realms is overwhelming because of her ability to draw powers from the elements.   ","她承受各种痛苦的不可思議的能力 使得莉娅 德伍兹 能够如此轻松地学习高水平的魔法  她对四大魔法王国的控制 压倒性很强 因为她有能力从要素。   "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere finally you locate the prison of the famous, legendary Sharpshooter Aryati.  Before she served Queen Esuna, Aryati commanded the sharpshooters of the Malang forest, close to the Necromancer clan area.   It's fate that Queen Esuna saved her life from grave injury and, in turn, years later Aryati almost gave her life to save the Queen's son, Prince Jasca. ","你终于找到了监禁所著名传奇人物幻影射手阿里亚提  在她为女王服务之前艾苏娜阿里亚提指挥 幻影射手联 联 年 月 日 月马兰森林,靠近死尸氏族区   女皇的命运艾苏娜救她免受重伤和之后的几年 阿里亚提几乎为了救她而献出了生命王后的儿子,王子贾斯卡. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere lizzard, lizzard","这儿,这边,那边,这边"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere you will finally have the chance to try out all the time you've spent practicing your combat against the mighty High Cleric Loynis!  His Prayer specialty will not be so frightening if you have already have the help from Princess Frondy's Enchanters. ","在这里,你终将有机会尝试全部你花时间练习你的战斗伟大的高贵教士罗尼斯!  他的祈祷专业才华不会这么可怕 如果你已经佛朗迪公主的帮助魔幻法师. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere's lizzard, lizzard","这是利萨德,利萨特"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere's my gift for you. ","这是我给你的礼物 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHere's your reward if you have dilligently been keeping track of your artifacts. ","这是奖励,如果你有 聪明的跟踪你的宝物. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHidden Seers","隐藏搜索者"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHidden under the rock, you uncover what appears to be a shining badge. ","隐藏在石头,你揭开一个闪亮的徽章 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHmm, so this is where Prince Jasca rules over the Necromancer clan.  Judging from the foul smells of the undead, it is clear that the Prince has completely turned to the evil side!","嗯,这就是王子的地方贾斯卡超过死神家族  从恶臭的臭味 亡灵很明显,王子已经完全转向了邪恶的一面!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHmm, so this is where Prince Jasca rules over the Necromancer's clan.  Judging from the foul smells of the undead, it is clear that the Prince has completely turned to the evil side!","嗯,这就是王子的地方贾斯卡超过死神的家族  从恶臭的臭味 亡灵很明显,王子已经完全转向了邪恶的一面!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHmm, you can see Rocklands magic fields cover the area.  The Rocklands should be able to subdue the powers of Brissa, the Lady of Air magic.  Her prison must be nearby! ","嗯,你可以看到 洛克兰的魔法田覆盖区域。  落石地应该能征服国 权博丽斯, 夫人夫人气系魔法.  她的监狱一定就在附近! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHmmm, so this is where the Barbarian's stronghold is.  It is a vast area, you feel that you must be on guard at all time if you want to survive here.","嗯,所以这里就是野蛮人的据点是  这是一个广阔的地区,你觉得 你必须时刻保持警惕 如果你想在这里生存。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHonor and love the people who've done a great deal for you. And tell them how much they mean to you and how much you love them because we just can't live without their care, love, and support. ","荣誉荣誉荣誉和爱爱他们为你做了很多事 和告诉他们他们对你有多重要和你有多爱他们 因为我们不能没有他们的照顾,爱,和支持。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHow pathetic! ","多么可悲! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nHow ridiculous if you think you can defeat me.  See how far you can go against the mightiest beast in the land:  the Ancient Behemoths! ","如果你认为你能打败我 真是太荒谬了  看你能对抗多远最强大的野兽陆地: 远古比蒙! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nI am an agent for an emperor of a distant land.  Recently, his armies have fallen on hard times.  If you could bring 4 Wyverns to me, I could pay you 15000 Gold.","我是一个经纪人皇帝那是从遥远的地方降示的。  最近,他的军队陷入了艰难时期。  如果你能带四飞龙我可以付你15000块金币."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nI will lend you 30 Arch Devils in exchange for the Ring of the Magi. ","我借你30块大恶魔兑换 法师之戒. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIf you can't cast any spells on the enemy, maybe it's a good idea to cast Prayer on your own troops at the start of combat.","如果你不能投法术日期 上敌人,也许这是个好主意祈祷派遣部队开始战斗"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIf you have a spare Armor of the Damned, you may want to use it to open the gate. ","如果你有备用的诅咒铠甲,您可能想要用它打开门。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIllusion","幻象"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nImpeek-a-boo! Who's hiding behind the Imps?","闪电! 躲在背后的是谁 小恶魔?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIn fact, your guardian convinces you that as a loyal subject to the kingdom it is your duty to try to save the King and Queen and fight the evil Prime Minister.  You don't have any idea of the whereabouts of where they're taken captive.  However, news from the snowland confirms that the King is still alive and that he has made a rare public audience even though he's under heavy surveillances from the Prime Minister himself.  With the King is still alive, there's more good reason for you now to fight for your cause.  Nevertheless, your guardian reminds you not to be distracted by the daunting task to rescue the King and Queen; instead it's best to focus your attention to build your troops first.","事实上,你的监护人说服你 作为忠诚的臣民你有责任拯救王国王王 国王和王后和战斗邪恶的总理  你完全不知道他们被囚禁的地方  然而,雪地证实国王还活着和尽管他受到严密的监视首相本人。  与国王还活着 你现在有更好的理由 为你的事业而战  尽管如此,你的监护人提醒你不要被艰巨的救援任务王王 国王和奎恩,你最好把注意力集中在先建立军队上"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIndeed, the strange terrain and weather changes must have been linked to the chaos that has been happening on the Elemental Plane.  The Necromancer clan is protected by the Lord of Earth while Lord of Air is the guardian of the Warlocks.  Lord of Water is worshipped by the Elementalist clan and Lord of Fire is the deity of the Heretics.  With the disappearance of all four of the Elemental Lords, it is no surprise there's no more control over the weather and terrain changes.  Only a demi-god foe will be able to defeat the Elemental Lords, could it be Erdian who's responsible for the missing Elemental Lords?  There's only one way to find out and that is to find the whereabouts the Elemental Lords are kept captive and whether they're still alive or not.","事实上,奇异地形和天气变化必须和一直以来的混乱元素平面。  死尸氏族受以下保护:大地的主,空中的主是监护人的监护人巫师  水的主,曾受崇拜,元素主义部族和火狱的主是(d)异教徒。  与失踪的所有失踪的所有大人 毫不奇怪 已经无法控制了天气和地形变化。  唯有神的敌人才能击败元素勋爵, 会不会是厄尔迪安负责失踪的元素领主?  只有一个方法可以知道和查找失踪世主们被俘虏和不管他们是否还活着。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIndeed, the strange terrain and weather changes must have been linked to the chaos that has been happening on the Elemental Plane.  The Necromancer clan is protected by the Lord of Earth while Lord of Air is the guardian of the Warlocks.  Lord of Water is worshipped by the Elementalist clan and Lord of Fire is the deity of the Heretics.  With the disappearance of all four of the Elemental Lords, it is no surprise there's no more control over the weather and terrain changes.  Only a demi-god foe will be able to match and defeat the Elemental Lords.  Could it be Erdian who's responsible for the missing Elemental Lords?  There's only one way to find out and that is to find the whereabouts the Elemental Lords are kept captive and whether they're still alive or not.","事实上,奇异地形和天气变化必须和一直以来的混乱元素平面。  死尸氏族受以下保护:大地的主,空中的主是监护人的监护人巫师  水的主,曾受崇拜,元素主义部族和火狱的主是(d)异教徒。  与失踪的所有失踪的所有大人 毫不奇怪 已经无法控制了天气和地形变化。  只有神的敌人才能匹配和失败失败成年勋爵  可能是埃尔迪安干的失踪的元素领主?  只有一个方法可以知道和查找失踪世主们被俘虏和不管他们是否还活着。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nInherited the special skill training the Enchanters from her ancestor, Dracon, Princess Frondy is Erdian's nemesis. She rallied against King Lerdes' decision to make Erdian the top official of the kingdom. She was quickly banished after Erdian became the Prime Minister. ","继承特别技能培训 魔幻法师她的祖先,德肯弗朗蒂公主是埃尔迪恩的敌人 她联合起来反对勒德斯王 做出厄尔丁的决定官员顶顶王国。 厄尔登出生后 她很快被流放总理。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIntro -- 1","内演 -- -- 1"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt looks like the castle ahead will be a great place for the new headquarters!","看起来像前方的城堡 将是一个伟大的地方新总部!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt looks like to be a dead end for now.  There's no other choice but to attack and kill Erdian first.  Perhaps he will finally reveal where he's put the King in prison.","它看起来像是死胡同 现在。  别无选择,只能进攻和先杀了埃尔迪安  也许他最终会揭开他的位置监狱里的国王。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt takes patience to finally get here.  Take your reward, you really deserve it. Thank you for playing the map. \n\nI dedicate the statue to my own Aryati, who's been loving me ever since I was born.  You're my champion and I love you dearly like a second mother to me. ","终于到这里需要耐心。  拿着你的奖赏,你应得的 谢谢你弹琴地图。 \n\n我献出我自己的阿里亚蒂的雕像, 阿里亚蒂, 谁一直爱我 从我出生。  你是我的,你是我的冠军骑兵 和我深爱你 就像我第二个母亲一样 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt was certainly hard for you to kill the beloved King with your own hands especially after you had come this close to release him.  The atrocity that has destroyed the royal family and the entire kingdom shall not go unpunished.  If Erdian and the King were right, there's still one daunting task in hand that needs to be done:  Finding the one working behind the evil scheme that has caused so much sorrow and chaos to everyone.  This may prove to be an impossible task considering that you will get to finally face off against the one capable of manipulating the weather and terrain, especially after you barely won against the armies of the Prime Minister and the King.  Nevertheless, you feel stronger and have renewed conviction after what the King has said to you about doing the right thing for the kingdom.  The King must be avenged and you're ready to unlock the gate and face what will be your greatest challenge yet.\n","杀你真是难亲爱的国王 用你自己的双手 尤其是你这么快就把他放了  摧毁了皇室家庭和整个王国不得逍遥法外。  如果埃尔迪安和国王是对的,还有一件艰巨的任务 需要完成:一名在工作,邪恶的计谋,它已造成许多悲痛欲绝 和给大家带来混乱  考虑到你最终将面对能够操纵天气和尤其是在你几乎没有赢过2001年5月1日至2001年4月总理总理总理,总理和国王  尽管如此,你还是感觉更坚强和之后又重新定罪,国王跟你说过要这么做正确的权利王国。  一定要为王报仇和你准备好解锁了门大门和面对你最大的挑战\n"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt will be to your best interest to find the location of the Lord of Air's prison as soon as possible.  Luckily, as one of the Warlock clan members, it will be easy for you to enter the Lord of the Air's chamber.  Similar to the Lucid Pools on the western part of your area, there's got to be other magical fields that serve as barrier to contain the Elemental Lords.  Unfortunately, bad news has just arrived from the other two neighborhood rulers, in addition to an equally disturbing news from the Prince himself.  The Elementalist and Heretic clan have both rejected the idea of an alliance and they seem to feel the need to exploit the chaos to claim the throne for their own.  Meanwhile, words from Prince Jasca are even grimmer.  The Prince has even sent an ultimatum for all clans to surrender under his name immediately.  It seems that sixteen years living under the Necromancer's tutelage has actually drawn out the evil side of the Prince.  It's not so clear whether the magical fields that contain the Lord of Air are located in either the Necromancer, Elementalist, or Heretic clan's territory.  Either way, it looks like fighting them all maybe the only option you have right now.","找到对你们最有利的地点的所在地空军监狱的领主 尽快。  幸运的是华洛克氏族成员,你们很容易进入约主王空降室  类似卢西德游泳池一定有其他的魔法田地 作为屏障成年勋爵  不幸的是,坏消息刚刚从还有另外两个街区的统治者 除了同样令人不安的消息之外王子自己。  元素学家和异端氏族都拒绝了联盟的理念和他们似乎觉得需要加以利用混乱索赔他们的王位。  同时,王子的话贾斯卡甚至更残酷。  王子甚至发出最后通牒 要求所有部族投降名字立即。  似乎有16年生活在15岁以下尼古鲁马术士的监护 已经被引出邪恶的一面王子  现在还不清楚包含空中之主在其中之一内鬼 元素主义者 或异教徒家族的领地  无论哪种方式,看起来都和他们战斗你现在只有选择"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt will be to your best interest to find the location of the Lord of Earth's prison as soon as possible.  Luckily, as one of the Necromancer clan members, it will be easy for you to enter the Lord of the Earth's chamber.  Similar to the Fiery Fields on the eastern part of your area, there's got to be other magical fields that serve as barrier to contain the Elemental Lords.  Unfortunately, it seems that the other three factions are hostile toward the Necromancers and they're even fighting against each other.  It's not so clear whether the magical fields that contain the Lord of Earth are located in either the Elementalist, Warlock, or Heretic clan's territory.  Either way, it looks like fighting them all maybe the only option you have right now..","找到对你们最有利的地点的所在地越快越好  幸运的是死尸氏族成员,你们很容易进入约主王地球的房间  类似火焰场在你的地区东部 一定还有其他的魔法田地 作为屏障成年勋爵  不幸的是,似乎其他三个派别对固骨术士和他们甚至还互相争斗  现在还不清楚包含地球之主位于元素主义者 华洛克 或异教徒家族的领地  无论哪种方式,看起来都和他们战斗现在只有你的选择..."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt will be to your best interest to find the location of the Lord of Fire's prison as soon as possible.  Luckily, as one of the Heretic clan members, it will be easy for you to enter the Lord of the Fire's chamber.  Similar to the Rocklands on the south-eastern part of your area, there's got to be other magical fields that serve as barrier to contain the Elemental Lords.  Unfortunately, bad news has just arrived from the other two neighborhood rulers, in addition to an equally disturbing news from the Prince himself.  The Elementalist and Warlock clan have both rejected the idea of an alliance and they seem to feel the need to exploit the chaos to claim the throne for their own.  Meanwhile, words from Prince Jasca are even grimmer.  The Prince has sent an ultimatum for all clans to surrender under his name immediately.  It seems that sixteen years living under the Necromancer's tutelage has actually drawn out the evil side of the Prince.  It's not so clear whether the magical fields that contain the Lord of Fire are located in either the Necromancer, Elementalist, or Warlock clan's territory.  Either way, it looks like fighting them all maybe the only option you have right now.","找到对你们最有利的地点的所在地火之王的监狱尽快。  幸运的是异端氏族成员,你们很容易进入约主王消防室  类似岩石地一定还有其他的魔法田 作为屏障成年勋爵  不幸的是,坏消息刚刚从还有另外两个街区的统治者 除了同样令人不安的消息之外王子自己。  元素学家和华洛克两族都拒绝了联盟的理念和他们似乎觉得需要加以利用混乱索赔他们的王位。  同时,王子的话贾斯卡甚至更残酷。  王子已经发出最后通牒 要求所有部族投降名字立即。  似乎有16年生活在15岁以下尼古鲁马术士的监护 已经被引出邪恶的一面王子  现在还不清楚包含火狱的主在其中之一,内奸 分子主义者 或华洛克家族的领地  无论哪种方式,看起来都和他们战斗你现在只有选择"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt will be to your best interest to find the location of the Lord of Water's prison as soon as possible.  Luckily, as one of the Elementalist clan members, it will be easy for you to enter the Lord of the Water's chamber.  Similar to the Magic Clouds on the western part of your area, there's got to be other magical fields that serve as barrier to contain the Elemental Lords.  Unfortunately, bad news has just arrived from the other two neighborhood rulers, in addition to an equally disturbing news from the Prince himself.  The Warlock and Heretic clan have both rejected the idea of an alliance and they seem to feel the need to exploit the chaos to claim the throne for their own.  Meanwhile, words from Prince Jasca are even grimmer.  The Prince has even sent an ultimatum for all clans to surrender under his name immediately.  It seems that sixteen years living under the Necromancer's tutelage actually has drawn out the evil side of the Prince.  It's not so clear whether the magical fields that contain the Lord of Water are located in either the Necromancer, Warlock, or Heretic clan's territory.  Either way, it looks like fighting them all maybe the only option you have right now.","找到对你们最有利的地点的所在地尽快让沃特监狱的领主  幸运的是元素派部族成员,你们很容易进入约主王水的室。  类似魔云开启一定有其他的魔法田地 作为屏障成年勋爵  不幸的是,坏消息刚刚从还有另外两个街区的统治者 除了同样令人不安的消息之外王子自己。  华洛克和异端氏族两族都拒绝了联盟的理念和他们似乎觉得需要加以利用混乱索赔他们的王位。  同时,王子的话贾斯卡甚至更残酷。  王子甚至发出最后通牒 要求所有部族投降名字立即。  似乎有16年生活在15岁以下尼古鲁马术士的监护 其实已经引出邪恶的一面王子  现在还不清楚包含水的主,在其中任一地方,内鬼 沃洛克 或异教徒部落的领地  无论哪种方式,看起来都和他们战斗你现在只有选择"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt's very dangerous ahead.  It's best that you come back later!  Open the Silver gate at your own risk!","前面很危险  你最好晚点再来!  开放银门,你冒着风险!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nIt's very dangerous ahead. It's best that you come back later!  Open the silver gate to free Princess Frondy at your own risk!  There may be a shortcut that will let you free the Princess if you just look hard enough. ","前面很危险 你最好晚点再来!  开放银门释放佛朗迪公主 冒着你自己的险  也许有条捷径可以让你自由公主,只要你仔细看看 "},
