 {"the-lone-knight-1\nJust when you think your nightmare will be over soon, there stand in front of you a legion of menacing Dread Knights waiting to mincemeat you. ","当你认为你的恶梦很快将结束时 站在你面前的是一群凶恶的士兵恐怖骑士等着你化身 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nJust when you thought you've reached the end of the ring, you're quickly overwhelmed with tremor after seeing who's been standing guard in front of the entrance to the castle.  It will really take all from you to be able to defeat the mighty dragon warrior! ","当你认为你已经达到期末看见谁一直守在进入城堡。  要能击败你们 需要你们全部的帮助伟大的神龙大侠! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nKalt was once summoned by powerful wizards from the water realm to subdue the flood that threatened the Nidogano continent. His affinity to water magic soon established his position as the Lord of Water. ","凯尔特曾经被强大的巫师召唤水体的征服洪水威胁尼多加诺大陆 他的亲亲关系水系魔法于2001年5月1日水之王 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nKing Lerdes","勒德国王"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nKing Lerdes chose to marry Queen Esuna under strong opposition from the royal family. His trust on the young mage Erdian would one day bring the downfall of his family and kingdom.","勒德斯国王选择娶皇后艾苏娜在强烈反对下皇室家族 他对年青法师厄尔迪安总有一天会带来他家属的毁灭,和王国。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLea de'Vuz","莉娅 德伍兹(瓦努阿图)"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLerdes","下游"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLerdes--Esuna","露迪丝...艾苏娜"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLet the journey begin!","Le 让我们旅程开始!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLet's go!","我们走!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLet's waste no time!","我们别浪费时间了!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLighthouse","灯塔"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nLooking for the Dead Man's Boots? Jump to the lake!","寻找 死神靴? 跳转到湖边!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nMaybe we should hurry!","也许我们应该快点!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nMeanwhile, your own scout who's been scouring the ocean to gather help from the Enchanters and Sharpshooters has sent you a report about the pleas to rescue Princess Frondy and Aryati who have been imprisoned by the Prime Minister.  The Princess will be a big help to your cause because she alone can train the elite Enchanters.  The sharpshooter legend Aryati is more important because not only she's the one who's sacrificed her own freedom to save you but also for the fact that her sharpshooters are some of the best marksmen in the land.  Having the help from the two will greatly boost your armies' power and morale.","同时,你自己的侦察兵 一直在搜探以从远洋收集援助 魔幻法师 和 幻影射手已经向您发送过关于请求拯救佛朗迪公主和被阿里亚蒂关押的总理。  公主会帮您大忙 因为她能独自训练精英精英魔幻法师.   幻影射手阿里亚蒂传说更重要 不仅因为她牺牲了自己的自由 来拯救你 也为了事实上,幻影射手中最优秀的格手土地。  已有帮助从二 二 将大大增强你们军队的力量和士气。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nMeanwhile, your own scout who's been scouring the ocean to gather help from the Enchanters and Sharpshooters has sent you a report about the pleas to rescue Princess Frondy and Aryati who have been imprisoned by the Prime Minister.  The Princess will be a big help to your cause because she alone can train the elite Enchanters.  The sharpshooter legend Aryati is no less important because sharpshooters are some of the best marksmen in the land.  Having the help from the two will greatly boost your armies' power and morale.","同时,你自己的侦察兵 一直在搜探以从远洋收集援助 魔幻法师 和 幻影射手已经向您发送过关于请求拯救佛朗迪公主和被阿里亚蒂关押的总理。  公主会帮您大忙 因为她能独自训练精英精英魔幻法师.   幻影射手阿里亚蒂传说同样重要,因为幻影射手中最优秀的格手土地。  已有帮助从二 二 将大大增强你们军队的力量和士气。"},
