 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNOTE:  Due to map design and glitch in the game, in order for the Elemental Lord learns all the spells, you will have to have her trade spells instead of your hero.  ","注:由于地图设计和插入错误游戏,以元素主学了所有东西 法术,你将不得不有她的交易法术而不是你的英雄。  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNOTE:  It is advisable that your main hero learns the following skills:  Logistics, Intelligence, Water, and Earth magic.  All four skills are availabe to learn from Witch's Huts and hidden Scholars.  Read all of the sign posts for clues. ","注:可取的做法是,主力英雄学习学习具备以下技能:后勤术, 智力水,和 土系魔法.  所有四种技能都用来学习巫师的棚屋和隐藏的学者。  全部读取线索的符号 。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNOTE:  It is advisable that your main hero learns the following skills: Logistics, Intelligence, Water, and Earth magic.  All four skills are availabe to learn from Witch's Huts and hidden Scholars.  Read all of the sign posts for clues. ","注:可取的做法是,主力英雄学习学习具备以下技能:后勤术, 智力水,和 土系魔法.  所有四种技能都用来学习巫师的棚屋和隐藏的学者。  全部读取线索的符号 。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNagash quickly reminds you not to take the whole matter too lightly. Raising skeletons can be very addictive all right but you must realize the urgent task in hands. Prime Minister Erdian has been trying to locate where you are and once he does, he will not hesitate to send his army to kill you and whatever it's in his way. Therefore, you will have to gather your own force quickly, especially if you want to free your parents and find the location where they're taken captive. Nagash shows you the map of the Ternate area. There's an abandoned town nearby to the south where you may be able to set up a new fort and amass more undead armies. ","纳格斯快速提醒您不要拿整个物质太轻轻。 提高 提高骷髅兵可能非常上瘾 但你必须意识到紧急任务掌握在手中。 埃尔迪安总理一直在寻找你的位置和一旦他这样做了,他会毫不犹豫地派军队来杀你和不管是什么阻碍着他 因此,你必须迅速集结自己的部队 特别是如果你想释放你的父母和查找查找查找他们被俘虏的地点 纳格斯显示地图图发芽区。 附近有个废弃的小镇你可以在南边建立新的堡垒和更大规模亡灵军队。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNeed more help? I will give you 200 Enchanters if you bring me the Wizard's Well. ","需要帮忙吗? 我给你200块魔幻法师如果你带我到 魔力源泉. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNext time pay more attention to your artifacts inventory! ","下次多注意你一点宝物库存! "},
