 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNidogano","尼多加诺"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nNonetheless, you can't help but grow skeptical about the Prince.  The Necromancers have long been waging wars against every ruler in the land and their misdeeds and corruption are notorious.  It could have been that the Necromancers were using the Prince to achieve their ulterior motive:  seizing the kingdom for their own.  For now all you can do is just wait and see what the Prince will do since reports from the Necromancer's land say that the Prince is leading an army.","尽管如此,你还是对王子  长期以来,死亡杀人犯一直在对每一个统治者发动战争。陆地和这等人的不义,和腐败臭名昭著。  本来可以正在使用Necromancer以达到其别有用心的目的:为他们自己的王国。  你现在所能做的就是等待和看见什么皇太子会这么做的,因为报告来自死神之地说王子领导着一支军队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOH YES! We're hungry for your flesh! ","哦,是的! 我们渴望你的肉! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOh good grief, that poor soul must have died of mushroom's poisoning.  You hope that he will not mind you taking his crest.","哦,天哪,那可怜的人一定是死于蘑菇中毒  你希望他不会介意你拿他的徽章"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOh no! You're not going any farther!","哦不! 你再也不会走了!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOh this is just great! She's just perfect as the Queen of Mushrooms! Seemingly unperturbed by your sarcasm, the Mushroom Seer told you to seek the King of Mushrooms farther to the northern island ring.","哦,这真是太棒了! 她就是那么完美蘑菇女王! 似乎没有被你的讽刺所困扰蘑菇Seer叫你找蘑菇之王远至北岛环"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOkay!","好吧!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOrb of Vuln","Vuln 半兽人"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nOvercome with tears, you are relieved that you have finally managed to find your mother's prison.  Even though you have little memory of your mother and know only what she looks like from what Nagash described to you, there's no mistake that the person being held in the prison is your mother.  It must have been some very hard years for her after having banished far away from her family in this wretched prison of no sunlight.  Her body looks very pale and weak even though the glow in her eyes is quite an evidence that she still has her life force within her.  Unable to restrain your heart anymore, you quickly move forward to open the prison and let her know that her son has come to rescue her. ","流着眼泪克服了这一切 你终于找到你母亲的监狱了  虽然你对母亲的记忆很少和只知道她长什么样纳格斯告诉你,没有错误关押在监狱是你的母亲。  一定对她来说是一段非常艰难的岁月, 因为她背井离乡,  她的身体看起来很苍白和虽说虚弱她眼中的发光 是一个相当的证据 证明她还有生命力 在她的体内。  无法再控制你的心脏了, 你迅速向前打开监狱监狱和让她知道她儿子是来救她的 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nP.M. Erdian","下午1时 埃尔迪安"},
