 {"the-lone-knight-1\nPrince Jasca","王子王子贾斯卡"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nPrince Jasca has command over a large territory of the Necromancer's clan right now.  Feared by many for his skills on the battlefield, Prince Jasca has assumed the name The Lone Knight.  It's a name that really suits him after having to endure all those solitary years without parents and despised by so many, even by most of the members of the Necromancer clan.  The news from the Necromancer clan has it that the Prince has been on the move to gather undead armies.  You're not so sure whether to take it as good or bad news.  The good news is that the Prince is well and alive and even though he's said to be a work of evil, he's after all the sole heir to the throne.  The bad news, the nature of the Necromancer clan has always been but unpredictable.  They're treacherous at heart and what they usually do will always bring utter destruction to others for the sake of building up massive skeleton armies.  For all you know, the Prince may just have been used as a cover-up for their ultimate motive to seize the kingdom for their own.  Nevertheless, you will just have to wait for the reply letter from the Prince.  And hoping for some really good news....","王子王子贾斯卡拥有对大片领土死亡骑士的部族现在。  许多人担心自己的技能王子,战场贾斯卡假定假设 名字 孤独的骑士.  是一个名字真正适合他 忍受了这么多年的孤独时光 没有父母和被如此多的人鄙视 甚至多数人成员名单死神家族  新闻来源尼古鲁曼骑士氏族有它王子一直以来移动以收集亡灵军队。  你不太确定是把它当成好消息还是坏消息  好消息是王子还好和活活和虽然据说他是邪恶的作品,但毕竟唯一的继承人宝座。  坏消息,A. 性质性质死神氏族一直无法预测  他们心底很奸诈和他们通常的行为,总是使别的民众遭受毁灭;兴盛起来骷髅兵军队。  就你们所知王子可能只是被利用来掩盖 他们最终的抓捕动机为他们自己的王国。  然而,你将不得不等待来函复信王子  和希望有好消息..."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nQueen Esuna","王后艾苏娜"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nQueen Esuna was the daughter of the most prominent family among the Necromancers. She has always been using the magic of the undead to protect her homeland and kingdom from the Beastmasters' invasion. After marrying King Lerdes, she moved to the palace and gave birth to Prince Jasca.","王后艾苏娜原为生儿最突出的家庭固死术士 她一直以来都在用魔法中的魔力 亡灵保护其祖国和王国从野兽大师入侵 嫁给勒德斯王后,她搬到了宫宫和生下王子贾斯卡."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nQuest Artifact: Emblem of Cognizance and Clover of Fortune.\nNote: It will be a good idea to fight Terek with your expendable troops. ","查询宝物: 真理徽章 和 幸运三叶草.\n注:这将是一个好的想法,特洛克与你的消耗品部队。 "},
