 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSixteen years have passed since the Prime Minister Erdian captured both the King and Queen and took control of the kingdom of Sashara.  The whereabouts King Lerdes and Queen Esuna are unknown.  Rumor has it that they both are still alive and that they're being imprisoned for fear of the effect their death would have on the Sashara. ","十六年过去了埃尔迪安总理兼总理兼首相王王 国王和王后和控制萨沙的王国  勒德斯王下落不明和王后艾苏娜未知。  传闻说他们俩还活着和因为他们害怕其死亡的影响萨沙拉 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSneak attack works best!","偷袭最有效!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSo this is where the Elementalist clan makes home.  Adela may look pretty but she's always ever scheming and ambitious!  Time to make her face the harsh reality that simply blessings won't be enough to make for a great commander!","所以这里就是元素主义的家族可以回家  阿德拉可能看起来很漂亮 但她总是有计划和雄心勃勃!  是时候让她的脸露脸了单纯的祝福不足以让一个伟大的指挥官 成为伟大的指挥官!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSomeone is hiding.","有人躲起来了"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSorry but first we'd like to see how worthy you're of our master!","对不起,但首先我们想看看你有多配我们的主人!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSoul Crusher","灵魂粉碎器"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSpeaking of the curse, both you and Queen Esuna grow really weary worrying about the fare of King Lerdes.  Erdian's dead and you've captured his Elixir of Life.  But from what Erdian told you before the fight, the Elixir might not be able lift the curse off of the King.  Nevertheless, it's still worth a try, besides the route to the palace is a short one.  If the King's still alive there's got to be hope. ","说到 恶咒附身你们两个和王后艾苏娜真正疲倦的 担心勒德斯国王的远征  埃尔迪恩死了和你俘获了他的神圣血瓶.  但从厄尔迪安之前告诉你的战斗,肝素可能无法升起 恶咒附身关闭国王  尽管如此,还是值得一试的路径路线宫殿是短的。  如果国王还活着 一定有希望的 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nSpeaking of the curse, both you and Queen Esuna grow really weary worrying about the fare of your father, King Lerdes.  Erdian's dead and you've captured his Elixir of Life.  But from what Erdian told you before the fight, the Elixir might not be able lift the curse off of your father.  Nevertheless, it's still worth a try, besides the route to the palace is a short one.  If your father the King's still alive there's got to be hope. ","说到 恶咒附身你们两个和王后艾苏娜真正疲倦的 担心你父亲,勒德斯国王  埃尔迪恩死了和你俘获了他的神圣血瓶.  但从厄尔迪安之前告诉你的战斗,肝素可能无法升起 恶咒附身从你父亲身上脱下来的  尽管如此,还是值得一试的路径路线宫殿是短的。  如果你的父亲国王还活着 一定有希望的 "},
