 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe Azure Dragon guarding the mushroom Seer holds the Stoic Watchman."," 圣龙警卫蘑菇树苗 守望者雕像."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe Belted Knights of Erathia guard this tower.  They will only let one of their own pass.  To join the order, you must first defeat the Medusa Queens guarding the Clover of Fortune of the northeastern region.","埃拉蒂亚的贝特骑士队 守卫这座塔  他们只准自己一个通过。  加入命令,你必须首先失败 美杜莎女王警卫 幸运三叶草联 联 年 月 日 月东北部地区。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe King is incapacitated and the Queen is banished by the evil Prime Minister.  The kingdom is in need of heroes to restore peace once again. Play the role of Prince Jasca to reclaim his rightful throne and rescue his parents or follow one of the other three rulers in the land to save the kingdom. ","国王无行为能力和女王被放逐邪恶的总理  王国需要英雄来恢复和平 播放亲王的作用贾斯卡夺回他的合法王位和或跟随其父母或其他三个统治者要保存的土地王国。 "},
