 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe Seer will swap your Cloak of the Undead King for the Armageddon's Blade.","将你换成新人鬼王斗蓬用于 末日之刃."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe Sharpshooters were also hiding something!"," 幻影射手也藏了东西!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe View Air and View Earth spells will come handy to locate towns, artifacts, and, especially, resources."," 透视大气 和 透视大地 法术迁居城市的时候,宝物, 和尤其是,资源."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe area behind the Silver Gate is a safe haven.  The whirlpools will take you to several different locations but will not take you toward the enemy's castles.  Seek the Mermaids, they will be happy to give you some rewards.   \nNOTE:  You can develop a secondary hero by visiting the Mermaids and doing the recruit Enchanter/Sharpshooter's side quest. ","区域后面银门是安全的避难所  龙池会带你们去几个不同的地方 但不会带你去敌人的城堡  寻找美人鱼,他们很乐意给你一些奖励   \n注意:您可以通过访问来培养第二英雄美人鱼和实做征聘征聘人员魔幻法师/幻影射手并肩作战 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe area behind the Silver Gate is a safe haven. The whirlpools will take you to several different locations but will not take you toward the enemy's castles.   Seek the Mermaids, they will be happy to give you some rewards.  \nNOTE:  You can develop a secondary hero by visiting the Mermaids and doing the recruit Enchanter/Sharpshooter's side quest. ","区域后面银门是安全的避难所 龙池会带你们去几个不同的地方 但不会带你去敌人的城堡   寻找美人鱼,他们很乐意给你一些奖励  \n注意:您可以通过访问来培养第二英雄美人鱼和实做征聘征聘人员魔幻法师/幻影射手并肩作战 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe area behind the Silver Gate is a safe haven. The whirlpools will take you to several different locations but will not take you toward the enemy's castles. Seek the Mermaids, they will be happy to give you some rewards.  \nNOTE:  You can develop a secondary hero by visiting the Mermaids and doing the recruit Enchanter/Sharpshooter's side quest. ","区域后面银门是安全的避难所 龙池会带你们去几个不同的地方 但不会带你去敌人的城堡 寻找美人鱼,他们很乐意给你一些奖励  \n注意:您可以通过访问来培养第二英雄美人鱼和实做征聘征聘人员魔幻法师/幻影射手并肩作战 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe area behind the Silver Gate is a safe haven. The whirlpools will take you to several different locations but will not take you toward the enemy's castles. Seek the Mermaids, they will be happy to give you some rewards.  \nNOTE: You can develop a secondary hero by visiting the Mermaids and do the recruit Enchanter/Sharpshooter's side quest. ","区域后面银门是安全的避难所 龙池会带你们去几个不同的地方 但不会带你去敌人的城堡 寻找美人鱼,他们很乐意给你一些奖励  \n注意:您可以通过访问来培养第二英雄美人鱼和do do 做征聘征聘人员魔幻法师/幻影射手并肩作战 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe birth of Prince Jasca was a very ominous event.  The Prince inherited his father's knightly leadership as well as his mother's sacred art of the Necromancy.  The evil Prime Minister took advantage of it and quickly spread rumors that the birth of the Prince was a curse.  People started to believe the rumor and that's how it all started.  The Prime Minister was finally able to capture the King, banish the Queen, and take control of the whole kingdom.  It was pure fate that the Prince managed to escape the dreadful attack by the Prime Minister.","出生日期贾斯卡这是一个非常不祥的事件。  王子继承了父亲的骑士领导术以及他母亲的神圣艺术 招魂术.  邪恶的总理利用了它和迅速散布谣言出生王子是个王子恶咒附身.  人们开始相信谣传和这一切就是这样开始的  总理终于抓住了国王,放逐奎恩,和控制整个王国  纯粹命运王子设法逃了出来可怕的攻击总理。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe green teleporter will take you to many different locations. It will also lead you to all four of the Elemental Lord's prisons. ","绿色传送器会带你去很多不同的地方 也会引领你找到元素主的监狱 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe guards here say they have orders to only let the member of the Necromancer's clan pass. ","这里的警卫说他们接到命令 只能让成员死亡骑士的部族通行证 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe latest news from the Snowland confirms that Queen Esuna has been imprisoned deep within the underground of the Elemental Plane.  The gate to the Plane can only be opened by all four of the Elemental Lords.  Rescuing all four of the Elemental Lords will have to come next because not only they hold the necessary keys to enter the Elemental Plane but also they will be able to teach you some powerful elemental spells known only by the Lords.","最新消息来源斯诺兰证实皇后艾苏娜被深囚禁在地下地下元素平面。  向只有所有四人才能打开飞机成年勋爵  恢复所有四个元素领主们将不得不来 因为不仅他们握着输入必需的密钥元素平面,他们也能教你 一些强大的元素法术仅为大人"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe only non-elemental being ever known to rule over elemental magic, Brissa was first accepted among the Air elementals due to her uncanny ability to weave a simple haste spell into powerful whirlwind. She became the Lady of Air magic after her predecessor relinquished her duty to marry a human. ","唯有非神学才能统治元素魔法博丽斯首次被接受 气元素因为她无法编织一个简单的攻击加速 法术变成强大的旋风 她变成夫人夫人气系魔法在她的前任放弃了与人类结婚的义务之后。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe past sixteen years have certainly not been easy for you.  The Necromancer clan, save for Nagash, have always been suspicious of you and will not accept you as one of their own.  It's because the Necromancer clan has never approved of your mother, Queen Esuna, marrying the King of Sashara.  However, now you are a strong adult.  Nagash tries to convince you that both the Knight and Necromancer blood running in your veins is actually a blessing, and that you need to tap into your powers within to realize the great potential inside you.  Maybe Nagash is right. It is time to show the Necromancers just who you truly are.","过去十六年对你们来说肯定不容易。  死神氏族,除纳格斯一直怀疑你和他们不会把你当作自己的一部分。  是因为女皇陛下,你母亲从未被死尸族批准过艾苏娜结婚萨沙的国王  然而,现在你是一个坚强的成年人。  纳格斯试图说服你骑士骑士和你血管里流淌的血 是一种祝福和需要利用自己的能力来实现你体内的巨大潜力  也许纳格斯是对的 是时候展示了死亡骑士只是你的真实身份"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe purple gate will randomly take you to any one of the four clans' territory. Approach with caution. ","紫色大门会随意带你去四个部族的领土。 谨慎行事。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThe ring surrounding the small island to the south is a perfect example of what's been happening across the kingdom.  All kinds of terrain known in Sashara can be found covering the ring.  Moreover, you feel curious about a very strong vibration coming off from the central island as if someone's practicing dark magic.  You finally get to understand that the landscape and weather changes must have originated from this very island and the ring serves to enhance the vibration and sending it off to all direction to disturb the balance of weather and terrains across the kingdom.  It's time to finally find out who's behind all of this and who's been casting the dark magic in such grand scale that its faintest vibration can cause so much trepidation.  ","环绕环环绕小岛屿至南南是整个南方 所发生的一切的完美例子王国。  萨沙所知道的所有地形 都可以找到覆盖环。  而且,你对一个非常强烈的震动感到好奇中岛好像有人在施暗魔法  你终于明白了景观和一定是这个岛引起的天气变化和用于增强振动和发送到所有方向以干扰天气平衡和横王国。  是时候终于找出幕后黑手是谁了和是谁一直在挑选其最微弱的震动 会造成如此多的惊恐  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThere has to be a shortcut near here because there's no way anyone can defeat those mighty dragons inside an anti-magic garrison! ","附近一定有捷径 因为没人能打败 反魔法卫军内部的强龙 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThere's an abandoned town to the East.","有个废弃的小镇东区"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThere's an abandoned town to the East. ","有个废弃的小镇东区 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThere's an abandoned town to the West.","有个废弃的小镇西边"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThere's no mistake that this part of the underground is the Warlock clan's stronghold.  The foul smell enveloping the area is unmistakably coming off from the wretched Harpies.  You just can't wait to finish off Mutare after the intimidating letter she sent rejecting the idea of an alliance!  ","这一点毫无疑问地下是地下沃洛克氏族的据点  肮脏的臭味笼罩区域从悲惨鹰身女妖.  你等不及要结束摩莉尔之后她寄来恐吓信,拒绝结盟的想法!  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nThis underground prison looks tame and uninhabited compared to the savage monsters guarding the entrance.  The lone obelisk over there might foretell that the Grail must also be hidden here somewhere. ","这个地下监狱看起来很温和和与野蛮野兽守卫入口。  那边的单方尖碑可能预言 圣杯也必须隐藏在这里某个地方。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTiatara","蒂塔拉a"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTime flies quickly and the conquest is going smoothly.  Leading an undead army proves to be natural for you.  It's still a long journey to reach all of the other three clan's territory, however, you feel confident that you will somehow manage to gather all four pieces of the Armor of the Damned.  Meanwhile, Nagash reminds you that the ultimate goals in your conquest are to find the King and Queen of Sashara and kill the evil Prime Minister Erdian for all the chaos and sorrow that he's caused both toward your family and your kingdom.  It will be a long and dangerous journey ahead indeed but you always keep your prayer that it will not be too late to rescue both your mother and father, as well as the glimpse of hope to find the loyal Lady who saved your life, Aryati.  Let everything be decided on the battlefield!","时间飞速飞逝和征服正在顺利进行。  领导亡灵军队证明你很自然  要到达所有地方 仍是一个漫长的旅程然而,你相信 你将设法 收集所有四块 诅咒铠甲.  同时纳格斯提醒你,最终要达到的目标就是找到王王 国王和萨沙拉女王和杀邪恶的总理埃尔迪安代表所有人混乱和 悲痛欲绝导致你的家人和你的国家。  时间会很长和前方确实有危险之旅 但你总是要保持祈祷救回你母亲还来得及和父亲,以及寻找希望的一瞥忠诚的女士救了你一命 阿里亚提  任由一切决定战场!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTime flies very quickly and the conquest is going smoothly.  Leading a big army proves to be natural for you.  It's still a long journey to reach all of the other three clan's territory, however, you feel confident that you will somehow manage to gather all four pieces of the Armor of the Damned.  Meanwhile, your guardian reminds you that the ultimate goal in your conquest is to find the King and Queen of Sashara and kill the evil Prime Minister Erdian for all the chaos and sorrow that he's caused both toward your clan and your kingdom.  It will be a long and dangerous journey ahead indeed but you always keep your prayer that it will not be too late to rescue both the King and Queen.  Let everything be decided on the battlefield!","时间飞速飞逝和征服正在顺利进行。  领导一支庞大的军队对你来说很自然  要到达所有地方 仍是一个漫长的旅程然而,你相信 你将设法 收集所有四块 诅咒铠甲.  同时 你的监护人提醒你最终目标是找到王王 国王和萨沙拉女王和杀邪恶的总理埃尔迪安代表所有人混乱和 悲痛欲绝导致他两个 都对你的部落和你的国家。  时间会很长和前方确实有危险之旅 但你总是要保持祈祷拯救这两个敌人,为时不晚,王王 国王和奎恩王后,请进  任由一切决定战场!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTiotara","提奥塔拉"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTired of using the Summon Boat spell over and over again? Lost or haven't found the Boots of Levitation? I have just the right spell for you. However, I'd first like to meet a hero who has mastered Attack Skill 50, Defense Skill 50, Spell Power 50 and Knowledge 50.  ","厌倦使用 召船术 法术超过和再来一次? 丢失或未找到 水神靴? 我刚才有右右右法术为你。 不过,我想先见见一位英雄 他已经掌握了攻击技巧50, 国防技能50,法术50电力 50和知识50  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTo fight or not to fight?!","斗不斗?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTorva","托尔瓦"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTorve","托盘"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTorvi","托维"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTorvo","托尔沃"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTrade the Clover of Fortune for the last piece to assemble the Angelic Alliance ahead or the Elixir of Life from the Seer above ground. ","贸易贸易贸易 幸运三叶草用于要组装的最后一块 天使联盟前方或 神圣血瓶调自地面上见。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTroops","部队部队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nTroops bonus","部队奖金"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nUGH!  You can't help but wondering how on earth you'd be able to defeat all those crazy Unicorns! ","唉哟!  你忍不住想知道 怎么能打败那些疯狂的人独角兽! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nUgh, the Archangels inside the garrison gate look very menacing!  However, there is no other choice.  The purple gate is the only key to let you finish off the remaining of the pesky Barbarians.","唉, 大天使内卫兵大门看起来好险恶!  然而,没有其他选择。  紫色大门是只允许您完成密钥剩余狂野野蛮人"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nUpon entering the last area of the Druid's clan, you're taken back by the sheer beauty of the Clover Fields.  The sweet, fragrant scent of the Clover's very irresistible and you hope you can find one of the freshest leaves to keep as a souvenir. ","入境时最后一个区域德鲁伊德的家族,你被带回来纯粹的美丽克罗佛菲尔德斯  甜甜香香香的香味克洛佛非常不可抗拒和希望你能找到一个最新鲜的叶子作为纪念品保存 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWe need to get going now!","我们现在得走了!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWe will not let you touch the Princess no matter what!","我们不让你碰公主不管发生什么!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWe'll be glad to join you.","我们会很高兴加入你们的"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWe're the Enchanters under the command of Princess Frondy.  Please rescue the Princess who's being held captive on the snow patch in the northern area of the Shi continent. ","我们是 魔幻法师下佛朗迪公主的指挥权  请营救被囚禁的公主积雪补雪北部地区什叶大陆 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWe're the Enchanters under the command of Princess Frondy. Please rescue the Princess who's being held captive on the snow patch in the northern area of the Shi continent. ","我们是 魔幻法师下佛朗迪公主的指挥权 请营救被囚禁的公主积雪补雪北部地区什叶大陆 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWeather","天气气象"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWell, well, look who's here.","看看谁来了"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhat are you waiting for?","你还在等什么?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhat do you mean by STUFFED MUSHROOMS?!","你是什么意思 东西MUSHROOMS!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhat took you so long?","你怎么这么久才来?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhat's this?! Where's the Tome of Air Magic?!","这是什么? 在哪里 气系魔法书?!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhat?  Give up already?!  You can do a little backtracking after you learn the Dimension Door spell from the King-of-the-Mushroom Seer over there.","什麽?  已经放弃了吗?  你可以在学习后做一些倒退 异次元之门 法术调自国王陛下- 那边的蘑菇房"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWhere else can you find a Clover of Fortune? ","哪里能找到幸运三叶草? "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nWimpy Giants can be quite overwhelming in great numbers!  Not to mention when they're cowardly hiding inside the anti-magic garrison.","胆怯巨人人数可相当惊人!  更别提当他们胆怯的时候躲在里面反魔法部队"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nXeron -- Armor of the Damned","塞尔伦 -- 诅咒铠甲"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nXeron -- Devils","塞尔伦 -- 恶魔"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nXeron -- Intro","塞尔伦-- 内演"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nXeron -- Lord of Fire","塞尔伦-- -- 火之王"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nXeron -- Rulers","塞尔伦- 标尺"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYes, I am the Prince of Mushrooms and I command Black Dragons. Have you found my sister, the Princess of Mushrooms? She lives near a fragrant clover field close to the south tip of Shi continent. Bring me the Emblem of Cognizance and I shall reward you with 30 Black Dragons.","是的,我是在蘑菇王子和我命令I 命令黑龙. 你找到我妹妹了吗?蘑菇公主? 她住在附近 香香的三叶草田附近什叶大陆南端 带我来 真理徽章 和我将用三十元奖励你黑龙."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYes, am I not the prettiest of all mushrooms? I am the Mushroom Princess. I will grant you the mightiest orb after you manage to defeat the Master of Resistance, Thorgrim.","是的,我不是最漂亮的蘑菇吗? 我是蘑菇公主 我答应你在你成功击败后 最强大的球硕士抵抗力, 索格灵."},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYes, make fun of me if you want.  I am the Mushroom King.  I will teach you the incomparable Dimension Door spell if you can kill those greedy, overstuffed Archangels that have been devouring my precious Snowfrost mushrooms. ","是的,如果你想取笑我的话。  我是蘑菇王  我会教你不可比较异次元之门 法术如果你能杀死那些贪婪的, 过度吃尽大天使吞噬了我珍贵的雪霜蘑菇 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYes, we're here to protect our leader, Aryati. Who are you? The Prince, Queen, King, we won't let anyone touch her anymore! ","是的,我们是来保护我们的领袖阿里亚提的 你是谁? 王子,女王,国王 我们不会再让任何人碰她了! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYes, you have finally come. I am the keeper of the Dead Man's Boots. I shall give you the boots if you can prove that you're worthy of Queen Esuna by bringing me her Armor of the Damned. ","是的 你终于来了 我是保存器 死神靴. 我会给你如果你能证明你配得上女王艾苏娜把她带到我身边诅咒铠甲. "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou can clearly see that the Prime Minister is hiding cowardly inside his castle.  Apparently he still has quite huge numbers of reserved armies to back him up but you feel that it's finally time to challenge the most evil person who's been causing so much grief to both your clan and kingdom for so long. However, upon further investigation, it may be wise to clear out the area to the south first for possible ambushes and, hopefully, you will also find the location where the King's being imprisoned. ","显而易见,你可以看到首相在城堡里躲藏着懦弱  显然他还有相当数量的 保留军队支持他 但你觉得终于该挑战了最邪恶的人 谁一直给你们两个家族 带来如此多的悲痛和如此漫长的王国 然而,经过进一步调查后,澄清区域为可能发生伏击,先南南部和希望你们也能找到位置的位置国王被囚禁了 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou can trade the Golden Bow for increased spell power from the Seer to the East or you can trade it for a mighty artifact from the swampland's Seer. ","你可以交易 黄金弓增加法术电源种子来源东方,或者你可以用它换一个强大的宝物调自沼泽地的探险者 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou did well!","你做得很好!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou feel an indescribable anguish after having to put your own father who you just have seen \"alive\" no more than few minutes to his eternal death.  Your mother comes to console you and that you have done what needs to be done and there should not be any regret.  Moreover, Erdian's dead and peace should be restored once again.  However, there's one unfinished task to do and that is to find who's been manipulating the whole situation.  In any event, it will be best to be well prepared because the real enemy looks like a formidable one.  One who can actually upset the balance of weather and terrain across the kingdom.  After a long moment of silence for your father, you feel more determined than ever to avenge for the death of your father and also to put an end to this whole evil scheme.  You march forward and get ready to unlock the gate.  ","你不得不把你父亲放在你眼里 让你感到难以形容的痛苦 你刚刚看到的\"活着\"的父亲  你妈妈来安慰你和已经做了你需要做的事情和不应有任何遗憾。  此外,埃尔迪安死了和应当再次恢复和平。  然而,还有一件未完成的任务和找到谁在操纵整个局势。  无论如何,最好做好充分的准备,因为:真正的敌人看起来像一个可怕的敌人。  真正能心烦的人天气平衡和横王国。  在你父亲沉默了很久之后 你比以往任何时候都更决心为他复仇你父亲的死和同时结束这个邪恶的阴谋  你向前前进和准备解锁门。  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou feel smart that you manage to find a shortcut! But the thought that those Dragons would run loose quite intimidates you. ","你找到捷径就觉得聪明! 但是以为那些龙会吓唬你 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou finally can see King Lerdes standing lifeless inside the castle ahead.  You tried to shout calling his name but there's no answer.  It's clear that the effect of the curse has really taken a toll on him that the Elixir of Life you obtained from Erdian may not cure. You quickly dispatch the Elixir to the guard standing at the border gate.","你终于能看到勒德斯王 活不动了城堡在前方  你喊着叫他名字但没有答案  很明显至 恶咒附身他真的付出了巨大的代价 神圣血瓶您从厄尔迪安那里获得的许可疗伤. 您迅速调度异异灵到守卫站岗边境大门。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou find a very curious key upon defeating the Cyclops Kings. Knowing the importance of such unique key, you decide to keep it safe. ","你找到一个非常奇怪的关键 击败 独眼巨人国王 知情如此独特钥匙的重要性 你决定要保证它的安全 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have come to find a rare phenomenon.  Here in this very spot all four of the elemental fields collide to form an intricate weave.  Stuck inside the weave, you notice a shining golden armor.  This must be the fabled Armor of Wonder! ","你来找一个罕见的现象  都在这四个地方元素字段相撞形成复杂的编织。  里面塞进去织,你注意到闪亮的金盔甲。  这必须传说奇迹战甲! "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have come to the end of your journey.  We are the Enchantress under the command of Princess Frondy.  Please release our Princess who's being imprisoned by the Druid's clan of the Shi continent.  We're trying to fight the Cyclops Kings over there for the key to the prison but we're overwhelmed. Please help us defeat the Cyclops and rescue the Princess!","你来过旅途结束  我们是A. 如下的促进者佛朗迪公主的指挥权  请释放被囚禁的公主德鲁伊德的家族什叶大陆  我们在努力战斗 独眼巨人那边的国王键的密钥监狱,但我们不堪重负。 请你帮我们打败 独眼巨人 和营救公主殿下! 公主阁下!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have come to the end of your journey.  We are the Sharpshooters under the command of Aryati.  Please rescue our master who's being imprisoned by the Witch's clan of the Torvi island.  We're trying to fight the Cyclops Kings over there for the key to the prison but we're outnumbered.  Please help us defeat the Cyclops and find our Master!","你来过旅途结束  我们是 幻影射手下阿里亚蒂 的指挥权。  救救我们被关进监狱的主人女巫的家族托维岛  我们在努力战斗 独眼巨人那边的国王键的密钥监狱,但我们人手不足。  请你帮我们打败 独眼巨人 和找到我们的主人!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have finally arrived on the Elemental Plane, one that can be considered a gate to enter the Snowland.  All four of the Elemental Lords have been rescued and they should be able to unlock the gates that hold the ancient Tomes of Magic.  However, it's better to attack the lone castle guarding the plane and find out about the location of Queen Esuna's prison.  It looks like the fight against the Prime Minister's main armies is just starting. ","你终于到了元素板块,可以被视为进入的大门雪地岛  全部四个成年勋爵获救和他们应该能够解锁锁着大门的门古老的魔法神话  不过,最好还是攻击独自守守城堡平平平面和发现女王所在地艾苏娜监狱  看起来像与打击反总理的主要军队才刚刚开始。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have finally reached the Tatara castle where Zubin cowardly hides himself.  The Prime Minister must have sent him to stay on guard here to keep the Clerics from rebelling.  Zubin's command over the Precision spell is unparalleled, it's good to keep the Forgetfulness spell handy. ","你终于达到塔塔拉城堡祖宾懦弱自藏  首相一定是派他来守守的叛逆派教士  祖宾命令 百发百中 法术这是无与伦比的,这是很好的保留 失忆大法 法术随你便 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have to defeat 1000 Crystal Dragons to remove this box. Remove the box?","你必须击败1000水晶龙要删除此框。 删除删除框中?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou have to defeat 1200 Rust Dragons to remove this box. Remove the box? ","你必须击败1200锈龙要删除此框。 删除删除框中? "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou just can't believe the Barbarian clan's stupidity.  They've actually left behind the key to open the sacred area where Kilgor's reigning!","你简直不敢相信野蛮部落的愚蠢。  其实他们已经离开了要打开的密钥密禁禁禁地区,其中科尔格统治!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou just don't believe how a mere human is capable of such atrocity and an evil scheme to destroy the entire kingdom!  This insanity must be put to an end.  The crazy witch Lea de'Vuz or whatever they call her shall not be allowed to live and cause any more pain.  And the only option that you have is to fight her fair and square.  She might be capable of controlling the elements but she's still human and there's got to be some weaknesses you can exploit to win against her.  There's no turning back now.  You just hope that the armies that you have are strong enough to defeat her ever-menacing Dragons. ","你只是不相信一个人 怎么会有这种暴行和一种恶计,欲加以毁灭;整个王国!  这种精神错乱必须结束。  疯疯癫癫的女巫莉娅 德伍兹或她们叫她的任何叫她的东西 都不得活着和造成更多的痛苦  和你唯一的选择就是与她公平竞争和平方。  她可能有能力控制她虽然是人类的元素和一定有一些弱点 你可以利用来战胜她  现在没有回头路了  你只是希望你拥有的军队足够强大 能够打败她那无穷的龙 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou may have to cast the View Earth spell to locate it but THE GOLD IS OURS!","可能你必须投 透视大地 法术以找到它,但 金币是我们的!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou may only have one chance for the Talisman of Mana for a long while, use it wisely.","你可能只有一个机会 魔法护符长时期的,你应当明智地使用它。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou may only have one chance for the Talisman of Mana for a long while, use it wisely.  Seek the Talisman of Mana from the Elemental Lords.","你可能只有一个机会 魔法护符长时期的,你应当明智地使用它。  寻找 魔法护符调自成年勋爵"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou may only have one chance for the Talisman of Mana for a long while, use it wisely. Seek the Talisman of Mana from the Elemental Lords.","你可能只有一个机会 魔法护符长时期的,你应当明智地使用它。 寻找 魔法护符调自成年勋爵"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou must kill the Azure Dragon to the north in order to leave the underground! Note: The Admiral's Hat may come handy at all time.","你必须杀人 圣龙至以北离开地下地下! 注: 海军上将之帽随时都可能很方便"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou must kill the Azure Dragon to the north in order to leave the underground! Note: The Admiral's Hat may come handy at all time. ","你必须杀人 圣龙至以北离开地下地下! 注: 海军上将之帽随时都可能很方便 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou pick up a fresh clover of fortune from the clover field. ","你捡到新鲜的幸运三叶草调自千叶田。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou ponder the matter carefully.  This is a really fishy situation because the King has for years been presumed dead.  If there's anything you can do, it will be finding the location of the prison where the Queen's being kept and perhaps sending a letter to the Prince to inquire about his stand in this whole situation.  You quickly dispatch carriers to deliver letters to the Prince as well as to the other rulers of the kingdom:  Mutare, the leader of the Warlock and Adela from the Elementalist clan.  You're hoping you will have full cooperation and alliances so that the battles ahead will not be too difficult.","你深思仔细考虑一下  这情况非常可疑 因为国王多年来一直被推定为死了  如果你能做点什么 它就会发现地点的所在地监禁地点:皇后被关起来了和可能发信给王子问他在这整件事中的立场  您迅速派遣承运人 发送信件给亲王和王子其他统治者的其他其他统治者王国 :摩莉尔, 组织领导者华洛克和 阿德拉调自元素主义家族  希望你们能全力配合和联盟,以便前面的战斗不会太困难。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou ponder the matter carefully.  This is a really fishy situation because the King has for years been presumed dead.  If there's anything you can do, it will be finding the location of the prison where the Queen's being kept and perhaps sending a letter to the Prince to inquire about his stand in this whole situation.  You quickly dispatch carriers to deliver letters to the Prince as well as to the other rulers of the kingdom:  Xeron, the leader of the Heretic and Adela from the Elementalist clan.  You're hoping you will have full cooperation and alliances so that the battles ahead will not be too difficult.","你深思仔细考虑一下  这情况非常可疑 因为国王多年来一直被推定为死了  如果你能做点什么 它就会发现地点的所在地监禁地点:皇后被关起来了和可能发信给王子问他在这整件事中的立场  您迅速派遣承运人 发送信件给亲王和王子其他统治者的其他其他统治者王国 :塞尔伦, 组织领导者异端和 阿德拉调自元素主义家族  希望你们能全力配合和联盟,以便前面的战斗不会太困难。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou ponder the matter carefully.  This is a really fishy situation because the King has for years been presumed dead.  If there's anything you can do, it will be finding the location of the prison where the Queen's being kept and perhaps sending a letter to the Prince to inquire about his stand in this whole situation.  You quickly dispatch carriers to deliver letters to the Prince as well as to the other rulers of the kingdom:  Xeron, the leader of the Heretic and Mutare from the Warlock clan.  You're hoping you will have full cooperation and alliances so that the battles ahead will not be too difficult.","你深思仔细考虑一下  这情况非常可疑 因为国王多年来一直被推定为死了  如果你能做点什么 它就会发现地点的所在地监禁地点:皇后被关起来了和可能发信给王子问他在这整件事中的立场  您迅速派遣承运人 发送信件给亲王和王子其他统治者的其他其他统治者王国 :塞尔伦, 组织领导者异端和 摩莉尔调自华洛克氏族  希望你们能全力配合和联盟,以便前面的战斗不会太困难。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou shall not pass until you can extinguish the curse we sure put on you!","直到你熄灭,你不得通过 恶咒附身我们确实把你戴上了!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou sit quietly inside your chamber accompanied by your trusty guardian, Damacon.  As the head of the Warlock clan, it is your duty to protect your home from harm.  With the fall of the capitol of the kingdom, Sashara, there's no telling when the Prime Minister Erdian will focus his attack on your clan's territory.  The urgent matter in hand is clear, you will have to start the preparation to fortify your castle and build an army big enough to thwart any invasion that may come to your way.","你静静地坐在你的房间 与你的信赖的监护人,黛玛克.  原头华洛克家族,你有责任保护你的家不受伤害  与秋秋甲甲基乙醇王国,萨沙拉,不知道何时埃尔迪安总理将集中攻击你们部落的领土  手头的急事已经很清楚了,你必须开始准备加固你的城堡和建立一支庞大的军队 来阻止任何入侵"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou sit quietly inside your chamber accompanied by your trusty guardian, Gelare.  As the new leader of the Elementalist clan, it is your duty to protect your home from harm.  With the fall of the capitol of the kingdom, Sashara, there's no telling when the Prime Minister Erdian will focus his attack on your clan's territory.  The urgent matter in hand is clear, you will have to start the preparation to fortify your castle and build an army big enough to thwart any invasion that may come to your way.","你静静地坐在你的房间 与你的信赖的监护人,格雷尔.  原新领导人的新领袖你有责任保护你的家不受伤害  与秋秋甲甲基乙醇王国,萨沙拉,不知道何时埃尔迪安总理将集中攻击你们部落的领土  手头的急事已经很清楚了,你必须开始准备加固你的城堡和建立一支庞大的军队 来阻止任何入侵"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou sit quietly inside your chamber accompanied by your trusty guardian, Nagash.  It has been years since the tragedy befalling your parents and your loyal friend Aryati, your mother's Lady-in-Waiting.  If it were not for her bravery in your rescue, you would not still be alive.  Sadly, even though Aryati managed to deliver you as a baby to the Necromancer clan for custody, she sustained great injury during the attack.  She surrendered feigning your death.  Nevertheless, deep inside your heart you believe that both your parents and your loyal savior must still be alive.  ","你静静地坐在你的房间 与你的信赖的监护人,纳格斯.  几年来父母的不幸降临,和你忠心的朋友亚里提 你妈妈的待婚女神  如果不是你救了她的勇气 你就不会活着了  可悲的是 尽管阿里亚蒂把你生成婴儿在被拘押期间,她受到重伤。攻击。  她投降 假装你死了。  尽管如此,内心深处... ...你相信双亲和你忠心的救世主一定还活着  "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou sit quietly inside your chamber accompanied by your trusty guardian, Octavia.  As the leader of the Heretic clan, it is your duty to protect your home from harm.  With the fall of the capitol of the kingdom, Sashara, there's no telling when the Prime Minister Erdian will focus his attack on your clan's territory.  The urgent matter in hand is clear, you will have to start the preparation to fortify your castle and build an army big enough to thwart any invasion that may come to your way.","你静静地坐在你的房间 与你的信赖的监护人,奥格塔维亚.  原组织领导者异端氏族 你有责任保护你的家不受伤害  与秋秋甲甲基乙醇王国,萨沙拉,不知道何时埃尔迪安总理将集中攻击你们部落的领土  手头的急事已经很清楚了,你必须开始准备加固你的城堡和建立一支庞大的军队 来阻止任何入侵"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou stumble upon what appears to be a very old key. ","你碰巧发现了一个很旧的钥匙 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou sure are slow!","你肯定是的迟缓大法!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to bring me the Elixir of Life before you can pass the border gate. The Elixir is necessary to wake the King up so he will give you an audience. ","你必须带我回来 神圣血瓶在通过前边境大门。 毒剂是醒来所必需的国王升起,他会给你观众。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to bypass a training ground to reach the Golden Gate.","你必须绕过训练场地才能到达金门"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to defeat 1400 Faerie Dragons to remove this box. Remove the box?","你必须击败1400仙灵龙去掉这个盒子 删除删除框中?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to defeat 800 Azure Dragons to remove this box. Remove the box?","你们必须击败八百圣龙要删除此框。 删除删除框中?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to defeat us first before you can challenge Kilgor. What? Afraid of the Magic Ground? ","在你挑战之前 你必须先打败我们科尔格. 什麽? 害怕魔力场? "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will have to kill the Azure Dragon before leaving the island. Note: The Admiral's Hat may come handy at all time.","你将不得不杀人 圣龙离开前岛屿岛。 注: 海军上将之帽随时都可能很方便"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will need all of the artifacts from the Elemental Lords. Do not lose them.","你们需要全部 宝物调自成年勋爵 不要失去他们。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will need all of the artifacts from the Elemental Lords. Do not lose them. ","你们需要全部 宝物调自成年勋爵 不要失去他们。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will need this artifact to open the gate blocking the sea to the far south.","你需要这个宝物要打开挡门至海远在南方"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will need this artifact to open the gate to the far south.","你需要这个宝物要打开向远在南方"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou will need this artifact to open the gate to the far west.","你需要这个宝物要打开向西部远处"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou're awed by the Fiery Fields surrounding the area.  The existence of the Fiery Fields will certainly nullify magic from water realm and it's almost certain you will find the Lord of Water's prison nearby.  Hardly anyone can match the powers of Kalt, the Lord of Water.  You start shivering thinking about who's capable of defeating the Lord of Water. ","被你迷倒了周围的火焰田区域。  存在烈火田势必使水田的魔力化为乌有和几乎可以肯定你会找到附近的Water监狱的主人  几乎没人能匹配国 权凯尔特, 水之王  你开始发抖 想着谁能击败水之王 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou're elated with joy after spotting the gate on the small island on the lake to the south. It looks like it will after all lead to the underground part of the Elemental Plane where Queen Esuna must have been imprisoned. If only the hero who's been standing guard inside the castle's cooperative.... You can't help but wondering the fine choices of heroes that Prime Minister has persuaded to fight for his side. If all of his minions are this tough, how tough can the Prime Minister himself be?","发现后你喜悦地欣欣喜大门打开小岛屿和小岛屿湖到南边。 看起来它终会变成地下地下部分女王所在的元素平面艾苏娜必须是监禁。 如果只有英雄一直守着里面城堡的合作社... 你忍不住想知道总理说服他们为自己而战的英雄们 选择了优美的英雄 如果他所有的仆人都这么坚强 多么艰难首相本人是吗?"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou're relieved with such a great joy after hearing about the news.  You owe your life to Aryati and it will only serve her well that you save her life now.  The passage to the Swampland is still yet to be discovered but you have found another good reason to march on now that you know your savior is still alive. ","听到关于新闻。  你欠阿里亚蒂的命和你现在救她一命 对她只会很好  通过至沼泽地还有待发现 但你找到了另一个好的理由 继续前进 现在你知道你的救世主还活着 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou're simply the best!","你很简单最好了!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYou've found me!","你找到了我! 找到我了! You've found me!"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYour eyes are covered with tears of joy after you're finally able to find the prison of Aryati, the one who risked her own life to save you during the skirmish in the Sashara palace.  You hurry to open the prison and can't wait to finally give her a hug yourself and let her know how grateful you are for all that she's done toward both you and your parents. ","在你终于找到之后 你的眼睛被喜悦的眼泪所覆盖阿里亚提人 的 监狱冒着生命危险来救你的人小规模萨沙拉宫殿  你快点开门监狱监狱和等不及要抱抱她了和让她知道 你是多么感激你 她对你们俩所做的一切和你的父母,你的父亲。 "},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nYour task here is to find the Clover of Fortune, which you can swap for the Thunder Helmet on the other side of the ocean.  Here's a pair of new boots and a speculum for your journey ahead.  Collect as many Sharpshooters and Enchanters as you can while you travel.","你的任务是在这里找到 幸运三叶草你可以用它交换 雷霆之盔日期 上另一边海洋。  这是一双新靴子和a a ,a瞭望镜让你的旅程向前。  收集尽可能多的收藏幻影射手 和 魔幻法师旅行时,您可以这样做。"},
 {"the-lone-knight-1\nZubin and Kilgor both hold the Sandals of the Saint. ","祖宾 和 科尔格两个都持有 圣者之靴. "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"By entering this sacred place you have proven your worthiness; you are one of a kind hero and we shall pledge our mighty wings & azure breath to your service! BEHOLD the might of the AZURE DRAGONS!!!\"","进入这个神圣的地方 你证明了你的价值 你是个善良的英雄和我们将保证我们强大的翅膀 和平静的呼吸为你服务! 将中 偶 数 圣龙!!!\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"Feel the thunderous rampage of the TITANS!!!\"","\"感觉疾雷轰轰轰烈 泰坦巨人!!!\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"Fire walk with me\"","\"火与我同行\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"The prisoner must not be freed! She still has 10 years to serve for her crimes!\"","\"绝不能释放囚犯! 她还有十年时间为她的罪行服务!\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"We are the keepers of the Grail and have kept its location a secret for more than a millenia! You shall not break this chain!\"","\"我们保存器 圣杯 和不止一个千禧年,它的位置一直保密! 你不可打破这条链子!\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"We were lost into this desolate land of fire and brimstone seeking better life and wealth, please let us join your army and get us outta here!\"","\"我们迷失在这个荒荒荒的 火灾之地和B. 寻求更美好生活的硫石和富足的财富,请让我们加入你们的军队吧!和让我们离开这里!\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\n\"When those bloody angels came, our group was disbanded and the rest of us were scattered across this island. You should seek them out. Notice that those remaining troops went hiding and like us they are not easily found; search carefully!\" ","\"当那些血腥的天使来了 我们的集团解散了和我们的其余部分散落在这座岛上 你该去找他们 通知其余部队人员躲藏和他们和我们一样,不容易找到;你们要仔细地搜寻。”"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nA ManBearPig?!?! ","曼比尔皮格? "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nA barbarian should know better!!!","野蛮人应该更清楚!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nA peasant took a shit on my island some time ago and now the bastard has fled to the most south-eastern corner of this land!! Go kill that son of a bitch!! He is hiding behind a local quest guard on that small piece of land... ","AA农民之前在我的岛上拉屎了和现在私生子逃跑了这片土地最东南的角落! 去杀了那个狗娘养的 他躲在一小块土地上的 本地探险警卫身后... "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nALL the remaining Black Dragons attack you!","全部全部剩余黑龙攻击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAbove: Stronghold island - The Hordes Haven -","以上: 坚固岛 -霍德斯港 -"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAfter a slow start, the birthrate of creatures in your first town has exploded due to a rapid improvements made to citys infrastructure and economy. This has greatly increased the number of creatures in creature dwellings!  ","a 之后迟缓大法开始,出生人口出生率生物在你的首个城镇,由于城市基础设施的迅速改善而爆炸和经济。 增加幅度大增数目数生物在动物的住处!  "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAfter so many days of wandering around you realise that it will take more than your current forces to conquer that Stronghold. It will take much much more! Absolute power is needed; something that would crush even the strongest defense...","历经了这么多天的漫游... ...你意识到... 还要花很多时间! 绝对力量是需要的;最强防守..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAh, finally the proof of your great deeds and bravery. Now you may pass but beware the danger that lurks ahead! I wish you luck...","啊,终于证明你们的行为,和勇敢无畏 现在你们或许能通过,但当心潜伏在前面的危险! 我希望你幸运术..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAhh!! Finally some upgrades!","啊! 终于升级了!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAhh, at last! Now I must prepare for the ritual. You have shown your valor and courage and that you are a gallant warrior traveler; the gates are opened! You might wanna check out that seer to the right before going in...","啊,终于! 现在我必须准备仪式。 你展示了你的勇气和勇气和你是一个英勇的勇士旅行者;大门打开了! 你也许想看看那个种子进去之前..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAhhhhahaha!!!! Finally the wanker is dead! Now you may enter my island. Just don't go taking a dump on there or I'll know...","阿哈哈! ! 最后,最后是最后的,蠢货死了! 现在你可以进入我的岛了 只是不要去 在那里拉屎,否则我会知道..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAlien shit","外星人狗屎"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAll the basic elements needed to summon Captain Planet: Only their combined power can free the seer beyond the brimstone stormclouds...","全部召唤地球船长所需的基本基本元素: 只有他们联合的力量才能自由过镜面红石暴风云..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAll the mindless masses that the Lord of Light controls have gathered here to serve as the operation human shield...","全部无知的大众光之王控制中心 聚集在此人道主义和过渡时期的护体神盾..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAs you approach the scholar, he shouts at you: \"Hey! I just saw a group of stronghold creatures running down that valley to the south!\"\n\n","随你行近 学术他对你大喊:\"嘿! 我刚刚看到一群据点生物奔向山谷南边!\"\n\n"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAs you are about to enter the red keymasters tent, legions of marksmen rushes out to defend the tent! It has been their barracks all along. \"How the hell they all fit in there!?\" you wonder to yourself...","当您即将进入红金主的帐篷, 枪手军团冲出防守帐篷! 一直以来都是他们的军营 \"如何\"地狱都在里面!\"你想知道..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nAt last, it is Ukko.  Do you wish to pass?","终于乌科.  你想通过吗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBehemoths growl something in their ancient tongue: you cannot comprehend what they say but somehow you sense that they are friendly and willing to join you!","比蒙在他们的古老的舌头里,有种长出,故你无法理解他们所说的话,但以某种方式,你觉得他们是亲善的人。和愿意加入你们!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBehold the Black Beast that lunges forward!","看着黑怪兽 向前冲!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBeware the Army of the Damned!!","当当心陆军可恶!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBeware the power of the elements that guard the portal...","当当心电功警卫人员门户网站..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBeyond lies the domain of Dungeons & Dragons","超越谎言Dungeons & 龙域域"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBuilding... Construction complete!","大楼... 施工完成!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBunch of wolf riders lunges forward from the bushes. They quickly recognize you as a trustworthy leader! ","一群骑狼的人从树丛。 他们很快就认出你是一个值得信赖的领导人! "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBy defeating the guardians in a fair fight you have proven yourself to the ancient Pagan Gods who have granted you passage to this sacred place of fallen warriors that are now honored by your presence. You may now freely take advantage of this place and visit any palces you like.","通过击败在公平斗争中的监护人 你证明自己远古的异教神灵 赐予你进入这个神圣之地... ...堕落的战士们... 现在你们可以随意利用这个地方了和去看任何你喜欢的薄荷糖"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBy fire be purged!!","被火烧了!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBy order of the king no one enters the underground!","以国王,任何人不得进入地下地下!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nBy the power of the light you shall not claim our most sacred relic! Army of angelic alliance attacks you!","由电功光之光... ...你不可索取我们最神圣的圣物! 陆军天使联盟攻击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nCAUTION: Sulfuric eruptions may occur!","可能发生硫喷发!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nCAUTION: The content of the box may decimate your ship. No docking allowed!","考量:内容的内容框中可能使您的船舶大量毁损。 不准对接!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nCCCCCHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!","CCCCHHHH HHHhHH HH! ! (CCCCHCHH HCHHCHH)! )!!!(CCCHHCH HH H HH CHH 赫哈! )。 !! (!)!(!!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nChaos beckoning!","乱七八糟!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nCrystal and Mercury shipment coordinates:\n\n-Crystals at 06:00\n-Mercury at 10:00\n\nCAUTION: May draw the attention of deadly dragons!\n","晶体和 水银货运坐标:\n\n-水晶上午6:00\n-水银上午10:00 10:00\n\n计算周期: 可能绘图致命龙的注意!\n"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nDo you know what killed the dinosaurs..?","你知道什么杀了人吗?恐龙... ?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nDwarf ready!","矮人准备!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nEchoes of the past heroes widens your experience and improves your skills!","回回过去的英雄会扩大你的经验和提高你的技能!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nEnchanters are known to sometimes wear Recanter's Cloak on festivals...","魔幻法师已知有时穿戴禁魔披风在节日上..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nEnormous amount of medusas ambush you!","大量数量美杜莎伏击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nEntering the Cloudvales of Odin. Beware the sudden storms...","进入奥丁云层 当当心突然暴风雨..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nExcellent!  You have found the 9999 Familiars; the project can finally begin! In fact, you may come with us and collect some of those sulfur dunes to yourself if you wish...","太棒了!  您已找到 9999 使魔; 项目终于可以开始了! 事实上,你可以跟我们走和收集其中一些硫磺如果你愿意的话..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFeel the fear of impending hell!!","感觉恐惧即将降临的火狱!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFew Rocs fly down from the sky and join you! ","少大鹏 飞行奇术下自天空天空和加入你们! "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFinally!  It is you, Ukko.  Here is what I have for you.  Do you accept?","终于!  是你们乌科.  这是我给你的礼物  你接受吗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFolks at your first town pulled their resources together and with hard effort they finally managed to build some critical buildings!","你第一个镇上的人拉着他们资源组合在一起和他们终于设法建造了一些关键建筑!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFreeze well!","别动!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nFrontal assault legions of the holy church attack you!","冲锋突击部队神圣的教堂攻击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nGGGRRRRROOOOWWLLLLLLLLLL!!!!!!!!!!!!!! We will fight by your side o mighty Ukko; the noble and honorable friend of the Ancients...","GGRRROOWLLLULLllLL ! !! 。 !。 。!!! 我们会在你身边战斗 与你并肩作战乌科; 高贵和光荣的朋友古代人..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nGive them a volley!","给他们一个排球!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nGoblins!? Don't let them free the prisoners! Attack em!!","哥布林!? 不要放他们自由战俘! 攻击他们!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nGoliaths crush!!","巨人冲撞!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nHail the Hordes!!","冰盖霍德斯!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nHelp us! We have been trapped and there is no boat here! Our bonfire is burnt out soon... \n-Group of hungry orcs-\n\n","帮帮我们! 我们被困和这里没有船! 我们的营火很快就烧光了... \n- 饥饿群体半兽人-\n\n"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nHow goes the hunt for that shithead?","怎么样猎杀那个混蛋?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nHuooooohhhhhhh!","呜呜呜!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nHurry that Tome of Earth Magic, I have to sacrifice soon or Crom will get angry! Also make haste finding those marks of honour or there will be no entrance for you! The marks are: Crest of Valor, Badge of Courage and Glyph of Gallantry! ","快点土系魔法书我必须牺牲很快或克罗姆会生气的! 也使攻击加速找到那些荣誉的痕迹 否则你将无法进入! 标记为:勇士勋章, 勇气勋章 和 勇士令! "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nI am sorry, but only 9999 Familiars will suffice, nothing else will do.","对不起,但只有9999使魔足够了,别无他法"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nI didn't vote for you!!","我没有投你一票!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nI require Tome of Earth Magic in order to properly sacrifice to Crom. As a sign of your honorability, you must bring me the Crest of Valor, Badge of Courage and Glyph of Gallantry. Only then you are able to pass. Just remember: It is extremely hard to find a way back from where you are about to enter...","我要求土系魔法书以便适当牺牲至克罗姆. 作为你荣誉的象征 你必须带我来 勇士勋章, 勇气勋章 和 勇士令. 只有这样你才能通过 记住,很难从你即将进入的地方 找到一条回来的路..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nI require huge volumes of manual labour in order to properly collect all that sulfur on that sulfur island ahead! I have heard the familiars are the best at collecting sulfur! Bring me 9999 familiars and the task will be completed in no time!","我需要大量体力劳动 才能妥善收集硫磺上硫磺前方的岛屿! 我听说过 使魔是最佳收集硫磺! 带我99999使魔 和任务将很快完成!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nICE AGE!!!","冰冰 冰 雪 冰时代!!!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nIn the ocean you see something floating; It seems to be some sort of a spell scroll in an ocean bottle: After carefully studying it, you learn its content...","内海洋,你可以看到一些漂浮的东西;它似乎是一种魔法卷轴在一个海洋瓶子里:经过仔细研究,你学会了它的内容..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nKiss me ääs me kiss me!","吻我,亲我!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nLegends tell that there is a massive amount of gems buried somewhere in the east; beyond the mountain, between the Cloudvale and the sea... ","传说有一大群宝石埋在某处东侧; 后山之间云谷和海洋... "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nLok tar ogar hero!! We will fight by your side! Also we heard a rumour that a famous sea captain named Haddock drowned along with his gold somewhere in the western seas; apparently he was looking for a strange box of mystery... No one has been able to find his body nor his gold...","洛塔欧加英雄! 我们会在你身边战斗! 我们还听说传闻 一位著名的船长 名叫哈多克金币中某处西海;显然他在找一个奇怪的神秘盒子... 没有人能找到他的尸体 或他的金币..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nLord ofLight","光华之王"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMA-39 ","MA-39号"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMASSE auta minua!! MASSE!!! Kultainen jouseni katosi mereen...\n\n-Tuusu","马苏塔米努亚! 马斯西! 库尔泰恩·约斯尼·卡托西·米伦...\n\n-图苏"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMassive undead strike force rises from the ground!","大规模亡灵由地面!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMay the power of the mages forever live on this land through our ring...","5月电功 法师永远生活在这片土地上 通过我们的戒指..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMore Archangels descents into the mortal world...","更多大天使与《公约》人类世界..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMore buildings...","更多的建筑..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nMountain vale belongs to the dwarves now! NO TRESPASSING!","山地山谷属于矮人,现在! 不许偷听!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNaaatting here..","在这儿看到..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNo chance...","没有机会..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNo one is allowed to enter this island! My marksmen will take care of that and even if they fail, we'll deploy an elite strike team to the entrance...","不准任何人进入这座小岛! 我的枪手会搞定的和即便他们失败了 我们也会部署一支精锐突击队入口..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNo trespassing beyond this point!","不准侵入此点之外!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNone may enter the golden sanctuary!","任何人不得进入金色的避难所!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNone shall desecrate the treasure sanctum!!","任何人不得亵渎宝藏!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNone shall read the sacred writings in the book of the water God! Prepare to meet your maker! ","任何人不应读作圣经中的圣物书本水神,水神! 准备迎接你的创造者! "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nNothing, eh?  I'm sure you will find the Recanter's Cloak soon.  Please keep looking. I hear Enchanters are usually wearing it...","没什么,嗯?  我相信你会找到 禁魔披风很快。  请继续寻找。 我听见魔幻法师通常穿着它..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nOn the side of the mountain it says: The one who reaches the Azure Lair shall reclaim the ultimate power...","时间侧边山上写着:达到的,Azure Lair 将收回终极力量..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nOn the wall of the garrison it says: In order to gain entrance to the ancestral hall of ancient northrend warriors, one must prove his worthiness in battle without any magical tricks; strength and honour are the only virtues venerated here! VICTORY or DEATH!!","时间墙壁驻军说:为了进入古老的北角战士的祖传殿堂 人们必须证明自己在战斗中的价值和荣誉是荣誉这里只尊崇美德! 胜利或死亡!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nOnly admiral class is granted passage to town, proof is required! The favorable winds are not to be trusted!","只有海军上将才获准进城 需要证明! 风是不可信任的!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nOur clan serves the Lord now! DIE!!","我们的家族服务于领主现在! 死!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nPath to victory is not easily found; the truth is often more than what meets the eye...","难以找到胜利之路;真理往往多于所见眼睛..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nPayback time","偿还时间"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nPooli on miesten peli!!","水手们!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nPresence of the Behemoths makes you tremble in terror!","出席情况 比蒙恐怖使你颤抖!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nProtectors of this sacred place attack you!","这个圣地的守护者攻击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nRemaining buildings...","其余建筑物..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSeeing that Stronghold up on the hill raises your spirit!","看到坚挺起来举起你的灵魂!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSo many skulls around here; you must be close to the entrance...","周围有这么多头骨,你一定离入口..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSome one eyed giants join you!","有些眼神,有些眼神巨人加入你们!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSome poor pirates have buried their treasure here!","一些贫穷的海盗 已经埋葬了他们的宝藏在这里!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuccess!! At last all the remaining buildings have been built by the townsfolk!","成功! 终于其余建筑物由乡民!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly a massive storm gathers around you!","暴风雨突然聚集在你身边!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly you feel as the earth splinters apart and the molten fires of hell fills the air. Vast army of Arch Devils attack you!!","突然间你感觉地分化和满是地狱的熔火空气。 庞大的军队大恶魔攻击你!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly you feel strange yet unstoppable force taking hold on you and lifting you and your whole army into the air! You loose conciousness for a brief moment but as you come to your senses, you feel different somehow; you feel enlightened, renewed, stronger, wiser and more experienced in every way: Odin himself has granted you superior knowledge, power and skills.","突然你觉得奇怪,但不可阻挡的力量 紧紧抓住你和举起你和整个军队进入...空气! 你一瞬间松开的同理心 但当你清醒时 感觉有不同的感觉和施恩而优美的(精神),即奥丁本身,确已赏赐你高明的知识、权力和权力。和技能。"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly you hear strange noises coming from the keymasters tent ahead... As you listen carefully you are able to hear some one saying: \"Hhsssh! He is coming, get your bows and arrows boys...\"","突然你听到怪异的声音前面的钥匙师帐篷... 当你仔细听的时候,你可以听到有人说: 他来了,拿你的弓和箭男孩...\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly you see a group of frightened orcs crawling out from behind nearby rocks and trees. They join you as they see their former companions with you!","突然你看到一群害怕的人半兽人从附近岩石后面爬出来和树。 他们与你们同在,因为他们看见前人的伴侣和你们在一起。"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSuddenly you see a strange hat floating in the sea accompanied with a heavy looking chest... On a closer look you see that there is a name on the hat: \"Haddock\"  ","突然你看到一顶奇怪的帽子漂浮在海中还有沉重的胸腔... 仔细看一眼,你可以看到名字日期 上\"哈多克\""},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSwarm of Ancient Behemoths guard this cloak! Fight?","摇摇远古比蒙守住这件斗篷! 战斗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSwarm of Archangels guard this ring! Fight?","摇摇大天使守住这个戒指! 战斗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSwarm of Chaos Hydras guard this ring! Fight?","摇摇混沌九头怪守住这枚戒指! 战斗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nSwarm of Phoenixes guard this vial! Fight?","摇摇凤凰守住这个瓶子! 战斗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTake me to the seer!","带我去看着!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTake us to our slavemaster. He resides in a quest tower somewhere in these lava fields...","带我们去找奴隶主 他住在一个探险塔里 位于这些熔岩田的某个地方"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTest your might!!","测试你的力量!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThat damn keymasters tent is unreachable!? I gotta find a way...","那该死的钥匙师帐篷是无法接触到的! 我得想办法..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThat's strange; you can't dock here no matter how hard you try?! There must be some way to reach that seer...","奇怪,不管你多努力,你不能停在这里? 一定有办法接近那个观察者..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe Harpies seem to be flying north. Perhaps to that shipwreck..."," 鹰身女妖似乎向北飞去了 也许到那个沉船..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe Lords forces came and stormed the island! Some of us were converted!! To think they'll fight their own kind now...","领主军来了和暴风,岛! 我们中有些人被改过自新了 想着他们现在会和同类战斗..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe Titans live?!"," 泰坦巨人活着?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe adventure begins...","冒险开始..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe devils shall desecrate this unholy place! We are just a scouting force! Our main army rises from hell if you take one more step... HAHAHAHAAAAAA!!! Now DIE!!"," 恶魔将亵渎这个不神圣的地方! 我们只是侦察术力量! 我们的主要军队从地狱中崛起 如果你再迈出一步... 哈哈哈哈! 现在死!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe dwarven returns return; Dwarf ready!!! (Ken Wahl is Dwarf...)","dwarven返回;矮人准备! (肯华华是矮人...)"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe dwellers in your first town sends a raven to you. The message says: \"Take heart Ukko, it's time we give something back and trust us, we know; hell it's about time!!\"","你们第一个城市的居民,确已派一只乌鸦来教化你们。 写着:\"心怀真心乌科是时候我们归还一些东西了和相信我们,我们知道。"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe guards here say they have orders to only let Oris pass. Any other hero entering this portal will fail!","这里的警卫说他们接到命令 只能让奥力斯过。 任何进入这个门户的英雄都会失败!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe guards here say they have orders to only let Ukko pass. Any other hero entering this portal will fail! Prepare yourself...","这里的警卫说他们接到命令 只能让乌科过。 任何进入这个门户的英雄都会失败! 准备一下..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe guards here will only let Ukko pass.","这里的警卫只会让乌科过。"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe guards note your red flag and offer to let you pass.  Do you accept? ","警卫注意您的红旗和允许你通过  你接受吗? "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe legendary archery division has finally tracked you down! Prepare for battle!","传奇箭术组织终于找到你了! 准备战斗!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe spirits tell me that I should trust those fiery birds ahead...","鬼魂告诉我,我应该相信 前面的火鸟..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThe swampland contains the prophecy of luck and fortune! The ladybird sings beyond the fortress of fear...","沼泽地含有预言幸运术 和 命运! 花鸟歌唱在恐惧的堡垒..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis area is filled with legions of dragons!! Only the bravest hero may enter and travel to the end... Pendant of Courage is the only thing that prooves me your worthiness!","这地方到处都是龙群! 仅最勇敢的英雄可能进入和前往结束... 勇气挂件是唯一能提升你价值的东西!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis massive mountain of sulfur is guarded by legions of Black and Rust Dragons. It seems to be the source of their fiery breaths. Fight?","这座巨大的山硫磺由黑军团守卫和 锈龙. 似乎是这样他们的毒气来源。 战斗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis massive stash of mercury has formed a consistent platform floating back and forth the shoreline. Unfortunately this platform has drawn the attention of  nearby Azure Dragons. They spot you as you are trying to recover the precious mineral! DEFEND YOURSELVES!!","大量藏匿的水银形成了一个一致的平台 向后浮动和未来海岸线 不幸的是,这个平台引出附近的注意圣龙. 他们发现你正试图康复贵重的矿物! 保护好自己!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis mystical artifact is guarded by a group of hostile creatures. Will you fight them?","这个神秘的宝物由敌对集团守卫生物. 你会跟他们打吗?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis spot feels magical for a brief moment...","片刻,这个地方感觉神奇..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis treasure is ours! Die!!","这宝藏是我们的! 去死吧!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis treasure seems to be haunted by thousands of ancient mariners that have turned to ghosts. You dare to challenge them?","这个宝藏似乎被成千上万的古代航海者所困扰 这些人变成了鬼魂 你敢挑战他们?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThis way! No that way!!","这边! 不许走那边!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThose damn fearie things prevents us claiming all that shiny stuff!!...","那些该死的恐怖的东西阻止我们声称那些闪亮的东西!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nThree great ones shall deliver the absolute creature...","三个大神将拯救绝对的生物..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTo Tame a Land","驯服大地"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTo gain the power to force ones mind not to shoot but to strike, follow the northern winds. Wings of venom and holy are the key...\n\n-Forgotten Seer","获得强力迫使人们不考虑开枪,而是罢工,跟着北风 毒液翼和圣圣键...\n\n- 忘记的见者"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTread carefully; underground passage leads to the land of the treading Behemoths! Proceed with your own responsibility...","仔细地看好线索;地下通道通向2008年1月1日至脚踏比蒙! 履行你自己的责任..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nTurn back or you will meet your end here in these dungeons!","转过身去 不然你就会在地牢里 遇上死路一条"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nUkko","乌科"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nUkko the allmighty you have proven to be the greatest hero of them all by freeing us from Jari-Pekkas torment! He shall feel the scorching heat of our horrible azure breath!","乌科 证明你是万能的将我们从亚里派卡斯的折磨中解救出来! 他将感觉到燃烧着我们可怕的正气的焦热!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nUkko, a great barbarian (pagan) who has lost everything, wakes up in a small island in an unknown land; a land full of unmathced perils and puzzles... Can you survive this tale? Can you beat the impossible odds? If so, consider yourself a true master of Heroes of Might and Magic 3!! ","乌科一个伟大的野蛮人 他失去了一切 在一个小岛上醒来 在未知的土地上和谜题... 你能活下来吗? 你能击打难得的几率? 如果是这样的话 就当自己是英雄的真主人吧和魔术3! "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nVery little is known about Ukko. Legends say he has been born of the Gods themselves and that he is a descendant of the original Northern Pagans. What is certain, is that his skills at commanding armies and winning battles are unmatched. He has the potential to be the absolute warrior hero... ","鲜为人知乌科. 传说他出生于真主自己和. 他是一个后裔,原为北方异教徒 可以肯定的是 他指挥军队的技巧和胜利的战斗是不可比拟的。 他曾经具有绝对勇士英雄... "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWANTED: 9999 Familiars, alive! \n\n-The slavemaster of the sulfur island-","需要:9999使魔活着! \n\n-奴隶主国 硫磺岛屿-"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWE DID IT!!","我们成功了!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWatch out! There is an ambush near tower guard...","当心! 塔岗附近有埋伏..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWe are the last guardians!!","我们是最后的守护者!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWelcome to High Hrothgar","欢迎使用 Hrouthgar 高发者"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWelcome to the realm of Boglords!","欢迎欢迎光临博格洛德王国!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWhat I have is for Ukko alone.  I shall give it to none other.","我所追求的乌科独自一人。  我不会再给别人了"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWhat a tough guy!! You have closed this case completely!","好硬的家伙! 你彻底结案了!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nWhat?! What is this..?","什么? 这是什么?"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou are Ukko, last remaining hero of the original pagan tribes from the North. Your journey begins here; alone and lost on the forgotten island in an unknown land. But that won't bother you at all, for you are determined to survive and conquer this world by becoming the greatest HERO of them all! But beware: the world is full of unimaginably dangerous creatures and hard puzzles... Good luck!","你是乌科最后剩下的英雄的原始异教徒部落北边 你的旅程从这里开始 独自一人和损失时间被遗忘的岛屿 在未知的土地上 但那不会困扰你 因为你决心活下去和征服这个世界成为最伟大的英雄,他们所有! 但请注意:世界上充满着难以想象的危险生物 和硬拼图... 好幸运术!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou are not Ukko.  Begone!","您不是乌科.  走开!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou are not welcome to the realm of the Titan Lords! If you continue down this path, legions of my fellow Titans will strike you down!! You may only stand a chance with the help of some rare magical items but even that's doubtful...","你不受欢迎领域所包括的领域 泰坦巨人领主! 如果你继续沿着这条路走下去 我的朋友们泰坦巨人将击倒你! 你可能只有机会与帮助一些稀有的魔法物品 但即使如此也值得怀疑..."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou come across a huge mountain of gems hidden beneath the clouds. But before you know it, some two legions of Fearie Dragons attack you as they are the guardians of these gems.","你来到了一座巨大的山宝石隐藏在云层。 但在你意识到之前 有两个恐龙大军攻击你监护人的监护人或监护人的宝石."},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou feel the earth itself shaking under your feet and deep thunder rising above your head! It must be the Titans... ","你感觉地在你的脚下摇动和深深的雷声从你的头上升起! 必须是 泰坦巨人... "},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou heathens will never learn... Hundreds of my brothers in arms have captured this town and you shall never reclaim it!","你们这些异教徒永远学不会... 我成百上千的弟兄们 已经占领了这个小镇和你绝不能收回它。"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou sail into a large mountain of crystals just beneath the sea level! As you are about to collect the crystals to your ship, you realise that some of them are moving; before you know it, Crystal Dragons attack you! DEFEND YOURSELVES!!","你驾船驶向一座大山水晶仅下海平面! 因为你们即将收集 水晶你确已知道他们中有迁移的,在你知道之前,水晶龙攻击你! 保护好自己!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYou unholy beasts shall feel the might of the Lord!","你们这些不神圣的野兽会感到中 偶 数领主!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nYour forces have made another breakthrough at building things!","你们的力量在建设东西方面又取得了突破!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nby the power of the light","至电功轻型"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nda be good choise mon!","做个好色狼!"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nmore creatures","更多生物"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\ntitans","泰坦巨人"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nyaya","亚亚"},
 {"to-tame-a-land-1\nÄÄYÄÄYOOOYÄÄY!!!","哟呦哟哟哟!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n                                     {~~~Hero Info per Faction~~~}                                     \n                                                  {-Woodland-}                                                  \n{-Leon-} Birth: 969 AF\nBecame Chief Ranger of Woodland: 992 AF\n\nLeon - a ranger of the Woodland Realm. After proving himself in battles numerous times he became the youngest elf to be given the title of Chief Ranger of Woodland. Now he is on a mission, with a small crew of elite fighters, to cause chaos in the Lizardmen's Realm deep behind enemy lines.\n\n{Queen Sarna} Birth: 971 AF\nBecomes Queen of Woodland: 993 AF\n\nQueen Sarna - ruler of the Woodland Realm. After the death of her father and brother by the hands of the lizards, during the 13th war, she was the only heir to the Realm. She was crowed at the young age of 22 and is now tasked with protecting Woodland from the lizardmen's invasion.\n\n{Gernian} Birth: 961 AF\n\nGernian was one of the chief rangers of Woodland. He was defeated in the battle at Black Shores (994 AF) and became a prisoner to the Lizardmen. He was a friend of Leon. They often fought side by side.\n\n{Ent Lord} Creation: 503 AF\n\nEnt Lord was an ancient forest being. He keeps the forests safe from unwelcomed eyes.\n\n                              {-Lizardmen’s Realm a.k.a. Boglandia-}                              \n{Rango} Birth: 949 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nRango was one of the captains of the Lizardmen.\n\n{Andra} Birth: 946 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nAndra - queen of the Lizardmen. They say she is a great beauty. Well... that depends on who you ask. Currently resides in Ednam.\n\n{Drudo} Birth: 954 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nDrudo was a tactical genius. The lizards won the battle of Black Shores during the 14th war because of him. He now takes pride in his war achievements.\n\n{Mauron} Birth: 950 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nMauron was a mercenary leader employed by the Lizardmen during the 14th war against Woodlands. It is said, that he has never lost a single battle.\n\n{Bongo} Birth: 958 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nBongo - one of the captains of the Lizardmen.\n\n{Tazarko} Birth:  945 AF\n\nTazarko - King of the Lizardmen. A tough soldier and a great ruler. He declared the 14th war against Woodland, wanting to prove his tactical and power superiority over Woodland.\n\n                                             {-Kingdoms of Men-}                                             \n{King Bran II “The Mad”} Birth: 970 AF, Death: 998AF\n\nKing Bran II - ruler of Kingdom of Ragnar, one of the Kingdoms of Men. His father - King John III died fighting Hell. Bran witnessed the brutal rape of his own mother when he was just a 7-year-old boy. This horrible event left a permanent mark in his psyche and later caused him to turn mad for blood!\n\n{King Stannis I} Birth: 953AF\n\nKing Stannis I was an honorable king that ruled over the only kingdom unaffected by Hell. Yet...\n\n{King Kingsley I} Birth: 959 AF\n\nKing Kingsley was the ruler of the strongest Kingdom of Men or what is left of it at least. He is born in war. Raised in war. And now rules in constant war. He saw from first hand, what Hell is capable of.\n\n                                                    {-Heaven-}                                                    \n{The One} Creation: -338 970 AF\n\nThe One is the Ruler of Heaven. A divine being worshiped by all men. He has the ability to watch upon all of Earth, well… almost all. Under his leadership and the help of the Great Wizards, he managed to beat Hell, in the great war between Heaven and Hell thousands of years ago.\n\n{Angelena} Birth: -145 990 AF\nRuler of Blessing -99 321 AF\n\nAngelena - one of the arcangels in Heaven and ruler of Blessing.\n\n                                                       {-Hell-}                                                       \n{Xiradraxaker} Spawned: -329 776 AF\n\nXiradraxaker – The first demon spawn of Lucifer “The Great”. He fought against Heaven thousands of years ago in the great war between Heaven and Hell. During the war he nearly killed Astral. Now he has been unleashed by Hell once more to bring destruction to all other Realms.\n\n{Xirera} Death: 998 AF\nXirera - A leader of the demon army.\n\n{Xerfax} Death: 998 AF\nXerfax - A leader of the demon army.\n\n{Xocalypto} Death: 998 AF\nXocalypto - A leader of the demon army.\n\n{Xyxy} Death: 998 AF\n Xyxy - A leader of the demon army.\n\n{Doombringer} Death: 998 AF\nDoombringer – A giant demon guarding the portal to Hell.\n\n{Xyrax} Death: 999 AF\nXyrax - one of the strongest demons of Hell.\n\n{Xardar} Death: 999 AF\nXardar - one of the great demons of Hell.\n\n{=Mr. Satan=} Spawn: -329 114 AF Death: 999 AF\n\nMr. Satan - current ruler of Hell. He was but a young demon lad, when his father – Lucifer \"The Great\" fought against Heaven and died. He ruled with an iron fist and for thousands of years he gathered the strength of Hell, waiting for the chance to unleash it upon all other Realms. He had his opportunity when the portal to Hell was unsealed.\n\n                                                  {-Barbarians-}                                                  \n{Winston Boragus} Birth: 896 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nWinston Boragus was a crazy barbarian lord. He was fierce in battle but not particularly intelligent. Hell easily manipulated him and had his men help them in The War of the 7 Realms.\n\n                                            {-Realm of Dragons-}                                            \n{Drogo} Birth: -2355 AF\n\nDrogo was one of the oldest surviving dragons. Despite his menacing appearance he has never been tested in true combat.\n\n{Dusk Maker} Birth: 886 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nDusk Maker was a half-elf half-dragon. You don’t want to know how he came to be.\n\n                                           {-Realm of The Death-}                                           \n{Conquest} Creation: -88 644 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nConquest - one of the White Riders, leading the armies of the dead.\n\n{War} Creation: -88 644 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nWar - one of the White Riders, leading the armies of the dead.\n\n{Famine} Creation: -88 644 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nFamine - one of the White Riders, leading the armies of the dead.\n\n{Plague} Creation: -88 644 AF Death: 998 AF\n\nPlague - one of the White Riders, leading the armies of the dead.\n\n{*Death*} Creation: -389 556 AF\n\nDeath – leader of The Realm of the Dead. He is also known as the Necromancer. He is an inevitable existential threat to all living beings! Zentimo gave him the body of Zargan and Death reanimated him. That led to the unsealing of the portal to Hell and the beginning of The War of the 7 Realms.\n\n                                           {-The 3 Great Wizards-}                                           \n{‘Astral’} Created: -330 321 AF Death: 998 AF\nFounded School of Earth -141 332 AF\n\nAstral - one of the three Great Wizards. He fought on the side of Heaven in the war against Hell thousands of years ago. He now resides in Heaven and is called for help to once again beat Hell and close the portal for good.\n\n{~Zentimo~} Creation: -330 321 AF\nFounding of School of Air -1332 AF\n\nZentimo was involved in The Great War between Heaven and Hell thousands of years ago, where he fought on the side of Heaven. For many millenniums he perfected his magical abilities and was the founder of the School of Air. He found the most promising magic users on Earth and started teaching them magic skills. He later killed all of his students but one – Wizardino. He gave the body of Zargan, of which he was in possession, to the Necromancer, known also as Death, which led to the unsealing of the portal to Hell and the beginning of The War of the 7 Realms.\n\n{Zargan} Creation: -330 321 AF Sacrificed: -326 432 AF\n\nZargan was one of the Three Great Wizards. He fought on the side of Heaven in the great war between Heaven and Hell, thousands of years ago. He had to sacrifice himself to seal the portal to Hell. His body was taken by Zentimo, who later gave it to the Necromancer. Death reanimated his body and thus broke the seal of the portal to Hell. Which led to the start of The War of the 7 Realms.\n\n                                                     {-Others-}                                                     \n{Sneaker} - A sneaky bastard employed by the lizards.\n{Purgatorian}\n{The Judge} - The judge judges harshly all who have died and determines who goes to Heaven and who goes to Hell.\n{Dace} - A simple worker, forced by the Necromancer to turn the troglodytes, that live in the caves, into skeletons.\n\n{Barnabas} Birth: 801 AF\n\nBarnabas was a student of the School of Fire, thanks to him Haradrim is no longer in ruins.\n\n{+Wizardino+} Birth: 756 AF\nBecomes student of Zentimo: 773 AF\n\nWizardino was the only surviving former student of Zentimo, after his teacher went mad and tried to kill all of his apprentices. Now he stays hidden in the Realm of Dragons perfecting his magic abilities.\n\n{Cutbert} - A useless guy.\n{Master Earth} - The Master of Earth - created by Zentimo.\n{Master Water} - The Master of Water - created by Zentimo.\n{Master Air} - The Master of Air - created by Zentimo.\n{Master Fire} - The Master of Fire - created by Zentimo.\n{Leon’s Soul} - The Soul of Leon is to be unleashed and tested in several tough tactical fights.\n{The 1st Test} - The 1st test for Leon's Soul.\n{The 4th Test} - The 4th test for Leon's Soul.\n{Final Test} - The final test for Leon's Soul.","“每个派别的高度信息”\n~ 罗德兰 ~\n{-里昂- 出生:969AF\n成为伍德兰首席骑警:992年\n\n里昂- a 调林地庄园 在无数次的战斗中证明自己之后,他变成了最小的精灵伍德兰游骑总长头衔 现在他正在执行任务 与一小队精英战士一起 制造混乱蜥蜴王国在敌后深处\n\n出生:971年\n成为伍德兰王后:993年\n\nSarna王后-统治者林地庄园 之后父亲死亡和和兄弟的兄弟国 家 手 手蜥蜴,第十三场战争,她是唯一的继承人地盘 她被叫叫着年青时代第 22 届和保护林地不受蜥蜴人的入侵\n\n出生时间:961年\n\n格尼安是伍德兰的首领 他被击败在黑海岸战役(994 AF)和成为囚犯蜥蜴 他是一个朋友里昂. 他们经常并肩作战。\n\n创建: 503个AF\n\n仁主是古老的森林 他一直说森林从不受欢迎的眼睛中安全。\n\n{利扎德曼王国 a.k.a. 博兰地亚 - }\n出生:949 死:998 死\n\n兰戈是上校蜥蜴\n\n{安洁儿* 出生:946起 死:998起\n\n安洁儿- 皇后的女王蜥蜴 他们说她是一个伟大的美人 这个嘛... 井... 这取决于你问谁。 目前居住在埃德南。\n\n{德鲁多出生:954 死后死亡:998\n\n德鲁多是个战术天才 … 圆在因为他,第14次战争 他现在为他的战争成就感到自豪。\n\n出生:950 死后: 998\n\n毛隆是一名雇佣军领导人,使用期间第14次对伍德兰的战争 据说,他从未输过一场战斗。\n\n出生: 958 死后: 998 年\n\n邦戈上校蜥蜴\n\n出生时间:945年\n\n塔扎尔科 - 国王蜥蜴 一个坚强的士兵和一个伟大的统治者。 他宣称向伍德兰发动第14次战争 想证明他的战术和威力优越于伍德兰\n\n男人的王国\n{布兰二世}出生:970 FF,死亡:998AF\n\n布兰二世国王 -- -- 拉格纳王国统治者人类的王国 他的父亲约翰三世国王死于地狱之战 布兰目击当他还是个7岁的男孩时,强奸了自己的母亲。 这个可怕的事件 他的心灵留下了永久的印记和后来,他为血而发疯。\n\n出生:953AF\n\n史坦尼斯国王 我是一个光荣的国王 统治了只有不受地狱影响的王国 然而...\n\n{国王}金斯利出生日期:959岁\n\n王王 国王金斯利原为规则的最强的人类王国 或者它剩下的东西 至少 他出生在战争中 在战争中长大 和现在在不断的战争中统治着 他亲眼所见,火狱是能做的。\n\n~ ~ - 以 - ~\n{创建单位: - 338 970非洲法郎\n\n一个是天堂统治者 被所有男人崇拜的神圣 他曾经能够观察地球,嗯... 几乎全部 在他的领导术 和帮助帮助 帮助伟大的巫师,他成功打败了地狱天与天之间的大战和数千年前的地狱\n\n出生:-145 - 990 女\n上帝保佑统治者-99 321 AF\n\nAngelena - 其中一个天堂的弧剑和祝福的统治者\n\n{地狱—}\n{希拉德拉克萨克-329 776 瑞郎\n\n希拉德拉克萨克 – 初次恶鬼产卵路西法 “伟大的”。 几千年前,他与天作战天与天之间的大战和地狱 期间他差点被杀死的战争艾斯却尔. 现在,他又被火狱所放逐,以便毁灭别的王国。\n\n{希雷拉死:998年\n希雷拉- 一名领导人 恶鬼军队。\n\n{夏尔法克斯死:998年\n夏尔法克斯- 一名领导人 恶鬼军队。\n\n死亡:998年以后\n索卡利普托- 恶鬼军队。\n\n死亡时间:998年\n希克希 - 领导者 恶鬼军队。\n\n死亡时间: 998年\n管家 — — A巨人 恶鬼警卫进入地狱入口\n\n{希拉克斯死亡:999年\n希拉克斯- 其中一个最强恶鬼地狱。\n\n死亡:999AF\n扎尔达尔 - 一种伟大恶鬼地狱。\n\n先生 Satana Spawn: -329 114 AF 死亡: 999 AF\n\nMr. 先生 - 撒旦,现在的地狱统治者 那时他还年轻恶鬼少年啊!当他的父亲,路西法 \"与天决战和死亡。 他用铁拳统治以及他共聚数千年,火狱的居民,等待着,有机会将它发泄到其他王国 当他有机会入火狱的门被揭开。\n\n{ - 巴巴拉尼亚 }\n{温斯顿}伯拉格出生:896起 死:998起\n\n温斯顿伯拉格是个疯狂的野蛮领主 他在战斗中很凶猛 但没有特别聪明 地狱很容易操纵他和有他的部下协助他们战争战争战争7王国。\n\n龙的真灵\n出生: -2355 AF\n\n卓戈是其中之一最古老的幸存龙 尽管他外表凶恶,但从未在真正的战斗中受到过考验。\n\n出生:886岁 死亡:998岁\n\n杜斯克造物主是半精灵半龙 你并不想知道他是如何来的。\n\n{ - 补偿死亡\n-88 644AF 死亡: 998AF\n\n征服 - 一个白骑士,领先2001年5月1日至2001年4月已经死了。\n\n-88 644 死: 998 死\n\n战争之一白骑士,领先2001年5月1日至2001年4月已经死了。\n\n-88 644AF 死亡: 998AF\n\n饥荒 - 一种白骑士,领先2001年5月1日至2001年4月已经死了。\n\n创建: - 88 644 AF 死亡: 998 AF\n\n瘟疫之一白骑士,领先2001年5月1日至2001年4月已经死了。\n\n创建: - 389 556 AF\n\n死亡组织领导人王国已经死了 也被称为死尸术士 他是所有生命中不可避免的生存威胁! 曾蒂莫给了他公扎尔甘 和死亡让他复活了 导致拆封进入地狱和开始战争战争战争7王国。\n\n                                           {-3大向导 }\n{‘艾斯却尔创建日期: -330 321\n创始地球学校 - 141 333 312\n\n艾斯却尔- 其中一个三个伟大的巫师。 他战斗在天边数千年前的反对地狱战争 他现在住在天堂和需要帮助以再次击败地狱和关闭门户永远是好的。\n\n{~曾蒂莫创建: - 330 321 AF\n创建空军学校----1332 AF\n\n曾蒂莫参与天与天之间的大战和数千年前,他在那里战斗天堂的侧面 千百年来,他完善了自己的魔力和原为创建者航空学校。 他发现地球上最有希望的神奇用户和开始教他们魔术技能。 后来他杀死了除了一个学生之外的所有学生——巫师。 他给了公扎尔甘他拥有的财产,导致拆封进入地狱和开始战争战争战争7王国。\n\n{扎尔甘创建: -330 321 牺牲: - 326 432 AF\n\n扎尔甘是三个伟大的巫师 他战斗在天边天与天之间的大战和地狱,数千年前。 他必须牺牲以密封封印进入地狱入口 他的尸体被曾蒂莫他后来把它给了死尸术士 死亡使他的身体复活和被打破的密封纸进入地狱入口 导致开始于战争战争战争7王国。\n\n{其他}\n- 一个受雇于蜥蜴\n{制药机}\n{法官} -法官严厉审判所有死去的人和. 谁能决定谁去天堂,和将入火狱者,\n{戴斯- 一个简单的工人, 被强迫要转弯的死灵法师 洞穴人活在洞洞中骷髅兵.\n\n出生: 801AF\n\n巴纳巴斯大学火焰学校,多亏了他 哈拉德林已经不再是废墟了\n\n出生时间:756年\n成为曾蒂莫:773个\n\n巫术仅幸存的前学生曾蒂莫之后他的老师发疯了和试图杀死他所有的学徒 现在他躲藏起来了龙的王国正在完善他的魔力\n\n一个没用的家伙\n{主地球}-地球大师 - 由曾蒂莫.\n[主水] -水务硕士——由曾蒂莫.\n{马斯特航空} -航空硕士 - 由曾蒂莫.\n{主火}-火灾管理者 - 由曾蒂莫.\n{里昂灵魂灵魂的灵魂里昂将释放和在几次激烈的战术战斗中测试过\n{第一次测试} - 第一次测试用于里昂灵魂\n{第4次测试} - 第4次测试用于里昂灵魂\n{结束}测试} - 期末测试用于里昂灵魂"},
