 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAfter the death of Zentimo, you meet up with Wizardino again. He tells you to head towards East Pomorie and face the demon, which supposedly killed Astral a while back. Then to find a passage near Ragnar and go through Kongo Desert.","之后死亡时曾蒂莫你和巫师又见面了 他叫你去东波莫里和脸面 恶鬼杀害艾斯却尔有一阵子了 然后在拉格纳尔附近找到一条通道和穿过孔戈沙漠"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAfter the destruction of the Lizardman’s Realm, Realm of the Death and the death of Zentimo, the only Realm remaining that stands in your way is Hell. After the death of Satan, you will finally have peace!  But you turn around and see the portal destroyed!","之后销毁销毁销毁 蜥蜴人王国,王国死亡死亡和死亡时曾蒂莫, 只留下阻碍你前进的王国就是地狱 之后撒旦之死,你终将安息!  但你转过身去和见见入口被摧毁了!"},
