 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAs you approach him the cave starts to shake and rocks start falling everywhere. \n{-Leon-}: It's a trap! I must kill him quickly!","当你接近他时洞穴开始颤抖和岩石开始落下无处不在 \n{-里昂- 这是个陷阱! 我要快点杀了他!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAs you approach the portal to Hell, you think to yourself: \"Why just close the portal, when I can deal with everyone in Hell? I remember when I was little, they used to tell us, that we would get send to Hell, if we weren't good and the leader of Hell was someone named Satan. If I can kill him, this whole mess will be over!\"","随你行近地狱之门,你自想:\"为什么关闭入口,我什么时候能和地狱里的人打交道? 我记得我小时候,他们常告诉我们 如果我们不乖,我们会被送进地狱和火狱的领导人,确是一个叫撒旦的人。 如果我能杀了他,整个烂摊子就结束了!\""},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAs you enter the passage you feel an earie feeling.","输入时通过你感觉 耳机的感觉。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAs you enter this strange land you see a big tower ahead of you.\nThe doors to it open and an old man walks towards you. He looks very similar to Astral.\n\n{~Zentimo~}: Hello I am Zentimo - One of the Three Great Wizards. We have work to do. I heard you have already met Astral. Well, he died trying to send you here, so you better not disappoint me. I will teach you great spells but I need to test you first. Go and beat the three Elemental Masters to prove that you are as good as they say you are.","当你进入这片陌生的土地时,你可以看到前面有一座大塔。\n门打开,和一个老人朝你走来 他看起来非常相似艾斯却尔.\n\n{~曾蒂莫:你好,我是曾蒂莫- 其中一个三个伟大的巫师 我们还有工作要做。 听说你已经见过面了艾斯却尔. 他为了送你来这里而死 所以你最好别让我失望 我会教教你伟大的法术但我需要测试你先说 上和弹打三个元素大师来证明 你和他们说的一样好"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAs you trek across this barren lava filled land, you suddenly hear a large explosion and big portal opens next to you. You wonder, is this the portal to Hell?","当你穿过这片贫瘠的熔岩 填满了土地, 你突然听到爆炸声和大门户在你旁边打开。 你想知道,是这个吗通往地狱的入口?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAstral has to die!","艾斯却尔必须死!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAstral meets a big group of people on his way to West Pomorie. They tell him that demons are destroying the kingdom and they are now running for their lives.","艾斯却尔在去西方 波莫里耶的路上遇到一大群人 他们告诉他恶鬼正在销毁王国和他们现在正在逃命。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAstral meets a fleeing soldier. He warns him that the royal family was murdered and now the whole kingdom is in chaos. Probably Hell's work. ","艾斯却尔遇到一个逃跑的士兵 他警告他皇室被谋杀和现在整个王国一片混乱 可能是地狱的工作 "},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAstral needs to meet Leon and than be killed by the demon! If not you will have a hard time at the end of the map!","艾斯却尔满足需要的需要里昂 和被 恶鬼! 如果不是,你会很难过期末地图!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nAstral you need to find Leon, a ranger from Woodlands and teach him all that you know. He is headed towards Lodrovin. He might just be the one savior.","艾斯却尔您需要找到里昂,来自林地的护林员和教他你所知道的一切。 他朝洛德罗文方向去了 他也许只是一个救世主"},
