 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth  945 AF\n\nTazarko - King of the Lizardmen. A tough soldier and a great ruler. He declared the 14th war against Woodland, wanting to prove his tactical and power superiority over Woodland.","出生 945 女\n\n塔扎尔科 - 国王蜥蜴 一个坚强的士兵和一个伟大的统治者。 他宣称向伍德兰发动第14次战争 想证明他的战术和威力优越于伍德兰"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth -145 990 AF\nBecame Ruler of Blessing -99 321 AF\n\n{Angelena} - one of the arcangels in Heaven and ruler of Blessing.","出生 -- -- 145,990\n成为祝福统治者 - 99 321 AF\n\n[安格莱娜] - 其中一个天堂的弧剑和祝福的统治者"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth -2355 AF\n\nDrogo was one of the oldest surviving dragons. Despite his menacing appearance he has never been tested in true combat.","出生 - 2355年\n\n卓戈是其中之一最古老的幸存龙 尽管他外表凶恶,但从未在真正的战斗中受到过考验。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 756 AF\nBecomes student of Zentimo 773 AF\n\nWizardino was the only surviving former student of Zentimo, after his teacher went mad and tried to kill all of his apprentices. Now he stays hidden in the Realm of Dragons perfecting his magic abilities.","出生756名女婴\n成为曾蒂莫773非洲法郎\n\n巫术仅幸存的前学生曾蒂莫之后他的老师发疯了和试图杀死他所有的学徒 现在他躲藏起来了龙的王国正在完善他的魔力"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 801 AF\n\nBarnabas was a student of the School of Fire, thanks to him Haradrim is no longer in ruins.","801AF\n\n巴纳巴斯大学火焰学校,多亏了他 哈拉德林已经不再是废墟了"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 886 AF\n\nDusk Maker was a half-elf half-dragon. You don’t want to know how he came to be.","出生 886 女\n\n杜斯克造物主是半精灵半龙 你并不想知道他是如何来的。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 896 AF\n\nWinston Boragus was a crazy barbarian lord. He was fierce in battle but not particularly intelligent. Hell easily manipulated him and had his men help them in The War of the 7 Realms.","出生人数 896\n\n温斯顿伯拉格是个疯狂的野蛮领主 他在战斗中很凶猛 但没有特别聪明 地狱很容易操纵他和有他的部下协助他们战争战争战争7王国。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 946 AF\n\nAndra - queen of the Lizardmen. They say she is a great beauty. Well... that depends on who you ask. Currently resides in Ednam.","946 女 生\n\n安洁儿- 皇后的女王蜥蜴 他们说她是一个伟大的美人 这个嘛... 井... 这取决于你问谁。 目前居住在埃德南。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 949 AF\n\nRango was one of the captains of the Lizardmen.","949 女\n\n兰戈是上校蜥蜴"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 950 AF\n\nMauron was a mercenary leader employed by the Lizardmen during the 14th war against Woodlands. It is said, that he has never lost a single battle.","出生 950 女\n\n毛隆是一名雇佣军领导人,使用期间第14次对伍德兰的战争 据说,他从未输过一场战斗。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 953AF\n\nKing Stannis I was an honorable king that ruled over the only kingdom unaffected by Hell. Yet...","分娩953AF\n\n史坦尼斯国王 我是一个光荣的国王 统治了只有不受地狱影响的王国 然而..."},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 954 AF\n\nDrudo was a tactical genius. The lizards won the battle of Black Shores during the 14th war because of him. He now takes pride in his war achievements.","出生 954 女\n\n德鲁多是个战术天才 … 圆在因为他,第14次战争 他现在为他的战争成就感到自豪。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 958 AF\n\nBongo - one of the captains of the Lizardmen.","958 女 生\n\n邦戈上校蜥蜴"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 959 AF\n\nKing Kingsley was the ruler of the strongest Kingdom of Men or what is left of it at least. He is born in war. Raised in war. And now rules in constant war. He saw from first hand, what Hell is capable of.","出生 959名女 女\n\n王王 国王金斯利原为规则的最强的人类王国 或者它剩下的东西 至少 他出生在战争中 在战争中长大 和现在在不断的战争中统治着 他亲眼所见,火狱是能做的。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 961 AF\n\n{Gernian} was one of the chief rangers of Woodland. He was defeated in the battle at Black Shores (994 AF) and became a prisoner to the Lizardmen. He was a friend of Leon. They often fought side by side.","出生 961 AF\n\n(格列尼安)伍德兰的首领 他被击败在黑海岸战役(994 AF)和成为囚犯蜥蜴 他是一个朋友里昂. 他们经常并肩作战。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 969 AF\nBecame Chief Ranger of Woodland 992 AF\n\n{Leon} - a ranger of the Woodland Realm. After proving himself in battles numerous times he became the youngest elf to be given the title of Chief Ranger of Woodland. Now he is on a mission, with a small crew of elite fighters, to cause chaos in the Lizardmen's Realm deep behind enemy lines.","969AF 出生\n成为伍德兰首席游骑长 992AF\n\n{里昂} - 调程员林地庄园 在无数次的战斗中证明自己之后,他变成了最小的精灵伍德兰游骑总长头衔 现在他正在执行任务 与一小队精英战士一起 制造混乱蜥蜴王国在敌后深处"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 970 AF\n\nKing Bran II - ruler of Kingdom of Ragnar, one of the Kingdoms of Men. His father - King John III died fighting Hell. Bran witnessed the brutal rape of his own mother when he was just a 7-year-old boy. This horrible event left a permanent mark in his psyche and later caused him to turn mad for blood!","970 女 生 970\n\n布兰二世国王 -- -- 拉格纳王国统治者人类的王国 他的父亲约翰三世国王死于地狱之战 布兰目击当他还是个7岁的男孩时,强奸了自己的母亲。 这个可怕的事件 他的心灵留下了永久的印记和后来,他为血而发疯。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBirth 971 AF\nBecame Queen of Woodland 993 AF\n\n{Queen Sarna} - ruler of the Woodland Realm. After the death of her father and brother by the hands of the lizards, during the 13th war, she was the only heir to the Realm. She was crowed at the young age of 22 and is now tasked with protecting Woodland from the lizardmen's invasion.","出生 971 女 生\n成为林地女王993年\n\n萨那王后 统治者林地庄园 之后父亲死亡和和兄弟的兄弟国 家 手 手蜥蜴,第十三场战争,她是唯一的继承人地盘 她被叫叫着年青时代第 22 届和保护林地不受蜥蜴人的入侵"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBlack Shores","黑海岸"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBlack Shores was a fortress, that exchanged hands numerous times between Woodland and Boglandia, during the 14 wars between those two Realms.","黑海岸是一个堡垒, 在伍德兰交手无数次和Boglandia, 期间这两个王国之间的14场战争"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBlack spirits rise from the evil fog.\n\n{-Leon-}: Another city?\n{Plague}: The Plaque will bring a horrible agonizing Death to all! You cannot defeat Death!\n{-Leon-}: I've had enough of this bullshit.","黑魂从邪恶的雾。\n\n{-里昂- 另一个城市?\n[拍子]:古板会给所有人带来可怕的痛苦的死神! 你不能打败死亡!\n{-里昂- 我受够了这些废话"},
