 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBut after you are done, you need to prepare for the upcoming battle. Head to the north part of the Great Central Sea. There you will find a portal.","但是,你完成之后, 你需要准备即将到来的战斗。 头到头北部北部大中海 在那里你会找到一个入口"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nBut be careful. The lizardmen are going to chase and find Andra’s killer! You need to cross the lake before they can get you.","但要小心。 蜥蜴人要去追和查找查找查找安洁儿杀手! 需要过路在他们抓到你之前"},
