 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -330 321 AF\n\nZargan was one of the Three Great Wizards. He fought on the side of Heaven in the great war between Heaven and Hell, thousands of years ago. He had to sacrifice himself to seal the portal to Hell. His body was taken by Zentimo, who later gave it to the Necromancer. Death reanimated his body and thus broke the seal of the portal to Hell. Which led to the start of The War of the 7 Realms.","创建 - 333 321\n\n扎尔甘是三个伟大的巫师 他战斗在天边天与天之间的大战和地狱,数千年前。 他必须牺牲以密封封印进入地狱入口 他的尸体被曾蒂莫他后来把它给了死尸术士 死亡使他的身体复活和被打破的密封纸进入地狱入口 导致开始于战争战争战争7王国。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -330 321 AF\nFounded School of Earth -141 332 AF\n\n{Astral} - one of the three Great Wizards. He fought on the side of Heaven in the war against Hell thousands of years ago. He now resides in Heaven and is called for help to once again beat Hell and close the portal for good.","创建 - 333 321\n创始地球学校 - 141 333 312\n\n{艾斯却尔- 其中一个三个伟大的巫师。 他战斗在天边数千年前的反对地狱战争 他现在住在天堂和需要帮助以再次击败地狱和关闭门户永远是好的。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -330 321 AF\nFounding of School of Air -1332 AF\n\nHe was involved in The Great War between Heaven and Hell thousands of years ago, where he fought on the side of Heaven. For many millenniums he perfected his magical abilities and was the founder of the School of Air. He found the most promising magic users on Earth and started teaching them magic skills. He later killed all of his students but one – Wizardino. He gave the body of Zargan, of which he was in possession, to the Necromancer, known also as Death, which led to the unsealing of the portal to Hell and the beginning of The War of the 7 Realms.","创建 - 333 321\n创建空军学校----1332 AF\n\n他参与了天与天之间的大战和数千年前,他在那里战斗天堂的侧面 千百年来,他完善了自己的魔力和原为创建者航空学校。 他发现地球上最有希望的神奇用户和开始教他们魔术技能。 后来他杀死了除了一个学生之外的所有学生——巫师。 他给了公扎尔甘他拥有的财产,导致拆封进入地狱和开始战争战争战争7王国。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -338 970 AF\n\nThe One is the Ruler of Heaven. A divine being worshiped by all men. He has the ability to watch upon all of Earth, well… almost all. Under his leadership and the help of the Great Wizards, he managed to beat Hell, in the great war between Heaven and Hell thousands of years ago.","创建 - 338 970\n\n一个是天堂统治者 被所有男人崇拜的神圣 他曾经能够观察地球,嗯... 几乎全部 在他的领导术 和帮助帮助 帮助伟大的巫师,他成功打败了地狱天与天之间的大战和数千年前的地狱"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -389 556 AF\n\nDeath – leader of The Realm of the Dead. He is also known as the Necromancer. He is an inevitable existential threat to all living beings! Zentimo gave him the body of Zargan and Death reanimated him. That led to the unsealing of the portal to Hell and the beginning of The War of the 7 Realms.","创建 - 389 556\n\n死亡组织领导人王国已经死了 也被称为死尸术士 他是所有生命中不可避免的生存威胁! 曾蒂莫给了他公扎尔甘 和死亡让他复活了 导致拆封进入地狱和开始战争战争战争7王国。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nCreation -88 644 AF\n\nConquest - one of the White Riders, leading the armies of the dead.","创建 - 88 644 531\n\n征服 - 一个白骑士,领先2001年5月1日至2001年4月已经死了。"},
