 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nLeon arrived at the place for the meetup and soon an old looking man, hastily approached him. \n\n{‘Astral’}: I am Astral. Quickly now, take these artifacts and go to the small island, in the northern part of the Great Central See. There you will find a portal to a wizard, called Zentimo. He will be expecting you. Hurry! There isn't much time! Those demons have already destroyed most of the Kingdoms of Men and soon they will come for Woodland!\n\nBefore Leon could ask any questions, Astral told him to go, because there is a great demon approaching and he will try to hold him back.","里昂抵达日期供举行会晤和不久,一个长相的老人,就仓促地接近他。 \n\n{‘艾斯却尔# : 我是艾斯却尔. 快点,拿着这个宝物 和转到小岛屿,北部北部中央大 see. 在那里,你会找到一个通往巫师的入口曾蒂莫. 他会等你的 快点! 时间不多了 那些那些恶鬼大部分已经销毁男子王国和他们很快就会来伍德兰了!\n\n之前里昂可以问任何问题,艾斯却尔因为他有一个伟大的,恶鬼接近和他会试着挡住他"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nLeon beat Death again and took Zargan’s body with him.","里昂死后再次死亡和采取扎尔甘与他同在的身体。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nLeon beat the giant demon guarding the portal and went in, cutting down countless demons on his way.","里昂弹打 巨人 恶鬼警卫门户门户网站和进去,砍了无数个恶鬼正在路上。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nLeon finds a passage through the caves.","里昂发现通过洞穴。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nLeon had come a long way. Satan was so close.\nThere was just one final battle. Leon gathered all of his strength and went in!\n\n{=Mr. Satan=}: Welcome, welcome! Did you like what you saw in Hell?\n{-Leon-}: Not really. This place is a bit too hot for my taste.\n{=Mr. Satan=}: Ha-ha a funny guy! Why did you come here in the first place huh? Why did you have to stick your nose in things that are none of your business?\n{-Leon-}: Cut the crap Satan! You know why I'm here. To close the portal and stop your destruction of the Realms. But now I'm stuck inside, so...\n{=Mr. Satan=}: So, you though you could kill me, for what I have done. Ha-ha-ha... Stupid elf! You can try. Let's make a deal. If you win, you become the new ruler of Hell! But if I win, then you will be my personal slave for eternity! Or you can go back and take a tour around Hell. I heard the fire pits are lovely this time of the year and then maybe...\n{-Leon-}: I accept your deal!\n{=Mr. Satan=}: Alright then. Sign here... and here... There. So, Ha-ha-ha! Let the game begin!","里昂已经走了很远的路 撒旦就差那么一点\n只有一场最后的战斗 里昂他将集合他的所有力量,和进去了!\n\n先生 欢迎,欢迎! 你喜欢你在地狱里看到的吗?\n{-里昂-不尽然 这地方太热了,我吃不下\n先生 哈哈,一个有趣的家伙! 你为何来这里头等兵? 为什么你非要插手那些与你无关的事?\n{-里昂- 剪切:该死的撒旦! 你知道我为什么来 关闭门户门户网站和停止破坏地产 但现在我被困在里面 所以...\n先生 撒旦:所以,你虽然可以杀了我, 因为我所做的一切。 哈 -哈 -哈... 愚蠢的精灵! 你可以试试 我们做个交易吧 如果你赢了,你就会变成火狱的新统治者! 但如果我赢了,那你就永远是我的奴隶! 或者你可以回去和环游地狱 我听到我听说这个时候 火坑是可爱的年份和然后也许...\n{-里昂- 我接受你的协议!\n先生 撒旦:好吧。 在这里签字... 和这里... 那边 那么,哈哈哈! Le 让我们游戏开始!"},
