 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nSpawn -329 114 AF\n\nMr. Satan - current ruler of Hell. He was but a young demon lad, when his father – Lucifer \"The Great\" fought against Heaven and died. He ruled with an iron fist and for thousands of years he gathered the strength of Hell, waiting for the chance to unleash it upon all other Realms. He had his opportunity when the portal to Hell was unsealed.","Spawun - 329 114 AF\n\nMr. 先生 - 撒旦,现在的地狱统治者 那时他还年轻恶鬼少年啊!当他的父亲,路西法 \"与天决战和死亡。 他用铁拳统治以及他共聚数千年,火狱的居民,等待着,有机会将它发泄到其他王国 当他有机会入火狱的门被揭开。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nSpawned -329 776 AF\n\nXiradraxaker – The first demon spawn of Lucifer “The Great”. He fought against Heaven thousands of years ago in the great war between Heaven and Hell. During the war he nearly killed Astral. Now he has been unleashed by Hell once more to bring destruction to all other Realms.","体积 - 329 776\n\n希拉德拉克萨克 – 初次恶鬼产卵路西法 “伟大的”。 几千年前,他与天作战天与天之间的大战和地狱 期间他差点被杀死的战争艾斯却尔. 现在,他又被火狱所放逐,以便毁灭别的王国。"},
