 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nYou return to Zentimo and tell him about your success in killing the Necromancer.\n\n{~Zentimo~}: Perfect. And what about Zargan? Did you find him anywhere?\n{-Leon-}: No, I didn't find him.\n{~Zentimo~}: That’s not good. Well, it turns out I was wrong about all the undead dying, when you kill the Necromancer. They are still very much alive and on the move. It is possible that he transferred himself into another body, before fighting you. Maybe into Zargan.\n{-Leon-}: It did seem like a trap. He was waiting for me in a cave.\n[~Zentimo~}: Well, we have work to do here. I will have to teach you a few more powerful spells. In the meantime, I will send my bird scouts across the land and see if they can find anything.","回到你身边曾蒂莫 和告诉他你杀人成功的事死尸术士\n\n{~曾蒂莫:完美。 和有关扎尔甘? 你在哪里找到他的吗?\n{-里昂- 不,我没有找到他\n{~曾蒂莫」:这不妙。 事实证明我错了 亡灵死亡,当你杀死死尸术士 他们还活着和日期 上移动。 他有可能在和你战斗之前 把自己转移到另一个身体里 也许进入扎尔甘.\n{-里昂- 看起来像个陷阱 他在山洞里等我\n[~曾蒂莫:我们还有工作要做。 还要教你们几个更厉害的法术. 内同时,我会派我的鸟童子侦察员过去陆地和看看他们能不能找到什么"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nYou see a bunch of devils. They say, they are tired of the constant fighting and seeing their friends dying. And for what? The ambitions of a mad ruler, filled with anger and hate. And now they wish to join you and put a stop to Hell and its ruler – Mr. Satan.","你看到了一堆恶魔. 他们说:他们厌倦了,持续战斗和看着他们的朋友死去 以及什麽? 一个疯狂的统治者的野心,充满愤怒和仇恨。 和现在他们想加入你们和阻止火狱,和统治者 - 先生 撒旦。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\nYou see a prison ahead of you. You wonder, who might be in there.","你看到前面有个监狱 你想知道,谁可能在那里。"},
