 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{'Astral'}: West Pomorie is devastated by Hell's might! But Anfalas forest is ahead of me and I must hope that Leon has come.","{'艾斯却尔'西方 波莫里耶被地狱的威力所摧残! 但是安法拉斯森林就在我前面和我一定要希望里昂来了"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{*Death*}: What is dead cannot die!\n\nYou hear that echoed in the caves. And there, on his white horse, stands a rider. So pale, that you can almost see through him.\n{-Leon-}: I finally found you!\n{*Death*}: Come forth and face your demise!","死神不会死!\n\n你听到那回响在洞穴。 和在那里,在他的白马上,站着骑手。 脸色苍白,几乎能看穿他\n{-里昂- 我终于找到你了!\n死亡:出来吧和面对你的死亡!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{+Wizardino+}: Leon the Ranger! Did you really believe Zentimo's lies?\n{-Leon-}: What are you talking about?\n{+Wizardino+}: He tricked you and made you find Zargan’s body and now with his powers, he plans to take control over all of the Realms for himself!\n{-Leon-}: He said, he needs his body to close the portal to Hell.\n{+Wizardino+}: You fool! Why do you think he wants to close the portal? Because Hell will stand in his way and prevent him from taking control for himself. He is selfish! He is just using you as a puppet!","维扎迪诺 … :里昂 游骑兵! 你真的相信曾蒂莫谎言?\n{-里昂-你在说什么?\n维扎迪诺:他欺骗了你和发现扎尔甘身体和现在有了他的权力 他打算掌握为自己而立!\n{-里昂- 他说,他需要 身体关闭进入地狱入口\n你个笨蛋! 你觉得他为什么想关门门户? 因为地狱会阻拦他和阻止他控制自己。 他是自私的! 他只是把你当木偶!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{+Wizardino+}: So, what did you choose?","维扎迪诺:你选择了什么?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{+Wizardino+}: So, you have a choice. Either kill me and go and close the portal and meet yours and your Woodland Realm's death. Or destroy the orb and go kill Zentimo.\n{-Leon-}: Even if I believed you and killed him, Hell will still come and destroy\nall the Realms.\n{+Wizardino+}: No, you can still go and close the portal but do not use the orb that Zentimo gave you. Instead destroy it and let me give you another. Enchant the orb that I give you and then kill Zentimo. Go to the magic lakes and make your choice.","所以,你有选择。 要么杀了我和移动和关闭门户门户网站和满足您的和林地王国的死 或摧毁(b) 或 b和杀曾蒂莫.\n{-里昂- 即使我相信你和火狱将毁灭他,火狱仍要来临他。和销毁\n全部地产\n不,你仍然可以去和关闭门户门户,但不使用(b) 或 b曾蒂莫给了你 不如摧毁它和让我再给你一个 灵巧或我给你的和然后杀死曾蒂莫. 转到魔法湖和做你自己的选择"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{+Wizardino+}: The orb that you carry is a bomb. After you enchant it and bring it to him, Zentimo will tell you to go and close the portal and once you do, he will kill you, using that orb! And then, no one can stop him. Not even Heaven, as they consider him an ally and will be blind for his actions.\n{-Leon-}: How do you know all of this?\n{+Wizardino+}: I was his student once. I knew Zentimo very well. He was humble and temperate but as he grew older, he became more and more ambitious. He killed all of his students, except for me and began plotting to take over all realms. I remember that day very well. He took something very dear from me! A while back, he gave the Necromancer - Zargan’s body. He got reanimated and that led to the opening of the portal, the destruction of the Kingdoms of Men and the death to Heaven's strongest heroes! He also tricked the lizards into starting a war with your own Realm. And now he used you to backstab the Necromancer and after you close the portal to Hell, he will kill you as well!","维扎迪诺 … :你携带的机器人是炸弹 在你施咒之后和你把它拿来给他吧!曾蒂莫会让你叫你走和关闭门户门户网站和一旦你这样做,他会杀了你, 使用那个球体! 和没有人能阻止他 甚至没有天堂,因为他们把他当作盟友。和将双目失明因为他的行动。\n{-里昂- 你怎么知道这一切?\n我曾经是他的徒弟 我知道曾蒂莫非常好。 他谦卑谦卑和温柔,但随着他长大, 他变得更和更加雄心勃勃。 他杀死了所有学生 除了我之外和开始密谋接管所有领域。 我非常清楚地记得那一天。 他从我这里夺走了很珍贵的东西! 很久以前,他曾经内骨术士扎尔甘身体。 他被救活了和导致开始门户网站,销毁销毁销毁男子王国和至死不渝的英雄! 他又欺骗人,蜥蜴开始与自己的王国开战 和现在他利用你 来反言内骨术士和关闭后到地狱入口,他也会杀了你!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: \"Ruins of Haradrim\" hmm... doesn't seem so ruined to me. In fact, it seems pretty alive.\n{Barnabas}: What are you doing in here, boy? I think you should turn around if you value your life!","{-里昂- \"哈拉德林之林\" 嗯... 对我来说似乎没有那么糟 事实上,它看起来还挺活的\n你在这里做什么,孩子? 我觉得你应该转身 如果你珍惜你的生命!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: A group of centaur captains approach you and report, that the woods have been decimated by some demons from Hell. They ask to join you and help beat back the demons. You eagerly agree and start searching for the enemy.","{-里昂- 一群人半人马首领与您接洽和报告,有些森林被一些森林砍伐恶鬼地狱的。 他们要求加入你们和帮助反击 恶鬼. 你热切同意和开始搜索敌人。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: A small group of lizardmen this deep in the swamps? They must be looking out for me. I must act fast!","{-里昂- 有一小群蜥蜴 深陷其中沼泽? 他们一定在照顾我 我必须快点行动!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Ahh finally! I arrived home. I must meet with Queen Sarna and report my success in reeking chaos in the Lizardmen's Realm. I hope she managed to defend Londrovin in my absence.","{-里昂- 啊,终于! 我回到家了,我回来了。 我必须见萨娜女王和报告说我成功地在蜥蜴王国 希望她能为我辩护隆德罗文是因为我不在"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Black Shores is close! I will have purge it from lizardmen scum! ","{-里昂- 黑海岸就快到了! 我会从蜥蜴人渣中清洗出来! "},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Black smoke rises from the tree tops. The forest seems to be in flames. Those lizardmen will pay for that!","{-里昂- 黑烟从树顶。 森林似乎着火了 那些蜥蜴会付出代价的!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Crookbak - One of the strongest Kingdoms of Men. They were our allies in many wars against the lizards. And now it's destroyed by Hell.","{-里昂- 克洛克巴克 - 其中一个最强的人类王国 他们曾经是我们在很多战争中的盟友蜥蜴 和现在它被地狱摧毁了"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Dragons. I knew they were going to be in my way.","{-里昂- 龙 我知道他们会挡我的道"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Edham - one of the main cities of the Lizards. Our men were killed here, after the loss at Black Shores. These fucking lizards will pay for this! I must find their Queen Anrda and assassinate her!","{-里昂- 爱德汉 - 其中一个主要城市的主要城市蜥蜴 我们的人在这里被杀 之后损失在黑海岸。 这些该死的蜥蜴会为此付出代价的! 我必须找到安达王后和刺杀她!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Hmm... Should I believe Wizardino? Is Zentimo really just using me? Or is Wizardino telling me this, so that he can eliminate his rival? Oh, what am I to do...?","{-里昂- 嗯... ... 我该相信巫师吗? 是曾蒂莫真的在利用我吗? 或者是巫师告诉我的 这样他才能消灭对手? 哦,我该怎么办?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Hmm… I expected more of a fight from Death. Strange...","{-里昂- 嗯,我期待更多的来自死亡的战斗。 奇怪的是..."},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I can see Woodland’s shores from here.","{-里昂- 从这里我可以看到伍德兰的海岸"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I don’t believe you, Wizardino.\n{+Wizardino+}: You think I'm lying? I didn't want to fight you but you leave me no choice. If I am to lose, then you would have let your own people to die for the ambitions of a corrupted old wizard!","{-里昂- 我不相信你,巫师\n你认为我在说谎? 我不想打你 但你让我别无选择 如果我输了,你就会让自己的人民为贪婪的老巫师!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I hope there are no more of these White Riders.","{-里昂-我希望不再有这些白骑士了"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I hope, I made the right choice.","{-里昂- 我希望,我做了选择权利。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I see a way through the mountains. Maybe this is the way to the portal.","{-里昂- 我看到一条路经过山峰。 也许这是方式到门户网站。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: I wonder if The One is saying the truth about Hell.","{-里昂-我想知道是否一个人在说地狱的真相。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Is that you Zargan?\n{*Zargan*}: What is dead cannot die!\n{-Leon-}: Oh, the Death guy again? So, you did change into Zargan before our fight and set the trap for me? There is no running away this time! I WILL take Zargan's body.\n{*Zargan*}: Face your demise!","{-里昂- 是你吗?扎尔甘?\n{*扎尔甘死不能死!\n{-里昂- 哦,哦,又是死人吗? 所以,你确实变了扎尔甘在战斗之前和集成套陷害我吗? 这次没有逃跑的机会了! 我将采取扎尔甘尸体\n{*扎尔甘面对你的死亡!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Is this it? This must be the island, that Astral told me to go to.","{-里昂- 是这个吗? 这必须岛岛,那个艾斯却尔让我去。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Let’s do this!","{-里昂-让我们开始吧!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Now it’s your turn to die, Satan!","{-里昂- 现在轮到你死,撒旦!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The Northern Wastelands. Hmm… Once upon a time there was a great elven kingdom and lush forests here. Now it's a barren wasteland.","{-里昂-}: 北部荒地。 从前有一个伟大的精灵王国和这里的森林很平淡 现在这里成了一片荒地"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The Realm of Dragons. I've heard about this place. How giant dragons roam in the skies but I though it was just a kids story.","{-里昂-}: 龙的地盘 我听说过这个地方 如何如何巨人龙在天空却只是孩子的故事"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The lizardmen left their city undefended! How stupid of them.","{-里昂-}: 蜥蜴人无防守地离开他们的城市 他们真蠢"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The portal leads back to Zentimo's place? Did not expect that.","{-里昂-}: 门户连接到曾蒂莫地方? 没想到会这样"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The road I came through is block! I must find a different way.","{-里昂-}: 我通过的路是路障! 我必须另寻出路"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The shores are overflowing with lava! What is this sorcery?","{-里昂-}: 海岸上满是熔岩! 这是什么魔力?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: The valley is full of these skeletons.","{-里昂-}: 山谷里充满了这些骷髅兵."},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: These swamps are horrible!","{-里昂- 这些沼泽太可怕了!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: They must be close, I can feel it.","{-里昂-他们一定在附近 我能感觉到"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: This is not Hell! It looks a lot more like Heaven. So, The One invited me to fight on his territory. What a mistake!","{-里昂- 这不是地狱! 它看起来更像天堂 那么,一个人邀请我在他的领地上战斗 搞错了!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: This seems to be the passage, that Zentimo told me about.","{-里昂- :这似乎是段落,该曾蒂莫跟我说过"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Those stupid barbarians why are they working for Hell?","{-里昂那些愚蠢的野蛮人 他们为什么为地狱工作?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Through here maybe.","{-里昂-也许从这里过去"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: What have I gotten myself into? - you wonder. \n{Conquest}: You cannot defeat Death!","{-里昂- 我把自己弄进什么了? -你想知道吗? \n你不能打败死亡!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: What have they done with the city? The One is right, they must be stopped!","{-里昂- 他们做了什么?城市吗? 一个是对的,必须阻止他们!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: What? But it was supposed to be sealed after I come out and use the orb. Did Wizardino lie to me? Did I make the wrong choice? Damn it all!\n\nIn your rage, you destroy the orb and now you are stuck in this hellhole. Hopefully Woodlands will be safe at least, even if you could not help anymore.","{-里昂- 什么? 但我出来后应该密封和使用或b。 巫师诺有没有骗我? 我做我做的错误的选择? 该死!\n\n在你的愤怒中,你摧毁(b) 或 b和现在你被困在这鬼地方了 希望林地至少会安全 即使你已经帮不上忙了"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: What? But it was supposed to be sealed after I come out and use the orb. Did Wizardino tell me the truth? Did I make the wrong choice? Damn it all!\n\nSuddenly the orb starts shaking and you throw it as far as possible. While it’s still in the air it explodes! Now you are stuck in Hell and Zentimo will probably come and destroy Woodlands and you can't do anything about it!","{-里昂- 什么? 但我出来后应该密封和使用或b。 巫师告诉我真相吗? 我做我做的错误的选择? 该死!\n\n突然间orgb 开始发抖和你扔得越远越好 在它仍然在时空气会爆炸! 现在你被困在火狱中和 曾蒂莫可能会来和销毁林地和你什么也做不了!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Where is the Necromancer!?\n{War}: War will be the undoing of all! You cannot defeat Death!","{-里昂- :在哪里?死亡骑士!\n[战争]:战争将全部消灭! 你不能打败死亡!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Leon-}: Why are the shores of Old Valensia, blackened? What is going on in here?","{-里昂- 为什么?旧瓦莱西西亚海岸黑了吗? 这是怎么回事在这里?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{-Note from the mapmaker-}\n\nPlay on 200% difficulty.\n\nWays to Play:\n\n1.Homm3 SoD/Complete\n2.Homm3 SoD/Complete + HD mod only, with HD+ option turned off (it changes battlefield terrain and may make the map unbeatable)\n3.Homm3 SoD/Complete + HD mod with HD+ on + SOD_SP plugin for HD mod (best option for single player in my opinion)\n\nOnly sacrifice artifacts if you have more than one copy of!\n\nThanks to Nautilius, Maygwan and many others for their great maps, inspiring me to make this map.\n\nHave Fun and Enjoy!","{- 注:}映像师-}\n\n在200%的难度下播放 。\n\n游戏方式 :\n\n1.英雄无敌3 死亡阴影/完成\n2. 英雄无敌3 死亡阴影/Cupplee +HD 模式,HD+选项关闭(改变战场地形)和可能作出地图无法击败)\n3. 英雄无敌3 死亡阴影/Conflete +HD++ + 死亡阴影_SP DHM(我认为单玩家的最佳选项)插件\n\n仅牺牲 宝物如果你有不止一份!\n\n感谢Nautililius, Maygwan和许许多多其他人的伟大地图,激励我绘制这张地图。\n\n玩得开心和玩得开心点!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{<<West Pomorie}\n{  East Pomorie >>}","西波莫里耶}(西Phomorie})\n东波莫里"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Angel}: For HEAVEN!!\n","{天使为海文干杯!\n"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Angel}: Hell needs to be stopped!","{天使地狱需要停止!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Archer}: Halt we protect this place from... Oh, Astral, we were awaiting your arrival. Please, we want to join you on your quest!","{弓箭手停止我们保护这个地方不受... 哦艾斯却尔我们在等你的到来 我们想加入你们的行列!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Astral} - one of the Three Great Wizards currently residing in the realm of Heaven. ","{艾斯却尔- 其中一个三个伟大的巫师目前居住在天堂的王国 "},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Border guards}: Stop no one enters the Kingdom of Ragnar without a pass.","禁止任何人进入拉格纳尔王国没有通行证。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Centaurs}: Go away!","{半人马走开!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Dace}: What, who are you? What is going on here?\n{-Leon-}: Where is the Necromancer!?\n{Dace}: He is there. Through the passage way. I... I'm a just a worker here. Don't kill me. Please! We are just turning the troglodytes, that live in the caves, into skeletons.\n{-Leon-}: What? You are fueling the armies of the dead? Then you are just as bad as those white riders?\n{Dace}: Wait...","{戴斯:什么,你是谁? 这是怎么回事?\n{-里昂- :在哪里?死亡骑士!\n{戴斯:他在那里。 通过通道。 我... . 我... 我只是这里的工人 别杀我 请! 我们正转弯 洞穴人活在洞洞中骷髅兵.\n{-里昂- 什么? 你正在加燃料2001年5月1日至2001年4月死了吗? 那你和那些白人骑手一样坏?\n{戴斯单单"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Darkness}","{黑暗}"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Doombringer}: Face your DOOM!!!","面对你的DOOM!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Golems}: We wish to help you! ","我们希望帮助你! "},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Heaven Warriors}: We will fight for the glory of Heaven!","我们将为...天堂的荣耀!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Heaven Warriors}: We will join you on your quest.","我们将同你们一道探险。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Heaven Warrior}: I am afraid I can't join you. I have some work to do here.","恐怕我不能加入你们 我还有事要做"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Heaven Warrior}: I can't join you but here, have some gold instead.","我不能加入你,但在这里,有一些金币相反。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Leon}","{里昂}"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Lizardmen}: What? Who are you?","- 什么? 你是谁?"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Magicians}: Halt this is the domain of the Great Wizard Zentimo!","停止,这是域的大向导曾蒂莫!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Message from Wizardino}: Before going in to stop Hell take this artifact. It will prove to be most useful. The leader of Heaven - The One has seen what you have done and is now mad. He will want vengeance for Zentimo! Go and kill him, before he has a chance to destroy Woodland.","在去阻止地狱之前 把这个拿走宝物. 它将证明是非常有用的。 天国领袖...你所做的事,你已亲眼看见;和现在已经疯了 他会想要报仇的曾蒂莫! 上和在他有机会摧毁伍德兰之前杀了他"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Message from Zentimo}: Before going in to stop Hell learn this spell. It will prove to be most useful. I recently learnt that The One - Leader of Heaven is planning to take control of all the realms, after you close the portal to Hell. That means he is going to try and destroy Woodland! Go and kill him, before he has a chance to do so!","{ 发自曾蒂莫在去阻止地狱之前法术. 它将证明是非常有用的。 我最近学到一,天领主正计划控制一切关闭后进入地狱入口 意味着他将尝试和毁灭伍德兰! 上和在他有机会杀之前杀了他!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Rogues}: Hey you, give me your boots!","{盗贼嘿,你给我你的靴子!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The Fire Lakes to the East}\n{Satan's Palace to the South}","{至东东}\n撒旦的宫殿南方}"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: Astral, go through the small passage in the Anfalas forest and wait for Leon to arrive. Instruct him to go to the portal to Zentimo. Be careful! Ahead of you lies a great demon! I know you have fought him long ago! Try to not engage in a battle with him.","{一:艾斯却尔,通过中小径 安法拉斯林林森林和等待里昂要到达。 教他去门户到门户网站曾蒂莫. 小心点! 在你面前的谎言 是一个伟大的恶鬼! 我知道你早就跟他打过架了! 尽量不要和他开战"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: First, go to The Kingdoms of Men and break Hell's hold over them, before they break into internal wars. Then find Zentimo, your old friend and ask him for help.","{一:第一,开始男子王国和在他们爆发内战之前 打破地狱的束缚 然后找到曾蒂莫你的老朋友和求他帮忙"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: Hell's corruption has begun to take hold over the other realms and soon it will spread over Heaven as well!","{一:地狱的腐化已经开始被控制其他领域和不久,它就蔓延到天上。"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: Hurry and good luck!","{一:快点和良好幸运术!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: I trusted you Leon! You were supposed to be the “savior”. But what you did, I can’t excuse. You will now pay for that!\n{-Leon-}: I know about your scheme! You want to take control of all the Realms! And destroy Woodlands!\n{The One}: You fool! You made the wrong choice and now you will die!","{一:我信任你,我相信你里昂! 你应该是“救世主”。 但我不能原谅你所做的一切。 你们现在要为此付出代价!\n{-里昂-我知道你的计划! 您想要控制全部地盘! 和摧毁伍德兰!\n{一:你这个傻瓜! 你造了错误选择和现在你们要死了!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{The One}: Many of our strongest heroes have already died fighting Hell. Astral, you are our only hope. Take as many willing allies, as you can and go and stop Hell!","{许多最强大的英雄 已经死于地狱之战 艾斯却尔你是我们唯一的希望 尽你所能,带尽可能多的心甘情愿的盟友和移动和停止地狱!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{Wizard's Home>>}\n{<<Magic Lakes}","维扎尔德的家\n马吉克湖]"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Lore Area~}","* 土地面积 *"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Zentimo~}: Ah, very good, very good! I will teach you Blind now. You are probably wondering why Hell came back, huh? Well, a long time ago, way before your Woodland Realm even existed, there was a great battle between Hell and Heaven. Astral, me and Zargan were fighting on the side of Heaven and we managed to win. But we needed to seal the portal to Hell, to prevent the demons from coming back, so Zargan sacrificed himself to seal the portal. And it remained shut but about 50 years ago, I learnt about a Necromancer far to the north, who was reanimating the dead to fight on his side. He managed to reanimate Zargan and opened the portal once more. Hell came back and now the Necromancer, also known as Death, wishes to turn all of the Realms into his graveyard! So, if you wish not to see Woodland in ruins, you have to help me stop him. I opened a portal to the northern wastelands. Go there and then through the passage in the mountains. Find Death and kill him! That should kill all of the dead, including Zargan. If you can return with his body, I might have something in mind, that can seal the portal to Hell again!","{~曾蒂莫# : 啊,非常好,非常好! 我会教你双目失明现在。 你可能想知道为什么地狱回来了,是吧? 很久以前 在你的林地王国存在之前 地狱之间曾有过一场大战和天堂。 天堂吗? 艾斯却尔,我和 扎尔甘战斗中上天边和我们成功赢得了胜利 但我们需要封印至火狱的门入口, 恶鬼从回来,所以扎尔甘牺牲自己以封印门户网站。 和50年前,我了解到 远在...以至北,他能复原,死在了他身边战斗 他设法重新释放了扎尔甘 和打开再一次进入门户。 地狱又回来了和现在死灵术士,又称死亡,希望翻过地产进他的墓地! 所以,如果你不想在废墟里看到伍德兰 你必须帮我阻止他 我打开了一个入口北部荒地。 去那边和直至中通过山峰。 查找死亡和杀了他! 这应该会杀死所有包括扎尔甘. 如果你能带着他的尸体回来 我可能想着什么 可以封印又是地狱入口!"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Zentimo~}: Ahh finally, you are ready to learn the powerful spells! While we were training, I have received word from my bird scouts. They say Zargan was spotted near the ruins of Haradrim. Go there and see if you can find him. And try to bring him to me.","{~曾蒂莫终于,你准备好学习了强大的法术! 我们训练的时候 我收到我鸟童子军的消息 他们说扎尔甘发现在附近哈拉德林的废墟 去那边和看你能不能找到他 和试着带他来见我"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Zentimo~}: Good, you have returned with Zargan! Now we can seal the portal. You need to take his body to the Magic Lakes of Oldtown, far in the North. Once you are there, use this orb to initiate the sacrifice ritual. The orb will be enchanted and then, you can use it to seal the portal. The way to Oldtown goes through the Realm of Dragons, so be careful. You don't know what you might come up against.","{~曾蒂莫:好,你回来了。扎尔甘! 现在我们可以密封了门户网站。 你需要把他的尸体带到旧城魔法湖,远在北边 一旦你到了那里,用这个工具启动 牺牲仪式。 org 将被施魔法和然后,你可以用它密封门户网站。 通往旧城路经过龙的地盘,小心点 你不知道自己会面对什么"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Zentimo~}: Leon you have returned. Did you enchant the orb, like I asked?\n{-Leon-}: I did but I met someone along the way, that calls himself Wizardino.\n{~Zentimo~}: Wizardino... That's a name I haven't heard in a long, long time. Tell me Leon did he tell you that I was very bad? Did you really fall for his lies?\n{-Leon-}: No, I trust you. And now to close the portal.\n{~Zentimo~}: Yes, but before you do, you must defeat the demon that killed Astral near East Pomorie. Then go through the passage to Kongo Desert. Wild barbarians reside there, so you are in for a fight. They are allied to Hell supposedly or more like tricked by Hell, as they are not the smartest.","{~曾蒂莫~}: 里昂您已经返回。 你是否施了魔法或者像我问的那样?\n{-里昂-我见过,但我认识了一个人他自己叫巫师\n{~曾蒂莫巫师... 那是个名字我很久没听说了 告诉我里昂他有没有告诉你我很坏? 你真的爱上他的谎言了?\n{-里昂- 不,我相信你。 和现在关闭门户网站。\n{~曾蒂莫:是的,但在此之前,你必须击败 恶鬼杀死艾斯却尔东波莫里附近 然后通过进入孔戈沙漠 野生野蛮人住在那里 所以你要参加一场战斗 这等人,是火狱的配主,或更像火狱所欺骗者,因为他们不是真主所迷惑的。最聪明的"},
 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~Zentimo~}: Leon, you have returned. Did you enchant the orb like I asked?\n{-Leon-}: I did but not the one you gave me.\n{~Zentimo~}: What? Not the one I gave you?\n{-Leon-}: You see, I met Wizardino when I was on the way to the magic lakes. He told me about your little scheme.\n{~Zentimo~}: Wizardino… That's a name, I haven't heard in a long, long time. Tell me, Leon, did he tell you that I was very bad? Did you really fall for his lies?\n{-Leon-}: Quiet! I know what I must do now, thanks to him.\n{~Zentimo~}: You are a fool! He is just using you to finish what he started a long time ago. He killed all of my other students and then ran away. You should have killed him when you had the chance.\n{-Leon-}: Lies! Now you die!\n{~Zentimo~}: I taught you incredibly powerful spells and you repay me like this? You make a big mistake.","{~曾蒂莫~}: 里昂你回来了 你是否施了魔法像我问的那样?\n{-里昂-我没有,但我没有一个你给我的\n{~曾蒂莫:什么? 不无我给了你一个?\n{-里昂- 你看,我遇到巫师,当我在方式到魔力湖。 他跟我说了你的小计划\n{~曾蒂莫巫师...名字我很久没听说了 告诉我里昂他有没有告诉你我很坏? 你真的爱上他的谎言了?\n{-里昂- 安静! 我知道现在我该做什么了 多亏了他\n{~曾蒂莫你是个傻瓜! 他只是在利用你 完成他很久以前开始的事 他杀了我所有的学生和然后,他们奔走。 你早该杀了他机会。\n{-里昂- 谎言! 现在你死了!\n{~曾蒂莫:我教过你非常强大的力量法术 和你这样报答我? 你犯了个大错误"},
