 {"war-of-seven-realms-1\n{~~~Part 1 of the Barbutilion~~~}\n{-War of the 7 Realms-}\n\nA long time ago, the great war between Hell and Heaven was fought. With the help of the 3 Great Wizards, Heaven managed to defeat Hell. But the portal to Hell had to be sealed off and Zargan - one of the wizards, sacrificed himself to seal it. And so, it remained shut for thousands of years.\n \nBut now the portal was opened once again and Hell unleashed its full force to conquer the other Realms and to destroy Heaven.\n\nAt the same time Woodland - Realm of the Elves and The Lizardmen's Realm were fighting with each other for the 14th time.\n\nWill your Realm survive or will it be destroyed and forgotten in time?","* 第1部分路管 …\n{ - 战争7王国-}\n\n很久以前火狱之间的重大战争,和天堂被打过 与帮助帮助 帮助3位伟大的巫师,天堂战胜了地狱 但是进入地狱的入口必须密封和 扎尔甘- 其中一个巫师们 牺牲了自己来封印它 和所以它被关闭了几千年\n \n但现在门户再次开放和地狱释放出它的全部力量去征服其他王国和毁灭天堂\n\n截止时林地-精灵和利沙德曼王国为了第14次\n\n你的地盘会生存下去 还是被毁灭和被遗忘在时间上?"},
